values
  ('84388311209126139', 'A Mom for Christmas', 1990, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family, TV Movie', 'George T. Miller, Ronald M. Lautore', null, 'Olivia Newton-John, Juliet Sorci, Doug Sheehan, Carmen Argenziano, Aubrey Morris, Jim Piddock, Doris Roberts, Elliot Moss Greenbaum', null, 'A department store mannequin comes to life during the holiday season for a motherless little girl who wishes she had a mom for Christmas, and proceeds to charm her hard-working dad, too.', 'A department store mannequin comes to life during the holiday season for a motherless little girl who wishes she had a mom for Christmas, and proceeds to charm her hard-working dad, too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FPRqHffN16IyIjZQPrPG6M8D1e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51310'),
  ('316990747178848011', 'A Moment in the Reeds', 2018, 'Romance, Drama', 'Mikko Mäkelä, Jarno Pimperi, Iikka Salminen', 'Mikko Mäkelä', 'Janne Puustinen, Boodi Kabbani, Mika Melender, Virpi Rautsiala', null, 'Having moved to Paris for university, Leevi returns to his native Finland for the summer to help his estranged father renovate the family lake house so it can be sold. Tareq, a recent asylum seeker from Syria, has been hired to help with the work, and when Leevi''s father has to return to town on business, the two young men establish a connection and embark on a romance set against the idyllic Finnish summer. However, looming over this chance encounter, is the father''s imminent return to the lake house, the continuation of Leevi''s studies abroad as well as Tareq''s complex relationship with his family in Syria.', 'Having moved to Paris for university, Leevi returns to his native Finland for the summer to help his estranged father renovate the family lake house so it can be sold. Tareq, a recent asylum seeker from Syria, has been hired to help with the work, and when Leevi''s father has to return to town on business, the two young men establish a connection and embark on a romance set against the idyllic Finnish summer. However, looming over this chance encounter, is the father''s imminent return to the lake house, the continuation of Leevi''s studies abroad as well as Tareq''s complex relationship with his family in Syria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqRTsyY7Hzse7vW5n7zSZWurhgx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467467'),
  ('1074523756193495749', 'A Moment of Innocence', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mohsen Makhmalbaf, Mahmoud Kalari', 'Mohsen Makhmalbaf', 'Mirhadi Tayebi, Mohsen Makhmalbaf, Ali Bakhsi, Ammar Tafti, Maryam Mohamadamini, Moharram Zaynalzadeh, Hana Makhmalbaf', null, 'A semi-autobiographical account of an incident in Makhmalbaf''s life when, as a 17-year-old, he stabbed a policeman at a protest rally. Two decades later, he tracks down the policeman he injured in an attempt to make amends.', 'A semi-autobiographical account of an incident in Makhmalbaf''s life when, as a 17-year-old, he stabbed a policeman at a protest rally. Two decades later, he tracks down the policeman he injured in an attempt to make amends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBgImBSOFUJg8voD7xbLqS1s1tf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43976'),
  ('209361622576072096', 'A Moment of Romance', 1990, 'Action, Romance, Crime', 'Benny Chan Muk-Sing, Horace Wong Wing-Hang, Chu Yat-Hung', 'James Yuen Sai-Sang', 'Andy Lau, Jacklyn Wu Chien-Lien, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Tommy Wong, Bonnie Wong Man-Wai, Sandra Lang, Anna Ng, Lau Kong', null, 'After a young Triad member takes an upper-class girl hostage during his escape from a jewelry heist, the two find themselves falling in love, in spite of the repercussions caused by their forbidden relationship.', 'After a young Triad member takes an upper-class girl hostage during his escape from a jewelry heist, the two find themselves falling in love, in spite of the repercussions caused by their forbidden relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uO6TjYi6vWKRhjmBFScbjh4ja86.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81128'),
  ('212040445192581886', 'A Moment of Romance II', 1993, 'Action, Crime, Romance', 'Benny Chan Muk-Sing, Andy Lam Kwok-Wah, Patrick Jim', 'Susan Chan Suk-Yin', 'Aaron Kwok, Jacklyn Wu Chien-Lien, Roger Kwok Chun-On, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Paul Chun Pui, Kwan Hoi-San, Hon Yee-Sang, Tse Wai-Kit', null, 'A street racer encounters a mainland courtesan under an extraordinary circumstances. A moment of Romance between them follows after.', 'A street racer encounters a mainland courtesan under an extraordinary circumstances. A moment of Romance between them follows after.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejKIlUjL7SqyBjXIFzGMhG2Oaks.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217631'),
  ('693944107194024936', 'A Moment of Romance III', 1996, 'Action, Romance, War', 'Johnnie To, Poon Hang-Sang', 'Yau Nai-Hoi, Sandy Shaw Lai-King', 'Andy Lau, Jacklyn Wu Chien-Lien, Fan Chi-Gong, Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Zhang Yan, Patrick Leung Pak-Kin, He Zhonghua, Yu Liwen', null, 'Lau Tin Wai is a fighter pilot in the Chinese airforce who is forced to ditch in a field; he is taken in by the remote community of farmers who nurse him back to health, here he meets Ting Siu Wo, a young woman who falls in love with him.', 'Lau Tin Wai is a fighter pilot in the Chinese airforce who is forced to ditch in a field; he is taken in by the remote community of farmers who nurse him back to health, here he meets Ting Siu Wo, a young woman who falls in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RDS1EVCghZ3KaMuOGLekF5cLeb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174127'),
  ('415487701005347199', 'À mon tour', 2022, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Drama', 'Frédéric Berthe, Ludovic Naar, François Ryckelynck', 'Vincent Solignac, Mickaël Quiroga', 'François-Xavier Demaison, Oscar Berthe, François Berléand, Kolia Abiteboul, Inès Limbourg, Mickaël Quiroga, Anis Mansour, Laure Sagols', null, 'Chateauneuf-sur-Valone, Mayor Félix de Ponte is preparing for his re-election, hoping to beat the far-right candidate Jean-Luc Molment Martinez. But when a video revealing his extra-marital affair is broadcast on the networks, Félix''s life will be turned upside down. Devastated, betrayed and humiliated, his wife, Rose, decides to react and runs against him in the elections.', 'Chateauneuf-sur-Valone, Mayor Félix de Ponte is preparing for his re-election, hoping to beat the far-right candidate Jean-Luc Molment Martinez. But when a video revealing his extra-marital affair is broadcast on the networks, Félix''s life will be turned upside down. Devastated, betrayed and humiliated, his wife, Rose, decides to react and runs against him in the elections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMgCpDgyoIM5fo7MLMthfjyzdeW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:916373'),
  ('862254348089215966', 'A Monkey in Winter', 1962, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Henri Verneuil, Louis Page, Claude Pinoteau', 'Michel Audiard, François Boyer', 'Jean Gabin, Jean-Paul Belmondo, Suzanne Flon, Gabrielle Dorziat, Hella Petri, Marcelle Arnold, Charles Bouillaud, Anne-Marie Coffinet', null, 'During World War II, an innkeeper vows to abstain from alcohol for the sake of his family. Years later, as they thrive in Normandy, his resolve is tested by a charming advertising professional who loves to drink.', 'During World War II, an innkeeper vows to abstain from alcohol for the sake of his family. Years later, as they thrive in Normandy, his resolve is tested by a charming advertising professional who loves to drink.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxp6FnCsblmjAkSrjWg4ATx72cC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33998'),
  ('970579880572591640', 'A Monkey''s Tale', 1999, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Jean-François Laguionie, Corine Marcel, Philippe Alessandri', 'Norman Hudis, Jean-François Laguionie', 'Nadia Farès, Tara Römer, Janine Souchon, Pierre Arditi, Michael Lonsdale, Yves Barsacq, Patrick Préjean, Jean Piat', null, 'Kom is from a tribe of monkeys who live in a canopy. He rejects elders'' authority as well as the superstition that the lower world would be inhabited by demons. But he accidentally falls from the trees…', 'Kom is from a tribe of monkeys who live in a canopy. He rejects elders'' authority as well as the superstition that the lower world would be inhabited by demons. But he accidentally falls from the trees…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4pYSLnGHXUyiTs0HNmpUJMYVKv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37949'),
  ('910864135693548535', 'A Monster Calls', 2016, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'J. A. Bayona, Óscar Faura, Mónica Sánchez', 'Patrick Ness', 'Lewis MacDougall, Sigourney Weaver, Felicity Jones, Toby Kebbell, Ben Moor, James Melville, Oliver Steer, Dominic Boyle', 'PG-13', '12-year-old Conor encounters an ancient tree monster who proceeds to help him cope with his mother''s terminal illness and being bullied in school.', '12-year-old Conor encounters an ancient tree monster who proceeds to help him cope with his mother''s terminal illness and being bullied in school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNzWJwVqjszWwXrA7ZfsrJmhgV9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258230'),
  ('981283538415364567', 'A Monster in Paris', 2011, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Bibo Bergeron, Fabrice Joubert, Bertrand Schutz', 'Stéphane Kazandjian, Bibo Bergeron', 'Vanessa Paradis, Matthieu Chedid, Gad Elmaleh, François Cluzet, Ludivine Sagnier, Julie Ferrier, Bruno Salomone, Sébastien Desjours', 'PG', 'Paris, 1910. Emile, a shy movie projectionist, and Raoul, a colourful inventor, find themselves embarked on the hunt for a monster terrorizing citizens. They join forces with Lucille, the big-hearted star of the Bird of Paradise cabaret, an eccentric scientist and his irascible monkey to save the monster, who turns out to be an oversized but harmless flea, from the city''s ruthlessly ambitious police chief.', 'Paris, 1910. Emile, a shy movie projectionist, and Raoul, a colourful inventor, find themselves embarked on the hunt for a monster terrorizing citizens. They join forces with Lucille, the big-hearted star of the Bird of Paradise cabaret, an eccentric scientist and his irascible monkey to save the monster, who turns out to be an oversized but harmless flea, from the city''s ruthlessly ambitious police chief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSYZR2QL58jWPIEe9TG7G9PlTya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77459'),
  ('976892651555539069', 'A Monster with a Thousand Heads', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Rodrigo Plá, Tess Anastasia Fernández, Raúl Sebastián Quintanilla', 'Laura Santullo', 'Veronica Falcón, Jana Raluy, Sebastián Aguirre, Emilio Echevarría, Hugo Albores, Úrsula Pruneda, Noé Hernández, Daniel Giménez Cacho', null, 'When Sonia receives the news that her husband’s cancer has progressed to a critical stage, she races to secure the insurance company’s approval for the care that can help him.', 'When Sonia receives the news that her husband’s cancer has progressed to a critical stage, she races to secure the insurance company’s approval for the care that can help him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wToNyO8nPExJGcIEryIj0EEuW3Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296865'),
  ('819437812447989520', 'A Month by the Lake', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'John Irvin, Pasqualino De Santis', 'Trevor Bentham', 'Vanessa Redgrave, Edward Fox, Uma Thurman, Alida Valli, Carlo Cartier, Alessandro Gassmann, Natalia Bizzi, Paolo Lombardi', 'PG', 'For 16 years Miss Bentley has been spending April at an elegant hillside villa on Lake Como. This year, 1937, her London society artist father has recently died and the only other English-speaking guests are brash Americans. Then Major Wilshaw arrives. He suggests they meet for cocktails and Miss Bentley stands him up -- not even thinking about it -- as she helps the new nanny of an Italian family settle in. Miss Beaumont, a tall, young American who has dropped out of finishing school in Switzerland, is bored and finds some amusement in flirting with the major, whose libido is awakened for the first time since before the great war. And Miss Bentley now finds more about the major to admire than his ears.', 'For 16 years Miss Bentley has been spending April at an elegant hillside villa on Lake Como. This year, 1937, her London society artist father has recently died and the only other English-speaking guests are brash Americans. Then Major Wilshaw arrives. He suggests they meet for cocktails and Miss Bentley stands him up -- not even thinking about it -- as she helps the new nanny of an Italian family settle in. Miss Beaumont, a tall, young American who has dropped out of finishing school in Switzerland, is bored and finds some amusement in flirting with the major, whose libido is awakened for the first time since before the great war. And Miss Bentley now finds more about the major to admire than his ears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgoiGvNffe4tZC33x6RIQQiKIp9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41007'),
  ('230306812778675092', 'A Month in the Country', 1987, 'History, Drama', 'Pat O''Connor, Kenneth MacMillan', 'Simon Gray', 'Colin Firth, Kenneth Branagh, Natasha Richardson, Patrick Malahide, Jim Carter, Richard Vernon, Tony Haygarth, Tim Barker', null, 'A destitute WWI veteran is hired to help carry out restoration work on a medieval mural in a rural Yorkshire church. While living in the quiet village, he forms a close friendship with an archaeologist and begins to come to terms with his trauma.', 'A destitute WWI veteran is hired to help carry out restoration work on a medieval mural in a rural Yorkshire church. While living in the quiet village, he forms a close friendship with an archaeologist and begins to come to terms with his trauma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbEinEvaz0mWcjbGqAx2764R1Ys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63639'),
  ('587322275092787787', 'A Moonlight Serenade', 1903, 'Fantasy, Romance, Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Pierrot goes to the house of his love to serenade her, but her father kicks him out. Soon the moon and its goddess Diana come towards the man and offers him something better.', 'Pierrot goes to the house of his love to serenade her, but her father kicks him out. Soon the moon and its goddess Diana come towards the man and offers him something better.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtbMz4hINBiimIYNinEwriMEBpL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190728'),
  ('1072086707126197584', 'A Moroccan Affair', 2023, 'Comedy, Family', 'Álvaro Fernández Armero, Sergi Gallardo, Lola Herraiz', 'Daniel Castro', 'Julián López, Michelle Jenner, Elena Irureta, María Ramos Mouhoub, Hamza Zaidi, Abdelatif Hwidar, Antonio Resines, Aníbal Soto', null, 'Follows the Díaz-Aguirre family, whose perfect universe turns upside down after the death of the patriarch, who in his will asks his wife to recover the ''Sardinete'', his first fishing boat which is rusting in a Moroccan port.', 'Follows the Díaz-Aguirre family, whose perfect universe turns upside down after the death of the patriarch, who in his will asks his wife to recover the ''Sardinete'', his first fishing boat which is rusting in a Moroccan port.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kQDvGo54El6S6CXfE6S5jneFt6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1074049'),
  ('368303267412810410', 'A Most Violent Year', 2014, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'J.C. Chandor, Bradford Young, Jeannette Kim', 'J.C. Chandor', 'Oscar Isaac, Jessica Chastain, David Oyelowo, Alessandro Nivola, Elyes Gabel, Albert Brooks, Catalina Sandino Moreno, Peter Gerety', 'R', 'A thriller set in New York City during the winter of 1981, statistically one of the most violent years in the city''s history, and centered on the lives of an immigrant and his family trying to expand their business and capitalize on opportunities as the rampant violence, decay, and corruption of the day drag them in and threaten to destroy all they have built.', 'A thriller set in New York City during the winter of 1981, statistically one of the most violent years in the city''s history, and centered on the lives of an immigrant and his family trying to expand their business and capitalize on opportunities as the rampant violence, decay, and corruption of the day drag them in and threaten to destroy all they have built.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYTUNxLcFomCdXe3D4Hq8OLwgv0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241239'),
  ('957473316175740485', 'A Most Wanted Man', 2014, 'Thriller', 'Anton Corbijn, Benoît Delhomme, Jina Jay', 'Andrew Bovell', 'Philip Seymour Hoffman, Willem Dafoe, Robin Wright, Rachel McAdams, Grigoriy Dobrygin, Homayoun Ershadi, Nina Hoss, Daniel Brühl', 'R', 'A Chechen Muslim illegally immigrates to Hamburg and becomes a person of interest for a covert government team tracking the movements of potential terrorists.', 'A Chechen Muslim illegally immigrates to Hamburg and becomes a person of interest for a covert government team tracking the movements of potential terrorists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6B76Z5Ct758RfKFoFg37skVRiMp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157849'),
  ('394756262393608107', 'A Mother', 2015, 'Drama', 'Christine Carrière, Jeanne Lapoirie', 'Christine Carrière', 'Mathilde Seigner, Kacey Mottet Klein, Pierfrancesco Favino, Salomé Dewaels, Fiona Hernout, Jenny Clève, Catherine Salée, Eloïse Charretier', null, 'Marie lives alone with her 16 year old son. She struggles to get by with this teenager who gets deeper and deeper in violence and juvenile delinquency. Speaking sentimentally, things are not going better: the relationship with her lover has come to an end. It may seems depressing, but Marie doesn’t give up, even if love seems to be an inaccessible dream. But love, there is. We can feel the affection of this mother for her troublesome child, thanks to Mathilde Seigner, who gives an astonishing performance. A subtle directing, a strong and captivating story, in short: a must see.', 'Marie lives alone with her 16 year old son. She struggles to get by with this teenager who gets deeper and deeper in violence and juvenile delinquency. Speaking sentimentally, things are not going better: the relationship with her lover has come to an end. It may seems depressing, but Marie doesn’t give up, even if love seems to be an inaccessible dream. But love, there is. We can feel the affection of this mother for her troublesome child, thanks to Mathilde Seigner, who gives an astonishing performance. A subtle directing, a strong and captivating story, in short: a must see.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJBjtzauF0411LV92ogT5m684Vd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343412'),
  ('312455923401168562', 'A Mother Knows Worst', 2020, 'Thriller, Drama, TV Movie', 'Robert Malenfant, Eric Anderson, John J. Tierney', 'Stephen Lyons', 'Katie Leclerc, Jeff Schine, Victoria Barabas, Heather Ankeny, Todd Cahoon, Katie Michels, Tyee Tilghman, Martha Hackett', null, 'Tragedy strikes when Olivia and Harry Davis’ newborn baby doesn’t survive the birth. 6 months later the young couple have come to terms with their loss and are rebuilding their lives, they may even be ready to try again for a family soon. But when Olivia meets glamourous Brooke Marsden and her baby girl, she is overwhelmed by a feeling of love and longing. She quickly becomes obsessed with Brooke and her baby, which worries Harry. Is Olivia going crazy’ Or is a mother’s instinct always right’ Katie Leclerc and Jeff Schine star.', 'Tragedy strikes when Olivia and Harry Davis’ newborn baby doesn’t survive the birth. 6 months later the young couple have come to terms with their loss and are rebuilding their lives, they may even be ready to try again for a family soon. But when Olivia meets glamourous Brooke Marsden and her baby girl, she is overwhelmed by a feeling of love and longing. She quickly becomes obsessed with Brooke and her baby, which worries Harry. Is Olivia going crazy’ Or is a mother’s instinct always right’ Katie Leclerc and Jeff Schine star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xyWBtqvPQttg3EJ8iNtdqM0JZV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:687516'),
  ('271873720848170820', 'A Mother Should Be Loved', 1934, 'Drama', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Isamu Aoki', 'Kōgo Noda, Masao Arata, Tadao Ikeda', 'Yukichi Iwata, Mitsuko Yoshikawa, Den Obinata, Seiichi Katô, Kōji Mitsui, Shusei Nomura, Shin''yō Nara, Shinobu Aoki', null, 'A young man discovers that the woman who raised him is his stepmother. His stepbrother, who is unaware of the revelation, resents his mother for always punishing him more severely than his stepsibling.', 'A young man discovers that the woman who raised him is his stepmother. His stepbrother, who is unaware of the revelation, resents his mother for always punishing him more severely than his stepsibling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jifX7z7a3KQfsnvjkJ97X82N3u7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135335'),
  ('822766194371426876', 'A Mother''s Embrace', 2024, 'Horror, Fantasy, Drama', 'Cristian Ponce, Lika Lopes, Raoni Seixas', 'Cristian Ponce, André Pereira, Gabriela Capello', 'Marjorie Estiano, Chandelly Braz, Javier Drolas, Reynaldo Machado, Val Perré, Angela Rabello, Helena Varvaki, Rafael Canedo', null, 'In 1996, during one of the biggest tropical storms ever to hit Rio de Janeiro, Ana and her firefighter team must evacuate a nursing home at risk of collapsing — but they soon discover the place’s mysterious residents have other plans with the arrival of the rain.', 'In 1996, during one of the biggest tropical storms ever to hit Rio de Janeiro, Ana and her firefighter team must evacuate a nursing home at risk of collapsing — but they soon discover the place’s mysterious residents have other plans with the arrival of the rain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pDDkVs5uxI3etz5qX4aEsBwRVT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1054561'),
  ('631791474765955383', 'A Mother''s Nightmare', 2012, 'TV Movie, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Vic Sarin, Vic Sarin, Wendy Ord', 'Shelley Gillen', 'Jessica Lowndes, Annabeth Gish, Grant Gustin, Jay Brazeau, Eric Breker, Aren Buchholz, Erica Carroll, Samuel Patrick Chu', null, 'A seductive teen becomes vindictive when her boyfriend tries to end the relationship.', 'A seductive teen becomes vindictive when her boyfriend tries to end the relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7nwnDNbKKnh5wjsWfgyaEPZhOO6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137776'),
  ('680191959043186264', 'A Mother''s Rage', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Jeff Dolen, Oren Kaplan', 'Ron Dobson, Frederick Cipoletti, Shane Mathers', 'Lori Loughlin, Kristen Dalton, Ted McGinley, Jordan Danger, Alix Elizabeth Gitter, Christopher Backus, Shaun Sipos, John Rubinstein', null, 'A mother and her daughter, Conner, embark on a journey to Conner''s new school - both unaware of how many "bumps" they may find along the way.', 'A mother and her daughter, Conner, embark on a journey to Conner''s new school - both unaware of how many "bumps" they may find along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6gjRyOlFjKaioZ5SkVjKP2d5jti.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224919'),
  ('944443380937158375', 'A Mother''s Special Love', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Auriane Lacince, Elsa Truscello, John Wax', 'John Wax, Marie Odile Weiss', 'Audrey Lamy, Nicolas Chupin, Benjamin Tranié, Naidra Ayadi, Jean-Charles Clichet, Steve Tientcheu, Jean-Pascal Zadi, Stéphan Wojtowicz', null, 'A single mother''s struggle to raise a child diagnosed with autism.', 'A single mother''s struggle to raise a child diagnosed with autism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MPZenW0I0AexBbil8das6kupIW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1083324'),
  ('386056791446447624', 'A Mouse Hunt for Christmas', 2025, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Henrik Martin Dahlsbakken', 'Susanne Skogstad', 'Pål Sverre Hagen, Sara Khorami, Flo Fagerli, Vegard Strand Eide, Jon Øigarden, Jakob Oftebro, Charlotte Frogner, Jonis Josef', null, 'A small mouse family plans a quiet Christmas outside the city, but their celebration is disrupted when humans unexpectedly appear. As the mice try to hide their preparations, the humans react to the noises behind the walls with determination.', 'A small mouse family plans a quiet Christmas outside the city, but their celebration is disrupted when humans unexpectedly appear. As the mice try to hide their preparations, the humans react to the noises behind the walls with determination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LgEDVRubQNsWzgJaUfIV4DcW7S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1427833'),
  ('935846203648398558', 'A Mouse in the House', 1947, 'Comedy, Animation', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Lillian Randolph', 'NR', 'Mammy Two-Shoes tells Tom and Butch that the cat who gets rid of the icebox-raiding, breadbox-invading mouse (Jerry) is the one who can stay.', 'Mammy Two-Shoes tells Tom and Butch that the cat who gets rid of the icebox-raiding, breadbox-invading mouse (Jerry) is the one who can stay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtGqMIU0jswhRRrmxHRpFkI6K9N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40073'),
  ('799570484563128461', 'A Mouse with the Men', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Jacques Poitrenaud, Marcel Grignon', 'Michel Audiard, Albert Simonin', 'Dany Saval, Louis de Funès, Maurice Biraud, Robert Manuel, Dora Doll, Gérard Lartigau, Jean Lefebvre, Claude Piéplu', null, 'Marcel and Francis are busy people. Marcel owns a café and spend all his nights running from meetings to meetings with members from the high society... at least, that''s what he say to his barman! Francis leaves his home, loving wife and adorable daughter, frequently to attend meetings and demonstration with customers. His boss trusts him so much that his agenda is always full... at least, that''s what he say to his wife! In fact, Marcel and Francis'' incomes come from their night job: thieves! Here at least, they are professional. Troubles arise when, during one robbery, they encounter a young, high-pitched voice, candid girl who takes the decision to become their associate in crime... for the fun!', 'Marcel and Francis are busy people. Marcel owns a café and spend all his nights running from meetings to meetings with members from the high society... at least, that''s what he say to his barman! Francis leaves his home, loving wife and adorable daughter, frequently to attend meetings and demonstration with customers. His boss trusts him so much that his agenda is always full... at least, that''s what he say to his wife! In fact, Marcel and Francis'' incomes come from their night job: thieves! Here at least, they are professional. Troubles arise when, during one robbery, they encounter a young, high-pitched voice, candid girl who takes the decision to become their associate in crime... for the fun!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6nvirQ3Aa7xi11HSeAYlGxiiUT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51957'),
  ('932820138474455607', 'A Mouse''s Tale', 2012, 'Animation, Adventure', 'David Bisbano', 'Raquel Faraoni, David Bisbano', 'Hernán Bravo, Natalia Rosminati, Ricardo Alanis, Enrique Porcellana, Sergio Bermejo, Oswaldo Salas, Gonzalo Urtizberea, Marcelo Chirinos', 'PG', 'A magical adventure begins Once upon a time, within a vast and wild forest there was a fantastic Kingdom called Rodencia, a place where wonderful creatures and powerful wizards lived. It''s the story of adventures and love of a small mouse called Edam, a clumsy magician''s apprentice and the beautiful and confident mouse Brie, who will have to face many dangerous obstacles in order to obtain the power of the princess''s tooth and defeat the troop of rats commanded by the evil Rotex who invades Rodencia (the peaceful kingdom of mice), in order to dominate them and take their treasure. In the middle of the forest; the magic of the light and the darkness, the love and resentment will face together. Edam and Rotex will fight and only one will leave victorious.', 'A magical adventure begins Once upon a time, within a vast and wild forest there was a fantastic Kingdom called Rodencia, a place where wonderful creatures and powerful wizards lived. It''s the story of adventures and love of a small mouse called Edam, a clumsy magician''s apprentice and the beautiful and confident mouse Brie, who will have to face many dangerous obstacles in order to obtain the power of the princess''s tooth and defeat the troop of rats commanded by the evil Rotex who invades Rodencia (the peaceful kingdom of mice), in order to dominate them and take their treasure. In the middle of the forest; the magic of the light and the darkness, the love and resentment will face together. Edam and Rotex will fight and only one will leave victorious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bH17s3BcjHvo0uJYTbgZzW1HBZG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227731'),
  ('24368028851379947', 'A Mouthful of Air', 2021, 'Drama', 'Frankie DeMarco, Amy Koppelman', 'Amy Koppelman', 'Amanda Seyfried, Finn Wittrock, Britt Robertson, Jennifer Carpenter, Paul Giamatti, Amy Irving, Josh Hamilton, Darren Goldstein', 'R', 'Julie is a new mom and children''s book author, who escapes into the bright Crayola-colored world of her creation in order to leave behind the darkness caused by her post-partum depression.', 'Julie is a new mom and children''s book author, who escapes into the bright Crayola-colored world of her creation in order to leave behind the darkness caused by her post-partum depression.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuBA3LxAwlzo1a90PHredvnPfRg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:714195'),
