  ('1032516175971875143', 'A Nameless Band', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Lyudmil Kirkov, Georgi Trenev', 'Stanislav Stratiev', 'Velko Kanev, Filip Trifonov, Pavel Popandov, Georgi Mamalev, Katerina Evro, Maria Kavardjikova, Dimitar Manchev, Nikolay Nikolaev', null, 'Velko, Filip, Pavel and Gosho have different professions but are connected by the love they have for music. They rehearse all year to make it big on the sea resorts in the summer. The head of the cultural center where they play is willing to give them the musical equipment if they replace their singer Maria (Filip''s girlfriend) with the attractive but untalented Reni. This is the first, but not the last compromise they have to make on the way to the dream.', 'Velko, Filip, Pavel and Gosho have different professions but are connected by the love they have for music. They rehearse all year to make it big on the sea resorts in the summer. The head of the cultural center where they play is willing to give them the musical equipment if they replace their singer Maria (Filip''s girlfriend) with the attractive but untalented Reni. This is the first, but not the last compromise they have to make on the way to the dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dET1DAeEIOy74C7YsuUQOV96vUa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110978'),
  ('471080156906572743', 'A Nanny for Christmas', 2010, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Michael Feifer, Carl Bartels, Yaron Kaplan', 'Richard Gnolfo, Michael Ciminera', 'Emmanuelle Vaugier, Sierra McCormick, Jared Gilmore, Cynthia Gibb, Richard Ruccolo, Sarah Thompson, Dean Cain, Michael Ciminera', 'G', 'Ally is a smart young career woman who needs a new job. Samantha is a busy Beverly Hills advertising executive/mom whose too-well-mannered kids need some fun in their lives. And Danny Donner is the tough-guy owner of a chocolate company who wants a major ad campaign immediately. Could it all somehow lead to the Christmas that changes everyone''s lives forever?', 'Ally is a smart young career woman who needs a new job. Samantha is a busy Beverly Hills advertising executive/mom whose too-well-mannered kids need some fun in their lives. And Danny Donner is the tough-guy owner of a chocolate company who wants a major ad campaign immediately. Could it all somehow lead to the Christmas that changes everyone''s lives forever?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlE665CgN922AUNosZEjgMv56HC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50652'),
