  ('641890695077391564', 'A New Life', 1988, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alan Alda, Kelvin Pike', 'Alan Alda', 'Alan Alda, Hal Linden, Ann-Margret, Veronica Hamel, John Shea, Mary Kay Place, Beatrice Alda, David Eisner', 'PG-13', 'Steve Giardino, an abrasive workaholic Wall Streeter, and his wife Jackie divorce after twenty-six years of marriage and find themselves thrust back into the dating world in middle age and in search of a new life.', 'Steve Giardino, an abrasive workaholic Wall Streeter, and his wife Jackie divorce after twenty-six years of marriage and find themselves thrust back into the dating world in middle age and in search of a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqeKfuh0DARivuw2SgN3lcouaVe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123615'),
  ('1031880502048031328', 'A New Life', 2002, 'Drama', 'Philippe Grandrieux, Stéphane Fontaine', 'Philippe Grandrieux, Eric Vuillard', 'Zachary Knighton, Anna Mouglalis, Marc Barbé, Zsolt Nagy, Raoul Dantec, Vladimir Zintov, Georgi Kadurin, Simona Huelsemann', null, 'A young American falls obsessively in love with a mysterious courtesan named Melania against the backdrop of a dilapidated Eastern European landscape.', 'A young American falls obsessively in love with a mysterious courtesan named Melania against the backdrop of a dilapidated Eastern European landscape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d2F4VwaTbwCqkiIhSgxHLCR3DLv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99642'),
  ('971894012135075807', 'A New Love in Tokyo', 1994, 'Romance, Drama', 'Banmei Takahashi, Naoki Kayano', 'Sho Kenzan, Kei Shimamoto, Banmei Takahashi', 'Sawa Suzuki, Reiko Kataoka, Aya Sugimoto, Hiromitsu Suzuki, Tomorowo Taguchi, Takashi Matsuo, Toshi Shioya, Suzuki Matsuo', null, 'A look at the lives of two prostitutes in Tokyo: Rei, who works as an S&M dominatrix, and Ayumi, in the more straightforward profession of call girl. In addition to their working life, the film also looks at their private lives. Rei is acting in an amateur theatre company along with the receptionist from Ayumi''s escort service, while Ayumi is living with her student-boyfriend as he struggles to finally get accepted to college.', 'A look at the lives of two prostitutes in Tokyo: Rei, who works as an S&M dominatrix, and Ayumi, in the more straightforward profession of call girl. In addition to their working life, the film also looks at their private lives. Rei is acting in an amateur theatre company along with the receptionist from Ayumi''s escort service, while Ayumi is living with her student-boyfriend as he struggles to finally get accepted to college.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZZZEiHuNSrcUysRsSrgHrShFzO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108433'),
  ('652407422443790413', 'A New Old Play', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Yuchao Feng, Huang Lingchao, Qiu Jiongjiong', 'Qiu Jiongjiong', 'Yi Sicheng, Chen Haoyu, Guan Nan, Qiu Zhimin, Xue Xuchun, Tao Gu, Xu Gang, Huang Lingchao', null, 'On a 1980s evening, the topmost clown-actor of the 20th century Sichuan opera, Qiu Fu passes away in an accident and half-unwillingly sets off for the Ghost City under the escort of two underworld officials. Along the way, he meets old friends. As they recall the past, a history of the living is conjured up.', 'On a 1980s evening, the topmost clown-actor of the 20th century Sichuan opera, Qiu Fu passes away in an accident and half-unwillingly sets off for the Ghost City under the escort of two underworld officials. Along the way, he meets old friends. As they recall the past, a history of the living is conjured up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gTx04TJjAKhoark4SZ6TrGxgWh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513305'),
  ('431391844449592151', 'A New Year''s Resolution', 2021, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Paul Suderman, Lesley Demetriades', 'Sarah Montana', 'Aimee Teegarden, Michael Rady, Elise Bauman, Patricia Isaac, Devon Alexander, Michelle Morgan, Michael Strickland, Adam Hurtig', null, 'When a morning show producer makes a New Year''s resolution to say yes more, she crosses paths with a confirmed Yes man who just might hold the key to her biggest story and to her heart.', 'When a morning show producer makes a New Year''s resolution to say yes more, she crosses paths with a confirmed Yes man who just might hold the key to her biggest story and to her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9l1v24dqbAlHdYHpt9T84zs17J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630926'),
  ('952447031245297514', 'A New York Christmas Wedding', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie, Drama, Fantasy', 'Eythan Maidhof, Otoja Abit, Mandy Marcus', 'Otoja Abit', 'Nia Fairweather, Adriana DeMeo, Chris Noth, Otoja Abit, Cooper Koch, David Anzuelo, Denny Dillon, Natasha Goodman', null, 'As her Christmas Eve wedding draws near, Jennifer is visited by an angel and shown what could have been if she hadn''t denied her true feelings for her childhood best friend.', 'As her Christmas Eve wedding draws near, Jennifer is visited by an angel and shown what could have been if she hadn''t denied her true feelings for her childhood best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HBCqJIBogtq3u1uyCJyo2as8ic.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:739518'),
  ('1017327636132029373', 'A Nice Girl Like You', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Chris Riedell, Nick Riedell, Nico van den Berg', 'Andrea Marcellus', 'Lucy Hale, Leonidas Gulaptis, Mindy Cohn, Jackie Cruz, Adhir Kalyan, Stephen Friedrich, Deborah S. Craig, Leah McKendrick', 'R', 'Lucy Neal is thrown for a loop when she is accused of being too inhibited by her ex-boyfriend. In an effort to prove him wrong, Lucy creates a rather wild to-do list that sends her on a whirlwind and surprising journey of self-discovery, friendship, and new love.', 'Lucy Neal is thrown for a loop when she is accused of being too inhibited by her ex-boyfriend. In an effort to prove him wrong, Lucy creates a rather wild to-do list that sends her on a whirlwind and surprising journey of self-discovery, friendship, and new love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVFfofTQCaoru8oiaOGW0G4YSwQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718840'),
  ('561327856201690442', 'A Nice Indian Boy', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Amy Vincent, Roshan Sethi', 'Eric Randall', 'Karan Soni, Jonathan Groff, Sunita Mani, Zarna Garg, Harish Patel, Peter S. Kim, Sean Amsing, Sas Goldberg', 'NR', 'When Naveen brings his fiancé Jay home to meet his traditional Indian family, they must contend with accepting his white-orphan-artist boyfriend and helping them plan the Indian wedding of their dreams.', 'When Naveen brings his fiancé Jay home to meet his traditional Indian family, they must contend with accepting his white-orphan-artist boyfriend and helping them plan the Indian wedding of their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfY2FZlnm5uaQbaWR9IYW41J1xG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1128614'),
  ('511871719710782579', 'A Nice Jewish Boy', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Moritz Parisius, Noé Debré, Boris Lévy', 'Noé Debré', 'Michael Zindel, Agnès Jaoui, Solal Bouloudnine, Eva Huault, Khalid Maadour, Pierre-Henry Salfati, Jean-Claude Bolle-Reddat, Redouanne Harjane', null, 'Bellisha is a good Jewish boy. He is a 27-year-old curly-haired, weak and nonchalant young man who struggles to become an adult. He still lives with his mother, Giselle, in a poor neighborhood. After the closing of the last synagogue, it is the turn of the last kosher grocery store to close its doors. That''s it, they are the last Jewish family in the area. But much to Giselle''s dismay, Bellisha doesn''t particularly want to leave. He feels comfortable and positive, despite the tensions in the community and his mother''s rapidly deteriorating health.', 'Bellisha is a good Jewish boy. He is a 27-year-old curly-haired, weak and nonchalant young man who struggles to become an adult. He still lives with his mother, Giselle, in a poor neighborhood. After the closing of the last synagogue, it is the turn of the last kosher grocery store to close its doors. That''s it, they are the last Jewish family in the area. But much to Giselle''s dismay, Bellisha doesn''t particularly want to leave. He feels comfortable and positive, despite the tensions in the community and his mother''s rapidly deteriorating health.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nA3pf2RKX9wJHIZ7cmhvgvD2rM6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958855'),
  ('770824387860106442', 'A Nice Plate of Spinach', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Václav Vorlíček, František Uldrich, Jaroslav Pour', 'Miloš Macourek, Václav Vorlíček', 'Vladimír Menšík, Jiří Sovák, Iva Janžurová, Michal Kocourek, Ondřej Hach, František Filipovský, Ivana Maříková, Petr Přívozník', null, 'The heroes of this absurd comedy, full of confusion and humor are Dzharda Zemanek and Frantisek Liska.', 'The heroes of this absurd comedy, full of confusion and humor are Dzharda Zemanek and Frantisek Liska.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7m5X72YSBBmwGzPfcK2GHpQclYR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80093'),
  ('40058676851133792', 'A Night at Karlstein', 1974, 'Comedy, History, Music', 'Zdeněk Podskalský, Jaroslav Kučera, Jan Mimra', 'Zdeněk Podskalský', 'Vlastimil Brodský, Jana Brejchová, Karel Höger, Jaroslav Marvan, Miloš Kopecký, Waldemar Matuška, Slávka Budínová, Daniela Kolářová', null, 'No Woman is allowed into Karlstejn Castle! Yet the enamoured Daniele Kolářová and the equally enamoured Jana Brejchová manage to spend one night in disguise in the Castle despite the strict royal ban.', 'No Woman is allowed into Karlstejn Castle! Yet the enamoured Daniele Kolářová and the equally enamoured Jana Brejchová manage to spend one night in disguise in the Castle despite the strict royal ban.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkjMLDccR7q33uIbBYTx09tSU31.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52217'),
  ('962811709267143141', 'A Night at the Garden', 2017, 'Documentary, History', 'Marshall Curry', null, null, null, 'Archival footage of an American Nazi rally that attracted 20,000 people at Madison Square Garden in 1939, shortly before the beginning of World War II.', 'Archival footage of an American Nazi rally that attracted 20,000 people at Madison Square Garden in 1939, shortly before the beginning of World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcRlfW4PzBBdcLk2a8T038VNRQ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480429'),
  ('40650340474907667', 'A Night at the Kindergarten', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Rafał Skalski, Filip Drożdż', 'Marek Baranowski', 'Piotr Witkowski, Lena Góra, Zbigniew Zamachowski, Aleksandra Domańska, Dobromir Dymecki, Matylda Damięcka, Maciej Nawrocki, Sylwia Boroń', null, 'A young man crashes a school play rehearsal to prevent a group of teachers and eccentric parents from expelling his girlfriend''s son.', 'A young man crashes a school play rehearsal to prevent a group of teachers and eccentric parents from expelling his girlfriend''s son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6tDFLtLzlzkm27OOOsdjlK58wD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1065796'),
  ('282293570436290622', 'A Night at the Movies', 1937, 'Comedy', 'Roy Rowland', 'Robert Benchley, Robert Lees, Frederic I. Rinaldo', 'Robert Benchley, Betty Ross Clarke, King Baggot, Jack Baxley, Sidney Bracey, Francis X. Bushman Jr., Ricardo Lord Cezon, Hal K. Dawson', 'NR', 'A Night at the Movies is a short film starring Robert Benchley. It was Benchley''s greatest success since How to Sleep, and won him a contract for more short films that would be produced in New York. In this comedic short, a man and his wife suffer through a night at the movies. The film was nominated for an Academy Award at the 10th Academy Awards, held in 1937, for Best Short Subject (One-Reel).', 'A Night at the Movies is a short film starring Robert Benchley. It was Benchley''s greatest success since How to Sleep, and won him a contract for more short films that would be produced in New York. In this comedic short, a man and his wife suffer through a night at the movies. The film was nominated for an Academy Award at the 10th Academy Awards, held in 1937, for Best Short Subject (One-Reel).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMd9DlChbegzLrnUZNOB4Q1eJVq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208527'),
  ('1060774305149338751', 'A Night at the Opera', 1935, 'Comedy, Music', 'Sam Wood, Merritt B. Gerstad, Lesley Selander', 'Morrie Ryskind, George S. Kaufman', 'Groucho Marx, Chico Marx, Harpo Marx, Kitty Carlisle, Allan Jones, Sig Ruman, Walter Woolf King, Robert Emmett O''Connor', 'NR', 'The Marx Brothers take on high society and the opera world to bring two lovers together. A sly business manager and two wacky friends of two opera singers help them achieve success while humiliating their stuffy and snobbish enemies.', 'The Marx Brothers take on high society and the opera world to bring two lovers together. A sly business manager and two wacky friends of two opera singers help them achieve success while humiliating their stuffy and snobbish enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4YDGfJwaG7aMxDVrVJsOHJ7ufK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37719'),
  ('42622193230621392', 'A Night at the Roxbury', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'John Fortenberry, Francis Kenny, J. Stephen Buck', 'Steve Koren, Chris Kattan, Will Ferrell', 'Chris Kattan, Will Ferrell, Dan Hedaya, Molly Shannon, Richard Grieco, Loni Anderson, Elisa Donovan, Gigi Rice', 'PG-13', 'Despite being well into adulthood, brothers Doug and Steve Butabi still live at home and work in the flower shop owned by their dad. They exist only to hit on women at discos, though they''re routinely unsuccessful until a chance run-in with Richard Grieco gets them inside the swank Roxbury club. Mistaken for high rollers, they meet their dream women, Vivica and Cambi, and resolve to open a club of their own.', 'Despite being well into adulthood, brothers Doug and Steve Butabi still live at home and work in the flower shop owned by their dad. They exist only to hit on women at discos, though they''re routinely unsuccessful until a chance run-in with Richard Grieco gets them inside the swank Roxbury club. Mistaken for high rollers, they meet their dream women, Vivica and Cambi, and resolve to open a club of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oZ5xE4AL4D5EbeQUaoRxahgzJX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9429'),
  ('127810041871296883', 'A Night Full of Rain', 1978, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lina Wertmüller, Giuseppe Rotunno, Gianni Arduini', 'Lina Wertmüller', 'Giancarlo Giannini, Candice Bergen, Michael Tucker, Mario Scarpetta, Lucio Amelio, Massimo Wertmüller, Anny Papa, Anne Byrne Hoffman', null, 'Lizzy, a liberated American photographer, falls for narrow-minded journalist Paolo. Then finds she can''t live with him or without him.', 'Lizzy, a liberated American photographer, falls for narrow-minded journalist Paolo. Then finds she can''t live with him or without him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HKngLySXZaQMvx1HoT914nrjx4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142358'),
  ('862883798530541035', 'A Night in 67', 2010, 'Documentary, Music, History', 'Renato Terra, Ricardo Calil, Jacques Cheuiche', null, 'Gilberto Gil, Caetano Veloso, Chico Buarque, Roberto Carlos, Sérgio Ricardo, Nelson Motta, Zuza Homem de Mello, Chico de Assis', null, 'In the 1970s, "festivals" were incredibly popular in Brazil, as they were recorded before a live studio audience, and usually featured a number of elimination rounds. They also formed the springboard for the career of many a big-name stars, such as Chico Buarque, Caetano Veloso, Roberto Carlos and Gilberto Gil. Appearing on such a program was no cakewalk, however: audiences could be as wild in their condemnation as in their appreciation of an artist. Extensive archive footage (including performances and behind-the-scenes interviews) from the turbulent final evening of the Festival of Brazilian Popular Music 1967 paints a fascinating picture, not only of the transformation of Brazilian music into real "festival" music, but also of a society starting to buck against the yoke of military rule.', 'In the 1970s, "festivals" were incredibly popular in Brazil, as they were recorded before a live studio audience, and usually featured a number of elimination rounds. They also formed the springboard for the career of many a big-name stars, such as Chico Buarque, Caetano Veloso, Roberto Carlos and Gilberto Gil. Appearing on such a program was no cakewalk, however: audiences could be as wild in their condemnation as in their appreciation of an artist. Extensive archive footage (including performances and behind-the-scenes interviews) from the turbulent final evening of the Festival of Brazilian Popular Music 1967 paints a fascinating picture, not only of the transformation of Brazilian music into real "festival" music, but also of a society starting to buck against the yoke of military rule.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/roYR6IPSHY8fpNRr0ZNIxCxyIr5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67257'),
  ('941837799632296440', 'A Night in Casablanca', 1946, 'Comedy', 'Archie Mayo, James Van Trees, Frank Webster', 'Roland Kibbee, Joseph Fields', 'Groucho Marx, Harpo Marx, Chico Marx, Charles Drake, Lois Collier, Sig Ruman, Lisette Verea, Lewis L. Russell', 'NR', 'The Marx Brothers are employed at a hotel in postwar Casablanca, where a ring of Nazis is trying to recover a cache of stolen treasure.', 'The Marx Brothers are employed at a hotel in postwar Casablanca, where a ring of Nazis is trying to recover a cache of stolen treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iltVdhtFkIyHuZDfJi9I1UAHD9D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26940'),
  ('677701099969399213', 'A Night in Four Parts', 2022, 'Drama', 'Ali Kemal Güven, Engin Özkaya, Fırat Sevin', 'Ali Kemal Güven', 'Ahmet Rıfat Şungar, Barış Gönenen, Adnan Devran, Gülhan Kadim, Ecrin Bolkar', null, 'Two former high school buddies meet on a raki night in Beyoğlu after 17 years. As they drink and talk they realize another life is possible on a land where toxic masculinity does not exist. They represent the great divide in Turkish gay society: The lonely self-declared homosexuals and the married hypocrites.', 'Two former high school buddies meet on a raki night in Beyoğlu after 17 years. As they drink and talk they realize another life is possible on a land where toxic masculinity does not exist. They represent the great divide in Turkish gay society: The lonely self-declared homosexuals and the married hypocrites.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NsePQEH01eQb159AelUl8ISVj5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:953148'),
  ('641674679739431280', 'A Night in Heaven', 1983, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'John G. Avildsen, Robert E. Warren, Alan Hopkins', 'Joan Tewkesbury', 'Christopher Atkins, Lesley Ann Warren, Robert Logan, Deborah Rush, Deney Terrio, Sandra Beall, Alix Elias, Carrie Snodgress', 'R', 'Faye Hanlon is a community-college professor with an emotionally depressed husband and an abundance of sexual frustration. Her sister drags her to a male strip-club for a girls-night out, where she discovers that one of the dancers is her failing student Rick Monroe, a.k.a. "Ricky the Rocket". A heated affair between teacher & student ensues, as Faye struggles to reconcile her emotions and make consequential life choices: Continue her lustful sessions with the studly-but-shallow teen stripper? Or break it off with Ricky & work to salvage her marriage to the loving-but-distant husband?', 'Faye Hanlon is a community-college professor with an emotionally depressed husband and an abundance of sexual frustration. Her sister drags her to a male strip-club for a girls-night out, where she discovers that one of the dancers is her failing student Rick Monroe, a.k.a. "Ricky the Rocket". A heated affair between teacher & student ensues, as Faye struggles to reconcile her emotions and make consequential life choices: Continue her lustful sessions with the studly-but-shallow teen stripper? Or break it off with Ricky & work to salvage her marriage to the loving-but-distant husband?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhre1Vcv8gp9VV9JkPKdPV97bXx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5686'),
  ('1146407285196394710', 'A Night in Nude', 1993, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Takashi Ishii, Yasushi Sasakibara', 'Takashi Ishii', 'Naoto Takenaka, Kimiko Yo, Kippei Shiina, Tomorowo Taguchi, Jinpachi Nezu, Noriko Hayami, Ryo Iwamatsu, Hideo Murota', null, 'Jiro is a Tokyo man who offers a stand-in service where he''ll do "anything". A woman claiming to be from Fukuoka wants to be shown around Tokyo and see the sights. What Jiro doesn''t know is that this woman isn''t who she says she is. She''s on the run from her Yakuza boyfriend, and Jiro is going to be unwittingly entwined in the situation.', 'Jiro is a Tokyo man who offers a stand-in service where he''ll do "anything". A woman claiming to be from Fukuoka wants to be shown around Tokyo and see the sights. What Jiro doesn''t know is that this woman isn''t who she says she is. She''s on the run from her Yakuza boyfriend, and Jiro is going to be unwittingly entwined in the situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AaGqanl3rDj4sqBcIJhHgqQs805.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105125'),
  ('58812584692220330', 'A Night In Nude: Salvation', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Takashi Ishii, Hiro''o Yanagida, Mineharu Kitamura', 'Takashi Ishii', 'Naoto Takenaka, Hiroko Satoh, Machiko Kochi, Harumi Inoue, Shinobu Otake, Joe Shishido, Ken Kurahara', null, 'A beautiful mother and her two daughters run a bar in a town. They have a dream of becoming rich, reforming the building, and living as celebrities. With no chance of their dream coming true with just their everyday earnings, they had another face - blinding the elderly with their beauty, putting on insurance coverage and seeking to get rich quick by murdering. However, their scheme begins to collapse from one little mistake.', 'A beautiful mother and her two daughters run a bar in a town. They have a dream of becoming rich, reforming the building, and living as celebrities. With no chance of their dream coming true with just their everyday earnings, they had another face - blinding the elderly with their beauty, putting on insurance coverage and seeking to get rich quick by murdering. However, their scheme begins to collapse from one little mistake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtL2LTr4YsPJIWb2Y5pNwOv7XYB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69574'),
  ('67298702663846789', 'A Night in Old Mexico', 2013, 'Drama', 'Emilio Aragón, David Omedes', 'William D. Wittliff', 'Robert Duvall, Jeremy Irvine, Angie Cepeda, Luis Tosar, Joaquín Cosío, Rene Rhi, Eric A. Williams, Sonny Carl Davis', 'NR', 'Forced to give up his land and home, Texas rancher Red Bovie isn''t about to retire quietly in a dismal trailer park. Instead he hops in his Cadillac and hits the road with his estranged grandson for one last wild adventure filled with guns, women and booze. It’s just another night in Old Mexico.', 'Forced to give up his land and home, Texas rancher Red Bovie isn''t about to retire quietly in a dismal trailer park. Instead he hops in his Cadillac and hits the road with his estranged grandson for one last wild adventure filled with guns, women and booze. It’s just another night in Old Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tKNOPkle5weHfrobca4LnXJMD5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248688'),
  ('1118943910620527042', 'A Night in the Fields', 2020, 'Drama', 'Guillaume Grélardon, Eric Blanckaert', 'Guillaume Grélardon', 'Félix Lefebvre, Jéremy Gillet, Yoann Zimmer, Nadia Tereszkiewicz, Sandrine Salyères, Jitka Grekova, Elisa Delorme, Yoann Jouneau', null, 'In a working-class town, Anthony and Dylan, two inseparable 14-year-old teenagers decide to go on a walk for a retro house party in a nightclub called the Komplex. While one wants to join Océane, a young girl with whom he is in love, the other wants to escape from Joe, his brother''s dealer, from whom he stole money and part of his stock.', 'In a working-class town, Anthony and Dylan, two inseparable 14-year-old teenagers decide to go on a walk for a retro house party in a nightclub called the Komplex. While one wants to join Océane, a young girl with whom he is in love, the other wants to escape from Joe, his brother''s dealer, from whom he stole money and part of his stock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70EhgNTJx6G70wTZRJfyVGvfoah.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:465820'),
  ('475849272337768763', 'A Night in the Life of Jimmy Reardon', 1988, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'William Richert, John J. Connor', 'William Richert', 'River Phoenix, Ann Magnuson, Meredith Salenger, Ione Skye, Louanne, Matthew Perry, Paul Koslo, Jane Hallaren', 'R', 'A recent high school graduate is faced with two options, either go to a business school where his father wants him to go to, or get a full time job. However he decides to defy his father and go to Hawaii. Trouble is he has no money. Along the way he comes to understand his parents and eventually bonds with his father.', 'A recent high school graduate is faced with two options, either go to a business school where his father wants him to go to, or get a full time job. However he decides to defy his father and go to Hawaii. Trouble is he has no money. Along the way he comes to understand his parents and eventually bonds with his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOH45Qf4O65BEODTlfMwrXUBCYO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47818'),
  ('437411556197127379', 'A Night in the Show', 1915, 'Comedy', 'Charlie Chaplin, Harry Ensign, Roland Totheroh', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin, Edna Purviance, Charlotte Mineau, Dee Lampton, Leo White, Wesley Ruggles, John Rand, James T. Kelley', 'NR', 'Mr. Pest tries several theatre seats before winding up in front in a fight with the conductor. He is thrown out. In the lobby he pushes a fat lady into a fountain and returns to sit down by Edna. Mr. Rowdy, in the gallery, pours beer down on Mr. Pest and Edna. He attacks patrons, a harem dancer, the singers Dot and Dash, and a fire-eater.', 'Mr. Pest tries several theatre seats before winding up in front in a fight with the conductor. He is thrown out. In the lobby he pushes a fat lady into a fountain and returns to sit down by Edna. Mr. Rowdy, in the gallery, pours beer down on Mr. Pest and Edna. He attacks patrons, a harem dancer, the singers Dot and Dash, and a fire-eater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9aFYk99nbwPlZ3hj1FJWMyPfoa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53412'),
  ('148682847205179250', 'A Night in Versailles', 1992, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bruno Podalydès, Pierre Stoeber, Frédéric Bassin', 'Bruno Podalydès', 'Isabelle Candelier, Denis Podalydès, Philippe Uchan, Michel Vuillermoz, Ariane Pirié, Bernard Levy, Jean-Noël Brouté, Dominique Esnault', null, 'A young man in Versailles invites a Parisian girl to his place for dinner. The evening is thrown into turmoil.', 'A young man in Versailles invites a Parisian girl to his place for dinner. The evening is thrown into turmoil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pb6wZ8mitRHun7QaQAivJoKgK6h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71260'),
