  ('796747448725608486', 'A Night on Bald Mountain', 1933, 'Animation, Fantasy, Horror', 'Claire Parker, Alexandre Alexeieff', null, null, null, 'Mussorgsky''s composition is the soundtrack for this pin-screen animated take on night and wild things. A scarecrow blows down, clouds move by quickly. Beings take shape; a town appears, animals flee, and a horse gallops by. A child looks on. Monsters run and float by: the phantasmagoric is everywhere. A woman''s figure tumbles through space. A clash ensues. The horse falls. Goblins take control. The night and its denizens are relentless. Forms appear and become grotesque. Will dawn and calm ever come?', 'Mussorgsky''s composition is the soundtrack for this pin-screen animated take on night and wild things. A scarecrow blows down, clouds move by quickly. Beings take shape; a town appears, animals flee, and a horse gallops by. A child looks on. Monsters run and float by: the phantasmagoric is everywhere. A woman''s figure tumbles through space. A clash ensues. The horse falls. Goblins take control. The night and its denizens are relentless. Forms appear and become grotesque. Will dawn and calm ever come?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fK121dvs0pTPs6a2gFtK26krxqv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129403'),
  ('14978504016324453', 'A Night to Dismember', 1983, 'Horror', 'Doris Wishman, C. Davis Smith', 'Judy J. Kushner', 'Samantha Fox, Diane Cummins, Saul Meth, Miriam Meth, William Szarka, Chris Smith, Dee Cummins, Larry Hunter', 'NR', 'A woman from a "cursed" family is released from a mental facility, and soon dismembered corpses start turning up.', 'A woman from a "cursed" family is released from a mental facility, and soon dismembered corpses start turning up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kZM0G11jpNuvVKP45e7uKVy4Dr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47827'),
  ('717092303558162567', 'A Night to Remember', 1942, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Richard Wallace, Morris Stoloff, William Mull', 'Richard Flournoy, Jack Henley', 'Loretta Young, Brian Aherne, Jeff Donnell, William Wright, Sidney Toler, Gale Sondergaard, Donald MacBride, Lee Patrick', 'NR', 'A woman rents a gloomy basement apartment in Greenwich Village thinking it will provide the perfect atmosphere for her mystery writer husband to create his next book. They soon find themselves in the middle of a real-life mystery when a corpse turns up in their apartment.', 'A woman rents a gloomy basement apartment in Greenwich Village thinking it will provide the perfect atmosphere for her mystery writer husband to create his next book. They soon find themselves in the middle of a real-life mystery when a corpse turns up in their apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mVHxgQk13KUMETPLf7GPgG8sObv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77121'),
  ('852709793898805762', 'A Night to Remember', 1958, 'Drama, Action, History', 'Roy Ward Baker, Geoffrey Unsworth, Maurice Gibson', 'Eric Ambler', 'Kenneth More, Ronald Allen, Robert Ayres, Honor Blackman, Anthony Bushell, John Cairney, Jill Dixon, Jane Downs', 'NR', 'The sinking of the Titanic is presented in a highly realistic fashion in this tense British drama. The disaster is portrayed largely from the perspective of the ocean liner''s second officer, Charles Lightoller. Despite numerous warnings about ice, the ship sails on, with Capt. Edward John Smith keeping it going at a steady clip. When the doomed vessel finally hits an iceberg, the crew and passengers discover that they lack enough lifeboats, and tragedy follows.', 'The sinking of the Titanic is presented in a highly realistic fashion in this tense British drama. The disaster is portrayed largely from the perspective of the ocean liner''s second officer, Charles Lightoller. Despite numerous warnings about ice, the ship sails on, with Capt. Edward John Smith keeping it going at a steady clip. When the doomed vessel finally hits an iceberg, the crew and passengers discover that they lack enough lifeboats, and tragedy follows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fDhJAz6AuYWj3hAnvUL42Xlxfj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10971'),
  ('420353474840575579', 'A Night with Sabrina Love', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Alejandro Agresti, Andy Muschietti, Myriam Marin-Celibert', 'Alejandro Agresti', 'Cecilia Roth, Tomás Fonzi, Fabián Vena, Giancarlo Giannini, Norma Aleandro, Julieta Cardinali, Mario Paolucci, Luis Margani', null, 'When he wins a contest, seventeen-year-old Daniel Montero gets to spend a night in Buenos Aires with his favorite adult movie star, Sabrina Love. However, getting there will be half the trouble of meeting Sabrina.', 'When he wins a contest, seventeen-year-old Daniel Montero gets to spend a night in Buenos Aires with his favorite adult movie star, Sabrina Love. However, getting there will be half the trouble of meeting Sabrina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4824tZ85D6M2cw3bF3fNPCylrD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127435'),
  ('556706177076451046', 'A Nightingale Sang In Berkeley Square', 1980, 'Crime, Comedy, Action', 'Ralph Thomas, John Coquillon, David Tringham', 'Guy Elmes', 'Richard Jordan, Oliver Tobias, David Niven, Elke Sommer, Gloria Grahame, Richard Johnson, Brian Protheroe, Brian Croucher', null, 'An American ex-con who is trying to go straight is persuaded to be the inside man for an audacious bank job in central London.', 'An American ex-con who is trying to go straight is persuaded to be the inside man for an audacious bank job in central London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ikuooBPq38HRLwn9qbEjTmyu1fb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104912'),
  ('481056227585203424', 'A Nightmare', 1896, 'Horror', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès, Jehanne d''Alcy', null, 'A man has a fantastical nightmare involving, among other things, a grinning malevolent moon.', 'A man has a fantastical nightmare involving, among other things, a grinning malevolent moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aB81KASGqn54LRFvQ0eeAkPkrxC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104469'),
  ('747523754841510519', 'A Nightmare on Elm Street', 1984, 'Horror', 'Wes Craven, Jacques Haitkin, Nicholas Batchelor', 'Wes Craven', 'John Saxon, Ronee Blakley, Heather Langenkamp, Amanda Wyss, Jsu Garcia, Johnny Depp, Charles Fleischer, Joseph Whipp', 'R', 'Teenagers in a small town are dropping like flies, apparently in the grip of mass hysteria causing their suicides. A cop''s daughter, Nancy Thompson, traces the cause to child molester Fred Krueger, who was burned alive by angry parents many years before. Krueger has now come back in the dreams of his killers'' children, claiming their lives as his revenge. Nancy and her boyfriend, Glen, must devise a plan to lure the monster out of the realm of nightmares and into the real world...', 'Teenagers in a small town are dropping like flies, apparently in the grip of mass hysteria causing their suicides. A cop''s daughter, Nancy Thompson, traces the cause to child molester Fred Krueger, who was burned alive by angry parents many years before. Krueger has now come back in the dreams of his killers'' children, claiming their lives as his revenge. Nancy and her boyfriend, Glen, must devise a plan to lure the monster out of the realm of nightmares and into the real world...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wGTpGGRMZmyFCcrY2YoxVTIBlli.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377'),
  ('168894294461954076', 'A Nightmare on Elm Street', 2010, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jeff Cutter, Samuel Bayer, Eric Leach', 'Wes Craven', 'Rooney Mara, Kyle Gallner, Jackie Earle Haley, Katie Cassidy, Thomas Dekker, Kellan Lutz, Clancy Brown, Connie Britton', 'R', 'Teenagers Nancy, Quentin, Kris, Jesse and Dean are all neighborhood friends who begin having the same dream of a horribly disfigured man who wears a tattered sweater and a glove made of knives. The man terrorizes them in their dreams, and the only escape is to wake up. But when, one by one, they start dying violently, the friends realize that what happens in the dream world is real, and the only way to stay alive is to stay awake.', 'Teenagers Nancy, Quentin, Kris, Jesse and Dean are all neighborhood friends who begin having the same dream of a horribly disfigured man who wears a tattered sweater and a glove made of knives. The man terrorizes them in their dreams, and the only escape is to wake up. But when, one by one, they start dying violently, the friends realize that what happens in the dream world is real, and the only way to stay alive is to stay awake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nsmW28GcNabCUZfP5YtUEe8Li0f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23437'),
  ('801475921435058973', 'A Nightmare on Elm Street 3: Dream Warriors', 1987, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Roy H. Wagner, Chuck Russell, Robert Engelman', 'Frank Darabont, Chuck Russell, Bruce Wagner', 'Heather Langenkamp, Patricia Arquette, Craig Wasson, Robert Englund, Laurence Fishburne, Ken Sagoes, Rodney Eastman, Jennifer Rubin', 'R', 'A psychiatrist, familiar with the knife-wielding dream demon Freddy Krueger, helps teens at a mental hospital battle the killer who is invading their dreams.', 'A psychiatrist, familiar with the knife-wielding dream demon Freddy Krueger, helps teens at a mental hospital battle the killer who is invading their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbtZewU6EGvxi8yFVzwZ31NijLX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10072'),
