  ('700671498720745990', 'A Noisy Day', 1961, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Anatoli Efros, Georgi Natanson, Viktor Dombrovsky', 'Viktor Rozov', 'Valentina Sperantova, Gennadi Pechnikov, Tatyana Nadezhdina, Vladimir Zemlyanikin, Oleg Tabakov, Yevgeni Perov, Lev Kruglyy, Liliya Tolmacheva', null, 'On an ordinary Moscow street, a family lives together in an unremarkable house: a mother and four children. But one "fine" day in this family there is a violent conflict over the furniture with which the apartment is packed. However, furniture is just an excuse. In fact, two worldviews collide, different ideas about life values...', 'On an ordinary Moscow street, a family lives together in an unremarkable house: a mother and four children. But one "fine" day in this family there is a violent conflict over the furniture with which the apartment is packed. However, furniture is just an excuse. In fact, two worldviews collide, different ideas about life values...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bnpllkzAjUz37M6W10phZHLPeYd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265963'),
  ('565045122943264403', 'A Noite da Virada', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Fábio Mendonça, Marcelo Trotta', 'Cláudia Jouvin, Nina Crintzs', 'Luana Piovani, Marcos Palmeira, Júlia Rabello, Paulo Tiefenthaler, João Vicente de Castro, Luana Martau, Rodrigo Sant''anna, Martha Nowill', null, 'Ana and Duda, a couple who''s in the verge of taking a break from their marriage, throw a New Year''s party at their house. The party gets overcrowded with all kinds of people, and it''s in the bathroom that most things will happen between them both and many other guests.', 'Ana and Duda, a couple who''s in the verge of taking a break from their marriage, throw a New Year''s party at their house. The party gets overcrowded with all kinds of people, and it''s in the bathroom that most things will happen between them both and many other guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9R0a85in6KPsNVRt7qcmhXwrzBY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309309'),
