  ('910764213389720619', 'A or B', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Yizeng Liu, Ren Peng-Yuan', null, 'Xu Zheng, Wang Likun, Wang Yanhui, Duan Bowen, Simon Yam, Yu Hewei, Zhu Zhu, Zhao Da', null, 'A young business elite, Zhong, was imprisoned in a house! Everyday, a mysterious man will reveal one of his darkest secrets to the world. At the same time, his wife, friends and business partners were all been dragged into this incident one after another. Being imprisoned, how will Zhong combat this challenging situation? How will he escape from the house and fight the mysterious man and complete the salvation?', 'A young business elite, Zhong, was imprisoned in a house! Everyday, a mysterious man will reveal one of his darkest secrets to the world. At the same time, his wife, friends and business partners were all been dragged into this incident one after another. Being imprisoned, how will Zhong combat this challenging situation? How will he escape from the house and fight the mysterious man and complete the salvation?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKpQdfHPY5eKJENBuTboizXR1s3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521871'),
