  ('482610561973129559', 'A Paw Patrol Christmas', 2025, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Jamie Whitney', 'Cal Brunker', 'Luke Dietz, Lilly Bartlam, Lucien Duncan-Reid, Jesse Gervasi, Courtney Gilmour, Kai Harris, Jordan Mazeral, Ron Pardo', 'G', 'Rubble is looking forward to Santa bringing him a new laser drill, but finds that Santa has come down with a cold and can’t deliver any presents. When Mayor Humdinger decides he’s going to the North Pole to take all the gifts for himself, it’s up to the PAW Patrol to stop him.', 'Rubble is looking forward to Santa bringing him a new laser drill, but finds that Santa has come down with a cold and can’t deliver any presents. When Mayor Humdinger decides he’s going to the North Pole to take all the gifts for himself, it’s up to the PAW Patrol to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZpH8UEQD2743cMOPjXqNCg7bWv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1507275'),
  ('436440583234814432', 'A Peck o'' Trouble', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Sheldon Leonard', 'NR', 'Lazy Dodsworth the Cat wants to catch a woodpecker for his breakfast. The woodpecker has built its home inside the upper trunk of a very tall tree, and Dodsworth puts on a professor''s cap, pretending to be a passive teacher of bird-catching and thereby deceive an eager-to-learn kitten into doing the perilous ascending of the tree to try to catch the woodpecker.', 'Lazy Dodsworth the Cat wants to catch a woodpecker for his breakfast. The woodpecker has built its home inside the upper trunk of a very tall tree, and Dodsworth puts on a professor''s cap, pretending to be a passive teacher of bird-catching and thereby deceive an eager-to-learn kitten into doing the perilous ascending of the tree to try to catch the woodpecker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjpqvtQiQ4C8RNiEX32Clig9ua4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165229'),
  ('312231096905559390', 'A Peephole', 2013, 'Animation, Romance', 'Katsuhiko Nishijima, Kenji Hattori', 'Ookubo Masahiro', 'Yuka Hirata, Daisuke Hirakawa', null, 'Kido Tatsuhiko moved to Tokyo to attend an art school and start his new life. In his new room, there''s a small hole in the wall. At first he can see nothing through the small hole, but one night, through the peeping hole, he saw a girl named Ikuno Emiru, a perverted voyeur who ropes him into her peeping fetish… But each winds up getting more than they bargained for.', 'Kido Tatsuhiko moved to Tokyo to attend an art school and start his new life. In his new room, there''s a small hole in the wall. At first he can see nothing through the small hole, but one night, through the peeping hole, he saw a girl named Ikuno Emiru, a perverted voyeur who ropes him into her peeping fetish… But each winds up getting more than they bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9WL2RuB1ddkUd8EV01MLryO4nL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235407'),
  ('396947409463895767', 'A Peephole', 2014, 'Mystery', 'Ataru Ueda, Kensuke Tsukuda', 'Manabu Fujita', 'Chocolat Ikeda, Atsumi Kanno, Beni Itô, Rin Ogawa, Riri Kuribayashi, Ayumi Niijima, Ayumi Kimito, Sū Suzuki', null, 'Tatsuhiko Kido is a young man who moved from Tokyo to attend a vocational school. Although he thought he had begun his new school life with no problem, he finds a hole in his wall, and sometimes he feels a gaze coming at him from that hole, so he can''t relax. The night he went drinking with his classmate Yoneyama, he sees a light coming from the same hole when he comes home. When he tries calling out to the other side, he gets a reply...', 'Tatsuhiko Kido is a young man who moved from Tokyo to attend a vocational school. Although he thought he had begun his new school life with no problem, he finds a hole in his wall, and sometimes he feels a gaze coming at him from that hole, so he can''t relax. The night he went drinking with his classmate Yoneyama, he sees a light coming from the same hole when he comes home. When he tries calling out to the other side, he gets a reply...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smOt9d4chH4tZXp059LSMOHhw2F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279281'),
