  ('417102066448186467', 'A Perfect Day', 2008, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ferzan Özpetek, Fabio Zamarion', 'Sandro Petraglia, Ferzan Özpetek', 'Isabella Ferrari, Valerio Mastandrea, Valerio Binasco, Nicole Grimaudo, Federico Costantini, Monica Guerritore, Angela Finocchiaro, Stefania Sandrelli', null, 'Antonio and Emma have been separated for years, but he does not accept when Emma dates other men. Indeed Antonio proves obsessive, aggressive and intrusive, and again threatens Emma to hurt the children: little Kevin, shy and introverted, and the adolescent Valentina.', 'Antonio and Emma have been separated for years, but he does not accept when Emma dates other men. Indeed Antonio proves obsessive, aggressive and intrusive, and again threatens Emma to hurt the children: little Kevin, shy and introverted, and the adolescent Valentina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OAoOukTHtkQjyT25tagOhlcESa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12432'),
  ('216287579523479843', 'A Perfect Day', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Fernando León de Aranoa, Antonio Ordóñez, Álex Catalán', 'Diego Farias', 'Benicio del Toro, Tim Robbins, Olga Kurylenko, Mélanie Thierry, Feđa Štukan, Eldar Rešidović, Sergi López, Nenad Vukelić', 'R', 'Somewhere in the Balkans, 1995. A team of aid workers must solve an apparently simple problem in an almost completely pacified territory that has been devastated by a cruel war, but some of the local inhabitants, the retreating combatants, the UN forces, many cows and an absurd bureaucracy will not cease to put obstacles in their way.', 'Somewhere in the Balkans, 1995. A team of aid workers must solve an apparently simple problem in an almost completely pacified territory that has been devastated by a cruel war, but some of the local inhabitants, the retreating combatants, the UN forces, many cows and an absurd bureaucracy will not cease to put obstacles in their way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/musAGdMpfvxhNvEnxXgmzcjBxWL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321751'),
  ('786797079519919734', 'A Perfect Ending', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Nicole Conn, Tal Lazar', 'Nicole Conn', 'Barbara Niven, Jessica Clark, John Heard, Morgan Fairchild, Kerry Knuppe, Imelda Corcoran, Mary Jane Wells, Rebecca Staab', 'NR', 'This intimate drama follows Rebecca, a woman who has kept her sexuality a secret from her friends but chooses to reveal it to a stranger. While Rebecca''s revelations may not yield the results she expects, a perfect ending is still in reach.', 'This intimate drama follows Rebecca, a woman who has kept her sexuality a secret from her friends but chooses to reveal it to a stranger. While Rebecca''s revelations may not yield the results she expects, a perfect ending is still in reach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjwWEwE1xdbtFGCOgeXi5jvQnOU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107257'),
  ('374920250630128675', 'A Perfect Enemy', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Rita Noriega, Kike Maíllo, Chloé Rosell', 'Fernando Navarro, Kike Maíllo, Cristina Clemente', 'Tomasz Kot, Athena Strates, Marta Nieto, Dominique Pinon, Felizia Trube, Julian Helmes, Sebastian Ghandchi, Nerea Jordana', null, 'Famed architect Jeremy Angust is approached on his trip to the Paris Airport by a chatty girl named Texel Textor who needs a ride. He obliges and after they part ways at the airport entrance, he misses his flight. As he settles in the lounge, he encounters the mysterious young Texel again, who insists on telling her strange story — and the conversation grows stranger and more twisted until it turns sinister and deadly.', 'Famed architect Jeremy Angust is approached on his trip to the Paris Airport by a chatty girl named Texel Textor who needs a ride. He obliges and after they part ways at the airport entrance, he misses his flight. As he settles in the lounge, he encounters the mysterious young Texel again, who insists on telling her strange story — and the conversation grows stranger and more twisted until it turns sinister and deadly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgz3SDI99VJEE9uJEiVh4iqNlq8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655917'),
  ('502931935916421037', 'A Perfect Family', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Fabrizio Lucci, Paolo Genovese', 'Fernando León de Aranoa', 'Sergio Castellitto, Marco Giallini, Claudia Gerini, Carolina Crescentini, Ilaria Occhini, Eugenia Costantini, Eugenio Franceschini, Giacomo Nasta', null, 'Leone is a rich and powerful man whose loneliness drives him to hire a cast of actors to play the family he never had. On Christmas Eve, reality and make-believe start to get blurred.', 'Leone is a rich and powerful man whose loneliness drives him to hire a cast of actors to play the family he never had. On Christmas Eve, reality and make-believe start to get blurred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkmvXoqQnzqkF66315TrsjSDilG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162282'),
