  ('613091898443493804', 'A Perfect Friend', 2006, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Francis Girod, Thierry Jault', 'Philippe Cougrand, Francis Girod', 'Antoine de Caunes, Jean-Pierre Lorit, Carole Bouquet, Martina Gedeck, Marie-France Pisier, Claude Miller, Mireille Roussel, Hanns Zischler', null, '"Julien Rossi wakes up in a hospital bed and finds he has no memory of the events that left him in a coma in the early hours of New Year''s Day. Was he attacked? Or was his head injury caused in an accident? This is only the first of many mysteries Julien has to resolve. Who is Marl?ne, the beautiful woman who claims to be his girlfriend? Why doesn''t his real girlfriend, Anna, return his calls? What made him walk out on his job as a leading investigative reporter? Julien relies on Lucas, his best friend and', '"Julien Rossi wakes up in a hospital bed and finds he has no memory of the events that left him in a coma in the early hours of New Year''s Day. Was he attacked? Or was his head injury caused in an accident? This is only the first of many mysteries Julien has to resolve. Who is Marl?ne, the beautiful woman who claims to be his girlfriend? Why doesn''t his real girlfriend, Anna, return his calls? What made him walk out on his job as a leading investigative reporter? Julien relies on Lucas, his best friend and', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7z3NPJCZ4sZt0qIr5ssHUmAtSL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77224'),
  ('364562424709685402', 'A Perfect Getaway', 2009, 'Thriller, Mystery, Adventure', 'David Twohy, Mark Plummer, Steve Koster', 'David Twohy', 'Steve Zahn, Milla Jovovich, Timothy Olyphant, Kiele Sanchez, Chris Hemsworth, Marley Shelton, Holt McCallany, Anthony Ruivivar', 'R', 'For their honeymoon, newlyweds Cliff and Cydney head to the tropical islands of Hawaii. While journeying through the paradisaical countryside the couple encounters Kale and Cleo, two disgruntled hitchhikers and Nick and Gina, two wild but well-meaning spirits who help guide them through the lush jungles. The picturesque waterfalls and scenic mountainsides quickly give way to terror when Cliff and Cydney learn of a grisly murder that occurred nearby and realize that they''re being followed by chance acquaintances that suspiciously fit the description of the killers.', 'For their honeymoon, newlyweds Cliff and Cydney head to the tropical islands of Hawaii. While journeying through the paradisaical countryside the couple encounters Kale and Cleo, two disgruntled hitchhikers and Nick and Gina, two wild but well-meaning spirits who help guide them through the lush jungles. The picturesque waterfalls and scenic mountainsides quickly give way to terror when Cliff and Cydney learn of a grisly murder that occurred nearby and realize that they''re being followed by chance acquaintances that suspiciously fit the description of the killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncuGG0hIlA03dQBJmdoT2LWgodG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12403'),
