  ('997890827584624264', 'A Perfect Man', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Prune Brachet, Yann Gozlan, Antoine Roch', 'Yann Gozlan, Guillaume Lemans', 'Pierre Niney, Ana Girardot, André Marcon, Valéria Cavalli, Thibault Vinçon, Marc Barbé, Sacha Mijovic, Éric Savin', null, 'A struggling writer finds a shortcut to fame, but a blackmailer threatens to ruin his perfect life.', 'A struggling writer finds a shortcut to fame, but a blackmailer threatens to ruin his perfect life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgmgPPPI3APwLHXRvxaGCWGf3FE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322125'),
  ('905463967039550871', 'A Perfect Murder', 1998, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Andrew Davis, Dariusz Wolski, Laura Brock', 'Frederick Knott, Patrick Smith Kelly', 'Michael Douglas, Gwyneth Paltrow, Viggo Mortensen, David Suchet, Sarita Choudhury, Michael P. Moran, Novella Nelson, Constance Towers', 'R', 'Millionaire industrialist Steven Taylor is a man who has everything but what he craves most: the love and fidelity of his wife. A hugely successful player in the New York financial world, he considers her to be his most treasured acquisition. But she needs more than simply the role of dazzling accessory.', 'Millionaire industrialist Steven Taylor is a man who has everything but what he craves most: the love and fidelity of his wife. A hugely successful player in the New York financial world, he considers her to be his most treasured acquisition. But she needs more than simply the role of dazzling accessory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wC0ax12N9GQ8vMXPEs4nES5AAiB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1965'),
  ('51186309017958319', 'A Perfect Pairing', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Stuart McDonald, Ben Nott', 'Hilary Galanoy, Elizabeth Hackett', 'Victoria Justice, Adam Demos, Luca Sardelis, Samantha Cain, Craig Horner, Antonio Alvarez, Lucy Durack, Emily Havea', 'PG', 'To land a major client, an LA wine exec travels to an Australian sheep station, where she signs on as a ranch hand and hits it off with a rugged local.', 'To land a major client, an LA wine exec travels to an Australian sheep station, where she signs on as a ranch hand and hits it off with a rugged local.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h65lLhYEfRGOWVZzwX9n7vYOixf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934761'),
  ('918469646122131374', 'A Perfect Plan', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Pascal Chaumeil, Glynn Speeckaert', 'Laurent Zeitoun, Yoann Gromb', 'Diane Kruger, Dany Boon, Alice Pol, Robert Plagnol, Jonathan Cohen, Bernadette Le Saché, Etienne Chicot, Laure Calamy', null, 'Successful woman in love tries to break her family curse of every first marriage ending in divorce, by dashing to the altar with a random stranger before marrying her boyfriend.', 'Successful woman in love tries to break her family curse of every first marriage ending in divorce, by dashing to the altar with a random stranger before marrying her boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPFBW4KaLyCdXwEsa2TXRBW0Jxe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133698'),
  ('413591647398092776', 'A Perfect Plan', 2020, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jesse D. Ikeman, Pasha Patriki, Stewart Young', 'Geoff Hart, Al Kratina, Jesse D. Ikeman', 'William Forsythe, Kathleen Munroe, Carlo Rota, Gia Sandhu, Michael Hough, Milton Barnes, Alli Chung, Dean Armstrong', null, 'Four notorious thieves wake up in a fortified warehouse and are forced by a cunning master thief to plan and commit an extraordinary diamond heist.', 'Four notorious thieves wake up in a fortified warehouse and are forced by a cunning master thief to plan and commit an extraordinary diamond heist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wah4b3hDb3ueVNuwNxdplUE8ppQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:699046'),
  ('441381862083569390', 'A Perfect Stranger', 1994, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Michael Miller, Mike Fash', 'Jan Worthington', 'Robert Urich, Stacy Haiduk, Darren McGavin, Susan Sullivan, Marion Ross, Holly Marie Combs, George R. Robertson', 'NR', 'A television movie based on "A Perfect Stranger," Danielle Steel''s novel about an attorney who falls in love with the young wife of a wealthy man who is dying.', 'A television movie based on "A Perfect Stranger," Danielle Steel''s novel about an attorney who falls in love with the young wife of a wealthy man who is dying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkMDHEhBJsnUptH9HZiRVbmotnF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233206'),
  ('62741826214040159', 'A Perfect World', 1993, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Jack N. Green, Clint Eastwood, Bill Bannerman', 'John Lee Hancock', 'Kevin Costner, Clint Eastwood, Laura Dern, T.J. Lowther, Bradley Whitford, Keith Szarabajka, Leo Burmester, Paul Hewitt', 'PG-13', 'A kidnapped boy strikes up a friendship with his captor: an escaped convict on the run from the law, headed by an honorable U.S. Marshal.', 'A kidnapped boy strikes up a friendship with his captor: an escaped convict on the run from the law, headed by an honorable U.S. Marshal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWX2CYM5TbWaZwll4ysh7OjVUmJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9559'),
  ('842041833743492033', 'A Perfectly Normal Family', 2020, 'Drama', 'Malou Reymann, Sverre Sørdal, Laura Emilie Hancock', 'Malou Reymann, Maren Louise Käehne, Rune Schjøtt', 'Mikkel Boe Følsgaard, Kaya Toft Loholt, Rigmor Ranthe, Neel Rønholt, Jessica Dinnage, Hadewych Minis, Tammi Øst, Nicolai Dahl Hamilton', null, 'Emma has a perfectly normal family until one day it turns out her dad, Thomas, is transgender. As Thomas becomes Agnete, both father and daughter struggle to hold on to what they had while accepting that everything has changed.', 'Emma has a perfectly normal family until one day it turns out her dad, Thomas, is transgender. As Thomas becomes Agnete, both father and daughter struggle to hold on to what they had while accepting that everything has changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qSChbRNvhpz6LOPxvTFuIyeOPTd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571687'),
  ('367213081670289955', 'A Pest in the House', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan', 'NR', 'A very tired businessman needs some sleep and checks into a hotel run by Elmer Fudd, where Daffy Duck is the bellhop.', 'A very tired businessman needs some sleep and checks into a hotel run by Elmer Fudd, where Daffy Duck is the bellhop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLeGFZiDtRYRdxV6EMtWtLaS787.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83675'),
  ('896345319331021054', 'A Petal', 1996, 'Drama', 'Jang Sun-woo, You Yong-kil, Kim Dong-ho', 'Choi Yoon', 'Lee Jung-hyun, Moon Sung-keun, Lee Young-ran, Sul Kyung-gu, Chu Sang-mi, Park Kwang-jung, Huh Joon-ho, Dong Bang-woo', null, 'The story of a girl who experienced the Gwangju massacre at the age of 15, and its effect on her life in later years.', 'The story of a girl who experienced the Gwangju massacre at the age of 15, and its effect on her life in later years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bcnsTh9mQVSrDdBbd56vSpkSZr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65335'),
  ('336746660218545946', 'A Phantasy', 1952, 'Fantasy, Animation', 'Norman McLaren', null, null, null, 'An animated film drawn entirely in pastels. Various fantastical plant-like things "grow" from the ground, eventually launching five spheres. The spheres drift in space while changing shapes and come back down to another setting, which eventually becomes more fantastical and symbolic than the opening one. The soundtrack has a jazz slant, with an ensemble of four saxophones and synthetic sound (i.e. sound created by drawing directly on the soundtrack).', 'An animated film drawn entirely in pastels. Various fantastical plant-like things "grow" from the ground, eventually launching five spheres. The spheres drift in space while changing shapes and come back down to another setting, which eventually becomes more fantastical and symbolic than the opening one. The soundtrack has a jazz slant, with an ensemble of four saxophones and synthetic sound (i.e. sound created by drawing directly on the soundtrack).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1aiJtOWm4rEqRXhzidUcQcvAal.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223243'),
  ('82011033006296385', 'A Picture of Her', 2023, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Mel Ward, Michael Robison', 'Donald Davenport, Jeff Wood', 'Rhiannon Fish, Tyler Hynes, Samantha Ferris, Robert Wisden, Alison Araya, Aadila Dosani, Gavin Langelo, Seth Whittaker', 'G', 'Beth unwittingly becomes the subject of an award-winning magazine’s cover and goes on a quest to uncover the true identity of the mystery photographer who snapped her photo.', 'Beth unwittingly becomes the subject of an award-winning magazine’s cover and goes on a quest to uncover the true identity of the mystery photographer who snapped her photo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iviFpnmCu0qs6VzH9H0WlhX4aja.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1081439'),
  ('1039934277588046702', 'A Picture of Madame Yuki', 1975, 'Drama', 'Masashige Narusawa, Makoto Naito, Tōichirō Narushima', 'Seiichi Funahashi, Masashige Narusawa', 'Yoshiko Sakuma, Tetsuro Tamba, Isao Yamagata, Yuko Hama, Akemi Kita, Hayato Tani', null, 'Set against the dramatic backdrop of the downfall of an old aristocratic family, this is the story of its last representant: Lady Yuki.', 'Set against the dramatic backdrop of the downfall of an old aristocratic family, this is the story of its last representant: Lady Yuki.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rECNoLHR6zz1jS3y2VQgLoPhvGe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1297345'),
  ('760492872025040371', 'A Picture Perfect Wedding', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Family, Romance, Drama', 'Geoff Wallace, Dave T. Nall, Jüs Percy', 'Jason Delaney', 'Emily Tennant, Tyler Johnston, Ben Bordeau, Kylee Bush, Loretta Walsh, Raylene Harewood, Scott Bellis, Adil Zaidi', null, 'Wedding photographer Lindsey gets her big opportunity when a New York mogul’s son, Josh, asks her to shoot his sister’s wedding. Sparks fly as Josh and Lindsey prepare for ceremony, and the pair begin to fall for each other. But as the big day arrives and the project finishes, do they go back their old, separate lives or will they follow their hearts?', 'Wedding photographer Lindsey gets her big opportunity when a New York mogul’s son, Josh, asks her to shoot his sister’s wedding. Sparks fly as Josh and Lindsey prepare for ceremony, and the pair begin to fall for each other. But as the big day arrives and the project finishes, do they go back their old, separate lives or will they follow their hearts?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCo6jzToNTOcpeECqSB6MF35Egu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:779008'),
  ('236111112390802418', 'A Piece of Cake', 2019, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Amnon Schwarz, Ute von Münchow-Pohl', 'Jan Strathmann', 'Jella Haase, Louis Hofmann, Elke Heidenreich, Leon Seidel, Detlef Bierstedt', null, 'The legendary Elfkins (Heinzelmännchen) of Cologne were gnomes secretly helping craftsmen at night until they were ousted by a tailor''s malevolent wife 200 years ago. This is the story of their return.', 'The legendary Elfkins (Heinzelmännchen) of Cologne were gnomes secretly helping craftsmen at night until they were ousted by a tailor''s malevolent wife 200 years ago. This is the story of their return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9nLplPuTXceAwvGqedZRPTAaX4d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638220'),
  ('1018591529404006088', 'A Piece of Pleasure', 1975, 'Drama', 'Jean Rabier, Claude Chabrol', 'Paul Gégauff', 'Paul Gégauff, Danièle Gégauff, Clémence Gégauff, Paula Moore, Michel Valette, Giancarlo Sisti, Cécile Vassort, Mario Santini', null, 'Phillipe and Esther live an apparently idyllic life with their daughter, Elise. In an attempt to preserve this bliss, Phillipe decides that he and Esther should each have affairs, being sure to tell each other openly about them. The plan backfires with tragic results as Phillipe becomes engulfed in jealously.', 'Phillipe and Esther live an apparently idyllic life with their daughter, Elise. In an attempt to preserve this bliss, Phillipe decides that he and Esther should each have affairs, being sure to tell each other openly about them. The plan backfires with tragic results as Phillipe becomes engulfed in jealously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eyzHCoSnsZIY9IiH3MvgTUXOXA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76207'),
  ('385649594287438047', 'A Piece of Sky', 2022, 'Drama', 'Armin Dierolf, Michael Koch', 'Michael Koch', 'Michèle Brand, Simon Wisler, Jeroen Engelsman, Anna-Katharina Müller, Elin Zgraggen, Daniela Barmettler, Josef Aschwanden', null, 'Although a lowlander, Marco is a robust fellow. He is now working as a farmhand for mountain farmer Alois in a remote Swiss alpine village and, even at the regulars’ table at the local inn, people are slowly learning to appreciate this iced tea drinker. Anna is a local village girl; she has a daughter, Julia, from a previous relationship. Some doubt whether this new relationship will work out – but not Marco or Anna. They get married. Their love is gentle and beautiful; unable to fully fathom it, they express it in simple words. The trust between them grows and their tenderness endures; the happiness they feel at every touch is only surpassed by the warmth of stroking a cow. But soon Marco seems to be losing control of his impulses more and more often.', 'Although a lowlander, Marco is a robust fellow. He is now working as a farmhand for mountain farmer Alois in a remote Swiss alpine village and, even at the regulars’ table at the local inn, people are slowly learning to appreciate this iced tea drinker. Anna is a local village girl; she has a daughter, Julia, from a previous relationship. Some doubt whether this new relationship will work out – but not Marco or Anna. They get married. Their love is gentle and beautiful; unable to fully fathom it, they express it in simple words. The trust between them grows and their tenderness endures; the happiness they feel at every touch is only surpassed by the warmth of stroking a cow. But soon Marco seems to be losing control of his impulses more and more often.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A321Ov8q30b2LPiSnIw6TBeLXrG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728499'),
  ('535693906883544028', 'A Piece of the Action', 1977, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Sidney Poitier, Donald M. Morgan', 'Charles Blackwell', 'Sidney Poitier, Bill Cosby, James Earl Jones, Denise Nicholas, Hope Clarke, Tracy Reed, Ja''net DuBois, Sheryl Lee Ralph', 'PG', 'How does retired cop Joshua Burke (James Earl Jones) get two career criminals, Manny Durrell (Sidney Poitier) and Dave Anderson (Bill Cosby), to follow the straight and narrow? Con them into helping juvenile delinquents turn over a new leaf. But how? Burke has never been able to nail the duo, but he uses what he knows of their seedy past to blackmail them into volunteering.', 'How does retired cop Joshua Burke (James Earl Jones) get two career criminals, Manny Durrell (Sidney Poitier) and Dave Anderson (Bill Cosby), to follow the straight and narrow? Con them into helping juvenile delinquents turn over a new leaf. But how? Burke has never been able to nail the duo, but he uses what he knows of their seedy past to blackmail them into volunteering.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25MMJiTb9KPmINm8XN1LXyuZOG0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29493'),
  ('127426407290172920', 'A Pig''s Tale', 1996, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Paul Tassie, Ronald Víctor García', 'Scott Sandorf, Charles Ransom, Todd Richardson', 'Joe Flaherty, Sean Babb, Mike Damus, Jonathan Hilario, Lisa Jakub, Andrew Leeds, Olumiji Olawumi, Graham Sack', 'PG', 'Kids'' comedy with all the clichés. Six boys (hero, pudgy, dumb, romeo, etc), reluctantly sent to summer camp, are grouped together in a ramshackle hut, and instantly identified as losers and outcasts by the overconfident camp bullies, who target gorgeous Tiffany (Jakub) as their Lothario''s girlfriend. They set out to make everyone''s life miserable as they impose their authority on the other kids and ineffective counselors alike. Andy, the good-guy hero, of course has a crush on Tiffany, but hasn''t a clue how to approach her. Gradually, the nice guys gain the edge over the bullies, by honest endeavor and standing up for themselves - and in doing so, win over the other kids, even Tiffany. Until the bullies frame them and have them expelled.', 'Kids'' comedy with all the clichés. Six boys (hero, pudgy, dumb, romeo, etc), reluctantly sent to summer camp, are grouped together in a ramshackle hut, and instantly identified as losers and outcasts by the overconfident camp bullies, who target gorgeous Tiffany (Jakub) as their Lothario''s girlfriend. They set out to make everyone''s life miserable as they impose their authority on the other kids and ineffective counselors alike. Andy, the good-guy hero, of course has a crush on Tiffany, but hasn''t a clue how to approach her. Gradually, the nice guys gain the edge over the bullies, by honest endeavor and standing up for themselves - and in doing so, win over the other kids, even Tiffany. Until the bullies frame them and have them expelled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jUEKhMjZSVRIRjlr8Cs6IMUXAj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112973'),
  ('759072737396032094', 'A Pigeon Sat on a Branch Reflecting on Existence', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Roy Andersson, István Borbás, Gergely Pálos', 'Roy Andersson', 'Holger Andersson, Nisse Vestblom, Viktor Gyllenberg, Lotti Törnros, Jonas Gerholm, Ola Stensson, Oscar Salomonsson, Roger Olsen Likvern', 'PG-13', 'An absurdist, surrealistic and shocking pitch-black comedy, which moves freely from nightmare to fantasy to hilariously deadpan humour as it muses on man’s perpetual inhumanity to man.', 'An absurdist, surrealistic and shocking pitch-black comedy, which moves freely from nightmare to fantasy to hilariously deadpan humour as it muses on man’s perpetual inhumanity to man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2uRIr0fNpZbTGH5youi7MDRL2T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110390'),
  ('835529984523403501', 'A Pilot Returns', 1942, 'Drama, War', 'Roberto Rossellini, Alberto Attili, Vincenzo Seratrice', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Massimo Mida, Margherita Maglione', 'Massimo Girotti, Michela Belmonte, Gaetano Masier, Piero Lulli, Nino Brondello, Giovanni Valdambrini, Elvira Betrone, Piero Palermini', null, 'A young Italian pilot is interned in a British prison camp after his plane is shot down during the war against Greece. He falls in love with a doctor''s daughter and manages to escape during a bombardment. He reaches home, wounded, just as news arrives of the Greek surrender.', 'A young Italian pilot is interned in a British prison camp after his plane is shot down during the war against Greece. He falls in love with a doctor''s daughter and manages to escape during a bombardment. He reaches home, wounded, just as news arrives of the Greek surrender.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9AaPmpdDq37usuoXkcPUoIcAM0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58532'),
  ('286838303683735490', 'A Pinch of Portugal', 2023, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Clare Niederpruem, Luís Branquinho', 'Nicole Baxter', 'Heather Hemmens, Luke Mitchell, Duarte Gomes, Johnna Dias-Watson, Eric Geynes, Darren Day, Amy Louise Pemberton, Martina Laird', 'G', 'When a celebrity chef walks off his show, prep cook Anna must step into the spotlight and make the show her own, with the help of her Aussie cameraman and Portuguese location scout.', 'When a celebrity chef walks off his show, prep cook Anna must step into the spotlight and make the show her own, with the help of her Aussie cameraman and Portuguese location scout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kezARoHkqxe9rwooYs2od1GgdOf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1093765'),
  ('465591916678598675', 'A Pink Christmas', 1978, 'Animation', 'Bill Perez', null, null, null, 'It''s holiday time, and while New York City bustles with yuletide celebrations, the Pink Panther suffers one misadventure after another... all in hopes of finding a warm heart and a warm meal! Finally, the Panther learns the true meaning of Christmas... and friendship.', 'It''s holiday time, and while New York City bustles with yuletide celebrations, the Pink Panther suffers one misadventure after another... all in hopes of finding a warm heart and a warm meal! Finally, the Panther learns the true meaning of Christmas... and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLDaYE1sMCAwUfcgr82DXnxD1wx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49854'),
  ('854276942107939866', 'A Pirate''s Heart', 2006, 'Adventure', 'Miguel Alexandre', 'Walter Kärger', 'Ken Duken, Claire Keim, Gottfried John, Miguel Herz-Kestranek, Stephan Luca, Frank Giering, Timo Dierkes, Jochen Nickel', null, 'The end of the 14th century. Parents send the eldest son Jan to study in Hamburg, and the youngest - Klaus - to the monastery. No sooner had the children moved away from their homes, as on Klaus''es eyes the robbers kill their parents and burn the house. Only thanks to the loyal monk Wigbold Klaus managed to survive the shock. A few years later Klaus Störtebeker finds his brother Jan and his long-time friend Elizabeth Pren in Hamburg. From her, he learns that she is expected to marry Simon von Wallenrod, whose father Klaus suspects of killing his parents. But the Pranks and the Wallenrods are rich and respected people, and Klaus is a poor man. And now he becomes a pirate...', 'The end of the 14th century. Parents send the eldest son Jan to study in Hamburg, and the youngest - Klaus - to the monastery. No sooner had the children moved away from their homes, as on Klaus''es eyes the robbers kill their parents and burn the house. Only thanks to the loyal monk Wigbold Klaus managed to survive the shock. A few years later Klaus Störtebeker finds his brother Jan and his long-time friend Elizabeth Pren in Hamburg. From her, he learns that she is expected to marry Simon von Wallenrod, whose father Klaus suspects of killing his parents. But the Pranks and the Wallenrods are rich and respected people, and Klaus is a poor man. And now he becomes a pirate...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9M4c2s5wwQJKJllBYebpxUw9nDk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187423'),
  ('556579367024651524', 'A Pistol for Ringo', 1965, 'Western', 'Duccio Tessari, Mahnahén Velasco, Francisco Marín', 'Duccio Tessari', 'Giuliano Gemma, Fernando Sancho, Lorella De Luca, Nieves Navarro, Antonio Casas, José Manuel Martín, Manuel Muñiz, Juan Cazalilla', null, 'Giuliano Gemma stars as a cool, cocky mercenary enlisted by a sheriff to infiltrate a ruthless gang of outlaws. Ennio Morricone provided the score to this early spaghetti western hit.', 'Giuliano Gemma stars as a cool, cocky mercenary enlisted by a sheriff to infiltrate a ruthless gang of outlaws. Ennio Morricone provided the score to this early spaghetti western hit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpA8zRTg3V6IXzzv7vgabJoQk6H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56431'),
  ('339486550463036598', 'A Pizza Tweety-Pie', 1958, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Daws Butler, June Foray', null, 'Another wet and wild Sylvester Cat-Tweety Bird chase, this time in the flooded areas of Venice, Italy, where Granny has taken Tweety on vacation.', 'Another wet and wild Sylvester Cat-Tweety Bird chase, this time in the flooded areas of Venice, Italy, where Granny has taken Tweety on vacation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aw3OT1yicoOmqGp0KvcehmsSLZb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234979'),
  ('247629143218507939', 'A Place Called Chiapas', 1998, 'Documentary', 'Nettie Wild, Kirk Tougas, Nettie Wild', 'Nettie Wild, Manfred Becker', 'Rafael Sebastián Guillén Vicente, Samuel Ruiz García, Javier Elorriaga, Jorge Kanter, Gonzalo Ituarte Icario', null, 'In 1994, the Zapatista National Liberation Army, made up of impoverished Mayan Indians from the state of Chiapas, took over five towns and 500 ranches in southern Mexico. The government deployed its troops and at least 145 people died in the ensuing battle. Filmmaker Nettie Wild travelled to the country''s jungle canyons to film the elusive and fragile life of this uprising.', 'In 1994, the Zapatista National Liberation Army, made up of impoverished Mayan Indians from the state of Chiapas, took over five towns and 500 ranches in southern Mexico. The government deployed its troops and at least 145 people died in the ensuing battle. Filmmaker Nettie Wild travelled to the country''s jungle canyons to film the elusive and fragile life of this uprising.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wAYj5ehozgtgjvJl65dM2mArxH9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41227'),
  ('314353125127307948', 'A Place Called Silence', 2024, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Sam Quah, Zhang Ying', 'Sam Quah, 王吱吱, 王祎梦', 'Wang Chuanjun, Janine Chang Chun-Ning, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Wang Shengdi, Cai Ming, King Shih-chieh, Huang Minghao, Josie Xu Jiao', null, 'Chen Yutong, a girl''s middle school student, was bullied at school, but her mother Li Han was unable to save her daughter from the "hell." Everyone around her turned a blind eye, and a collective silence brewed greater violence.', 'Chen Yutong, a girl''s middle school student, was bullied at school, but her mother Li Han was unable to save her daughter from the "hell." Everyone around her turned a blind eye, and a collective silence brewed greater violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKThqY2oRYSHOPxYryTp2550fuZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1300945'),
  ('924119974373389725', 'A Place Close to Heaven', 1952, 'Drama', 'Rogelio A. González, Manuel Muñoz ''Torito'', Agustín Martínez Solares', 'Rogelio A. González', 'Pedro Infante, Marga López, Andrés Soler, Antonio Aguilar, Silvia Pinal, Luis Aceves Castañeda, Arturo Soto Rangel, Diana Ochoa', null, 'An honest man emigrates to the capital in search of a better life, but ends up mired in extreme poverty along with his family; forced to overcome tragedy and despair to find, even in misery, a glimmer of hope.', 'An honest man emigrates to the capital in search of a better life, but ends up mired in extreme poverty along with his family; forced to overcome tragedy and despair to find, even in misery, a glimmer of hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diLDkCyq1kQD85F913WXsDBBVuk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122763'),
  ('617025426644492929', 'A Place for Annie', 1994, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'John Gray, Donald M. Morgan', 'Lee Guthrie, Cathleen Young', 'Sissy Spacek, Mary-Louise Parker, Joan Plowright, S. Epatha Merkerson, Jack Noseworthy, David Spielberg, Robin Pearson Rose, Richard Gilbert-Hill', null, 'Baby Annie is HIV positive and has been left in the clinic by her drug addicted mother. To prevent her from being placed in a home where they''d just wait for her to die, nurse Susan takes charge of Annie at her home. Two years later, she plans to adopt her -- but suddenly Annie''s mother reappears and demands her back. And under the law, Susan, as foster-mother, has no claim to the child.', 'Baby Annie is HIV positive and has been left in the clinic by her drug addicted mother. To prevent her from being placed in a home where they''d just wait for her to die, nurse Susan takes charge of Annie at her home. Two years later, she plans to adopt her -- but suddenly Annie''s mother reappears and demands her back. And under the law, Susan, as foster-mother, has no claim to the child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nN0JBL2Ha8kr5wKavjcfDZ2zCsh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57682'),
  ('880488783027703698', 'A Place for Her', 2026, 'Drama', 'Mélisa Godet, Fabien Faure, Yasmine Abboud', 'Mélisa Godet', 'Karin Viard, Laetitia Dosch, Oulaya Amamra, Eye Haïdara, Pierre Deladonchamps, Juliette Armanet, Laurent Stocker, Jean-Charles Clichet', null, 'At the Maison des Femmes, women victims of violence are cared for. Elsewhere, they are threatened, brutalized, raped, mutilated, their suffering ignored. Here, they are listened to, supported, helped and believed. Diane, Manon, Inès, Awa and the others will give them a helping hand until they can stand up again. As a team. Even if it means risking their own equilibrium.', 'At the Maison des Femmes, women victims of violence are cared for. Elsewhere, they are threatened, brutalized, raped, mutilated, their suffering ignored. Here, they are listened to, supported, helped and believed. Diane, Manon, Inès, Awa and the others will give them a helping hand until they can stand up again. As a team. Even if it means risking their own equilibrium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CUXmCLU9DkZHH8w4w43ZvOdVTd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1318417'),
  ('754601768857104192', 'A Place for Lovers', 1968, 'Drama, Romance', 'Peter Baldwin, Luisa Alessandri, Zeno Vukelich', 'Julian Zimet, Ennio De Concini, Tonino Guerra', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Faye Dunaway, Enrico Simonetti, Karin Eugh, Esmeralda Ruspoli, Caroline Mortimer, Mirella Pamphili, Yvonne Gilbert', null, 'Globe-trotting clothes-horse Julia, who''s harboring a secret, embarks on a 10-day fling with Valerio in Italy.', 'Globe-trotting clothes-horse Julia, who''s harboring a secret, embarks on a 10-day fling with Valerio in Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccQv9jzBHP7qo5KY7gQoCuFg5JG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95727'),
  ('1121407816147579352', 'A Place for Pierrot', 2025, 'Drama', 'Hélène Médigue, Vianney Etossé, Seb Antoine', 'Hélène Médigue, Stéphane Cabel', 'Marie Gillain, Grégory Gadebois, Mathilde Labarthe, Patrick Mille, François Vincentelli, Marianne Basler, Jack Claudany, Vincent Elbaz', null, 'Pierrot, 50, is autistic and lives in a care home. His sister Camille, 45, discovers that he is being overmedicated, causing him to regress. Outraged, she decides to take him into her home while she searches for a place that is better suited to his needs. A long quest begins.', 'Pierrot, 50, is autistic and lives in a care home. His sister Camille, 45, discovers that he is being overmedicated, causing him to regress. Outraged, she decides to take him into her home while she searches for a place that is better suited to his needs. A long quest begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwi1idRTXlQXhdqJzUQDPNdH20D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1151269'),
  ('596315089844381909', 'A Place in the Caribbean', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Juan Carlos Fanconi', null, 'José Zúñiga, Gabriela de la Garza, Lali González, Rodrigo Guirao Díaz, Gastón Pauls, Jamie Bernadette, Daniel Zacapa, Fermin Galeano', null, 'Gael travels to the Island of Roatan to finish his last novel and finds love at first sight. Sofia and her father missed their cruise and are forced to stay in the wonderful island. Three love stories around this magical place.', 'Gael travels to the Island of Roatan to finish his last novel and finds love at first sight. Sofia and her father missed their cruise and are forced to stay in the wonderful island. Three love stories around this magical place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXSw54alMY3K2MXV5nhMAD06B7e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396797'),
  ('1005624516394278165', 'A Place in the Sun', 1951, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'George Stevens, William C. Mellor, Charles C. Coleman', 'Michael Wilson, Harry Brown', 'Montgomery Clift, Elizabeth Taylor, Shelley Winters, Anne Revere, Keefe Brasselle, Fred Clark, Raymond Burr, Herbert Heyes', 'NR', 'A young social climber wins the heart of a beautiful heiress but his former girlfriend''s pregnancy stands in the way of his ambition.', 'A young social climber wins the heart of a beautiful heiress but his former girlfriend''s pregnancy stands in the way of his ambition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3tKYbChwIRYCwFrMUDBkbZyDIoN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25673'),
  ('386437041426633133', 'A Place in the Sun', 2019, 'Documentary', 'François Ruffin, Gilles Perret, Gilles Perret', null, 'François Ruffin', null, 'Made on a shoestring budget, François Ruffin and Gilles Perret’s investigative documentary has the adventurous spirit of a road movie. Intimate and sometimes humorous, encounters with yellow vest protestors pierce through reports of violence and destruction, revealing a collective desire for equity.', 'Made on a shoestring budget, François Ruffin and Gilles Perret’s investigative documentary has the adventurous spirit of a road movie. Intimate and sometimes humorous, encounters with yellow vest protestors pierce through reports of violence and destruction, revealing a collective desire for equity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVRWVQ0CvEMh0sLxSBHGA5w8zP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584350'),
  ('809177091796096963', 'A Place in the World', 1992, 'Drama', 'Adolfo Aristarain, Fernando Bassi, Noemí Nemirovsky', 'Kathy Saavedra, Alberto Lecchi', 'Federico Luppi, Gastón Batyi, José Sacristán, Cecilia Roth, Leonor Benedetto, Rodolfo Ranni, Hugo Arana, Nathalie Poza', null, 'Mario and Ana, in voluntary exile from Buenos Aires, live in a remote Argentine valley with their 12-year-old son Ernesto. Mario runs a school and a wool cooperative; Ana, a doctor, heads a clinic with Nelda, a progressive nun. Into this idealistic family comes Hans, a jaded Spanish geological engineer -- surveying the land for the local patron, to see if it can be dammed for hydro-electric power, which would drive the peasants from the land into the cities.', 'Mario and Ana, in voluntary exile from Buenos Aires, live in a remote Argentine valley with their 12-year-old son Ernesto. Mario runs a school and a wool cooperative; Ana, a doctor, heads a clinic with Nelda, a progressive nun. Into this idealistic family comes Hans, a jaded Spanish geological engineer -- surveying the land for the local patron, to see if it can be dammed for hydro-electric power, which would drive the peasants from the land into the cities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fm7OklHHGq8wYHWSZsVwtfv8CLx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32635'),
  ('564802570630353233', 'A Place of One''s Own', 1945, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Bernard Knowles, Stephen Dade', 'Brock Williams', 'Margaret Lockwood, James Mason, Barbara Mullen, Dennis Price, Helen Haye, Michael Shepley, Dulcie Gray, Ernest Thesiger', 'NR', 'An elderly couple move into an old, supposedly haunted abandoned house. A young girl comes to live with the pair as a companion for the wife. However, soon the girl is possessed by the spirit of another girl, a wealthy woman who had once lived in the house but who had been murdered there.', 'An elderly couple move into an old, supposedly haunted abandoned house. A young girl comes to live with the pair as a companion for the wife. However, soon the girl is possessed by the spirit of another girl, a wealthy woman who had once lived in the house but who had been murdered there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfsBdPN710GPxAuXcKQTVrHIGBR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29368'),
  ('334550435930489246', 'A Place on Earth', 2013, 'Drama', 'Crystel Fournier, Fabienne Godet', 'Claire Mercier, Fabienne Godet, Franck Vassal', 'Benoît Poelvoorde, Ariane Labed, Max Baissette de Malglaive, Jacques Spiesser, Catherine Demaiffe, Julie Moulier, Marie-Armelle Deguy, Thomas Coumans', null, 'Antoine is a joyful but disenchanted photographer. His only true friend, Mateo, is 7 years old and the son of his neighbor, who is often absent. One day, he hears a piano sonata coming from the building across the courtyard. Mesmerized by the music, he becomes obsessed by Elena, the beautiful but mysterious pianist, and starts to photograph her at every opportunity. An intense relationship develops between fragile and idealistic Elena and Antoine, who is transformed by this encounter.', 'Antoine is a joyful but disenchanted photographer. His only true friend, Mateo, is 7 years old and the son of his neighbor, who is often absent. One day, he hears a piano sonata coming from the building across the courtyard. Mesmerized by the music, he becomes obsessed by Elena, the beautiful but mysterious pianist, and starts to photograph her at every opportunity. An intense relationship develops between fragile and idealistic Elena and Antoine, who is transformed by this encounter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFaAaqLQGj6fXQTJiV7X8hHHbXV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203145'),
  ('1105430091842708952', 'A Place to Be', 2017, null, 'Tadeo Garcia', null, 'Andrew Saenz, Nelson Rodriguez, Christopher Acevedo, Charin Alvarez, Debbie Baños, Richard Cotovsky, Erica Hernández, Gaby Labotka', null, 'Set against the background of a broken U.S. immigration system, A Place to Be is a love story between two young men, Abel & Diego. When tragedy strikes and Diego''s immigration status is revealed, Abel and Diego discover the power of love during uncertain times.', 'Set against the background of a broken U.S. immigration system, A Place to Be is a love story between two young men, Abel & Diego. When tragedy strikes and Diego''s immigration status is revealed, Abel and Diego discover the power of love during uncertain times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDZSN3OlH9FWM4grIF66OQdnAIU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477580'),
  ('929460891231424544', 'A Place to Fight For', 2023, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Franck Heslon, Marie Usannaz, Alice Pic', 'Catherine Paillé, Romain Cogitore, Thomas Bidegain', 'François Civil, Lyna Khoudri, Nathalie Richard, Bellamine Abdelmalek, Hugo Rossano Parvez, Arthur Rossano Parvez, Anne Alvaro, Chantal Trichet', null, 'Greg is a police lieutenant; he must collect informations on eco-activists, infiltrating them for months. Myriam, a young free woman, is fighting to save a forest from the building of a dam. They meet and fall in love on the Zone. A beautiful life, a joy that Greg discovers, despite the risks of being unmasked. For each of them, time is short: soon everything will disappear.', 'Greg is a police lieutenant; he must collect informations on eco-activists, infiltrating them for months. Myriam, a young free woman, is fighting to save a forest from the building of a dam. They meet and fall in love on the Zone. A beautiful life, a joy that Greg discovers, despite the risks of being unmasked. For each of them, time is short: soon everything will disappear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36wyM5ceCCIpu8lU88mxonYET71.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:988762'),
  ('1038802863977265256', 'A Place to Stand', 1967, 'Documentary', 'Christopher Chapman, Laszlo George, Christopher Chapman', null, null, null, 'An Academy Award winning multi-image large-format film showcasing life in Ontario without narration or dialogue but accompanied by the classic song "A Place to Stand, a Place to Grow (Ontari-ari-ari-o!)" Produced for the Ontario Department of Economics and Development, it premiered at the Ontario Pavilion at Expo ''67 in Montreal.', 'An Academy Award winning multi-image large-format film showcasing life in Ontario without narration or dialogue but accompanied by the classic song "A Place to Stand, a Place to Grow (Ontari-ari-ari-o!)" Produced for the Ontario Department of Economics and Development, it premiered at the Ontario Pavilion at Expo ''67 in Montreal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/362hypl0aakTAX5lyocMzRCKJHL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243307'),
