  ('1079604696634739185', 'A Plasticine Crow', 1981, 'Animation', 'Aleksandr Tatarskiy, Ernst Gaman', 'Aleksandr Tatarskiy', 'Leonid Bronevoy, Alexandr Levenbuk, Lev Shimelov, Grigoriy Gladkov, Alyosha Pavlov', null, 'Short animation of a Russian folk tale, made in 1981. A parody of the fable by Ivan Krylov "The Crow and the Fox".', 'Short animation of a Russian folk tale, made in 1981. A parody of the fable by Ivan Krylov "The Crow and the Fox".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80QaOskAV7IWlqZw4orrw0bjQVZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129229'),
  ('270295090579946718', 'A Plumbing We Will Go', 1940, 'Comedy', 'Del Lord', null, 'Curly Howard, Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Bud Jamison, Wilson Benge, Dudley Dickerson, Bess Flowers, John Tyrrell', 'NR', 'To escape the police, the stooges pose as plumbers and are hired to fix a leak in a fancy mansion, but they wind up crossing the electrical system with the plumbing and generally ruin the place.', 'To escape the police, the stooges pose as plumbers and are hired to fix a leak in a fancy mansion, but they wind up crossing the electrical system with the plumbing and generally ruin the place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9AouAKqxLantITEyI4b7kHfPPG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115983'),
  ('806308568002533028', 'A Poet', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Simón Mesa Soto, Juan Sarmiento G., Eloísa Arcila', 'Simón Mesa Soto', 'Ubeimar Rios, Rebeca Andrade, Guillermo Cardona, Alisson Correa, Margarita Soto, Humberto Restrepo, Hilda Gutíerrez Lodoño, Emmanuel Garcés Botero', null, 'An aging poet finds purpose mentoring Yurlady, a talented teen, though exposing her to the poetry scene might be unwise. His own poetic pursuits led nowhere, leaving him a stereotypical obscure writer.', 'An aging poet finds purpose mentoring Yurlady, a talented teen, though exposing her to the poetry scene might be unwise. His own poetic pursuits led nowhere, leaving him a stereotypical obscure writer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0MRVa3XMUUIxiSCZYaJ1jGXdk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1465563'),
  ('851105284589167109', 'A Police Inspector Calls', 1974, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Sergiu Nicolaescu, Alexandru David', 'Sergiu Nicolaescu, Eugen Burada, Mircea Gândilă', 'Sergiu Nicolaescu, Jean Constantin, Amza Pellea, Ion Besoiu, Ștefan Mihăilescu-Brăila, Vasile Nițulescu, Emmerich Schäffer, Gheorghe Dinică', null, 'The Iron Guard, also known as Legion of Archangel Michael, was a Romanian nationalist and patriotic movement of extreme right; as such, after it rose to power, it supported Nazi Germany and started a fierce campaign of retaliation against its political enemies. As such, in the night of November 26-27, 1940, the Death Teams executed forty political prisoners in the Jilava prison (in the movie, named "Viraga"), and next day, other two Teams arrested and shot the former minister Virgil Madgearu and the world famous historian Nicolae Iorga. To squash down the political outcry, the Police Prefect Stefan Zävoianu conveniently assigns the cases to a commissioner from the "Morals Division" (prostitution, thieves), Tudor Moldovan, hoping that he will fail to get to the bottom of the case. However, Moldovan has communist sympathies, so he quickly comes under the influence of the Bolshevik Pîrvu, who had escaped during the Viraga...', 'The Iron Guard, also known as Legion of Archangel Michael, was a Romanian nationalist and patriotic movement of extreme right; as such, after it rose to power, it supported Nazi Germany and started a fierce campaign of retaliation against its political enemies. As such, in the night of November 26-27, 1940, the Death Teams executed forty political prisoners in the Jilava prison (in the movie, named "Viraga"), and next day, other two Teams arrested and shot the former minister Virgil Madgearu and the world famous historian Nicolae Iorga. To squash down the political outcry, the Police Prefect Stefan Zävoianu conveniently assigns the cases to a commissioner from the "Morals Division" (prostitution, thieves), Tudor Moldovan, hoping that he will fail to get to the bottom of the case. However, Moldovan has communist sympathies, so he quickly comes under the influence of the Bolshevik Pîrvu, who had escaped during the Viraga...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEbP3ymXAVaBNDr3dxEYzUwiHa0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224089'),
