  ('470674000841804484', 'A Prayer for the Dying', 1987, 'Crime, Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Mike Hodges, Terry Needham, John Lawlor', 'Edmund Ward, Martin Lynch', 'Mickey Rourke, Bob Hoskins, Alan Bates, Sammi Davis, Christopher Fulford, Liam Neeson, Leonard Termo, Camille Coduri', 'R', 'Martin, an I.R.A. hitman, is seen by a Catholic priest while carrying out a hit. He grows a bond with the priest and his niece. But his past and his former employers put all their lives in danger.', 'Martin, an I.R.A. hitman, is seen by a Catholic priest while carrying out a hit. He grows a bond with the priest and his niece. But his past and his former employers put all their lives in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLkkVH9u75sciAzTUNZNwFp1smp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33851'),
  ('150537492161046248', 'A Prayer for the Dying', 2026, 'Drama, Family, Thriller', 'Dara Van Dusen, Kate McCullough', 'Dara Van Dusen', 'Johnny Flynn, John C. Reilly, Kristine Kujath Thorp, Gustav Lindh, Hilton Pelser', null, 'In 1870 Friendship, Wisconsin, a small town of Scandinavian settlers still suffering the repercussions of the recent Civil War. When faced with a new and even deadlier threat, one man is forced to make a harrowing choice: save his young family or defend the community that gave him a second chance at life and meaning.', 'In 1870 Friendship, Wisconsin, a small town of Scandinavian settlers still suffering the repercussions of the recent Civil War. When faced with a new and even deadlier threat, one man is forced to make a harrowing choice: save his young family or defend the community that gave him a second chance at life and meaning.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FkYIhGPwr5ztkvnRcD4GzZGfuNhv.jpg', 'plex:movie:a-prayer-for-the-dying-2026'),
  ('155075863316846563', 'A Prewar Grandmother', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Vicente Escrivá, Sinesio Isla', 'Vicente Coello, Vicente Escrivá', 'Isabel Garcés, Alberto de Mendoza, Helga Liné, Josele Román, Guadalupe Muñoz Sampedro, Nadiuska, Deborah Coletti, Francisco Cecilio', null, 'Doña Emilia lives quietly in a village in Lugo, when she receives the news that her son has suffered an accident. So she travels to Madrid without warning.', 'Doña Emilia lives quietly in a village in Lugo, when she receives the news that her son has suffered an accident. So she travels to Madrid without warning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2NxhiGORRQxhWeKE1mXPWt6261.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250475'),
