  ('176658464067040909', 'A Prince', 2023, 'Drama', 'Pierre Creton, Olivier Rignault, Antoine Pirotte', 'Vincent Barré, Mathilde Girard, Cyril Neyrat', 'Antoine Pirotte, Pierre Creton, Grégory Gadebois, Vincent Barré, Mathieu Amalric, Manon Schaap, Françoise Lebrun, Chiman Dangi', null, 'The journey of a young man as he begins an apprenticeship in the French countryside to train as a gardener. There he encounters a trio of men who will prove decisive in both his nascent career as a horticulturist and in unleashing his sexuality.', 'The journey of a young man as he begins an apprenticeship in the French countryside to train as a gardener. There he encounters a trio of men who will prove decisive in both his nascent career as a horticulturist and in unleashing his sexuality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epZuC1BvBCDTliI8Qlbo97aUeLv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1110135'),
  ('708559821346233300', 'A Prince (almost) Charming', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Philippe Lellouche', 'Philippe Lellouche, Luc Besson', 'Vincent Perez, Vahina Giocante, Jacques Weber, Nicole Calfan, Chloé Coulloud, Jérôme Kircher, Moussa Maaskri, Côme Levin', null, 'A romantic comedy about Jean-Marc who is a convinced bachelor and also very busy. So busy that he almost missed his own daughters wedding ceremony...', 'A romantic comedy about Jean-Marc who is a convinced bachelor and also very busy. So busy that he almost missed his own daughters wedding ceremony...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNKNwF1g04Re7VreJiok4HYJnA9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155887'),
  ('192277379490428061', 'A Prince for Christmas', 2015, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Theo Angell, Fred Olen Ray', 'Fred Olen Ray', 'Viva Bianca, Kirk Barker, Aaron O''Connell, Brittany Beery, Kelly LeBrock, Maxwell Caulfield, Mark Lindsay Chapman, Peter Johnson', null, 'A prince from Europe meets a charming waitress when he travels to America during the Christmas holiday to escape an arranged marriage.', 'A prince from Europe meets a charming waitress when he travels to America during the Christmas holiday to escape an arranged marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyMRbk3aVjc8E5eXZLtvAhRLDQ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369057'),
  ('773842915537487153', 'A Prince in Paradise', 2023, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Shing Fung Cheung, Adrian Powers', 'Caera Bradshaw, Adrian Powers', 'Rhiannon Fish, Mitchell Bourke, Cara McCarthy, David Hooley, Juan Fernando Monge, Andrea Moor, Dirk Hunter, Naomi Sequeira', 'G', 'Olivia, struggling with writer''s block after a break up, takes a tropical holiday in hope of some inspiration and meets Prince Alexander, who needs some distance from his duty to marry royalty.', 'Olivia, struggling with writer''s block after a break up, takes a tropical holiday in hope of some inspiration and meets Prince Alexander, who needs some distance from his duty to marry royalty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xO9hRWjxEGVzwC14QwD28SlYQOM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1012669'),
  ('485108895734574201', 'A Princess for Christmas', 2011, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Christopher Landry, Michael Damian, Viorel Sergovici', 'Michael Damian, Janeen Damian', 'Katie McGrath, Sam Heughan, Miles Richardson, Charlotte Salt, Travis Turner, Leilah de Meza, Roger Moore, Mãdãlina Anea', 'PG', 'After her sister and brother-in-law''s tragic deaths, an American woman who is the guardian for her young niece and nephew is invited to a royal European castle for Christmas by her late brother-in-law''s father, the Duke of Castlebury. Feeling out of place as a commoner, she is determined to give her family a merry Christmas and surprises herself when she falls for a handsome prince.', 'After her sister and brother-in-law''s tragic deaths, an American woman who is the guardian for her young niece and nephew is invited to a royal European castle for Christmas by her late brother-in-law''s father, the Duke of Castlebury. Feeling out of place as a commoner, she is determined to give her family a merry Christmas and surprises herself when she falls for a handsome prince.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qv7fx4gW2bNU3eUiwtaxh829Imq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79113'),
  ('724684415065110625', 'A Private Affair', 2002, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Guillaume Nicloux, Laure Prévost, Samantha Gordowski', 'Guillaume Nicloux', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Marion Cotillard, Samuel Le Bihan, Aurore Clément, Frédéric Diefenthal, Jeanne Balibar, Robert Hirsch, Garance Clavel', null, 'Divorced private detective Francois Maneri is assigned by his agency to investigate the disappearance of Rachel, a young student who has been missing for six months. After interviewing Rachel''s family, friends and classmates, Francois is attacked and injured by an anonymous assailant and becomes reluctant to continue his search. But when Rachel''s body is found, Francois is drawn deeper into the investigation as he discovers the dead girl''s secret life.', 'Divorced private detective Francois Maneri is assigned by his agency to investigate the disappearance of Rachel, a young student who has been missing for six months. After interviewing Rachel''s family, friends and classmates, Francois is attacked and injured by an anonymous assailant and becomes reluctant to continue his search. But when Rachel''s body is found, Francois is drawn deeper into the investigation as he discovers the dead girl''s secret life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPdnP2ts47ZWeMvPkktxiK0LUA8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64935'),
  ('291471416209285176', 'A Private Collection', 1972, 'Documentary', 'Walerian Borowczyk', 'Walerian Borowczyk', 'André Pieyre de Mandiargues', null, 'A witty and eye-opening tour through Borowczyk''s own collection of vintage erotica. Originally intended as part of his ''Contes immoraux'', it was released first as a separate short, and is therefore marks the turning-point between Borowczyk''s career as a highly-regarded animator and surrealist filmmaker, and his subsequent career in the sexploitation field.', 'A witty and eye-opening tour through Borowczyk''s own collection of vintage erotica. Originally intended as part of his ''Contes immoraux'', it was released first as a separate short, and is therefore marks the turning-point between Borowczyk''s career as a highly-regarded animator and surrealist filmmaker, and his subsequent career in the sexploitation field.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZeMEw1A0rG7wvmJuiqNltjPkTz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252951'),
  ('521926125483576586', 'A Private Function', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Malcolm Mowbray, Tony Pierce-Roberts, Nick Godden', 'Alan Bennett', 'Michael Palin, Maggie Smith, Denholm Elliott, Richard Griffiths, Tony Haygarth, John Normington, Bill Paterson, Liz Smith', 'R', 'In the summer of 1947, Britain prepares to commemorate the wedding of Princess Elizabeth and Prince Phillip. To get around food-rationing laws, Dr. Charles Swaby, accountant Henry Allardyce and solicitor Frank Lockwood are fattening a black-market pig for the big day. Egged on by his wife, meek Gilbert Chilvers steals the swine, but the couple must conceal it from inspector Morris Wormold.', 'In the summer of 1947, Britain prepares to commemorate the wedding of Princess Elizabeth and Prince Phillip. To get around food-rationing laws, Dr. Charles Swaby, accountant Henry Allardyce and solicitor Frank Lockwood are fattening a black-market pig for the big day. Egged on by his wife, meek Gilbert Chilvers steals the swine, but the couple must conceal it from inspector Morris Wormold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OC2OqimnYqB8d9S38MdQS2DkeQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57565'),
  ('396935274627445917', 'A Private Life', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Rebecca Zlotowski, Léonard Vindry, Mikaël Gaudin', 'Rebecca Zlotowski', 'Jodie Foster, Daniel Auteuil, Virginie Efira, Mathieu Amalric, Vincent Lacoste, Luàna Bajrami, Noam Morgensztern, Sophie Guillemin', 'R', 'When renowned psychiatrist Lilian Steiner learns of the sudden death of a patient, she suspects murder. She mounts a private investigation, enlisting an odd assortment of quirky characters.', 'When renowned psychiatrist Lilian Steiner learns of the sudden death of a patient, she suspects murder. She mounts a private investigation, enlisting an odd assortment of quirky characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grozteYTaspY4xaJRt3nw4zMtTs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1290432'),
  ('1144573580579017717', 'A Private War', 2018, 'Drama, War', 'Matthew Heineman, Robert Richardson, Michael van Kesteren', 'Arash Amel', 'Rosamund Pike, Jamie Dornan, Tom Hollander, Stanley Tucci, Corey Johnson, Greg Wise, Faye Marsay, Nikki Amuka-Bird', 'R', 'One of the most celebrated war correspondents of our time, Marie Colvin is an utterly fearless and rebellious spirit, driven to the frontlines of conflicts across the globe to give voice to the voiceless.', 'One of the most celebrated war correspondents of our time, Marie Colvin is an utterly fearless and rebellious spirit, driven to the frontlines of conflicts across the globe to give voice to the voiceless.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAh6uDR9bBznybiJCVYZNJmjg63.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475132'),
  ('537427577666700798', 'A Proletarian Winter''s Tale', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Markus Koob, Julian Radlmaier', 'Julian Radlmaier', 'Natia Bakhtadze, Ilia Korkashvili, Lars Rudolph, Katja Weilandt, Willem Menne, Christoph Förster, Sophie Weikert, Kyung-Taek Lie', null, 'Three young Georgians have to clean a castle in Berlin, where a German arms manufacturer''s art collection is being set up for an exhibition. Of course, the proletariat isn''t welcome at the opening party and they are banished to a servants'' room in the attic. Downstairs, however, a splendid buffet attracts them - so why not just ignore the unfair prohibition and cross the line of class society? Didn''t the French Revolution start over a piece of cake?', 'Three young Georgians have to clean a castle in Berlin, where a German arms manufacturer''s art collection is being set up for an exhibition. Of course, the proletariat isn''t welcome at the opening party and they are banished to a servants'' room in the attic. Downstairs, however, a splendid buffet attracts them - so why not just ignore the unfair prohibition and cross the line of class society? Didn''t the French Revolution start over a piece of cake?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lVpjRlDIhjbcAjQM1m1OpksrUzi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262665'),
  ('966218802259374546', 'A Promise', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'Patrice Leconte, Françoise Joset, Eduardo Serra', 'Patrice Leconte, Jérôme Tonnerre', 'Rebecca Hall, Alan Rickman, Richard Madden, Toby Murray, Maggie Steed, Shannon Tarbet, Jean-Louis Sbille, Sarah Messens', 'R', 'A romantic drama set in Germany just before WWI and centered on a married woman who falls in love with her husband''s teacher. Separated by the war, they pledge their devotion to one another.', 'A romantic drama set in Germany just before WWI and centered on a married woman who falls in love with her husband''s teacher. Separated by the war, they pledge their devotion to one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6QfDLXrO2PX5xAl2x2koJmwlNa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214081'),
  ('462278007561804913', 'A Prophet', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jacques Audiard, Stéphane Fontaine, Lionel Mathis', 'Thomas Bidegain, Jacques Audiard', 'Tahar Rahim, Niels Arestrup, Adel Bencherif, Hichem Yacoubi, Reda Kateb, Jean-Philippe Ricci, Gilles Cohen, Antoine Basler', 'R', 'Sentenced to six years in prison, Malik El Djebena is alone in the world and can neither read nor write. On his arrival at the prison, he seems younger and more brittle than the others detained there. At once he falls under the sway of a group of Corsicans who enforce their rule in the prison. As the ''missions'' go by, he toughens himself and wins the confidence of the Corsican group.', 'Sentenced to six years in prison, Malik El Djebena is alone in the world and can neither read nor write. On his arrival at the prison, he seems younger and more brittle than the others detained there. At once he falls under the sway of a group of Corsicans who enforce their rule in the prison. As the ''missions'' go by, he toughens himself and wins the confidence of the Corsican group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9Jb8kewBHPzjTtgCQvoQoDsy4d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21575'),
  ('159342731838113936', 'À propos de Nice', 1930, 'Documentary', 'Jean Vigo, Boris Kaufman, Boris Kaufman', 'Jean Vigo', null, null, 'What starts off as a conventional travelogue turns into a satirical portrait of the town of Nice on the French Côte d''Azur, especially its wealthy inhabitants.', 'What starts off as a conventional travelogue turns into a satirical portrait of the town of Nice on the French Côte d''Azur, especially its wealthy inhabitants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mAr8wThrq5qrV571luLnYgdTcPY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47831'),
  ('878182190494725143', 'A Pure Formality', 1994, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Giuseppe Tornatore, Blasco Giurato', 'Giuseppe Tornatore', 'Gérard Depardieu, Roman Polanski, Sergio Rubini, Nicola Di Pinto, Tano Cimarosa, Paolo Lombardi, Maria Rosa Spagnolo, Alberto Sironi', null, 'Famous writer Onoff is now a recluse. The Inspector is suspicious when Onoff is brought into the station one night, disoriented and suffering a kind of amnesia. In an isolated, rural police station, the Inspector tries to establish the events surrounding a killing, to reach a startling resolution.', 'Famous writer Onoff is now a recluse. The Inspector is suspicious when Onoff is brought into the station one night, disoriented and suffering a kind of amnesia. In an isolated, rural police station, the Inspector tries to establish the events surrounding a killing, to reach a startling resolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAd56dYln4cgoJBa1r60cb9S5xR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19223'),
