  ('86427324729180274', 'A Pure Spirit', 2004, 'Drama', 'Mia Hansen-Løve, Pascal Auffray', 'Mia Hansen-Løve', 'Isabelle Marchandier', null, 'On a wintery January afternoon, a girl walks in a park by herself. As groups of boys play football, she strolls about, observing the activities of her fellow park-goers.', 'On a wintery January afternoon, a girl walks in a park by herself. As groups of boys play football, she strolls about, observing the activities of her fellow park-goers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZARAOpdpwz6PZz2RQmBnYQ5EnT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185600'),
  ('30356042039681004', 'A Pyromaniac''s Love Story', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Joshua Brand, John Schwartzman, Patrice Leung', 'Morgan Ward', 'William Baldwin, John Leguizamo, Erika Eleniak, Michael Lerner, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Joan Plowright, Mike Starr, Julio Oscar Mechoso', 'PG', 'A pastry boy and the son of a hair-piece mogul become involved in an arson scandal. Sergio is offered a bribe in exchange for taking the blame for the fire that destroys his workplace. Garet, the real arsonist, is apalled that someone else would try to take credit for his act of love. Before long, Sergio and Garet become entangled in a zany love-quadrangle involving Hattie and Stephanie. Written by Brian Whiting', 'A pastry boy and the son of a hair-piece mogul become involved in an arson scandal. Sergio is offered a bribe in exchange for taking the blame for the fire that destroys his workplace. Garet, the real arsonist, is apalled that someone else would try to take credit for his act of love. Before long, Sergio and Garet become entangled in a zany love-quadrangle involving Hattie and Stephanie. Written by Brian Whiting', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjhmiAVkxl1EHkE9o6C93yKQdJ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2307'),
  ('607114790742007073', 'A Quest for Meaning', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Nathanaël Coste, Marc de la Ménardière', null, 'Pierre Rabhi, Hervé Kempf, Vandana Shiva', null, 'Two childhood friends leave everything behind to go question the workings of the world. This incredible, life-changing journey across America, Europe, and Asia encourages us to reconsider our relationship with nature, happiness, and the meaning of life.', 'Two childhood friends leave everything behind to go question the workings of the world. This incredible, life-changing journey across America, Europe, and Asia encourages us to reconsider our relationship with nature, happiness, and the meaning of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtcpDX2UXJOngJePltHdkIOKTIZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334656'),
  ('551747110678820752', 'A Question of Faith', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kevan Otto, Lamese Williams, Brandon Riley', 'Ty Manns', 'Richard T. Jones, Kim Fields, C. Thomas Howell, Renée O''Connor, T.C. Stallings, Jaci Velasquez, Amber Thompson, Gregory Alan Williams', 'PG', 'When Tragedy Strikes three Families, their Destiny forces them on a coverging path and mercy as the challenges of their fate could also resurrect their beliefs', 'When Tragedy Strikes three Families, their Destiny forces them on a coverging path and mercy as the challenges of their fate could also resurrect their beliefs', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DwBNsU23aI3A83Mtpj2QDmmXAH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467433'),
  ('716323781067014291', 'A Question of Silence', 1982, 'Drama, Crime', 'Frans Bromet, Marc Felperlaan, Marleen Gorris', 'Marleen Gorris', 'Edda Barends, Nelly Frijda, Henriëtte Tol, Cox Habbema, Eddie Brugman, Hans Croiset, Erik Plooyer, Anna van Beers', null, 'When three women with no previous acquaintance kill a male shopkeeper in the middle of the day, the female psychiatrist assigned to the case sets out to understand why.', 'When three women with no previous acquaintance kill a male shopkeeper in the middle of the day, the female psychiatrist assigned to the case sets out to understand why.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGhs4woh7yfRupCYOYFMFj9DUPN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96529'),
  ('367911187643014803', 'A Quiet Day at the End of the War', 1970, 'Drama', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Dmitri Korzhikhin', 'Rustam Ibragimbekov', 'Natalya Arinbasarova, Sergey Nikonenko, Yuri Bogatyryov, Lev Durov, Irina Dyomina, Aleksandr Kaydanovskiy, Aleksandr Porokhovshchikov, Valentin Smirnitskiy', null, 'As WWII comes to a close, a wounded Soviet soldier and a Kazak woman seek refuge in a church. In this holy place, they take time to rest and appreciate the beauty of their surroundings, as the interior of the building is lined with ornate works of art. A group of Nazi soldiers eventually disrupts this moment of peace, as they enter the church and defile the sacred works within. Undetected, the original occupants witness this atrocity and the proud Russian feels compelled to fight in an effort to preserve his country’s history.', 'As WWII comes to a close, a wounded Soviet soldier and a Kazak woman seek refuge in a church. In this holy place, they take time to rest and appreciate the beauty of their surroundings, as the interior of the building is lined with ornate works of art. A group of Nazi soldiers eventually disrupts this moment of peace, as they enter the church and defile the sacred works within. Undetected, the original occupants witness this atrocity and the proud Russian feels compelled to fight in an effort to preserve his country’s history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBPqoe0YGiDJY61i3iI1jJ5r8F7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301722'),
  ('118344048214862902', 'A Quiet Dream', 2016, 'Drama', 'Zhang Lu, Cho Young-jik, Jung Hoon', 'Zhang Lu', 'Han Ye-ri, Yang Ik-june, Park Jung-bum, Yoon Jong-bin, Lee Joo-young, Choi Si-hyung, Bek Hyun-jin, Shin Min-a', null, 'They''re losers, but nice ones. Every day they sit at Yeri''s bar, smitten by the young Chinese-Korean woman. Yeri doesn''t have a preference. To her, they are equally sweet: Jongbin, a milk-drinking epileptic, Ikjune, a former petty criminal, and the introverted Jungbum, who fled from North Korea.', 'They''re losers, but nice ones. Every day they sit at Yeri''s bar, smitten by the young Chinese-Korean woman. Yeri doesn''t have a preference. To her, they are equally sweet: Jongbin, a milk-drinking epileptic, Ikjune, a former petty criminal, and the introverted Jungbum, who fled from North Korea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQgTNLPtucpInmkjMDrx9FgCZtw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416727'),
  ('1065776087436093313', 'A Quiet Life', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Claudio Cupellini, Gergely Pohárnok', 'Guido Iuculano, Filippo Gravino, Claudio Cupellini', 'Toni Servillo, Marco D''Amore, Francesco Di Leva, Juliane Köhler, Leonardo Sprengler, Alice Dwyer, Maurizio Donadoni, Micki Bertling', null, 'The story of a man who murdered thirty-two people, gained power, and then got afraid because too many people wanted to kill him. One August morning, he disappeared. For fifteen years, everyone believed him dead.', 'The story of a man who murdered thirty-two people, gained power, and then got afraid because too many people wanted to kill him. One August morning, he disappeared. For fifteen years, everyone believed him dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jE2b7aojjGkLdzPZFbseyeBoMRD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49850'),
