  ('906524640468442443', 'A Radiant Girl', 2022, 'History, Drama, War', 'Guillaume Schiffman, Hadrien Bichet, Sandrine Kiberlain', 'Sandrine Kiberlain', 'Rebecca Marder, Ben Attal, India Hair, André Marcon, Anthony Bajon, Florence Viala, Françoise Widhoff, Cyril Metzger', null, 'Paris, summer 1942. Irene is a young, bubbly, 19-year-old Jewish girl. Her family watches her discover the world, friends, new love and a passion for the theatre. The aspiring actress is living her youthful life without a care in the world, but she does not know that time may be running out.', 'Paris, summer 1942. Irene is a young, bubbly, 19-year-old Jewish girl. Her family watches her discover the world, friends, new love and a passion for the theatre. The aspiring actress is living her youthful life without a care in the world, but she does not know that time may be running out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAL791kCpoYQQFMWbFw5t2FlwZJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788943'),
