  ('222872457607302968', 'A Rage to Live', 1965, 'Drama, Romance', 'Walter Grauman, Charles Lawton Jr., Emmett Emerson', 'John T. Kelley', 'Suzanne Pleshette, Bradford Dillman, Ben Gazzara, Peter Graves, Bethel Leslie, Carmen Mathews, Linden Chiles, James Gregory', 'NR', 'Grace Caldwell, a young Pennsylvania newspaper heiress living with her widowed mother, has trouble restraining herself when it comes to the amorous attentions of young men. As word starts to spread about her behavior, Grace becomes a major source of heartache for her mother and a big source of concern to her brother.', 'Grace Caldwell, a young Pennsylvania newspaper heiress living with her widowed mother, has trouble restraining herself when it comes to the amorous attentions of young men. As word starts to spread about her behavior, Grace becomes a major source of heartache for her mother and a big source of concern to her brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZR2F8jqZ1x10ODpGxRJxspJHtg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104759'),
