  ('874448568231166322', 'A Raisin in the Sun', 1961, 'Drama, Romance', 'Daniel Petrie, Charles Lawton Jr., Sam Nelson', 'Lorraine Hansberry', 'Sidney Poitier, Claudia McNeil, Ruby Dee, Diana Sands, Ivan Dixon, John Fiedler, Louis Gossett Jr., Steven Perry', null, 'Walter Lee Younger is a young man struggling with his station in life. Sharing a tiny apartment with his wife, son, sister and mother, he seems like an imprisoned man. Until, that is, the family gets an unexpected financial windfall.', 'Walter Lee Younger is a young man struggling with his station in life. Sharing a tiny apartment with his wife, son, sister and mother, he seems like an imprisoned man. Until, that is, the family gets an unexpected financial windfall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxGAJFfryAgdi4ONkVyrBWKDBbI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29478'),
  ('262354661686569965', 'A Raisin in the Sun', 2008, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Kenny Leon, Ivan Strasburg', null, 'Sean Combs, Sanaa Lathan, Audra McDonald, Phylicia Rashād, Bill Nunn, David Oyelowo, Ron Cephas Jones, Sean Patrick Thomas', null, 'Dreams can make a life worth living, but they can also be dashed by bad decisions. This is the crossroads whare the Younger family find themselves when their father passes away and leaves them with $10,000 in life insurance money. Should they buy a new home for the family? Perhaps a liquor store? While no choice is easy, life on the South Side of Chicago in the 1950s is even harder.', 'Dreams can make a life worth living, but they can also be dashed by bad decisions. This is the crossroads whare the Younger family find themselves when their father passes away and leaves them with $10,000 in life insurance money. Should they buy a new home for the family? Perhaps a liquor store? While no choice is easy, life on the South Side of Chicago in the 1950s is even harder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUoE6wFKPTm9fWy0Qio38OqUDFG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25781'),
  ('68576032122882323', 'A Rather Complicated Girl', 1969, 'Thriller', 'Damiano Damiani, Mario Giorsi', 'Damiano Damiani, Alberto Silvestri, Franco Verucci', 'Catherine Spaak, Jean Sorel, Florinda Bolkan, Gabriella Boccardo, Gigi Proietti, Luigi Casellato, Gino Lavagetto, Sergio Graziani', null, 'Having casually overheard a confusing phone conversation between two women, Alberto manages to get in touch with one of the callers, Claudia, a painter. The two become lovers and things are spiced up by Claudia''s ambiguous sexual nature and by the presence of her former lover, Pietro. Alberto discovers a pistol in Claudia''s handbag and this leads to a further revelation: she''s dominated by her stepmother Greta, who forced her into a clandestine lesbian relationship; of which Claudia is ashamed and wants to end - at all costs. Alberto, now a slave to love, runs Greta over. But Claudia denies urging him to murder...', 'Having casually overheard a confusing phone conversation between two women, Alberto manages to get in touch with one of the callers, Claudia, a painter. The two become lovers and things are spiced up by Claudia''s ambiguous sexual nature and by the presence of her former lover, Pietro. Alberto discovers a pistol in Claudia''s handbag and this leads to a further revelation: she''s dominated by her stepmother Greta, who forced her into a clandestine lesbian relationship; of which Claudia is ashamed and wants to end - at all costs. Alberto, now a slave to love, runs Greta over. But Claudia denies urging him to murder...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fu9MRjpaWAo7kHoW0nYJOI6efwF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106944'),
  ('162930355840426639', 'A Rather English Marriage', 1998, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Paul Seed, Gavin Finney', null, 'Albert Finney, Tom Courtenay, Joanna Lumley, John Light, Joanna Scanlan, Lucy Robinson, Ursula Howells, Priyanga Burford', null, 'A squadron leader and a retired milkman decide to bury their differences and move in together after they are both widowed on the very same night. They become a companionable if odd couple, until their unlikely friendship is threatened by the arrival of an alluring woman with a hidden agenda.', 'A squadron leader and a retired milkman decide to bury their differences and move in together after they are both widowed on the very same night. They become a companionable if odd couple, until their unlikely friendship is threatened by the arrival of an alluring woman with a hidden agenda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/an5DlZwIDAmCmTF2RLqqralbdKB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47332'),
  ('939136704760714517', 'A Real Friend', 2006, 'Horror, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Enrique Urbizu, Unax Mendia', 'Jorge Arenillas, Enrique Urbizu', 'Goya Toledo, Nerea Inchausti, Josep Maria Pou, Aitor Mazo, Eduard Farelo, Mark Ullod, Roelkis Bueno', null, 'Estrella, an intelligent teen student, spends most of her time alone at school or home, enjoying horror books and movies, while her widow mother Angela works as a nurse in a hospital. Her favorite author is Stephen King and her only friends are Leatherface and a vampire.', 'Estrella, an intelligent teen student, spends most of her time alone at school or home, enjoying horror books and movies, while her widow mother Angela works as a nurse in a hospital. Her favorite author is Stephen King and her only friends are Leatherface and a vampire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9o2qkkPH4EdC2tgFG2wIWKMoeJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71919'),
  ('160604460179126595', 'A Real Job', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Antoine Héberlé, Olive Chenieux, Elodie Gay', 'Thomas Lilti', 'Vincent Lacoste, François Cluzet, Louise Bourgoin, Adèle Exarchopoulos, William Lebghil, Lucie Zhang, Bouli Lanners, Léo Chalié', null, 'Benjamin is a PhD student without scholarship support. Under the pressure of his parents, and in need of money, he becomes a substitute teacher in a middle school. Without training nor experience, and facing a declining public educational system, he discovers how tough this job can be. Hopefully, his supportive and committed colleagues will lead him to take a fresh look at the profession.', 'Benjamin is a PhD student without scholarship support. Under the pressure of his parents, and in need of money, he becomes a substitute teacher in a middle school. Without training nor experience, and facing a declining public educational system, he discovers how tough this job can be. Hopefully, his supportive and committed colleagues will lead him to take a fresh look at the profession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KxpXV3fqM58jU5kaFWPChrrSgz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:934506'),
  ('417781000037291770', 'A Real Pain', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Michał Dymek, Mieszko Falana', 'Jesse Eisenberg', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Kieran Culkin, Will Sharpe, Jennifer Grey, Kurt Egyiawan, Liza Sadovy, Daniel Oreskes, Ellora Torchia', 'R', 'Mismatched cousins David and Benji reunite for a tour through Poland to honor their beloved grandmother. The adventure takes a turn when the pair''s old tensions resurface against the backdrop of their family history.', 'Mismatched cousins David and Benji reunite for a tour through Poland to honor their beloved grandmother. The adventure takes a turn when the pair''s old tensions resurface against the backdrop of their family history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67xRIXm5TxXRT4nV2V4AEJ9yq2d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1013850'),
