  ('172102617394161686', 'A Reindeer''s Journey', 2018, 'Documentary, Family, Adventure', 'Guillaume Maidatchevsky, Daniel Meyer', 'Guillaume Maidatchevsky', 'Aldebert', null, 'Narrated by Golden Globe winner, Donald Sutherland, this is the incredible story of Ailo, the little reindeer. This uplifting tale follows the journey of baby Ailo as he navigates his first year of life in the snowy landscapes of a picturesque Lapland. Frail and vulnerable, Ailo must learn to walk, run, leap and hide to ensure he survives the long, treacherous journey with the herd. Ailo’s Journey is an inspirational story, in which a bleak wilderness is warmed by a mother’s endless love as she watches over Ailo in his incredible adventures with other creatures of the Arctic.', 'Narrated by Golden Globe winner, Donald Sutherland, this is the incredible story of Ailo, the little reindeer. This uplifting tale follows the journey of baby Ailo as he navigates his first year of life in the snowy landscapes of a picturesque Lapland. Frail and vulnerable, Ailo must learn to walk, run, leap and hide to ensure he survives the long, treacherous journey with the herd. Ailo’s Journey is an inspirational story, in which a bleak wilderness is warmed by a mother’s endless love as she watches over Ailo in his incredible adventures with other creatures of the Arctic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jprquSROhLbm9ZsPWXaVROuBcie.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:478503'),
  ('50105184917579208', 'A Remarkable Tale', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Marina Seresesky', 'Marina Seresesky', 'Carmen Machi, Pepón Nieto, Ricardo Nkosi, Jimmy Castro, Montse Pla, Malcolm Sitté, Kiti Mánver, Jon Kortajarena', 'PG', 'The residents of an isolated town look to revive their home''s identity when a group of foreigners unexpectedly arrive, bringing culture shock with them.', 'The residents of an isolated town look to revive their home''s identity when a group of foreigners unexpectedly arrive, bringing culture shock with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aepBkIFxNYZaGZsRIzC1jw1rA15.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542930'),
  ('511324785676454136', 'A Resistance', 2019, 'History, Drama', 'Kim Ba-da, Cho Min-ho, Choi Sang-ho', 'Cho Min-ho', 'Ko A-sung, Kim Sae-byuk, Kim Yae-eun, Jeong Ha-dam, Ryu Kyung-soo, Choi Moo-seong, Kim Ah-song, Jin Ho-eun', null, '17-year-old Yu Gwan-Sun participates in the Korean independence movement. The country is under the rule of Japan, which annexed the country in 1910.', '17-year-old Yu Gwan-Sun participates in the Korean independence movement. The country is under the rule of Japan, which annexed the country in 1910.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7x6dntwSuvAduuFzarXQdjDWQql.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575752'),
  ('102201548847584668', 'A Respectable Life', 1979, 'Documentary', 'Per Källberg, Jan Lindkvist, Staffan Lindqvist', 'Stefan Jarl', 'Kenneth ''Kenta'' Gustafsson, Gustav ''Stoffe'' Svensson, Patric Gustafsson, Eva Blondin, Majken Gustafsson, Lena Löfgren, Jan Löfgren, Jan ''Jajje'' Klingryd', null, 'A decade has gone by and the spirit of the preceding film, Dom kallar oss mods, has disappeared. Kenta is an alcoholic and lives with his girlfriend Eva. Together they have a son, Patric. Kenta''s mom is in jail for manslaughter and Kenta goes to Kronoberg to greet her. Heroin also comes to play and Stoffe is one of those who falls victim to it. He lives with his girlfriend Lena and their young son, Janne. Lena later throws Stoffe out their home when she gets enough of his abuse, and he is forced to live with his mother. Kenta calls Stoffe and decides to meet him, and he tries to persuade him to give up heroin, but the two have a falling out and they separate. This film features other users from the previous film, such as Jajje and Kenta Bergkvist. The film ends with the death of a prominent person in the trilogy.', 'A decade has gone by and the spirit of the preceding film, Dom kallar oss mods, has disappeared. Kenta is an alcoholic and lives with his girlfriend Eva. Together they have a son, Patric. Kenta''s mom is in jail for manslaughter and Kenta goes to Kronoberg to greet her. Heroin also comes to play and Stoffe is one of those who falls victim to it. He lives with his girlfriend Lena and their young son, Janne. Lena later throws Stoffe out their home when she gets enough of his abuse, and he is forced to live with his mother. Kenta calls Stoffe and decides to meet him, and he tries to persuade him to give up heroin, but the two have a falling out and they separate. This film features other users from the previous film, such as Jajje and Kenta Bergkvist. The film ends with the death of a prominent person in the trilogy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XZm3pCtH6rAYkbLZxs8SncAdQz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56503'),
  ('317583745017157091', 'A Return to Salem''s Lot', 1987, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Larry Cohen, Timothy J. Lonsdale, J. Michael McClary', 'James Dixon, Larry Cohen', 'Michael Moriarty, Samuel Fuller, Andrew Duggan, Ricky Addison Reed, June Havoc, Evelyn Keyes, Tara Reid, James Dixon', 'R', 'Anthropologist Joe Weber takes his son on a trip to the New England town of Salem''s Lot, unaware of its vampire population. When the inhabitants reveal their secret, they seek Weber to write a bible for them.', 'Anthropologist Joe Weber takes his son on a trip to the New England town of Salem''s Lot, unaware of its vampire population. When the inhabitants reveal their secret, they seek Weber to write a bible for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sc3jWWodUIaofc176PlYUQzUslj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27740'),
  ('603565285780146248', 'A Ring of Endless Light', 2002, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama, Family', 'Greg Beeman, Rodney Charters, James Legge', 'Marita Giovanni, Bruce Graham', 'Mischa Barton, Ryan Merriman, Jared Padalecki, Scarlett Pomers, Soren Fulton, James Whitmore, Theresa Wong, Penny Everingham', null, 'When 15-year-old Vicky Austin, her sister Suzy and little brother Rob visit their grandfather on Seven Bay Island, Vicky faces several unexpected challenges. Her beloved grandfather, retired Reverend Eaton, seems to be seriously ill, but tries to pretend that nothing is wrong. Vicky met the rich but emotionally troubled Zachary Gray the previous summer, and he reappears to renew the acquaintance. Another boy, 17-year-old Adam Eddington, recruits Vicky to help him with a research project, working with a dolphin called Basil. Vicky discovers she can communicate telepathically with the dolphin and his mate - and possibly with Adam as well', 'When 15-year-old Vicky Austin, her sister Suzy and little brother Rob visit their grandfather on Seven Bay Island, Vicky faces several unexpected challenges. Her beloved grandfather, retired Reverend Eaton, seems to be seriously ill, but tries to pretend that nothing is wrong. Vicky met the rich but emotionally troubled Zachary Gray the previous summer, and he reappears to renew the acquaintance. Another boy, 17-year-old Adam Eddington, recruits Vicky to help him with a research project, working with a dolphin called Basil. Vicky discovers she can communicate telepathically with the dolphin and his mate - and possibly with Adam as well', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7gK8wahIPtg2MAtc28FCKjrt2m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126934'),
  ('777201742477305047', 'A Ripple in the Pond', 1952, 'Comedy', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Victor Antoun, Anis Farid', 'Christos Giannakopoulos, Alekos Sakellarios', 'Vasilis Logothetidis, Ilia Livykou, Mary Lalopoulou, Vagelis Protopapas, Kaiti Lambropoulou, Stephanos Stratigos, Dina Stathatou, Anna Roussou', null, 'A peaceful, though extremely mean, family man, Manolis, is married for ten years to Veta. Some night he spends an astronomical amount of money at a night club, with his partner Giorgos and two pretty and cheerful Greek-American girls, Margaret and Evelyn. However, to his bad luck, Evelyn is no other but Vangelitsa, his wife’s cousin, who visits the next day for lunch.', 'A peaceful, though extremely mean, family man, Manolis, is married for ten years to Veta. Some night he spends an astronomical amount of money at a night club, with his partner Giorgos and two pretty and cheerful Greek-American girls, Margaret and Evelyn. However, to his bad luck, Evelyn is no other but Vangelitsa, his wife’s cousin, who visits the next day for lunch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtIfmpquJRunnFws5L4Kphl9EK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391182'),
  ('765951047087438157', 'A River Called Titas', 1973, 'Drama', 'Ritwik Ghatak, Abdul Zalil Mintu, Tamijuddin Rizvi', 'Ritwik Ghatak', 'Rosy Afsary, Kabori Sarwar, Rawshan Zamil, Rani Sarkar, Sufia Rustam, Prabir Mitra, Shafikul Islam, Golam Mustafa', null, 'An in-depth look at the lives and struggles of a fishing community living by the River Titas in Bangladesh after the Partition of India in 1947.', 'An in-depth look at the lives and struggles of a fishing community living by the River Titas in Bangladesh after the Partition of India in 1947.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9IO1a8dfVHRgMwBKXU4RNRtQBr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93164'),
  ('132074259765527834', 'A River Runs Through It', 1992, 'Drama, Family', 'Robert Redford, Philippe Rousselot, J. Stephen Buck', 'Richard Friedenberg', 'Craig Sheffer, Brad Pitt, Tom Skerritt, Brenda Blethyn, Emily Lloyd, Edie McClurg, Stephen Shellen, Vann Gravage', 'PG', 'The Maclean brothers, Paul and Norman, live a relatively idyllic life in rural Montana, spending much of their time fly fishing. The sons of a minister, the boys eventually part company when Norman moves east to attend college, leaving his rebellious brother to find trouble back home. When Norman finally returns, the siblings resume their fishing outings, and assess where they''ve been and where they''re going.', 'The Maclean brothers, Paul and Norman, live a relatively idyllic life in rural Montana, spending much of their time fly fishing. The sons of a minister, the boys eventually part company when Norman moves east to attend college, leaving his rebellious brother to find trouble back home. When Norman finally returns, the siblings resume their fishing outings, and assess where they''ve been and where they''re going.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVP45oS2cBL4WtZ1kB7r8uarruB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293'),
  ('390400784300713803', 'A Robbery In... Style', 1978, 'Animation', 'Yefim Gamburg, Mikhail Druyan, Georgiy Martynyuk', 'Mikhail Lipskerov', 'Gennadiy Morozov, Vsevolod Larionov, Aleksandr Baranov, Eduard Nazarov', null, 'A cartoon composed of four parts, parodying "classical" gangster and criminal movies of four countries: robbery American style, French style, Italian style and Russian style. All cartoon characters resemble real movie stars of 50th and 60th.', 'A cartoon composed of four parts, parodying "classical" gangster and criminal movies of four countries: robbery American style, French style, Italian style and Russian style. All cartoon characters resemble real movie stars of 50th and 60th.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5V4ilnbDHKk70h6YMFUoOUAtJl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399778'),
  ('924503644107573697', 'A Romance Wedding', 2021, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Andy Hodgson, Mike Johannson, Jean-Christophe Castell', 'Lisa Di Trolio', 'Morgan Kohan, Drew Nelson, Carey Feehan, Cory Hawkes, Georgia Bradner, Raylene Harewood, Janet Walmsley, Shanelle Connell', null, 'Zoe Davis is a successful and highly driven wedding planner in the big city. When her father asks her for help at the family café shop, she happily drives back to her cozy hometown of Romance, Oregon. Little does she know her mom has already hired Will to help, an aspiring chef and coincidentally…Zoe’s childhood sweetheart! Tensions rise between Zoe and Will, but so does the chemistry. Will they settle their differences and find lost love along the way?', 'Zoe Davis is a successful and highly driven wedding planner in the big city. When her father asks her for help at the family café shop, she happily drives back to her cozy hometown of Romance, Oregon. Little does she know her mom has already hired Will to help, an aspiring chef and coincidentally…Zoe’s childhood sweetheart! Tensions rise between Zoe and Will, but so does the chemistry. Will they settle their differences and find lost love along the way?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqlAZWVAoQWGXMJzBTtf1qjrRpH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:778996'),
  ('154112092779900440', 'A Romantic Comedy', 2010, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Ketche', 'Ceren Aslan, Aslı Zengin', 'Sinem Kobal, Burcu Kara, Sedef Avci, Cemal Hünal, Engin Altan Düzyatan, Gürgen Öz, Begüm Kütük, Kubilay Penbeklioğlu', null, 'Bored with her life and inspired by a friend''s wedding, Esra quits her job and dumps her boyfriend, leading to a series of romantic misadventures.', 'Bored with her life and inspired by a friend''s wedding, Esra quits her job and dumps her boyfriend, leading to a series of romantic misadventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uYbUcq4OSFvFgS35BwX3sBA3Xr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38614'),
  ('611566724710594903', 'A Romantic Comedy 2', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Erol Özlevi', 'Ceren Aslan, Aslı Zengin', 'Sinem Kobal, Engin Altan Düzyatan, Sedef Avci, Cemal Hünal, Burcu Kara, Gürgen Öz, Öykü Çelik, Gökçe Özyol', null, 'Didem tries everything to get actor Cem to propose to her, but he''s got other things on his mind: a beautiful new co-star and a secret bachelor party.', 'Didem tries everything to get actor Cem to propose to her, but he''s got other things on his mind: a beautiful new co-star and a secret bachelor party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BGr8oY94Trwagiddq2FtylYQN9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171179'),
  ('730808969601283576', 'A Room for Romeo Brass', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shane Meadows, Ashley Rowe', 'Paul Fraser, Shane Meadows', 'Paddy Considine, Andrew Shim, Frank Harper, Vicky McClure, Johann Myers, Shane Meadows, Bob Hoskins, Ben Marshall', 'R', 'Two twelve-year-old boys, Romeo and Gavin, undergo an extraordinary test of character and friendship when Morell, a naive but eccentric and dangerous stranger, comes between them. Morell befriends with the two boys and later asks them to help him pursue Romeo''s beautiful elder sister. He gradually becomes more violent after she rejects him.', 'Two twelve-year-old boys, Romeo and Gavin, undergo an extraordinary test of character and friendship when Morell, a naive but eccentric and dangerous stranger, comes between them. Morell befriends with the two boys and later asks them to help him pursue Romeo''s beautiful elder sister. He gradually becomes more violent after she rejects him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLpv2UUf5We4sXDKdo11aFfnKgw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22908'),
  ('156307116198783835', 'A Room in Town', 1982, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jacques Demy, Jean Penzer, Philippe Verro', 'Jacques Demy', 'Dominique Sanda, Richard Berry, Michel Piccoli, Fabienne Guyon, Anna Gaylor, Jean-François Stévenin, Danielle Darrieux, Jean-Louis Rolland', null, 'Set against the backdrop of an increasingly violent strike, a worker falls in love with the middle-class daughter of his landlady.', 'Set against the backdrop of an increasingly violent strike, a worker falls in love with the middle-class daughter of his landlady.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDO1onM1IxTouTFSXM747Wd7Psj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4269'),
  ('404857241552713894', 'A Room with a View', 1986, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tony Pierce-Roberts, James Ivory, Kevan Barker', 'Ruth Prawer Jhabvala', 'Helena Bonham Carter, Julian Sands, Maggie Smith, Denholm Elliott, Daniel Day-Lewis, Simon Callow, Rosemary Leach, Rupert Graves', 'NR', 'When Lucy Honeychurch and chaperon Charlotte Bartlett find themselves in Florence with rooms without views, fellow guests Mr Emerson and son George step in to remedy the situation. Meeting the Emersons could change Lucy''s life forever but, once back in England, how will her experiences in Tuscany affect her marriage plans?', 'When Lucy Honeychurch and chaperon Charlotte Bartlett find themselves in Florence with rooms without views, fellow guests Mr Emerson and son George step in to remedy the situation. Meeting the Emersons could change Lucy''s life forever but, once back in England, how will her experiences in Tuscany affect her marriage plans?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xRAqywVo6tNUNQbAESGVP930la.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11257'),
  ('513378147382117045', 'A Rose for Christmas', 2017, 'Drama, TV Movie, Romance', 'Kevin Fair', 'Gregg Rossen, Brian Sawyer', 'Rachel Boston, Marc Bendavid, Nels Lennarson, Daryl Shuttleworth, Jenson Kerr, Ali Milner, Venus Terzo, Karen Holness', null, 'Andy is a passionate artist whose family has been building Rose Parade floats for generations. When her Dad gets sick, Andy is forced to take the helm and supervise the construction and decoration of their client''s float. And to make matters worse, she''s saddled with the extra challenge of dealing with a demanding businessman Cliff, whose company commissioned the float.', 'Andy is a passionate artist whose family has been building Rose Parade floats for generations. When her Dad gets sick, Andy is forced to take the helm and supervise the construction and decoration of their client''s float. And to make matters worse, she''s saddled with the extra challenge of dealing with a demanding businessman Cliff, whose company commissioned the float.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11Wh6RWKNtPcDrdGd1aMM9kE2m3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421628'),
  ('1075683716149495251', 'A Rough Draft', 2018, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Action', 'Alexandr Tananov, Sergey Mokritsky', 'Denis Kuryshev, Maxim Budarin, Sergey Mokritsky', 'Nikita Volkov, Yulia Peresild, Evgeny Tsyganov, Andrey Merzlikin, Evgeniy Tkachuk, Nikita Tarasov, Konstantin Konstantinov, Vilen Babichev', null, 'Young Muscovite Kirill is a talented designer of computer games. One day, he is completely erased from the memory of everyone he knew and loved. Kirill learns that he has been chosen for an important and mysterious mission: to become a customs officer between parallel worlds, of which there are dozens in the universe. Will Kirill unravel the mystery of these worlds and who controls them? And is our Earth really just an imaginary "draft" -- a parallel world -- which in reality does not exist ...', 'Young Muscovite Kirill is a talented designer of computer games. One day, he is completely erased from the memory of everyone he knew and loved. Kirill learns that he has been chosen for an important and mysterious mission: to become a customs officer between parallel worlds, of which there are dozens in the universe. Will Kirill unravel the mystery of these worlds and who controls them? And is our Earth really just an imaginary "draft" -- a parallel world -- which in reality does not exist ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fT7yOqXhXoYrrUlz0ftavPrxKp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:495601'),
  ('1006549363191001601', 'A Round Trip to Love', 2016, 'Drama, Action, Romance', 'Zoe Qin', 'Huai Yu', 'Gao Taiyu, Huang Jingxiang, Yi Shuai, Xiang Hao, Luan Leiying, Lu Ben Juan, Tian Miao, Guo Zhen', null, 'College sweethearts Lu Feng and Xiao Chen are torn apart by family and prejudice. Years later, they reunite as boss and employee, still in love—but their second chance comes at a cost neither saw coming.', 'College sweethearts Lu Feng and Xiao Chen are torn apart by family and prejudice. Years later, they reunite as boss and employee, still in love—but their second chance comes at a cost neither saw coming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j89sQe98bIviRkCed79vB8LowmP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441846'),
  ('1040108312130176239', 'A Round Trip to Love 2', 2016, 'Action, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Zoe Qin', 'Huai Yu', 'Gao Taiyu, Huang Jingxiang, Yi Shuai, Xiang Hao', null, 'Five years apart, they reunite as lovers, but when family-demands force Xiao Chen to marry, Lu Feng feels betrayed—and vows revenge.', 'Five years apart, they reunite as lovers, but when family-demands force Xiao Chen to marry, Lu Feng feels betrayed—and vows revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WYVsjITbUJ49Y5a0CHNKhvkOgG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441900'),
  ('241311867292483389', 'A Royal Affair', 2012, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Nikolaj Arcel, Rasmus Videbæk, Martin Kurel', 'Rasmus Heisterberg, Nikolaj Arcel', 'Alicia Vikander, Mads Mikkelsen, Mikkel Boe Følsgaard, Trine Dyrholm, David Dencik, Thomas W. Gabrielsson, Cyron Melville, Bent Mejding', 'R', 'A young queen falls in love with her physician, and they start a revolution that changes their nation forever.', 'A young queen falls in love with her physician, and they start a revolution that changes their nation forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AafVGIirBlCw8Whb4DSPSLX9nGW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88273'),
  ('495596078912960466', 'A Royal Christmas', 2014, 'TV Movie, Romance, Family', 'Alex Zamm', 'Michael Damian, Neal H. Dobrofsky, Tippi Dobrofsky', 'Lacey Chabert, Stephen Hagan, Jane Seymour, Katherine Flynn, Ionut Grama, Mitchell Mullen, Diana Dumitrescu, Simon Dutton', 'G', 'A young working girl with a blue-collar background is surprised when her new fiancé announces he is actually a prince of a small sovereign country in Europe. After the couple quickly takes off to spend the holidays at his family’s sprawling, royal castle, she must work hard to win over her disapproving and unaccepting future mother-in-law—the Queen—and find out if love truly can conquer all.', 'A young working girl with a blue-collar background is surprised when her new fiancé announces he is actually a prince of a small sovereign country in Europe. After the couple quickly takes off to spend the holidays at his family’s sprawling, royal castle, she must work hard to win over her disapproving and unaccepting future mother-in-law—the Queen—and find out if love truly can conquer all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7wDZesIEdn9UJgqBLzulbFRhCr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299582'),
  ('814484725699678735', 'A Royal Christmas Crush', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Marita Grabiak', 'Catherine Reay, Keith Hemstreet, Kate Somerville', 'Stephen Huszar, Katie Cassidy, Charlie Ebbs, Angela Besharah, Glenn Edward Gyorffy, Kathryn Kohut, Pip Dwyer, Alice Hamid', 'G', 'Ava accepts the opportunity of a lifetime to work at the Royal Ice Hotel which leads her to a surprise whirlwind romance with the most important guest of all, the Royal Prince himself.', 'Ava accepts the opportunity of a lifetime to work at the Royal Ice Hotel which leads her to a surprise whirlwind romance with the most important guest of all, the Royal Prince himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znk6frNlEd90QATu40qsh997KvU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1132366'),
  ('1044803286527678554', 'A Royal Christmas Engagement', 2020, 'Family, Romance, TV Movie', 'Julien Louis, Fred Olen Ray', 'Adam Rockoff', 'Paige Bach, James Nitti, John Schneider, Louie Chapman, Samantha Dawson, Mariah Robinson, John Colton, Angela Nicholas', 'NR', 'A Manhattan ad agency boss, John Holiday, entrusts Lauren to deliver the big pre-holiday client pitch, but only winds up annoying her when she’s teamed up with a European consultant. To Lauren''s surprise, this consultant turns out to be the handsome Prince Edward of Candashire, masquerading as his consultant pal to escape his royal duties for an incognito American Christmas.', 'A Manhattan ad agency boss, John Holiday, entrusts Lauren to deliver the big pre-holiday client pitch, but only winds up annoying her when she’s teamed up with a European consultant. To Lauren''s surprise, this consultant turns out to be the handsome Prince Edward of Candashire, masquerading as his consultant pal to escape his royal duties for an incognito American Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQhIhzrw3vzqqZJiOJ0UASjX78p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:748897'),
  ('57813225839426882', 'A Royal Christmas on Ice', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Fred Olen Ray, Alexander Yellen, Dylan Hoffman', 'Fred Olen Ray', 'Anna Marie Dobbins, Jonathan Stoddard, William Baldwin, Charlene Amoia, Mary-Kate O''Connell, Peter Johnson, Robbie Jarvis, Christopher Collins', 'G', 'Looking to escape his Royal life, a dashing prince comes to the United States to start a business in a small town in upstate New York and winds up falling for a former Olympic ice skater.', 'Looking to escape his Royal life, a dashing prince comes to the United States to start a business in a small town in upstate New York and winds up falling for a former Olympic ice skater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOM1wQc997qHnbHl8ZbTw4r6nfX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032517'),
