  ('339408317532633000', 'A Royal Seaside Romance', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Graeme Campbell, Marc Forand, Aaron Duncan', 'Steve Turner', 'Brittany Bristow, Dan Jeannotte, Scott Wentworth, Liz Taylor, Dianne Aguilar, Neil Whitely, Sarah Deakins, Peter Cockett', null, 'A real estate agent helps a prince who keeps his identity a secret buy property in his magical seaside hometown. After seeing the houses and spending time together, they become friends and then team up to stop the rebuilding of the town''s port. But will the prince''s true identity prevent a romance between them?', 'A real estate agent helps a prince who keeps his identity a secret buy property in his magical seaside hometown. After seeing the houses and spending time together, they become friends and then team up to stop the rebuilding of the town''s port. But will the prince''s true identity prevent a romance between them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihhHKmRyloQFtx1fKfZ6FGS5omN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874251'),
  ('762118766643718478', 'A Royal Setting', 2026, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Bradley Walsh, Bill Corcoran, Maty Ralph', 'Ansley Gordon, W. Stewart', 'Jen Lilley, Dan Jeannotte, Ed Pinker, Ferelith Young, Sarah Orenstein', 'TV-G', 'Ruby, a world-renowned gemologist is hired by Prince Luca to restore the crown jewels and design his crown challenging tradition and complicating his relationship with his mother, the queen.', 'Ruby, a world-renowned gemologist is hired by Prince Luca to restore the crown jewels and design his crown challenging tradition and complicating his relationship with his mother, the queen.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FhyjbxAfB9XlFogKM7BENqdNMa77.jpg', 'plex:movie:a-royal-setting-2026'),
  ('657555441988539165', 'A Royal Winter', 2017, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Ernie Barbarash, Viorel Sergovici', 'Ernie Barbarash', 'Merritt Patterson, Jack Donnelly, Samantha Bond, Rhea Bailey, Cian Barry, Ryan Ellsworth, Christopher Bowen, Richard Ashton', 'G', 'While on a last-minute European holiday, a young woman finds herself in the middle of a real-life fairy tale when a chance meeting with a handsome local leads to something more. However, things get complicated when she learns that the "local" is actually a prince who is about to be crowned King, and whose mother is dead-set against her royal son''s romance with the tourist.', 'While on a last-minute European holiday, a young woman finds herself in the middle of a real-life fairy tale when a chance meeting with a handsome local leads to something more. However, things get complicated when she learns that the "local" is actually a prince who is about to be crowned King, and whose mother is dead-set against her royal son''s romance with the tourist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxeJQe4lcW8AzDrRjzixOrlmihv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435107'),
  ('1015106884276381704', 'A Rugrats Chanukah', 1996, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Raymie Muzquiz, Alex Dilts', null, 'E. G. Daily, Christine Cavanaugh, Kath Soucie, Cheryl Chase, Michael Bell, Melanie Chartoff, Jack Riley, David Doyle', null, 'The story of the Jewish holiday Chanukah through the eyes of the Rugrats, who imagine themselves as the main characters. Meanwhile, Grandpa Boris and his long-time rival, Shlomo, feud over who will play the lead in the local synagogue''s Chanukah play.', 'The story of the Jewish holiday Chanukah through the eyes of the Rugrats, who imagine themselves as the main characters. Meanwhile, Grandpa Boris and his long-time rival, Shlomo, feud over who will play the lead in the local synagogue''s Chanukah play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkPAIbatNJGQlGMoehyJzeaZPCc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:721820'),
  ('8506591199700994', 'A Rugrats Passover', 1994, 'Family, Animation', 'Jeff McGrath, Jim Duffy, Steve Socki', null, 'E. G. Daily, Michael Bell, Christine Cavanaugh, Melanie Chartoff, Cheryl Chase, David Doyle, Manuel Garcia Merino, Dana Hill', null, 'The plot follows series regulars Grandpa Boris and the babies as they become trapped in the attic on Passover; to pass the time, Boris tells the Jewish story of the Exodus. During the episode the babies themselves reenact the story, with young Tommy portraying Moses, while his cousin Angelica represents the Pharaoh of Egypt.', 'The plot follows series regulars Grandpa Boris and the babies as they become trapped in the attic on Passover; to pass the time, Boris tells the Jewish story of the Exodus. During the episode the babies themselves reenact the story, with young Tommy portraying Moses, while his cousin Angelica represents the Pharaoh of Egypt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUQxvkxlXGxeX1tQyPe4guM0fq7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:722289'),
  ('883861489052667848', 'A Rugrats Vacation', 1997, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Toni Vian', 'Jon Cooksey, Ali Marie Matheson', 'Michael Bell, Cheryl Chase, Melanie Chartoff, Christine Cavanaugh, E. G. Daily, Tress MacNeille', null, 'The adults decide to bring the babies and Angelica to Las Vegas on vacation. Tommy convinces the babies to help him find the tigers. Angelica hopes to sing while in Las Vegas.', 'The adults decide to bring the babies and Angelica to Las Vegas on vacation. Tommy convinces the babies to help him find the tigers. Angelica hopes to sing while in Las Vegas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/py4O1OIEUbFtp2DdDWMbxS62mb8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511869'),
  ('678325389040713920', 'A Rumor of Angels', 2000, 'Drama', 'Peter O''Fallon, Roy H. Wagner', 'James Eric, Jamie Horton, Peter O''Fallon', 'Vanessa Redgrave, Ray Liotta, Catherine McCormack, Trevor Morgan, Ron Livingston, George Coe, Michelle Grace, Karsen Liotta', 'PG-13', 'An old woman helps a young boy resolve his feelings over the death of his mother.', 'An old woman helps a young boy resolve his feelings over the death of his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/deCJCn5Z1bj1Fow23g7twY3CqlL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50225'),
  ('435834271795700406', 'A Run for Money', 1999, 'Drama', 'Reha Erdem, Jean-Louis Vialard, Florent Herry', 'Reha Erdem', 'Taner Birsel, Bennu Yıldırımlar, Zuhal Gencer, Engin Alkan, Sermet Yeşil, Bülent Emin Yarar, Ali Düşenkalkar, Ara Güler', null, 'The film is set in present-day Istanbul. Selim is a shop owner in his early forties. He sells clothing for men in his shop situated in one of the back streets of Istanbul. Selim is a family man who has devoted his life to his home and his work. He lives with his wife Ayla, his six-year-old daughter Esma and his old father in a simple flat in and old, modest neighbourhood. He has warm relations with his family. He is an affectionate father. One of his neighbours, a young widow named Nihal tries to seduce Selim, but her flirtation leaves him cold. Selim is known for his honesty and integrity among his family and friends. He is a careful spender. As a little child, he has learned that money is not easily earned. He has no tolerance for petty "trickery" met in daily life. One day, Selim finds a bag full of dollar bills (approximately 500,000$) in a cab. From that day on, Selim finds himself in a bewildered state with a bag full of money on his hands.', 'The film is set in present-day Istanbul. Selim is a shop owner in his early forties. He sells clothing for men in his shop situated in one of the back streets of Istanbul. Selim is a family man who has devoted his life to his home and his work. He lives with his wife Ayla, his six-year-old daughter Esma and his old father in a simple flat in and old, modest neighbourhood. He has warm relations with his family. He is an affectionate father. One of his neighbours, a young widow named Nihal tries to seduce Selim, but her flirtation leaves him cold. Selim is known for his honesty and integrity among his family and friends. He is a careful spender. As a little child, he has learned that money is not easily earned. He has no tolerance for petty "trickery" met in daily life. One day, Selim finds a bag full of dollar bills (approximately 500,000$) in a cab. From that day on, Selim finds himself in a bewildered state with a bag full of money on his hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSk881stLcxpc743ldkCguylbSs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47103'),
  ('160131002208929490', 'A Run for Your Money', 1949, 'Comedy', 'Charles Frend, Norman Priggen, Douglas Slocombe', 'Leslie Norman, Charles Frend, Richard Hughes', 'Donald Houston, Meredith Edwards, Moira Lister, Alec Guinness, Hugh Griffith, Joyce Grenfell, Clive Morton, Leslie Perrins', null, 'Two Welsh coal-mining brothers win a trip to London to claim a monetary prize. They are supposed to meet a newspaper reporter who will be their escort. Instead, the brothers are launched into an adventure with some London riff-raff. It is up to the reporter to look out for the brothers, and what a job it turns out to be!', 'Two Welsh coal-mining brothers win a trip to London to claim a monetary prize. They are supposed to meet a newspaper reporter who will be their escort. Instead, the brothers are launched into an adventure with some London riff-raff. It is up to the reporter to look out for the brothers, and what a job it turns out to be!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xs1nH2NtdF6NjvuVRpI7VS1gWy7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63395'),
