  ('816493127343854171', 'A Sacrifice', 2024, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Jordan Scott, Julie Kirkwood', 'Jordan Scott', 'Eric Bana, Sadie Sink, Sylvia Hoeks, Jonas Dassler, Sophie Rois, Stephan Kampwirth, Justine del Corte, Joone Dankou', 'R', 'American social psychologist Ben Monroe investigates a local cult connected to a disturbing event. While he immerses himself into his work, his rebellious teenage daughter, Mazzy, gets involved with a mysterious local boy, who introduces her to the city’s underground party scene. As these two worlds head towards an intersection, Mazzy finds herself in great danger and Ben will need to race against the clock to save her.', 'American social psychologist Ben Monroe investigates a local cult connected to a disturbing event. While he immerses himself into his work, his rebellious teenage daughter, Mazzy, gets involved with a mysterious local boy, who introduces her to the city’s underground party scene. As these two worlds head towards an intersection, Mazzy finds herself in great danger and Ben will need to race against the clock to save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihXINKQfzdaVKvZwZqmchy20uVD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:931628'),
  ('324159267892830641', 'A Safe Place', 1971, 'Drama', 'Henry Jaglom, Richard C. Kratina, Stephen F. Kesten', 'Henry Jaglom', 'Tuesday Weld, Orson Welles, Jack Nicholson, Phil Proctor, Gwen Welles, Dov Lawrence, Fanny Birkenmier, Rhonda Alfaro', 'PG', 'Noah, a young woman who lives alone in New York, is dating two very different men, Fred and Mitch, at the same time. However, she realises that neither man can totally fulfil her needs.', 'Noah, a young woman who lives alone in New York, is dating two very different men, Fred and Mitch, at the same time. However, she realises that neither man can totally fulfil her needs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xRIdcMxfPgSKqUN4SVmFN4E2iyZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53898'),
  ('558864815172070213', 'A Sailor-Made Man', 1921, 'Comedy', 'Fred C. Newmeyer, Walter Lundin', 'Sam Taylor, Jean C. Havez, Hal Roach', 'Harold Lloyd, Mildred Davis, Noah Young, Dick Sutherland, Sybil Seely', 'NR', 'An idle, wealthy playboy foolishly joins the Navy when the father of the girl he wants to marry tells him to get a job to prove himself worthy.', 'An idle, wealthy playboy foolishly joins the Navy when the father of the girl he wants to marry tells him to get a job to prove himself worthy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Qdn5nArhsVNL0awfYUhWEpQFhb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44406'),
  ('112697710388153607', 'A Saintly Switch', 1999, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Peter Bogdanovich, James Gardner', 'Sally Hampton, Haris Orkin', 'Vivica A. Fox, David Alan Grier, Al Waxman, Scott Cumberbatch, Shadia Simmons, David Keeley, Rue McClanahan, Frank Welker', null, 'The story is about a married couple with children on the verge of divorce. Their imminent divorce, like many, is due to their mutual lack of respect and compassion for each other and the effect it has on their children. When the family makes a traumatic move to New Orleans they move into an old, Victorian home. There, in the attic, the children think they have found the "magic" to solve their parent''s problems. The children accidentally manage to switch the souls of their parents. Now the wife must face the perils of the lockeroom and pressures as family breadwinner and the husband must face pregnancy and bond with his children. Newfound respect and appreciation is gained as the couple finally find out what it''s like to walk in the other person''s shoes.', 'The story is about a married couple with children on the verge of divorce. Their imminent divorce, like many, is due to their mutual lack of respect and compassion for each other and the effect it has on their children. When the family makes a traumatic move to New Orleans they move into an old, Victorian home. There, in the attic, the children think they have found the "magic" to solve their parent''s problems. The children accidentally manage to switch the souls of their parents. Now the wife must face the perils of the lockeroom and pressures as family breadwinner and the husband must face pregnancy and bond with his children. Newfound respect and appreciation is gained as the couple finally find out what it''s like to walk in the other person''s shoes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPFYW8EKWlwFTPetvL8HQ9EEpLr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89255'),
  ('136098304164861972', 'A Samurai in Time', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Junichi Yasuda, Junichi Yasuda, Yuno Sakura', 'Junichi Yasuda', 'Makiya Yamaguchi, Norimasa Fuke, Yuno Sakura, Rantaro Mine, Ken Shonozaki, Manko Kurenai, Yoshiharu Fukuda, Hajime Inoue', null, 'A samurai who gets hit by lightning wakes up to find himself on a film set in the present day and starts to work as an extra on samurai films.', 'A samurai who gets hit by lightning wakes up to find himself on a film set in the present day and starts to work as an extra on samurai films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQbxGmLOqZrFLxLrfeIU4TGaOiU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1287819'),
  ('1048456044305112028', 'A Savannah Haunting', 2022, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'William Mark McCullough', 'William Mark McCullough', 'Gena Shaw, Dean J. West, Tommi Rose, Simbi Khali, Anna Harriette Pittman, Bill Winkler, Moses Jones, Brittney Level', null, 'Based on true events and filmed in the actual haunted house upon which the script is based, A Savannah Haunting is a chilling supernatural thriller about a family that is torn apart by evil forces inside their new home.', 'Based on true events and filmed in the actual haunted house upon which the script is based, A Savannah Haunting is a chilling supernatural thriller about a family that is torn apart by evil forces inside their new home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCq3yjkckWeD6UhyUJYfMQ1Pcoo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852917'),
