  ('12749420544417782', 'A Screaming Man', 2010, 'War, Drama', 'Mahamat-Saleh Haroun', 'Mahamat-Saleh Haroun', 'Youssouf Djaoro, Diouc Koma, Emile Abossolo M''bo, Hadje Fatime N''Goua, Marius Yelolo, Djénéba Koné, Li Heling, Rémadji Adèle Ngaradoumbaye', 'NR', 'Adam Ousmane is a pool attendant at a local resort. When the new managers decide to downsize, Adam loses his job to his own son, Abdel. Shattered by the turn of events, Adam is pressured into contributing to the Chadian war effort. With no money to speak of, the only asset he can donate is his son.', 'Adam Ousmane is a pool attendant at a local resort. When the new managers decide to downsize, Adam loses his job to his own son, Abdel. Shattered by the turn of events, Adam is pressured into contributing to the Chadian war effort. With no money to speak of, the only asset he can donate is his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q90ysGM6CQmHnUTGGU4x5TBv4hn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57602'),
  ('620612827864067489', 'A Season for Miracles', 1999, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Michael Pressman', 'Maria Nation', 'Carla Gugino, Kathy Baker, David Conrad, Laura Dern, Patty Duke, Lynn Redgrave, Mary Fogarty, Faith Prince', 'G', 'A miracle occurs for a homeless family consisting of two wayward children and their protective aunt with the help of an angel. When a young woman''s niece and nephew are threatened with foster care after her sister is hospitalized following yet another overdose, she flees with them until they land in the sleepy town of Bethlehem just before Christmas and a series of kindnesses and coincidences gives the trio a chance at happiness.', 'A miracle occurs for a homeless family consisting of two wayward children and their protective aunt with the help of an angel. When a young woman''s niece and nephew are threatened with foster care after her sister is hospitalized following yet another overdose, she flees with them until they land in the sleepy town of Bethlehem just before Christmas and a series of kindnesses and coincidences gives the trio a chance at happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDtDxE6tHTJ51he0aeCLTUMHWM8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146405'),
  ('443366543869485071', 'A Season in France', 2018, 'Drama', 'Mahamat-Saleh Haroun, Mathieu Giombini', 'Mahamat-Saleh Haroun', 'Ériq Ebouaney, Sandrine Bonnaire, Aalayna Lys, Ibrahim Burama Darboe, Bibi Tanga, Léonie Simaga, Régine Conas, Khampha Thammavongsa', null, 'An African high school teacher flees his war-torn country for France, where he falls in love with a Frenchwoman who offers a roof for him and his family.', 'An African high school teacher flees his war-torn country for France, where he falls in love with a Frenchwoman who offers a roof for him and his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKWfZwNZo6PHYvjTnCBtEYy0MnP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470643'),
  ('59178236374541818', 'A Season in Hakkari', 1983, 'Drama', 'Erden Kıral, Leyla Özalp, Kenan Ormanlar', 'Onat Kutlar', 'Genco Erkal, Erkan Yücel, Şerif Sezer, Rana Cabbar, Erol Demiröz, Berrin Koper, Macit Koper, Zeynep Irgat', null, 'An urban Turkish teacher is transferred for political reasons to a backward Kurdish village in the mountains near the Iranian border. He is welcomed with distrust, but during that harsh year the mutual cultural misunderstandings fade away.', 'An urban Turkish teacher is transferred for political reasons to a backward Kurdish village in the mountains near the Iranian border. He is welcomed with distrust, but during that harsh year the mutual cultural misunderstandings fade away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wD5RlQFWI0HkGLv7d2XKWxX2sZw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263547'),
  ('260263152212028325', 'A Season in Hell', 1971, 'Drama, History', 'Aldo Scavarda, Nelo Risi', 'Raffaele La Capria, Nelo Risi', 'Terence Stamp, Jean-Claude Brialy, Florinda Bolkan, Pier Paolo Capponi, Niké Arrighi, Giancarlo Prati, Debebe Eshetu, Pascal Mazzotti', null, 'The tumultuous life of Arthur Rimbaud, the cursed poet, who completed his masterwork at the age of twenty, became an arms dealer and died at thirty-seven; and his passionate relationship with Paul Verlaine, full of wanderings, storms and falling out.', 'The tumultuous life of Arthur Rimbaud, the cursed poet, who completed his masterwork at the age of twenty, became an arms dealer and died at thirty-seven; and his passionate relationship with Paul Verlaine, full of wanderings, storms and falling out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jyQpkiNyxKxJXvEbVXdoQuSQhHR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279541'),
  ('160010554476377952', 'A Season to Blossom', 2026, 'Romance, TV Movie, Drama', 'Terry Ingram, Graham Talbot, Nelson Talbot', 'Jennifer Wolfgram', 'Emily Tennant, Carlo Marks, Laura Soltis, EaeMya ThynGi, Mark Humphrey, Milo Shandel, Anita Brown, Devon Kenzo', null, 'An aspiring writer takes over her late grandmother''s bookstore and finds love.', 'An aspiring writer takes over her late grandmother''s bookstore and finds love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7DP7lulYcuMtUFc7AbmnqJBdtw1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1638782'),
  ('884116792656613809', 'A second Chance', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Bob Buchholz, Daniel Camhi, Javier Solar', 'Carolina Rivera', 'Jesús Ochoa, Lisa Owen, Jorge Poza, Ximena Sariñana, Fabiana Perzabal, Juan Carlos Vives, Martha Cristiana Merino, Patricio Castillo', null, 'Julia and Moises fell in love and got married when they were young, idealistic, and passionate; now in their 30s, their marriage has cooled and their lives have sunken into the mediocrity they had sought to avoid. This realization inspires a quest to regain the lost dreams of their youth, which is complicated when a handsome student begins to pursue Julia. She begins an affair with the fiery young activist that may just put the excitement back into her marriage. This is a funny and insightful exploration of the intricacies of relationships, love, and idealism, and Jesus Ochoa as Moises turns in a stellar performance.', 'Julia and Moises fell in love and got married when they were young, idealistic, and passionate; now in their 30s, their marriage has cooled and their lives have sunken into the mediocrity they had sought to avoid. This realization inspires a quest to regain the lost dreams of their youth, which is complicated when a handsome student begins to pursue Julia. She begins an affair with the fiery young activist that may just put the excitement back into her marriage. This is a funny and insightful exploration of the intricacies of relationships, love, and idealism, and Jesus Ochoa as Moises turns in a stellar performance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nkVM9kC5PZe8ypcrggCTs6B2kTT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75789'),
  ('1004563904492516200', 'A Second Chance', 1976, 'Drama', 'Claude Lelouch', 'Claude Lelouch', 'Catherine Deneuve, Anouk Aimée, Charles Denner, Francis Huster, Colette Baudot, Jean-Jacques Briot, Jean-Pierre Kalfon, Valérie Lagrange', null, 'Imprisoned as an accessory to murder, Catherine gives birth to a son she conceived in prison. Eighteen years later, her sentence served, she is reunited with the boy, Simon, who has remained in an orphanage the entire time. She is accompanied by toothsome prison buddy Sarah, and gradually these people whose lives have been frozen in time "thaw" and get on with the business of living.', 'Imprisoned as an accessory to murder, Catherine gives birth to a son she conceived in prison. Eighteen years later, her sentence served, she is reunited with the boy, Simon, who has remained in an orphanage the entire time. She is accompanied by toothsome prison buddy Sarah, and gradually these people whose lives have been frozen in time "thaw" and get on with the business of living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0w6TAyrxWT0JXPfIAnQSqC4YtR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263230'),
  ('972563624328934659', 'A Second Chance', 2011, 'Drama, Family', 'Clay Glen, Hugh Freytag, Charlotte Rose Hamlyn', 'Clay Glen', 'Adam Tuominen, Emily Morris, Nina Pearce, Amy Handley, Carmel Johnson, Alanah Gilbert, Lilly Blacker, Hapi Murphy', 'PG', 'A young girl and her coach overcome adversity to make their way into the National Australian Gymnastics Squad.', 'A young girl and her coach overcome adversity to make their way into the National Australian Gymnastics Squad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHCiLSLwnAlj4sNJECyx5r8h97G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252674'),
  ('1132171893248770849', 'A Second Chance', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Susanne Bier, Michael Snyman', 'Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Ulrich Thomsen, Nikolaj Lie Kaas, May Andersen, Maria Bonnevie, Kirsten Lehfeldt, Peter Haber, Ewa Fröling', null, 'Detectives and best friends Andreas and Simon lead vastly different lives; Andreas has settled down with his beautiful wife and son; while Simon, recently divorced, spends most of his waking hours getting drunk at the local strip club. But all that changes when the two of them are called out to a domestic dispute between a junkie couple, caught in a vicious cycle of violence and drugs. It all looks very routine – until Andreas finds the couple''s infant son, crying in a closet. The usually collected policeman finds himself confronted with his own powerlessness and is shaken to his core. As Andreas slowly loses his grip on justice, it suddenly becomes up to the unruly Simon to restore the balance between right and wrong.', 'Detectives and best friends Andreas and Simon lead vastly different lives; Andreas has settled down with his beautiful wife and son; while Simon, recently divorced, spends most of his waking hours getting drunk at the local strip club. But all that changes when the two of them are called out to a domestic dispute between a junkie couple, caught in a vicious cycle of violence and drugs. It all looks very routine – until Andreas finds the couple''s infant son, crying in a closet. The usually collected policeman finds himself confronted with his own powerlessness and is shaken to his core. As Andreas slowly loses his grip on justice, it suddenly becomes up to the unruly Simon to restore the balance between right and wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89jXZYnP7RB6xTHhZCMUxk14HaZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254200'),
  ('278512721451078175', 'A Second Chance: Rivals!', 2019, 'Drama, Family', 'Clay Glen', 'Clay Glen', 'Emily Morris, Stella Shute, Eva Grados, India Colombi, Elysia Markou, Alexander Lloyd, Adam Tuominen, Sally Pearson', null, 'As Maddy takes on coaching a team of young twelve-year-old gymnasts, she faces up to intense city versus country rivalry, racism, cyberbullying and her own self-doubt but eventually takes the challenge head on.', 'As Maddy takes on coaching a team of young twelve-year-old gymnasts, she faces up to intense city versus country rivalry, racism, cyberbullying and her own self-doubt but eventually takes the challenge head on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/egTUn0oodsHa6gC9XXux40eSAhQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588730'),
  ('1132331961052808733', 'A Second Childhood', 2010, 'Drama', 'Pupi Avati, Pasquale Rachini', 'Pupi Avati', 'Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Francesca Neri, Lino Capolicchio, Manuela Morabito, Erika Blanc, Osvaldo Ruggieri, Isa Barzizza, Martine Brochard', null, 'Lino and Chicca are an aging, childless middle-class couple whose life is disrupted after he''s diagnosed with Alzheimer''s disease.', 'Lino and Chicca are an aging, childless middle-class couple whose life is disrupted after he''s diagnosed with Alzheimer''s disease.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5IAn6saIOJscT8Gf7ezreiXRGkr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56922'),
  ('245505535724398899', 'A Secret', 2007, 'Drama', 'Claude Miller, Gérard de Battista', 'Claude Miller, Natalie Carter', 'Patrick Bruel, Cécile de France, Ludivine Sagnier, Julie Depardieu, Mathieu Amalric, Nathalie Boutefeu, Yves Verhoeven, Yves Jacques', null, 'In 1953, a sensitive French boy finds out from a neighbor that his family''s Jewish. François Grimbert becomes a physician, and gradually peels the layers of his buried family history which resulted in his difficult upbringing, raised as Catholic by his "Aryan" appearing parents. His athletic father labored to stamp out stereotypical Jewish characteristics he perceived in his son, to keep the family''s many secrets, as most relatives fought in World War II, and later were hauled off to labor and death camps by the Gestapo.', 'In 1953, a sensitive French boy finds out from a neighbor that his family''s Jewish. François Grimbert becomes a physician, and gradually peels the layers of his buried family history which resulted in his difficult upbringing, raised as Catholic by his "Aryan" appearing parents. His athletic father labored to stamp out stereotypical Jewish characteristics he perceived in his son, to keep the family''s many secrets, as most relatives fought in World War II, and later were hauled off to labor and death camps by the Gestapo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KcpHL8hjqBxZnMTMITGh8MNAhh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13726'),
  ('141427575129191846', 'A Secret Love', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Chris Bolan, Stephen Kazmierski', 'Brendan Mason, Chris Bolan, Alexa L. Fogel', 'Terry Donahue, Pat Henschel, Diana Bolan, Kim Donahue, Tammy Donahue, Jack Xagas, John Byrd, Yvonne Zipter', null, 'Amid shifting times, two women kept their decades-long love a secret. But coming out later in life comes with its own set of challenges.', 'Amid shifting times, two women kept their decades-long love a secret. But coming out later in life comes with its own set of challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28LNd4KEpqt9i8sgXrVcrdr2kgI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:687156'),
  ('352361774378392046', 'A Secret World', 2012, 'Drama', 'Gabriel Mariño', 'Gabriel Mariño', 'Lucía Uribe, Roberto Mares, Olivia Lagunas, Claudia Ríos', null, 'A poetic, tender road movie, A Secret World follows tormented teenager Maria as she makes her way through Mexico seeking her place in life. The film focuses on the pleasant beauty of the landscape and the eccentric, endearing personality of Maria as she comes into her own. Gorgeously filmed, this lyrical coming-of-age story doubles as a wistful hymn to a young woman’s self-discovery.', 'A poetic, tender road movie, A Secret World follows tormented teenager Maria as she makes her way through Mexico seeking her place in life. The film focuses on the pleasant beauty of the landscape and the eccentric, endearing personality of Maria as she comes into her own. Gorgeously filmed, this lyrical coming-of-age story doubles as a wistful hymn to a young woman’s self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TaOXG99ixEGzgQIDeOGfMm0CA7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99395'),
  ('82446322793901308', 'A Self-Made Hero', 1996, 'Drama, War, Comedy', 'Jean-Marc Fabre, Jacques Audiard, Florence Botel', 'Alain Le Henry, Jacques Audiard', 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Anouk Grinberg, Sandrine Kiberlain, Albert Dupontel, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Nadia Barentin, Bernard Bloch, François Chattot', null, 'Set in France at the end of World War II Albert Dehousse finds out his father wasn''t a war hero and his mother is a collaborator.', 'Set in France at the end of World War II Albert Dehousse finds out his father wasn''t a war hero and his mother is a collaborator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXB4G4UTwJCBKLdFLNKA8fWYdeQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48580'),
