  ('1075710428934836670', 'A Serious Man', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ethan Coen, Joel Coen, Roger Deakins', 'Joel Coen, Ethan Coen', 'Michael Stuhlbarg, Richard Kind, Fred Melamed, Sari Lennick, Aaron Wolff, Jessica McManus, Peter Breitmayer, Brent Braunschweig', 'R', 'It is 1967, and Larry Gopnik, a physics professor at a quiet Midwestern university, has just been informed by his wife Judith that she is leaving him. She has fallen in love with one of his more pompous acquaintances Sy Ableman.', 'It is 1967, and Larry Gopnik, a physics professor at a quiet Midwestern university, has just been informed by his wife Judith that she is leaving him. She has fallen in love with one of his more pompous acquaintances Sy Ableman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gGxDS8WmrebPlMHexVS8EVehiP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12573'),
  ('461120780784592728', 'A Serious Shock! Yes Madam!', 1993, 'Action, Adventure', 'Albert Lai Gin-Kwok, Danny Lee Yau-Tong, Lee Man-Kwai', 'Ella Chan Bo-wa', 'Cynthia Khan, Moon Lee Choi-Fung, Yukari Ôshima, Lawrence Ng Kai-Wah, Waise Lee Chi-Hung, Karel Wong Chi-Yeung, Ku Feng, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai', null, 'In this action packed Hong Kong Yes Madam installment two friends in the police force are in love with the same man. After a certain incident one of them goes crazy and does everything she can to kill her former friend.', 'In this action packed Hong Kong Yes Madam installment two friends in the police force are in love with the same man. After a certain incident one of them goes crazy and does everything she can to kill her former friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qscluEk87alZ6f4NmTJ8qBwLbEc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37868'),
  ('247379046695152755', 'A Severed Head', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Dick Clement, Peter Bolton, Austin Dempster', 'Frederic Raphael', 'Lee Remick, Richard Attenborough, Ian Holm, Claire Bloom, Jennie Linden, Clive Revill, Ann Firbank, Rosamund Greenwood', null, 'Antonia Lynch-Gibbon, wife of upper-crust wine dealer Martin, falls in love with her husband''s best friend, noted psychiatrist Palmer Anderson. While both Palmer and Antonia would like to remain in Martin''s life, he has some secrets of his own — namely, a mistress called Georgie, whom his womanizing brother also desires. All the while, Palmer''s sister Honor seems to know everyone''s business.', 'Antonia Lynch-Gibbon, wife of upper-crust wine dealer Martin, falls in love with her husband''s best friend, noted psychiatrist Palmer Anderson. While both Palmer and Antonia would like to remain in Martin''s life, he has some secrets of his own — namely, a mistress called Georgie, whom his womanizing brother also desires. All the while, Palmer''s sister Honor seems to know everyone''s business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGTw7rHEL8dpxthy646r98xQ2bY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61622'),
  ('1091102926510956560', 'A Shaun the Sheep Movie: Farmageddon', 2019, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Charles Copping, Will Becher, Richard Phelan', 'Mark Burton, Jon Brown', 'Justin Fletcher, John Sparkes, Amalia Vitale, Kate Harbour, David Holt, Andy Nyman, Rich Webber, Emma Tate', 'G', 'When an alien with amazing powers crash-lands near Mossy Bottom Farm, Shaun the Sheep goes on a mission to shepherd the intergalactic visitor home before a sinister organization can capture her.', 'When an alien with amazing powers crash-lands near Mossy Bottom Farm, Shaun the Sheep goes on a mission to shepherd the intergalactic visitor home before a sinister organization can capture her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p08FoXVFgcRm5QZBaGj0VKa2W2Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422803'),
  ('154188523318265996', 'A Sheep in the Deep', 1962, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Maurice Noble', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Ralph Wolf and Sam Sheepdog punch into work, with Sam guarding a flock of sheep against Ralph''s attempts to snatch some mutton for dinner. Ralph uses a lull-a-bye record to put Sam to sleep and steals one of the sheep, but the lamb unzips itself to reveal someone very unexpected beneath!', 'Ralph Wolf and Sam Sheepdog punch into work, with Sam guarding a flock of sheep against Ralph''s attempts to snatch some mutton for dinner. Ralph uses a lull-a-bye record to put Sam to sleep and steals one of the sheep, but the lamb unzips itself to reveal someone very unexpected beneath!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GbngFaMhymLXcq2lZL6dutuJaI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148698'),
  ('912415907580953190', 'A Shine of Rainbows', 2009, 'Family, Drama', 'Vic Sarin, Vic Sarin', 'Vic Sarin, Catherine Spear', 'Connie Nielsen, Aidan Quinn, John Bell, Tara Alice Scully, Niamh Shaw, Jack Gleeson', 'PG', 'An orphaned boy named Tomás is adopted by Maire O’Donnell to live on a whimsical Irish isle filled with new friends, secret caves and a lost baby pup seal stranded on the coast. But when Maire''s reluctant husband Alec refuses to accept Tomás as his own son, the boy drifts down a fateful path of adventure and self-discovery, illuminating how rainbows can shine around - and within - us all.', 'An orphaned boy named Tomás is adopted by Maire O’Donnell to live on a whimsical Irish isle filled with new friends, secret caves and a lost baby pup seal stranded on the coast. But when Maire''s reluctant husband Alec refuses to accept Tomás as his own son, the boy drifts down a fateful path of adventure and self-discovery, illuminating how rainbows can shine around - and within - us all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FWxI20tzm9LuP3KT9cbmp5YN6Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37206'),
  ('102885550523483487', 'A Ship Comes In', 1928, 'Drama', 'William K. Howard, Emile de Ruelle, Lucien N. Andriot', 'Sonya Levien', 'Louise Dresser, Rudolph Schildkraut, Fritz Feld, Milton Holmes, Linda Landi, Lucien Littlefield, Robert Edeson, Louis Natheaux', null, 'Film which tells the story of immigrants coming to the United States.', 'Film which tells the story of immigrants coming to the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWoUWWoOw4zXsmUpzrgLPHzSXSv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104212'),
  ('206363565864267938', 'A Ship to India', 1947, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ingmar Bergman, Göran Strindberg', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Holger Löwenadler, Anna Lindahl, Birger Malmsten, Gertrud Fridh, Naemi Briese, Hjördis Petterson, Lasse Krantz, Jan Molander', null, 'Returning home after seven years at sea, a sailor relives his youth aboard a salvage ship dominated by his abusive father, recalling love, betrayal, and the desire to escape. Told in flashback, the film explores family conflict, longing, and moral reckoning in an early milestone of Ingmar Bergman’s career.', 'Returning home after seven years at sea, a sailor relives his youth aboard a salvage ship dominated by his abusive father, recalling love, betrayal, and the desire to escape. Told in flashback, the film explores family conflict, longing, and moral reckoning in an early milestone of Ingmar Bergman’s career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t3YMYzdL25sdd2G4JIugcfZBeIm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106122'),
  ('999852690896612357', 'A Shock to the System', 1990, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Jan Egleson, Paul Goldsmith', 'Andrew Klavan', 'Michael Caine, Elizabeth McGovern, Peter Riegert, Swoosie Kurtz, Will Patton, Jenny Wright, John McMartin, Barbara Baxley', 'R', 'When experienced advertising executive Graham Marshall loses out on a promotion to a young man, he goes down in a path of vengeance.', 'When experienced advertising executive Graham Marshall loses out on a promotion to a young man, he goes down in a path of vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8V0zLIEuMQicvhoSPAXZTT39GYT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20876'),
  ('1126913182124908554', 'A Shoe Addict''s Christmas', 2018, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie, Fantasy', 'Michael Robison, Eric J. Goldstein', 'Rick Garman', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Luke Macfarlane, Jean Smart, Tenika Davis, Vanessa Matsui, Kristian Bruun, Dan Willmott, Maria Ricossa', null, 'As Christmas approaches, a department store worker whose life lacks fulfillment meets her guardian angel, who offers her a chance to change her circumstances by magically transporting her to Christmases past whenever she tries on a new pair of shoes.', 'As Christmas approaches, a department store worker whose life lacks fulfillment meets her guardian angel, who offers her a chance to change her circumstances by magically transporting her to Christmases past whenever she tries on a new pair of shoes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAMSWUBSG8rhXuU9JmQItWNmn4U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535809'),
  ('665377384660724450', 'A Short Love Affair', 1990, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jang Sun-woo, You Yong-kil', 'Im Jong-jae, Jang Sun-woo', 'Park Joong-hoon, Choi Myung-gil, Yoo Hye-ri, Lee Dae-geun, Choi Joo-bong, Kim Yeong-ok, Sin Chung-sik, Jung Sang-cheol', null, 'Bae Il-do, who feels unappreciated in his rural village, runs away from home and works as a tailor. His wife grew up under a harsh stepmother and worked as a housekeeper and bar hostess before meeting Il-do, for whom she bore a child. The young and attractive Gong-rye comes between them, having an affair with Il-do while working with him in a garment factory. Their secret meetings don''t remain secret for long and Il-do''s wife inevitably finds out...', 'Bae Il-do, who feels unappreciated in his rural village, runs away from home and works as a tailor. His wife grew up under a harsh stepmother and worked as a housekeeper and bar hostess before meeting Il-do, for whom she bore a child. The young and attractive Gong-rye comes between them, having an affair with Il-do while working with him in a garment factory. Their secret meetings don''t remain secret for long and Il-do''s wife inevitably finds out...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kFv7Vjyu0GOtqSmROWG3JjTnzG1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271791'),
