  ('224027715461881428', 'A Short Vision', 1956, 'Drama, Animation, War', 'Joan Foldes, Peter Foldès', 'Peter Foldès, Joan Foldes', 'James McKechnie', null, 'The leaders, the wise men, the leopard, the deer, the owl and the rat all look up in the sky in fear as a strange object flies through the sky.', 'The leaders, the wise men, the leopard, the deer, the owl and the rat all look up in the sky in fear as a strange object flies through the sky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8XLAzWaBmA1OluP3QRG75vLjcm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326545'),
  ('617005226483164995', 'A Shot at Glory', 2000, 'Drama', 'Michael Corrente, Alex Thomson, Mark Taylor', 'Denis O''Neill', 'Robert Duvall, Michael Keaton, Ally McCoist, Cole Hauser, Brian Cox, Kirsty Mitchell, Libby Langdon, Derek Lord', 'R', 'The irascible manager of a lower-division Scottish football side must contend with problems off and on the field when his team''s impatient American owner demands they win the Scottish Cup or else be relocated to Ireland, while also dealing with the forced arrival of a new star striker - who happens to be his estranged son-in-law, whom he blames for the breakdown of his relationship with his daughter.', 'The irascible manager of a lower-division Scottish football side must contend with problems off and on the field when his team''s impatient American owner demands they win the Scottish Cup or else be relocated to Ireland, while also dealing with the forced arrival of a new star striker - who happens to be his estranged son-in-law, whom he blames for the breakdown of his relationship with his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixYNeNqUAEGMth666MnvjqTG1Vo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72087'),
  ('599423114837878071', 'A Shot in the Dark', 1964, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Blake Edwards, George Dunning, Christopher Challis', 'Blake Edwards, William Peter Blatty', 'Peter Sellers, Elke Sommer, George Sanders, Herbert Lom, Graham Stark, Moira Redmond, Tracy Reed, Burt Kwouk', 'PG', 'Inspector Jacques Clouseau, smitten with the accused maid Maria Gambrelli, unwittingly turns a straightforward murder investigation into a comedic series of mishaps, testing the patience of his irritable boss Charles Dreyfus as casualties mount.', 'Inspector Jacques Clouseau, smitten with the accused maid Maria Gambrelli, unwittingly turns a straightforward murder investigation into a comedic series of mishaps, testing the patience of his irritable boss Charles Dreyfus as casualties mount.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pR6tNqNLYIbRRYC5TFKWVWaVvvK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1594'),
  ('469567010915925843', 'A Show of Force', 1990, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'James Glennon, Zachary Weintraub, Ty Arnold', 'John Strong, Evan Jones', 'Amy Irving, Andy Garcia, Lou Diamond Phillips, Robert Duvall, Kevin Spacey, Erik Estrada, Juan Fernández, Lupe Ontiveros', 'R', 'In this thriller, television reporter Kate Ryan de Meléndez investigates the death of two radical Puerto Rican activists, whom she begins to believe may have been framed and murdered by undercover American agents.', 'In this thriller, television reporter Kate Ryan de Meléndez investigates the death of two radical Puerto Rican activists, whom she begins to believe may have been framed and murdered by undercover American agents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keqFwiYtHnTIMTMvQjAYyGEkrQp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26426'),
  ('606814608300232486', 'A Shriek in the Night', 1933, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Albert Ray, Tom Galligan, Harry Neumann', 'Frances Hyland', 'Ginger Rogers, Lyle Talbot, Harvey Clark, Purnell Pratt, Lillian Harmer, Arthur Hoyt, Louise Beavers, Clarence Wilson', 'NR', 'Rival newspaper reporters Pat Morgan and Ted Rand find themselves unraveling the mystery behind the death of a millionaire philanthropist who fell from his penthouse balcony. When it is discovered that the plunge was not an accident, the building''s residents come under suspicion. Soon, the body count begins to mount as three more murders occur by strangulation.', 'Rival newspaper reporters Pat Morgan and Ted Rand find themselves unraveling the mystery behind the death of a millionaire philanthropist who fell from his penthouse balcony. When it is discovered that the plunge was not an accident, the building''s residents come under suspicion. Soon, the body count begins to mount as three more murders occur by strangulation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQzNjqtHJHVoG1M9UcINVKenC0Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22689'),
  ('9541938931786316', 'A Silence', 2024, 'Drama', 'Joachim Lafosse, Jean-François Hensgens', 'Joachim Lafosse, Chloé Duponchelle, Paul Ismael', 'Emmanuelle Devos, Daniel Auteuil, Larisa Faber, Matthieu Galoux, Jeanne Cherhal, Louise Chevillotte, Nicolas Buysse, Karim Barras', null, 'Astrid is the wife of an acclaimed lawyer. Silenced for 25 years, her family balance suddenly collapses when her children initiate their search for justice.', 'Astrid is the wife of an acclaimed lawyer. Silenced for 25 years, her family balance suddenly collapses when her children initiate their search for justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXWJGRUqztTkflac30jjd2bjvBU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:962319'),
  ('235903400730182747', 'A Silent Death', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Guillermo Greco, Sebastián Schindel, Ariel Checcio', 'Matías Lucchesi', 'Joaquín Furriel, Soledad Villamil, Alejandro Awada, Víctor Laplace, Patricio Contreras, María Marull, Sol Wainer, Javier Pedersoli', null, 'Octavio, a hunting guide from southern Argentina, desperately fights to clarify the death of his niece Sofía, discovered shot in the hunting preserve where he works. The shot bursts into the darkness, unleashing an enigma that shakes the entire town. Octavio will be forced to unravel what really happened that night and thus confront a truth that threatens to change everything forever.', 'Octavio, a hunting guide from southern Argentina, desperately fights to clarify the death of his niece Sofía, discovered shot in the hunting preserve where he works. The shot bursts into the darkness, unleashing an enigma that shakes the entire town. Octavio will be forced to unravel what really happened that night and thus confront a truth that threatens to change everything forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfxVkV5vFZmgnR2zzoj6virotwB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1191605'),
  ('1009556382916202611', 'A Silent Voice: The Movie', 2016, 'Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Naoko Yamada, Kazuya Takao, Yota Tsuruoka', 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Miyu Irino, Saori Hayami, Aoi Yuuki, Kensho Ono, Yuki Kaneko, Yui Ishikawa, Megumi Han, Toshiyuki Toyonaga', 'NR', 'Shouya Ishida starts bullying the new girl in class, Shouko Nishimiya, because she is deaf. But as the teasing continues, the rest of the class starts to turn on Shouya for his lack of compassion. When they leave elementary school, Shouko and Shouya do not speak to each other again... until an older, wiser Shouya, tormented by his past behaviour, decides he must see Shouko once more. He wants to atone for his sins, but is it already too late...?', 'Shouya Ishida starts bullying the new girl in class, Shouko Nishimiya, because she is deaf. But as the teasing continues, the rest of the class starts to turn on Shouya for his lack of compassion. When they leave elementary school, Shouko and Shouya do not speak to each other again... until an older, wiser Shouya, tormented by his past behaviour, decides he must see Shouko once more. He wants to atone for his sins, but is it already too late...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tuFaWiqX0TXoWu7DGNcmX3UW7sT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378064'),
  ('1079561212165408117', 'A Simple Case', 1930, 'Romance, Drama', 'Vsevolod Pudovkin, Mikhail Doller, Grigory Kabalov', 'Alexandr Rzheshevsky', 'Aleksandr Baturin, Yevgeniya Rogulina, Mariya Belousova, Andrei Gorchilin, Anna Chekulaeva, Ivan Novoseltsev, Aleksandr Chistyakov, V. Kuzmich', null, 'As a response to criticism for the allegedly excessive “mass appeal” of his earlier epic STORM OVER ASIA (1928), Vsevolod Pudovkin unleashed his flair for experimentation in what was supposed to be the director’s first sound feature. Everything went wrong: technical problems forced him to complete the film as a silent; viewers were baffled by the lack of a recognizable plot; then, the ideological climate of the Soviet Union changed. He was now being blamed for catering to bourgeois taste! Time has come to set the record straight. Here’s lyrical cinema at its best, deliberately operatic and yet intimate as it matches the characters’ inner life with the solemn rhythms of nature, and depicted through breathtaking black-and-white photography. A sensation at last year’s Pordenone fest, Pudovkin’s long-forgotten swan song to the art of montage is resurrected by Gabriel Thibaudeau’s emotionally charged live music performance. –PCU (USSR, 1930, 75m)', 'As a response to criticism for the allegedly excessive “mass appeal” of his earlier epic STORM OVER ASIA (1928), Vsevolod Pudovkin unleashed his flair for experimentation in what was supposed to be the director’s first sound feature. Everything went wrong: technical problems forced him to complete the film as a silent; viewers were baffled by the lack of a recognizable plot; then, the ideological climate of the Soviet Union changed. He was now being blamed for catering to bourgeois taste! Time has come to set the record straight. Here’s lyrical cinema at its best, deliberately operatic and yet intimate as it matches the characters’ inner life with the solemn rhythms of nature, and depicted through breathtaking black-and-white photography. A sensation at last year’s Pordenone fest, Pudovkin’s long-forgotten swan song to the art of montage is resurrected by Gabriel Thibaudeau’s emotionally charged live music performance. –PCU (USSR, 1930, 75m)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtQgfJsh37sIDclm0OAqutfNP4f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219057'),
  ('1059990472546365507', 'A Simple Event', 1973, 'Drama', 'Sohrab Shahid Saless, Naghi Ma''soomi', 'Sohrab Shahid Saless, Omid Roohani', 'Hibibollah Safarian, Mohammed Zamani, Ane Mohammad Tarikhi, Hedayatollah Navid', null, 'The story of a ten years old Iranian schoolboy living with his mother and his father in Northern coasts of Iran. The boy helps his father in selling the latter''s illegal fishing and helps his mother in shopping for her and bringing home water from a well. The three characters live together in only one room. Their life is austere. The boy eats only bread and milk every day... One day the boy''s mother dies.', 'The story of a ten years old Iranian schoolboy living with his mother and his father in Northern coasts of Iran. The boy helps his father in selling the latter''s illegal fishing and helps his mother in shopping for her and bringing home water from a well. The three characters live together in only one room. Their life is austere. The boy eats only bread and milk every day... One day the boy''s mother dies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8prxvHcITIPxnEJl0HxIT8Wjd0C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:318342'),
  ('1056127432538769764', 'A Simple Favor', 2018, 'Thriller, Comedy, Mystery', 'Paul Feig, John Schwartzman, Myron Hoffert', 'Paul Feig', 'Anna Kendrick, Blake Lively, Henry Golding, Rupert Friend, Linda Cardellini, Bashir Salahuddin, Danielle Bourgon, Kelly McCormack', 'R', 'Stephanie, a dedicated mother and popular vlogger, befriends Emily, a mysterious upper-class woman whose son Nicky attends the same school as Miles, Stephanie''s son. When Emily asks her to pick Nicky up from school and then disappears, Stephanie undertakes an investigation that will dive deep into Emily''s cloudy past.', 'Stephanie, a dedicated mother and popular vlogger, befriends Emily, a mysterious upper-class woman whose son Nicky attends the same school as Miles, Stephanie''s son. When Emily asks her to pick Nicky up from school and then disappears, Stephanie undertakes an investigation that will dive deep into Emily''s cloudy past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DfQCZE02FTfkhFLIwWN5dyzn7y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484247'),
  ('514657807951286190', 'A Simple Heart', 2008, 'Drama', 'Marion Laine, Guillaume Schiffman', 'Marion Laine, Gustave Flaubert', 'Sandrine Bonnaire, Marina Foïs, Pascal Elbé, Patrick Pineau, Thibault Vinçon, Noémie Lvovsky, Michaël Abiteboul, Swann Arlaud', null, 'Unable to forget her first love, Félicité, a simple and kind maid, devotes herself completely to her new master, Mathilde Aubain. As the passing of time doesn''t heal her wounds, she gives love to all those who surround her: Mathilde''s children, her nephew Victor. But fate seems to always deny her from any love in return. Still she tries to find someone who''ll accept her unconditional love.', 'Unable to forget her first love, Félicité, a simple and kind maid, devotes herself completely to her new master, Mathilde Aubain. As the passing of time doesn''t heal her wounds, she gives love to all those who surround her: Mathilde''s children, her nephew Victor. But fate seems to always deny her from any love in return. Still she tries to find someone who''ll accept her unconditional love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHl1iHaQB2YliipF53m53OyCI6L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84639'),
  ('523540004926064713', 'A Simple Life', 2012, 'Drama', 'Ann Hui, Nelson Yu Lik-wai', 'Susan Chan Suk-Yin, Roger Lee', 'Andy Lau, Deanie Ip, Qin Hailu, Wang Fuli, Paul Chun Pui, Leung Tin, Wendy Yu Man-Si, Eman Lam Yi-Man', null, 'After suffering a stroke, an altruistic maid announces that she wants to quit her job and move into an old people''s home.', 'After suffering a stroke, an altruistic maid announces that she wants to quit her job and move into an old people''s home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pL0mtka6FKRtlEX6jM9OteDjlTi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91186'),
  ('664081885722431874', 'A Simple Plan', 1998, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Sam Raimi, Paul Ryan, Newt Arnold', 'Scott B. Smith', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Bill Paxton, Bridget Fonda, Brent Briscoe, Jack Walsh, Chelcie Ross, Becky Ann Baker, Gary Cole', 'R', 'Captivated by the lure of sudden wealth, the quiet rural lives of two brothers erupt into conflicts of greed, paranoia and distrust when over $4 million in cash is discovered at the remote site of a downed small airplane. Their simple plan to retain the money while avoiding detection opens a Pandora''s box when the fear of getting caught triggers panicked behavior and leads to virulent consequences.', 'Captivated by the lure of sudden wealth, the quiet rural lives of two brothers erupt into conflicts of greed, paranoia and distrust when over $4 million in cash is discovered at the remote site of a downed small airplane. Their simple plan to retain the money while avoiding detection opens a Pandora''s box when the fear of getting caught triggers panicked behavior and leads to virulent consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wO2gH7DMqpMeHlj5QmDhW4IkgAr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10223'),
  ('210463194778013189', 'A Simple Story', 1959, 'Drama', 'Jacques Warnant, Marcel Hanoun', 'Marcel Hanoun', 'Micheline Bezançon, Elizabeth Huart, Raymond Jourdan, Gilette Barbier, Madeleine Marion, Maria Meriko, Max Delon', null, 'A woman arrives in Paris with her little girl to look for work. With limited funds and no luck, they end up penniless, homeless and dependent on the rare kindness of strangers.', 'A woman arrives in Paris with her little girl to look for work. With limited funds and no luck, they end up penniless, homeless and dependent on the rare kindness of strangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DehFEUFwgd9fjEdzKKRj5b9amg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203263'),
  ('263339758369925377', 'A Simple Story', 1960, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yuri Yegorov, Igor Shatrov, Valentin Khlobynin', 'Budimir Metalnikov', 'Nonna Mordyukova, Mikhail Ulyanov, Vasiliy Shukshin, Valentina Vladimirova, Irina Murzayeva, Danylo Ilchenko, Nina Sazonova, Vladimir Smirnov', null, 'The war was over. Like many of her female friends, Sasha Potapova was left a widow. It was hard living without a man’s shoulder to lean on, without love and affection, yet no one had ever seen her crying or despairing. For her strong character, the fellow-villagers elected her a collective farm chairwoman. The work, with its cares and worries, helped all but forget about her personal misfortune and woman’s loneliness. And then she fell in love – a bittersweet, unshared love, but happy anyway…', 'The war was over. Like many of her female friends, Sasha Potapova was left a widow. It was hard living without a man’s shoulder to lean on, without love and affection, yet no one had ever seen her crying or despairing. For her strong character, the fellow-villagers elected her a collective farm chairwoman. The work, with its cares and worries, helped all but forget about her personal misfortune and woman’s loneliness. And then she fell in love – a bittersweet, unshared love, but happy anyway…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6lUWtuvquGdzi1JBDvdgfqZQzZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150003'),
  ('1081853311455545019', 'A Simple Story', 1978, 'Drama, Romance', 'Claude Sautet, Jean Boffety', 'Claude Sautet, Jean-Loup Dabadie', 'Romy Schneider, Bruno Cremer, Claude Brasseur, Arlette Bonnard, Sophie Daumier, Éva Darlan, Jacques Sereys, Madeleine Robinson', null, 'A middle-aged woman leaves her partner and drifts back to her ex-husband, while the lives of her middle class friends intersect with her own.', 'A middle-aged woman leaves her partner and drifts back to her ex-husband, while the lives of her middle class friends intersect with her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OyRQunGqWBMcBDjT4s0nFXFXsh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3425'),
  ('1147049424756313742', 'A Simple Story', 1991, 'Drama', 'Emidio Greco, Tonino Delli Colli', 'Andrea Barbata, Emidio Greco', 'Gian Maria Volonté, Ennio Fantastichini, Ricky Tognazzi, Massimo Dapporto, Massimo Ghini, Paolo Graziosi, Gianluca Favilla, Gianmarco Tognazzi', null, 'After many years, a retired diplomat returns to his native Sicily to visit an abandoned property and delve into family correspondence. But is it worth bringing up the past? A difficult Sicilian history against the backdrop of the mafia and drugs.', 'After many years, a retired diplomat returns to his native Sicily to visit an abandoned property and delve into family correspondence. But is it worth bringing up the past? A difficult Sicilian history against the backdrop of the mafia and drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iloutir67eQTKutOaAWLxkvnfnb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103218'),
  ('64944684034559742', 'A Simple Twist of Fate', 1994, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Gillies MacKinnon, Andrew Dunn', 'Steve Martin', 'Steve Martin, Gabriel Byrne, Laura Linney, Catherine O''Hara, Alana Austin, Stephen Baldwin, Byron Jennings, Michael Des Barres', 'PG-13', 'When Michael McCann is thrown over by the woman he loves, he becomes something of a misanthrope and a miser, spending all of his spare money on collectible gold coins. Living in the same town is an affluent family with two sons: John and Tanny. Tanny''s a wild boy, whom John cannot control, and one night he breaks into McCann''s house, and steals the gold and disappears, which nearly confirms McCann''s distrust of mankind. But then, a mysterious young woman dies in the snow outside McCann''s house, and her small daughter makes her way to McCann''s house and into McCann''s life and heart.', 'When Michael McCann is thrown over by the woman he loves, he becomes something of a misanthrope and a miser, spending all of his spare money on collectible gold coins. Living in the same town is an affluent family with two sons: John and Tanny. Tanny''s a wild boy, whom John cannot control, and one night he breaks into McCann''s house, and steals the gold and disappears, which nearly confirms McCann''s distrust of mankind. But then, a mysterious young woman dies in the snow outside McCann''s house, and her small daughter makes her way to McCann''s house and into McCann''s life and heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Jorj80Y4EVEAPDRVVdDXKSVUTw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43535'),
  ('77028463098699417', 'A Simple Wish', 1997, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Michael Ritchie, Ralf D. Bode', 'Jeff Rothberg', 'Martin Short, Kathleen Turner, Mara Wilson, Robert Pastorelli, Deborah Odell, Francis Capra, Ruby Dee, Amanda Plummer', 'PG', 'Murray is a male fairy godmother, and he is trying to help 8-year-old Anabel to fulfil her "simple wish" - that her father Oliver, who is a cab driver, would win the leading role in a Broadway musical. Unfortunately, Murray''s magic wand is broken and the fairies convention is threatened by evil witches Claudia and Boots.', 'Murray is a male fairy godmother, and he is trying to help 8-year-old Anabel to fulfil her "simple wish" - that her father Oliver, who is a cab driver, would win the leading role in a Broadway musical. Unfortunately, Murray''s magic wand is broken and the fairies convention is threatened by evil witches Claudia and Boots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfyJ7yIvNTlz2ooH8iU6r0pxAMj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17834'),
  ('19831104450399670', 'A Single Girl', 1995, 'Drama', 'Benoît Jacquot, Antoine Santana, Audrey Robert', 'Jérôme Beaujour, Benoît Jacquot', 'Virginie Ledoyen, Benoît Magimel, Dominique Valadié, Michel Bompoil, Véra Briole, Toni Cecchinato, Virginie Emane, Jean-Claude Frissung', null, 'A young Parisian must make major decisions about pregnancy, a job and her boyfriend.', 'A young Parisian must make major decisions about pregnancy, a job and her boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dFs6OW8T8Y1R56U2YdlDDBkUPj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102461'),
  ('682434261433869955', 'A Single Life', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Marieke Blaauw, Joris Oprins, Job Roggeveen', 'Job Roggeveen, Joris Oprins, Marieke Blaauw', null, null, 'When Pia plays a mysterious vinyl record single, she suddenly knows how to travel through her own life.', 'When Pia plays a mysterious vinyl record single, she suddenly knows how to travel through her own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euY1pWQB5FE9QwgTj4mdo5lSk9w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289280'),
  ('423178823612637483', 'A Single Man', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tom Ford, Eduard Grau', 'Tom Ford, David Scearce', 'Colin Firth, Julianne Moore, Nicholas Hoult, Matthew Goode, Jon Kortajarena, Paulette Lamori, Ryan Simpkins, Ginnifer Goodwin', 'R', 'Set in Los Angeles in 1962, at the height of the Cuban missile crisis, is the story of a British college professor who dwells on the past and cannot see his future. We follow him through a single day, where a series of events and encounters ultimately lead him to decide if there is a meaning to life after the death of his long time partner, Jim.', 'Set in Los Angeles in 1962, at the height of the Cuban missile crisis, is the story of a British college professor who dwells on the past and cannot see his future. We follow him through a single day, where a series of events and encounters ultimately lead him to decide if there is a meaning to life after the death of his long time partner, Jim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvqTb66bS1i1NjlPC76zvxo0taT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34653'),
  ('422226079716003742', 'A Single Rider', 2017, 'Drama', 'Lee Zoo-young, Kim Il-yeon, Lee Sang-yong', 'Lee Zoo-young', 'Lee Byung-hun, Gong Hyo-jin, An So-hee, Jack Campbell, Annika Whitely, Kay Ekiund, Baek Soo-jang, Choi Jun-young', null, 'Promising fund manager Jae-hoon is at the brink of losing everything when his company goes bankrupt. Overwhelmed by despair, he takes an impulsive trip to Australia where his wife and son live. As his trip nears its unexpected end, Jae-hoon gets a chance to look back on his life.', 'Promising fund manager Jae-hoon is at the brink of losing everything when his company goes bankrupt. Overwhelmed by despair, he takes an impulsive trip to Australia where his wife and son live. As his trip nears its unexpected end, Jae-hoon gets a chance to look back on his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8IOObR7vo4K1moBRv8AOMsg5J6U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435603'),
  ('1066313907213438958', 'A Single Shot', 2013, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Matthias Mellinghaus, David Heimbecker, David M. Rosenthal', 'Matthew F. Jones', 'Sam Rockwell, William H. Macy, Jeffrey Wright, Kelly Reilly, Ted Levine, Jason Isaacs, Joe Anderson, Ophelia Lovibond', 'R', 'The tragic death of a beautiful young girl starts a tense and atmospheric game of cat and mouse between hunter John Moon and the hardened backwater criminals out for his blood.', 'The tragic death of a beautiful young girl starts a tense and atmospheric game of cat and mouse between hunter John Moon and the hardened backwater criminals out for his blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRGBGjdeGf12Pmalr1adT9IpoId.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159932'),
  ('205022187423063848', 'A Single Spark', 1995, 'Drama', 'Park Kwang-su, Lee Jong-hyeok, Hur Jin-ho', 'Kim Jung-hwan, Lee Chang-dong, Hur Jin-ho', 'Hong Kyung-in, Moon Sung-keun, Kim Sun-jae, Kim Bo-kyung, Dong Bang-woo, Jeong In-gi, Park Yong-su, Lee Yong-nyeo', null, 'Activist and law school graduate Kim is being persecuted by the mid-’70s Park regime for trying to write a book about Jeon Tae-il, a union activist who immolated himself at age 22 to protest government hypocrisy.', 'Activist and law school graduate Kim is being persecuted by the mid-’70s Park regime for trying to write a book about Jeon Tae-il, a union activist who immolated himself at age 22 to protest government hypocrisy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53iMgx4wbvSb5hfRD2kevq682zd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123997'),
  ('794838858662904119', 'A Sister', 2018, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Delphine Girard, Juliette Van Dormael', 'Delphine Girard', 'Veerle Baetens, Selma Alaoui, Guillaume Duhesme', null, 'A night. A car. Alie is in danger. To get by she must make the most important phone call of her life.', 'A night. A car. Alie is in danger. To get by she must make the most important phone call of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtrSb61G0x8wALUNlEFjGPsECgq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575107'),
  ('845481644199698910', 'A Sister''s Kiss', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'Dmitry Gribanoff', 'Dmitry Gribanoff', 'Nadya Emelina, Rina Grishina, Sergey Fedorov, Polina Stepanova', null, 'The story takes place in St. Petersburg, Russia. Two Russian schoolgirls suffer crash in natural love. Once they''ve met each other and fall in love. But once they''ve found that they are sisters...', 'The story takes place in St. Petersburg, Russia. Two Russian schoolgirls suffer crash in natural love. Once they''ve met each other and fall in love. But once they''ve found that they are sisters...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4eaEduWilAPfUO51JpO3TAhjcSo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83789'),
  ('239581986034803581', 'A Sixth Part of the World', 1926, 'Documentary', 'Dziga Vertov, Mikhail Kaufman, Elizaveta Svilova', 'Dziga Vertov', null, null, 'Through the travelogue format, it depicts the multitude of Soviet peoples in remote areas of USSR and details the entirety of the wealth of the Soviet land. Focusing on cultural and economic diversity, the film is in fact a call for unification in order to build a "complete socialist society".', 'Through the travelogue format, it depicts the multitude of Soviet peoples in remote areas of USSR and details the entirety of the wealth of the Soviet land. Focusing on cultural and economic diversity, the film is in fact a call for unification in order to build a "complete socialist society".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZbljS3ZuvkuJxZaRdezjrYQ9cb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185579'),
  ('848710276732142111', 'A Skeleton in the Closet', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Juan Andrés Galli, Nicolás Teté, Ignacio Aveille', 'Nicolás Teté', 'Facundo Gambandé, Maria Fernanda Callejón, Diego De Paula, Antonella Ferrari, Mateo Giuliani, Lucas Ferraro, Norma Argentina, Pablo Valdés', null, 'Manuel goes back to his hometown for his parents’ wedding anniversary, but he actually wants to ask money to move to Denmark with his boyfriend. Last time he saw his family, he came out of the closet. Since then, their relationship became tense. Manuel’s plans get ruined when his boyfriend dumps him.', 'Manuel goes back to his hometown for his parents’ wedding anniversary, but he actually wants to ask money to move to Denmark with his boyfriend. Last time he saw his family, he came out of the closet. Since then, their relationship became tense. Manuel’s plans get ruined when his boyfriend dumps him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4NNyjfUy5IldHpEWaapwOuRH3F1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680022'),
  ('985283057194481209', 'A Sky Full of Stars for a Roof', 1968, 'Western', 'Giulio Petroni, Carlo Carlini', 'Stefano Strucchi, Bernardino Zapponi', 'Giuliano Gemma, Mario Adorf, Magda Konopka, Federico Boido, Julie Menard, Anthony Dawson, Cris Huerta, Sandro Dori', null, 'The bandit Pratt, looking for Tim, who is responsible for the death of his two sons, attacks a caravan killing all the passengers. Harry, the vagabond, after having robbed the dead, casually meets Tim and they become friends. Running away together from Pratt, they reach Harry''s farm, but their hiding place is soon discovered.', 'The bandit Pratt, looking for Tim, who is responsible for the death of his two sons, attacks a caravan killing all the passengers. Harry, the vagabond, after having robbed the dead, casually meets Tim and they become friends. Running away together from Pratt, they reach Harry''s farm, but their hiding place is soon discovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27YqUONDLt8g0E3FI7ib7aOzKJJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131229'),
  ('341643808873754177', 'A Slave of Love', 1976, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Pavel Lebeshev, N. Kromas', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Fridrikh Gorenshteyn', 'Yelena Solovey, Rodion Nahapetov, Aleksandr Kalyagin, Oleg Basilashvili, Konstantin Grigorev, Nikolai Pastukhov, Vera Kuznetsova, Gotlib Roninson', null, 'During the Russian Civil War, the production of a silent melodrama runs into numerous complications.', 'During the Russian Civil War, the production of a silent melodrama runs into numerous complications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbKuy5RswhtJd82DFCv8FGm6BJM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73100'),
  ('872501860207215909', 'A Slight Case of Murder', 1938, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Lloyd Bacon, Leo F. Forbstein, Sidney Hickox', 'Joseph Schrank, Earl Baldwin', 'Edward G. Robinson, Jane Bryan, Allen Jenkins, Ruth Donnelly, Willard Parker, John Litel, Edward Brophy, Harold Huber', 'NR', 'Former bootlegger Remy Marco has a slight problem with foreclosing bankers, a prospective son-in-law, and four hard-to-explain corpses.', 'Former bootlegger Remy Marco has a slight problem with foreclosing bankers, a prospective son-in-law, and four hard-to-explain corpses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3fC4dLkZ8NXw51v84ASCG2OsFpC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34006'),
  ('775268471977854114', 'A Slight Case of Murder', 1999, 'Mystery, Comedy, Crime, TV Movie', 'Steven Schachter, André Pienaar', 'William H. Macy, Steven Schachter', 'William H. Macy, Adam Arkin, Felicity Huffman, James Cromwell, Julia Campbell, James Pickens Jr., Paul Mazursky, Vincent Pastore', null, 'In the midst of a spat, film critic Terry Thorpe accidentally kills his lover. Though Thorpe covers his tracks, he raises the suspicions of a private investigator, who then tries to blackmail him. Thorpe also falls under the watchful eye of Detective Fred Stapelli, a cop who is intent on becoming a screenwriter. Before long, Thorpe''s girlfriend, Kit, and Stapelli''s wife, Patricia, are roped into the case.', 'In the midst of a spat, film critic Terry Thorpe accidentally kills his lover. Though Thorpe covers his tracks, he raises the suspicions of a private investigator, who then tries to blackmail him. Thorpe also falls under the watchful eye of Detective Fred Stapelli, a cop who is intent on becoming a screenwriter. Before long, Thorpe''s girlfriend, Kit, and Stapelli''s wife, Patricia, are roped into the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lzixEbonNLJHhKSEWiMKJUVxMs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37444'),
  ('290851420912368191', 'A Slightly Pregnant Man', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Jacques Demy, Andréas Winding', 'Jacques Demy', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Catherine Deneuve, Micheline Presle, Claude Melki, Mireille Mathieu, Maurice Biraud, Alice Sapritch, Jacques Legras', null, 'Marco Mazzetti, a driving instructor, lives with his wife Irène and their young son. After a series of nauseous dizzy spells he goes to the doctor and discovers that he is four-months pregnant. Marco then becomes internationally famous.', 'Marco Mazzetti, a driving instructor, lives with his wife Irène and their young son. After a series of nauseous dizzy spells he goes to the doctor and discovers that he is four-months pregnant. Marco then becomes internationally famous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5uKLNbStFg0DEFi1r6VqUQkQ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121960'),
