  ('890411867373638532', 'A Small September Affair', 2014, 'Mystery, Romance', 'Özlem Yılmaz, Nihan Kahraman, Kerem Deren', 'Kerem Deren', 'Engin Akyürek, Farah Zeynep Abdullah, Ceren Moray, Onur Tuna, Serra Keskin, Ege Aydan, Ebru Aykaç, Merve Bulut', null, 'A beautiful girl who has everything. A sudden car crash, and her heart stops for a few minutes. When she wakes up, everyone assures that everything’s alright. But she knows it isn’t. Because she cant remember her final month; a September of her life is missing.', 'A beautiful girl who has everything. A sudden car crash, and her heart stops for a few minutes. When she wakes up, everyone assures that everything’s alright. But she knows it isn’t. Because she cant remember her final month; a September of her life is missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUDlxXGJjv8FoNJRusmacfUcwEZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256546'),
  ('568578677298649991', 'A Small Southern Enterprise', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Rocco Papaleo, Fabio Zamarion', 'Walter Lupo, Rocco Papaleo', 'Rocco Papaleo, Riccardo Scamarcio, Sarah Felberbaum, Barbora Bobuľová, Giuliana Lojodice, Giorgio Colangeli, Giovanni Esposito, Claudia Potenza', null, 'Mamma Stella is on edge. As if she hadn''t got enough trouble already with her daughter Rosa Maria, who has left her husband now Costantino, her son, has disrobed. Afraid to be the talk of the village, relegates him to a distant lighthouse belonging to the family. But Costantino does not remain far from the madding crowd for long. It does not take long indeed before all the local (or even distant) outcasts flock together there: Magnolia, a retired escort girl; Arturo, Rosa Maria''s estranged husband; Valbona, a lesbian; Rosa Maria herself; and, to crown it all, two eccentric workers accompanied by a little girl... After a period of chaos, this small world gradually discovers that unity makes strength.', 'Mamma Stella is on edge. As if she hadn''t got enough trouble already with her daughter Rosa Maria, who has left her husband now Costantino, her son, has disrobed. Afraid to be the talk of the village, relegates him to a distant lighthouse belonging to the family. But Costantino does not remain far from the madding crowd for long. It does not take long indeed before all the local (or even distant) outcasts flock together there: Magnolia, a retired escort girl; Arturo, Rosa Maria''s estranged husband; Valbona, a lesbian; Rosa Maria herself; and, to crown it all, two eccentric workers accompanied by a little girl... After a period of chaos, this small world gradually discovers that unity makes strength.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kMgLAQMpi3YRmP9KQ2JViV8yTk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228290'),
  ('66150413467818594', 'A Small Town in Texas', 1976, 'Action', 'Jack Starrett, Robert C. Jessup, Craig Huston', 'William W. Norton', 'Timothy Bottoms, Susan George, Bo Hopkins, Morgan Woodward, John Karlen, Art Hindle, Hank Rolike, George Buck Flower', 'R', 'A crooked sheriff in a small Southern town frames an ex-convict in a drug bust and takes his girlfriend.', 'A crooked sheriff in a small Southern town frames an ex-convict in a drug bust and takes his girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1Fzxzk5wDxA5GzU3lLJD9nvtdx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199715'),
  ('1004948501680775346', 'A Smell of Honey, a Swallow of Brine', 1966, 'Drama', 'László Kovács, Byron Mabe', 'David F. Friedman', 'Stacey Walker, Sam Melville, Bob Todd, Sharon Carr, Linda Gearhart, Tom Hughes, Larry Jones, Michael O''Kelly', null, 'Sharon is a young office worker who sexually teases, seduces and then cries ''rape'' on various men just to see them emotionally suffer for her own man-hating, twisted amusement leading to one lovestruck boyfriend being sent to prison, the financial ruin of another, and the meltdown and death of a third victim.', 'Sharon is a young office worker who sexually teases, seduces and then cries ''rape'' on various men just to see them emotionally suffer for her own man-hating, twisted amusement leading to one lovestruck boyfriend being sent to prison, the financial ruin of another, and the meltdown and death of a third victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HSFGFfXVyd3MA6vBEiy2T4uUHf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50945'),
  ('1124636151367186641', 'A Smile Doesn''t Lie', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Chad Chenouga, Christine Paillard, Jacques Girault', 'Chad Chenouga, Christine Paillard', 'Jean-Pascal Zadi, Judith Magre, Emmanuelle Devos, Raphaël Quenard, Camille Rutherford, Anne-Lise Heimburger, Vincent Deniard, Stéphane Pezerat', null, 'Wisi is in trouble. He arrives in Bordeaux in the hope of finding a job and crosses paths with Marina, a humanitarian with a big heart. To get accommodation with her, he pretends to be undocumented. One evening, he meets Jérôme, himself on the street after the death of his mother.', 'Wisi is in trouble. He arrives in Bordeaux in the hope of finding a job and crosses paths with Marina, a humanitarian with a big heart. To get accommodation with her, he pretends to be undocumented. One evening, he meets Jérôme, himself on the street after the death of his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmgcuru7xkR5ftvaosQLbHGXwbH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000079'),
  ('826607809149512453', 'A Smile Like Yours', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Keith Samples, Richard Bowen', 'Keith Samples, Kevin Meyer', 'Greg Kinnear, Lauren Holly, Joan Cusack, Jay Thomas, Jill Hennessy, Christopher McDonald, Donald Moffat, France Nuyen', 'R', 'Danny and Jennifer are happily married, except for one major issue – he''s doubtful about having children, and she desperately wants to have a baby. Soon both Danny and Jennifer are tempted to stray from their marriage as their baby conception woes mount.', 'Danny and Jennifer are happily married, except for one major issue – he''s doubtful about having children, and she desperately wants to have a baby. Soon both Danny and Jennifer are tempted to stray from their marriage as their baby conception woes mount.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x18HBMhlxCbaWv95VktUavib0Rv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33657'),
  ('1107310130877800117', 'A Smoky Mountain Christmas', 1986, 'Music, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Henry Winkler, Reynaldo Villalobos', null, 'Dolly Parton, Lee Majors, Bo Hopkins, Dan Hedaya, Anita Morris, Danny Cooksey, Gennie James, Chad Sheets', null, 'A country-western singer on a trip through the Tennessee mountains runs into a reclusive backwoodsman — and a witch.', 'A country-western singer on a trip through the Tennessee mountains runs into a reclusive backwoodsman — and a witch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSId7LLral6TWDuLTCryAigbXbS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60629'),
  ('59238357132488410', 'A Snake of June', 2003, 'Romance, Drama, Thriller', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Shinya Tsukamoto', 'Shinya Tsukamoto', 'Asuka Kurosawa, Shinya Tsukamoto, Susumu Terajima, Takuji Suzuki, Mansaku Fuwa, Masato Tsujioka, Tomorowo Taguchi, Yûji Kôtari', null, 'Rinko, a woman in a sexless marriage, is blackmailed by a stalker with intimate photos, forcing her into a series of erotic acts that disrupt her mundane life.', 'Rinko, a woman in a sexless marriage, is blackmailed by a stalker with intimate photos, forcing her into a series of erotic acts that disrupt her mundane life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8HRcVaZS5IV3InYxnAWIzzVqwc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33431'),
  ('836405544307576978', 'A Snow Capped Christmas', 2016, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Christie Will Wolf, Anthony C. Metchie', 'Barbara Kymlicka', 'Leah Renee, Niall Matter, Gracyn Shinyei, Michael Teigen, Lisa Whelchel, Lochlyn Munro, Jocelyne Loewen, Kathryn Kirkpatrick', null, 'An injured figure skater is sent to the mountains to recover from an injury. Once there, she meets an ex-hockey player and his young daughter and begins to realise that something is missing from her life.', 'An injured figure skater is sent to the mountains to recover from an injury. Once there, she meets an ex-hockey player and his young daughter and begins to realise that something is missing from her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1v5zDTiYK5Kbnm760Tu0efQzNe2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426473'),
  ('136615934505483298', 'A Soap', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Erik Molberg Hansen, Pernille Fischer Christensen', 'Kim Fupz Aakeson', 'Trine Dyrholm, David Dencik, Frank Thiel, Elsebeth Steentoft, Christian Tafdrup, Pauli Ryberg, Jacob Lohmann, Claes Bang', null, '32-year-old Charlotte could have it all, but she doesn''t want any of it. When she moves away from her boyfriend, she happens to become the upstairs neighbour of a trans woman Veronica. Veronica prefers to keep to herself with her little dog and a romantic soap show on TV, while Charlotte gets through the nights with one-night stands. An assault, a new bed and some white curtains bring the two of them together.', '32-year-old Charlotte could have it all, but she doesn''t want any of it. When she moves away from her boyfriend, she happens to become the upstairs neighbour of a trans woman Veronica. Veronica prefers to keep to herself with her little dog and a romantic soap show on TV, while Charlotte gets through the nights with one-night stands. An assault, a new bed and some white curtains bring the two of them together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/voJjFkkn240R0ppNljTqxeuxRgO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15845'),
  ('1125432649651062652', 'A Sogra Perfeita', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Raissa Drumond, Alexandre Ramos, Rodrigo Olliveira', 'Flávia Guimarães, Bia Crespo', 'Cacau Protásio, André Mattos, Luis Navarro, Evelyn Castro, Polliana Aleixo, Rodrigo Sant''anna, Marcelo Laham, Fábio Júnior', null, 'Neide recently separated from her husband and wants to make the most of her single life. Hindered by her youngest son, she decides to set him up with one of her employees by hook or by crook', 'Neide recently separated from her husband and wants to make the most of her single life. Hindered by her youngest son, she decides to set him up with one of her employees by hook or by crook', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31Mad8qY3gsWYd7OeOgDXqqsUlt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:769223'),
  ('93733149204032160', 'A Soldier''s Daughter Never Cries', 1998, 'Drama', 'James Ivory, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'James Ivory, Ruth Prawer Jhabvala', 'Kris Kristofferson, Leelee Sobieski, Jane Birkin, Barbara Hershey, Dominique Blanc, Virginie Ledoyen, Jesse Bradford, Isaach de Bankolé', 'R', 'This fictionalized story, based on the family life of writer James Jones, is an emotional slice-of-life story. Jones is portrayed here as Bill Willis, a former war hero turned author who combats alcoholism and is starting to experience health problems. Living in France with his wife, daughter, and an adopted son, the family travels an unconventional road which casts them as outsiders to others. Preaching a sexual freedom, his daughter''s sexual discovery begins at an early age and betrays her when the family moves to Hanover in America. Her overt sexuality clashes with the values of her teenage American peers and gives her a problematic reputation. Meanwhile, her brooding brother copes with his own interior pain regarding his past, only comfortable communicating within the domestic space.', 'This fictionalized story, based on the family life of writer James Jones, is an emotional slice-of-life story. Jones is portrayed here as Bill Willis, a former war hero turned author who combats alcoholism and is starting to experience health problems. Living in France with his wife, daughter, and an adopted son, the family travels an unconventional road which casts them as outsiders to others. Preaching a sexual freedom, his daughter''s sexual discovery begins at an early age and betrays her when the family moves to Hanover in America. Her overt sexuality clashes with the values of her teenage American peers and gives her a problematic reputation. Meanwhile, her brooding brother copes with his own interior pain regarding his past, only comfortable communicating within the domestic space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3DmaY20ynkRTE17Oe1dR8pZWaR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72987'),
  ('729227557710607953', 'A Soldier''s Dream', 1995, 'Documentary', 'Aleksandr Sokurov, Aleksandr Burov', 'Aleksandr Sokurov', 'Aleksandr Sokurov', null, 'This small film came out of the material edited for Sokurov''s five-hour documentary Spiritual Voices.', 'This small film came out of the material edited for Sokurov''s five-hour documentary Spiritual Voices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqh6I84cIjP9zbDzeD8HFWkYbI5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206978'),
  ('719548999750675166', 'A Soldier''s Story', 1984, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Norman Jewison, Russell Boyd, Reuben Cannon', 'Charles Fuller', 'Howard Rollins, Adolph Caesar, Art Evans, Robert Townsend, Denzel Washington, David Alan Grier, David Harris, Dennis Lipscomb', 'PG', 'In a rural town in Louisiana, a black Master Sergeant is found shot to death just outside the local Army Base. Military lawyer, Captain Davenport—also a black man—is sent from Washington to conduct an investigation. Facing an uncooperative chain of command and fearful black troops, Davenport must battle with deceit and prejudice in order to find out exactly who really did kill the Master Sergeant.', 'In a rural town in Louisiana, a black Master Sergeant is found shot to death just outside the local Army Base. Military lawyer, Captain Davenport—also a black man—is sent from Washington to conduct an investigation. Facing an uncooperative chain of command and fearful black troops, Davenport must battle with deceit and prejudice in order to find out exactly who really did kill the Master Sergeant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSLrddsvH8bJzryOS5BD9qtTtFa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26522'),
  ('1008129511791744190', 'A Somewhat Gentle Man', 2010, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Hans Petter Moland, Philip Øgaard', 'Kim Fupz Aakeson', 'Stellan Skarsgård, Jorunn Kjellsby, Bjørn Floberg, Gard B. Eidsvold, Jannike Kruse, Bjørn Sundquist, Kjersti Holmen, Jon Øigarden', 'NR', 'After serving a 12-year sentence for killing the man that slept with his wife, a man ponders whether he should try and reconcile with his family, or take revenge on those who turned him in.', 'After serving a 12-year sentence for killing the man that slept with his wife, a man ponders whether he should try and reconcile with his family, or take revenge on those who turned him in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3I58PdeJHTPTzLa1QWtKS97hyW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31035'),
  ('900447002016454756', 'A Son', 2020, 'Drama', 'Mehdi M. Barsaoui, Antoine Héberlé', 'Mehdi M. Barsaoui', 'Sami Bouajila, Najla Ben Abdallah, Youssef Khemiri, Noomene Hamda, Slah Msadak, Med Ali Ben Jemaa, Qassine Rawane, Jihed Cherni', null, 'Tunisia, summer 2011. The holiday to the South of the country ends in disaster for Fares, Meriem and their 10-year-old son Aziz, when he is accidentally shot in an ambush. His injury will change their lives: Aziz needs a liver transplant, which leads to discovery of a long-buried secret. Will Aziz and the relationship survive?', 'Tunisia, summer 2011. The holiday to the South of the country ends in disaster for Fares, Meriem and their 10-year-old son Aziz, when he is accidentally shot in an ambush. His injury will change their lives: Aziz needs a liver transplant, which leads to discovery of a long-buried secret. Will Aziz and the relationship survive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZStVC3LeOy4g5jI4a7xFBtFRU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618224'),
  ('667177629902585805', 'A Son Named Erasmus', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Saverio Guarna, Alberto Ferrari', 'Gianluca Ansanelli, Debora Alessi, Alberto Ferrari', 'Luca Bizzarri, Paolo Kessisoglu, Daniele Liotti, Ricky Memphis, Carol Alt, Filipa Pinto, Giorgio Gobbi, Fernando Rodrigues', null, 'Four friends in their 40s find out a deceased old flame of theirs had a child, conceived with one of them during an Erasmus (EU student exchange program) in Portugal 20 years earlier. They embark on a journey in search of the offspring, while waiting for the DNA results to find out which one is the father.', 'Four friends in their 40s find out a deceased old flame of theirs had a child, conceived with one of them during an Erasmus (EU student exchange program) in Portugal 20 years earlier. They embark on a journey in search of the offspring, while waiting for the DNA results to find out which one is the father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbYyqqpXt5EBWL07BTwHso9CN7m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:608755'),
  ('1143964720027308359', 'A Son of Man', 2018, 'Drama, Adventure, Family', 'Pablo Agüero, Jamaicanoproblem, Benjamín Echazarreta', null, 'Luis Felipe Fernández-Salvador y Bolona, Luis Felipe Fernandez-Salvador y Campodonico, Andrés Fernández-Salvador y Zaldumbide, Eugene Park, Juliana Andreina Carbo Lozano, Manri Ovidio Rodriguez, Fernando Cunuhay, Martha Patricia', null, 'Pipe is invited to join his mysterious father on a quest for the lost Inca gold. But as they journey deeper into the jungle, he understands that they cannot escape the family demons that are traveling with them.', 'Pipe is invited to join his mysterious father on a quest for the lost Inca gold. But as they journey deeper into the jungle, he understands that they cannot escape the family demons that are traveling with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tw88pKpJ1CaFTbtPMzXh1OriTwh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:546069'),
  ('242686380652806407', 'A Son of the Sun', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Aras Demiray, Onur Ünlü', 'Onur Ünlü', 'Haluk Bilginer, Özgü Namal, Bülent Emin Yarar, Köksal Engür, Hümeyra, Levent Öktem, Ahmet Kural, Tansu Biçer', null, 'Although it sounds good in theory, the miracle of becoming the Son of the Sun doesn''t in practice turn out the way Fikri Şemsigil expects. His whole life depends on this one "big" day, but the consequences of this miracle disappoint Fikri as his life is turned upside down. To rid himself of this so-called miracle, Fikri decides to explore its source but there''s still the big problem with the woman in the building across the street!', 'Although it sounds good in theory, the miracle of becoming the Son of the Sun doesn''t in practice turn out the way Fikri Şemsigil expects. His whole life depends on this one "big" day, but the consequences of this miracle disappoint Fikri as his life is turned upside down. To rid himself of this so-called miracle, Fikri decides to explore its source but there''s still the big problem with the woman in the building across the street!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHWHiVaLanWpLdWFAi6qxWNaEFC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37417'),
  ('981204704556266734', 'A Son''s Promise', 1990, 'TV Movie, Drama, Family', 'John Korty, Kees Van Oostrum', null, 'Andrew Lowery, Stephen Dorff, Rick Schroder, David Andrews, Veronica Cartwright, Boyd Gaines, Donald Moffat, Ryan Marshall', 'NR', 'An iron-willed Georgia boy accepts the burden of a man on his young shoulders. Fifteen-year-old Terry O''Kelly is fatherless and his remaining parent, his mother, is dying. Anguished, the soon-to-be orphan makes a surprising grown-up decision: Terry promises to care for his six brothers and vows to keep the family together. Steadfast to his word, Terry takes on the struggles of parenthood, which yields some difficult and unpleasant surprises.', 'An iron-willed Georgia boy accepts the burden of a man on his young shoulders. Fifteen-year-old Terry O''Kelly is fatherless and his remaining parent, his mother, is dying. Anguished, the soon-to-be orphan makes a surprising grown-up decision: Terry promises to care for his six brothers and vows to keep the family together. Steadfast to his word, Terry takes on the struggles of parenthood, which yields some difficult and unpleasant surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ypO8WAhCeTBn32LR0FDqPg7A7Uf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64401'),
  ('28728558567950617', 'A Song For Mama', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Joël Franka', 'Joël Franka', 'Patrick Timsit, Sylvie Testud, Dave, Fabrizio Rongione, Guy Lecluyse, Sam Louwyck, Michèle Moretti, Mathilde Goffart', null, 'With their beloved mother only a few days to live, her children decide to give her a surprising parting gift: bring Dave, a lifelong fan, to her bedside in the Ardennes. But even though everyone adores her, brothers, sister and brother-in-law are not on the best of terms and cooperation is not their strong point. For her sake, however, they will overcome their resentments, drawing from their love the energy and the madness necessary to carry out their project. Finding Dave and luring him to the Ardennes will be no easy task.', 'With their beloved mother only a few days to live, her children decide to give her a surprising parting gift: bring Dave, a lifelong fan, to her bedside in the Ardennes. But even though everyone adores her, brothers, sister and brother-in-law are not on the best of terms and cooperation is not their strong point. For her sake, however, they will overcome their resentments, drawing from their love the energy and the madness necessary to carry out their project. Finding Dave and luring him to the Ardennes will be no easy task.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHBCqWhx2alyyVAzk9DacsckSJ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180433'),
  ('44173679051769453', 'A Song for Mia', 2019, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Mira Thiel', 'Peer Klehmet, Friederich Oetker, Alexander Dydyna', 'Tim Oliver Schultz, Paula Kalenberg, Angela Roy, Daniel Friedrich, Jonathan Beck, Rony Herman, Max von Thun, Sophie von Kessel', null, 'For the handsome Sebastian life goes by easily. During the day he works in a fashion shop, in the evening he flirts through the clubs of the city. Blessed with an extraordinary voice, all signs of a career for the young singer. Ironically, an accident rips him out of his carefree life: Suddenly Sebastian can not see anymore. Instead of the party girls, a young woman enters his life, for whom he had never had eyes: the inconspicuous nurse Mia (Paula Kalenberg). Through her, Sebastian begins to re-experience the world - and for the first time gets to know real feelings. Thanks to Mia he writes a song that really comes from the heart. Overnight, it makes him, the blind romantic, known on the Internet. When he regains his sight, he has to decide: Will he also return to his old life?', 'For the handsome Sebastian life goes by easily. During the day he works in a fashion shop, in the evening he flirts through the clubs of the city. Blessed with an extraordinary voice, all signs of a career for the young singer. Ironically, an accident rips him out of his carefree life: Suddenly Sebastian can not see anymore. Instead of the party girls, a young woman enters his life, for whom he had never had eyes: the inconspicuous nurse Mia (Paula Kalenberg). Through her, Sebastian begins to re-experience the world - and for the first time gets to know real feelings. Thanks to Mia he writes a song that really comes from the heart. Overnight, it makes him, the blind romantic, known on the Internet. When he regains his sight, he has to decide: Will he also return to his old life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sShUt8BMSZ5QNkzSw97hENgWRVd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575442'),
  ('751528320931040060', 'A Song Is Born', 1948, 'Comedy, Music', 'Howard Hawks, Gregg Toland, Emil Newman', 'Charles Brackett, Billy Wilder', 'Danny Kaye, Virginia Mayo, Benny Goodman, Tommy Dorsey, Louis Armstrong, Lionel Hampton, Charlie Barnet, Mel Powell', 'NR', 'The story of seven scholars in search of an expert to teach them about swing music. They seem to have found the perfect candidate in winsome nightclub singer Honey Swanson. But Honey''s gangster boyfriend doesn''t want to give her up.', 'The story of seven scholars in search of an expert to teach them about swing music. They seem to have found the perfect candidate in winsome nightclub singer Honey Swanson. But Honey''s gangster boyfriend doesn''t want to give her up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSAR6nbRbAWOdcXz51LQsrMsTjS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17829'),
  ('778094019486645859', 'A Song of Lisbon', 1933, 'Music, Comedy', 'Enrique Barreyre, César de Sá, José Cottinelli Telmo', 'José Cottinelli Telmo', 'Vasco Santana, Beatriz Costa, António Silva, Teresa Gomes, Sofia Santos, Alfredo Silva, Ana María, Manoel de Oliveira', null, 'Vasco is a medical student in Lisbon, supported by his rich aunts, whom he had falsely told he had already graduated. In fact, he devotes himself to a bohemian life, preferring the popular fairs and pretty women, especially Alice, a seamstress from the Castelinhos quarter, which rather upsets her ambitious father, tailor Caetano, who is familiar with Vasco''s debts. After failing yet another final exam, he is surprised by his aunts'' announcement that they will visit him in Lisbon to see his practice.', 'Vasco is a medical student in Lisbon, supported by his rich aunts, whom he had falsely told he had already graduated. In fact, he devotes himself to a bohemian life, preferring the popular fairs and pretty women, especially Alice, a seamstress from the Castelinhos quarter, which rather upsets her ambitious father, tailor Caetano, who is familiar with Vasco''s debts. After failing yet another final exam, he is surprised by his aunts'' announcement that they will visit him in Lisbon to see his practice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZvvfGRy3nNoqncdDodtL6Y5AQK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49961'),
  ('644229869474063281', 'A Song of Lisbon', 2016, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Pedro Varela, José António Loureiro', 'José Cottinelli Telmo', 'César Mourão, Luana Martau, Miguel Guilherme, Marcus Majella, São José Lapa, Maria Vieira, Carla Vasconcelos, Nuria Mencía', null, 'How happy and proud they are those two ladies back in Oporto! Thanks to them, their bright nephew can study medicine in Lisbon and may already have become a doctor. Little do they know, not only Vasco wastes all his time drinking, dancing and picking up girls but he has just failed his final exam! And in that same day, he receives an email from the two aunts announcing their visit to Lisbon! Will he be able to make them believe he is such a good student as they think?', 'How happy and proud they are those two ladies back in Oporto! Thanks to them, their bright nephew can study medicine in Lisbon and may already have become a doctor. Little do they know, not only Vasco wastes all his time drinking, dancing and picking up girls but he has just failed his final exam! And in that same day, he receives an email from the two aunts announcing their visit to Lisbon! Will he be able to make them believe he is such a good student as they think?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnn6zWX44pUUgMd9HZCA3Wk0nzu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373399'),
  ('464523654471373419', 'A Song to Remember', 1945, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Charles Vidor, Allen M. Davey, Tony Gaudio', 'Sidney Buchman', 'Paul Muni, Merle Oberon, Cornel Wilde, Nina Foch, George Coulouris, Howard Freeman, Stephen Bekassy, Sig Arno', 'NR', 'Prof. Joseph Elsner guides his protégé Frydryk Chopin through his formative years to early adulthood in Poland. The professor takes him to Paris, where he eventually comes under the wing and influence of novelist George Sand and rises to prominence in the music world, to the exclusion of his old friends and patriotic feelings towards Poland.', 'Prof. Joseph Elsner guides his protégé Frydryk Chopin through his formative years to early adulthood in Poland. The professor takes him to Paris, where he eventually comes under the wing and influence of novelist George Sand and rises to prominence in the music world, to the exclusion of his old friends and patriotic feelings towards Poland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyERBKfUZAE1RyXQn6jvE2wQ0s3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119764'),
  ('997390719849995614', 'A Sort of Family', 2017, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Bruno Roberti, Julio Noguera, Renata Biagiola', 'Diego Lerman, María Meira', 'Bárbara Lennie, Daniel Aráoz, Claudio Tolcachir, Paula Cohen, Yanina Ávila', null, 'What limits does Malena cross to get what she wants most? Malena is a 38 year old middle class doctor from Buenos Aires. One afternoon she receives the call from Doctor Costas, who informs her that she must travel immediately to the north of the country: the baby she was waiting for is about to be born. Unexpectedly Malena decides to embark on an uncertain journey, full of crossroads, facing all kinds of legal and moral obstacles that will make her constantly wondering how far she is ready to go.', 'What limits does Malena cross to get what she wants most? Malena is a 38 year old middle class doctor from Buenos Aires. One afternoon she receives the call from Doctor Costas, who informs her that she must travel immediately to the north of the country: the baby she was waiting for is about to be born. Unexpectedly Malena decides to embark on an uncertain journey, full of crossroads, facing all kinds of legal and moral obstacles that will make her constantly wondering how far she is ready to go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4e3W1dT2n3h7JGEfxSoH5YZWn7T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444404'),
  ('843620385192570411', 'A Soul Haunted by Painting', 1994, 'Drama, Romance', 'Huang Shuqin, Lü Yue', 'Min Anqi, Li Zhiyu, Huang Shuqin', 'Gong Li, Derek Yee, Da Shichang, Shen Hai-Rong, Chang Chiung-tzu, Gao Junxia, Sherman Chou Shao-Tung, Fang Chen', null, 'A Chinese prostitute weds, studies painting, and becomes a renowned artist and professor in Paris.', 'A Chinese prostitute weds, studies painting, and becomes a renowned artist and professor in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbTDhJr2Cb9wL1CsPM6hO9rtgYb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44558'),
  ('122095984771983764', 'A Sound of Thunder', 2005, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Peter Hyams, Peter Hyams, Charlie Watson', 'Joshua Oppenheimer, Thomas Dean Donnelly, Gregory Poirier', 'Edward Burns, Catherine McCormack, Ben Kingsley, William Armstrong, Jemima Rooper, David Oyelowo, Corey Johnson, August Zirner', 'PG-13', 'When a hunter sent back to the prehistoric era runs off the path he must not leave, he causes a chain reaction that alters history in disastrous ways.', 'When a hunter sent back to the prehistoric era runs off the path he must not leave, he causes a chain reaction that alters history in disastrous ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdO0UpJEmSZJqauMbNrfzwKlxoR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10077'),
  ('214014287285853666', 'A Soweto Love Story', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Rolie Nikiwe', 'Zelipa Zulu, Darrel Bristow-Bovey', 'Lunga Shabalala, Duduzile Ngcobo, Sparky Xulu, Ray Neo Buso, Motsoaledi Setumo, Mamodibe Ramodibe, Didintle Khunou, Monnye Kunupi', null, 'Desperate for her three single sons to get married, a mother promises her house to the first one to tie the knot, setting off a race to the altar.', 'Desperate for her three single sons to get married, a mother promises her house to the first one to tie the knot, setting off a race to the altar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNxLPPXAR13sjNIBGIncnR13v6E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1237835'),
  ('400665703840165313', 'A Special Cop in Action', 1976, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Marino Girolami, Romano Scandariato, Fausto Zuccoli', 'Leila Buongiorno, Gianfranco Clerici, Vincenzo Mannino', 'Maurizio Merli, John Saxon, Mirella D''Angelo, Raymond Pellegrin, Toni Ucci, Daniele Dublino, Sergio Fiorentini, Franco Borelli', null, 'A school bus with young children being kidnapped. Commissario Betti will solve the case. High action is promised, including hostage, bank robberies, car chases, prison scenes and mafia bosses!', 'A school bus with young children being kidnapped. Commissario Betti will solve the case. High action is promised, including hostage, bank robberies, car chases, prison scenes and mafia bosses!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giUayHCbRFewdjR6NfOAt9n7NcC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106155'),
  ('35930399520233800', 'A Special Day', 2012, 'Romance, Drama', 'Francesca Comencini', 'Giulia Calenda, Francesca Comencini', 'Filippo Scicchitano, Giulia Valentini, Roberto Infascelli, Antonio Zavatteri', null, 'Gina and Marco are living in the suburbs of Rome. The two meet on a very special day: their first day at work. They have a future that awaits them and really seems at hand. Gina is about to realize her dream of becoming an actress, while Marco for the first time has found an opportunity that allows him to start dreaming: a job in a car rental company as a driver. They are enabled to know each other since his first duty is to drive Gina to an appointment, and given a delay, they have to share the whole day. This journey will take them from the periphery to the center of the city, will serve both to compare their experiences and think about a future that has already begun...', 'Gina and Marco are living in the suburbs of Rome. The two meet on a very special day: their first day at work. They have a future that awaits them and really seems at hand. Gina is about to realize her dream of becoming an actress, while Marco for the first time has found an opportunity that allows him to start dreaming: a job in a car rental company as a driver. They are enabled to know each other since his first duty is to drive Gina to an appointment, and given a delay, they have to share the whole day. This journey will take them from the periphery to the center of the city, will serve both to compare their experiences and think about a future that has already begun...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7mJXUXJpjnbwqSFWHnYpfEDXRC4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123375'),
  ('1008836571885499951', 'A Special Lady', 2017, 'Action, Crime', 'Hong Seung-chul, Lee An-kyu, Kim Tae-kyeong', 'Lee An-kyu', 'Kim Hye-soo, Lee Sun-kyun, Lee Hee-jun, Choi Moo-seong, Kim Min-seok, Oh Ha-ni, Geum Gwang-san, Lee Hyun-gul', null, 'A corrupt prosecutor plans for revenge against Hyun-jung''s crime organization by using her loyal partner, Sang-hoon.', 'A corrupt prosecutor plans for revenge against Hyun-jung''s crime organization by using her loyal partner, Sang-hoon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsmv8sDlVJsrSOHtdrimWxIjDCD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437116'),
  ('869922328366704015', 'A Species Odyssey', 2003, 'Documentary, History', 'Jacques Malaterre', 'Yves Coppens, Frédéric Fougea, Jacques Dubuisson', 'Charles Berling, Pere Arquillué, Johanne Léveillé', null, '"A Species Odyssey" portrays the origins of Mankind from the moment the first primate stood up on their hind legs and set off to conquer the African Savanna, to modern Man, setting off to conquer space. 7 million years of triumph fraught with difficulties and extraordinary events that make Man what he is today.', '"A Species Odyssey" portrays the origins of Mankind from the moment the first primate stood up on their hind legs and set off to conquer the African Savanna, to modern Man, setting off to conquer space. 7 million years of triumph fraught with difficulties and extraordinary events that make Man what he is today.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcbDq8AIZx3gKeZSoTMCEocb21U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52062'),
  ('462394655577089399', 'A Spicy Kraut', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Buket Alakuş', 'Hatice Akyün', 'İdil Üner, Adnan Maral, Şiir Eloğlu, Sesede Terziyan, Demet Gül, Hüseyin Ekici, Max von Thun, Julia Dietze', null, 'Hatice has a problem: she desperately needs a man. Because her younger sister Fatma is pregnant and must marry immediately. However, that is only allowed when Hatice is under the hood, as the old Anatolian tradition, to which the father Ismail firmly clings. But where should Hatice find a groom so fast? Because a Turk may not be under any circumstances, which may blaze in the German man already a bit Turkish fire. And so Hatice goes in search of her "Hans with hot sauce".', 'Hatice has a problem: she desperately needs a man. Because her younger sister Fatma is pregnant and must marry immediately. However, that is only allowed when Hatice is under the hood, as the old Anatolian tradition, to which the father Ismail firmly clings. But where should Hatice find a groom so fast? Because a Turk may not be under any circumstances, which may blaze in the German man already a bit Turkish fire. And so Hatice goes in search of her "Hans with hot sauce".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rte3udWi47fKxDXKyJfRf7Voda3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261364'),
  ('78844288457417863', 'A Spinal Tap Reunion: The 25th Anniversary London Sell-Out', 1992, 'Music, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Jim DiBergi, Lauren Eton-Hogg', 'Michael McKean, Christopher Guest, Harry Shearer', 'Christopher Guest, Michael McKean, Harry Shearer, Jeff Beck, June Chadwick, Jamie Lee Curtis, Graham Nash, Kenny Rogers', null, 'Spinal Tap is back in a whole new feature-length rockumentary. Go behind the scenes and find out where the somewhat-less-than-fab three are now -- and where it all began in Squatney, England. Also, catch up with director Marty DiBergi, ex-Polymer marketing whiz Artie Fufkin, and Jeanine, who now owns a shop specializing in itchy Irish clothing.', 'Spinal Tap is back in a whole new feature-length rockumentary. Go behind the scenes and find out where the somewhat-less-than-fab three are now -- and where it all began in Squatney, England. Also, catch up with director Marty DiBergi, ex-Polymer marketing whiz Artie Fufkin, and Jeanine, who now owns a shop specializing in itchy Irish clothing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/btDOwB73yQaktnPNFtgJwJdhm5V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67872'),
  ('1059332623339022736', 'A Spiritual Matter', 2015, 'Drama', 'Bénédicte Acolas, Gilles Porte', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Sophie Marceau', null, '"A Spiritual Matter" is the first-ever adaptation of an Ingmar Bergman script since his passing. In this movie, Viktoria is a 40-year-old woman who seems to have gone mad and develops a compelling and moving monologue of moments that marked her existence. Viktoria (Sophie Marceau), a bishop''s daughter and pastor''s wife, talks to herself and reveals her intimate world: her joys and woes, her childhood and her relationship with her cheating and aloof husband. She voyages from life to life, seemingly playing several roles. She remembers, dreams, fantasizes and hallucinates, bringing back to life her late husband, mother, father and friends.', '"A Spiritual Matter" is the first-ever adaptation of an Ingmar Bergman script since his passing. In this movie, Viktoria is a 40-year-old woman who seems to have gone mad and develops a compelling and moving monologue of moments that marked her existence. Viktoria (Sophie Marceau), a bishop''s daughter and pastor''s wife, talks to herself and reveals her intimate world: her joys and woes, her childhood and her relationship with her cheating and aloof husband. She voyages from life to life, seemingly playing several roles. She remembers, dreams, fantasizes and hallucinates, bringing back to life her late husband, mother, father and friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csVe0WaPDIO6DgBN0s32veDn4WA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372390'),
  ('33280544704915388', 'A Spiritualist Photographer', 1903, 'Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'A magician transforms a woman into a portrait of herself, then restores her to life.', 'A magician transforms a woman into a portrait of herself, then restores her to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVACUYam7u0YbmnrCRCTqKp8h7h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195960'),
  ('312490279880379579', 'A Spot of Bother', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Alfred Lot', 'Michel Blanc, Alfred Lot, Mark Haddon', 'Michel Blanc, Miou-Miou, Mélanie Doutey, Gilles Lellouche, Cyril Descours, Yannick Renier, Jolhan Martin, Wladimir Yordanoff', null, 'Retired Englishman George Hall''s hypochondria worsens and takes its toll on his family.', 'Retired Englishman George Hall''s hypochondria worsens and takes its toll on his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/blJfnl0RiIzd98jVO7GSZVKKgbJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40188'),
  ('186254870603943429', 'A Spring for the Thirsty', 1965, 'Drama', 'Yurii Illienko, Volodymyr Davydov, Yurii Illienko', 'Ivan Drach', 'Dmytro Milyutenko, Larysa Kadochnykova, Feodosiya Lytvynenko, Gemma Firsova, Nina Alisova, Yevhen Baliyev, Yurii Mazhuha, Olena Kovalenko', null, 'A parable centering on an old man who lives a secluded life in the desert, alone with only his memories and photographs. His wellspring, once a source of joy and hope for thirsty passersby, is now rarely used. No longer able to find comfort in his memories, he turns all his photographs to face the walls.', 'A parable centering on an old man who lives a secluded life in the desert, alone with only his memories and photographs. His wellspring, once a source of joy and hope for thirsty passersby, is now rarely used. No longer able to find comfort in his memories, he turns all his photographs to face the walls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8c5FZAoHvEbgUTq46BbVPT8qQc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149455'),
  ('994326652413257111', 'A Stand Worthy of Men', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Ahmed Abd El Aziz, Ahmed El Gendy', 'Haitham Dabbour', 'Sayed Ragab, Maged El Kedwany, Bayoumi Fouad, Sherif Desouqy, Mohamed Sallam, Amina Khalil, Sawsan Badr, Safaa Al Toukhy', null, 'A comedy about a group of friends as they get reunited to help one of their own find his way out of major trouble. As the situation gets more complicated, they are forced to take a trip to a coastal town.', 'A comedy about a group of friends as they get reunited to help one of their own find his way out of major trouble. As the situation gets more complicated, they are forced to take a trip to a coastal town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gpAHWaPR6soH7Y3YtSNaKjEIAm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785861'),
  ('246341259929373357', 'A Star Is Bored', 1956, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Arthur Q. Bryan, June Foray', null, 'Daffy Duck must double for Bugs in any slapstick which Warners considers too dangerous for its star Bug Bunny.', 'Daffy Duck must double for Bugs in any slapstick which Warners considers too dangerous for its star Bug Bunny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pxBoj799L6RCTSFd7esdw54tW4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235149'),
  ('107205164499490442', 'A Star Is Born', 1937, 'Drama, Romance', 'William A. Wellman, W. Howard Greene, Eric Stacey', 'Ben Hecht, David O. Selznick', 'Janet Gaynor, Fredric March, Adolphe Menjou, May Robson, Andy Devine, Lionel Stander, Owen Moore, Peggy Wood', 'NR', 'Esther Blodgett is just another starry-eyed farm kid trying to break into the movies. Waitressing at a Hollywood party, she catches the eye of her idol Norman Maine, is sent for a screen test, and before long attains stardom as newly minted Vicki Lester. She and Norman marry, though his career soon dwindles to nothing due to his chronic alcoholism.', 'Esther Blodgett is just another starry-eyed farm kid trying to break into the movies. Waitressing at a Hollywood party, she catches the eye of her idol Norman Maine, is sent for a screen test, and before long attains stardom as newly minted Vicki Lester. She and Norman marry, though his career soon dwindles to nothing due to his chronic alcoholism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90EfCmXXWOs5dy7rHTNvGT9T8Kz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22692'),
  ('1077224859744973875', 'A Star Is Born', 1954, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'George Cukor, Sam Leavitt, Earl Bellamy', 'Dorothy Parker, Alan Campbell, Robert Carson', 'Judy Garland, James Mason, Jack Carson, Charles Bickford, Tommy Noonan, Lucy Marlow, Amanda Blake, Irving Bacon', 'PG', 'A movie star helps a young singer-actress find fame, even as age and alcoholism send his own career into a downward spiral.', 'A movie star helps a young singer-actress find fame, even as age and alcoholism send his own career into a downward spiral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpg2SzpYhZk1D1seDfIIlwaqAxT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3111'),
  ('23596368899486362', 'A Star Is Born', 1976, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Frank Pierson, Robert Surtees, Stu Fleming', 'Joan Didion, John Gregory Dunne, Frank Pierson', 'Barbra Streisand, Kris Kristofferson, Gary Busey, Oliver Clark, Venetta Fields, Clydie King, Marta Heflin, M.G. Kelly', 'R', 'Drunken, has-been rock star John Norman Howard falls in love with unknown singer Esther Hoffman after seeing her perform at a club. He lets her sing a few songs at one of his shows and she becomes the talk of the music industry. Esther''s star begins to rise, while John''s continues to fall. She tries desperately to get John to sober up and focus on his music, but it may be too late to save him.', 'Drunken, has-been rock star John Norman Howard falls in love with unknown singer Esther Hoffman after seeing her perform at a club. He lets her sing a few songs at one of his shows and she becomes the talk of the music industry. Esther''s star begins to rise, while John''s continues to fall. She tries desperately to get John to sober up and focus on his music, but it may be too late to save him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Hr63lBDhvYGpSd8HxDpWvowZpY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19610'),
  ('134778483177536784', 'A Star Is Born', 2018, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Matthew R. Milan, Bruce Jones, Bradley Cooper', 'John Gregory Dunne, Joan Didion, Frank Pierson', 'Lady Gaga, Bradley Cooper, Sam Elliott, Andrew Dice Clay, Rafi Gavron, Anthony Ramos, Dave Chappelle, Alec Baldwin', 'R', 'Seasoned musician Jackson Maine discovers — and falls in love with — struggling artist Ally. She has just about given up on her dream to make it big as a singer — until Jack coaxes her into the spotlight. But even as Ally''s career takes off, the personal side of their relationship is breaking down, as Jack fights an ongoing battle with his own internal demons.', 'Seasoned musician Jackson Maine discovers — and falls in love with — struggling artist Ally. She has just about given up on her dream to make it big as a singer — until Jack coaxes her into the spotlight. But even as Ally''s career takes off, the personal side of their relationship is breaking down, as Jack fights an ongoing battle with his own internal demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrFpXMNBRj2PBiN4Z5kix51XaIZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332562'),
  ('610226824885727595', 'A Star Is Hatched', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Sara Berner, Mel Blanc, Bernice Hansen, Tedd Pierce', null, 'Emily the chicken lives in Hickville but dreams of Hollywood. Her chance comes when director J. Megga-Phone happens to drive past and gives her his card.', 'Emily the chicken lives in Hickville but dreams of Hollywood. Her chance comes when director J. Megga-Phone happens to drive past and gives her his card.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sj9wbmqg9OALwLeUoC4NnUgoPlo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236177'),
  ('764058782115680103', 'A Stasi Comedy', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Leander Haußmann, Michał Grabowski, Lutz Rabbach', 'Leander Haußmann', 'David Kross, Antonia Bill, Christopher Nell, Deleila Piasko, Jörg Schüttauf, Bernd Stegemann, Margarita Broich, Henry Hübchen', null, 'East Berlin, early 1980s: Ludger is hired by the Stasi to spy on the oppositional arts scene in Prenzlauer Berg. But when he falls in love with the mysterious Nathalie, he has to choose between a life as a celebrated underground poet and his career as a Stasi agent. A choice that will turn back on him 30 years later.', 'East Berlin, early 1980s: Ludger is hired by the Stasi to spy on the oppositional arts scene in Prenzlauer Berg. But when he falls in love with the mysterious Nathalie, he has to choose between a life as a celebrated underground poet and his career as a Stasi agent. A choice that will turn back on him 30 years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ifcAHWaJuTjKkbsZyITr3paadR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:943000'),
  ('560647045851042374', 'A State of Mind', 2005, 'Documentary, Music', 'Daniel Gordon', 'Daniel Gordon', 'Daniel Gordon, Hyon Sun Pak, Song Yun Kim, Kim Jong-il, Kim Jong-ho, Hyon Sun Pak, Song Yun Kim', null, 'Two young North Korean gymnasts prepare for an unprecedented competition in this documentary that offers a rare look into the communist society and the daily lives of North Korean families. For more than eight months, film crews follow 13-year-old Pak Hyon Sun and 11-year-old Kim Song Yun and their families as the girls train for the Mass Games, a spectacular nationalist celebration.', 'Two young North Korean gymnasts prepare for an unprecedented competition in this documentary that offers a rare look into the communist society and the daily lives of North Korean families. For more than eight months, film crews follow 13-year-old Pak Hyon Sun and 11-year-old Kim Song Yun and their families as the girls train for the Mass Games, a spectacular nationalist celebration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjwH61zraSRtQAe5K9tXdKiiPsu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24738'),
  ('947550551705410843', 'A Steven Wright Special', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Walter C. Miller', 'Steven Wright, Michael Armstrong', 'Steven Wright', null, 'Steven Wright, the Confucius of Comedy, recorded his first album, I Have A Pony, in 1985. That Grammy - nominated album, along with an HBO special the following year, established Wright as one of the most inventive, peculiar and admired comedians of our era. Surreal and cerebral, his languid voice and deadpan delivery of ironic, witty and sometimes even deeply philosophical one-liners made him a unique and unforgettable performer.', 'Steven Wright, the Confucius of Comedy, recorded his first album, I Have A Pony, in 1985. That Grammy - nominated album, along with an HBO special the following year, established Wright as one of the most inventive, peculiar and admired comedians of our era. Surreal and cerebral, his languid voice and deadpan delivery of ironic, witty and sometimes even deeply philosophical one-liners made him a unique and unforgettable performer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50cHHBQ23cMEScFskOQDLXSqtaI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55882'),
  ('381972844060955494', 'A Sticky Woman', 1906, 'Comedy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'A lady uses her maid to lick her stamps, when an overtly excited man notices the maid, forcibly kisses her, and they wind up stuck to each other.', 'A lady uses her maid to lick her stamps, when an overtly excited man notices the maid, forcibly kisses her, and they wind up stuck to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7Li7SQEAMGsSnAxOcGVlGssjy0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120018'),
  ('889994398178089462', 'A Stitch in Time', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Robert Asher, Jack Asher, Anthony Waye', 'Norman Wisdom', 'Norman Wisdom, Edward Chapman, Jeanette Sterke, Jerry Desmonde, Jill Melford, Glyn Houston, Hazel Hughes, Patsy Rowlands', null, 'An accident in the butchers shop leads Norman Pitkin and Mr Grimsdale to the hospital where, after causing the normal amount of chaos, Pitkin finds Lindy, a little girl who hasn''t spoken or smiled since her parents were killed in an aeroplane accident. Pitkin decides to help.', 'An accident in the butchers shop leads Norman Pitkin and Mr Grimsdale to the hospital where, after causing the normal amount of chaos, Pitkin finds Lindy, a little girl who hasn''t spoken or smiled since her parents were killed in an aeroplane accident. Pitkin decides to help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaXRPV7jpsvBvVe2wD0y2ngG3Dg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38377'),
  ('682197712128139571', 'A Stolen Life', 1946, 'Drama', 'Curtis Bernhardt, Ernest Haller, Sol Polito', 'Catherine Turney', 'Bette Davis, Glenn Ford, Dane Clark, Walter Brennan, Charles Ruggles, Bruce Bennett, Peggy Knudsen, Esther Dale', 'NR', 'A twin takes her deceased sister''s place as wife of the man they both love.', 'A twin takes her deceased sister''s place as wife of the man they both love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwa3EVAc4dvq1G3WTAL9FBFGNCD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43470'),
  ('248390927567967398', 'A Stoning in Fulham County', 1988, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Larry Elikann, Laszlo George', 'Jackson Gillis, Jud Kinberg', 'Ron Perlman, Ken Olin, Jill Eikenberry, Gregg Henry, Nicholas Pryor, Brad Pitt, Maureen Mueller, Noble Willingham', null, 'Religious beliefs clash with the law when an Amish infant is killed in a rural community.', 'Religious beliefs clash with the law when an Amish infant is killed in a rural community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vn75uH508WWdFsLvtysodjrOUju.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209340'),
  ('341038355959617701', 'A Stork''s Journey', 2017, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Toby Genkel, Emely Christians, Kristine Knudsen', 'Reza Memari', 'Christian Gaul, Tilman Döbler, Nicolette Krebitz, Maud Ackermann, Schroeder Kacmar, Marco Eßer, Erica D. Schroeder, Marc Thompson', 'PG', 'Orphaned at birth and raised by storks, teenage sparrow Richard believes he is one of them. But when time comes to migrate to Africa, his stork family is forced to reveal his true identity and leave him behind in the forest, since he is not a migratory bird and would not survive the journey. Determined to prove he is a stork after all, Richard ventures south on his own. But only with the help of Olga, an eccentric owl with an imaginary friend and Kiki, a narcissistic, disco-singing parakeet, does he stand a chance to reach his goal and learn to accept who he really is.', 'Orphaned at birth and raised by storks, teenage sparrow Richard believes he is one of them. But when time comes to migrate to Africa, his stork family is forced to reveal his true identity and leave him behind in the forest, since he is not a migratory bird and would not survive the journey. Determined to prove he is a stork after all, Richard ventures south on his own. But only with the help of Olga, an eccentric owl with an imaginary friend and Kiki, a narcissistic, disco-singing parakeet, does he stand a chance to reach his goal and learn to accept who he really is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKwgGlhdhdbx0duJhCRojkEZXgU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378111'),
  ('372462812340508609', 'A Stormy Summer Night', 2015, 'Drama', 'Fabrice Camoin, David Chizallet, Pierric Gantelmi d''Ille', 'Fabrice Camoin, Ariane Fert', 'Marina Foïs, Sami Bouajila, Valérie Donzelli, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Olivier Desautel, Slimane Dazi, Jeanne Jestin, Radivoje Bukvić', null, 'Pierre and Maria, a Parisian couple, travel to Spain with their daughter and her friend. When a violent storm hits they must settle for the night in a tiny hotel in a small Andalusian city. This small city has been the scene of a crime of passion. The police search the murderer, an immigrant worker. The whole city is aroused by this murderous act which roused resentment and a dangerous desire for vengeance...', 'Pierre and Maria, a Parisian couple, travel to Spain with their daughter and her friend. When a violent storm hits they must settle for the night in a tiny hotel in a small Andalusian city. This small city has been the scene of a crime of passion. The police search the murderer, an immigrant worker. The whole city is aroused by this murderous act which roused resentment and a dangerous desire for vengeance...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ecw4IrugNhNhJojoFRjCqpTUxP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372362'),
  ('585283068620959745', 'A Story', 1987, 'Animation, Adventure', 'Andrew Stanton', 'Andrew Stanton', 'Ethan Kanfer, Sue C. Nichols, Jeff Pidgeon, Andrew Stanton, Broose Johnson', null, 'A young boy named Melvin and a purple television dinosaur named Ted have happy adventures that lead them into the clutches of Randy the Killer Clown and his Goon Squad.', 'A young boy named Melvin and a purple television dinosaur named Ted have happy adventures that lead them into the clutches of Randy the Killer Clown and his Goon Squad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48L35oaTTXQrwVPdRs0St6bZ5Ql.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148950'),
  ('391730939533389179', 'A Story of Floating Weeds', 1934, 'Drama', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Hideo Shigehara, Kazuo Ishikawa', 'Tadao Ikeda', 'Takeshi Sakamoto, Chōko Iida, Kōji Mitsui, Emiko Yagumo, Yoshiko Tsubouchi, Tomio Aoki, Reikō Tani, Seiji Nishimura', null, 'An aging actor returns to a small town with his troupe and reunites with his former lover and illegitimate son, a scenario that enrages his current mistress and results in heartbreak for all.', 'An aging actor returns to a small town with his troupe and reunites with his former lover and illegitimate son, a scenario that enrages his current mistress and results in heartbreak for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eR0KHE3mS2Ti8sOADMp9ZmKJdJG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44163'),
  ('197567343553182390', 'A Story of No Importance', 1980, 'Drama', 'Jacques Duron', 'Jacques Duron', 'Philippe Bories, Bernard Flamain', null, 'A coming of age story about two great friends during the school years whose friendship is truly tested when one of the boys start to develop different feelings for the other. At first, it seems Philippe and Claude are just experimenting new sensations, everything is pure curiosity to them. But total reciprocity isn''t the name of the game and Philippe is clearly infatuated with his friend.', 'A coming of age story about two great friends during the school years whose friendship is truly tested when one of the boys start to develop different feelings for the other. At first, it seems Philippe and Claude are just experimenting new sensations, everything is pure curiosity to them. But total reciprocity isn''t the name of the game and Philippe is clearly infatuated with his friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqKbKZyr6LOCNgk9glVR3dTOXGf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56318'),
  ('756400159172964942', 'A Story of the Forest: Mavka', 1980, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Yurii Illienko, Yurii Illienko', 'Yurii Illienko', 'Lyudmila Efimenko, Viktor Kremlev, Maya Bulgakova, Ivan Mykolaichuk, Boris Khmelnitsky, Viktor Demertash, Liudmyla Lobza, Nina Shatskaya', null, 'Mavka, a water nymph, loves Lukash, a country youth. Their brief happiness ends when Lukash is forced to marry the shrewish Kilina. The Spirit of the Forest turns Lukash into a wolf as punishment for his infidelity. The strength of Mavka''s love breaks the spell, but Kilina curses the nymph, transforming her into a weeping willow. This beautiful and tragic story is based on a play written in 1912 by Lesya Ukrainka, a Ukrainian poet, writer and political, civil and female activist, and includes mythological characters taken from Ukrainian folklore.', 'Mavka, a water nymph, loves Lukash, a country youth. Their brief happiness ends when Lukash is forced to marry the shrewish Kilina. The Spirit of the Forest turns Lukash into a wolf as punishment for his infidelity. The strength of Mavka''s love breaks the spell, but Kilina curses the nymph, transforming her into a weeping willow. This beautiful and tragic story is based on a play written in 1912 by Lesya Ukrainka, a Ukrainian poet, writer and political, civil and female activist, and includes mythological characters taken from Ukrainian folklore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKuque77615Xm2gJMPQfuVg0jSU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254902'),
  ('749795892531817172', 'A Story of Water', 1961, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Michel Latouche, François Truffaut', 'Jean-Luc Godard, François Truffaut', 'Caroline Dim, Jean-Claude Brialy, Jean-Luc Godard', null, 'A young woman tries to go to Paris, but her garden and the whole village is flooded with water.', 'A young woman tries to go to Paris, but her garden and the whole village is flooded with water.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knJdTZL4VtodAFvmoIfDLIqXn8s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45948'),
  ('106054939614232718', 'A Story of Yonosuke', 2013, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Shuichi Okita, Ryuto Kondo, Atsushi Unno', 'Shiro Maeda, Shuichi Okita', 'Kengo Kora, Yuriko Yoshitaka, Sosuke Ikematsu, Ayumi Ito, Go Ayano, Aki Asakura, Mei Kurokawa, Tasuku Emoto', 'NR', 'The year is 1987 and Japan is just reaching the peak of its economic success. Eighteen-year old Yonosuke Yokomichi arrives in Tokyo from Nagasaki. Ordinary in every way possible, he lives in a suburb far from the excitement of the big city and commutes to a university in the center of Tokyo.', 'The year is 1987 and Japan is just reaching the peak of its economic success. Eighteen-year old Yonosuke Yokomichi arrives in Tokyo from Nagasaki. Ordinary in every way possible, he lives in a suburb far from the excitement of the big city and commutes to a university in the center of Tokyo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbXzGpXL2eEQTS7ZPqBuQsAv7sR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200145'),
