  ('849829952245386697', 'A Straightforward Boy', 1929, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Hiroshi Nomura', 'Tadao Ikeda', 'Tatsuo Saitō, Tomio Aoki, Takeshi Sakamoto', null, 'A kidnapped boy proves to be more than his abductor can handle.', 'A kidnapped boy proves to be more than his abductor can handle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHwFGyBuWN8IsoOaAZcodhYXFw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137119'),
  ('9190598194642598', 'A Strange Adventure', 1956, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Bud Thackery, William Witney', 'Houston Branch', 'Joan Evans, Ben Cooper, Marla English, Jan Merlin, Nick Adams, Peter Miller, Paul Smith, Emlen Davies', 'NR', 'A trio of thieves make their getaway by kidnapping a young hot-rodder, and take over a mountain cabin for a hideout after overpowering its occupants.', 'A trio of thieves make their getaway by kidnapping a young hot-rodder, and take over a mountain cabin for a hideout after overpowering its occupants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tu38EBHZHTB16cp5gQGhSMv0zt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204946'),
  ('753643620542936705', 'A Strange House', 2024, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Junichi Ishikawa, Hiro''o Yanagida', 'Kentaro Ushio', 'Shotaro Mamiya, Jiro Sato, Rina Kawaei, DJ Matsunaga, Seiya Osada, Miori Takimoto, Masanobu Takashima, Toshie Negishi', null, 'Amemiya is an unpopular Youtuber who specializes in the occult. One day, his manager brings him a floor plan with an inscrutable point. With the help of Kurihara and Yuzuki, he begins to look into the plan and reveal the mystery behind.', 'Amemiya is an unpopular Youtuber who specializes in the occult. One day, his manager brings him a floor plan with an inscrutable point. With the help of Kurihara and Yuzuki, he begins to look into the plan and reveal the mystery behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uYWD7TmbLLPGODczH9NGVDqE8dY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1188456'),
  ('1152766025346217256', 'A Stranger Among Us', 1992, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Sidney Lumet, Andrzej Bartkowiak, Burtt Harris', 'Robert J. Avrech', 'Melanie Griffith, Eric Thal, John Pankow, Tracy Pollan, Lee Richardson, Mia Sara, Jamey Sheridan, Jake Weber', 'PG-13', 'Detective Emily Eden is a tough New York City cop forced to go undercover to solve a puzzling murder. Her search for the truth takes her into a secret world of unwritten law and unspoken power, a world where the only way out is deeper in.', 'Detective Emily Eden is a tough New York City cop forced to go undercover to solve a puzzling murder. Her search for the truth takes her into a secret world of unwritten law and unspoken power, a world where the only way out is deeper in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9V1cE3PzlK0syDD2HzrUiUpIRV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41670'),
  ('1066918671131646672', 'A Stranger in Town', 1943, 'Crime, Romance', 'Roy Rowland', 'Isobel Lennart, William Kozlenko', 'Frank Morgan, Richard Carlson, Jean Rogers, Porter Hall, Robert Barrat, Donald MacBride, Walter Baldwin, Andrew Tombes', 'NR', 'In the small town of Crownport local attorney Bill Adams is trying to break up the ring of corrupt town officials by running for mayor. The cards seemed stacked against him when he gets help from a visiting hunter who, unknown to Adams and the rest of the town, is actually vacationing supreme court justice John Josephus Grant.', 'In the small town of Crownport local attorney Bill Adams is trying to break up the ring of corrupt town officials by running for mayor. The cards seemed stacked against him when he gets help from a visiting hunter who, unknown to Adams and the rest of the town, is actually vacationing supreme court justice John Josephus Grant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avVfGnYdiDjj4nRt1OrHyJY3O4J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194516'),
  ('766894930883500005', 'A Stranger in Town', 1967, 'Western, Drama', 'Luigi Vanzi, Marcello Masciocchi', 'Warren Garfield, Giuseppe Mangione', 'Tony Anthony, Frank Wolff, Jolanda Modio, Gia Sandri, Raf Baldassarre, Aldo Berti, Lars Bloch, Antonio Marsina', null, 'Unknown to anybody else but himself The Stranger arrives in an abandoned town where he witnesses the slaughter of Mexican soldiers by a gang led by Aguila. The Stranger threatens Aguila to denounce him if he does not accept to let him take part in the theft of a shipment of gold. The plan is a success but when The Stranger claims his due, he gets a good beating instead. However The Stranger manages to escape with the gold. The bandits, who want his skin, pursue him. But The Stranger is not the kind to get caught so easily...', 'Unknown to anybody else but himself The Stranger arrives in an abandoned town where he witnesses the slaughter of Mexican soldiers by a gang led by Aguila. The Stranger threatens Aguila to denounce him if he does not accept to let him take part in the theft of a shipment of gold. The plan is a success but when The Stranger claims his due, he gets a good beating instead. However The Stranger manages to escape with the gold. The bandits, who want his skin, pursue him. But The Stranger is not the kind to get caught so easily...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwTnKOwCpntOoWRK8bnFRwDruQo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88947'),
  ('648493704110117578', 'A Stranger Is Watching', 1982, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Sean S. Cunningham, Dan Eriksen, Barry Abrams', 'Earl Mac Rauch, Victor Miller', 'Kate Mulgrew, Rip Torn, James Naughton, Shawn von Schreiber, Barbara Baxley, Stephen Joyce, James Russo, William Hickey', 'R', 'A twisted man holds a TV newswoman and a girl hostage in the bowels of Grand Central Station.', 'A twisted man holds a TV newswoman and a girl hostage in the bowels of Grand Central Station.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oR5pmMjly2pR0XfpTDzKKTX8knz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21158'),
  ('417853982685655518', 'A Stranger of Mine', 2005, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Kenji Uchida', 'Kenji Uchida', 'Yasuhi Nakamura, Reika Kirishima, So Yamanaka, Yuka Itaya, Kisuke Yamashita, Hidekazu Mashima, Masahiro Furugohri', null, 'In one long Friday evening, Takeshi Miyata, a straight-arrow businessman, will encounter a number of people (some only fleetingly) who have intertwining fates.', 'In one long Friday evening, Takeshi Miyata, a straight-arrow businessman, will encounter a number of people (some only fleetingly) who have intertwining fates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9aiQ5n0nPBvPEW922x2RHQR1yM6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38977'),
  ('568420418250313226', 'A Street Cat Named Sylvester', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet', null, 'The title of this cartoon is a misnomer, because it is in fact Tweety Bird who is the homeless one here, and Sylvester is Granny''s pet. Tweety seeks shelter from a blizzard and taps on Granny''s house door. Sylvester answers and grabs the canary. He tries to hide Tweety from Granny while evading the attacks of Hector, Granny''s bed-ridden bulldog, who wants revenge on Sylvester for his broken leg. Tweety keeps escaping Sylvester''s clutches, with Hector''s help.', 'The title of this cartoon is a misnomer, because it is in fact Tweety Bird who is the homeless one here, and Sylvester is Granny''s pet. Tweety seeks shelter from a blizzard and taps on Granny''s house door. Sylvester answers and grabs the canary. He tries to hide Tweety from Granny while evading the attacks of Hector, Granny''s bed-ridden bulldog, who wants revenge on Sylvester for his broken leg. Tweety keeps escaping Sylvester''s clutches, with Hector''s help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVKFXF46tHN33sp8wZVam0R4EUZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235818'),
  ('757024302504378814', 'A Street in Palermo', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Emma Dante, Gherardo Gossi', 'Licia Eminenti', 'Emma Dante, Alba Rohrwacher, Elena Cotta, Renato Malfatti, Dario Casarolo, Carmine Maringola, Sandro Maria Campagna', null, 'Shut inside their cars, two women face off in a silent duel that is fought out in the intimate violence of their stares. A wholly female duel punctuated by the refusal to drink, eat and sleep; more obstinate than the sun of Palermo and more stubborn than the ferocity of the men who surround them. For, as in every duel, it is a question of life or death... It’s a Sunday afternoon. The sirocco is blowing pitilessly in Palermo when Rosa and Clara lose their way in the streets of the city and end up in a sort of alley: Via Castellana Bandiera. At the same moment, another car driven by Samira, crammed with members of the Calafiore family, arrives from the opposite direction and enters the same street.', 'Shut inside their cars, two women face off in a silent duel that is fought out in the intimate violence of their stares. A wholly female duel punctuated by the refusal to drink, eat and sleep; more obstinate than the sun of Palermo and more stubborn than the ferocity of the men who surround them. For, as in every duel, it is a question of life or death... It’s a Sunday afternoon. The sirocco is blowing pitilessly in Palermo when Rosa and Clara lose their way in the streets of the city and end up in a sort of alley: Via Castellana Bandiera. At the same moment, another car driven by Samira, crammed with members of the Calafiore family, arrives from the opposite direction and enters the same street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mEcUbsjIU304rPfHT97lgcq4eU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216788'),
  ('462189647591699721', 'A Streetcar Named Desire', 1995, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Glenn Jordan', 'Tennessee Williams', 'Alec Baldwin, Jessica Lange, John Goodman, Diane Lane, Matt Keeslar, Jerry Hardin, Carlos Gómez, Rondi Reed', null, 'A fading Southern Belle moves in with her sister in New Orleans where her ferocious brother-in-law takes stabs at her sanity.', 'A fading Southern Belle moves in with her sister in New Orleans where her ferocious brother-in-law takes stabs at her sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xB0dg5ALgUEEs7WdDsIm0IqYBKj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133021'),
  ('105185532181204573', 'A Stroke of Luck', 2016, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Nacho G. Velilla, Isaac Vila, Antton Zabala', 'Oriol Capel, David S. Olivas, Antonio Sánchez', 'Carmen Machi, Leo Harlem, Carlos Santos, Salva Reina, Jon Plazaola, Boré Buika, Arturo Valls, Antonio Pagudo', null, 'Villaviciosa de al Lado is a peaceful town stuck in time, living exclusively of the fame of a 200 years-old spa. Therefore, city hall''s debts threatens to close the spa and ruin all town. Their salvation becomes when suddenly mayor Anselmo and the rest of members of city hall realize that they won the Christmas Lottery. But their happiness turns in horror after to discover that the prize belongs to a serial number distributed by the town''s brothel, causing the suspicion of the wives and fear of the husbands after a TV interview where Mari, brothel''s owner, claims that the almost men of the town will have prize from the lottery. Wanting a way to charge the prize to save the town without having to suffer the anger of their respective women, Anselmo, Ricardo, César, Juandi and Paco plots a plan in order to steal the money from the brothel, meanwhile Mari tries reconcile her stranded life and restore the memory of her deceased father, a former mayor.', 'Villaviciosa de al Lado is a peaceful town stuck in time, living exclusively of the fame of a 200 years-old spa. Therefore, city hall''s debts threatens to close the spa and ruin all town. Their salvation becomes when suddenly mayor Anselmo and the rest of members of city hall realize that they won the Christmas Lottery. But their happiness turns in horror after to discover that the prize belongs to a serial number distributed by the town''s brothel, causing the suspicion of the wives and fear of the husbands after a TV interview where Mari, brothel''s owner, claims that the almost men of the town will have prize from the lottery. Wanting a way to charge the prize to save the town without having to suffer the anger of their respective women, Anselmo, Ricardo, César, Juandi and Paco plots a plan in order to steal the money from the brothel, meanwhile Mari tries reconcile her stranded life and restore the memory of her deceased father, a former mayor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kWOLgs9gbfGlvM2KDXfuUIML3I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375868'),
  ('86043575954554825', 'A Strong Man', 1929, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Henryk Szaro, Jan Belina, Giovanni Vitrotti', 'Jerzy Braun, Henryk Szaro', 'Gregori Chmara, Agnes Kuck, Julian Krzewiński, Julian Krzewiński, Julian Krzewiński, Stanisława Wysocka, Bolesław Mierzejewski, Janina Romanówna', null, 'Bielecki becomes determined to become a famous writer, but the means he employs in achieving his goal are far from ethical. Bielecki discourages his friend Jerzy Gorski by telling him his new work is rather poor, driving him into despair. But Bielecki is such a good friend that he even provides Gorski with the morphine so he can overdose too. With Gorski out of the way, Bielecki can now peddle his friend''s book as his own. However, it doesn''t take long for Bielecki''s evil ways to catch up to him.', 'Bielecki becomes determined to become a famous writer, but the means he employs in achieving his goal are far from ethical. Bielecki discourages his friend Jerzy Gorski by telling him his new work is rather poor, driving him into despair. But Bielecki is such a good friend that he even provides Gorski with the morphine so he can overdose too. With Gorski out of the way, Bielecki can now peddle his friend''s book as his own. However, it doesn''t take long for Bielecki''s evil ways to catch up to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovZ4HFI0dOPEuEkvrYssQIFtV6D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168808'),
  ('774379618806077294', 'A Study in Choreography for Camera', 1945, 'Music', 'Maya Deren', null, 'Talley Beatty', null, 'Maya Deren’s shortest, two-minute A Study in Choreography for Camera seems like an exercise piece to capture a dancer’s movement on celluloid, which later on developed into her masterpieces such as Ritual in Transfigured Time and Meditation on Violence.', 'Maya Deren’s shortest, two-minute A Study in Choreography for Camera seems like an exercise piece to capture a dancer’s movement on celluloid, which later on developed into her masterpieces such as Ritual in Transfigured Time and Meditation on Violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9T4zoT4QHTicz39EOiYccqnbMEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104378'),
  ('260804153490495785', 'A Study in Reds', 1932, null, 'Miriam Bennett', null, null, null, 'While listening to a tedious lecture on the Soviet threat, Wisconsin Dells’ Tuesday Club members fall asleep and find themselves laboring in an all-women collective in Russia under the unflinching eye of the Soviet special police', 'While listening to a tedious lecture on the Soviet threat, Wisconsin Dells’ Tuesday Club members fall asleep and find themselves laboring in an all-women collective in Russia under the unflinching eye of the Soviet special police', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dkExAoWMUw8x6va7nHdPQnFViT3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246713'),
  ('774625908564315110', 'A Study in Scarlet', 1933, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Edwin L. Marin, Arthur Edeson', 'Robert Florey', 'Reginald Owen, June Clyde, Alan Mowbray, Warburton Gamble, Doris Lloyd, John Warburton, Leila Bennett, J.M. Kerrigan', 'NR', 'In London, a secret society led by lawyer Thaddeus Merrydew collects the assets of any of its deceased members and divides them among the remaining members. Society members start dropping like flies. Sherlock Holmes is approached by member James Murphy''s widow, who is miffed at being left penniless by her husband. When Captain Pyke is shot, Holmes keys in on his mysterious Chinese widow as well as the shady Merrydew. Other members keep dying: Malcom Dearing first, then Mr. Baker. There is also an attempt on the life of young Eileen Forrester, who became a reluctant society member upon the death of her father. Holmes'' uncanny observations and insights are put to the test.', 'In London, a secret society led by lawyer Thaddeus Merrydew collects the assets of any of its deceased members and divides them among the remaining members. Society members start dropping like flies. Sherlock Holmes is approached by member James Murphy''s widow, who is miffed at being left penniless by her husband. When Captain Pyke is shot, Holmes keys in on his mysterious Chinese widow as well as the shady Merrydew. Other members keep dying: Malcom Dearing first, then Mr. Baker. There is also an attempt on the life of young Eileen Forrester, who became a reluctant society member upon the death of her father. Holmes'' uncanny observations and insights are put to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0IdtTeMOXVty8Lp7aufagNJD22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38585'),
  ('142408801064404095', 'A Study in Terror', 1965, 'Crime, Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'James Hill, Barry Langley, Desmond Dickinson', 'Derek Ford, Donald Ford', 'John Neville, Donald Houston, John Fraser, Anthony Quayle, Barbara Windsor, Adrienne Corri, Frank Finlay, Judi Dench', 'NR', 'When Watson reads from the newspaper there have been two similar murders near Whitechapel in a few days, Sherlock Holmes'' sharp deductive is immediately stimulated to start its merciless method of elimination after observation of every apparently meaningless detail. He guesses right the victims must be street whores, and doesn''t need long to work his way trough a pawn shop, an aristocratic family''s stately home, a hospital and of course the potential suspects and (even unknowing) witnesses who are the cast of the gradually unraveled story of the murderer and his motive.', 'When Watson reads from the newspaper there have been two similar murders near Whitechapel in a few days, Sherlock Holmes'' sharp deductive is immediately stimulated to start its merciless method of elimination after observation of every apparently meaningless detail. He guesses right the victims must be street whores, and doesn''t need long to work his way trough a pawn shop, an aristocratic family''s stately home, a hospital and of course the potential suspects and (even unknowing) witnesses who are the cast of the gradually unraveled story of the murderer and his motive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWKXoUpzB28R5qHhQAoC6kOJaQ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42729'),
  ('356356300221940954', 'A Sudden Case of Christmas', 2024, 'Family, Comedy', 'Peter Chelsom, Christophe Lanzenberg', 'Peter Chelsom, Tinker Lindsay', 'Danny DeVito, Andie MacDowell, Lucy DeVito, Antonella Rose, Wilmer Valderrama, José Zúñiga, Adrian Dunbar, Valéria Cavalli', null, 'An American couple bring their 10 year old daughter, Claire, to her grandfather Lawrence''s hotel in The Dolomites, Italy. They usually come for Christmas but this year it’s August. The fact is they are breaking up, and once Claire realizes there’s not going to be a family Christmas this year, she insists on everyone making it out for Christmas in August. Claire, in collusion with her grandfather, plan activities that are designed to re-unite her parents.', 'An American couple bring their 10 year old daughter, Claire, to her grandfather Lawrence''s hotel in The Dolomites, Italy. They usually come for Christmas but this year it’s August. The fact is they are breaking up, and once Claire realizes there’s not going to be a family Christmas this year, she insists on everyone making it out for Christmas in August. Claire, in collusion with her grandfather, plan activities that are designed to re-unite her parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ykjCB9yKQolzEMIVH6L16wQo27.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1197662'),
  ('870112457714315587', 'A Sugar & Spice Holiday', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Robert Aschmann, Jennifer Liao', 'Eirene Donohue', 'Jacky Lai, Tony Giroux, Tzi Ma, Lillian Lim, Cardi Wong, Cindy Piper, Naomi Tan, Grace Sunar', null, 'Suzie, a rising young architect, returns to her small hometown in Maine for Christmas. When she gets there, she is pushed to follow her grandmother''s footsteps and enter the local gingerbread house competition.', 'Suzie, a rising young architect, returns to her small hometown in Maine for Christmas. When she gets there, she is pushed to follow her grandmother''s footsteps and enter the local gingerbread house competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttaDCxW3Z7nzwW98mk5kmhaU04J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743403'),
  ('699901902496408239', 'A Summer at Grandpa''s', 1984, 'Drama', 'Hou Hsiao-hsien, Chen Kun-hou', 'Hou Hsiao-hsien, Chu Tien-Wen', 'Wong Kai-Gwong, Lee Suk-Ching, Chen Bo-zheng, Lin Hsiu-Ling, Yen Cheng-kuo, Nai-Chu Ting, Edward Yang, Mei Fang', 'PG', 'A coming-of-age story about a young brother and sister whom spend a pivotal summer in the country with their grandparents.', 'A coming-of-age story about a young brother and sister whom spend a pivotal summer in the country with their grandparents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnmZGNut8TLk5630yiGgoMvPaah.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92989'),
  ('870829675579745436', 'A summer at the sea', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Claudio Zamarion, Giorgio Melidoni', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Lino Banfi, Gigi Proietti, Enrico Brignano, Biagio Izzo, Enzo Salvi, Ezio Greggio, Massimo Ceccherini, Nancy Brilli', null, 'Set against the sun-soaked shores of Italy in the summertime, seven different tales unfold about life, love, loss, family, and friendship.', 'Set against the sun-soaked shores of Italy in the summertime, seven different tales unfold about life, love, loss, family, and friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8VHs07VJ9iGqkWJON54uUc21MYN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84056'),
  ('239729094912074261', 'A Summer by the River', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kari Sohlberg, Markku Pölönen, Nadja Pyykkö', 'Markku Pölönen', 'Pertti Koivula, Simo Kontio, Esko Nikkari, Anu Palevaara, Peter Franzén, Sulevi Peltola, Heikki Kujanpää, Vesa Mäkelä', null, 'Kuningasjätkä is set in North Karelia in the mid-1950s and depicts the summer of 10-year-old Topi at the boating site with his widowed father Tenho.', 'Kuningasjätkä is set in North Karelia in the mid-1950s and depicts the summer of 10-year-old Topi at the boating site with his widowed father Tenho.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x37srfJhBkVEu3hFEn0nfIYghsL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189076'),
  ('506195199164307032', 'A Summer Day', 2006, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Franck Guérin, Mathieu Pansard', 'Franck Guérin, Agnès Feuvre', 'Baptiste Bertin, Catherine Mouchet, Jean-François Stévenin, Théo Frilet, Élise Caron, Philippe Fretun, Yann Peira, Thierry Godard', null, 'The sudden death of a teenager during a soccer match puts a small community completely off-balance.', 'The sudden death of a teenager during a soccer match puts a small community completely off-balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1y2mY552PwZtJ1PIYdcqJMQAB9v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102449'),
  ('264653943705939921', 'A Summer Dress', 1996, 'Drama, Romance', 'François Ozon, Jean-Marie Omont, Yorick Le Saux', 'François Ozon', 'Frédéric Mangenot, Lucía Sánchez, Sébastien Charles', null, 'It''s summer. Sébastien loves the singer Sheila. Lucia loves boys. As for Frédéric, all he wants to do is work on his tan.', 'It''s summer. Sébastien loves the singer Sheila. Lucia loves boys. As for Frédéric, all he wants to do is work on his tan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUlbPvjY5O8QgyJphlBuxun8lqI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48782'),
  ('73994596103943604', 'A Summer in Hell', 1984, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Michael Schock, Teo Escamilla', 'Claude de Givray, Jean-Pierre Thomacini', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Véronique Jannot, Daniel Duval, Nana Mouloudji, Corynne Charbit, Joaquín Hinojosa, Monique Tarbès, Michel Adam de Villiers', null, 'An amateur detective helps a hotel owner to find her younger sister.', 'An amateur detective helps a hotel owner to find her younger sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tasbB0jnyFm844DJ9HOl2BFn4uG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242248'),
  ('757112414150680904', 'A Summer in La Goulette', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Férid Boughedir, Robert Alazraki', 'Férid Boughedir, Nouri Bouzid', 'Sonia Mankaï, Claudia Cardinale, Gamil Ratib, Sarah Pariente, Ava Cohen-Jonathan, Mustapha Adouani, Jamel Sassi, Hatem Berrabeh', null, 'Summer, 1967. La Goulette, the touristic beach of Tunisi, is the site where three nice seventeen-year-old girls live: Gigi, Sicilian and Catholic; Meriem, Tunisian and Muslim; Tina, French and Jewish. They would like to have their first sexual experience during that summer, challenging their families. Their fathers, Youssef, Jojo and Giuseppe, are old friends and their friendship will be in crisis because of the girls, while Hadj, an old rich Arab, would like to marry Meriem.', 'Summer, 1967. La Goulette, the touristic beach of Tunisi, is the site where three nice seventeen-year-old girls live: Gigi, Sicilian and Catholic; Meriem, Tunisian and Muslim; Tina, French and Jewish. They would like to have their first sexual experience during that summer, challenging their families. Their fathers, Youssef, Jojo and Giuseppe, are old friends and their friendship will be in crisis because of the girls, while Hadj, an old rich Arab, would like to marry Meriem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3XOpcPsCjnieAiHPiobB85jxqa0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121493'),
  ('886930492581933744', 'A Summer in St. Tropez', 1983, 'Drama, Romance', 'David Hamilton', 'David Hamilton', 'Monica Broeke, Joan, Catherine, Esther', null, 'In an isolated country house close to the shore near Saint-Tropez, seven young women share a bedroom. Over two days, they wake, shower, breakfast, play dress up, bathe in the sea, picnic, ride bikes, pick flowers, have a pillow fight, run on the strand, practice ballet stretches, groom themselves and each other, and laugh. Anne returns a horse to Renaud; the next day, he''s in a rowboat and meets her by the pier. By the film''s end, all are celebrating with the lovers.', 'In an isolated country house close to the shore near Saint-Tropez, seven young women share a bedroom. Over two days, they wake, shower, breakfast, play dress up, bathe in the sea, picnic, ride bikes, pick flowers, have a pillow fight, run on the strand, practice ballet stretches, groom themselves and each other, and laugh. Anne returns a horse to Renaud; the next day, he''s in a rowboat and meets her by the pier. By the film''s end, all are celebrating with the lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vkxxJWRgtti0hunj4UugGiuMhBz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54165'),
  ('797742099070987622', 'A Summer In The Caribbean', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Claudio Zamarion, Giorgio Melidoni', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Enrico Brignano, Carlo Buccirosso, Biagio Izzo, Martina Stella, Enrico Bertolino, Alena Šeredová, Paolo Conticini, Paolo Ruffini', null, 'Several groups of Italians experience amusing adventures and tests of character on the Caribbean island of Antigua. Some of the characters are there simply for rest and relaxation, while others act with different motivations. Multiple plot lines unfold simultaneously as different characters'' stories are presented.', 'Several groups of Italians experience amusing adventures and tests of character on the Caribbean island of Antigua. Some of the characters are there simply for rest and relaxation, while others act with different motivations. Multiple plot lines unfold simultaneously as different characters'' stories are presented.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HVWYvCO5uSZrIDjghpXBJ0gbjQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53700'),
  ('134295913152124555', 'A Summer Place', 1959, 'Drama, Romance', 'Delmer Daves, Harry Stradling Sr., Russell Llewellyn', 'Delmer Daves', 'Richard Egan, Dorothy McGuire, Sandra Dee, Arthur Kennedy, Troy Donahue, Beulah Bondi, Constance Ford, Jack Richardson', 'NR', 'A self-made businessman rekindles a romance with a former flame while their two teenage children begin a romance of their own with drastic consequences for both couples.', 'A self-made businessman rekindles a romance with a former flame while their two teenage children begin a romance of their own with drastic consequences for both couples.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/escHRIldvNphvBnxMcn6ybaJId0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18904'),
  ('89103960357940800', 'A Summer Romance', 2019, 'Romance, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Tyler Walzak, Bob Massie, David Winning', 'Robert Tate Miller', 'Erin Krakow, Ryan Paevey, Sarah Strange, Lucie Guest, Ava Grace Cooper, Kevin O''Grady, Geoff Gustafson, Liza Huget', null, 'Samantha’s Montana ranch is her family’s legacy, so when a developer shows up to buy it, Sam isn’t interested. But as he tries to win her trust and her ranch, Sam finds he might also be winning her heart.', 'Samantha’s Montana ranch is her family’s legacy, so when a developer shows up to buy it, Sam isn’t interested. But as he tries to win her trust and her ranch, Sam finds he might also be winning her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYGLSQElCEkf8mA63KzKf2qTEXD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612315'),
  ('435281731554566476', 'A Summer Story', 1988, 'Romance, Drama', 'Piers Haggard, Kenneth MacMillan', 'Penelope Mortimer', 'James Wilby, Imogen Stubbs, Susannah York, Kenneth Colley, Jerome Flynn, Sophie Ward, John Elmes, Sukie Smith', null, 'A young lawyer from London, Mr. Ashton, and his best friend are hiking across Dartmoor. When he twists his ankle, Ashton is forced to seek help at a nearby farmhouse and stays there for a few days. Innocent beauty Megan David catches the attention of Ashton. He decides to stay longer, and he and Megan fall in love, much to the displeasure of Megan''s aunt and her loutish son.', 'A young lawyer from London, Mr. Ashton, and his best friend are hiking across Dartmoor. When he twists his ankle, Ashton is forced to seek help at a nearby farmhouse and stays there for a few days. Innocent beauty Megan David catches the attention of Ashton. He decides to stay longer, and he and Megan fall in love, much to the displeasure of Megan''s aunt and her loutish son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3uy8p48wyd4gBBtJKbyQPvE0nze.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123623'),
  ('481299700566619978', 'A Summer Tale', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Ulf Malmros, Mats Olofson, Emma Gabrielsson', 'Ulf Malmros, Vasa', 'Kjell Bergqvist, Anastasios Soulis, Rebecca Scheja, Cecilia Nilsson, Brasse Brännström, Marcus Hasselborg, Gachugo Makini, Göran Thorell', null, 'The summer of ''58, the year Sweden almost won the world championship in soccer over Brazil, Yngve Johansson accepts two children to live with him during the summer, as told through the eyes of a young boy. His name is Mårten, and the other child''s name is Annika. She is a rough girl, with many problems. The three of them do not get along, and Yngve is a true dictator to the children''s eyes. However, when the children discover that their new guardian has a crush on their teacher (Cecilia Nilsson), they do what they can to bring the two together. Soon enough, the three will discover that they have a lot more in common than they previously imagined, and together they can make their lives worth living again. This is a sweet story about life in Sweden in the mid 1900''s. It is about family, love, hate, innocent friendship that we all can relate to, and much, much more...', 'The summer of ''58, the year Sweden almost won the world championship in soccer over Brazil, Yngve Johansson accepts two children to live with him during the summer, as told through the eyes of a young boy. His name is Mårten, and the other child''s name is Annika. She is a rough girl, with many problems. The three of them do not get along, and Yngve is a true dictator to the children''s eyes. However, when the children discover that their new guardian has a crush on their teacher (Cecilia Nilsson), they do what they can to bring the two together. Soon enough, the three will discover that they have a lot more in common than they previously imagined, and together they can make their lives worth living again. This is a sweet story about life in Sweden in the mid 1900''s. It is about family, love, hate, innocent friendship that we all can relate to, and much, much more...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rROZUiGbgIuEMiQ9WzyOIVTWdU8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26436'),
  ('920874574582629985', 'A Summer to Remember', 1960, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Igor Talankin, Georgiy Daneliya, Anatoli Nitochkin', 'Vera Panova, Igor Talankin, Georgiy Daneliya', 'Boris Barkhatov, Irina Skobtseva, Lyubov Sokolova, Sergey Bondarchuk, Vasili Merkuryev, Aleksandra Panova', null, 'Based on the Vera Panova book about a complicated relationship between an 8-year-old boy and his new stepfather.', 'Based on the Vera Panova book about a complicated relationship between an 8-year-old boy and his new stepfather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5efoGSjO0Zo5kdQv6rROkHnFCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27920'),
  ('485273058795652781', 'A Summer''s Tale', 1996, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Éric Rohmer, Diane Baratier', 'Éric Rohmer', 'Melvil Poupaud, Amanda Langlet, Gwenaëlle Simon, Aurelia Nolin, Aimé Lefèvre, Alain Guellaff, Evelyne Lahana, Yves Guérin', null, 'Awaiting his girlfriend Léna’s arrival at the Breton seaside resort of Dinard, Gaspard befriends — and flirts heavily with — two other women, the companionable ethnology student Margot and the sensual townie Solène, making for a rather complicated situation when Léna finally arrives.', 'Awaiting his girlfriend Léna’s arrival at the Breton seaside resort of Dinard, Gaspard befriends — and flirts heavily with — two other women, the companionable ethnology student Margot and the sensual townie Solène, making for a rather complicated situation when Léna finally arrives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3syqgYqqfqPVheINI5jOBN5hXL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37563'),
  ('1043527415513174369', 'A Sun', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Chung Mong-hong, Tu Duu-chih, Wu Shu-yao', 'Chung Mong-hong, Chang Yao-sheng', 'Chen Yi-wen, Ko Shu-Chin, Wu Chien-ho, Apple Wu, Greg Hsu, Liu Kuan-ting, Ivy Yin, Chen-Ling Wen', 'NR', 'A family of four fractures under the weight of unmet expectations, unexpected tragedy, and uncompromising pride.', 'A family of four fractures under the weight of unmet expectations, unexpected tragedy, and uncompromising pride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMdGYF0IBSJKgiNOuDoagmnOstu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:622951'),
  ('1145659451314747417', 'A Sun-Tribe Myth from the Bakumatsu Era', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Yūzō Kawashima, Kuratarō Takamura, Shōhei Imamura', 'Yūzō Kawashima, Shōhei Imamura, Hisashi Yamanouchi', 'Frankie Sakai, Sachiko Hidari, Yōko Minamida, Yūjirō Ishihara, Izumi Ashikawa, Toshiyuki Ichimura, Nobuo Kaneko, Hisano Yamaoka', null, 'Saheji, a man-about-town, gets stuck at a high-class brothel when he can’t pay the bill. He makes the best of his situation by performing various tasks amidst the tumult of the end of the shogunate—but always by making sure to get a “commission” for his troubles.', 'Saheji, a man-about-town, gets stuck at a high-class brothel when he can’t pay the bill. He makes the best of his situation by performing various tasks amidst the tumult of the end of the shogunate—but always by making sure to get a “commission” for his troubles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBRGMzF2lro0Aj5S1BIugJIm2NP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125217'),
  ('346732764581770523', 'A Sunday Horse', 2016, 'Drama, Family', 'Vic Armstrong, Steve Love, Peter N. Green', 'Fred T. Kuehnert, Susan Rhinehart', 'Nikki Reed, Linda Hamilton, William Shatner, Ving Rhames, Ryan Merriman, Cassi Thomson, Deena Dill, Gary Grubbs', null, 'After a near-fatal accident, on a horse the experts thought was nothing special, a determined rider from the wrong side of the tracks defies all the odds to pursue her dreams of winning a national jumping championship.', 'After a near-fatal accident, on a horse the experts thought was nothing special, a determined rider from the wrong side of the tracks defies all the odds to pursue her dreams of winning a national jumping championship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFQYIrS32BlSDdqDx0fps4eZllc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382951'),
  ('1095609790273204724', 'A Sunday in the Country', 1984, 'Drama, Family', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Bruno de Keyzer', 'Colo Tavernier O''Hagan, Bertrand Tavernier', 'Sabine Azéma, Louis Ducreux, Michel Aumont, Monique Chaumette, Geneviève Mnich, Thomas Duval, Quentin Ogier, Katia Wostrikoff', null, 'In France, before WWI. As every Sunday, an old painter living in the country is visited by his son Gonzague, coming with his wife and his three children. Then his daugther Irene arrives. She is always in a hurry, she lives alone and does not come so often... An intimist chronicle in which what is not shown, what is guessed, is more important than how it looks, dealing with what each character expects of life.', 'In France, before WWI. As every Sunday, an old painter living in the country is visited by his son Gonzague, coming with his wife and his three children. Then his daugther Irene arrives. She is always in a hurry, she lives alone and does not come so often... An intimist chronicle in which what is not shown, what is guessed, is more important than how it looks, dealing with what each character expects of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qymxYwTuND3tiKZh5d1uKjykZ3U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42102'),
  ('1103697048751132238', 'A Super Fêmea', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Anibal Massaini Neto, Milton Rodrigues da Cunha, Oswaldo de Oliveira', 'Anibal Massaini Neto, Adriano Stuart', 'Vera Fischer, Perry Salles, Walter Stuart, Adoniran Barbosa, John Herbert, Geórgia Gomide, Líbero Ripoli Filho, Sérgio Hingst', null, 'Eva is a beautiful model who’s hired to star in a campaign to sell a marvelous new product: the male contraceptive pill. But it isn''t easy to win the confidence of its target market, since they believe it causes impotence.', 'Eva is a beautiful model who’s hired to star in a campaign to sell a marvelous new product: the male contraceptive pill. But it isn''t easy to win the confidence of its target market, since they believe it causes impotence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2R6oz6MgFKT816JnMZV0bhEmdJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81721'),
  ('5046472760793271', 'A Super Progressive Movie', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Sebastian Peart', 'Mark Nicholson, Sebastian Peart', 'Holly Valance, Pauline Hanson, Mark Nicholson, Sebastian Peart', null, 'When their rainbow malfunctions, four progressives journey beyond the insulated “Naarm Bubble” into a real world led by Prime Minister Pauline Hanson, searching for their ideology’s most powerful weapon: the Victimhood.', 'When their rainbow malfunctions, four progressives journey beyond the insulated “Naarm Bubble” into a real world led by Prime Minister Pauline Hanson, searching for their ideology’s most powerful weapon: the Victimhood.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FiHqvrXObO2RD27qdY2FrdZdlIGs.jpg', 'plex:movie:a-super-progressive-movie'),
  ('283463014063207941', 'A Swedish Love Story', 1970, 'Drama, Romance', 'Roy Andersson, Jörgen Persson', 'Roy Andersson', 'Rolf Sohlman, Ann-Sofie Kylin, Bertil Norström, Lennart Tellfelt, Anita Lindblom, Margreth Weivers, Arne Andersson, Maud Backéus', null, 'The puppy love of two teenagers is set against a backdrop of adults struggling with their own lives. As a couple in love, they don''t care about anything but themselves and seem totally unaware about everything that surrounds them.', 'The puppy love of two teenagers is set against a backdrop of adults struggling with their own lives. As a couple in love, they don''t care about anything but themselves and seem totally unaware about everything that surrounds them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNp4pLSYolObA4pVWvUW5cbIG1v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31304'),
