  ('147429501470005517', 'A Tale of Lost Times', 1964, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Aleksandr Ptushko, Samuil Rubashkin, Raisa Khairova', 'Yevgeni Shvarts, Vladimir Lifshits', 'Oleg Anofriev, Grisha Plotkin, Sergei Martinson, Zhenya Sokolov, Georgiy Vitsin, Sergei Karponosov, Irina Murzayeva, Zina Kukushkina', null, 'Four evil wizards succeeded to become young by using a time stolen from lazy kids. Now these kids who became seniors must act fast if they want to return to their real age.', 'Four evil wizards succeeded to become young by using a time stolen from lazy kids. Now these kids who became seniors must act fast if they want to return to their real age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWMzUJMItGu80kcwMO1Y5S2rJZT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20946'),
  ('695653026928400748', 'A Tale of Love and Darkness', 2015, 'Drama', 'Natalie Portman, Sławomir Idziak', 'Natalie Portman', 'Natalie Portman, Makram J. Khoury, Shira Haas, Neta Riskin, Gilad Kahana, Yonatan Shiray, Moni Moshonov, Ohad Knoller', 'PG-13', 'The story of young Amos Oz, growing up in Jerusalem in the years before Israeli statehood with his parents; his academic father, Arieh, and his dreamy, imaginative mother, Fania.', 'The story of young Amos Oz, growing up in Jerusalem in the years before Israeli statehood with his parents; his academic father, Arieh, and his dreamy, imaginative mother, Fania.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1wvj1fegZmEeFpNFMKgc0DjL6Zc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336029'),
  ('265003163026828482', 'A Tale of Love and Desire', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Leyla Bouzid, Sébastien Goepfert', 'Leyla Bouzid', 'Sami Outalbali, Zbeida Belhajamor, Diong-Kéba Tacu, Aurélia Petit, Mahia Zrouki, Bellamine Abdelmalek, Mathilde La Musse, Samir Elhakim', null, 'Ahmed, 18, is French of Algerian origin. He grew up in the Parisian suburbs. On the benches of the university, he meets Farah, a young Tunisian full of energy recently arrived from Tunis. While discovering a body of sensual and erotic Arabic literature that he never knew existed, Ahmed falls deeply in love with this girl, and although literally overwhelmed by desire, he will try to resist it.', 'Ahmed, 18, is French of Algerian origin. He grew up in the Parisian suburbs. On the benches of the university, he meets Farah, a young Tunisian full of energy recently arrived from Tunis. While discovering a body of sensual and erotic Arabic literature that he never knew existed, Ahmed falls deeply in love with this girl, and although literally overwhelmed by desire, he will try to resist it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84TEK0sWiH7bSIs1WdXpqk6GCE4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820702'),
  ('309241289716890148', 'A Tale of Mari and Three Puppies', 2007, 'Drama, Family, Adventure', 'Ryuichi Inomata, Nobuyasu Kita, Yoshikazu Ishii', 'Ako Takahashi, Yuki Kiyomoto, Kota Yamada', 'Eiichiro Funakoshi, Ryohei Hirota, Yoshikazu Ebisu, Yukijiro Hotaru, Mao Kobayashi, Akiko Matsumoto, Hiroki Miyake, Kenjiro Nashimoto', 'PG', 'The touching and dramatic tale of the relationship between a Japanese family, their dog and her three puppies, set against the backdrop of a devastating earthquake and the ensuing chaos, rescues and heroism.', 'The touching and dramatic tale of the relationship between a Japanese family, their dog and her three puppies, set against the backdrop of a devastating earthquake and the ensuing chaos, rescues and heroism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f1whweG8kJemHt4aSwYTin7pckh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125239'),
  ('134831297388562786', 'A Tale of Samurai Cooking', 2013, 'Drama, History', 'Yuzo Asahara, Masanori Inoue, Yukihiro Okimura', 'Yuzo Asahara, Yukiko Yamamuro, Michio Kashiwada', 'Aya Ueto, Kengo Kora, Kimiko Yo, Toshiyuki Nishida, Yui Natsukawa, Riko Narumi, Kenta Hamano, Hana Ebise', null, 'In this love story set in the Edo period, 27-year-old Oharu is a genius in the kitchen. Oharu attracts the attention of the master chef of the Kaga Domain, who arranges for her to marry his son and heir, 24-year-old Yasunobu. But, Yasunobu is cold to his new wife, and he''s more interested in swordplay than cookery.', 'In this love story set in the Edo period, 27-year-old Oharu is a genius in the kitchen. Oharu attracts the attention of the master chef of the Kaga Domain, who arranges for her to marry his son and heir, 24-year-old Yasunobu. But, Yasunobu is cold to his new wife, and he''s more interested in swordplay than cookery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Jdbv4Z4xbCb7z5yEbnJ5kqoF9W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208986'),
