  ('697020607310085741', 'A Tale of Three Sisters', 2019, 'Drama', 'Emre Erkmen, Özkan Yılmaz, Sinem Kanat', 'Emin Alper', 'Cemre Ebüzziya, Ece Yüksel, Helin Kandemir, Kayhan Açıkgöz, Müfit Kayacan, Kubilay Tunçer, Hilmi Özçelik, Başak Kıvılcım Ertanoğlu', null, 'A stagnant and gloomy village in the 1980s. Reyhan, Nurhan, and Havva, three sisters were sent to town as ''besleme'' (foster child and maid). Since they fail their foster parents for different reasons, they are sent back to their father''s house in their poor village. Deprived of their dreams of a better life, they try to hold on to each other.', 'A stagnant and gloomy village in the 1980s. Reyhan, Nurhan, and Havva, three sisters were sent to town as ''besleme'' (foster child and maid). Since they fail their foster parents for different reasons, they are sent back to their father''s house in their poor village. Deprived of their dreams of a better life, they try to hold on to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wltmOsIIncjRAIw8REwI0gh5Jc6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539186'),
  ('1116592949938362971', 'A Tale of Two Christmases', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jason Bourque, Andy Hodgson', 'Nancy Katz, Cylin Busby', 'Katherine Barrell, Chandler Massey, Evan Roderick, Beverley Breuer, Marissa Leong, Karee Everett, Keith MacKechnie, Sunita Prasad', 'G', 'Thanks to some Christmas magic, Emma gets to experience two different Christmases – one where she stays in the city and celebrates with a new crush and his friends, and one where she returns home for all the traditions with her family…and Drew, a longtime friend who may have feelings for her. Emma’s double holiday ultimately helps her discover what will truly make her happy in life as well as in love.', 'Thanks to some Christmas magic, Emma gets to experience two different Christmases – one where she stays in the city and celebrates with a new crush and his friends, and one where she returns home for all the traditions with her family…and Drew, a longtime friend who may have feelings for her. Emma’s double holiday ultimately helps her discover what will truly make her happy in life as well as in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2UlaSWJNZivax806OOCiY4x5jGS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028546'),
  ('1133592139264393229', 'A Tale of Two Cities', 1935, 'History, Drama, Romance, Adventure', 'Douglas Shearer, Jack Conway, Oliver T. Marsh', 'W.P. Lipscomb, S. N. Behrman', 'Ronald Colman, Elizabeth Allan, Edna May Oliver, Reginald Owen, Basil Rathbone, Blanche Yurka, Henry B. Walthall, Donald Woods', null, 'Set against the conditions leading up to the French Revolution and the Reign of Terror, French doctor Alexandre Manette serves an 18-year imprisonment in the Bastille in Paris, followed by his release to live in London with the daughter he has never met.', 'Set against the conditions leading up to the French Revolution and the Reign of Terror, French doctor Alexandre Manette serves an 18-year imprisonment in the Bastille in Paris, followed by his release to live in London with the daughter he has never met.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mO8ezngn6ZYqpCQuhXUSEtDDwos.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17831'),
