  ('370053435272683391', 'A Tale of Two Guns', 2022, 'Western', 'Justin Lee, Eamon Long', 'Justin Lee', 'Dendrie Taylor, Jennifer Wenger, Griff Furst, Edward Finlay, Ed Morrone, Randy Charach, Daniel Luján, Curt Lambert', null, 'In the lawless West, The Cowboys, a notorious brotherhood of killers and thieves, reigned over the land with brutal fists and fast guns. Fate had finally caught up with them and now the merciless gang has but a single surviving member. When a deputized gunslinger takes up the call to hunt down the last Cowboy, the chase is on and the bullets fly, and only one of these hardened men can survive.', 'In the lawless West, The Cowboys, a notorious brotherhood of killers and thieves, reigned over the land with brutal fists and fast guns. Fate had finally caught up with them and now the merciless gang has but a single surviving member. When a deputized gunslinger takes up the call to hunt down the last Cowboy, the chase is on and the bullets fly, and only one of these hardened men can survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwCUleEzLjSLNMs9rRNP5FRC4pA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:940175'),
  ('615942008059151848', 'A Tale of Two Kitties', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Tedd Pierce, Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Two alley cats, Babbitt and Catsello, decide to make a meal out of Orson as he sleeps in his nest atop a telephone pole. The gullible (and loud) Catsello is repeatedly gulled into trying to "get the bird," earning a variety of thrashings from the casually murderous little canary. Catsello finally resorts to an air strike (with a pair of wooden boards for wings), but it''s wartime, and Orson has the cat blasted out of the sky by anti-aircraft guns.', 'Two alley cats, Babbitt and Catsello, decide to make a meal out of Orson as he sleeps in his nest atop a telephone pole. The gullible (and loud) Catsello is repeatedly gulled into trying to "get the bird," earning a variety of thrashings from the casually murderous little canary. Catsello finally resorts to an air strike (with a pair of wooden boards for wings), but it''s wartime, and Orson has the cat blasted out of the sky by anti-aircraft guns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62H79iSWCmMijgdt6n2j0Xf0r81.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83676'),
  ('543554365099665202', 'A Tale of Two Sisters', 2003, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery', 'Lee Mo-gae, Kim Jee-woon, Lee So-yeong', 'Kim Jee-woon', 'Lim Soo-jung, Moon Geun-young, Yum Jung-ah, Kim Kap-soo, Park Mi-hyeon, Lee Seung-bi, Woo Ki-hong, Lee Dae-yeon', 'R', 'Two sisters return home after a stay in a mental institution, only to face disturbing events and a strained relationship with their stepmother. As eerie occurrences unfold, dark family secrets begin to surface, blurring the line between reality and nightmare.', 'Two sisters return home after a stay in a mental institution, only to face disturbing events and a strained relationship with their stepmother. As eerie occurrences unfold, dark family secrets begin to surface, blurring the line between reality and nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3exwhwyGE0NnHJ3lFQ7eXoBSkH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4552'),
  ('936702059329179837', 'A Tale of Winter', 1992, 'Drama, Romance', 'Éric Rohmer, Luc Pagès, Philippe Renaud', 'Éric Rohmer', 'Charlotte Véry, Frédéric van den Driessche, Michel Voletti, Hervé Furic, Ava Loraschi, Christiane Desbois, Rosette, Jean-Luc Revol', null, 'Felicie and Charles have a whirlwind holiday romance. Due to a mix-up on addresses they lose contact, and five years later at Christmas-time Felicie is living with her mother in a cold Paris with a daughter as a reminder of that long-ago summer. For male companionship she oscillates between hairdresser Maxence and the intellectual Loic, but seems unable to commit to either as the memory of Charles and what might have been hangs over everything.', 'Felicie and Charles have a whirlwind holiday romance. Due to a mix-up on addresses they lose contact, and five years later at Christmas-time Felicie is living with her mother in a cold Paris with a daughter as a reminder of that long-ago summer. For male companionship she oscillates between hairdresser Maxence and the intellectual Loic, but seems unable to commit to either as the memory of Charles and what might have been hangs over everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHmgUZXl7qkgu97E5ruDetLyDPt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10241'),
  ('723105170640624642', 'A Talking Picture', 2003, 'Drama, History', 'Manoel de Oliveira, Emmanuel Machuel', 'Manoel de Oliveira', 'Leonor Silveira, Filipa de Almeida, John Malkovich, Catherine Deneuve, Stefania Sandrelli, Irene Papas, Luis Miguel Cintra, Ricardo Trêpa', null, 'A meditation on civilization. July, 2001: friends wave as a cruise ship departs Lisbon for Mediterranean ports and the Indian Ocean. On board and on day trips in Marseilles, Pompeii, Athens, Istanbul, and Cairo, a professor tells her young daughter about myth, history, religion, and wars. Men approach her; she''s cool, on her way to her husband in Bombay. After Cairo, for two evenings divided by a stop in Aden, the captain charms three successful, famous (and childless) women, who talk with wit and intellect, each understanding the others'' native tongue, a European union. The captain asks mother and child to join them. He gives the girl a gift. Helena sings. Life can be sweet.', 'A meditation on civilization. July, 2001: friends wave as a cruise ship departs Lisbon for Mediterranean ports and the Indian Ocean. On board and on day trips in Marseilles, Pompeii, Athens, Istanbul, and Cairo, a professor tells her young daughter about myth, history, religion, and wars. Men approach her; she''s cool, on her way to her husband in Bombay. After Cairo, for two evenings divided by a stop in Aden, the captain charms three successful, famous (and childless) women, who talk with wit and intellect, each understanding the others'' native tongue, a European union. The captain asks mother and child to join them. He gives the girl a gift. Helena sings. Life can be sweet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVEWev0owMP6IYV1Y1wjyv0CkZH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95536'),
  ('101592371797716640', 'A Taste of Blood', 1967, 'Horror', 'Herschell Gordon Lewis, Allison Louise Downe', 'Allison Louise Downe, Donald Stanford', 'Bill Rogers, Elizabeth Wilkinson, William Kerwin, Lawrence Tobin, Ted Schell, Otto Schlessinger, Eleanor Vaill, Herschell Gordon Lewis', null, 'A businessman becomes a vampire after drinking brandy laced with vampire blood and sets out on an odyssey of killing Dracula''s executioners'' descendants.', 'A businessman becomes a vampire after drinking brandy laced with vampire blood and sets out on an odyssey of killing Dracula''s executioners'' descendants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsx7PlGE47iFPL8IitsXBMrnG9b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121143'),
  ('229487065778105381', 'A Taste of Christmas', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Juan Hernández, Damián Romay', 'Amy Katherine Taylor, Kelly Peters', 'Anni Krueger, Gilles Marini, Nia Vardalos, Andrew Brodeur, Emma Myers, Charles Green, Mara Hall, Lauren LaVera', null, 'When Natalie learns her cousin Francesca must cancel the Christmas Eve opening of her new Italian restaurant, Natalie’s heart goes out to all of the guests who were planning on attending. Since no one should be alone on Christmas, Natalie decides to make the opening happen any way she can. However, the attractive but pessimistic Chef Stefano believes it’s impossible – there are only three days until Christmas! But Natalie insists that problems are just opportunities in disguise and soon she convinces Stefano that they can do it. At first, these opposites do not attract, but feelings begin to change when they find themselves working side-by-side. With Stefano’s help Natalie learns that cooking, like Christmas, isn’t about perfection…it’s about sharing it with the ones you love.', 'When Natalie learns her cousin Francesca must cancel the Christmas Eve opening of her new Italian restaurant, Natalie’s heart goes out to all of the guests who were planning on attending. Since no one should be alone on Christmas, Natalie decides to make the opening happen any way she can. However, the attractive but pessimistic Chef Stefano believes it’s impossible – there are only three days until Christmas! But Natalie insists that problems are just opportunities in disguise and soon she convinces Stefano that they can do it. At first, these opposites do not attract, but feelings begin to change when they find themselves working side-by-side. With Stefano’s help Natalie learns that cooking, like Christmas, isn’t about perfection…it’s about sharing it with the ones you love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LlpRHEgNa4VzuOjkKU7ZRQ40NG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744938'),
  ('488073069875970620', 'A Taste of Evil', 1971, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Horror', 'John Llewellyn Moxey, Wesley Barry, Archie R. Dalzell', 'Jimmy Sangster', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Barbara Parkins, Roddy McDowall, William Windom, Arthur O''Connell, Bing Russell, Dawn Frame', null, 'On her way home from a stay at a mental institution after a traumatic rape, a woman realizes that someone is deliberately trying to drive her insane.', 'On her way home from a stay at a mental institution after a traumatic rape, a woman realizes that someone is deliberately trying to drive her insane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gilMh1rLzfLE66Gvd6ALmeFcL82.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184804'),
  ('5177992644980124', 'A Taste of Honey', 1961, 'Drama', 'Tony Richardson, Walter Lassally, Peter Yates', 'Shelagh Delaney, Tony Richardson', 'Rita Tushingham, Murray Melvin, Paul Danquah, Dora Bryan, Robert Stephens, Michael Bilton, Eunice Black, David Boliver', null, 'While out to avoid spending time with her narcissistic and promiscuous mother, sixteen-year-old Jo has a brief affair that leaves her pregnant and abandoned. When her mother remarries, Jo''s only support becomes her friend Geoffrey, a homosexual.', 'While out to avoid spending time with her narcissistic and promiscuous mother, sixteen-year-old Jo has a brief affair that leaves her pregnant and abandoned. When her mother remarries, Jo''s only support becomes her friend Geoffrey, a homosexual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5psrZNVZ9E6Eck7OtpO47A8zTbQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25062'),
  ('822720962152151526', 'A Taste of Hunger', 2021, 'Romance, Drama', 'Christoffer Boe', 'Christoffer Boe, Tobias Lindholm', 'Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Charlie Gustafsson, Katrine Greis-Rosenthal, Dag Malmberg, Nicolas Bro, Flora Augusta, August Christian Høyer-Kruse-Vinkel, Maj-Britt Mathiesen', null, 'Maggie and Carsten love each other, they have two wonderful children and run their own gourmet restaurant; Malus. They want it all. And they have it all. Almost. They are missing the coveted Michelin Star. It has been their dream, on which they gambled everything to win. One day Carsten receives a letter saying that his wife loves somebody else. But who sent the letter and why? In their continuous passion and pursuit for the ultimate recognition, they forget that the meals of life are best enjoyed together.', 'Maggie and Carsten love each other, they have two wonderful children and run their own gourmet restaurant; Malus. They want it all. And they have it all. Almost. They are missing the coveted Michelin Star. It has been their dream, on which they gambled everything to win. One day Carsten receives a letter saying that his wife loves somebody else. But who sent the letter and why? In their continuous passion and pursuit for the ultimate recognition, they forget that the meals of life are best enjoyed together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMy7XXgivypcXjPUeLiYOdVxX8f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:766105'),
  ('18064899715239524', 'A Taste of Ink', 2017, 'Drama', 'Morgan Simon, Julien Poupard', 'Morgan Simon', 'Kévin Azaïs, Monia Chokri, Nathan Willcocks, Julien Krug, Constance Jérôme, Selim Aymard, Cedric Laban, Delphine Gleize', null, 'Vincent, still of tender age, has already tattooed most of his body and hoarsened his voice with his post-hardcore band – his way of venting his frustrations and desires. Ever since his mother died, he shares his time between Porte de Clignancourt and Bastille, between a piercer job he is unhappy with and his fishmonger father, Hervé, who is trying to start a new life with a younger woman named Julia. Vincent is initially appalled by the woman, with whom his father has ‘betrayed’ his mother, but the more they get to know each other, the more he becomes intrigued by the beautiful and empathetic woman. Unlike his father, she shows interest in him, even attending one of his gigs. What starts out as a potential way of reconciling with his father soon implodes.', 'Vincent, still of tender age, has already tattooed most of his body and hoarsened his voice with his post-hardcore band – his way of venting his frustrations and desires. Ever since his mother died, he shares his time between Porte de Clignancourt and Bastille, between a piercer job he is unhappy with and his fishmonger father, Hervé, who is trying to start a new life with a younger woman named Julia. Vincent is initially appalled by the woman, with whom his father has ‘betrayed’ his mother, but the more they get to know each other, the more he becomes intrigued by the beautiful and empathetic woman. Unlike his father, she shows interest in him, even attending one of his gigs. What starts out as a potential way of reconciling with his father soon implodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mi5YqA8DNBfmZMq0LesPaYshIuu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416786'),
  ('793008045559321756', 'A Taste of Killing and Romance', 1994, 'Action, Crime, Romance, Thriller', 'Veronica Chan, Fan Chuen-Yam, Ho Tim', null, 'Andy Lau, Anita Yuen Wing-Yee, Mark Cheng Ho-Nam, Christine Ng Wing-Mei, Waise Lee Chi-Hung, John Ching Tung, Henry Fong Ping, William Duen Wai-Lun', null, 'An experienced assassin considers giving up his profession when he meets his society''s newest recruit. He soon falls in love with this female assassin who donates her fees to the church. Soon the couple are being chased both by the police and the society which hires them.', 'An experienced assassin considers giving up his profession when he meets his society''s newest recruit. He soon falls in love with this female assassin who donates her fees to the church. Soon the couple are being chased both by the police and the society which hires them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t0NkxkgPeEqyzbvw4IGv4XfttZQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191563'),
  ('383285201572655171', 'A Taxi Driver in New York', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Alberto Sordi, Giuseppe Ruzzolini, Giuseppe Pedersoli', 'Rodolfo Sonego, Alberto Sordi', 'Alberto Sordi, Anna Longhi, Dom DeLuise, George Gaynes, Buffy Dee, Bruno Corazzari, Sasha D''Arc, Egidio Termine', null, 'The Roman taxi driver Pietro Marchetti finds himself to witness a mafia crime. Having to testify at the trial, he is checked by the police, especially when he has to go to the United States to attend the graduation of his son Francesco.', 'The Roman taxi driver Pietro Marchetti finds himself to witness a mafia crime. Having to testify at the trial, he is checked by the police, especially when he has to go to the United States to attend the graduation of his son Francesco.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhAIl7dhovwle16gW9jkXUcqas.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82826'),
  ('265830358248795504', 'A Taxing Woman', 1987, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jūzō Itami, Yonezō Maeda', 'Jūzō Itami', 'Nobuko Miyamoto, Tsutomu Yamazaki, Masahiko Tsugawa, Yasuo Daichi, Kinzō Sakura, Hajime Asô, Kiriko Shimizu, Kazuyo Matsui', null, 'Intrepid tax investigator Ryoko Itakura sets her sights on the mysterious and philandering Hideki Gondo, a suspected millionaire and proprietor of a thriving chain of seedy hourly hotels, who has for years succeeded at hiding the true extent of his assets from the Japanese authorities. Itakura and Gondo soon find themselves engaged in a complicated, satirical battle of wits.', 'Intrepid tax investigator Ryoko Itakura sets her sights on the mysterious and philandering Hideki Gondo, a suspected millionaire and proprietor of a thriving chain of seedy hourly hotels, who has for years succeeded at hiding the true extent of his assets from the Japanese authorities. Itakura and Gondo soon find themselves engaged in a complicated, satirical battle of wits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LZaAKWKIp2oAncEoQEgXlMiF0f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42011'),
  ('951901822376665500', 'A Taxing Woman''s Return', 1988, 'Comedy, Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Jūzō Itami, Yonezō Maeda', 'Jūzō Itami', 'Rentaro Mikuni, Nobuko Miyamoto, Toru Masuoka, Masahiko Tsugawa, Tetsuro Tamba, Yasuo Daichi, Kinzō Sakura, Yoriko Doguchi', null, 'Ryōko Itakura returns as the tough-as-nails government taxing agent. This time she must figure out a way to expose a fanatical religious cult lead by a corrupt sociopath.', 'Ryōko Itakura returns as the tough-as-nails government taxing agent. This time she must figure out a way to expose a fanatical religious cult lead by a corrupt sociopath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MaLVFMSISfG0SAJQubBL7LK69A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41962'),
  ('8286738481679027', 'A Teacher', 2013, 'Drama', 'Andrew Droz Palermo, Hannah Fidell', 'Hannah Fidell', 'Lindsay Burdge, Will Brittain, Jennifer Prediger, Jonny Mars, Julie Dell Phillips, Chris Doubek, Michael J. Wilson, Hannah Dannelly', 'NR', 'Diana Watts, a high school teacher in Austin, Texas, is in the midst of an affair with one of her students, Eric Tull. As the reality of their situation forces itself upon them, Diana puts the relationship on hold. It’s only a matter of time before she gives in again to her desire; this time even more recklessly than before.', 'Diana Watts, a high school teacher in Austin, Texas, is in the midst of an affair with one of her students, Eric Tull. As the reality of their situation forces itself upon them, Diana puts the relationship on hold. It’s only a matter of time before she gives in again to her desire; this time even more recklessly than before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqARjEtNutJOTMnLhB4HtLYT4Vb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158884'),
  ('111036449916911638', 'A Teacher of Singing', 1968, 'Animation', 'Anatoliy Petrov', 'Roza Khusnutdinova', null, null, 'Hippo came to the teacher of singing, but all the efforts of the maestro do not help (neither hearing nor voice). It was necessary for the student to simply swallow the teacher, and he sang with a beautiful, alien voice.', 'Hippo came to the teacher of singing, but all the efforts of the maestro do not help (neither hearing nor voice). It was necessary for the student to simply swallow the teacher, and he sang with a beautiful, alien voice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncBX8rm3qODJQL2rC98k2YlYuwy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450168'),
  ('610566692605417410', 'A Tear in the Sky', 2022, 'Documentary, Mystery', 'Caroline Cory', 'Caroline Cory', 'William Shatner, Michio Kaku, Travis Taylor, Kevin Day, Gary Voorhis, John B. Alexander, Kevin Knuth, Matthew Szydagis', null, 'A Tear in the Sky takes you on an unprecedented journey into the UAP/UFO phenomenon as we follow a team of world-renowned experts, scientists, and military personnel who will attempt to unravel the UAP/UFO mysteries using state-of-the-art, military-grade equipment, and technology. While the UFO phenomenon has existed since the dawn of recorded history, very little scientific research is accessible to the public. Most of the serious research is conducted by various governments and militaries across the planet; this film is a documentary on how a team of military veterans, scientists, and researchers come together and launch an investigation into this fascinating world of the unknown while providing the data and results to the public.', 'A Tear in the Sky takes you on an unprecedented journey into the UAP/UFO phenomenon as we follow a team of world-renowned experts, scientists, and military personnel who will attempt to unravel the UAP/UFO mysteries using state-of-the-art, military-grade equipment, and technology. While the UFO phenomenon has existed since the dawn of recorded history, very little scientific research is accessible to the public. Most of the serious research is conducted by various governments and militaries across the planet; this film is a documentary on how a team of military veterans, scientists, and researchers come together and launch an investigation into this fascinating world of the unknown while providing the data and results to the public.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDnnHlhTCd70hUihcoeHYIDNyci.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:959668'),
  ('549709165789412358', 'A Terra-Cotta Warrior', 1989, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Lee San-Yip, Peter Pau Tak-Hai, Tony Ching Siu-Tung', 'Lilian Lee Bik-Wah', 'Zhang Yimou, Gong Li, Yu Rongguang, Lu Shuming, Zhang Chunzhong, Wu Tianming, David Cheung, Choi Hin-Cheung', null, 'An awakened immortal warrior struggles between defending the emperor and the actress he believes to be his love of old.', 'An awakened immortal warrior struggles between defending the emperor and the actress he believes to be his love of old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgGZrUyogyWDUy2e2EOvkdMg9gN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96466'),
  ('611210861305495070', 'A Terrible Night', 1896, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A man tries to get a good night''s sleep, but is disturbed by a giant spider that leaps onto his bed, and a battle ensues in hilarious comic fashion.', 'A man tries to get a good night''s sleep, but is disturbed by a giant spider that leaps onto his bed, and a battle ensues in hilarious comic fashion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7UDpBTe9mSwGeHUo5DZ2VmUWZMy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104462'),
  ('347547740874204960', 'À tes côtés', 2021, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Gilles Paquet-Brenner', 'Gilles Paquet-Brenner, Jarry, Simon Astier', 'Jarry, Marie-Anne Chazel, Didier Bourdon, Charlotte Gabris, Terence Telle, Matthias Van Khache, Eric Pucheu, Delphine Baril', null, 'The story of a father and son who live in polar opposite worlds and seem to be constantly at odds. But life brings city-dwelling Anthony back to the side of Marcel, his ailing wine-grower father.', 'The story of a father and son who live in polar opposite worlds and seem to be constantly at odds. But life brings city-dwelling Anthony back to the side of Marcel, his ailing wine-grower father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRv8rs8YfHGzrfvXv2G0QXeHuXD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:845182'),
  ('1062131330408764195', 'A Texas Funeral', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'William Blake Herron', 'William Blake Herron', 'Robert Patrick, Jane Adams, Martin Sheen, Chris Noth, Olivia D''Abo, Grace Zabriskie, Joanne Whalley, Mona Lee Fultz', null, 'It''s 1968 and the Whit clan are reuniting for the burial of Grandpa Sparta. But Sparta still has some secrets to reveal to his family and wisdom to impart to his grandson.', 'It''s 1968 and the Whit clan are reuniting for the burial of Grandpa Sparta. But Sparta still has some secrets to reveal to his family and wisdom to impart to his grandson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymou9DzBk1jjmacMFira4srikPu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49119'),
  ('949419974784497461', 'A Thief''s Daughter', 2019, 'Drama', 'Belén Funes, Marta Ramírez, Neus Ollé', 'Belén Funes, Marçal Cebrian', 'Eduard Fernández, Greta Fernández, Àlex Monner, Tomás Martín, Adela Silvestre, Borja Espinosa, Frank Feys, Daniel Medrán', null, 'Sara has been alone all her life. She’s 22, has a baby, and wants to form a normal family with her young brother and the father of her child. Her own father, Manuel, decides to come back into their lives after years of absence and his release from prison. Sara knows he’s the main obstacle to her plans and she makes a difficult decision: to distance him from herself and her brother.', 'Sara has been alone all her life. She’s 22, has a baby, and wants to form a normal family with her young brother and the father of her child. Her own father, Manuel, decides to come back into their lives after years of absence and his release from prison. Sara knows he’s the main obstacle to her plans and she makes a difficult decision: to distance him from herself and her brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrbI8HBv3yD7DKMcbO3tHCktJmM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:620639'),
  ('1007803740314228087', 'A Thin Line Between Love and Hate', 1996, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Martin Lawrence, Francis Kenny', 'Kenny Buford, Kim Bass, Martin Lawrence', 'Lynn Whitfield, Martin Lawrence, Regina King, Della Reese, Bobby Brown, Malinda Williams, Daryl Mitchell, Roger E. Mosley', 'R', 'Nightclub manager Darnell Wright is a perpetual playboy who is almost as devoted to his job as he is to the pursuit of beautiful women. After he sets his sights on the ultra-classy Brandi Web, he launches an all-out assault to win her heart. Ultimately, charm, lust and passion prevail, but Darnell learns the hard way that when you play, you pay. Brandi is much harder to get rid of than she was to get--especially when she realizes that she has a rival vying for Darnell''s affection. When he finally decides to call it quits, Brandi becomes an obsessed femme fatale stalking the new love of her life.', 'Nightclub manager Darnell Wright is a perpetual playboy who is almost as devoted to his job as he is to the pursuit of beautiful women. After he sets his sights on the ultra-classy Brandi Web, he launches an all-out assault to win her heart. Ultimately, charm, lust and passion prevail, but Darnell learns the hard way that when you play, you pay. Brandi is much harder to get rid of than she was to get--especially when she realizes that she has a rival vying for Darnell''s affection. When he finally decides to call it quits, Brandi becomes an obsessed femme fatale stalking the new love of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wo9AGi5LlFXZUj8MDPq3eKCUMpd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28121'),
  ('661209784114410794', 'A Thirsty World', 2012, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Baptiste Rouget-Luchaire, Thierry Piantanida', 'Thierry Piantanida, Baptiste Rouget-Luchaire', 'Yann Arthus-Bertrand, Catarina de Albuquerque, Vandana Shiva', null, 'Today, against a backdrop of sharply increasing demand, growth in the world population and the growing impact of an unsettled climate, water has become one of the most precious natural resources of our planet.', 'Today, against a backdrop of sharply increasing demand, growth in the world population and the growing impact of an unsettled climate, water has become one of the most precious natural resources of our planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g80zJJNlUExkA6SnKZyYikzHGba.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112931'),
  ('24140830826219807', 'A Thorn in the Heart', 1986, 'Drama', 'Luigi Kuveiller, Alberto Lattuada', 'Alberto Lattuada, Franco Ferrini, Enrico Oldoini', 'Anthony Delon, Sophie Duez, Antonella Lualdi, Gastone Moschin, Leonardo Treviglio, Carola Stagnaro, Angelo Infanti', null, 'Guido, a young idler with a gambling problem falls in love with Caterina a mysterious girl. A torrid affair follows thereafter. When Caterina leaves him Guido investigates her past and learns she had a lot of lovers.', 'Guido, a young idler with a gambling problem falls in love with Caterina a mysterious girl. A torrid affair follows thereafter. When Caterina leaves him Guido investigates her past and learns she had a lot of lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z8zXGfTujxyxqXSATjzu9599xaD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218210'),
  ('630900634880138928', 'A Thousand Acres', 1997, 'Drama, Family', 'Jocelyn Moorhouse, Tak Fujimoto', 'Laura Jones', 'Michelle Pfeiffer, Jessica Lange, Jason Robards, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Colin Firth, Keith Carradine, Kevin Anderson, Pat Hingle', 'R', 'The lives of an Iowa farmer''s three daughters are shattered when he suddenly decides to bequeath them the family''s fertile farm.', 'The lives of an Iowa farmer''s three daughters are shattered when he suddenly decides to bequeath them the family''s fertile farm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7tsW4oUi7hHbpNtFZdMQEBj42g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66588'),
  ('57860208918791313', 'A Thousand and One', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'A.V. Rockwell, Clarence McLay, Eric K. Yue', 'A.V. Rockwell', 'Teyana Taylor, William Catlett, Josiah Cross, Aven Courtney, Aaron Kingsley Adetola, Terri Abney, Delissa Reynolds, Amelia Workman', 'R', 'Struggling but unapologetically living on her own terms, Inez is moving from shelter to shelter in mid-1990s New York City. With her 6-year-old son Terry in foster care and unable to leave him again, she kidnaps him so they can build their life together. As the years go by, their family grows and Terry becomes a smart yet quiet teenager, but the secret that has defined their lives threatens to destroy the home they have so improbably built.', 'Struggling but unapologetically living on her own terms, Inez is moving from shelter to shelter in mid-1990s New York City. With her 6-year-old son Terry in foster care and unable to leave him again, she kidnaps him so they can build their life together. As the years go by, their family grows and Terry becomes a smart yet quiet teenager, but the secret that has defined their lives threatens to destroy the home they have so improbably built.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yW97MlBddOeiw17zUSf2iWvOmkr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:855263'),
  ('4474079927893323', 'A Thousand and One Nights', 1945, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Alfred E. Green', 'Jack Henley, Richard English, Wilfred H. Petitt', 'Evelyn Keyes, Phil Silvers, Adele Jergens, Cornel Wilde, Dusty Anderson, Dennis Hoey, Philip Van Zandt, Gus Schilling', null, 'On the run after being found sweet-talking the Sultan''s daughter, Aladdin comes upon a lamp which, when rubbed, summons up Babs the genie. He uses it to return as a visiting prince asking for the princess''s hand. Unfortunately for him, the sultan''s wicked twin brother has secretly usurped the throne, someone else is after the lamp for his own ends, and Babs has taken a shine to Aladdin herself and is bent on wrecking his endeavours.', 'On the run after being found sweet-talking the Sultan''s daughter, Aladdin comes upon a lamp which, when rubbed, summons up Babs the genie. He uses it to return as a visiting prince asking for the princess''s hand. Unfortunately for him, the sultan''s wicked twin brother has secretly usurped the throne, someone else is after the lamp for his own ends, and Babs has taken a shine to Aladdin herself and is bent on wrecking his endeavours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9TkJCciogYkJwU6P1GxdeIIrvES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90984'),
  ('408228724785822152', 'A Thousand and One Nights', 1969, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Eiichi Yamamoto, Akira Tsuchiya, Atsumi Tashiro', 'Osamu Tezuka', 'Yukio Aoshima, Kyôko Kishida, Hiroshi Akutagawa, Haruko Katō, Isao Hashizume, Noboru Mitsuya, Asao Koike, Sachiko Ito', null, 'Aldin, a vagabond water vendor, embarks of a series of fantastical and tragic misadventures through the Middle East in search of love, fortune, and power.', 'Aldin, a vagabond water vendor, embarks of a series of fantastical and tragic misadventures through the Middle East in search of love, fortune, and power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjBg2W3UCxZIr5SnXyfgs9rTUqd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85398'),
  ('977750260834240981', 'A Thousand and One Nights', 1974, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Karel Zeman, Bohuslav Pikhart', 'Karel Zeman', 'Jan Tříska', null, 'Five different exploits of Sinbad the sailor where he gets mixed up with the pretty daughters of exotic potentates, with powerful monsters that threaten his existence, and with all sorts of teeming jungle life.', 'Five different exploits of Sinbad the sailor where he gets mixed up with the pretty daughters of exotic potentates, with powerful monsters that threaten his existence, and with all sorts of teeming jungle life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5gGWmabwXzfaaPIfpHBckBMbc1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46657'),
  ('444152265741519808', 'A Thousand Billion Dollars', 1982, 'Thriller', 'Henri Verneuil, Jean-Louis Picavet, Michèle Aragon', 'Henri Verneuil', 'Patrick Dewaere, Michel Auclair, Caroline Cellier, Charles Denner, Anny Duperey, Jeanne Moreau, Mel Ferrer, Jean-Laurent Cochet', null, 'A young journalist uncovers an assassination disguised as a suicide, linked to an American multinational seeking to dominate French industries. Determined to expose the truth, he races against time to gather evidence before more lives—and his own—are at stake.', 'A young journalist uncovers an assassination disguised as a suicide, linked to an American multinational seeking to dominate French industries. Determined to expose the truth, he races against time to gather evidence before more lives—and his own—are at stake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9v3jDcSKto0gEqy4jjrBDyGm98H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4023'),
  ('789374257864048594', 'A Thousand Clouds of Peace Fence the Sky, Love; Your Being Love Will Never End', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Julián Hernández', 'Julián Hernández', 'Juan Carlos Ortuño, Salvador Alvarez, Gloria Andrade, Llane Fragoso, Manuel Grapain Zaquelarez, Martha Gómez, Rosa María Gómez, Marcos Hernández', null, 'Gerardo, a 17-year old guy has just finished his relationship with Bruno and starts wandering hopeless through the streets of the city. In his wandering he''s tortured by images: each masculine body he sees reminds him of his lover. Gerardo is determined to keep what''s left of his dying love. The only comfort he has is a letter that Bruno left him with his boss.', 'Gerardo, a 17-year old guy has just finished his relationship with Bruno and starts wandering hopeless through the streets of the city. In his wandering he''s tortured by images: each masculine body he sees reminds him of his lover. Gerardo is determined to keep what''s left of his dying love. The only comfort he has is a letter that Bruno left him with his boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8M590EVyDKZEmDmZwupjX8C1Raq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163676'),
  ('458505963265270505', 'A Thousand Clowns', 1965, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Dan Eriksen, Fred Coe, Arthur J. Ornitz', 'Herb Gardner', 'Jason Robards, Barry Gordon, Barbara Harris, Martin Balsam, Gene Saks, William Daniels, John McMartin, Philip Bruns', null, 'Twelve-year-old Nick lives with his Uncle Murray, a Mr.Micawber-like Dickensian character who keeps hoping something won''t turn up. What turns up is a social worker, who falls in love with Murray and a bit in love with Nick. As the child welfare people try to force Murray to become a conventional man (as the price they demand for allowing him to keep Nick), the nephew, who until now has gloried in his Uncle''s iconoclastic approach to life, tries to play mediator. But when he succeeds, he is alarmed by the uncle''s willingness to cave in to society in order to save the relationship.', 'Twelve-year-old Nick lives with his Uncle Murray, a Mr.Micawber-like Dickensian character who keeps hoping something won''t turn up. What turns up is a social worker, who falls in love with Murray and a bit in love with Nick. As the child welfare people try to force Murray to become a conventional man (as the price they demand for allowing him to keep Nick), the nephew, who until now has gloried in his Uncle''s iconoclastic approach to life, tries to play mediator. But when he succeeds, he is alarmed by the uncle''s willingness to cave in to society in order to save the relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tXPsmtVy3T5Whz20LwiscprCdCT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42731'),
  ('775736296115685951', 'A Thousand Days', 2023, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ricky Lionardi, Muslimaturrosyiidah, Stanley Saklil', 'Khalid Kashogi, Agasyah Karim', 'Mikha Tambayong, Gisellma Firmansyah, Rio Dewanto, Marthino Lio, Givina Lukita, Agla Artalidia, Karina Suwandi, Maryam Supraba', null, 'Sri accepts a generous job offer and tasked to perform a cleansing ritual for Dela Atmojo, an unconscious girl who is suffering from the hex of 1000-days. The terror begins when her coworker neglects to finish the ritual. Failing to perform until the 1000th day will result in their demise.', 'Sri accepts a generous job offer and tasked to perform a cleansing ritual for Dela Atmojo, an unconscious girl who is suffering from the hex of 1000-days. The terror begins when her coworker neglects to finish the ritual. Failing to perform until the 1000th day will result in their demise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7B1r0hHoNbQ3pyKyAbjub6F3L2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1052865'),
  ('810513290640241658', 'A Thousand Lines', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Torsten Breuer, Michael Herbig', 'Hermann Florin, Juan Moreno', 'Elyas M''Barek, Jonas Nay, Michael Ostrowski, Michael Maertens, Jörg Hartmann, Marie Burchard, Sara Fazilat, Kurt Krömer', null, 'Star reporter Lars Bogenius is a respected journalist and knows how to wow his readers and critics with emotional reportage. Emotional, realistic and moving, his style regularly promises to win him the industry''s most coveted awards. His publishing house is also grateful to the exceptional journalist, because the paper''s numbers are sinking and are being cushioned by Bogenius'' reportage, among other things. Everything sounds too good to be true - at least that''s the opinion of freelance journalist Juan Romero, who takes on the inconsistencies and looks deeper behind Bogenius'' research and reportage. It''s a dangerous plan that faces numerous obstacles. But what he discovers turns out to be the biggest journalism scandal in Germany.', 'Star reporter Lars Bogenius is a respected journalist and knows how to wow his readers and critics with emotional reportage. Emotional, realistic and moving, his style regularly promises to win him the industry''s most coveted awards. His publishing house is also grateful to the exceptional journalist, because the paper''s numbers are sinking and are being cushioned by Bogenius'' reportage, among other things. Everything sounds too good to be true - at least that''s the opinion of freelance journalist Juan Romero, who takes on the inconsistencies and looks deeper behind Bogenius'' research and reportage. It''s a dangerous plan that faces numerous obstacles. But what he discovers turns out to be the biggest journalism scandal in Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzH9z7iqvSS4EzwYekTlIYucOuH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:932498'),
  ('728166580648694320', 'A Thousand Pleasures', 1968, 'Horror', 'Michael Findlay, Roberta Findlay', 'Berla L. Moke', 'Janet Banzet, Uta Erickson, Michael Findlay, Linda Boyce, Kim Lewid, Donna Stone, John Amero, Roberta Findlay', null, 'Henpecked misogynist Richard Davis murders his shrewish wife and goes out to dispose of her corpse. However, things go awry for Richard after he''s abducted by a pair of insane lesbians who take him to their house where they keep a grown woman called Baby in a crib.', 'Henpecked misogynist Richard Davis murders his shrewish wife and goes out to dispose of her corpse. However, things go awry for Richard after he''s abducted by a pair of insane lesbians who take him to their house where they keep a grown woman called Baby in a crib.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksdzgW69czxn1U2DWWivy24n4z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128400'),
  ('1112097109386292262', 'A Thousand Times Good Night', 2013, 'Drama', 'Erik Poppe', 'Jan Trygve Røyneland, Harald Rosenløw-Eeg, Erik Poppe', 'Juliette Binoche, Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Lauryn Canny, Adrianna Cramer Curtis, Maria Doyle Kennedy, Larry Mullen Jr., Mads Ousdal, Chloë Annett', 'NR', 'On assignment while photographing a female suicide bomber in Kabul, Rebecca – one of the world’s top war photojournalists - gets badly hurt. Back home, another bomb drops as her husband and daughters give her an ultimatum: her work or her family.', 'On assignment while photographing a female suicide bomber in Kabul, Rebecca – one of the world’s top war photojournalists - gets badly hurt. Back home, another bomb drops as her husband and daughters give her an ultimatum: her work or her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6hchdUV8B13QyIv2Pb8ohQbyMJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212606'),
  ('309767298722661606', 'A Thousand Words', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Brian Robbins, Clark Mathis, Lars P. Winther', 'Steve Koren', 'Eddie Murphy, Kerry Washington, Cliff Curtis, Clark Duke, Allison Janney, Emanuel Ragsdale, Ruby Dee, Alain Chabat', 'PG-13', 'Jack McCall is a fast-talking literary agent, who can close any deal, any time, any way. He has set his sights on New Age guru Dr. Sinja for his own selfish purposes. But Dr. Sinja is on to him, and Jack’s life comes unglued after a magical Bodhi tree mysteriously appears in his backyard. With every word Jack speaks, a leaf falls from the tree and he realizes that when the last leaf falls, both he and the tree are toast. Words have never failed Jack McCall, but now he’s got to stop talking and conjure up some outrageous ways to communicate or he’s a goner.', 'Jack McCall is a fast-talking literary agent, who can close any deal, any time, any way. He has set his sights on New Age guru Dr. Sinja for his own selfish purposes. But Dr. Sinja is on to him, and Jack’s life comes unglued after a magical Bodhi tree mysteriously appears in his backyard. With every word Jack speaks, a leaf falls from the tree and he realizes that when the last leaf falls, both he and the tree are toast. Words have never failed Jack McCall, but now he’s got to stop talking and conjure up some outrageous ways to communicate or he’s a goner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hSxVSMHrW3epffELvi2CC5XdFXb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72358'),
  ('505718096308460581', 'A Thousand Years of Good Prayers', 2007, 'Drama', 'Wayne Wang, Patrick Lindenmaier', null, 'Henry O, Yu Feihong, Vida Ghahremani, Pasha D. Lychnikoff, Jared Wagner', null, 'The film follows Mr. Shi, a retired widower from Beijing. When his only daughter, Yilan, who lives in Spokane, Washington and works as a librarian, gets divorced, he decides to visit her to help her heal. However, Yilan is not interested. She tries keeping an emotional distance but when this finally fails she begins physically avoiding her father. He confronts her about an affair with a married Russian man and she, in turn, lets loose about all the gossip she''d heard as a young girl about his alleged affair with a female colleague back in China.', 'The film follows Mr. Shi, a retired widower from Beijing. When his only daughter, Yilan, who lives in Spokane, Washington and works as a librarian, gets divorced, he decides to visit her to help her heal. However, Yilan is not interested. She tries keeping an emotional distance but when this finally fails she begins physically avoiding her father. He confronts her about an affair with a married Russian man and she, in turn, lets loose about all the gossip she''d heard as a young girl about his alleged affair with a female colleague back in China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBc0NbqTZb1MBOnKNlBHgx1YNvR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4890'),
  ('841755397387900010', 'A Throw of Dice', 1929, 'Drama, Adventure, Romance', 'Franz Osten, Emil Schünemann, Alan Campbell', 'Max Jungk, W. A. Burton', 'Seeta Devi, Charu Roy, Himansu Rai, Modhu Bose, Sarada Gupta, Tincory Chakrabarty, Lala Bijoykishen', null, 'Two neighboring kings addicted to gambling, Ranjit and his cousin Sohat, vie for the same beautiful young woman, Sunita, daughter of the hermit Kanwa.', 'Two neighboring kings addicted to gambling, Ranjit and his cousin Sohat, vie for the same beautiful young woman, Sunita, daughter of the hermit Kanwa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLz24vUaBG19sqrIZSuuD67ALfv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35454'),
  ('208018347551106372', 'A Thunder of Drums', 1961, 'Western', 'William W. Spencer, Joseph M. Newman, Hal W. Polaire', 'James Warner Bellah', 'Richard Boone, George Hamilton, Luana Patten, Arthur O''Connell, Charles Bronson, Richard Chamberlain, James Douglas, Tammy Marihugh', 'NR', 'Captain Maddocks will never be promoted beyond Captain because of a mistake that he made in the past. Lt. McQuade is a green rookie who is now under the command of the tough Captain and he does not seem to be able to do anything right. Lt. McQuade also has trouble with Tracey, but it will be the renegade Indians that will test him and teach him the importance of following orders.', 'Captain Maddocks will never be promoted beyond Captain because of a mistake that he made in the past. Lt. McQuade is a green rookie who is now under the command of the tough Captain and he does not seem to be able to do anything right. Lt. McQuade also has trouble with Tracey, but it will be the renegade Indians that will test him and teach him the importance of following orders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5kWlB2IJiKw6EGCc8kv7fVhaKI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78038'),
  ('671015411492433441', 'A Thursday', 2022, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Abhishek Banerjee, Anmol Ahuja, Behzad Khambata', 'Ashley Michael Lobo, Behzad Khambata', 'Yami Gautam Dhar, Atul Kulkarni, Neha Dhupia, Dimple Kapadia, Karanvir Sharma, Maya Sarao, Kalyanee Mulay, Boloram Das', null, 'When a kindergarten teacher takes her 16 students hostage and makes a set of demands, it not only rattles the Mumbai police and the city but also sends shockwaves through the country and its leaders as the motive behind the hostage situation is unearthed.', 'When a kindergarten teacher takes her 16 students hostage and makes a set of demands, it not only rattles the Mumbai police and the city but also sends shockwaves through the country and its leaders as the motive behind the hostage situation is unearthed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnoyG3rPuKAHeRbNlwuyiC08Sya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:897525'),
  ('337887560103319329', 'A Ticket to Space', 2006, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Eric Lartigau, Régis Blondeau', 'Kad Merad, Olivier Baroux, Julien Rappeneau', 'Kad Merad, Olivier Baroux, Marina Foïs, Guillaume Canet, André Dussollier, Anne Marivin, Frédérique Bel, Pierre-François Martin-Laval', null, 'Face à l''incompréhension de la population française quant au montant des crédits alloués à la recherche spatiale, le gouvernement lance une vaste opération de communication. En partenariat avec le Centre spatial français, un grand jeu est organisé. "Le ticket pour l''espace", un jeu à gratter, va permettre à deux civils de séjourner dans la station orbitale européenne.', 'Face à l''incompréhension de la population française quant au montant des crédits alloués à la recherche spatiale, le gouvernement lance une vaste opération de communication. En partenariat avec le Centre spatial français, un grand jeu est organisé. "Le ticket pour l''espace", un jeu à gratter, va permettre à deux civils de séjourner dans la station orbitale européenne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lJFxH732BjLTQzuqMdASoX7IDz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13748'),
  ('906415602190638393', 'A Ticket to Tomahawk', 1950, 'Comedy, Western', 'Richard Sale, Harry Jackson', 'Mary Loos, Richard Sale', 'Dan Dailey, Anne Baxter, Rory Calhoun, Walter Brennan, Arthur Hunnicutt, Charles Kemper, Connie Gilchrist, Will Wright', 'NR', 'A cowboy is hired by a stagecoach boss to stop the railroad reaching his territory and putting him out of business. He uses everything from Indians to dancehall girls to try to thwart the plan. But the railroad workers, led by a female sharpshooter and an ambitious salesman, prove tough customers.', 'A cowboy is hired by a stagecoach boss to stop the railroad reaching his territory and putting him out of business. He uses everything from Indians to dancehall girls to try to thwart the plan. But the railroad workers, led by a female sharpshooter and an ambitious salesman, prove tough customers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUR3KtvCT80ZMHUjpPBNazMEHHM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136772'),
  ('845869455366853718', 'A Tiger Walks', 1964, 'Drama, Family', 'Norman Tokar, William E. Snyder', 'Lowell S. Hawley', 'Brian Keith, Vera Miles, Pamela Franklin, Sabu, Edward Andrews, Una Merkel, Frank McHugh, Peter Brown', null, 'A tiger escapes from a circus truck as it passes by a small town, and hides itself in the surrounding woods. This throws the town into a panic and everyone wants the animal killed immediately, except for the daughter of the sheriff. She wants to capture the tiger and put it in a zoo, thereby saving the tiger''s life. Her determination starts a nationwide campaign among children to raise the money to buy the tiger from the circus, but first, she, her father and an Indian tiger trainer must find the tiger before the National Guard do, who have orders to kill it on sight.', 'A tiger escapes from a circus truck as it passes by a small town, and hides itself in the surrounding woods. This throws the town into a panic and everyone wants the animal killed immediately, except for the daughter of the sheriff. She wants to capture the tiger and put it in a zoo, thereby saving the tiger''s life. Her determination starts a nationwide campaign among children to raise the money to buy the tiger from the circus, but first, she, her father and an Indian tiger trainer must find the tiger before the National Guard do, who have orders to kill it on sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGEYLZOJLAyYzMCgfFen9eDag23.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64872'),
  ('712704138666520085', 'A Tiger''s Tale', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Peter Douglas, Tony Pierce-Roberts, Tom Seidman', 'Peter Douglas', 'Ann-Margret, C. Thomas Howell, Kelly Preston, Charles Durning, Ann Wedgeworth, William Zabka, Tim Thomerson, Angel Tompkins', null, 'A young man falls for his girlfriend''s mother.', 'A young man falls for his girlfriend''s mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVchoagaSizAwD9mqJviXqJjNJS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86547'),
  ('548823222364641021', 'A Time for Bravery', 2025, 'Comedy, Action', 'Ariel Winograd', null, 'Luis Gerardo Méndez, Memo Villegas, Christian Tappán, Verónica Bravo, Enrique Arreola, Noé Hernández, Fernando Cuautle, Iván Aragón', 'R', 'A psychoanalyst on community service aids an agent shattered by infidelity; together, they will confront danger and discover second chances.', 'A psychoanalyst on community service aids an agent shattered by infidelity; together, they will confront danger and discover second chances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKKG22O5pFxqglG0oMjWTjQWCNl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1589891'),
  ('834434573142553735', 'A Time for Dancing', 2002, 'Drama, Music', 'Peter Gilbert, Alex Nepomniaschy', 'Kara Lindstrom', 'Larisa Oleynik, Shiri Appleby, Peter Coyote, Patricia Kalember, Amy Madigan, Shane West, Scott Vickaryous, Anton Yelchin', null, 'Their love of dance, and their friendship, is challenged for two high school girls when one is diagnosed with cancer.', 'Their love of dance, and their friendship, is challenged for two high school girls when one is diagnosed with cancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4R2EWdzh1aL1jVSPnSuKsePrro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44266'),
  ('620336427649239566', 'A Time for Defiance', 1998, 'War, Romance, Drama', 'Antonio Mercero, Jaume Peracaula, Luis Oliveros', 'Antonio Mercero, Horacio Valcárcel', 'Gabino Diego, Leonor Watling, Adriana Ozores, Luis Cuenca, Héctor Colomé, Aten Soria, Javier Bódalo, Ramon Agirre', null, 'After the Spanish Civil War breaks out, the Prado Museum is being evacuated. One of the guards finds a painting by the master, Goya, and takes it to prevent damage to the work of art. In the interim, he meets a young lady with whom he falls in love. Assisted by her and her family members, the soldier attempts to save Goya''s masterpiece intact amidst the war and violence.', 'After the Spanish Civil War breaks out, the Prado Museum is being evacuated. One of the guards finds a painting by the master, Goya, and takes it to prevent damage to the work of art. In the interim, he meets a young lady with whom he falls in love. Assisted by her and her family members, the soldier attempts to save Goya''s masterpiece intact amidst the war and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XVHCN1w6odKQpfo3LNwaaJUYOy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124955'),
  ('924689497547596598', 'A Time for Drunken Horses', 2000, 'Drama, War', 'Bahman Ghobadi, Saed Nikzat, Kaveh Moeinfar', 'Bahman Ghobadi', 'Ayoub Ahmadi, Rojin Younessi, Amaneh Ekhtiar-dini, Madi Ekhtiar-dini, Kolsolum Ekhtiar-dini, Karim Ekhtiar-dini, Rahman Salehi, Osman Karimi', null, 'After their father dies, a family of five children are forced to survive on their own in a Kurdish village on the border of Iran and Iraq.', 'After their father dies, a family of five children are forced to survive on their own in a Kurdish village on the border of Iran and Iraq.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQv7sCP0FddDwVo243Fpf32u4uR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29270'),
  ('749764905084652333', 'A Time for Dying', 1969, 'Western', 'Budd Boetticher, Lucien Ballard', 'Budd Boetticher', 'Richard Lapp, Anne Randall, Robert Random, Beatrice Kay, Victor Jory, Audie Murphy, Ron Masak, Burt Mustin', 'G', 'Passing through a town, a farm boy aspiring to be a bounty hunter rescues a woman who has been tricked into working in its brothel and the two travel towards his father''s ranch.', 'Passing through a town, a farm boy aspiring to be a bounty hunter rescues a woman who has been tricked into working in its brothel and the two travel towards his father''s ranch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6iVxFLWXGvYIfjwySfp7428Isu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128848'),
  ('382958502002935412', 'A Time for Killing', 1967, 'Western, War', 'Phil Karlson, Kenneth Peach, Anthony Ray', 'Halsted Welles', 'Glenn Ford, George Hamilton, Inger Stevens, Paul Petersen, Todd Armstrong, Max Baer Jr., Kenneth Tobey, Timothy Carey', null, 'During the Civil War, Confederate soldiers escape from a Union prison and head for the Mexican border. Along the way, they kill a Union courier bearing the news that the war is over. Keeping the message a secret, the captain has his men go on and they soon find themselves in a battle with the Union search party who also is unaware of the war''s end.', 'During the Civil War, Confederate soldiers escape from a Union prison and head for the Mexican border. Along the way, they kill a Union courier bearing the news that the war is over. Keeping the message a secret, the captain has his men go on and they soon find themselves in a battle with the Union search party who also is unaware of the war''s end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xIfi6De5aavf1nuHEbcKZ61jkV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4949'),
  ('857921686854807605', 'A Time Out of War', 1954, 'War, Drama', 'Denis Sanders, Terry Sanders', 'Denis Sanders', 'Barry Atwater, Robert Sherry, Corey Allen', null, 'Black and White UCLA Student Film, Preserved by the Academy Film Archive. During the American Civil War, two Union soldiers and a Confederate solider fire at each other from across a brook. The two sides negotiate a one-hour truce, from which they develop a bond. Based on the short story "Pickets" (1897) by Robert W. Chambers, it was the winner of an Academy Award for Best Short Subject (Two Reel) film in 1955. The film is on the National Film Registry for its cultural significance in 2007.', 'Black and White UCLA Student Film, Preserved by the Academy Film Archive. During the American Civil War, two Union soldiers and a Confederate solider fire at each other from across a brook. The two sides negotiate a one-hour truce, from which they develop a bond. Based on the short story "Pickets" (1897) by Robert W. Chambers, it was the winner of an Academy Award for Best Short Subject (Two Reel) film in 1955. The film is on the National Film Registry for its cultural significance in 2007.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgEWmmciOmNTgyXCky4NlorTtv5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163370'),
  ('454803406013654837', 'A Time to Die', 1991, 'Thriller, Action', 'Ken Blakey, Charla Driver, Charles T. Kanganis', 'Charles T. Kanganis', 'Traci Lords, Jeff Conaway, Richard Roundtree, Robert Miano, Jesse Thomas, Nitchie Barrett, Bradford Bancroft, Gino Dentie', 'R', 'A female photographer teams up with a policeman to try to bring down a corrupt police officer who framed her for drug possession and during her investigation, finds that not everything, or everyone, is what they appear to be.', 'A female photographer teams up with a policeman to try to bring down a corrupt police officer who framed her for drug possession and during her investigation, finds that not everything, or everyone, is what they appear to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvOeQBYsiebyqd7wzvKcNIdYGJk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55458'),
  ('1127528560070147404', 'A Time to Kill', 1996, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Peter Menzies Jr., Joel Schumacher, James F. Truesdale', 'Akiva Goldsman', 'Matthew McConaughey, Sandra Bullock, Samuel L. Jackson, Kevin Spacey, Ashley Judd, Donald Sutherland, Oliver Platt, Charles S. Dutton', 'R', 'A young lawyer defends a black man accused of murdering two white men who raped his 10-year-old daughter, sparking a rebirth of the KKK.', 'A young lawyer defends a black man accused of murdering two white men who raped his 10-year-old daughter, sparking a rebirth of the KKK.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8UCke112E9jrhjKcwG32kyhTx5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1645'),
  ('231652603844908322', 'A Time to Love and a Time to Die', 1958, 'Drama, War, Romance', 'Douglas Sirk, Russell Metty, Michael Braun', 'Orin Jannings', 'John Gavin, Liselotte Pulver, Jock Mahoney, Don DeFore, Keenan Wynn, Erich Maria Remarque, Dieter Borsche, Barbara Rütting', 'NR', 'A German soldier home on leave falls in love with a girl, then returns to World War II.', 'A German soldier home on leave falls in love with a girl, then returns to World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTN6eW0iYtLW2PEDveaHSAOq92X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84079'),
  ('412757587807171986', 'A Time to Remember', 2021, 'Romance', 'Hwang Kyung-sung', null, 'Lee Sung-yeol, Bae Yoo-bin, Nam Kyu-hee, Park Sung-woo, Yu Yeon-Su, Park Eun-woo', null, 'Woo-jin is Korea''s top star - every item he wears and uses are always a hot potato and gets sold out overnight. He is especially famous for remembering all his fan names. He seems to be just perfect, but there is one big secret that nobody knows - he cannot forget but only remember things. Woo-jin is forced to relive painful moments over and over again, feeling the same amount of anguish each time. One day, Woo-jin encounters a woman named Hae-soo, who suffers from the opposite pain from him: her memory resets every 30 days.', 'Woo-jin is Korea''s top star - every item he wears and uses are always a hot potato and gets sold out overnight. He is especially famous for remembering all his fan names. He seems to be just perfect, but there is one big secret that nobody knows - he cannot forget but only remember things. Woo-jin is forced to relive painful moments over and over again, feeling the same amount of anguish each time. One day, Woo-jin encounters a woman named Hae-soo, who suffers from the opposite pain from him: her memory resets every 30 days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khn4CsijMjBURnYuLNNx5NMQh0s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1087914'),
  ('917093760896474574', 'A Timeless Christmas', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Thomas M. Harting, Ron Oliver', 'Duane Poole, Ron Oliver', 'Erin Cahill, Ryan Paevey, Brandi Alexander, Jennifer Kitchen, Zahf Paroo, Nelson Wong, Michael St. John Smith, Karen Kruper', null, 'Charles Whitley travels from 1903 to 2020 where he meets Megan Turner, a tour guide at his historic mansion, and experiences a 21st Century Christmas.', 'Charles Whitley travels from 1903 to 2020 where he meets Megan Turner, a tour guide at his historic mansion, and experiences a 21st Century Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lW6jwqUxXhojjKZ54OGu6KbCcWa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746039'),
  ('328126753527366335', 'A Ton of Luck', 2006, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Rodrigo Triana, Sergio García', 'Jörg Hiller', 'Diego Cadavid, Marlon Moreno, Juan Sebastián Aragón, Manuel José Chaves, Verónica Orozco, Carolina Ramírez, Carolina Cuervo, Vicky Rueda', null, 'The story, based on true events occurred in Colombia en May 2003, tells the dreams and adventures of Porras, Venegas, Lloreda and Perlaza, four of the 147 soldiers that were in a company of the anti-guerrilla "Destroyer" battalion. It begun when these soldiers found in the middle of the jungle, during a rescue mission, 46 million dollars inside a FARC "guaca". Instead of give it to the Government, they take it all for themselves instead. They desperate when realize that they''re completely isolated because the bridge, the only way to return to civilization, has been blown up. Everything''s ironic, almost surreal: These soldiers don''t have food, water, or toilet paper, but they sleep on their dollar-ful bags. This discovery will change their lives forever, and will allow them to have everything they''ve dreamt about: some authority, power and respect, others help their families and have a no-longer poor life. Their big challenge: return to civilization and make their dreams come true.', 'The story, based on true events occurred in Colombia en May 2003, tells the dreams and adventures of Porras, Venegas, Lloreda and Perlaza, four of the 147 soldiers that were in a company of the anti-guerrilla "Destroyer" battalion. It begun when these soldiers found in the middle of the jungle, during a rescue mission, 46 million dollars inside a FARC "guaca". Instead of give it to the Government, they take it all for themselves instead. They desperate when realize that they''re completely isolated because the bridge, the only way to return to civilization, has been blown up. Everything''s ironic, almost surreal: These soldiers don''t have food, water, or toilet paper, but they sleep on their dollar-ful bags. This discovery will change their lives forever, and will allow them to have everything they''ve dreamt about: some authority, power and respect, others help their families and have a no-longer poor life. Their big challenge: return to civilization and make their dreams come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIqQyLgq5XmDCGeL6abNWTHbuDX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189478'),
  ('1064957985461141137', 'A Toothful Smile', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Roman Polanski, Henryk Kucharski', 'Roman Polanski', 'Nikola Todorow', null, 'A man walks down the exterior staircase of building of flats; he''s dressed to go out, taking care to wrap a scarf around his neck. He pauses as he passes a small window that''s about eye high. He ventures to look in, and there a young woman stands at a washbasin, drying her hair,', 'A man walks down the exterior staircase of building of flats; he''s dressed to go out, taking care to wrap a scarf around his neck. He pauses as he passes a small window that''s about eye high. He ventures to look in, and there a young woman stands at a washbasin, drying her hair,', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lu2xYit4EhsE8i07KdDVsJrZNC1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163041'),
  ('1032507494804718560', 'A Touch of Class', 1973, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Nigel Wooll, Simon Relph, Melvin Frank', 'Melvin Frank, Jack Rose', 'George Segal, Glenda Jackson, Paul Sorvino, K Callan, Cec Linder, Michael Elwyn, Mary Barclay, Nadim Sawalha', 'PG', 'Steve, a happily married American man living in London meets Vicki, an English divorcée and run off to Marbella for a rollicking week of sex. They then return to London to set up a cozy menage, despite the fact that he loves his wife and children, and now realize that he and Vicki have also fallen in love.', 'Steve, a happily married American man living in London meets Vicki, an English divorcée and run off to Marbella for a rollicking week of sex. They then return to London to set up a cozy menage, despite the fact that he loves his wife and children, and now realize that he and Vicki have also fallen in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iEjIwaaXlg8fK7uyNdQU2ityj8v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42458'),
  ('444979021776244029', 'A Touch of Fever', 1993, 'Romance, Drama', 'Junichi Tozawa, Ryosuke Hashiguchi', 'Ryosuke Hashiguchi', 'Yoshihiko Hakamada, Reiko Kataoka, Masashi Endô, Sumiyo Yamada, Koji Sato, Bunmei Harada, Kōta Kusano, Yoichi Kawaguchi', null, 'Tatsuru and Shinichiro’s relationship shifts from casual to complicated as love and emotions blur the lines between their work and personal lives.', 'Tatsuru and Shinichiro’s relationship shifts from casual to complicated as love and emotions blur the lines between their work and personal lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kzbnAvkT3ebv3cNfZ0K4ZK7cgU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214879'),
  ('451376149189203839', 'A Touch of Larceny', 1960, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Guy Hamilton, John Wilcox, Charles Blair', 'Ivan Foxwell, Guy Hamilton', 'James Mason, George Sanders, Vera Miles, Robert Flemyng, Oliver Johnston, William Kendall, Duncan Lamont, Harry Andrews', null, 'After falling in love with an American woman, Virginia Killain, who is engaged to another man, British Naval Commander Max Easton, hatches a plan that will get him enough money to support Virginia in the lifestyle she is accustomed to. Easton''s plan is to disappear for a time making it seem that he has defected to the Soviets taking important Naval secrets from his job at the Admiralty and to return and sue the newspapers for slander. Not everything goes as planned for Commander Easton.', 'After falling in love with an American woman, Virginia Killain, who is engaged to another man, British Naval Commander Max Easton, hatches a plan that will get him enough money to support Virginia in the lifestyle she is accustomed to. Easton''s plan is to disappear for a time making it seem that he has defected to the Soviets taking important Naval secrets from his job at the Admiralty and to return and sue the newspapers for slander. Not everything goes as planned for Commander Easton.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vFGg8eKloPHeswYQwdkyvwN1XWq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96828'),
  ('694000936312277081', 'A Touch of Love', 1969, 'Drama', 'Waris Hussein, Ariel Levy, Jake Wright', 'Margaret Drabble', 'Sandy Dennis, Ian McKellen, Michael Coles, John Standing, Peggy Thorpe-Bates, Kenneth Benda, Deborah Stanford, Roger Hammond', null, 'Intellectually driven doctoral student Rosamund Stacey, while undertaking graduate work at the British Museum, becomes pregnant after a brief affair with a television newsreader. Against the advice of her best friend, Lydia, Rosamund chooses to keep the baby and adjusts her life to include both her studies and her pregnancy. However, when the baby is born, an unforeseen complication threatens the self-sufficient life Rosamund plans for herself.', 'Intellectually driven doctoral student Rosamund Stacey, while undertaking graduate work at the British Museum, becomes pregnant after a brief affair with a television newsreader. Against the advice of her best friend, Lydia, Rosamund chooses to keep the baby and adjusts her life to include both her studies and her pregnancy. However, when the baby is born, an unforeseen complication threatens the self-sufficient life Rosamund plans for herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AhrpRic5dsBEGyAFfBnCOM5LeKZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118883'),
  ('697339210589870412', 'A Touch of Sin', 2013, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jia Zhangke, Nelson Yu Lik-wai, Wang Jing', 'Jia Zhangke', 'Jiang Wu, Wang Baoqiang, Zhao Tao, Li Meng, Zhang Jiayi, Luo Lanshan, Wang Hongwei, Liu Lu', null, 'Four people in different provinces are driven to violent ends: An angry miner is enraged by corruption in his village. A migrant discovers the possibilities of owning a firearm. A receptionist is pushed beyond her limits by an abusive client. A young factory worker goes from one job to the next.', 'Four people in different provinces are driven to violent ends: An angry miner is enraged by corruption in his village. A migrant discovers the possibilities of owning a firearm. A receptionist is pushed beyond her limits by an abusive client. A young factory worker goes from one job to the next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZKem3DGUiM3664otaSfuGacjiz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187022'),
  ('885953656174633251', 'A Touch of Spice', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tasos Boulmetis, Takis Zervoulakos', 'Tasos Boulmetis', 'Georges Corraface, Ieroklis Michaelidis, Renia Louizidou, Stelios Mainas, Tassos Bandis, Marina Kalogirou, Ersi Malikenzou, Odysseas Papaspiliopoulos', null, '"A Touch of Spice" is a story about Fanis, a young Greek boy growing up in Istanbul, whose grandfather, a culinary philosopher and mentor, teaches him that both food and life require a little salt to give them flavor. They both require... A Touch of Spice. Fanis grows up to become an excellent cook and uses his cooking skills to spice up the lives of those around him. 35 years later he leaves Athens and travels back to his birthplace of Istanbul to reunite with his grandfather and his first love. He travels back only to realize that he forgot to put a little bit of spice in his own life.', '"A Touch of Spice" is a story about Fanis, a young Greek boy growing up in Istanbul, whose grandfather, a culinary philosopher and mentor, teaches him that both food and life require a little salt to give them flavor. They both require... A Touch of Spice. Fanis grows up to become an excellent cook and uses his cooking skills to spice up the lives of those around him. 35 years later he leaves Athens and travels back to his birthplace of Istanbul to reunite with his grandfather and his first love. He travels back only to realize that he forgot to put a little bit of spice in his own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtLPf20exDzczcgxeW5pazWEFGi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12497'),
  ('67202606238480903', 'A Touch of Zen', 1970, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'King Hu, Hua Hui-Ying, Miao Tian', 'King Hu', 'Hsu Feng, Shih Chun, Pai Ying, Tien Peng, Roy Chiao, Tsao Chien, Miao Tian, Melvin Chang Yun-Wen', 'NR', 'Gu Sheng-zhai, an artist in his early 30s, still lives with his mother, but he is suddenly shaken by the arrival of Yang Hui-zhen, a mysterious princess on the run. Yang brings Gu into her circle of protectors, including a nameless monk whose spiritual guidance transforms him into a valiant fighter.', 'Gu Sheng-zhai, an artist in his early 30s, still lives with his mother, but he is suddenly shaken by the arrival of Yang Hui-zhen, a mysterious princess on the run. Yang brings Gu into her circle of protectors, including a nameless monk whose spiritual guidance transforms him into a valiant fighter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0VDLox8ufaR4Ry1mFceELYJbKq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44154'),
  ('277852413861068151', 'A Tourist''s Guide to Love', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Andrew Shea, Sarah Campbell, Jon Keng', 'Eirene Donohue', 'Rachael Leigh Cook, Scott Ly, Missi Pyle, Ben Feldman, Glynn Sweet, Alexa Povah, Jacqueline Correa, Nondumiso Tembe', 'PG', 'After an unexpected break up, a travel executive accepts an assignment to go undercover and learn about the tourist industry in Vietnam. Along the way, she finds adventure and romance with her Vietnamese expat tour guide and they decide to hijack the tour bus in order to explore life and love off the beaten path.', 'After an unexpected break up, a travel executive accepts an assignment to go undercover and learn about the tourist industry in Vietnam. Along the way, she finds adventure and romance with her Vietnamese expat tour guide and they decide to hijack the tour bus in order to explore life and love off the beaten path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWkpjbBe4gRZilXRXbYfsMUZMhz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:813726'),
  ('456550867554928201', 'À tout de suite', 2004, 'Crime, Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Benoît Jacquot, Caroline Champetier, Joan de Camaret', 'Benoît Jacquot, Elisabeth Fanger', 'Isild Le Besco, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Laurence Cordier, Sabri Lahmer, Odile Vuillemin, Forini Kodoukaki, Emmanuelle Bercot, Ouassini Embarek', null, 'A girl from bourgeoisie discovers the pleasures of banditism, following her lover in his lifestyle.', 'A girl from bourgeoisie discovers the pleasures of banditism, following her lover in his lifestyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1DzpOBhB3ZwGd3y09KzNH3RXHr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78293'),
  ('755250271449627889', 'A Town Called Bastard', 1971, 'Western', 'Robert Parrish, Irving Lerner, Manuel Berenguer', 'Richard Aubrey', 'Robert Shaw, Telly Savalas, Martin Landau, Stella Stevens, Fernando Rey, Michael Craig, Dudley Sutton, Al Lettieri', 'R', 'A group of Mexican revolutionaries murders a town priest and a number of his christian followers. Ten years later, a widow arrives in town intent to take revenge from her husband''s killers.', 'A group of Mexican revolutionaries murders a town priest and a number of his christian followers. Ten years later, a widow arrives in town intent to take revenge from her husband''s killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOmOmiZMKoFtmWYZHECbomcT9cY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65674'),
  ('819416776277945949', 'A Town Called Panic', 2009, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Vincent Patar, Stéphane Aubier, Steven De Beul', 'Stéphane Aubier, Vincent Patar, Guillaume Malandrin', 'Stéphane Aubier, Vincent Patar, Bruce Ellison, Jeanne Balibar, Bouli Lanners, Benoît Poelvoorde, Nicolas Buysse, François De Brigode', 'PG', 'Cowboy and Indian''s only wish was to come up with a brilliant idea for Mr Horse''s birthday, but when their plan ends up in utter disaster, they''ll need to travel the world and back to make things right again.', 'Cowboy and Indian''s only wish was to come up with a brilliant idea for Mr Horse''s birthday, but when their plan ends up in utter disaster, they''ll need to travel the world and back to make things right again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Q1jtFU1zutKsAR9lwAl6YMkgZM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40623'),
  ('474946825536690101', 'A Town Called Panic: Back to School Panic!', 2016, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Jan Vandenbussche, Vincent Patar, Stéphane Aubier', 'Stéphane Aubier, Vincent Tavier, Vincent Patar', 'Stéphane Aubier, Vincent Patar, Bruce Ellison, Benoît Poelvoorde, Véronique Dumont, Bouli Lanners, Jeanne Balibar, Ingrid Heiderscheidt', null, 'Indian and Cowboy are about to set off on a magnificent cruise on a luxury liner, but they have made a big mistake. They completely forgot that today is the first day of school! Goodbye tropical islands, our friends are back at their desks in school listening as the teacher drones on and on.', 'Indian and Cowboy are about to set off on a magnificent cruise on a luxury liner, but they have made a big mistake. They completely forgot that today is the first day of school! Goodbye tropical islands, our friends are back at their desks in school listening as the teacher drones on and on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3FcjqQLsxj1afQlhNyZ1XIbebTV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415355'),
  ('685167852941909864', 'A Town Like Alice', 1956, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Jack Lee, Geoffrey Unsworth', 'W.P. Lipscomb, Richard Mason', 'Virginia McKenna, Peter Finch, Tran Van Khe, Jean Anderson, Marie Lohr, Maureen Swanson, Renée Houston, Nora Nicholson', 'NR', 'In 1941 Malaysia, the advancing Japanese army captures a lot of British territory very quickly. The men are sent off to labor camps, but they have no plan on what to do with the women and children of the British.', 'In 1941 Malaysia, the advancing Japanese army captures a lot of British territory very quickly. The men are sent off to labor camps, but they have no plan on what to do with the women and children of the British.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTBNZnQVSn26DuQHdRUTW8a6Aux.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88558'),
  ('160131684588105445', 'A Train for Durango', 1968, 'Comedy, Western', 'Mario Caiano, Enzo Barboni', 'Mario Caiano, Duccio Tessari', 'Anthony Steffen, Mark Damon, Enrico Maria Salerno, Dominique Boschero, Roberto Camardiel, José Bódalo, Aldo Sambrell, Lorenzo Robledo', null, 'Two buddy adventurers witness a train-robbery and are then hunting the robbed gold and they also robbed Helen.', 'Two buddy adventurers witness a train-robbery and are then hunting the robbed gold and they also robbed Helen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3quhRnpaPUKfV6TV3YAKmzLpI1f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129606'),
  ('978265164918192086', 'A Translator', 2019, 'Drama', 'Sebastián Barriuso, M.I. Littin-Menz, Rodrigo Barriuso', 'Lindsay Gossling', 'Rodrigo Santoro, Maricel Álvarez, Yoandra Suárez, Milda Gecaitė, Nataliya Rodina, Aleksandra Maslennikova, Genadijs Dolganovs, Eslinda Núñez', null, 'A Russian Literature professor at the University of Havana is ordered to work as a translator for child victims of the Chernobyl nuclear disaster when they are sent to Cuba for medical treatment. Based on a true story.', 'A Russian Literature professor at the University of Havana is ordered to work as a translator for child victims of the Chernobyl nuclear disaster when they are sent to Cuba for medical treatment. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5AnYk6YoVZVCMObD4LunWqIis8y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:491317'),
  ('63170984847678458', 'A Trap', 1965, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Yoji Yamada, Tetsuo Takaha, Jirō Sugioka', 'Shinobu Hashimoto', 'Chieko Baisho, Osamu Takizawa, Michiyo Aratama, Yūsuke Kawazu, Yōsuke Kondō, Taketoshi Naitō, Shigeru Tsuyuguchi, Etsuko Ichihara', null, 'When her only relative, her elder brother is accused of robbing and murdering an old woman loan-shark, pretty, young Kiriko travels from her home in Kyushu to Tokyo to get Japan''s top lawyer to defend her brother. Unfortunately her naive idealism is shattered when the lawyer refuses to take the case based on her insufficient funds. What follows is a long determined revenge plot that sees the heroine become a Tokyo bar hostess and worse to punish the lawyer. The plot thickens with another murder mystery and a sleuthing reporter.', 'When her only relative, her elder brother is accused of robbing and murdering an old woman loan-shark, pretty, young Kiriko travels from her home in Kyushu to Tokyo to get Japan''s top lawyer to defend her brother. Unfortunately her naive idealism is shattered when the lawyer refuses to take the case based on her insufficient funds. What follows is a long determined revenge plot that sees the heroine become a Tokyo bar hostess and worse to punish the lawyer. The plot thickens with another murder mystery and a sleuthing reporter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOl2yRrWLnZcbrEGPeHsK9OYMFI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244198'),
  ('40955222682400256', 'A Trap for Cinderella', 1965, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'André Cayatte, Armand Thirard', 'Jean Anouilh', 'Dany Carrel, Madeleine Robinson, Hubert Noël, Jean Gaven, René Dary, Francis Nani, Robert Dalban, Dominique Davray', null, 'Based on Sébastien Japrisot''s novel, the story revolves around a young girl who suffers from amnesia after surviving a terrible fire.', 'Based on Sébastien Japrisot''s novel, the story revolves around a young girl who suffers from amnesia after surviving a terrible fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qu9Hp2rQ74O7P5iU6bVXrpGWbba.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276517'),
  ('148592764368128909', 'A Trap for Lonely Man', 1990, 'Crime, Comedy, Mystery', 'Aleksei Korenev', 'Aleksei Korenev', 'Nikolai Karachentsov, Innokentiy Smoktunovskiy, Yuriy Yakovlev, Irina Shmeleva, Venyamin Smekhov, Sergey Migitsko, Yelena Koreneva', null, 'Daniel Corban reports his wife Elizabeth missing to the police. A priest arrives and says he has found her. When he brings her in, Corban insists she is not his wife. When several other people arrive and verify she is Elizabeth, Daniel feels he is losing his grip on reality.', 'Daniel Corban reports his wife Elizabeth missing to the police. A priest arrives and says he has found her. When he brings her in, Corban insists she is not his wife. When several other people arrive and verify she is Elizabeth, Daniel feels he is losing his grip on reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lHddOlwlxzyHECfP8RwsvtRu6B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87793'),
  ('790148311424106768', 'A Trash Truck Christmas', 2020, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Eddie Rosas', 'Todd Casey', 'Henry Keane, Glen Keane, Lucas Neff, Brian Baumgartner, Jackie Loeb, John DiMaggio, Max Keane, Olive Keane', 'G', 'When Santa crash-lands in the junkyard on Christmas Eve, Hank, Trash Truck and their animal friends all have a hand in rescuing the holiday for everyone.', 'When Santa crash-lands in the junkyard on Christmas Eve, Hank, Trash Truck and their animal friends all have a hand in rescuing the holiday for everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kWVSZfK9gbbNQD93Qwi8VvYjlB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:774810'),
  ('344533882888198209', 'A Traveler''s Needs', 2024, 'Drama', 'Hong Sang-soo, Hong Sang-soo', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Isabelle Huppert, Lee Hye-young, Kwon Hae-hyo, Cho Yun-hee, Ha Seong-guk, Kim Seung-yun, Kang So-yi, Ha Jin-hwa', 'NR', 'Iris, a woman abroad in Seoul, teaches French and English in an idiosyncratic fashion that allows her to pursue her own philosophical and personal interests. Through four encounters over a single day, Iris probes students and strangers for information about poetry, their own histories, and their relationship to their egos.', 'Iris, a woman abroad in Seoul, teaches French and English in an idiosyncratic fashion that allows her to pursue her own philosophical and personal interests. Through four encounters over a single day, Iris probes students and strangers for information about poetry, their own histories, and their relationship to their egos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDimH4UKv1qsXdnFePXuDZb3cA4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1146410'),
  ('909557741915184828', 'A Tree Grows in Brooklyn', 1945, 'Drama', 'Elia Kazan, Leon Shamroy, Saul Wurtzel', 'Tess Slesinger, Frank Davis', 'Dorothy McGuire, Joan Blondell, James Dunn, Lloyd Nolan, James Gleason, Ted Donaldson, Peggy Ann Garner, Ruth Nelson', 'PG', 'In Brooklyn circa 1900, the Nolans manage to enjoy life on pennies despite great poverty and Papa''s alcoholism. We come to know these people well through big and little troubles: Aunt Sissy''s scandalous succession of "husbands"; the removal of the one tree visible from their tenement; and young Francie''s desire to transfer to a better school...if irresponsible Papa can get his act together.', 'In Brooklyn circa 1900, the Nolans manage to enjoy life on pennies despite great poverty and Papa''s alcoholism. We come to know these people well through big and little troubles: Aunt Sissy''s scandalous succession of "husbands"; the removal of the one tree visible from their tenement; and young Francie''s desire to transfer to a better school...if irresponsible Papa can get his act together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFmmEyjD3tnA8NbbasfeDFMaAjY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30177'),
  ('240394084681898662', 'A Tree of Palme', 2002, 'Animation, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Masafumi Mima, Mamoru Sasaki, Takashi Nakamura', 'Takashi Nakamura', 'Akiko Hiramatsu, Megumi Toyoguchi, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Kappei Yamaguchi, Emi Motoi, Mika Kanai, Etsuko Kozakura, Motomu Kiyokawa', null, 'A Tree of Palme is an interpretation of the Pinocchio tale. It concerns a small puppet, Palme, who was tasked by his creator to look over his ailing wife, Xian. After her passing, Palme is visited by a mysterious woman who he mistakenly believes to be Xian. Shaken out of his sadness, Palme accepts her request to deliver something special to a far-off place known as Tama. This sets Palme off on a journey to discover his own emotions, and what it truly means to be human.', 'A Tree of Palme is an interpretation of the Pinocchio tale. It concerns a small puppet, Palme, who was tasked by his creator to look over his ailing wife, Xian. After her passing, Palme is visited by a mysterious woman who he mistakenly believes to be Xian. Shaken out of his sadness, Palme accepts her request to deliver something special to a far-off place known as Tama. This sets Palme off on a journey to discover his own emotions, and what it truly means to be human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TstH4AKPpxVOsdKlSyogMkRfMP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30491'),
  ('462906399493077232', 'A Trick of the Light', 1995, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Wim Wenders, Jürgen Jürges, Sebastian Andrae', 'Sebastian Andrae, Henrick Heckmann, Veit Helmer', 'Udo Kier, Otto Kuhnle, Christoph Merg, Nadine Büttner, Lucie Hürtgen-Skladanowsky, Bodo Werner Lang, Rüdiger Vogler, Alfred Sczczot', null, 'A rare gem of cinematic storytelling that weaves docudrama, fictional reenactment, and experimental photography into a powerful, reflective work on the early days of German cinema. The film tells the story of the Skladanowsky Brothers, the German-born duo responsible for inventing the "bioskop", an early version of the film projector.', 'A rare gem of cinematic storytelling that weaves docudrama, fictional reenactment, and experimental photography into a powerful, reflective work on the early days of German cinema. The film tells the story of the Skladanowsky Brothers, the German-born duo responsible for inventing the "bioskop", an early version of the film projector.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxa0XUYZzzTFNNt5pK3v50ZiGmC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50106'),
  ('1142986642958164328', 'A Trickle of Blood', 1995, null, 'Guillermo Granillo, Erwin Neumaier', 'Alejandro Lubezki', 'Diego Luna, Jorge Martínez de Hoyos, Yuriria Rodríguez, Naoto Takamoto, Guillermo Gil, Claudette Maillé, Ariane Pellicer, Antonio Serrano', null, 'Leon has a crush on Ofelia, so he decides to steal money from his father and cross the country looking for Ofelia who traveled to Guadalajara. On his journey, Leon goes through many adventures and takes the final step from childhood into adolescence.', 'Leon has a crush on Ofelia, so he decides to steal money from his father and cross the country looking for Ofelia who traveled to Guadalajara. On his journey, Leon goes through many adventures and takes the final step from childhood into adolescence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWE68KUhaKIxi0aOIKMNDCHe8u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346501'),
  ('640288869031489108', 'A Trip', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paz Fábrega, Esteban Chinchilla, Paz Fábrega', 'Paz Fábrega', 'Kattia G. Zúñiga, Fernando Bolaños, Hernán Jiménez', null, 'After meeting at a party, Luciana and Pedro... embark on a spur of the moment journey together that takes them to the forest. Asthey explore the beauty in the nature that surrounds them, they camp out under the stars, go on hikes, indulge in the passions of their encounter, and discuss their personal beliefs surrounding love, obligations, and attraction. Lensed in lush black-and-white cinematography amidst the gorgeous backdrop of the Costa Rican forest, an honest and genuine relationship story unfolds, lending a feeling of realism to their storybook romance in a refreshing and youthful way.', 'After meeting at a party, Luciana and Pedro... embark on a spur of the moment journey together that takes them to the forest. Asthey explore the beauty in the nature that surrounds them, they camp out under the stars, go on hikes, indulge in the passions of their encounter, and discuss their personal beliefs surrounding love, obligations, and attraction. Lensed in lush black-and-white cinematography amidst the gorgeous backdrop of the Costa Rican forest, an honest and genuine relationship story unfolds, lending a feeling of realism to their storybook romance in a refreshing and youthful way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpal22jkVi6bIapc61iYv96y24e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332491'),
  ('830972853202787014', 'A Trip to Infinity', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Jonathan Halperin, Drew Takahashi, Jim Ball', 'Jonathan Halperin, Alex Ricciardi', 'Anthony Aguirre, Stephon Alexander, Eugenia Cheng, Moon Duchin, Kenny Easwaran, Delilah Gates, Rebecca Goldstein, Brian Greene', 'PG', 'Does infinity exist? Can we experience the Infinite? In an animated film (created by artists from 10 countries) the world''s most cutting-edge scientists and mathematicians go in search of the infinite and its mind-bending implications for the universe. Eminent mathematicians, particle physicists and cosmologists dive into infinity and its mind-bending implications for the universe.', 'Does infinity exist? Can we experience the Infinite? In an animated film (created by artists from 10 countries) the world''s most cutting-edge scientists and mathematicians go in search of the infinite and its mind-bending implications for the universe. Eminent mathematicians, particle physicists and cosmologists dive into infinity and its mind-bending implications for the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24EXccaDuDEMYp7eVvsCicj5K41.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005031'),
  ('421928433911826460', 'A Trip to Jupiter', 1909, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Segundo de Chomón', null, null, null, 'The King and his official astronomer are alone in the study viewing the heavenly bodies through the monstrous telescope. They go out on the balcony and the gay old ruler is much absorbed in the phenomenon, and spends some time in studying the stars and planets. The evening has been well spent with the many mysteries which have made such a deep impression upon the King''s mind that they are still with him in his dreams. (Moving Picture World synopsis)', 'The King and his official astronomer are alone in the study viewing the heavenly bodies through the monstrous telescope. They go out on the balcony and the gay old ruler is much absorbed in the phenomenon, and spends some time in studying the stars and planets. The evening has been well spent with the many mysteries which have made such a deep impression upon the King''s mind that they are still with him in his dreams. (Moving Picture World synopsis)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gydqILUv3JOVd2zi3FVVDBW1N08.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194070'),
  ('942844518551918479', 'A Trip to the Moon', 2017, 'Drama', 'Joaquín Cambre', 'Laura Farhi, Joaquín Cambre', 'Angelo Mutti Spinetta, Leticia Brédice, Germán Palacios, Ángela Torres, Luis Machín, Micaela Amaro, Luca Tedesco, Federico Venzi', null, 'At fourteen years of age, Tomás is entering adolescence, that time in your life in which not only do you have to face physical and emotional changes, but in which there are also memories that start taking more traumatic forms. That is why he continuously visits a psychiatrist, why he acts a bit weird. He is a bit of a hermit, bearing, as much as he can, the extreme normalcy of his family, who are dying for summer to arrive so they can go to a time share at the beach, while Tomás wants to escape… to the moon.', 'At fourteen years of age, Tomás is entering adolescence, that time in your life in which not only do you have to face physical and emotional changes, but in which there are also memories that start taking more traumatic forms. That is why he continuously visits a psychiatrist, why he acts a bit weird. He is a bit of a hermit, bearing, as much as he can, the extreme normalcy of his family, who are dying for summer to arrive so they can go to a time share at the beach, while Tomás wants to escape… to the moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAEWAFoljaxBlJlGhrHv7l6l8lP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:481264'),
  ('960683544403116756', 'A Troll in Central Park', 1994, 'Fantasy, Animation, Science Fiction, Family', 'Don Bluth, Gary Goldman', 'Stu Krieger', 'Dom DeLuise, Phillip Glasser, Tawny Sunshine Glover, Cloris Leachman, Hayley Mills, Jonathan Pryce, Charles Nelson Reilly, Jack Angel', 'G', 'A friendly troll with a magic green thumb grows one flower too many for the queen, whose laws require all trolls to be mean ugly and scare humans whenever possible. As a punishment, he is exiled to a world of concrete, where he should live a life of proper trolldom: Manhattan.', 'A friendly troll with a magic green thumb grows one flower too many for the queen, whose laws require all trolls to be mean ugly and scare humans whenever possible. As a punishment, he is exiled to a world of concrete, where he should live a life of proper trolldom: Manhattan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5RH87MTTrQwfX3HgYD444naIWn7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35614'),
  ('289440842541399350', 'A True Gentleman', 2024, 'Romance, Drama', 'Onur Bilgetay', 'Deniz Madanoğlu', 'Çağatay Ulusoy, Ebru Şahin, Şenay Gürler, Haki Biçici, Nazlı Bulum, Gümeç Alpay Aslan, Selen Uçer, Kubilay Tunçer', 'R', 'A charming male escort finds his life turned upside down when he starts to fall in love, challenging him to discover what he truly wants and needs.', 'A charming male escort finds his life turned upside down when he starts to fall in love, challenging him to discover what he truly wants and needs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCMSCNy8kGerF1Dw4woWUP6ltxR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1352821'),
  ('657971412222553711', 'A True Mob Story', 1998, 'Action, Crime, Romance, Thriller', 'Wong Jing, Cheng Siu-Keung', 'Wong Jing', 'Andy Lau, Gigi Leung Wing-Kei, Suki Kwan Sau-Mei, Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Ben Ng Ngai-Cheung, Mark Cheng Ho-Nam, Sam Lee, Joe Ma Tak-Chung', null, 'A low level gangster in Hong Kong gains new respect after saving a boss''s life in a gang fight. Despite his wife''s death in this attack, he appears to be moving up in the Triad family until he discovers the other bosses are not looking out for him when he is double crossed and the gangster he previously hospitalized in the gang fight comes back for revenge.', 'A low level gangster in Hong Kong gains new respect after saving a boss''s life in a gang fight. Despite his wife''s death in this attack, he appears to be moving up in the Triad family until he discovers the other bosses are not looking out for him when he is double crossed and the gangster he previously hospitalized in the gang fight comes back for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEyydesczSfRZaT8Q204hSV5rWF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58414'),
  ('1109300698673965216', 'A Turtle''s Tale 2: Sammy''s Escape from Paradise', 2012, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Vincent Kesteloot, Ben Stassen', 'Domonic Paris', 'Kaitlyn Maher, Carter Hastings, Alan Shearman, Khary Payton, Carlos Alazraqui, Joe J. Thomas, Jeff Dunham, Dino Andrade', 'NR', 'When Sammy and Ray find themselves trapped in The Tank, an underwater aquarium, they must hatch a plan to escape and reunite with their grandkids, Ricky and Ella, and protect them from the dangers of the ocean.', 'When Sammy and Ray find themselves trapped in The Tank, an underwater aquarium, they must hatch a plan to escape and reunite with their grandkids, Ricky and Ella, and protect them from the dangers of the ocean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/br7BxWeKDKCPExIIN6ePoCLe07z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113594'),
  ('538339009112315478', 'A Turtle''s Tale: Sammy''s Adventures', 2010, 'Animation, Family', 'Ben Stassen, Mimi Maynard', 'Domonic Paris', 'Yuri Lowenthal, Gemma Arterton, Isabelle Fuhrman, Melanie Griffith, Tim Curry, John Hurt, Robert Sheehan, Kathy Griffin', 'G', 'Born on a Baja, California beach in 1959, new hatchling Sammy races across the beach to the ocean while avoiding being caught by seagulls and crabs. Thus begins Sammy''s incredible fifty-year ocean journey where he overcomes obstacles, both natural and man-made, while trying to fulfill his dream of travelling around the world. Along the way he meets his best friend, a fellow turtle named Ray, and never forgets about Shelly, a turtle he saved that first day on the beach and the one he''s always loved.', 'Born on a Baja, California beach in 1959, new hatchling Sammy races across the beach to the ocean while avoiding being caught by seagulls and crabs. Thus begins Sammy''s incredible fifty-year ocean journey where he overcomes obstacles, both natural and man-made, while trying to fulfill his dream of travelling around the world. Along the way he meets his best friend, a fellow turtle named Ray, and never forgets about Shelly, a turtle he saved that first day on the beach and the one he''s always loved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYz1FQjspxQCUCMXuB4ihnH9Y03.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49953'),
  ('1121077051342549226', 'A Twelve-Year Night', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, History', 'Álvaro Brechner, Angie Paul Risque, Maria Belen Cirio', 'Álvaro Brechner', 'Antonio de la Torre, Chino Darín, Alfonso Tort, César Troncoso, Soledad Villamil, Sílvia Pérez Cruz, Mirella Pascual, Nidia Telles', null, 'Uruguay, 1973. Having been crushed by the military dictatorship, surviving members of the Tupamaro guerillas are imprisoned and tortured. They must find a way to endure the coming 12 years.', 'Uruguay, 1973. Having been crushed by the military dictatorship, surviving members of the Tupamaro guerillas are imprisoned and tortured. They must find a way to endure the coming 12 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1SEABHjk34flsBQigm9ygMuUM4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514575'),
  ('876731660301680471', 'A Unique Life', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Çağan Irmak, Fikret Kadıoğlu, Barış Özbiçer', 'Ali Demirel, Çağan Irmak, Emre Özdür', 'Demet Akbağ, Yetkin Dikinciler, Sevil Akı Saner, Batuhan Begimgil, Çisem Çancı, Efecan Şenolsun, Irmak Örnek, Ümit Erlim', null, 'A widowed housewife returns to college to complete her studies and embarks on a journey that gives her life new meaning.', 'A widowed housewife returns to college to complete her studies and embarks on a journey that gives her life new meaning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWBXFE9rKn776gZXaJeupY4HX0Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374074'),
  ('170778636564354104', 'A United Kingdom', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Amma Asante, Sam McCurdy', 'Guy Hibbert', 'David Oyelowo, Rosamund Pike, Tom Felton, Jack Davenport, Terry Pheto, Laura Carmichael, Jessica Oyelowo, Vusi Kunene', 'PG-13', 'The inspiring true story of Seretse Khama, the King of Bechuanaland (modern Botswana), and Ruth Williams, the London office worker he married in 1948 in the face of fierce opposition from their families and the British and South African governments. Seretse and Ruth defied family, Apartheid and empire - their love triumphed over every obstacle flung in their path and in so doing they transformed their nation and inspired the world.', 'The inspiring true story of Seretse Khama, the King of Bechuanaland (modern Botswana), and Ruth Williams, the London office worker he married in 1948 in the face of fierce opposition from their families and the British and South African governments. Seretse and Ruth defied family, Apartheid and empire - their love triumphed over every obstacle flung in their path and in so doing they transformed their nation and inspired the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyhoW9qK7ZaDM1V4A6pPL9DWjn8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347026'),
  ('353478050574353218', 'A Useful Ghost', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Ratchapoom Boonbunchachoke, Tippawan Narintorn, Soifa Saenkhumkon', 'Ratchapoom Boonbunchachoke', 'Davika Hoorne, Witsarut Himmarat, Apasiri Nitibhon, Wanlop Rungkumjad, Wisarut Homhuan, Gandhi​ Wasuvitchayagit, Ornanong Thaisriwong, Kritpahat Srimangkornkaew', null, 'Worried about her husband being allergic to dust, Nat, a recently-dead woman, returns as a ghost possessing a vacuum cleaner to clean the house and protect her family from other vengeful ghosts in the house. To become a useful ghost, she needs to get rid of the useless ones.', 'Worried about her husband being allergic to dust, Nat, a recently-dead woman, returns as a ghost possessing a vacuum cleaner to clean the house and protect her family from other vengeful ghosts in the house. To become a useful ghost, she needs to get rid of the useless ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ysCOASLn8SaiFYWZYqNLTdO97NQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1364904'),
  ('666371210680366850', 'A Useful Life', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Federico Veiroj, María Angélica Gil, Manolo Nieto', 'Gonzalo Delgado, Federico Veiroj, Inés Bortagaray', 'Jorge Jellinek, Manuel Martinez Carril, Paola Venditto, Gonzalo Delgado, Felipe Arocena, Victoria Novic, Pablo Stoll', null, 'A movie-theater employee adjusts to a new life as the cinema he''s worked at for over 25 years faces closure.', 'A movie-theater employee adjusts to a new life as the cinema he''s worked at for over 25 years faces closure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udTBOL4BlTZXXE1DPC3vfwsgYW7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81523'),
  ('455384499742182510', 'A Valentine''s Match', 2020, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie', 'Tyler Walzak, Christie Will Wolf', 'Cara J. Russell, Kim Beyer-Johnson', 'Bethany Joy Lenz, Luke Macfarlane, Caitlin Stryker, Trevor Lerner, Marco Grazzini, Claude Knowlton', null, 'Fired from her job as a reality TV host, Natalie returns home for Valentine''s Day, only to find herself running the town festival''s auction with her ex-fiancé thanks to two scheming mothers.', 'Fired from her job as a reality TV host, Natalie returns home for Valentine''s Day, only to find herself running the town festival''s auction with her ex-fiancé thanks to two scheming mothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFt5aETu3TnANmS7N6zmZgJL8hh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661331'),
  ('391121564970212005', 'A Vampire in the Family', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Ale McHaddo, Elaine Freitas, Paulo de Tarso Disca', 'Paulo Cursino', 'Leandro Hassum, Rômulo Arantes Neto, Edson Celulari, Monique Alfradique, Mel Maia, Caio Mendonça, Renata Brás, Maria Flor Franco', 'R', 'Fernandinho is a family man, former football player and a current podcast commentator that is surprised by the visit of his inconvenient brother-in-law, Gregorio, who discovers to be lazy and literally a bloodsucker - a vampire.', 'Fernandinho is a family man, former football player and a current podcast commentator that is surprised by the visit of his inconvenient brother-in-law, Gregorio, who discovers to be lazy and literally a bloodsucker - a vampire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dws3yBxzT70cI53tEpUk21OIliS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1211419'),
  ('574275687275052339', 'A Velha a Fiar', 1964, 'Comedy, Music', 'Humberto Mauro, José A. Mauro', null, 'Mateus Colaço', null, 'A Velha a Fiar illustrates a Brazilian folk song in which a being or entity is always predating another being, but is in its turn predated by some other animal, until the circle closes. It begins like this: an old woman is quietly weaving and a fly disturbs her; a spider eats the fly; a mouse eats the spider; a cat chases the mouse and so on...', 'A Velha a Fiar illustrates a Brazilian folk song in which a being or entity is always predating another being, but is in its turn predated by some other animal, until the circle closes. It begins like this: an old woman is quietly weaving and a fly disturbs her; a spider eats the fly; a mouse eats the spider; a cat chases the mouse and so on...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMAmnXyPhnausHbLNl6PdxoQvGX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329583'),
  ('759869632549001501', 'A Very Bad Friend', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Varante Soudjian, Patrice Marchand, Jean-Eudes Monachon', 'Thomas Nlend, Varante Soudjian', 'Ahmed Sylla, Alban Ivanov, Judith El Zein, Ornella Fleury, Christian Bujeau, Amir el Kacem, Jean-Philippe Ricci, Pierre-Marie Mosconi', null, 'Mika, a little crook, took a quick tour of the prison, where he got to know "Putin", a crazy and unpredictable detainee. As soon as his sentence has been served, he decides to start from scratch and start his life over again. As he prepares to marry the daughter of a wealthy businessman, his past catches up with him: Putin arrives without warning! Mika will quickly realize that we do not easily get rid of such a ball ...', 'Mika, a little crook, took a quick tour of the prison, where he got to know "Putin", a crazy and unpredictable detainee. As soon as his sentence has been served, he decides to start from scratch and start his life over again. As he prepares to marry the daughter of a wealthy businessman, his past catches up with him: Putin arrives without warning! Mika will quickly realize that we do not easily get rid of such a ball ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSspU3czt0eGoVeJAjJvLOtaS8X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589984'),
  ('979067743054801648', 'A Very Brady Christmas', 1988, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Isidore Mankofsky, Peter Baldwin', 'Lloyd J. Schwartz, Sherwood Schwartz', 'Florence Henderson, Robert Reed, Ann B. Davis, Maureen McCormick, Eve Plumb, Jennifer Runyon, Barry Williams, Christopher Knight', null, 'Almost 20 years after the start of the original "Brady Bunch" the kids are grown up and have kids of their own. Everyone is having a wonderful time back at the family house for Christmas, until Mike learns of a structural problem in one of the buildings he designed. As he is inspecting the problem, the building collapses, trapping him inside. As the whole family waits by the pile of rubble, they fear the worst. Will Dad be all right?', 'Almost 20 years after the start of the original "Brady Bunch" the kids are grown up and have kids of their own. Everyone is having a wonderful time back at the family house for Christmas, until Mike learns of a structural problem in one of the buildings he designed. As he is inspecting the problem, the building collapses, trapping him inside. As the whole family waits by the pile of rubble, they fear the worst. Will Dad be all right?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3F7vQJYKeDJoVJXBrQS5H2D1za.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49358'),
  ('289178631496970709', 'A Very Brady Sequel', 1996, 'Family, Comedy', 'Arlene Sanford, Mac Ahlberg, Gregory Jacobs', 'James Berg, Deborah Kaplan, Harry Elfont', 'Shelley Long, Gary Cole, Christopher Daniel Barnes, Christine Taylor, Paul Sutera, Jennifer Elise Cox, Jesse Lee Soffer, Olivia Hack', 'PG-13', 'A man claiming to be Carol Brady''s long-lost first husband, Roy Martin, shows up at the suburban Brady residence one evening. An impostor, the man is actually determined to steal the Bradys'' familiar horse statue, a $20-million ancient Asian artifact.', 'A man claiming to be Carol Brady''s long-lost first husband, Roy Martin, shows up at the suburban Brady residence one evening. An impostor, the man is actually determined to steal the Bradys'' familiar horse statue, a $20-million ancient Asian artifact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xqOkzAQvXCLkDtmlWU6HZnOhru.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12606'),
  ('835053556638269080', 'A Very British Gangster', 2007, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Donal MacIntyre', null, 'Dominic Noonan', null, 'A documentary about one of Britain''s most dangerous crime families and introduces us to its magnetic, larger-than-life leader, Dominic Noonan (aka Lattlay Fottfoy).', 'A documentary about one of Britain''s most dangerous crime families and introduces us to its magnetic, larger-than-life leader, Dominic Noonan (aka Lattlay Fottfoy).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2YAox1eooEKxSP2WgEFJAUles7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13137'),
  ('507585293522227969', 'A Very Charming Christmas Town', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Jake Helgren', 'Jake Helgren', 'Natalie Hall, Jon Prescott, Kelley Jakle, Jo Marie Payton, Tracey E. Bregman, Mark Hapka, Joe Lando, Autumn Federici', null, 'Aubrey Lang, a travel and lifestyle blogger, goes to the little town of Solvang for her next holiday vlog piece after it’s voted Most Christmassy Town in the USA. She soon meets Sawyer Larsen, a local community coordinator and chocolate shop owner assigned to show her around the small town. At first, the unlikely pairing is at odds but soon start to fall for each other amidst the twinkling lights of the romantic little Danish village.', 'Aubrey Lang, a travel and lifestyle blogger, goes to the little town of Solvang for her next holiday vlog piece after it’s voted Most Christmassy Town in the USA. She soon meets Sawyer Larsen, a local community coordinator and chocolate shop owner assigned to show her around the small town. At first, the unlikely pairing is at odds but soon start to fall for each other amidst the twinkling lights of the romantic little Danish village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glibmmF2Ru2PUXoreDXxTmAnDhi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744933'),
  ('291464438371014812', 'A Very Corgi Christmas', 2019, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Joshua Fraiman, Andrew Cymek', 'Andrew Cymek, Brigitte Kingsley, Patrick McBrearty', 'Kelly Kruger, Kevin McGarry, Ariella Cannon, Alys Crocker, Jennifer Dale, Davide Fair, Dan Karpenchuk, Rebecca LaMarche', null, 'All Lauren Bradley, a single mom and confirmed workaholic, wants this holiday is a much deserved break. Those hopes are dashed when she runs into fellow single dad Ben who enlists her help in taking care of a cute and cuddly christmas present he plans to give his daughter. Through all the chaos and calls from work, Lauren just might get the best gift of all, the holiday spirit.', 'All Lauren Bradley, a single mom and confirmed workaholic, wants this holiday is a much deserved break. Those hopes are dashed when she runs into fellow single dad Ben who enlists her help in taking care of a cute and cuddly christmas present he plans to give his daughter. Through all the chaos and calls from work, Lauren just might get the best gift of all, the holiday spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SRzWkTWJSTvJppdzob7oJHfAQS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:637879'),
  ('556898324141932720', 'A Very Country Christmas', 2017, 'Drama, TV Movie, Romance', 'Joshua Fraiman, Justin G. Dyck', 'Keith Cooper', 'Greyston Holt, Bea Santos, Greg Vaughan, Deanna Kay Carter, Allison Hossack, Michelle Morgan, Soma Bhatia, Raven Stewart', 'G', 'Jeanette Williams is a busy single parent, trying to make the best life for her and her daughter. With no time to follow current celebrity gossip, Jeanette is unaware of when a Country superstar returns to their small town to escape the intrusive paparazzi and the chaos of fame. A chance meeting between the two have them both letting their guards down and opening their hearts to the possibility of romance.', 'Jeanette Williams is a busy single parent, trying to make the best life for her and her daughter. With no time to follow current celebrity gossip, Jeanette is unaware of when a Country superstar returns to their small town to escape the intrusive paparazzi and the chaos of fame. A chance meeting between the two have them both letting their guards down and opening their hearts to the possibility of romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36aJwqGmoR1TamObPtklVRjBCCX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486982'),
  ('104992714785315669', 'A Very Curious Girl', 1969, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nelly Kaplan, Jean Badal, Jean-Paul Ginet', 'Claude Makovski, Nelly Kaplan', 'Bernadette Lafont, Georges Géret, Henri Czarniak, Claire Maurier, Julien Guiomar, Jean Parédès, Pascal Mazzotti, Jacques Marin', null, 'Treated as an outcast and exploited by the villagers of a small town, a young woman liberates herself through sex, which she uses as a tool of economic gain and an instrument of revenge against those who have wronged her.', 'Treated as an outcast and exploited by the villagers of a small town, a young woman liberates herself through sex, which she uses as a tool of economic gain and an instrument of revenge against those who have wronged her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yoj0ha9lShk42cIs1594GkCxgH7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67496'),
  ('686668201674098868', 'A Very English Murder', 1974, 'Mystery, TV Movie', 'Samson Samsonov, Evgeniy Guslinskiy', 'Edgar Smirnov, Vadim Yusov', 'Boris Ivanov, Aleksey Batalov, Georgi Taratorkin, Irina Muravyova, Ivan Pereverzev, Faime Jurno, Einari Koppel, Leonid Obolensky', null, 'A classic detective story based on one of the best-loved Golden Age crime writers, Cyril Hare, novel "An English Murder" originally published in 1951. The setting of An English Murder seems, at first, to be a very conventional one. A group of family and friends come together for Christmas at a country house, Warbeck Hall. The house is owned by Lord Warbeck, a dying and impoverished peer who wants to be among loved ones for what he thinks will be his last Christmas. The holiday decorations are up and snow is falling fast outside. The guests range from the Lord''s difficult son to a visiting Czech historian. There is, of course, a faithful butler and his ambitious daughter. But when the murders begin, there is nothing at all conventional about them - or the manner of their detection...', 'A classic detective story based on one of the best-loved Golden Age crime writers, Cyril Hare, novel "An English Murder" originally published in 1951. The setting of An English Murder seems, at first, to be a very conventional one. A group of family and friends come together for Christmas at a country house, Warbeck Hall. The house is owned by Lord Warbeck, a dying and impoverished peer who wants to be among loved ones for what he thinks will be his last Christmas. The holiday decorations are up and snow is falling fast outside. The guests range from the Lord''s difficult son to a visiting Czech historian. There is, of course, a faithful butler and his ambitious daughter. But when the murders begin, there is nothing at all conventional about them - or the manner of their detection...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0oo9FuvD6jWy4Oygb6BPWGMqyC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121270'),
  ('703458820133830207', 'A Very Fine Lady', 1908, 'Comedy', 'Louis Feuillade', 'Louis Feuillade', 'Renée Carl', null, 'Renée Carl stars in this lively slapstick silent short as a beautiful lady who causes distractions and accidents among the male population as she walks though the streets of Paris.', 'Renée Carl stars in this lively slapstick silent short as a beautiful lady who causes distractions and accidents among the male population as she walks though the streets of Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4cEn9xOm8v0TOFho861mh2nztia.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196644'),
  ('534580416967820504', 'A Very Good Boy', 2026, 'Documentary, Biography', 'Sébastien Lifshitz, Paul Guilhaume', 'Sebastien Lifshitz, Claude Loir, Damien Roger', 'Claude Loir, Ghislain Van Hove, Yolande Decarsin, Elias Boughedir, Olivier Goinard', null, 'From his childhood in a modest family in the Pyrénées to his unexpected career as a porn actor in the 1970s, the film traces the life of Claude Loir, who set out to fully embrace life. His homosexuality and curiosity guide him through encounters that lead into the shadowy, liberated circles of a pre-AIDS era, caught between conservatism and sexual freedom. Loves and lovers, flamboyance and fragility… the film offers a striking portrait of a fearless, hedonistic man navigating desire, identity, and society’s constraints.', 'From his childhood in a modest family in the Pyrénées to his unexpected career as a porn actor in the 1970s, the film traces the life of Claude Loir, who set out to fully embrace life. His homosexuality and curiosity guide him through encounters that lead into the shadowy, liberated circles of a pre-AIDS era, caught between conservatism and sexual freedom. Loves and lovers, flamboyance and fragility… the film offers a striking portrait of a fearless, hedonistic man navigating desire, identity, and society’s constraints.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Ft7b3IwU88LSIQEmE4py6lp1rhjD.jpg', 'plex:movie:a-very-good-boy-2026'),
  ('656218413132889543', 'A Very Harold & Kumar Christmas', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Todd Strauss-Schulson, Michael Barrett', 'Jon Hurwitz, Hayden Schlossberg', 'John Cho, Kal Penn, Paula Garcés, Neil Patrick Harris, Elias Koteas, Danneel Ackles, Thomas Lennon, Jake Johnson', 'R', 'Six years have elapsed since Guantanamo Bay, leaving Harold and Kumar estranged from one another with very different families, friends and lives. But when Kumar arrives on Harold''s doorstep during the holiday season with a mysterious package in hand, he inadvertently burns down Harold''s father-in-law''s beloved Christmas tree. To fix the problem, Harold and Kumar embark on a mission through New York City to find the perfect Christmas tree, once again stumbling into trouble at every single turn.', 'Six years have elapsed since Guantanamo Bay, leaving Harold and Kumar estranged from one another with very different families, friends and lives. But when Kumar arrives on Harold''s doorstep during the holiday season with a mysterious package in hand, he inadvertently burns down Harold''s father-in-law''s beloved Christmas tree. To fix the problem, Harold and Kumar embark on a mission through New York City to find the perfect Christmas tree, once again stumbling into trouble at every single turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cncxLilRHKayn8VKhzjAMHkbN4f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55465'),
  ('224243658357161084', 'A Very Jonas Christmas Movie', 2025, 'Comedy, Music', 'Jessica Yu, Brendan Steacy, Matt Birman', 'Isaac Aptaker, Elizabeth Berger', 'Kevin Jonas, Joe Jonas, Nick Jonas, Chloe Bennet, Billie Lourd, Laverne Cox, Andrew Barth Feldman, Randall Park', 'PG', 'Kevin, Nick, and Joe Jonas face a series of escalating obstacles as they struggle to make it from London to New York in time to spend Christmas with their families.', 'Kevin, Nick, and Joe Jonas face a series of escalating obstacles as they struggle to make it from London to New York in time to spend Christmas with their families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGLgaDrYWmTAdRFzGP5pBquRnhO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1425122'),
  ('588575633767517876', 'A Very Long Engagement', 2004, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Bruno Delbonnel, Jean-Pierre Jeunet', 'Guillaume Laurant, Jean-Pierre Jeunet', 'Audrey Tautou, Gaspard Ulliel, Dominique Pinon, Chantal Neuwirth, André Dussollier, Ticky Holgado, Marion Cotillard, Dominique Bettenfeld', 'R', 'Young Frenchwoman Mathilde searches for the truth about her missing fiancé, lost during World War I, and learns many unexpected things along the way. The love of her life is gone. But she refuses to believe he''s gone forever — and she needs to know for sure.', 'Young Frenchwoman Mathilde searches for the truth about her missing fiancé, lost during World War I, and learns many unexpected things along the way. The love of her life is gone. But she refuses to believe he''s gone forever — and she needs to know for sure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZ3Ir3d69dsyxif8dTVh3DjKzKH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2841'),
  ('479771627475997711', 'A Very Merry Bridesmaid', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'David I. Strasser, Joanne Gerein, Cassy Hungerson', 'Tracy Andreen, Elena Valdez', 'Emily Osment, Casey Deidrick, Patch May, Frances Leigh, Iris Quinn, Mike Dopud, Parmiss Sehat, Libby Osler', 'G', 'Leah''s 30th birthday is on Christmas Eve, the same day as her brother''s wedding. Her childhood crush is back in town for the wedding and he is determined to make sure her birthday does not go by the wayside.', 'Leah''s 30th birthday is on Christmas Eve, the same day as her brother''s wedding. Her childhood crush is back in town for the wedding and he is determined to make sure her birthday does not go by the wayside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGQIre0Q9TVf9sjMNUZ1FNzfkNI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:876104'),
  ('454550286971352790', 'A Very Merry Cricket', 1973, 'Animation, Family', 'Chuck Jones', 'Chuck Jones', 'Les Tremayne, Mel Blanc', null, 'A sequel to "A Cricket in Times Square," in this feature a musical cricket returns to his New York City home and his friends, a cat and a mouse, to discover the meaning of Christmas.', 'A sequel to "A Cricket in Times Square," in this feature a musical cricket returns to his New York City home and his friends, a cat and a mouse, to discover the meaning of Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jO2TGV0ouVShMVUnz72yrJt3Sm5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59195'),
  ('492546362733796965', 'A Very Merry Mix-Up', 2013, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Jonathan Wright', 'Barbara Kymlicka', 'Alicia Witt, Mark Wiebe, Scott Gibson, Susan Hogan, Richard Fitzpatrick, Lawrence Dane, Mimi Kuzyk, Judah Katz', null, 'Shop owner Alice Chapman is nervous to meet her future in-laws at Christmas, especially because she is arriving ahead of her new fiance Will Mitchum. Alice''s trip becomes more stressful when her luggage is lost and her phone is damaged, leaving her no way to find Will''s family!', 'Shop owner Alice Chapman is nervous to meet her future in-laws at Christmas, especially because she is arriving ahead of her new fiance Will Mitchum. Alice''s trip becomes more stressful when her luggage is lost and her phone is damaged, leaving her no way to find Will''s family!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WwGwKE9yMB90EsXduuPTX3iBbL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238749'),
  ('1034309321545745796', 'A Very Merry Toy Store', 2017, 'Family, Romance, TV Movie', 'Mark Parry, Paula Hart', 'David Breckman', 'Melissa Joan Hart, Mario López, Tara Strong, Dan Amboyer, Brian Dennehy, Beth Broderick, William Ragsdale, Billy Gardell', null, 'Two rival toy shop owners reluctantly join forces when an unscrupulous toy magnate opens a box store in their town.', 'Two rival toy shop owners reluctantly join forces when an unscrupulous toy magnate opens a box store in their town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKnRZ02JMWI0gkXpFPhDNfhr4io.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485034'),
  ('765230570573890155', 'A Very Moral Night', 1977, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Károly Makk, János Tóth', 'Péter Bacsó, István Örkény', 'Margit Makay, Irén Psota, Carla Romanelli, Györgyi Tarján, György Cserhalmi, Mari Kiss, Lajos Balázsovits, Edith Leyrer', null, 'A brothel in a small Hungarian town becomes the home of a medical student after his favorite working girls find out he''s out of rent money. Trouble brews as they learn his mother is coming for a visit and they must transform the house.', 'A brothel in a small Hungarian town becomes the home of a medical student after his favorite working girls find out he''s out of rent money. Trouble brews as they learn his mother is coming for a visit and they must transform the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aw1nToBG5Du67LPJ7snwB59Rixq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131012'),
  ('549333425853671669', 'A Very Murray Christmas', 2015, 'Comedy, Music, TV Movie', 'Sofia Coppola, Roman Coppola, John Tanzer', 'Mitch Glazer, Sofia Coppola, Bill Murray', 'Bill Murray, Paul Shaffer, Michael Cera, George Clooney, Miley Cyrus, Dimitri Dimitrov, David Johansen, Rashida Jones', null, 'Bill Murray worries no one will show up to his TV show due to a massive snowstorm in New York City. Through luck and perseverance, guests arrive at Gotham’s Carlyle Hotel to help him — dancing and singing in holiday spirit.', 'Bill Murray worries no one will show up to his TV show due to a massive snowstorm in New York City. Through luck and perseverance, guests arrive at Gotham’s Carlyle Hotel to help him — dancing and singing in holiday spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ir2DjNNXmMePsyc4inFa8oI23r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364067'),
  ('1049839657953357261', 'A Very Natural Thing', 1974, 'Drama, Romance', 'Purusha Larkin, C.H. Douglass', 'Purusha Larkin, Joseph Coencas', 'Robert McLane, Curt Gareth, Bo White, Anthony McKay, Marilyn Meyers, Jay Pierce, Barnaby Rudge, A. Bailey Chapin', 'R', 'When David, an ex-monk still in his twenties meets Mark, he falls hard; soon he''s asked Mark if they can live together. Things go well for awhile, and then differences in their definition of "commitment" begin to push them apart. Mark wants other sexual adventures, David tries to go along. Can they talk through the crisis in their relationship or is a breakup in the offing? David sees his relationship with Mark as a marriage, so if it ends, can David''s heart ever heal?', 'When David, an ex-monk still in his twenties meets Mark, he falls hard; soon he''s asked Mark if they can live together. Things go well for awhile, and then differences in their definition of "commitment" begin to push them apart. Mark wants other sexual adventures, David tries to go along. Can they talk through the crisis in their relationship or is a breakup in the offing? David sees his relationship with Mark as a marriage, so if it ends, can David''s heart ever heal?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxHEvJU4Ae97gyTyi7TuGvusuXF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44495'),
  ('1080700595926511920', 'A Very Nutty Christmas', 2018, 'TV Movie, Family', 'Colin Theys, Branden James Maxham', 'Juliet Giglio, Keith Giglio', 'Melissa Joan Hart, Barry Watson, Marissa Jaret Winokur, Conchata Ferrell, Rizwan Manji, Richard Riehle, Ryan Caltagirone, Chester Jones III', null, 'Hard-working bakery owner Kate Holiday, has more cookie orders than she has time to fill this holiday season, and when her boyfriend suddenly breaks up with her, any shred of Christmas joy she was hanging onto, immediately disappears. After Kate hangs the last ornament on the tree and goes to bed, she awakens the next morning to a little bit of Christmas magic. She gets the surprise of her life when Chip, a handsome soldier who may or may not be the Nutcracker Prince from Tchaikovsky’s “The Nutcracker,” appears in her living room.', 'Hard-working bakery owner Kate Holiday, has more cookie orders than she has time to fill this holiday season, and when her boyfriend suddenly breaks up with her, any shred of Christmas joy she was hanging onto, immediately disappears. After Kate hangs the last ornament on the tree and goes to bed, she awakens the next morning to a little bit of Christmas magic. She gets the surprise of her life when Chip, a handsome soldier who may or may not be the Nutcracker Prince from Tchaikovsky’s “The Nutcracker,” appears in her living room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZsYTYA4YvZ727UbfXGshqwmygk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550651'),
  ('1142906104047579254', 'A Very Old Story', 1968, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Nadezhda Kosheverova, Konstantin Ryzhov, Anna Tubenshlyak', 'Valeri Frid, Yuli Dunsky', 'Oleg Dal, Marina Neyolova, Vladimir Etush, Georgiy Vitsin, Vera Titova, Viktor Perevalov, Georgiy Shtil, Anatoly Korolkevich', null, 'Based on the famous fairytale "The Tinderbox" by Hans Christian Andersen. The main character of the film is a puppeteer who lives in a poor and gray world. He composes a fairy tale in which he himself, in the guise of a brave soldier, finds a flint and is helped by a kind wizard. The soldier falls in love with a spoiled, capricious princess who, as befits a princess, poses riddles to her numerous suitors. Her father, the king, is eager to see the soldier as her husband, as he believes the soldier has a great deal of gold. In the fairy tale, everything ends well, but in real life, not so much. "But life is not a fairy tale," his beloved girl says to him as she bids him farewell.', 'Based on the famous fairytale "The Tinderbox" by Hans Christian Andersen. The main character of the film is a puppeteer who lives in a poor and gray world. He composes a fairy tale in which he himself, in the guise of a brave soldier, finds a flint and is helped by a kind wizard. The soldier falls in love with a spoiled, capricious princess who, as befits a princess, poses riddles to her numerous suitors. Her father, the king, is eager to see the soldier as her husband, as he believes the soldier has a great deal of gold. In the fairy tale, everything ends well, but in real life, not so much. "But life is not a fairy tale," his beloved girl says to him as she bids him farewell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWl0UDEmRX0HG2F1nNpx0FV2S52.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80244'),
  ('3824678342711172', 'A Very Private Affair', 1962, 'Drama', 'Louis Malle, Henri Decaë, Philippe Collin', 'Louis Malle, Jean-Paul Rappeneau, Jean Ferry', 'Brigitte Bardot, Marcello Mastroianni, Dirk Sanders, Jacqueline Doyen, Eléonore Hirt, Gloria France, Gregor von Rezzori, Nicolas Bataille', 'NR', 'After achieving fame as a movie star, a woman finds her private life invaded by relentless fans, leading her mother’s ex-lover to intervene and offer protection.', 'After achieving fame as a movie star, a woman finds her private life invaded by relentless fans, leading her mother’s ex-lover to intervene and offer protection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLiqpUkxnuo20WVJhvCHCQIkCkU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48196'),
  ('312906415009502500', 'A Very Unlucky Leprechaun', 1998, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Harry C. Box, Brian Hennessy, Ivan McMahon', 'Craig J. Nevius', 'Warwick Davis, Tim Matheson, Danielle Lombardi, Stephanie Lombardi, Lisa Thornhill, Mick Nolan, Donal Simmie, Jimmy Keogh', 'PG', 'Nine year old Molly and her father move to Ireland into a house they''ve inherited, nicknamed "Misfortune Manor". It brings bad luck to anyone who lives in it, and Molly and her father soon fall victim to the curse: they will lose their new found home unless they can pay the taxes they owe on it. Lucky the Leprechaun is on hand to help Molly break the curse and help with pots of gold.', 'Nine year old Molly and her father move to Ireland into a house they''ve inherited, nicknamed "Misfortune Manor". It brings bad luck to anyone who lives in it, and Molly and her father soon fall victim to the curse: they will lose their new found home unless they can pay the taxes they owe on it. Lucky the Leprechaun is on hand to help Molly break the curse and help with pots of gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLgp5sm6LMGVLBUrHji9CLrcdo0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66457'),
  ('1118400810437900266', 'A Very Very Beautiful Love Story', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Pascal Thomas, Renan Pollès', 'Pascal Thomas, François Caviglioli, Clémence de Biéville', 'Julien Doré, Marina Hands, Guillaume Gallienne, Noémie Lvovsky, Hervé Pierre, Paul Minthe, Christian Morin, Laure de Clermont-Tonnerre', null, 'Dorothée and Nicolas fall in love at first sight. Together, they’re going to live a very beautiful love story... they know it. But life always finds a way to compromise the best resolutions, the best script, and nothing will happen as expected. Nicolas and Dorothée will be carried into a stormy comedy as crazy as their passion for each other…', 'Dorothée and Nicolas fall in love at first sight. Together, they’re going to live a very beautiful love story... they know it. But life always finds a way to compromise the best resolutions, the best script, and nothing will happen as expected. Nicolas and Dorothée will be carried into a stormy comedy as crazy as their passion for each other…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FJNEffv07QrKAgkUCnFiF23TjS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44962'),
  ('795223909844815838', 'A Very, Like, Crazy Date', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tim Kamps', 'Tim Kamps, Bart van den Donker', 'Tobias Kersloot, Yuani Blindenburg, Laura Bakker', null, 'When the first date between the introverted Sander and urbanite Alex seems hopeless within the first 10 minutes, they decide to call it a night early. At that moment, the restaurant is robbed and they end up in a hostage situation. While ordered to sit under their table, they are forced to continue their date. When it turns out that one of the robbers is carrying a big secret, everything descends into chaos.', 'When the first date between the introverted Sander and urbanite Alex seems hopeless within the first 10 minutes, they decide to call it a night early. At that moment, the restaurant is robbed and they end up in a hostage situation. While ordered to sit under their table, they are forced to continue their date. When it turns out that one of the robbers is carrying a big secret, everything descends into chaos.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FjSmoTcVFKoCenrhUBVFQthuve0r.jpg', 'plex:movie:a-very-like-crazy-date'),
  ('780677471980592698', 'A Veteran''s Christmas', 2018, 'TV Movie, Family, Drama', 'Russ Goozee, Mark Jean', 'Mark Jean', 'Eloise Mumford, Sean Faris, Miriam McDonald, Jacob Blair, Richard Waugh, Amanda Lisman, Jenna Weir, Mary Long', 'PG', 'Captain Grace Garland, a decorated U.S. veteran, returns home after two tours of Search and Rescue in Afghanistan. After being separated from her beloved K9 partner, Grace must rediscover the magic of Christmas. When she finds herself stranded in the town of River’s Crossing a couple weeks before Christmas, the local judge, Joe Peterson, offers her a place to stay on his property and takes it upon himself to show Grace everything she has been missing; Christmas, family, community, and love.', 'Captain Grace Garland, a decorated U.S. veteran, returns home after two tours of Search and Rescue in Afghanistan. After being separated from her beloved K9 partner, Grace must rediscover the magic of Christmas. When she finds herself stranded in the town of River’s Crossing a couple weeks before Christmas, the local judge, Joe Peterson, offers her a place to stay on his property and takes it upon himself to show Grace everything she has been missing; Christmas, family, community, and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3TNeyevlA5GHPtQaAzmaQcbinC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551863'),
  ('698871062216634159', 'A View from the Bridge', 1962, 'Drama', 'Sidney Lumet, Georges Glon, Angelo Laiacona', 'Arthur Miller', 'Raf Vallone, Maureen Stapleton, Carol Lawrence, Jean Sorel, Raymond Pellegrin, Morris Carnovsky, Harvey Lembeck, Mickey Knox', 'NR', 'Eddie Carbone, a Brooklyn longshoreman is unhappily married to Beatrice and unconsciously in love with Catherine, the niece that they have raised from childhood. Into his house come two brothers, illegal immigrants, Marco and Rodolpho. Catherine falls in love with Rudolpho; and Eddie, tormented but unable to admit even to himself his quasi-incestuous love, reports the illegal immigrants to the authorities.', 'Eddie Carbone, a Brooklyn longshoreman is unhappily married to Beatrice and unconsciously in love with Catherine, the niece that they have raised from childhood. Into his house come two brothers, illegal immigrants, Marco and Rodolpho. Catherine falls in love with Rudolpho; and Eddie, tormented but unable to admit even to himself his quasi-incestuous love, reports the illegal immigrants to the authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4O2fZ7DVTSDaCmiowopH5RR8WU7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183889'),
  ('659992478823666419', 'A View to a Kill', 1985, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'John Glen, Alan Hume, Barbara Broccoli', 'Richard Maibaum, Michael G. Wilson', 'Roger Moore, Tanya Roberts, Christopher Walken, Grace Jones, Patrick Macnee, Patrick Bauchau, David Yip, Fiona Fullerton', 'PG', 'A newly-developed microchip designed by Zorin Industries for the British Government that can survive the electromagnetic radiation caused by a nuclear explosion has landed in the hands of the KGB. James Bond must find out how and why. His suspicions soon lead him to big industry leader Max Zorin who forms a plan to destroy his only competition in Silicon Valley by triggering a massive earthquake in the San Francisco Bay.', 'A newly-developed microchip designed by Zorin Industries for the British Government that can survive the electromagnetic radiation caused by a nuclear explosion has landed in the hands of the KGB. James Bond must find out how and why. His suspicions soon lead him to big industry leader Max Zorin who forms a plan to destroy his only competition in Silicon Valley by triggering a massive earthquake in the San Francisco Bay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/arJF829RP9cYvh0NU70dC5TtXSa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:707'),
  ('244438170339961913', 'A Vigilante', 2019, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Dan Taggatz, Alice Johnson, Max O''Brasky', 'Sarah Daggar-Nickson', 'Olivia Wilde, Morgan Spector, Tonye Patano, Judy Marte, Betsy Aidem, C.J. Wilson, Chuck Cooper, Kyle Catlett', 'R', 'A once-abused woman devotes herself to ridding victims of their domestic abusers while hunting down the one she must kill to be truly free.', 'A once-abused woman devotes herself to ridding victims of their domestic abusers while hunting down the one she must kill to be truly free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avoKZfgBzyBGJsrAr2WQOwZK978.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500904'),
  ('120281356931478903', 'A Viking Saga: The Darkest Day', 2013, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Chris Crow, Alex Metcalfe', 'Graham Davidson', 'Elen Rhys, Mark Lewis Jones, Gary Mavers, Marc Pickering, Michael Jibson, Ioan Hefin, Christopher Godwin, Gareth John Bale', 'R', 'Cast into a violent and bloody world of murder, Hereward, a novice monk, must deliver the Holy Gospel of Lindisfarne - a book of great beauty and power - to the safety of the Iona monastery, while being pursued by a Viking death squad hell- bent on its capture. On his way to the monastery, he meets a fierce and skilled swordsman who answers his prayers and dedicates his life to protecting Hereward while he delivers the book. In the midst of their journey, they are confronted by Vikings ready to kill in order to get what they want, leaving Hereward and his protector at their mercy.', 'Cast into a violent and bloody world of murder, Hereward, a novice monk, must deliver the Holy Gospel of Lindisfarne - a book of great beauty and power - to the safety of the Iona monastery, while being pursued by a Viking death squad hell- bent on its capture. On his way to the monastery, he meets a fierce and skilled swordsman who answers his prayers and dedicates his life to protecting Hereward while he delivers the book. In the midst of their journey, they are confronted by Vikings ready to kill in order to get what they want, leaving Hereward and his protector at their mercy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37LtzncocEztZVhvrRAefqXGLQg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141058'),
  ('475876533503392542', 'A Village Affair', 1995, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Moira Armstrong, John Else', 'Alma Cullen', 'Sophie Ward, Kerry Fox, Nathaniel Parker, Jeremy Northam, Claire Bloom, Peter Jeffrey, Michael Gough, Barbara Jefford', null, 'An apparently happy wife in an English village has a relationship with a local aristocrat''s daughter.', 'An apparently happy wife in an English village has a relationship with a local aristocrat''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJLt850kWTpdbDxURSLO69ARTYt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39426'),
  ('1111719509291409740', 'A Village Almost Perfect!', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Stéphane Meunier, Baptiste Nicolaï', 'Stéphane Meunier, Djamel Bensalah, Jérôme L''hotsky', 'Didier Bourdon, Lorànt Deutsch, Lionnel Astier, Denis Podalydès, Élie Semoun, Carmen Maura, Annie Grégorio, Armelle', null, '"Saint-Loin-la-Mauderne", a tiny village hurt by the financial crisis and the desertification. Its last hope : Start back the Smoked Salmon factory. The only issue : Insurances require a permanent doctor on site. But it s has been 5 years the previous doctor retired without setting a replacement. The whole village,supporting their surly major Germain, will try everything to convince the very Parisian Doctor Maxime Meyer that happiness is only at Saint-Loin-la-Mauderne! This movie is the french remake of the Canadian movie ''la Grande Seduction''', '"Saint-Loin-la-Mauderne", a tiny village hurt by the financial crisis and the desertification. Its last hope : Start back the Smoked Salmon factory. The only issue : Insurances require a permanent doctor on site. But it s has been 5 years the previous doctor retired without setting a replacement. The whole village,supporting their surly major Germain, will try everything to convince the very Parisian Doctor Maxime Meyer that happiness is only at Saint-Loin-la-Mauderne! This movie is the french remake of the Canadian movie ''la Grande Seduction''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TE3ZD4ecpu70Xe10cYVga7kqlg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319143'),
  ('17835663096279823', 'A Violent Life', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Claire Mathon, Thierry de Peretti', 'Thierry de Peretti, Guillaume Bréaud', 'Jean Michelangeli, Henri-Noël Tabary, Cédric Appietto, Jean-Etienne Brat, Marie-Pierre Nouveau, Délia Sepulcre-Nativi, Dominique Colombani, Paul Garatte', null, 'Despite the life threat hanging over his head, Stéphane decides to go back to Corsica for the funeral of Christophe, a childhood friend and companion in arms, murdered the day before. On this occasion, the chain of events which made him, the learned petit-bourgeois from Bastia, shift from delinquency to political radicalization and then to clandestinity, comes back to his mind.', 'Despite the life threat hanging over his head, Stéphane decides to go back to Corsica for the funeral of Christophe, a childhood friend and companion in arms, murdered the day before. On this occasion, the chain of events which made him, the learned petit-bourgeois from Bastia, shift from delinquency to political radicalization and then to clandestinity, comes back to his mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jf3XauB7d1kOtQgzNzyNu71NAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453352'),
  ('702825272240306201', 'A Violent Man', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ross McCall, Stefan Ciupek', 'Ross McCall', 'Craig Fairbrass, Stephen Odubola, Zoë Tapper, Jason Flemyng, Ross McCall, Ulrich Thomsen, Robin Laing, Morgan Watkins', null, 'Steve Mackleson is a dangerous prisoner, incarcerated for double murder in a maximum security prison. We follow, as he navigates his struggle against redemption the system and his inner turmoil, when a young black gang member becomes his unlikely new cell mate and a daughter he has never met, finally requests to meet her estranged father, face to face.', 'Steve Mackleson is a dangerous prisoner, incarcerated for double murder in a maximum security prison. We follow, as he navigates his struggle against redemption the system and his inner turmoil, when a young black gang member becomes his unlikely new cell mate and a daughter he has never met, finally requests to meet her estranged father, face to face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88E7ZZtjkRZWNIJnazH4X3CORJ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826396'),
  ('1112206211085720284', 'A Violent Prosecutor', 2016, 'Crime, Comedy, Action', 'You Seok-moon, Lee Il-hyung, Choi Chan-min', 'Lee Il-hyung', 'Hwang Jung-min, Gang Dong-won, Lee Sung-min, Park Sung-woong, Kim Eung-soo, Park Jong-hwan, Han Jae-yeong, Kim Won-hae', null, 'After a prosecution lawyer is framed and convicted for murder, he tries to catch the real murderer from jail with the help of a con artist.', 'After a prosecution lawyer is framed and convicted for murder, he tries to catch the real murderer from jail with the help of a con artist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pA4MoUac4jlCbASIvkzB0YZ2RWu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378348'),
