  ('865265467987703710', 'A Virgin Among the Living Dead', 1973, 'Horror', 'Jesús Franco, José Climent', 'Jesús Franco', 'Christina von Blanc, Carmen Yazalde, Rosa Palomar, Anne Libert, Howard Vernon, Jesús Franco, Paul Müller, Linda Hastreiter', null, 'A girl arrives from London to visit her estranged relatives in a remote castle for the reading of her father''s will. After a while she discovers that they are all in fact dead and her decision to live with them turns into a nightmare. Unable to leave she''s drawn into a macabre underworld through visions of nude satanic rituals and her own impending sacrifice.', 'A girl arrives from London to visit her estranged relatives in a remote castle for the reading of her father''s will. After a while she discovers that they are all in fact dead and her decision to live with them turns into a nightmare. Unable to leave she''s drawn into a macabre underworld through visions of nude satanic rituals and her own impending sacrifice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vP6ZC7L8CLawIiTx19tXfIuaIuF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19095'),
  ('354432551123891329', 'A Visitor to a Museum', 1989, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Konstantin Lopushansky, Tatyana Rozantseva, Aleksandr Karelin', 'Konstantin Lopushansky', 'Viktor Mikhaylov, Vera Mayorova, Vadim Lobanov, Irina Rakshina, Aleksandr Rasinsky, Iosif Ryklin, Liliyan Malkina, Nora Gryakalova', null, 'It is the future, the world is in ruins and a large portion of the population consists of deformed mutants living in reservations. In this world a man decides to spend his vacation visiting the ruins of a museum that is now buried under the sea.', 'It is the future, the world is in ruins and a large portion of the population consists of deformed mutants living in reservations. In this world a man decides to spend his vacation visiting the ruins of a museum that is now buried under the sea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aeQtvKr2iQnCmVIWtAkb1sFDtw3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73922'),
  ('763730101447058076', 'A Volta', 2024, null, 'Jefferson Nali', 'Luciana Costa', 'Rafaela Ferreira, Sofia Savietto', null, 'Laura is surprised one night with the news that her younger sister Katherine, who disappeared at age 7, has been found. More than 11 years have passed since the tragic event. Her parents died uncertain whether their daughter was alive or not. Now, Laura must cope alone with this reunion and with all of Katherine''s scars.', 'Laura is surprised one night with the news that her younger sister Katherine, who disappeared at age 7, has been found. More than 11 years have passed since the tragic event. Her parents died uncertain whether their daughter was alive or not. Now, Laura must cope alone with this reunion and with all of Katherine''s scars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9ALJfBM468wO1BfxOuxFdXDxVA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1622470'),
