  ('201776623313320759', 'A Walk with Johnny Guitar', 1996, 'Drama', 'Dominique Chapuis, João César Monteiro, Henri Maïkoff', 'João César Monteiro', 'João César Monteiro, Ana Reis', null, 'Lord knows where João de Deus has been. He''s come home wounded in the head. He''s got a bit of the soundtrack to Johnny Guitar in his head. Strangely enough, there is no sign of the hole in his head. Day breaks over the city. Further strolls are in sight. It is said that Mr. Monteiro, the alter ego of João de Deus, occasionally goes out with Nicholas Ray. At least, they''ve been seen together.', 'Lord knows where João de Deus has been. He''s come home wounded in the head. He''s got a bit of the soundtrack to Johnny Guitar in his head. Strangely enough, there is no sign of the hole in his head. Day breaks over the city. Further strolls are in sight. It is said that Mr. Monteiro, the alter ego of João de Deus, occasionally goes out with Nicholas Ray. At least, they''ve been seen together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4oUAtoWFQz3tMtgQ9E1L5HiYut.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244836'),
  ('1016743747157717203', 'A Walk with Love and Death', 1969, 'Adventure, Drama, History, Romance, War', 'John Huston, Edward Scaife, Wolfgang Glattes', 'Dale Wasserman', 'Anjelica Huston, Assi Dayan, Anthony Higgins, John Hallam, Robert Lang, Guy Deghy, Michael Gough, George Murcell', 'PG', 'During France’s Hundred Years’ War, a Parisian student seeks refuge by the sea and falls in love with an aristocrat. As they find shelter in a monastery, their romance is overshadowed by the ongoing conflict between peasants and noblemen.', 'During France’s Hundred Years’ War, a Parisian student seeks refuge by the sea and falls in love with an aristocrat. As they find shelter in a monastery, their romance is overshadowed by the ongoing conflict between peasants and noblemen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8bXRancCsnw0ubjhJI0lYPnkJv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98248'),
  ('623064796281748870', 'A Wanderer''s Notebook', 1962, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Jun Yasumoto, Masazumi Kawanishi', 'Toshiro Ide, Sumie Tanaka', 'Hideko Takamine, Akira Takarada, Daisuke Katō, Keiju Kobayashi, Kinuyo Tanaka, Mitsuko Kusabue, Noboru Nakaya, Yūnosuke Itō', null, 'Based on the life and career of novelist Fumiko Hayashi, she bitterly struggles for literary recognition in the first half of the 20th-century – her affairs with feckless men, the jobs she took to survive (peddler, waitress, bar maid), and her arduous, often humiliating attempts to get published in a male-dominated culture.', 'Based on the life and career of novelist Fumiko Hayashi, she bitterly struggles for literary recognition in the first half of the 20th-century – her affairs with feckless men, the jobs she took to survive (peddler, waitress, bar maid), and her arduous, often humiliating attempts to get published in a male-dominated culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6f0l6k4L8oLcW8PuzfWN4ueb8SX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117800'),
  ('447408632296003490', 'A War', 2015, 'Drama, War', 'Magnus Nordenhof Jønck, Tobias Lindholm, Emrah İstanbullu', 'Tobias Lindholm', 'Pilou Asbæk, Tuva Novotny, Søren Malling, Charlotte Munck, Dar Salim, Dulfi Al-Jabouri, Alex Høgh Andersen, Jakob Frølund', 'R', 'Company commander Claus Michael Pedersen and his men are stationed in Helmand, Afghanistan. Meanwhile back in Denmark, with a husband at war and three children missing their father, everyday life is a struggle for Claus'' wife Maria. During a routine mission, the soldiers are caught in heavy Taliban crossfire. In order to save his men, Claus makes a decision that ultimately sees him return to Denmark accused of a war crime.', 'Company commander Claus Michael Pedersen and his men are stationed in Helmand, Afghanistan. Meanwhile back in Denmark, with a husband at war and three children missing their father, everyday life is a struggle for Claus'' wife Maria. During a routine mission, the soldiers are caught in heavy Taliban crossfire. In order to save his men, Claus makes a decision that ultimately sees him return to Denmark accused of a war crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBiGQf5qz6HSKKk10aejFGLMclj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348674'),
  ('1128983008032104027', 'A Warm December', 1973, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sidney Poitier, Paul Beeson, David Tomblin', 'Lawrence Roman', 'Sidney Poitier, Ester Anderson, Yvette Curtis, George Baker, Johnny Sekka, Earl Cameron, Hilary Crane, John Beardmore', 'PG', 'Widower Dr. Matt Younger and his daughter go to London for a month of dirt-bike racing. While there, Dr. Younger is surprised by finding himself attracted to Catherine, a charming but elusive woman who seems to have some mysterious men following her. A romance slowly develops between the doctor and Catherine, but there are complications to their happiness.', 'Widower Dr. Matt Younger and his daughter go to London for a month of dirt-bike racing. While there, Dr. Younger is surprised by finding himself attracted to Catherine, a charming but elusive woman who seems to have some mysterious men following her. A romance slowly develops between the doctor and Catherine, but there are complications to their happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2tkZ0oRTUajsL0EA0NlJv30bWp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67696'),
  ('875119602289502730', 'A Warning to the Curious', 1972, 'TV Movie, Horror, Drama', 'Lawrence Gordon Clark, John McGlashan', 'Lawrence Gordon Clark', 'Peter Vaughan, Clive Swift, Julian Herrington, John Kearney, David Cargill, George Benson, Roger Milner, Gilly Fraser', null, 'Paxton, an amateur archeologist, travels to the town of Seaburgh and inadvertently stumbles across one of the lost crowns of Anglia, which, according to legend, protect the county from invasion. On digging the crown up, Paxton is stalked by its supernatural guardian.', 'Paxton, an amateur archeologist, travels to the town of Seaburgh and inadvertently stumbles across one of the lost crowns of Anglia, which, according to legend, protect the county from invasion. On digging the crown up, Paxton is stalked by its supernatural guardian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3le6NswckzmGYAa7vl3XiCLNSC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109157'),
  ('753530948790850099', 'A Warrior''s Heart', 2011, 'Action, Drama, Family, Romance', 'Mike Sears, Thomas L. Callaway', 'Martin Dugard', 'Kellan Lutz, Ashley Greene, Adam Beach, Gabrielle Anwar, Chord Overstreet, William Mapother, Chris Potter, Aaron Hill', 'PG', 'Unable to cope with his military father''s sudden death in combat, quick-tempered teen, Conor, starts getting into serious trouble. During an intense lacrosse camp, his father''s old friend challenges Conor to get his life on track and become a man.', 'Unable to cope with his military father''s sudden death in combat, quick-tempered teen, Conor, starts getting into serious trouble. During an intense lacrosse camp, his father''s old friend challenges Conor to get his life on track and become a man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rZsmMHmSZGj2hcYGNsHFLomw37E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79699'),
  ('1051545305030886334', 'A Wedding', 1978, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert Altman, Charles Rosher Jr.', 'John Considine, Robert Altman, Patricia Resnick', 'Desi Arnaz Jr., Carol Burnett, Geraldine Chaplin, Howard Duff, Mia Farrow, Vittorio Gassman, Lillian Gish, Nina van Pallandt', 'PG', 'Muffin''s wedding to Dino Corelli is to be a big affair. Except the ageing priest isn''t too sure of the ceremony, only the families actually turn up as the Corelli Italian connection is suspect, security guards watch the gifts rather over-zealously, and Dino''s grandma expires in bed just as the reception starts. Could be quite an occasion.', 'Muffin''s wedding to Dino Corelli is to be a big affair. Except the ageing priest isn''t too sure of the ceremony, only the families actually turn up as the Corelli Italian connection is suspect, security guards watch the gifts rather over-zealously, and Dino''s grandma expires in bed just as the reception starts. Could be quite an occasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7cs5RMLbnA6a0u87ychiyHdxbV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45695'),
  ('548074829866391933', 'A Wedding', 2017, 'Drama', 'Stephan Streker, Grimm Vandekerckhove', 'Stephan Streker', 'Lina El Arabi, Sébastien Houbani, Babak Karimi, Olivier Gourmet, Alice de Lencquesaing, Zacharie Chasseriaud, Aurora Marion, Harmandeep Palminder', null, 'Zahira, 18, is close to her family until her parents ask her to follow Pakistani tradition to choose a husband. Torn between family customs and her western lifestyle, the young woman turns for help to her brother and confidant Amir.', 'Zahira, 18, is close to her family until her parents ask her to follow Pakistani tradition to choose a husband. Torn between family customs and her western lifestyle, the young woman turns for help to her brother and confidant Amir.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cATTGdEjhcSWRRsqoIc6VQZYzas.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413837'),
  ('1124289468510739811', 'A Wedding Invitation', 2013, 'Romance', 'Hwang Sun-wook, Oh Ki-hwan', null, 'Bai Baihe, Eddie Peng Yu-Yan, Pace Wu Pui-Tsi, Jiang Jinfu, Lin Mei-shiu, Li Hongtao, Chen Mengqi, Yu Yankai', null, 'High school sweethearts QiaoQiao and Li Xing are about to graduate from university and Li Xing surprises QiaoQiao with a marriage proposal. QiaoQiao, however, declines the proposal, offering rash arguments as to why he''s not ready. Little does he know, QiaoQiao has a devastating secret. Nonetheless, they write a break-up contract; if they''re both single in five years, they''ll get married. The two part ways and five years pass. Believing Li Xing is still waiting for her, QiaoQiao waits patiently for his call. But when Li Xing finally does contact her it''s to invite her to his wedding. QiaoQiao is flabbergasted and is determined to win her former flame back at any cost-even though the secret that forced them apart lingers. Can their love truly be reignited?', 'High school sweethearts QiaoQiao and Li Xing are about to graduate from university and Li Xing surprises QiaoQiao with a marriage proposal. QiaoQiao, however, declines the proposal, offering rash arguments as to why he''s not ready. Little does he know, QiaoQiao has a devastating secret. Nonetheless, they write a break-up contract; if they''re both single in five years, they''ll get married. The two part ways and five years pass. Believing Li Xing is still waiting for her, QiaoQiao waits patiently for his call. But when Li Xing finally does contact her it''s to invite her to his wedding. QiaoQiao is flabbergasted and is determined to win her former flame back at any cost-even though the secret that forced them apart lingers. Can their love truly be reignited?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fGrND0aHP8x6AZABjZTQfaDJAb4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195921'),
  ('594021733001714171', 'A Wedding Suit', 1976, 'Drama', 'Abbas Kiarostami, Firooz Malekzadeh', 'Parviz Davayi, Abbas Kiarostami', 'Mohammad Fassih, Mehdi Nekoueï, Massoud Zand, Reza Hashemi, Hashem Arkan', null, 'A woman orders a suit from a tailor for her young son to wear to her sister''s wedding. The tailor''s apprentice, together with two other teenage boys who work in the same building, devise a plan to try on the suit at night to see what it feels like.', 'A woman orders a suit from a tailor for her young son to wear to her sister''s wedding. The tailor''s apprentice, together with two other teenage boys who work in the same building, devise a plan to try on the suit at night to see what it feels like.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g31ePKouKrV13Wt1Fsuow3PJl5M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134209'),
  ('130896903929157129', 'A Wedding to Remember', 2021, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Jon Thomas, Jean-Christophe Castell, Graham Cairns', 'Victoria Rose', 'Cristina Rosato, Greyston Holt, Rebecca Olson, Matt Hamilton, Shanelle Connell, Matt Mazur, Sharon Estephan, A.J. McKerracher', 'G', 'On opposite sides of a development project, Olivia and Brian are surprised to find they are the Maid of Honor and Best Man at the same wedding. They have to put their feelings aside to save their best friends’ wedding… which may turn out to be their own as well!', 'On opposite sides of a development project, Olivia and Brian are surprised to find they are the Maid of Honor and Best Man at the same wedding. They have to put their feelings aside to save their best friends’ wedding… which may turn out to be their own as well!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4K2X7yc1bQVmgAxL7cj0xYd2bvV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:779011'),
  ('911990360546496973', 'A Wednesday!', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Neeraj Pandey, Fuwad Khan', 'Neeraj Pandey', 'Anupam Kher, Naseeruddin Shah, Jimmy Shergill, Deepal Shaw, Aamir Bashir, Rohitashv Gour, Vijay Bhatia, Kali Prasad Mukherjee', null, 'Prakash Rathod, a retired police commissioner recounts the most memorable case of his career wherein he was informed about a bomb scare in Mumbai by an ordinary commoner.', 'Prakash Rathod, a retired police commissioner recounts the most memorable case of his career wherein he was informed about a bomb scare in Mumbai by an ordinary commoner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVUSxtJM3arL5VIUIRNYde20EF0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19703'),
  ('332886103757197431', 'A Week Away', 2021, 'Drama, Music, Romance, Comedy', 'Roman White, James King', 'Kali Bailey, Alan Powell', 'Bailee Madison, Kevin G. Quinn, Sherri Shepherd, David Koechner, Jahbril Cook, Kat Conner Sterling, Iain Tucker, Ed Amatrudo', 'NR', 'Troubled teen Will Hawkins has a run-in with the law that puts him at an important crossroad: go to juvenile detention or attend a Christian summer camp. At first a fish-out-of-water, Will opens his heart, discovers love with a camp regular, and sense of belonging in the last place he expected to find it.', 'Troubled teen Will Hawkins has a run-in with the law that puts him at an important crossroad: go to juvenile detention or attend a Christian summer camp. At first a fish-out-of-water, Will opens his heart, discovers love with a camp regular, and sense of belonging in the last place he expected to find it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htTS07IvYv3rv57ftzNEprefwSq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:699102'),
  ('231983248403307096', 'A Week in the Life of a Man', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jerzy Stuhr, Edward Kłosiński', 'Jerzy Stuhr', 'Jerzy Stuhr, Małgorzata Dobrowolska, Danuta Szaflarska, Alex Mozdzynski, Ewa Skibińska, Krzysztof Stroiński', null, 'Jerzy Stuhr wrote, directed, and starred in this drama about a man sworn to uphold the law who applies a very different moral code to himself than he does to others. As Adam Borowski, Stuhr plays a government lawyer prosecuting a variety of cases, including smuggling, theft, child abandonment, and racially motivated assault. However, Adam''s own life is hardly a model by which to live. He''s overextended himself financially and is trying to figure out how to avoid paying the hospital bills for his terminally ill mother. Adam is married, but he''s been having an affair for some time, and, while he breaks off his relationship with his mistress, he''s easily tempted into other liaisons. His wife wants to adopt a handicapped child; Adam would prefer not to have another child in the house, and he uses his influence to slow up the paperwork. And in order to reduce his tax bill, Adam has involved himself in a charitable donation scheme of dubious legality.', 'Jerzy Stuhr wrote, directed, and starred in this drama about a man sworn to uphold the law who applies a very different moral code to himself than he does to others. As Adam Borowski, Stuhr plays a government lawyer prosecuting a variety of cases, including smuggling, theft, child abandonment, and racially motivated assault. However, Adam''s own life is hardly a model by which to live. He''s overextended himself financially and is trying to figure out how to avoid paying the hospital bills for his terminally ill mother. Adam is married, but he''s been having an affair for some time, and, while he breaks off his relationship with his mistress, he''s easily tempted into other liaisons. His wife wants to adopt a handicapped child; Adam would prefer not to have another child in the house, and he uses his influence to slow up the paperwork. And in order to reduce his tax bill, Adam has involved himself in a charitable donation scheme of dubious legality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7wj996zuSVcizqPbeE7GqJFxvT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203770'),
  ('796447747312665265', 'A Week''s Vacation', 1980, 'Drama', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Pierre-William Glenn, Louis Grau', 'Colo Tavernier O''Hagan, Bertrand Tavernier, Marie-Françoise Hans', 'Nathalie Baye, Gérard Lanvin, Flore Fitzgerald, Philippe Noiret, Philippe Léotard, Jean Dasté, Marie-Louise Ebeli, Philippe Delaigue', null, 'On the verge of an emotional collapse, schoolteacher Laurence takes a week off from work to figure out her life. She reconnects with friends and family and wrestles with everything from whether she should continue her job to whether she should have a child with her boyfriend.', 'On the verge of an emotional collapse, schoolteacher Laurence takes a week off from work to figure out her life. She reconnects with friends and family and wrestles with everything from whether she should continue her job to whether she should have a child with her boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJThC4TqiXhR9nFyk6zhQorwB3a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71586'),
  ('783389925894072299', 'A Welcome Home Christmas', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Brian Herzlinger', 'T. Booker James', 'Jana Kramer, Brandon Quinn, Charlene Tilton, Tim Reid, Tyler Merritt, Rose Reid, Kristopher Charles, Tamiko Robinson Steele', null, 'Chloe has always supported various military organizations, including the town’s Army toy drive for Christmas. This year, she is paired up with Michael, a vet who recently returned home, and together they recruit other veterans and active military personnel to help in the cause. As the community gears up for the Officer’s Christmas Ball, where all the kids will meet Santa Claus and receive their gifts, Michael and Chloe begin to realize the greatest gift this season has been each other’s company.', 'Chloe has always supported various military organizations, including the town’s Army toy drive for Christmas. This year, she is paired up with Michael, a vet who recently returned home, and together they recruit other veterans and active military personnel to help in the cause. As the community gears up for the Officer’s Christmas Ball, where all the kids will meet Santa Claus and receive their gifts, Michael and Chloe begin to realize the greatest gift this season has been each other’s company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8f2BISD69UpJe1f2vNA2p8gFZms.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744931'),
  ('807557279252763831', 'A Well Spent Life', 1971, 'Documentary, Music', 'Les Blank, Skip Gerson', null, 'Mance Lipscomb, Elnora Lipscomb, Hattie Franklin, Alfred Franklin', null, 'A tribute to the Texas songster, Mance Lipscomb, considered by many to be the greatest guitarist of all time.', 'A tribute to the Texas songster, Mance Lipscomb, considered by many to be the greatest guitarist of all time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBSmbUWbQCLUArMm9umr01eUhQK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124019'),
  ('258475216332053397', 'A Werewolf Boy', 2012, 'Romance, Fantasy', 'Choi Sang-muk, Lee Sung-jae, Jo Sung-hee', 'Jo Sung-hee', 'Song Joong-ki, Park Bo-young, Yoo Yeon-seok, Lee Young-ran, Jang Young-nam, Kim Hyang-gi, Yoo Seung-mok, Shin Bi', null, 'An unexpected phone call brings an elderly woman to her childhood country cottage, and memories of an orphan boy she knew 47 years ago come flooding back to her.', 'An unexpected phone call brings an elderly woman to her childhood country cottage, and memories of an orphan boy she knew 47 years ago come flooding back to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8nLI2052swGQ53p5eVVPuEzlAf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128246'),
  ('80662936456290009', 'A Werewolf in England', 2020, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Charlie Steeds, Charlie Steeds', 'Charlie Steeds', 'Reece Connolly, Tim Cartwright, Natalie Martins, Mark McKirdy, Jéssica Alonso, Emma Spurgin Hussey, Barrington De La Roche, Rory Wilton', null, 'In Victorian-Era England, a Parish Councillor and criminal take refuge from a storm, at a remote countryside Inn. Forced to stay the night, they soon uncover a deadly pact between the strange Innkeepers and the flesh-hungry werewolves that inhabit the surrounding woodlands... now, as the werewolves close in, the guests must band together and fight tooth and nail to survive the night!', 'In Victorian-Era England, a Parish Councillor and criminal take refuge from a storm, at a remote countryside Inn. Forced to stay the night, they soon uncover a deadly pact between the strange Innkeepers and the flesh-hungry werewolves that inhabit the surrounding woodlands... now, as the werewolves close in, the guests must band together and fight tooth and nail to survive the night!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tkCUc5l4vPrW09D0ipdnTQusC68.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:710217'),
  ('328256550589085959', 'A West Wing Special to Benefit When We All Vote', 2020, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Thomas Schlamme, John Lindley', 'Aaron Sorkin, Eli Attie', 'Martin Sheen, Bradley Whitford, Richard Schiff, Rob Lowe, Allison Janney, Janel Moloney, Sterling K. Brown, Dulé Hill', null, 'Taped at Los Angeles’ iconic Orpheum Theatre, this staged presentation of The West Wing’s “Hartsfield’s Landing” episode stars core cast members along with special guest stars. Act Breaks feature commentary from former First Lady Michelle Obama, President Bill Clinton and Lin-Manuel Miranda who share messages about the vital importance of making our voices heard in every election.', 'Taped at Los Angeles’ iconic Orpheum Theatre, this staged presentation of The West Wing’s “Hartsfield’s Landing” episode stars core cast members along with special guest stars. Act Breaks feature commentary from former First Lady Michelle Obama, President Bill Clinton and Lin-Manuel Miranda who share messages about the vital importance of making our voices heard in every election.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmqqLKSm7d6Wwjupm4sOUodnAg9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:753563'),
  ('939474021325563511', 'A Whale', 2025, 'Mystery', 'Pablo Hernando, Sara Gallego, María Rodrigo', 'Pablo Hernando', 'Ingrid García Jonsson, Ramón Barea, Kepa Errasti, Óscar Pastor, David Pareja', null, 'When Ingrid pulls the trigger, her victims don’t know who has shot. Her ability to infiltrate and disappear without leaving a trace makes her an unrelenting killer. But that power comes from another world.', 'When Ingrid pulls the trigger, her victims don’t know who has shot. Her ability to infiltrate and disappear without leaving a trace makes her an unrelenting killer. But that power comes from another world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7ZsATIYWQQSAjmwp5bLPFoHNP0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1266675'),
  ('753374829025702316', 'A Whirlwind Wedding', 2021, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Danny J. Boyle, Andy Hodgson, Joe Gold', 'Shannon Latimer', 'Morgan Kohan, Drew Nelson, Cameron McDonald, Laura Soltis, Brendan Taylor, Philip Prajoux, Annie Chen, Nancy Kerr', 'PG', 'Darcy, a talented event planner returns to her home town to plan her mother’s wedding. She’s having trouble accepting her stepfather-to-be and quickly Darcy’s obsession with perfection begins to clash with her mother’s wishes for a low-key celebration —especially when it comes to handsome and charming Kyle, the chef Darcy deems inadequate for catering the event. But as complications arise—both personal and professional—it’s Kyle who is able to help her pull off the big day and help her find the love she’s been looking for…', 'Darcy, a talented event planner returns to her home town to plan her mother’s wedding. She’s having trouble accepting her stepfather-to-be and quickly Darcy’s obsession with perfection begins to clash with her mother’s wishes for a low-key celebration —especially when it comes to handsome and charming Kyle, the chef Darcy deems inadequate for catering the event. But as complications arise—both personal and professional—it’s Kyle who is able to help her pull off the big day and help her find the love she’s been looking for…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4k3pwqUNLNo807G7GiPghkrRsGB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:778997'),
  ('674289930529360385', 'A Whisker Away', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Tomotaka Shibayama, Yuji Shimizu, Junichi Sato', 'Mari Okada', 'Mirai Shida, Natsuki Hanae, Koichi Yamadera, Hiroaki Ogi, Minako Kotobuki, Kensho Ono, Susumu Chiba, Ayako Kawasumi', 'PG', 'A peculiar girl transforms into a cat to catch her crush''s attention. But before she realizes it, the line between human and animal starts to blur.', 'A peculiar girl transforms into a cat to catch her crush''s attention. But before she realizes it, the line between human and animal starts to blur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6inkRM1XGBG5vRhclCPWfMenp7N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:667520'),
  ('1097860004587867134', 'A Whisper in the Dark', 1976, 'Horror, Drama', 'Marcello Aliprandi, Claudio Cirillo, Carlo Montanaro', 'Nicolò Rienzi, Maria Teresa Rienzi', 'John Phillip Law, Nathalie Delon, Olga Bisera, Alessandro Poggi, Joseph Cotten, Lucretia Love, Adriana Russo, Zora Velcova', null, 'Martino is a young child who claims to have an invisible friend called Luca. His parents assume it is just a game, but strange things start to happen.', 'Martino is a young child who claims to have an invisible friend called Luca. His parents assume it is just a game, but strange things start to happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afmFL39G2g3xDK3UBuXnZfRDpB6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139387'),
  ('414351771511181078', 'A White Dress for Marialé', 1972, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Romano Scavolini, Bruno Nicolai', 'Giuseppe Mangione, Remigio Del Grosso', 'Ida Galli, Ivan Rassimov, Luigi Pistilli, Pilar Velázquez, Ezio Marano, Giancarlo Bonuglia, Gianni Dei, Franco Calogero', 'PG-13', 'A woman, who witnessed her father kill himself as a child, invites several friends to her husband''s secluded castle. Unbeknownst to them, she has a sinister motive for the invitation.', 'A woman, who witnessed her father kill himself as a child, invites several friends to her husband''s secluded castle. Unbeknownst to them, she has a sinister motive for the invitation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueuTgtihXqNtHa7lDCLqKjQOIKI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104360'),
  ('990375448972551546', 'A White, White Day', 2019, 'Drama', 'Hlynur Pálmason, Maria von Hausswolff, Kristinn Guðmundsson', 'Hlynur Pálmason', 'Ingvar E. Sigurðsson, Ída Mekkín Hlynsdóttir, Hilmir Snær Guðnason, Björn Ingi Hilmarsson, Elma Stefanía Ágústsdóttir, Sara Dögg Ásgeirsdóttir, Haraldur Ari Stefánsson, Sigurður Sigurjónsson', null, 'In a remote Icelandic town, an off duty police chief begins to suspect a local man to have had an affair with his wife, who has recently died in a car accident. Gradually his obsession for finding out the truth accumulates and inevitably begins to endanger himself and his loved ones. A story of grief, revenge and unconditional love.', 'In a remote Icelandic town, an off duty police chief begins to suspect a local man to have had an affair with his wife, who has recently died in a car accident. Gradually his obsession for finding out the truth accumulates and inevitably begins to endanger himself and his loved ones. A story of grief, revenge and unconditional love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NPNQSXlYvRqECOPFozjoGhjy4n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:596870'),
  ('121054312045343261', 'A Whole Life', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Armin Franzen, Nicole Schmied, Hans Steinbichler', 'Robert Seethaler, Ulrich Limmer', 'Stefan Gorski, August Zirner, Andreas Lust, Julia Franz Richter, Robert Stadlober, Thomas Schubert, Lukas Walcher, Marianne Sägebrecht', null, 'When Andreas arrives in the remote valley in the Austrian Alps, he is only about four years old - nobody knows for sure. He grows up to become a skilled farmhand and, as a young man, joins a work crew that builds one of the first mountain railroads, bringing light and noise to the valley along with electricity. He also finds the love of his life in Marie, but their happiness is short-lived. Only many years later, when Andreas embarks on his final journey, she is with him once again. And in amazement Andreas looks back at all the years that lie behind him.', 'When Andreas arrives in the remote valley in the Austrian Alps, he is only about four years old - nobody knows for sure. He grows up to become a skilled farmhand and, as a young man, joins a work crew that builds one of the first mountain railroads, bringing light and noise to the valley along with electricity. He also finds the love of his life in Marie, but their happiness is short-lived. Only many years later, when Andreas embarks on his final journey, she is with him once again. And in amazement Andreas looks back at all the years that lie behind him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/podcOble2lPYMQoBIwBPYaHtGhy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1161680'),
  ('468889937464541296', 'A Whole Life Ahead', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paolo Virzì, Elisabetta Boni, Stefano Lorenzi', 'Francesco Bruni, Paolo Virzì', 'Isabella Ragonese, Massimo Ghini, Valerio Mastandrea, Micaela Ramazzotti, Elio Germano, Sabrina Ferilli, Laura Morante, Giulia Salerno', null, '25-year-old philosophy major Marta faces the ugly truth for many young Italians — a complete lack of career opportunities. While babysitting for single mother Sonia, she starts to work as a telemarketer, experiencing first-hand the fanatical and exploitative rat-race culture pushed on employees while quickly rising through the ranks of the company. Around her revolve people like delusional supervisor Daniela, her womanizing boss Claudio, fragile coworker Lucio "2", and well-meaning but inconsistent union rep Giorgio.', '25-year-old philosophy major Marta faces the ugly truth for many young Italians — a complete lack of career opportunities. While babysitting for single mother Sonia, she starts to work as a telemarketer, experiencing first-hand the fanatical and exploitative rat-race culture pushed on employees while quickly rising through the ranks of the company. Around her revolve people like delusional supervisor Daniela, her womanizing boss Claudio, fragile coworker Lucio "2", and well-meaning but inconsistent union rep Giorgio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmoSWKB2pgnUyN1E9RP5ETU0q20.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51917'),
  ('153497753583663005', 'A Whole New Life', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Ramiro Civita, Daniele Fontana, Stefano Farina', 'Alessandro Pondi, Paolo Logli, Mauro Graiani', 'Enrico Brignano, Ilaria Spada, Paola Minaccioni, Maurizio Lombardi, Monica Vallerini, Daniela Terreri, Gabriele Lustri, Giordano Di Cola', null, 'Gianni is a taxi driver dissatisfied with his life. One day by chance he gets the opportunity to take possession of the villa and life of a billionaire on holiday.', 'Gianni is a taxi driver dissatisfied with his life. One day by chance he gets the opportunity to take possession of the villa and life of a billionaire on holiday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbCOZjVZRrWrqk3DBT2GZ3nz8zK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:609408'),
  ('1013663534284257798', 'A Wicked Ghost', 1999, 'Horror', 'Tony Leung Hung-Wah', 'Tony Leung Hung-Wah', 'Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Gigi Lai Chi, Gabriel Harrison, Celia Sze Lim-Tse, Edward Mok, Gloria Lam Suk-Yan, Chow Yan-Yan, Lui Tat', null, 'A group of friends decide to do a ritual to contact the spirit world, but things go bad and a spirit actually appears. One by one the group of friends die, one of them who is not affected by the spirit tries to uncover the truth behind the ghost. He is joined by his sister and a friend who is familiar with the occult. They soon find out that the ghost targets people from a certain village where 66 people died long ago. They desperately try to find a solution to appease the spirit.', 'A group of friends decide to do a ritual to contact the spirit world, but things go bad and a spirit actually appears. One by one the group of friends die, one of them who is not affected by the spirit tries to uncover the truth behind the ghost. He is joined by his sister and a friend who is familiar with the occult. They soon find out that the ghost targets people from a certain village where 66 people died long ago. They desperately try to find a solution to appease the spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1pGd2i701Zt8vEhbWHV6NyFOV1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261427'),
  ('239713446311773167', 'A Widow''s Game', 2025, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Carlos Sedes, Conchi Iglesias, Estíbaliz García', 'Ramón Campos, Gema R. Neira, Jon de la Cuesta', 'Ivana Baquero, Tristán Ulloa, Carmen Machi, Pepe Ocio, Joel Sánchez, Álex Gadea, Pablo Molinero, Ramón Ródenas', 'R', 'When a man is found dead, the investigation shatters his widow''s perfect facade and exposes a hidden double life in this thriller based on real events.', 'When a man is found dead, the investigation shatters his widow''s perfect facade and exposes a hidden double life in this thriller based on real events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZOdrJDl2GwREoigC0y40kMosxj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1397832'),
  ('379134230205701809', 'A Wife Confesses', 1961, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Yasuzō Masumura, Setsuo Kobayashi, Shû Sakiyama', 'Masato Ide', 'Ayako Wakao, Hiroshi Kawaguchi, Eitarō Ozawa, Haruko Mabuchi, Jun Negami, Hideo Takamatsu, Tōru Konoki, Yūji Moriya', null, 'Tied to a mountain between her brutalizing spouse and her secret lover, disaster strikes; the authorities accuse her of murder and prompt a confession.', 'Tied to a mountain between her brutalizing spouse and her secret lover, disaster strikes; the authorities accuse her of murder and prompt a confession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BPuiKeAkNP8CalmAzSZaeKnLSV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111397'),
  ('603873064753106743', 'A Wife''s Heart', 1956, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Masao Tamai', 'Toshiro Ide', 'Hideko Takamine, Toshirō Mifune, Keiju Kobayashi, Akemi Negishi, Yōko Sugi, Machiko Kitagawa, Chieko Nakakita, Ranko Hanai', null, 'A young woman tries to raise money to open her own coffee shop. She arranges a loan when her rigid family won''t help and then her husband becomes jealous of the loan officer.', 'A young woman tries to raise money to open her own coffee shop. She arranges a loan when her rigid family won''t help and then her husband becomes jealous of the loan officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNDJyXvK4h6iJL1lAuEVMrF5pRE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88549'),
