  ('551989636925188553', 'A Wild Patience Has Taken Me Here', 2021, 'Romance', 'Cris Lyra, Erika Candido, Mariana Graciotti', 'Éri Sarmet', 'Zélia Duncan, Bruna Linzmeyer, Lorre Motta, Camila Rocha, Clari Ribeiro', null, 'Vange, a lonely biker, is enchanted by the relationship and freedom of four girls, with whom she spends a weekend where exchanges about lesbian experiences and culture are present, accompanied by a mutual affection that gradually establishes itself.', 'Vange, a lonely biker, is enchanted by the relationship and freedom of four girls, with whom she spends a weekend where exchanges about lesbian experiences and culture are present, accompanied by a mutual affection that gradually establishes itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bUc4X3ahvTaMewHNd6AdwSMwsR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:643185'),
  ('352804450405484314', 'A Wind Named Amnesia', 1990, 'Animation, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Kazuo Yamazaki, Michio Mihara, Satoru Nakamura', 'Kazuo Yamazaki, Yoshiaki Kawajiri, Kenji Kurata', 'Kazuki Yao, Keiko Toda, Kappei Yamaguchi, Yuko Mita, Daisuke Gori, Noriko Hidaka, Osamu Saka, Masaharu Sato', null, 'A wind has swept the Earth taking all the memories from everyone. No one knows who they are, how to speak, or how to use the tools of modern civilization. Two years later, a young man who has been re-educated travels across America on a mysterious journey.', 'A wind has swept the Earth taking all the memories from everyone. No one knows who they are, how to speak, or how to use the tools of modern civilization. Two years later, a young man who has been re-educated travels across America on a mysterious journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKy8pmvIw986oSvij2HYYode521.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42070'),
