  ('522484725570665212', 'A Winnie the Pooh Thanksgiving', 1998, 'Animation, Family', 'Jun Falkenstein, Jamie Thomason', 'Carter Crocker', 'Brady Bluhm, Peter Cullen, Jim Cummings, John Fiedler, Frankie J. Galasso, Ken Sansom, Andre Stojka, David Warner', null, 'It''s Thanksgiving time in the Hundred Acre Wood and Winnie the Pooh and all his friends bring food for the big dinner. Piglet brings acorns, Pooh brings honey, Owl brings biscuits, Gopher brings lemonade, and Tigger brings ice cream. But then, Rabbit walks in and tells them their Thanksgiving dinner was unacceptable and informs them that a real Thanksgiving dinner includes turkey, cranberry sauce, and pumpkin pie, so Pooh and his friends set out to find those very items.', 'It''s Thanksgiving time in the Hundred Acre Wood and Winnie the Pooh and all his friends bring food for the big dinner. Piglet brings acorns, Pooh brings honey, Owl brings biscuits, Gopher brings lemonade, and Tigger brings ice cream. But then, Rabbit walks in and tells them their Thanksgiving dinner was unacceptable and informs them that a real Thanksgiving dinner includes turkey, cranberry sauce, and pumpkin pie, so Pooh and his friends set out to find those very items.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nom4BRv0azYlZh3IZemrnaLk51w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357684'),
  ('1047781837015193958', 'A Winter Getaway', 2021, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Steven R. Monroe, Thomas M. Harting', 'Steven Sessions', 'Nazneen Contractor, Brooks Darnell, Erik Athavale, Daina Leitold, Stephanie Sy, Jacob Blair, Ryan Northcott, Vanessa Mitchell', 'G', 'When an average guy is gifted a luxury trip, he is mistaken as a millionaire. But then, sparks fly with the lovely concierge. Will she feel the same way about him when she learns the truth?', 'When an average guy is gifted a luxury trip, he is mistaken as a millionaire. But then, sparks fly with the lovely concierge. Will she feel the same way about him when she learns the truth?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2r1AFLFkQWqmlMk415xPUGkJGl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:775619'),
