  ('246132724436425115', 'A Witch''s Way of Love', 1997, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Pal Gyulay, René Manzor', 'René Manzor', 'Vanessa Paradis, Gil Bellows, Jeanne Moreau, Jean Reno, Dabney Coleman, Louise Vincent, Malcon Dixon, Eléonore Hirt', null, 'Michael Firch is very skilled in computers and he goes to Paris to meet very important persons to discuss a contract. Michael was born on a special astral date. On arriving in Paris, he meets Morgane and her son. Morgane is a witch, she is beautiful, she is good and she needs Michael to save her son from evil powers. Molok is a sorcerer and he opposes Morgana''s plan.', 'Michael Firch is very skilled in computers and he goes to Paris to meet very important persons to discuss a contract. Michael was born on a special astral date. On arriving in Paris, he meets Morgane and her son. Morgane is a witch, she is beautiful, she is good and she needs Michael to save her son from evil powers. Molok is a sorcerer and he opposes Morgana''s plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azNil7xE2srTzvKYY6wnAf6o9M6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64340'),
  ('1150104694421095732', 'A Witches'' Ball', 2017, 'Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Justin G. Dyck', 'Keith Cooper', 'Morgan Neundorf, Joey Fatone, Karen Slater, Loukia Ioannou, Madeline Leon, Will Ennis, Renee Stein, Keith Cooper', 'PG', 'Every year the Witching World gathers to celebrate the newly inducted witches into their world. Beatrix (12) is eager to become part of this world, but when her pending magical status is jeopardized she needs the help of her furry best friend Muggs (voiced by Joey Fatone) to solve some magical riddles before the big event. Will Beatrix sink or soar on the night of the Witches'' Ball?', 'Every year the Witching World gathers to celebrate the newly inducted witches into their world. Beatrix (12) is eager to become part of this world, but when her pending magical status is jeopardized she needs the help of her furry best friend Muggs (voiced by Joey Fatone) to solve some magical riddles before the big event. Will Beatrix sink or soar on the night of the Witches'' Ball?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7Bsubh0n3PqjgCCj5UgXKN0fuJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487047'),
  ('697802785388219702', 'A Witness Out of the Blue', 2019, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Andrew Fung Chih-Chiang, Kenny Tse Chung-To, Jack Wong', 'Andrew Fung Chih-Chiang', 'Louis Koo, Louis Cheung, Jessica Hsuan, Cherry Ngan Cheuk-Ling, Philip Keung Ho-Man, Fiona Sit Hoi-Kei, Patrick Tam Yiu-Man, Andy On Chi-Kit', null, 'In this classic whodunit, a police detective must rely on the only witness - a parrot, to catch the killer of an armed robber.', 'In this classic whodunit, a police detective must rely on the only witness - a parrot, to catch the killer of an armed robber.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfyT9HVkXVnf8qkyNvWq5VMK5bi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:629919'),
  ('1098777127768062852', 'A Wizard''s Tale', 2018, 'Comedy, Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'Samuel Arturo Rico, Andrés Couturier', 'Jim Hecht, Alicia Núñez Puerto', 'Toby Kebbell, Lily Collins, Ian McShane, Keith Wickham, David Holt, Rasmus Hardiker, Emma Tate, Amy Thompson', 'PG', 'Balloon kingdoms, dopey police dragons and happy wizards are exactly how Terry remembered his Grandmother''s whacky fairy tales. Except they are real and it''s definitely not as ''cheerful.''', 'Balloon kingdoms, dopey police dragons and happy wizards are exactly how Terry remembered his Grandmother''s whacky fairy tales. Except they are real and it''s definitely not as ''cheerful.''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azvZPjrMOfQyIdNL7wyHSztAGqq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502259'),
