  ('722824275975841776', 'A Woman', 1915, 'Comedy', 'Charlie Chaplin, Harry Ensign', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin, Edna Purviance, Charles Inslee, Marta Golden, Margie Reiger, Billy Armstrong, Leo White', null, 'Mother, father and daughter go to the park. The women doze off on a bench while the father plays a hide-and-seek game with a girl, blindfolded. Charlie leads him into a lake. Both dozing ladies on the bench fall for Charlie and invite him for dinner. The father returns home with a friend. Charlie rushes upstairs and dresses like a woman, shaving his mustache. Both men fall for Charlie.', 'Mother, father and daughter go to the park. The women doze off on a bench while the father plays a hide-and-seek game with a girl, blindfolded. Charlie leads him into a lake. Both dozing ladies on the bench fall for Charlie and invite him for dinner. The father returns home with a friend. Charlie rushes upstairs and dresses like a woman, shaving his mustache. Both men fall for Charlie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m57avVE0w4DM8l5F8YLFpSt3R6B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53409'),
  ('399928398197304016', 'A Woman', 2022, 'Drama', 'Pierre-Hubert Martin, Jean-Paul Civeyrac', 'Jean-Paul Civeyrac', 'Sophie Marceau, Johan Heldenbergh, Cristina Flutur, Michaël Erpelding, Héloïse Bousquet, Frédéric Matona, Ouassini Embarek, Mohamed Badissy', null, 'Juliane, a police commissioner in Paris, is a woman with great moral integrity. But when she discovers her husband’s double life, she starts committing acts she never would have thought herself capable of.', 'Juliane, a police commissioner in Paris, is a woman with great moral integrity. But when she discovers her husband’s double life, she starts committing acts she never would have thought herself capable of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWdflTODHwPosSi665c3uXSLPtM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:930596'),
  ('96787260590771482', 'A Woman After a Killer Butterfly', 1978, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance, Horror, Fantasy', 'Kim Ki-young, Lee Seong-chun, Seo Byeong-su', 'Lee Mun-woong', 'Nam Koong Won, Kim Man, Kim Jung-chul, Kim Ja-ok, Lee Hwa-si, Park Am, Yoo Soon-chul, Lee Hyang', null, 'A melodrama about a man who survives an attempted double suicide with a stranger while picnicking with friends. He goes on a cave expedition for a famous archaeologist where he discovers a skeleton several thousand years old. He meets the spirit of the skeleton in a dream, and then becomes romantically involved with the archeologist''s daughter.', 'A melodrama about a man who survives an attempted double suicide with a stranger while picnicking with friends. He goes on a cave expedition for a famous archaeologist where he discovers a skeleton several thousand years old. He meets the spirit of the skeleton in a dream, and then becomes romantically involved with the archeologist''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xaG0Jmx5HP7mshYjTTibGEFFCK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122259'),
  ('483854144877764584', 'A Woman Alone', 1987, 'Drama', 'Agnieszka Holland, Piotr Łazarkiewicz, Jacek Petrycki', 'Agnieszka Holland, Maciej Karpiński', 'Maria Chwalibóg, Bogusław Linda, Sława Kwaśniewska, Krzysztof Zaleski, Bożena Baranowska, Bohdana Majda, Pawel Witczak, Henryk Hunko', null, 'Irena, a postal delivery worker, is struggling with inadequate housing, a drunk neighbor who wants to take her place, and a heartless boss, knowing that the whole day at work, she is leaving her young son. But the worst is the loneliness, exacerbated by her single mother status. She meets a crippled pensioner Jacek, who appears to be the key to her happiness, but tragedy continues to strike.', 'Irena, a postal delivery worker, is struggling with inadequate housing, a drunk neighbor who wants to take her place, and a heartless boss, knowing that the whole day at work, she is leaving her young son. But the worst is the loneliness, exacerbated by her single mother status. She meets a crippled pensioner Jacek, who appears to be the key to her happiness, but tragedy continues to strike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95oSXqkPQZOX9MxteoYpxRt17t8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42983'),
  ('344390652447853897', 'A Woman as a Friend', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Alberto Mangiante, Barbara Pastrovich, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Ugo Chiti, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Fabio De Luigi, Laetitia Casta, Valentina Lodovini, Monica Scattini, Geppi Cucciari, Virginia Raffaele, Valeria Solarino, Adriano Giannini', null, 'Francesco and Claudia are best friends. They''re inseparable and tell each other everything, until another man enters the picture stealing Claudia''s heart. Francesco then realizes that friendship between man and woman is a complicated thing.', 'Francesco and Claudia are best friends. They''re inseparable and tell each other everything, until another man enters the picture stealing Claudia''s heart. Francesco then realizes that friendship between man and woman is a complicated thing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRgcU5YrChGjvk5SrFvO2rKqeBa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257314'),
  ('442209488940806578', 'A Woman at Her Window', 1976, 'Drama', 'Pierre Granier-Deferre, Aldo Tonti, Jean-Michel Lacor', 'Jorge Semprún, Pierre Granier-Deferre', 'Romy Schneider, Philippe Noiret, Victor Lanoux, Umberto Orsini, Gastone Moschin, Delia Boccardo, Martine Brochard, Joachim Hansen', null, 'Greece, 1936. An aristocratic woman engages in a series of loveless affairs before finding herself falling for a political activist.', 'Greece, 1936. An aristocratic woman engages in a series of loveless affairs before finding herself falling for a political activist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iux4Lb5jPQ19a3usjmdbvXv8MFD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4947'),
  ('563028006361529886', 'A Woman Called Golda', 1982, 'TV Movie, Drama, History', 'Avner Orshalimy, Nachum Katzin, Gerald Walsh', 'Harold Gast, Steve Gethers', 'Ingrid Bergman, Leonard Nimoy, Jack Thompson, Judy Davis, Anne Jackson, David de Keyser, Robert Loggia, Ned Beatty', null, 'The story of the Russian-born, Wisconsin-raised woman who rose to become Israel''s prime minister in the late 1960s and early 1970s.', 'The story of the Russian-born, Wisconsin-raised woman who rose to become Israel''s prime minister in the late 1960s and early 1970s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Tp2tYPddbcLhOFXe0PXeH5svM1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126031'),
  ('169708498777988420', 'A Woman Called Sada Abe', 1975, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Noboru Tanaka, Masaru Mori, Hideyuki Kobayashi', 'Akio Ido', 'Junko Miyashita, Eimei Esumi, Genshū Hanayagi, Yoshie Kitsuda, Ikunosuke Koizumi, Nagatoshi Sakamoto, Ran Chihaya, Yōko Ōyagi', null, 'The young and beautiful Sada Abe, the daughter of a rich merchant, is banished for losing her virginity after being raped by a college student. Sada wanders the city, becoming a geisha and eventually meeting Kichizo, a posh restaurateur who falls under her spell. Together, they embark on a week-long sexual escapade filled with dangerous obsessions. Their complete descent into each others desires culminates in a shocking crime of passion which captures the city''s headlines. Based on a real event from 1936.', 'The young and beautiful Sada Abe, the daughter of a rich merchant, is banished for losing her virginity after being raped by a college student. Sada wanders the city, becoming a geisha and eventually meeting Kichizo, a posh restaurateur who falls under her spell. Together, they embark on a week-long sexual escapade filled with dangerous obsessions. Their complete descent into each others desires culminates in a shocking crime of passion which captures the city''s headlines. Based on a real event from 1936.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/metI6uPwJiRm0cFgCb4ZutYWb7A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69013'),
  ('928336492175727333', 'A Woman for All Men', 1975, 'Drama, Thriller', 'William F. Sheehan, Robert Birchall, Arthur Marks', 'Robert Blees', 'Judith Brown, Andrew Robinson, Keenan Wynn, Patty Bodeen, Peter Hooten, Don Porter, Lois Hall, Alex Rocco', 'R', 'Irascible and domineering millionaire Walter McCoy marries the beautiful, but shady and duplicitous Karen Petrie. Walter''s son Steve automatically becomes smitten with Karen while both Walter''s daughter Cynthia and loyal housekeeper Sarah suspect that something is up. This provokes a tangled web of deception, infidelity, and even murder.', 'Irascible and domineering millionaire Walter McCoy marries the beautiful, but shady and duplicitous Karen Petrie. Walter''s son Steve automatically becomes smitten with Karen while both Walter''s daughter Cynthia and loyal housekeeper Sarah suspect that something is up. This provokes a tangled web of deception, infidelity, and even murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6G89wQ54w8kEf9kOsV5X29Ox9di.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236138'),
  ('1051755150326232082', 'A Woman in Berlin', 2008, 'Drama, War, History', 'Benedict Neuenfels, Max Färberböck, Tina Rexilius', 'Catharina Schuchmann, Max Färberböck', 'Nina Hoss, Evgeniy Sidikhin, Juliane Köhler, August Diehl, Irm Hermann, Rüdiger Vogler, Ulrike Krumbiegel, Isabell Gerschke', 'NR', 'A woman tries to survive the invasion of Berlin by the Soviet troops during the last days of World War II.', 'A woman tries to survive the invasion of Berlin by the Soviet troops during the last days of World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZMkrrmR21rTibFzTeSCollOpbt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12832'),
  ('626720637675621057', 'A Woman in Danger', 2001, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama, TV Movie', 'Laurent Carcélès, Ion Marinescu', 'Anne Landois', 'Jean-Marie Winling, Marion Cotillard, Natacha Amal, Stéphanie Lagarde, Coca Bloos, Laurent Hennequin, Radu Amzulescu, Cédric Chevalme', 'PG-13', 'After a one-night fling, Florence Lacaze, a married woman, finds her lover''s dead body in a hotel bathroom. Drawn into a hunt by police, Florence is forced to defend herself and uncover the awful truth.', 'After a one-night fling, Florence Lacaze, a married woman, finds her lover''s dead body in a hotel bathroom. Drawn into a hunt by police, Florence is forced to defend herself and uncover the awful truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVuvjPtpQiLhZxSgvUZ5j4l6lun.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288481'),
  ('644698340109326282', 'A Woman in Flames', 1983, 'Drama', 'Robert van Ackeren, Jürgen Jürges', 'Robert van Ackeren, Catharina Zwerenz', 'Gudrun Landgrebe, Mathieu Carrière, Hanns Zischler, Gabriele Lafari, Matthias Fuchs, Klaus Mikoleit, Magdalena Montezuma, Carola Regnier', null, 'Eva, an upper-class housewife, frustratedly leaves her arrogant husband and decides to enter the call girl business. She lets Yvonne, a prostitute, teach her the basics and both set out for prey together, until Eva starts an affair with Chris, who turns out to be a call boy, as well. Consequently, she moves into his penthouse, large enough for both to offer their services separately.', 'Eva, an upper-class housewife, frustratedly leaves her arrogant husband and decides to enter the call girl business. She lets Yvonne, a prostitute, teach her the basics and both set out for prey together, until Eva starts an affair with Chris, who turns out to be a call boy, as well. Consequently, she moves into his penthouse, large enough for both to offer their services separately.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iKeCVR0x8vnRXLtjwjZ7EuVFlo7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11192'),
  ('289611364659193815', 'A Woman in the Mirror', 1984, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Paolo Quaregna, Claudio Cirillo', 'Paolo Quaregna, Barbara Alberti, Fabio Carlini', 'Stefania Sandrelli, Marzio Honorato, Dina D''Isa, Emilio Locurcio, Ottavio Marcelli, Sergio Daneri, Barbara Dolza, Alfredo Dori', null, 'A couple meet during the Carnival in Ivrea (a little town in northern Italy), feel drawn to each other and have a torrid affair destined not to last long.', 'A couple meet during the Carnival in Ivrea (a little town in northern Italy), feel drawn to each other and have a torrid affair destined not to last long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGMAsCjtTcVVLHKzuozm1W30CFV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248392'),
  ('750141501890352135', 'A Woman Is a Woman', 1961, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Francis Cognany, Raoul Coutard', 'Jean-Luc Godard', 'Anna Karina, Jean-Claude Brialy, Jean-Paul Belmondo, Henri Attal, Karyn Balm, Dorothée Blanck, Catherine Demongeot, Marie Dubois', 'NR', 'Longing for a baby, a stripper pursues another man in order to make her boyfriend jealous.', 'Longing for a baby, a stripper pursues another man in order to make her boyfriend jealous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xrZu21hriGJQY3qY8nifh2smVHu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31522'),
  ('43007993738568602', 'A Woman Kills', 1968, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Gérard de Battista, Jean-Denis Bonan', 'Jean-Denis Bonan', 'Claude Merlin, Solange Pradel, Myriam Mézières, Jackie Raynal, Catherine Deville, Alain Yves Beaujour, Velly Beguard, Bernard Letrou', null, 'Paris, in the 1960s. A series of crimes troubles the public tranquility. On March, 22, 1968, Hélène Picard, a prostitute sentenced to death two years before for several murders, is killed by executioner Louis Guilbeau. Immediately, the violent crimes, similar to Hélène’s ones, go on again. In parallel, Louis is having an affair with the police woman in charge of the investigation… What are the obscure relations hidden behind the executioner and the mysterious killer? Who is this dark man in reality?', 'Paris, in the 1960s. A series of crimes troubles the public tranquility. On March, 22, 1968, Hélène Picard, a prostitute sentenced to death two years before for several murders, is killed by executioner Louis Guilbeau. Immediately, the violent crimes, similar to Hélène’s ones, go on again. In parallel, Louis is having an affair with the police woman in charge of the investigation… What are the obscure relations hidden behind the executioner and the mysterious killer? Who is this dark man in reality?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43RXOeSnzn56WmSmmUrLjlq9xQb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306503'),
  ('490881638525738650', 'A Woman Like Eve', 1979, 'Drama, Romance', 'Nurith Aviv, Nouchka van Brakel', 'Judith Herzberg, Nouchka van Brakel', 'Monique van de Ven, Maria Schneider, Marijke Merckens, Peter Faber, Renée Soutendijk, Truus Dekker, Heleen van Meurs, Karin Meerman', null, 'A devoted yet stressed out housewife takes a holiday to relax, and falls in love with another woman: a guitar-playing hippie who lives in a commune.', 'A devoted yet stressed out housewife takes a holiday to relax, and falls in love with another woman: a guitar-playing hippie who lives in a commune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zTxT8ZuEUqRhYkg3rJiwC6QYBP2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96597'),
  ('144392597530796786', 'A Woman Like Satan', 1958, 'Drama, Romance', 'Julien Duvivier, Roger Hubert', 'Julien Duvivier, Albert Valentin, Jean Aurenche', 'Brigitte Bardot, António Vilar, Michel Roux, Lila Kedrova, Jacques Mauclair, Daniel Ivernel, Darío Moreno, Anne-Marie Mersen', null, 'Handsome and rich Spanish gentleman abandons his wife and riches for his love of a young girl of poor stock who taunts and degrades him.', 'Handsome and rich Spanish gentleman abandons his wife and riches for his love of a young girl of poor stock who taunts and degrades him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvGp90BfKAzGIVvIoChO839Ek3x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57669'),
  ('652273307229021982', 'A Woman Married to a Farmer: Ripe Fruit', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ryō Kaihara', 'Ryō Kaihara', 'Toko Namiki, Sousuke Yamamoto, Ryôichi Inaba, Takuya Sakurai, Shuki Kawamata', null, 'Misaki (Toko Namiki) and her husband Takumi are a close couple who work together on a farm in a rural village. One day, their tractor breaks down while they are working, and they decide to go to Taki-mura, a large scale farm, to borrow a tractor.', 'Misaki (Toko Namiki) and her husband Takumi are a close couple who work together on a farm in a rural village. One day, their tractor breaks down while they are working, and they decide to go to Taki-mura, a large scale farm, to borrow a tractor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HJK9x44bsAqW7iVjs2GpYxnTyT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826921'),
  ('882967266582466750', 'A Woman of Affairs', 1928, 'Drama, Romance', 'Clarence Brown, William H. Daniels, Charles Dorian', 'Marian Ainslee, Ruth Cummings, Bess Meredyth', 'Greta Garbo, John Gilbert, Lewis Stone, Johnny Mack Brown, Douglas Fairbanks Jr., Hobart Bosworth, Dorothy Sebastian, Gertrude Astor', 'NR', 'Childhood friends Diana, Neville and David are caught in a love triangle as adults. Diana and Neville have long been smitten with each other, but her father disapproves of the relationship, resulting in her eventual marriage to David. It''s not long after their wedding, however, that tragedy strikes, sending Diana on a downward spiral. When Neville reappears in her life, will he be able to save her from her own misery?', 'Childhood friends Diana, Neville and David are caught in a love triangle as adults. Diana and Neville have long been smitten with each other, but her father disapproves of the relationship, resulting in her eventual marriage to David. It''s not long after their wedding, however, that tragedy strikes, sending Diana on a downward spiral. When Neville reappears in her life, will he be able to save her from her own misery?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mPXzRGMBKrzN9XBrEgPoxhdbu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42615'),
  ('543113555271034420', 'A Woman of Courage', 2016, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'David Ambrosini, Saverio Di Biagio, Serena Lupo', 'Monica Zapelli', 'Lunetta Savino, Linda Caridi, Carmelo Galati, Salvatore Sclafani, Gaetano Aronica, Ettore Belmondo, Antonio Catania, Giorgio Colangeli', null, 'Felicia Impastato, mother of the brave Peppino Impastato, tries to keep the memory of his son alive after his murder.', 'Felicia Impastato, mother of the brave Peppino Impastato, tries to keep the memory of his son alive after his murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9TpF7Iry0ag8yoGvbqqqF8fGxCe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396849'),
  ('1129651747987555900', 'A Woman of Paris: A Drama of Fate', 1923, 'Drama, Romance', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Edna Purviance, Clarence Geldart, Carl Miller, Lydia Knott, Charles K. French, Adolphe Menjou, Betty Morrissey, Malvina Polo', null, 'When Marie St. Clair believes she has been jilted by her artist fiance Jean, she decides to leave for Paris on her own. After spending a year in the city as a mistress of the wealthy Pierre Revel, she is reunited with Jean by chance. This leaves her with the choice between a glamorous life in Paris, and the true love she left behind.', 'When Marie St. Clair believes she has been jilted by her artist fiance Jean, she decides to leave for Paris on her own. After spending a year in the city as a mistress of the wealthy Pierre Revel, she is reunited with Jean by chance. This leaves her with the choice between a glamorous life in Paris, and the true love she left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shmnpKWwfgNzntaDLPO0WYli5PX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28974'),
  ('409415437207023298', 'A Woman Possessed', 1968, 'Horror', 'Emilio Gómez Muriel, Raúl Domínguez', 'Alfredo Ruanova', 'Libertad Leblanc, Enrique Rocha, Rogelio Guerra, Adriana Roel, Bertha Moss, Juan Miranda, Guillermo Rivas, Enrique Rocha', null, 'An evil princess who kills her lovers is condemned by the Inquisition. Four centuries later she returns with the help of a vampire and tries to live forever in the body of an identical woman.', 'An evil princess who kills her lovers is condemned by the Inquisition. Four centuries later she returns with the help of a vampire and tries to live forever in the body of an identical woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iNnOLutFA2AJNBNH8zPdDS6B5Y1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367502'),
  ('1003082034531553728', 'A Woman Rebels', 1936, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mark Sandrich, Robert De Grasse', 'Ernest Vajda, Anthony Veiller', 'Katharine Hepburn, Herbert Marshall, Elizabeth Allan, Donald Crisp, Doris Dudley, David Manners, Lucile Watson, Van Heflin', null, 'A defiant young woman struggles against the norms and morals established by Victorian society and enforced by her autocratic father.', 'A defiant young woman struggles against the norms and morals established by Victorian society and enforced by her autocratic father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ai6kdrJEh6G2aQLITTeFEhySPKM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108348'),
  ('95582855317797442', 'A Woman Scorned: The Betty Broderick Story', 1992, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Drama', 'Dick Lowry, Frank Beascoechea, Brian Ort', 'Joe Cacaci', 'Meredith Baxter, Stephen Collins, Michelle Johnson, Kelli Williams, Stephen Root, Lori Hallier, Christine Jansen, Debra Jo Rupp', null, 'After sixteen years of marriage and four children, Betty Broderick''s high-powered attorney husband decides to leave her for a younger woman with whom he''s been having an affair. Hurt by his betrayal and feeling helpless against his legal expertise, Betty begins a campaign of vandalism and verbal assault. Her rage consumes her and ultimately leads to a terrible and violent act.', 'After sixteen years of marriage and four children, Betty Broderick''s high-powered attorney husband decides to leave her for a younger woman with whom he''s been having an affair. Hurt by his betrayal and feeling helpless against his legal expertise, Betty begins a campaign of vandalism and verbal assault. Her rage consumes her and ultimately leads to a terrible and violent act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbgeFS8gsZuEUrGJIaBzO9bCZHZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176000'),
  ('111685355945609829', 'A Woman with No Filter', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Arthur Fontes, Flávio Zangrandi', 'Tati Bernardi, Diego Ayala, Nicolás López', 'Fabiula Nascimento, Camila Queiroz, Samuel de Assis, Júlia Rabello, Caito Mainier, Emílio Dantas, Polly Marinho, Patrícia Ramos', null, 'Surrounded by a lazy husband, a pedantic stepson, a sexist boss, a self-centered friend, and a neighbor who ruins her sleep with frequent parties, Bia must exert enormous energy to maintain control. But the arrival of a young influencer who takes a higher position than her at the magazine where she works is the final straw. On the verge of a breakdown, Bia ends up being treated by Deusa Xana in a kind of esoteric session. As a result, she frees herself from all filters and begins to practice zero tolerance for all the absurdities that affect her daily life.', 'Surrounded by a lazy husband, a pedantic stepson, a sexist boss, a self-centered friend, and a neighbor who ruins her sleep with frequent parties, Bia must exert enormous energy to maintain control. But the arrival of a young influencer who takes a higher position than her at the magazine where she works is the final straw. On the verge of a breakdown, Bia ends up being treated by Deusa Xana in a kind of esoteric session. As a result, she frees herself from all filters and begins to practice zero tolerance for all the absurdities that affect her daily life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oci0gTmLt55n6T5reT6xKvRNT9y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1302318'),
  ('687966370522641367', 'A Woman With No Filter', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Luis Eduardo Reyes, Antonio Quercia', 'Ángel Pulido, Diego Ayala, Nicolás López', 'Fernanda Castillo, Flavio Medina, Alejandro Calva, Roberto Sosa, Ignacia Allamand, Mariano Palacios, Carmen Aub, Mara Escalante', null, 'Paz, a kind woman, has allowed everyone around her to treat her as if she were worth nothing, keeping silent so as not to hurt feelings. Until one day, in her head, a phenomenon forces her to express what she feels.', 'Paz, a kind woman, has allowed everyone around her to treat her as if she were worth nothing, keeping silent so as not to hurt feelings. Until one day, in her head, a phenomenon forces her to express what she feels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ayBqDoZ6Znvb9gMk2F4syPZr18f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496096'),
  ('34261347584115037', 'A Woman Without Love', 1952, 'Drama, Romance', 'Luis Buñuel, Mario Llorca, Raúl Martínez Solares', 'Luis Buñuel', 'Rosario Granados, Tito Junco, Julio Villarreal, Joaquín Cordero, Xavier Loyá, Elda Peralta, Jaime Calpe, Eva Calvo', null, 'After indulging in an affair with a man (a friend of the family) she truly loves, a woman returns to her young son and husband for good, and loses contact with the man. Her husband is unaware of the affair. Twenty years later, there is news that the friend has died and left all of his money to the younger son in the family, which leads us to question this younger son''s biological origin.', 'After indulging in an affair with a man (a friend of the family) she truly loves, a woman returns to her young son and husband for good, and loses contact with the man. Her husband is unaware of the affair. Twenty years later, there is news that the friend has died and left all of his money to the younger son in the family, which leads us to question this younger son''s biological origin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3P6b465zE1jqevT8sm68EaVvl9J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48883'),
  ('244095283256073258', 'A Woman, a Gun and a Noodle Shop', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Zhang Yimou, Zhao Xiaoding, Shang Jing', 'Xu Zhengchao, Shi Jianquan', 'Sun Honglei, Xiao Shenyang, Yan Ni, Ni Dahong, Cheng Ye, Nikita Mao, Zhao Benshan, Julien Gaudfroy', null, 'Wang is a gloomy, cunning and avaricious noodle shop owner in a desert town in China. His neglected, sharp-tongued wife is involved in a secret affair with Li, one of Wang’s employees. A timid man, Li reluctantly keeps the gun his lover has bought to kill her husband. But Wang is watching their every move. He bribes patrol officer Zhang to murder the illicit couple. It seems like a perfect plan: the affair will come to a cruel, bloody but satisfying end or so he thinks. The equally wicked Zhang has an agenda of his own. As the plot twists, more blood will flow, and ever greater violence will erupt.', 'Wang is a gloomy, cunning and avaricious noodle shop owner in a desert town in China. His neglected, sharp-tongued wife is involved in a secret affair with Li, one of Wang’s employees. A timid man, Li reluctantly keeps the gun his lover has bought to kill her husband. But Wang is watching their every move. He bribes patrol officer Zhang to murder the illicit couple. It seems like a perfect plan: the affair will come to a cruel, bloody but satisfying end or so he thinks. The equally wicked Zhang has an agenda of his own. As the plot twists, more blood will flow, and ever greater violence will erupt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqIjReP7BAx3OqKayy7vwIQ1Kqv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44555'),
  ('530236466165401450', 'A Woman''s Decision', 1975, 'Drama', 'Krzysztof Zanussi, Witold Holtz, Anna Hrynaszkiewicz', 'Krzysztof Zanussi', 'Maja Komorowska, Piotr Fronczewski, Marek Piwowski, Zofia Mrozowska, Halina Mikołajska, Mariusz Dmochowski, Barbara Wrzesińska, Chip Taylor', null, 'The main character is a bookkeeper, 40, who lives a quiet, uninteresting life with her husband and son of school age. She realizes that soon she won''t be needed much at home as the boy grows up and the relationship with her husband crumbles. It''s only when an embezzlement is discovered at the office and she stands up to her management, that she realizes life has more to offer. She meets a well-off former classmate, married to an American. Then she meets Jacek and starts contemplating possibilities of a new start. She discovers love for the first time, but turns to old ways rather than to break loose.', 'The main character is a bookkeeper, 40, who lives a quiet, uninteresting life with her husband and son of school age. She realizes that soon she won''t be needed much at home as the boy grows up and the relationship with her husband crumbles. It''s only when an embezzlement is discovered at the office and she stands up to her management, that she realizes life has more to offer. She meets a well-off former classmate, married to an American. Then she meets Jacek and starts contemplating possibilities of a new start. She discovers love for the first time, but turns to old ways rather than to break loose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCAs5GvteRrEWDAVcVV3VSKj4kT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259468'),
  ('53173282785096606', 'A Woman''s Devotion', 1956, 'Adventure, Crime, Drama, Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Paul Henreid, Mario Cisneros', 'Robert Hill', 'Ralph Meeker, Janice Rule, Paul Henreid, Rosenda Monteros, Fanny Schiller, José Torvay, Yerye Beirute, Tony Carbajal', 'NR', 'An artist suffering from mental problems from his experiences during the war goes to Acapulco on his honeymoon. Soon young women are turning up dead in the area, and the ex-GI comes to believe he might be responsible, as he has long stretches where he can''t remember anything.', 'An artist suffering from mental problems from his experiences during the war goes to Acapulco on his honeymoon. Soon young women are turning up dead in the area, and the ex-GI comes to believe he might be responsible, as he has long stretches where he can''t remember anything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5CFf43GAmbtNT6KQoBYbTPfow3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28662'),
  ('212874968649557724', 'A Woman''s Face', 1938, 'Drama, Crime', 'Åke Dahlqvist, Gustaf Molander', 'Ragnhild Prim, Stina Bergman, Francis de Croisset', 'Ingrid Bergman, Tore Svennberg, Anders Henrikson, Georg Rydeberg, Gunnar Sjöberg, Hilda Borgström, Karin Kavli, Erik ''Bullen'' Berglund', null, 'A cynical woman with a disfigured face—a hardened criminal—gets an opportunity to change her ways when she meets a sympathetic plastic surgeon. She leaves her old life behind, but soon her old friends catch up with her.', 'A cynical woman with a disfigured face—a hardened criminal—gets an opportunity to change her ways when she meets a sympathetic plastic surgeon. She leaves her old life behind, but soon her old friends catch up with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r294LI2tQrYi10ovdBNJ5KPIhge.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76848'),
  ('727797406937176356', 'A Woman''s Face', 1941, 'Drama, Thriller', 'George Cukor, Robert H. Planck, Edward Woehler', 'Donald Ogden Stewart, Elliot Paul', 'Joan Crawford, Melvyn Douglas, Conrad Veidt, Osa Massen, Reginald Owen, Albert Bassermann, Marjorie Main, Donald Meek', 'NR', 'A female blackmailer with a disfiguring facial scar meets a plastic surgeon who offers her the possibility of looking like a normal woman.', 'A female blackmailer with a disfiguring facial scar meets a plastic surgeon who offers her the possibility of looking like a normal woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5ULQxXBUomMgqwQjNwRHqlxCQ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27622'),
  ('177175394511769243', 'A Woman''s Hole', 2014, 'Mystery, Comedy, Romance', 'Hironori Yamasaki, Kōta Yoshida', 'Fumiko Fumi, Kōta Yoshida', 'Naoho Ichihashi, Yūkichi Kobayashi, Toshiyuki Fuse, Keito Aoki, Toshiya Sakai, Yumi Ishikawa', null, 'Sachiko Suzuki is a female high school student. She claims that she is an alien and her mission on Earth is to conceive a child with a human man. Sachicko seduces her class teacher Mr. Fukuda. After their intimate encounter, Mr. Fukuda becomes becomes convinced that Sachiko is not a human. Meanwhile, female student Kobato Hagimoto knows that Mr. Murata has a crush on some male students. Because of this, Mr. Murata is treated as a pig by Kobata until he can''t bear the situation anymore.', 'Sachiko Suzuki is a female high school student. She claims that she is an alien and her mission on Earth is to conceive a child with a human man. Sachicko seduces her class teacher Mr. Fukuda. After their intimate encounter, Mr. Fukuda becomes becomes convinced that Sachiko is not a human. Meanwhile, female student Kobato Hagimoto knows that Mr. Murata has a crush on some male students. Because of this, Mr. Murata is treated as a pig by Kobata until he can''t bear the situation anymore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKQyvsNoZJBOHE1lS5SsVvX8FQs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399898'),
  ('851454574134972827', 'A Woman''s Life', 1963, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Jun Yasumoto', 'Ryōzō Kasahara', 'Hideko Takamine, Tatsuya Nakadai, Akira Takarada, Yuriko Hoshi, Tsutomu Yamazaki, Natsuko Kahara, Keiko Awaji, Mitsuko Kusabue', null, 'A woman remembers her own marriage when dealing with the love life of her son.', 'A woman remembers her own marriage when dealing with the love life of her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dM7makJ7C3dTHPLk1FPnkiIz2yQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147366'),
  ('775950848051819240', 'A Woman''s Life', 2016, 'Drama', 'Stéphane Brizé, Antoine Héberlé, Marc Le Hingrat', 'Florence Vignon, Stéphane Brizé', 'Judith Chemla, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Swann Arlaud, Yolande Moreau, Nina Meurisse, Clotilde Hesme, Alain Beigel, Olivier Perrier', null, 'Normandy, 1819. Jeanne is a young woman full of childish dreams and innocence when she returns home after finishing her schooling in a convent. She marries a local Viscount, Julien de Lamare, who soon reveals himself to be a miserly and unfaithful man. Little by little Jeanne’s illusions are stripped away.', 'Normandy, 1819. Jeanne is a young woman full of childish dreams and innocence when she returns home after finishing her schooling in a convent. She marries a local Viscount, Julien de Lamare, who soon reveals himself to be a miserly and unfaithful man. Little by little Jeanne’s illusions are stripped away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndBjKcPgyyoGd4Y6hNhcGM8QXWe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408543'),
  ('590969973824441774', 'A Woman''s Love', 2001, 'Romance, Drama', 'Sylvie Verheyde, Philippe Vene, Pierre-William Glenn', 'Sylvie Verheyde', 'Hélène Fillières, Raffaëla Anderson, Anthony Delon, Jeannick Gravelines, Karole Rocher, William Wayolle, Thierno Sy, Roselyne Delpuech', null, 'Jeanne attends the birthday party of a friend of her husband. There she meets a dancer named Marie and there is instant chemistry between them. Jeanne falls for Marie and they embark on an extramarital affair.', 'Jeanne attends the birthday party of a friend of her husband. There she meets a dancer named Marie and there is instant chemistry between them. Jeanne falls for Marie and they embark on an extramarital affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CinNLzLrjVg0zkoSg1nfpcQrqy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106538'),
