  ('493033506184962194', 'A Woman''s Revenge', 1990, 'Drama', 'Jacques Doillon, Patrick Blossier', 'Jacques Doillon, Jean-François Goyet', 'Isabelle Huppert, Béatrice Dalle, Jean-Louis Murat, Laurence Côte, Sebastian Roché, David Léotard, Albert Le Prince, Brigitte Marvine', null, 'Suzy, a beautiful woman, is coming back to Paris to attend the funeral of her lover, a married man. Cecile, his wife, is holding Suzy responsible for his suicide. By finding Suzy in Paris, Cecile is trying to seek the truth by playing a psychological game on her.', 'Suzy, a beautiful woman, is coming back to Paris to attend the funeral of her lover, a married man. Cecile, his wife, is holding Suzy responsible for his suicide. By finding Suzy in Paris, Cecile is trying to seek the truth by playing a psychological game on her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfuFIlQMXktxfEmZYuBNHRWz1ea.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128776'),
  ('1119533052375025765', 'A Woman''s Revenge', 2012, 'Drama', 'Rita Azevedo Gomes, Acácio de Almeida', 'Rita Azevedo Gomes', 'Rita Durão, Isabel Ruth, João Pedro Bénard, Francisco Nascimento, Hugo Tourita, Fernando Rodrigues, Maria Carré, Duarte Martins', null, 'Roberto is one of those men to whom simulation has become the greatest art. He is an unmoved, inscrutable, mysterious man. But the truth is that Robert feels an intimate, deep tedium. The boredom of those who have already exhausted all the pleasures of life. The only thing still surprising him is the fact that nothing surprises him anymore. One evening he has an overwhelming encounter with a woman. For his own bewilderment, he discovers the sublime horrors in which the woman has sank.', 'Roberto is one of those men to whom simulation has become the greatest art. He is an unmoved, inscrutable, mysterious man. But the truth is that Robert feels an intimate, deep tedium. The boredom of those who have already exhausted all the pleasures of life. The only thing still surprising him is the fact that nothing surprises him anymore. One evening he has an overwhelming encounter with a woman. For his own bewilderment, he discovers the sublime horrors in which the woman has sank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUbDnm94V8Axc9OlYutkQkBjYmY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89451'),
  ('27420149930727416', 'A Woman''s Revenge', 2015, 'Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Joyce Buñuel, Dominique De Wever', 'Emmanuelle Rey-Magnan, Matthieu Savignac, Pascal Fontanille', 'Laëtitia Milot, Alexandre Varga, Annie Grégorio, Laure Killing, Joy Esther, Vincent Winterhalter, Mathilda May, Xavier de Guillebon', null, 'Following the death of her mother, a thirty-something woman discovers she was conceived through rape and vows revenge.', 'Following the death of her mother, a thirty-something woman discovers she was conceived through rape and vows revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42dcLUh2UAbt4nJyXOHSk0YXgya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345163'),
  ('858200891486882890', 'A Woman''s Secret', 1949, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Nicholas Ray, George E. Diskant, Doran Cox', 'Herman J. Mankiewicz', 'Maureen O''Hara, Melvyn Douglas, Gloria Grahame, Bill Williams, Victor Jory, Mary Philips, Jay C. Flippen, Robert Warwick', 'NR', 'A popular singer, Marian Washburn, suddenly and unexplainably loses her voice, causing a shake-up at the club where she works. Her worried but loyal piano player, Luke Jordan, helps to promote a new, younger singer, Susan Caldwell, to temporarily replace Marian. Susan finds some early acclaim but decides to leave the club after a few performances. Soon after Susan quits, she is gunned down, and Marian quickly becomes a suspect.', 'A popular singer, Marian Washburn, suddenly and unexplainably loses her voice, causing a shake-up at the club where she works. Her worried but loyal piano player, Luke Jordan, helps to promote a new, younger singer, Susan Caldwell, to temporarily replace Marian. Susan finds some early acclaim but decides to leave the club after a few performances. Soon after Susan quits, she is gunned down, and Marian quickly becomes a suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BEccn00r1oExZxyzys7tayWDFN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84364'),
  ('279717495594885941', 'A Woman''s Tale', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Paul Cox, Nino Gaetano Martinetti', 'Paul Cox', 'Sheila Florance, Małgorzata Dobrowolska, Norman Kaye, Chris Haywood, Ernie Gray, Myrtle Woods, Bruce Myles, Alex Menglet', 'PG-13', 'Uplifting and intimate look at the last days of an elderly cancer victim. The film is even more relevant as it was written specifically for the lead actress, Sheila Florance, who was in fact dying of cancer as she created what is essentially a self-portrait.', 'Uplifting and intimate look at the last days of an elderly cancer victim. The film is even more relevant as it was written specifically for the lead actress, Sheila Florance, who was in fact dying of cancer as she created what is essentially a self-portrait.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HwPXpxIQMIm7muzAA9tOJQdGVM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91207'),
