  ('312216883407228526', 'A Wonderful Girl', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Marie Garel-Weiss, Jeanne Lapoirie, Clemence de Sailly', 'Salvatore Lista, Benoît Graffin, Marie Garel-Weiss', 'Benoît Poelvoorde, Daphné Patakia, Agnès Jaoui, Raphaël Quenard, François Rollin, Florence Muller, Maud Wyler, Evelyne Buyle', null, 'Mimi is 29 years old and still dreaming about a job she could get. She meets Paul, a sidelined lawyer, as she decides to seek employment. Together, they will defend Christophe, a conman who proclaims his innocence.', 'Mimi is 29 years old and still dreaming about a job she could get. She meets Paul, a sidelined lawyer, as she decides to seek employment. Together, they will defend Christophe, a conman who proclaims his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A49Y98OkeSgZY71UFu5ILX19ZAg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958854'),
