  ('936283397998254431', 'A Worker''s Diary', 1967, 'Drama', 'Risto Jarva, Lasse Naukkarinen, Antti Peippo', 'Risto Jarva, Jaakko Pakkasvirta', 'Elina Salo, Paul Osipow, Titta Karakorpi, Pentti Irjala, Matti Ruohola, Heikki Hämäläinen, Irma Seikkula, Pertti Lumirae', null, 'Juhani, a welder and Ritva, a right-wing backgrounded, future clerk get married. Soon we see that their marriage seems to be all about long business trips, housing problems, concerns about the money and political disagreements.', 'Juhani, a welder and Ritva, a right-wing backgrounded, future clerk get married. Soon we see that their marriage seems to be all about long business trips, housing problems, concerns about the money and political disagreements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUrvDIS8FhkHuphpZcx3tpXQjN9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358999'),
  ('883049439312319673', 'A Working Man', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'David Ayer, Shawn White, Eddie J. Fernandez', 'Sylvester Stallone, David Ayer', 'Jason Statham, Jason Flemyng, Merab Ninidze, Maximilian Osinski, Cokey Falkow, Michael Peña, David Harbour, Noemi Gonzalez', 'R', 'Levon Cade left behind a decorated military career in the black ops to live a simple life working construction. But when his boss''s daughter, who is like family to him, is taken by human traffickers, his search to bring her home uncovers a world of corruption far greater than he ever could have imagined.', 'Levon Cade left behind a decorated military career in the black ops to live a simple life working construction. But when his boss''s daughter, who is like family to him, is taken by human traffickers, his search to bring her home uncovers a world of corruption far greater than he ever could have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6FRFIogh3zFnVWn7Z6zcYnIbRcX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1197306'),
  ('467379020222765232', 'A World Apart', 1988, 'Drama', 'Chris Menges, Peter Biziou', 'Shawn Slovo', 'Barbara Hershey, David Suchet, Jeroen Krabbé, Paul Freeman, Tim Roth, Jodhi May, Nadine Chalmers, Maria Pilar', 'PG', 'A White enclave in Johannesburg, South Africa, in the 1960s. Molly Roth, 13 years old, is the daughter of leftist parents, and she must piece together what''s happening around her when her father disappears one night, barely evading arrest, and, not long after, her mother is detained by the authorities. Some of Molly''s White friends turn against her, and her family''s friendships with Blacks take on new meaning. Relationships are fragile in the world of apartheid. How will she manage?', 'A White enclave in Johannesburg, South Africa, in the 1960s. Molly Roth, 13 years old, is the daughter of leftist parents, and she must piece together what''s happening around her when her father disappears one night, barely evading arrest, and, not long after, her mother is detained by the authorities. Some of Molly''s White friends turn against her, and her family''s friendships with Blacks take on new meaning. Relationships are fragile in the world of apartheid. How will she manage?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLo4PwbuT3C7k2VxAGbMQU1aINp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41949'),
  ('621742420808240008', 'A World Apart', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Riccardo Milani, Saverio Guarna', 'Riccardo Milani, Michele Astori', 'Antonio Albanese, Virginia Raffaele, Sergio Saltarelli, Alessandra Barbonetti, Solidea Pistilli, Sergio Meogrossi, Corrado Oddi, Gianmarco Borsa', null, 'Elementary school teacher Michele Cortese is about to start a whole new life. After 40 years of teaching in the metropolitan Roman jungle, he had to move to a village in Central Italy, to teach in a tiny school with just a few children aged 7-10. Struggling to overcome his urban inadequacy, he finds a friendly face in vice-principal Agnese and gradually manages to fit in, thanks to her and their spirited pupils. As everything seems to be falling into place, unwelcome news comes through: the school has failed to meet its student quota for the next year and will soon be shut for good.', 'Elementary school teacher Michele Cortese is about to start a whole new life. After 40 years of teaching in the metropolitan Roman jungle, he had to move to a village in Central Italy, to teach in a tiny school with just a few children aged 7-10. Struggling to overcome his urban inadequacy, he finds a friendly face in vice-principal Agnese and gradually manages to fit in, thanks to her and their spirited pupils. As everything seems to be falling into place, unwelcome news comes through: the school has failed to meet its student quota for the next year and will soon be shut for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Laozh4nmOZkmf3meyjPb2IYAdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1109306'),
  ('82924239191670138', 'A World For Julius', 2021, 'Drama', 'Gabriel Di Martino, Rossana Díaz-Costa', 'Rossana Díaz-Costa', 'Augusto Linares, Pamela Saco, Mayella Lloclla, Nacho Fresneda, Antonieta Pari, Matías Raygada, Américo Zúñiga, Javier Sardà', null, 'Julius is an upper-class boy in Lima in the 1940s. He lives in a palace with his aristocratic family and extensive servants. As the years go by, Julius will gradually lose his innocence, discovering and never understanding an adult world full of inequalities and injustices.', 'Julius is an upper-class boy in Lima in the 1940s. He lives in a palace with his aristocratic family and extensive servants. As the years go by, Julius will gradually lose his innocence, discovering and never understanding an adult world full of inequalities and injustices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcXyHceQxSvViCKgI8XvGV8rDqp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:877669'),
  ('624414806298429179', 'A World Gone Mad - The War Diaries of Astrid Lindgren', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Wilfried Hauke', 'Wilfried Hauke', 'Sofia Pekkari, Tom Sommerlatte, Karin Nyman', null, '“Pippi Longstocking“ has been translated into 70 languages and sold more than 60 million copies. The film tells the story of her “mother“, famous Swedish author Astrid Lindgren. When young an still unknown, she starts a diary on September 1, 1939. Full of despair about the world, she is in conversation with herself and discovers the healing power of writing. As WWII ends with millions dead and the destruction of Europe, her first book about rebellious Pippi is published.', '“Pippi Longstocking“ has been translated into 70 languages and sold more than 60 million copies. The film tells the story of her “mother“, famous Swedish author Astrid Lindgren. When young an still unknown, she starts a diary on September 1, 1939. Full of despair about the world, she is in conversation with herself and discovers the healing power of writing. As WWII ends with millions dead and the destruction of Europe, her first book about rebellious Pippi is published.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F7PJItikCkbRJia0hSb91HlARzX9.jpg', 'plex:movie:a-world-gone-mad-the-war-diaries-of-astrid-lindgren'),
  ('1120769232855523042', 'A World of Ours', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Frédéric Balekdjian', 'Frédéric Balekdjian, Fabien Vehlmann', 'Édouard Baer, Anton Balekdjian, Nassereba Keita, Philippe Lefebvre, Jean-François Stévenin, Véronique Gallet, Julien Frison, Alain Chabat', null, 'Noé comes into sixth grade at the same time he discovers a new city and a new house where he has just moved with his father, Marc. Coached by him, Noé takes intensive training of combat sport. And Mark does not hesitate to put him in a situation of attack. They are in danger, he must be prepared to respond to any aggression. While keeping the secret of his "double" life, Noé has to learn how to find a place in his new college. He becomes friend with Marine, a young girl full of energy. Noé discovers a world whose vision was shaped by his father so far. A father so near and yet so mysterious. Between them there is a history of complicity and confrontation.', 'Noé comes into sixth grade at the same time he discovers a new city and a new house where he has just moved with his father, Marc. Coached by him, Noé takes intensive training of combat sport. And Mark does not hesitate to put him in a situation of attack. They are in danger, he must be prepared to respond to any aggression. While keeping the secret of his "double" life, Noé has to learn how to find a place in his new college. He becomes friend with Marine, a young girl full of energy. Noé discovers a world whose vision was shaped by his father so far. A father so near and yet so mysterious. Between them there is a history of complicity and confrontation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPtz7zevnUNhSmd6NFr9OSQ9OUq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15913'),
  ('351182216781162129', 'A World Without Thieves', 2004, 'Action, Drama', 'Feng Xiaogang, Zhang Li', 'Lin Lisheng, Feng Xiaogang, Wang Gang', 'Andy Lau, René Liu, Wang Baoqiang, Li Bingbing, Ge You, Zhang Hanyu, You Yongzhi, Xu Fan', null, 'A con-team couple head west after taking a city businessman for his BMW. But an encounter with a naive young carpenter traveling home with his life savings challenges their fate as thieves.', 'A con-team couple head west after taking a city businessman for his BMW. But an encounter with a naive young carpenter traveling home with his life savings challenges their fate as thieves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IjyqBSxyB15suArMMOXefWQu4D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29363'),
  ('111355588585700553', 'A World Without Women', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Guillaume Brac, Tom Harari, Guilhem Amesland', 'Guillaume Brac, Hélène Ruault', 'Vincent Macaigne, Laure Calamy, Constance Rousseau, Laurent Papot, Terry Fouache, Geoffrey Boulanger, Cédric Cailleux, Marie Picard', null, 'A little sea resort on the Picardie coast, the last week of august. When handing over the keys to a rented apartment, Sylvain makes the acquaintance of two beautiful women. This is a fabulous occasion for him to escape his routine, single life in which women are a rarity, even if only for a few days. Quickly Sylvain''s new friends can''t do without him. Unfortunately, things get complicated when feelings and flirty Gilles, the local lady''s man, get mixed up in it all.', 'A little sea resort on the Picardie coast, the last week of august. When handing over the keys to a rented apartment, Sylvain makes the acquaintance of two beautiful women. This is a fabulous occasion for him to escape his routine, single life in which women are a rarity, even if only for a few days. Quickly Sylvain''s new friends can''t do without him. Unfortunately, things get complicated when feelings and flirty Gilles, the local lady''s man, get mixed up in it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLGXmrOBs2aO3WjOMPuzxRh7n0l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170832'),
  ('405114358793733216', 'A Wounded Fawn', 2022, 'Horror', 'Ksusha Genenfeld, Travis Stevens', 'Nathan Faudree, Travis Stevens', 'Josh Ruben, Sarah Lind, Malin Barr, Katie Kuang, Tanya Everett, Laksmi Hedemark, Marshall Taylor Thurman, Neal Mayer', 'NR', 'A local museum curator who is dipping her toe back into the dating pool is targeted by a charming serial killer. When a fateful romantic getaway between the two becomes a tense game of cat and mouse, both must confront the madness within him.', 'A local museum curator who is dipping her toe back into the dating pool is targeted by a charming serial killer. When a fateful romantic getaway between the two becomes a tense game of cat and mouse, both must confront the madness within him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rE3szsbV1LyZtIfzJadqklnJO7l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964873'),
