  ('737202669171513147', 'A Year of the Quiet Sun', 1984, 'Romance, Drama', 'Krzysztof Zanussi, Sławomir Idziak', 'Krzysztof Zanussi', 'Maja Komorowska, Scott Wilson, Hanna Skarżanka, Ewa Dałkowska, Vadim Glowna, Danny Webb, Zbigniew Zapasiewicz, Tadeusz Bradecki', 'PG', 'Shortly after World War II an American soldier (Norman) and a Polish refugee (Emilia) fall in love. Eventually he will return to the U.S. and both expect that she will soon follow him with her mother. Emilia''s mother is sick, but will recover with the right medicine. But the mother, and not Emilia, knows that there will only be one ticket...', 'Shortly after World War II an American soldier (Norman) and a Polish refugee (Emilia) fall in love. Eventually he will return to the U.S. and both expect that she will soon follow him with her mother. Emilia''s mother is sick, but will recover with the right medicine. But the mother, and not Emilia, knows that there will only be one ticket...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMxB1CzBRzy48JjFbrdgVArTolc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42096'),
