  ('757829224705185812', 'A Year-End Medley', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kwak Jae-yong, Kim Jang-mi, Jo Gyeong-hun', 'Yoo Seung-hee', 'Lee Dong-wook, Won Jin-ah, Han Ji-min, Seo Kang-joon, Kang Ha-neul, Yoona, Lee Hye-young, Jung Jin-young', null, 'A romantic comedy of a young man and woman that is told in the background of hotel ''Emross''. It has stories of people who met each other at Hotel Emross during the New Year holidays. Each one has his own memory to relate and create relationships or just going nostalgic.', 'A romantic comedy of a young man and woman that is told in the background of hotel ''Emross''. It has stories of people who met each other at Hotel Emross during the New Year holidays. Each one has his own memory to relate and create relationships or just going nostalgic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ls9ljfJWqxYMKnQ4KgOLNFyzqDS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:821661'),
  ('1057179181240135961', 'A Young Man', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Stepan Zhivov, Sergey Kurbatov, Anastasiya Trofimova', 'Aleksander Fomin', 'Pavel Tabakov, Danila Kozlovsky, Danila Poperechny, Ingrid Olerinskaya, Valentina Lyapina, Rakhim Abramov, Vlad Feldman, Egor Kiriachok', null, 'The main character was a standout high school student and graduated university at the highest level. When he reached his 30-s he has found himself a failure: his wife left him for a successful boxer, he got fired from a misearable job, and a morgage that he had to keep up paying off for years ahead. At the most desperate moment the character finds out that that his cunning classmate (Danila Kozlovsky) has become a prosperous businessman and announced a competition for high school students with the prize fund of over a million or rubbles. The main character looks a lot younger than he is, he even gets asked if he is of age when buying alcholol. He gets rid of his beard, fakes his DOB in ID and decides to take a chance in the competition assured that expirience can take over youth.', 'The main character was a standout high school student and graduated university at the highest level. When he reached his 30-s he has found himself a failure: his wife left him for a successful boxer, he got fired from a misearable job, and a morgage that he had to keep up paying off for years ahead. At the most desperate moment the character finds out that that his cunning classmate (Danila Kozlovsky) has become a prosperous businessman and announced a competition for high school students with the prize fund of over a million or rubbles. The main character looks a lot younger than he is, he even gets asked if he is of age when buying alcholol. He gets rid of his beard, fakes his DOB in ID and decides to take a chance in the competition assured that expirience can take over youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApEbuLy6iapP1nVvYtpiDZ4kb4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:650253'),
  ('830484244808684732', 'A Young Miss... Aged 39', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Victor Antoun, Anis Nohra', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Christos Giannakopoulos', 'Vasilis Logothetidis, Smaro Stefanidou, Ilia Livykou, Thanasis Tzeneralis, Stephanos Stratigos, Vagelis Protopapas, Dina Stathatou, Mihalis Papadakis', null, 'Telemachus, an unhappy old man, still lives with his sister, whom he expects to restore so that he marries the woman he loves. In the end, he is persuaded by a friend to put an ad in the newspaper to find her bridegroom, without mentioning her real age and highlighting her dowry. Finally, two bridal candidates appear: A retired and a Greek-Argentine landowner...', 'Telemachus, an unhappy old man, still lives with his sister, whom he expects to restore so that he marries the woman he loves. In the end, he is persuaded by a friend to put an ad in the newspaper to find her bridegroom, without mentioning her real age and highlighting her dowry. Finally, two bridal candidates appear: A retired and a Greek-Argentine landowner...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFOsU3dWEBMe4rh9BPAteUUNYyv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484721'),
