  ('197945637450370771', 'A.I. Rising', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Romance', 'Lazar Bodroža, Kosta Glušica', 'Dimitrije Vojnov', 'Sebastian Cavazza, Stoya, Maruša Majer, Kirsty Besterman', 'R', 'On a lonely mission to Alpha Centauri, Milutin is teamed up with Nimani 1345, a female cyborg designed to fulfill his every need. At first thrilled to be able to control her, Sebastian grows tired of having his desires fulfilled so easily. Longing for human intimacy, Sebastian alters Nimani''s programmed responses, but in doing so he risks the mission''s security — and his own life.', 'On a lonely mission to Alpha Centauri, Milutin is teamed up with Nimani 1345, a female cyborg designed to fulfill his every need. At first thrilled to be able to control her, Sebastian grows tired of having his desires fulfilled so easily. Longing for human intimacy, Sebastian alters Nimani''s programmed responses, but in doing so he risks the mission''s security — and his own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXosp6MFBxYi4m6ZmE4u1auReHc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505914'),
  ('980818497547747030', 'A.K.A. Serial Killer', 1975, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Masao Adachi, Susumu Iwabuchi', 'Masao Adachi', 'Masao Adachi', null, 'AKA Serial Killer documents the social upheaval and political oppression that roiled Japan in the 1960s, profiling a nineteen-year-old serial killer Norio Nagayama. An indictment of media sensationalism, the film humanizes the young man by situating his crimes in the larger context of his environment.', 'AKA Serial Killer documents the social upheaval and political oppression that roiled Japan in the 1960s, profiling a nineteen-year-old serial killer Norio Nagayama. An indictment of media sensationalism, the film humanizes the young man by situating his crimes in the larger context of his environment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqxEvqCDIBfGhiueFn8WEFl7XXo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156314'),
