  ('620544638833157923', 'A.P.E.X.', 1994, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Phillip J. Roth, Mark W. Gray', 'Phillip J. Roth, Ron Schmidt', 'Richard Keats, Mitchell Cox, Lisa Ann Russell, Marcus Aurelius, Adam Lawson, David Jean Thomas, Brian Peck, Anna B. Choi', 'R', 'A time-travel experiment in which a robot probe is sent from the year 2073 to the year 1973 goes terribly wrong thrusting one of the project scientists,into a plague ravaged alternate time-line whose war weary inhabitants are locked in a constant battle with killer robots from the future.', 'A time-travel experiment in which a robot probe is sent from the year 2073 to the year 1973 goes terribly wrong thrusting one of the project scientists,into a plague ravaged alternate time-line whose war weary inhabitants are locked in a constant battle with killer robots from the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2suttaVnNI3dhxBZ1jI9bHMf12m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21947'),
  ('326286503667032442', 'A.R.C.H.I.E.', 2016, 'Family, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Robin Dunne', 'Robin Dunne', 'Michael J. Fox, Katharine Isabelle, Jonathan Whitesell, Robin Dunne, Sarah Desjardins, Farrah Aviva, Fred Ewanuick, Laura Abramsen', null, 'A recently orphaned 15-year-old who has moved to a small town to live with her uncle befriends a robotic canine with super strength, x-ray vision and the ability to talk and the pair take on a military complex, bullies, kidnappers, romance and the world.', 'A recently orphaned 15-year-old who has moved to a small town to live with her uncle befriends a robotic canine with super strength, x-ray vision and the ability to talk and the pair take on a military complex, bullies, kidnappers, romance and the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYEEmFFlT5jVbe8xfCP6WVwhKN2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393877'),
