  ('352448822931280967', 'A*P*E', 1976, 'Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Paul Leder, Tony Francis, Daniel L. Symmes', 'Paul Leder, Reuben Leder', 'Alex Nicol, Joanna Kerns, Lee Nak-hoon, Woo Yeon-jeong, Rod Arrants, Jerry Harke, Larry Chandler, Walt Myers', 'PG', 'A newly discovered 36-foot gorilla escapes from a freighter off the coast of Korea. At the same time an American actress is filming a movie in the country. Chaos ensues as the ape kidnaps her and rampages through Seoul.', 'A newly discovered 36-foot gorilla escapes from a freighter off the coast of Korea. At the same time an American actress is filming a movie in the country. Chaos ensues as the ape kidnaps her and rampages through Seoul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvjTUBCZNiQPH3bWOJQn6FKS7gv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31126'),
