  ('544609078061390700', 'Aa ab Laut Chalen', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rishi Kapoor, Sameer Arya', 'Sachin Bhowmick', 'Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, Akshaye Khanna, Rajesh Khanna, Moushumi Chatterjee, Paresh Rawal, Kader Khan, Navin Nischol, Suman Ranganathan', null, 'An ambitious, unemployed youth goes to the US to find a job and gets caught in a love triangle between Pooja and Loveleen. However, he soon realises that he loves Pooja and reconciles with her.', 'An ambitious, unemployed youth goes to the US to find a job and gets caught in a love triangle between Pooja and Loveleen. However, he soon realises that he loves Pooja and reconciles with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w87ziVrS9aWGW3WvDU6VJb2jXDQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75253'),
  ('472689627000035637', 'Aa Bata Aama', 2026, 'Drama', 'Chandra Pant', 'Chandra Pant, Abhimanyu Nirabi', 'Saigrace Pokharel, Pradeep Rawat, Paul Shah, Bipana Thapa', null, 'Emotional family drama that explores the deep, heartfelt bond between a mother and her child. The story revolves around a young Nepali man who is preparing to go abroad in search of a better future.', 'Emotional family drama that explores the deep, heartfelt bond between a mother and her child. The story revolves around a young Nepali man who is preparing to go abroad in search of a better future.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BYWFmNDczYzAtNmIzZC00MzYyLTkzYmMtZDQ0ZDE1NTgzYjFiXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:aa-bata-aama'),
  ('663298912328101479', 'Aa Dekhen Zara', 2009, 'Thriller, Action', 'Jehangir Choudhary, Haseena Shaikh, Jehangir Surti', null, 'Neil Nitin Mukesh, Bipasha Basu, Rahul Dev, Sophiya Chaudhary, Bobby Vatsa, Srivas Naidu, Deepak Dhariwal, Biswajeet Chatterjee', 'PG', 'A photographer (Ray) has nothing going for him, until he inherits a camera from his grandfather. This changes his life in a way that he could not have ever imagined in his wildest dreams.', 'A photographer (Ray) has nothing going for him, until he inherits a camera from his grandfather. This changes his life in a way that he could not have ever imagined in his wildest dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZQC25WN6N5v9kidjHEv4Azq5gC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17059'),
  ('766485940846259942', 'AAA - The Movie', 2010, 'Animation, Action', 'Alberto Rodríguez, Alberto Mar', 'David Israel Hernández', 'Andrés Gutierrez, Sergio Coto, César Arias, Bruno Coronel, Rolando de Castro, Alejandro Mayén, Jesús Guzmán, Luis Alfonso Mendoza', null, 'On the night that Parka pried the championship from Abismo Negro''s hands, the master of darkness'' long lasting resentments resurge, thus threatening AAA''s stability. With the help of Chesman, Charly Manson, and Cybernético, Abismo plots his revenge. Not even Octagón, AAA''s spiritual leader, can stop the evil turn of events. When Kenzo Suzuki and Yonatan, Parka''s younger brother, are kidnapped, it''s quite clear the war has begun. Parka, helped by Gronda, Mascarita, Faby Apache, and Octagón, will fight to their very last breath to overcome the obstacles. The sudden appearance of a long lost evil, Triple A''s ancestral enemy, rises the odds even more. An abandoned insane asylum, murderous cyborgs, gigantic dragonflies, ancient armies, and time travel are just the beginning of the adventure. The most spectacular lucha libre match ever is about to begin...', 'On the night that Parka pried the championship from Abismo Negro''s hands, the master of darkness'' long lasting resentments resurge, thus threatening AAA''s stability. With the help of Chesman, Charly Manson, and Cybernético, Abismo plots his revenge. Not even Octagón, AAA''s spiritual leader, can stop the evil turn of events. When Kenzo Suzuki and Yonatan, Parka''s younger brother, are kidnapped, it''s quite clear the war has begun. Parka, helped by Gronda, Mascarita, Faby Apache, and Octagón, will fight to their very last breath to overcome the obstacles. The sudden appearance of a long lost evil, Triple A''s ancestral enemy, rises the odds even more. An abandoned insane asylum, murderous cyborgs, gigantic dragonflies, ancient armies, and time travel are just the beginning of the adventure. The most spectacular lucha libre match ever is about to begin...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ludzEAyXiP8jWYtooZszIEb2PFr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69738'),
  ('441471620396612054', 'AAA Rey De Reyes 2026', 2026, 'Action, Sport', null, null, 'Marcel Barthel, Tyler Bate, Chas Betts, Jack Cartwright, Kevin Citlali Zamora', 'TV-PG', 'The event takes place on March 14, 2026 at Auditorio GNP Seguros in Puebla de Zaragoza, Puebla, and will air as a three-week event, airing every Saturday on episodes of Lucha Libre AAA from March 14 to March 28, 2026.', 'The event takes place on March 14, 2026 at Auditorio GNP Seguros in Puebla de Zaragoza, Puebla, and will air as a three-week event, airing every Saturday on episodes of Lucha Libre AAA from March 14 to March 28, 2026.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BNTBlZWMxNjctZmYwMi00MzgwLTkzYmMtMWM5MDZkYmM1ZmIyXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:aaa-rey-de-reyes-2026-2026'),
