  ('466924901977653294', 'Aaaaaaaah!', 2015, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Steve Oram, Matthew Wicks', 'Steve Oram', 'Steve Oram, Lucy Honigman, Toyah Willcox, Julian Rhind-Tutt, Tom Meeten, Holli Dempsey, Julian Barratt, Noel Fielding', null, 'Alpha Male Smith and his Beta, Keith, move to take over a local community. They hook up with restless Female, Denise, igniting a deadly feud in which emotions run high and deep-seated grudges resurface amongst the tribe. Are we not men? Or are we simply beasts?', 'Alpha Male Smith and his Beta, Keith, move to take over a local community. They hook up with restless Female, Denise, igniting a deadly feud in which emotions run high and deep-seated grudges resurface amongst the tribe. Are we not men? Or are we simply beasts?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvDVbVHrfsDj1Aj5EDtrcdybTmH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347760'),
  ('675704829448745678', 'Aaahh Belinda', 1986, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Atıf Yılmaz, Orhan Oğuz', 'Barış Pirhasan', 'Müjde Ar, Macit Koper, Yılmaz Zafer, Füsun Demirel, Fatoş Sezer, Güzin Özipek, İsmet Ay, Mehmet Akan', null, 'Serap is a successful theater actress. Although she rejects the traditional roles assigned to women in her personal life, she agrees to play the role of a traditional housewife in a shampoo commercial. However, she is unaware that this commercial will turn into her worst nightmare.', 'Serap is a successful theater actress. Although she rejects the traditional roles assigned to women in her personal life, she agrees to play the role of a traditional housewife in a shampoo commercial. However, she is unaware that this commercial will turn into her worst nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bp3h7SZDI7KPw0jK0L6EwfMqzZC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74304'),
  ('847993831481486866', 'Aachi & Ssipak', 2006, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction, Comedy, Adventure', 'Jo Beom-jin, Lee Chung-bok', 'Jo Beom-jin, Jeong Hye-won, Kang Sang-kyun', 'Ryoo Seung-bum, Hyun Young, Shin Hae-chul, Im Chang-jung', null, 'Sometime in the future, mankind has depleted all energy and fuel sources, however they have engineered a way to use human excrement as fuel. To reward production, the government hands out extremely addictive, popsicle-like "Juicybars", which in turn also act as a laxative. Aachi and Ssipak are street hoodlums who struggle to survive by trading these bars in the black market.', 'Sometime in the future, mankind has depleted all energy and fuel sources, however they have engineered a way to use human excrement as fuel. To reward production, the government hands out extremely addictive, popsicle-like "Juicybars", which in turn also act as a laxative. Aachi and Ssipak are street hoodlums who struggle to survive by trading these bars in the black market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ib8yTKDDYIxj0X8ywGomFPLpJE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22520'),
  ('856106227158034129', 'Aadhavan', 2009, 'Thriller, Action, Comedy', 'K. S. Ravikumar, Ganesh Rajavelu', 'K. S. Ravikumar, Ramesh Khanna', 'Suriya, Nayanthara, Vadivelu, Murali, B. Saroja Devi, Rahul Dev, Sayaji Shinde, Anand Babu', null, 'A professional assassin is tasked with the murder of a prominent local judge; however, after a series of failed attempts, he is forced to deal with complications and old relationships arising from his troubled past.', 'A professional assassin is tasked with the murder of a prominent local judge; however, after a series of failed attempts, he is forced to deal with complications and old relationships arising from his troubled past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zInbT4vo0w9liEIbtydoOIUWifI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55951'),
  ('1069184149608884383', 'Aadu 3', 2026, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Midhun Manuel Thomas, Akhil George, Vishnu Bharathan', 'Midhun Manuel Thomas', 'Jayasurya, Vinayakan, Sunny Wayne, Saiju Kurup, Vijay Babu, Vineeth Mohan, Dharmajan Bolgatty, Harikrishnan', null, 'Shaji Pappan and Co. opens a Pandora''s box of reincarnations and multiple timelines leading to comic chaos of epic proportions.', 'Shaji Pappan and Co. opens a Pandora''s box of reincarnations and multiple timelines leading to comic chaos of epic proportions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3yqreNY1f4iOXX0vBAqY64ZvxiV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1260210'),
  ('587535165751458619', 'Aadukalam', 2011, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Vetrimaaran, R. Velraj', 'Vetrimaaran', 'Dhanush, Kishore, V. I. S. Jayapalan, Aadukalam Naren, Taapsee Pannu, Meenal, Periya Karuppu Thevar, V R Dinesh', null, 'Pettaikaaran is famous in his town for an impeccable track record of successes in rooster fights. When one of his aides, Karuppu, goes against his word in a fight, it leads to an enmity between them.', 'Pettaikaaran is famous in his town for an impeccable track record of successes in rooster fights. When one of his aides, Karuppu, goes against his word in a fight, it leads to an enmity between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osU8Egxu2xhS6RwkxDbfOMYjZZ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68016'),
  ('599850571982120462', 'Aag', 1994, 'Drama, Action, Mystery', 'Meghha Chheda, K. Ravi Shankar', 'Satish Jain', 'Govinda, Shilpa Shetty Kundra, Sadashiv Amrapurkar, Vikas Anand, Mohnish Behl, Sonali Bendre, Suresh Chatwal, Avtar Gill', null, 'Birju is the mysterious guardian of a remote village. One day, a beautiful young woman arrives and disrupts the order. This disruption forces Birju into conflict with the village aristocracy and reveals his shocking past.', 'Birju is the mysterious guardian of a remote village. One day, a beautiful young woman arrives and disrupts the order. This disruption forces Birju into conflict with the village aristocracy and reveals his shocking past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4z6SwWjrcSM7WwP7WdaOMQRl9H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463001'),
  ('571161465502604817', 'Aag Lagay Basti Mein', 2026, 'Action, Crime, Comedy', 'Bilal Atif Khan', 'Naeem Ali', 'Fahad Mustafa, Mahira Khan, Javed Sheikh, Tabish Hashmi, Salahuddin Tunio, Ayub Khoso', null, 'Barkat is an honest, hard-working man struggling to make ends meet alongside his wife, Almaas, who has grown tired of their modest life. Working as cleaners, the couple decides to turn to petty crime in hopes of improving their financial situation. What begins as small, calculated risks soon spirals into something far bigger, drawing the couple into the world of seasoned criminals. As guns, chases, and escalating chaos enter their lives, Barkat and Almaas find their domestic relationship increasingly entangled with crime and danger. Blending dark comedy with crime drama, the story explores ambition, greed, and the unintended consequences of trying to take shortcuts to a better life', 'Barkat is an honest, hard-working man struggling to make ends meet alongside his wife, Almaas, who has grown tired of their modest life. Working as cleaners, the couple decides to turn to petty crime in hopes of improving their financial situation. What begins as small, calculated risks soon spirals into something far bigger, drawing the couple into the world of seasoned criminals. As guns, chases, and escalating chaos enter their lives, Barkat and Almaas find their domestic relationship increasingly entangled with crime and danger. Blending dark comedy with crime drama, the story explores ambition, greed, and the unintended consequences of trying to take shortcuts to a better life', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAvQELcI17z2YKnqOmuukfaFGg9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1610901'),
  ('410046804586081676', 'Aaja Nachle', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'Anil Mehta, K.U. Mohanan', null, 'Madhuri Dixit, Konkona Sen Sharma, Kunal Kapoor, Raghubir Yadav, Dalai, Ranvir Shorey, Vinay Pathak, Jugal Hansraj', null, 'Dia is a divorced mom living in New York and must go back to India after she receives news that her guru is on his death bed. When she arrives she finds he is gone and has left her the responsibility of saving and reviving the Ajanta Theater where she used to dance. The problem is that the political officers want it torn down and turned into a shopping mall. The storyline follows Dia and her challenge to stand up for what she believes in and fight the cause to the end, while trying to win back the love and support of the people of the town whom she walked out on ten years prior.', 'Dia is a divorced mom living in New York and must go back to India after she receives news that her guru is on his death bed. When she arrives she finds he is gone and has left her the responsibility of saving and reviving the Ajanta Theater where she used to dance. The problem is that the political officers want it torn down and turned into a shopping mall. The storyline follows Dia and her challenge to stand up for what she believes in and fight the cause to the end, while trying to win back the love and support of the people of the town whom she walked out on ten years prior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xru51i8vXJrowpjz7z6ZsCYakPD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14159'),
  ('51688700073504912', 'Aakhree Raasta', 1986, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'K. Bhagyaraj, S. Gopala Reddy', 'K. Bhagyaraj', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Jaya Prada, Sridevi, Anupam Kher, Om Shivpuri, Sadashiv Amrapurkar, Dalip Tahil, Bharat Kapoor', null, 'David is an old prisoner, released after twenty-four years in a penitentiary for a crime he hasn''t committed. The three men who framed him and sent him away, are now prominent citizens of his town. David walks out of the prison straight into a confessional booth at his church. He tells the priest that he is about to kill three prominent men, for which he seeks God''s pardon in advance. He must find his old friend, bootlegger and the custodian of David''s only son. David had believed in his friend to bring up his son as the worst criminal and seek revenge from the men who put him away. On meeting him, David finds that his son is a Cop instead. Devastated, David continues on his own. When he is about to kill the three men, his son has vowed to protect the citizens under any circumstances. David and his son are at war..who will prevail?', 'David is an old prisoner, released after twenty-four years in a penitentiary for a crime he hasn''t committed. The three men who framed him and sent him away, are now prominent citizens of his town. David walks out of the prison straight into a confessional booth at his church. He tells the priest that he is about to kill three prominent men, for which he seeks God''s pardon in advance. He must find his old friend, bootlegger and the custodian of David''s only son. David had believed in his friend to bring up his son as the worst criminal and seek revenge from the men who put him away. On meeting him, David finds that his son is a Cop instead. Devastated, David continues on his own. When he is about to kill the three men, his son has vowed to protect the citizens under any circumstances. David and his son are at war..who will prevail?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeOByJ06LPHctubIWZzOfpdPzYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267504'),
  ('116442042169445037', 'Aakrosh', 1980, 'Drama', 'Govind Nihalani', 'Vijay Tendulkar, Satyadev Dubey', 'Naseeruddin Shah, Om Puri, Amrish Puri, Smita Patil, Mohan Agashe, Achyut Potdar, Deepak Shirke, Reema Lagoo', null, 'In the 1980s, a lawyer defends a tribal man who is under arrest for killing his own wife. As he proceeds with the case, he learns about the harsh life of scheduled tribes in India.', 'In the 1980s, a lawyer defends a tribal man who is under arrest for killing his own wife. As he proceeds with the case, he learns about the harsh life of scheduled tribes in India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJRbl9X6agXb3gTjHsmJebW7HDh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190213'),
  ('1093076827391815275', 'Aakrosh', 2010, 'Action, Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Priyadarshan, S. Thirunavukkarasu, Honey Trehan', 'Akash Khurana, Robin Bhatt', 'Ajay Devgn, Akshaye Khanna, Bipasha Basu, Reema Sen, Paresh Rawal, Jaideep Ahlawat, Pankaj Tripathi, Ashraf Ul Haq', null, 'The Central Bureau of Investigation deputes two officers to investigate the disappearance of three medical students, which they believe to be an incident of ''honour killing'' in a small, closed community.', 'The Central Bureau of Investigation deputes two officers to investigate the disappearance of three medical students, which they believe to be an incident of ''honour killing'' in a small, closed community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ya8x3bI2MkvVfu4ZKzkgKSTsDaU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54081'),
  ('671956236940555042', 'Aalavandhan', 2001, 'Thriller', 'Suresh Krissna, S. Thirunavukkarasu, A. R. Rajasekar', 'Kamal Haasan', 'Kamal Haasan, Raveena Tandon, Anu Hasan, Milind Gunaji, Kitu Gidwani, Manisha Koirala, Gollapudi Maruti Rao, Shri Vallabh Vyas', null, 'Nandu and Vijay are brothers who were abused by their stepmother during their younger days. Nandhu, who is mentally ill, decides to kill Vijay''s fiancee as he visualizes her as his stepmother.', 'Nandu and Vijay are brothers who were abused by their stepmother during their younger days. Nandhu, who is mentally ill, decides to kill Vijay''s fiancee as he visualizes her as his stepmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6C8youno9ycdYfO7DaRi01meax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66346'),
  ('333347214656169217', 'Aaliyah: The Princess of R&B', 2014, 'Drama, Music, TV Movie', 'Bradley Walsh, André Pienaar', 'Michael Elliot', 'Alexandra Shipp, Elise Neal, Clé Bennett, Christopher Jacot, Chattrisse Dolabaille, Anthony Grant, Lyriq Bent, Izaak Smith', 'PG-13', 'The story of R&B singer and actress Aaliyah; namely, the highs and lows of her career, her romantic pursuits, and the events leading up to her death in 2001 at the age of 22.', 'The story of R&B singer and actress Aaliyah; namely, the highs and lows of her career, her romantic pursuits, and the events leading up to her death in 2001 at the age of 22.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXmkTsKFh3xKqFAEq5XakakQJfC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:303616'),
  ('911492101337184919', 'Aalto', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Tuomo Hutri, Jani Kumpulainen, Virpi Suutari', 'Virpi Suutari', 'Alvar Aalto, Aino Aalto, Elissa Aalto, Martti Suosalo, Pirkko Hämäläinen', null, 'Aalto is one of the greatest names in modern architecture and design, Aino and Alvar Aalto gave their signature to iconic Scandic design. The first cinematic portrait of their life love story is an enchanting journey of their creations and influence around the world.', 'Aalto is one of the greatest names in modern architecture and design, Aino and Alvar Aalto gave their signature to iconic Scandic design. The first cinematic portrait of their life love story is an enchanting journey of their creations and influence around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdymebZxcPeLscqYr9zCl9YrTRB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:683722'),
  ('629954659738212783', 'Aaltra', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hugues Poulain, Benoît Delépine, Gustave Kervern', 'Benoît Delépine, Gustave Kervern', 'Benoît Delépine, Gustave Kervern, Michel de Gavre, Isabelle Delépine, Gérard Condejean, Pierre Ghenassia, Pierre Carles, Jan Bucquoy', 'NR', 'In this pitch black comedy the rivalry between two neighbors escalates into an all out war. Through a maintenance error on a tractor they both end up, paralyzed, in a wheelchair. It seems they are doomed to stay together. They no longer focus their rage on each other but on the manufacturer of the tractor, in Helsinki. So get ready for a hilarious wheelchair road movie.', 'In this pitch black comedy the rivalry between two neighbors escalates into an all out war. Through a maintenance error on a tractor they both end up, paralyzed, in a wheelchair. It seems they are doomed to stay together. They no longer focus their rage on each other but on the manufacturer of the tractor, in Helsinki. So get ready for a hilarious wheelchair road movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oacJEKUH4czthUvFdfWY2f5FdMy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12249'),
  ('454683964585522502', 'Aamdani Atthanni Kharcha Rupaiya', 2001, 'Comedy', 'K Raghavendra Rao', null, 'Govinda, Juhi Chawla Mehta, Johny Lever, Tabu, Ketki Dave, Chandrachur Singh, Tiku Talsania, Shakti Kapoor', null, 'Jhoomri and her husband, Bhimsha, move into a new neighbourhood. Their immediate neighbours are three squabbling couples, namely Vijay and Anjali who are newly married; Appu Khote and Vimla, who are married and have 4 children; and Ravi and Meena, who are also married and have one child. With their wages unable to keep up with inflation and high cost of living, unable to pay even rent to the landlord, B.K. Kakkad, the wives decide to seek employment to augment their income, with hilarious results from their spouses, who will go to any extent to keep their wives at home, even if means to bring a dancing girl home to cook and look after the children!!', 'Jhoomri and her husband, Bhimsha, move into a new neighbourhood. Their immediate neighbours are three squabbling couples, namely Vijay and Anjali who are newly married; Appu Khote and Vimla, who are married and have 4 children; and Ravi and Meena, who are also married and have one child. With their wages unable to keep up with inflation and high cost of living, unable to pay even rent to the landlord, B.K. Kakkad, the wives decide to seek employment to augment their income, with hilarious results from their spouses, who will go to any extent to keep their wives at home, even if means to bring a dancing girl home to cook and look after the children!!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xl6TNdI2QM1kKBrsuNKJkWadu4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25801'),
