  ('794247982570867555', 'Aazhi', 2026, 'Drama, Action', 'Madhav Ramadasan, Anand N Nair', 'Madhav Ramadasan', 'Liju Prabhakar, Sabari Krishnan, Navin kannan, R. Sarathkumar, Devika Satheesh', null, 'In Nagercoil, a devoted father struggles when he learns of his daughter''s relationship. A solitary sea journey becomes a moment of reflection, where love, responsibility, and acceptance quietly reshape their family bonds.', 'In Nagercoil, a devoted father struggles when he learns of his daughter''s relationship. A solitary sea journey becomes a moment of reflection, where love, responsibility, and acceptance quietly reshape their family bonds.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F1SQ0PL6bf0IHdf2xV8sIiMbc8Wq.jpg', 'plex:movie:aazhi-2026'),
  ('752855244107287382', 'Ab Tak Chhappan', 2004, 'Crime, Drama', 'Shimit Amin, Vishal Sinha', 'Sandeep Srivastava', 'Nana Patekar, Yashpal Sharma, Prasad Purandhare, Nakul Vaid, Kunal Vijaykar, Jeeva, Mohan Agashe, Revathi', null, 'Following the fortunes of tough cop Sadhu Agashe both in his fight against crime and in his personal life. Garnering newspaper headlines for his crime-fighting activities, he also makes some enemies in the police department, most notably in the form of his superior, who believes his officer has gone too far.', 'Following the fortunes of tough cop Sadhu Agashe both in his fight against crime and in his personal life. Garnering newspaper headlines for his crime-fighting activities, he also makes some enemies in the police department, most notably in the form of his superior, who believes his officer has gone too far.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4oiBsdFOy2Wuivznvq9r145x5PJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16566'),
  ('36328565901799900', 'Ab Tak Chhappan 2', 2015, 'Crime, Action', 'Ejaz Gulab', 'Nilesh Girkar', 'Nana Patekar, Gul Panag, Mohan Agashe, Govind Namdeo, Vikram Gokhale, Dilip Prabhavalkar, Ashutosh Rana, Revathi', null, 'Home Minister Janardhan Jagirdarand chief Minister Anna Saheb are much concerned over the criminal activities of underworld dons Rawal and Rauf Lala. Rawal is operating from Bangkok while Rauf supervises his gang from Mumbai. The famous Encounter Squad is activated to counter the gangsters and restore peace in the area. The formidable Sadhu Agashe (Nana Patekar) is requested to take charge of the peace-keeping mission. At first he is reluctant but after continuous insistence, he agrees to launch a counter attack against Rawal and Lala Rauf gangs and the action begins.', 'Home Minister Janardhan Jagirdarand chief Minister Anna Saheb are much concerned over the criminal activities of underworld dons Rawal and Rauf Lala. Rawal is operating from Bangkok while Rauf supervises his gang from Mumbai. The famous Encounter Squad is activated to counter the gangsters and restore peace in the area. The formidable Sadhu Agashe (Nana Patekar) is requested to take charge of the peace-keeping mission. At first he is reluctant but after continuous insistence, he agrees to launch a counter attack against Rawal and Lala Rauf gangs and the action begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acRIouyjmxO9UwKtFSHslUU192Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328402'),
  ('1123092331706473111', 'Ab Tumhare Hawale Watan Saathiyo', 2004, 'War, Drama, Action', 'Anil Sharma', 'Shaktimaan Talwar', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Akshay Kumar, Bobby Deol, Divya Khossla, Sandali Sinha, Nagma, Aarti Chabria, Kapil Sharma', null, 'All Maj. Amarjeet Singh wants is for his grandson Kunal to be as noble and brave as Amarjeet and the boy''s father, Vikramjeet. But Kunal has other plans and does not wish to follow in his father''s and grandfather''s military legacies. Reluctantly, Kunal gives in and joins the army and ends up falling for Shweta, the widow of a fallen soldier. When the man later turns up alive, will Shweta return to him or stay with her new love?', 'All Maj. Amarjeet Singh wants is for his grandson Kunal to be as noble and brave as Amarjeet and the boy''s father, Vikramjeet. But Kunal has other plans and does not wish to follow in his father''s and grandfather''s military legacies. Reluctantly, Kunal gives in and joins the army and ends up falling for Shweta, the widow of a fallen soldier. When the man later turns up alive, will Shweta return to him or stay with her new love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxYbTEakxvnigRab30Nwlyu7lRC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177360'),
  ('800598378944457647', 'Ab-normal Beauty', 2004, 'Horror', 'Oxide Pang Chun, Decha Srimantra, Jil Wong Pak-Kei', 'Pang Pak-Sing, Oxide Pang Chun', 'Race Wong, Rosanne Wong, Anson Leung Chun-Yat, Michelle Yim, Cub Chin Kong-Hon, Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin', null, 'Jiney is an popular art and photography student, but despite winning an award, she remains unhappy with her work. After photographing the aftermath of a fatal car accident, she finds herself obsessed with death. Suffering from morbid throughts, flashbacks of an incident from her youth when she was sexually abused by some young boys start to appear.', 'Jiney is an popular art and photography student, but despite winning an award, she remains unhappy with her work. After photographing the aftermath of a fatal car accident, she finds herself obsessed with death. Suffering from morbid throughts, flashbacks of an incident from her youth when she was sexually abused by some young boys start to appear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NkyHkMbF4hBLOEm0ZMb4EfO9Mf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10255'),
  ('607754083228330847', 'Abacus: Small Enough to Jail', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Steve James, Tom Bergmann', null, 'Neil Barofsky, Ti-Hua Chang, Jiayang Fan, Roman Fuzaylov, Polly Greenberg, Linda Hall, Don Lee, David Lindorff', null, 'The incredible saga of the Chinese immigrant Sung family, owners of Abacus Federal Savings of Chinatown, New York. Accused of mortgage fraud by Manhattan District Attorney Cyrus R. Vance, Jr., Abacus becomes the only U.S. bank to face criminal charges in the wake of the 2008 financial crisis. The indictment and subsequent trial forces the Sung family to defend themselves – and their bank’s legacy in the Chinatown community – over the course of a five-year legal battle.', 'The incredible saga of the Chinese immigrant Sung family, owners of Abacus Federal Savings of Chinatown, New York. Accused of mortgage fraud by Manhattan District Attorney Cyrus R. Vance, Jr., Abacus becomes the only U.S. bank to face criminal charges in the wake of the 2008 financial crisis. The indictment and subsequent trial forces the Sung family to defend themselves – and their bank’s legacy in the Chinatown community – over the course of a five-year legal battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4u00FWfh8dUruEB7C3KCaV3FtOH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411007'),
  ('39295091113062459', 'Aballay, the Man without Fear', 2011, 'Drama, Western', 'Fernando Spiner, Claudio Beiza', 'Valentín Javier Diment, Fernando Spiner, Santiago Hadida', 'Pablo Cedrón, Nazareno Casero, Claudio Rissi, Mariana Anghileri, Luis Ziembrowski, Horacio Fontova, Gabriel Goity, Lautaro Delgado Tymruk', null, 'Aballay was a bad tempered gaucho. After killing a man, the terrified look of the victim''s son raised his consciousness about his savagery. Years go by, that kid''s look doesn''t leave him. Aballay knows that the kid will look for him.', 'Aballay was a bad tempered gaucho. After killing a man, the terrified look of the victim''s son raised his consciousness about his savagery. Years go by, that kid''s look doesn''t leave him. Aballay knows that the kid will look for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6SYAQMdBSgbkSQdMt190z5B20S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92780'),
  ('922462052051790923', 'Abandon', 2002, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Stephen Gaghan', 'Stephen Gaghan', 'Katie Holmes, Benjamin Bratt, Charlie Hunnam, Zooey Deschanel, Fred Ward, Mark Feuerstein, Melanie Lynskey, Philip Bosco', 'PG-13', 'A psychological thriller about a senior at one of America''s most prestigious universities. Under enormous pressure to complete her thesis and earn a top job at one of the world''s most competitive consulting firms, Katie is still coping with the sudden unexplained disappearance of her first love two years prior. As the investigation continues, Katie is forced to choose between past passions and new possibilities, even as new facts are uncovered.', 'A psychological thriller about a senior at one of America''s most prestigious universities. Under enormous pressure to complete her thesis and earn a top job at one of the world''s most competitive consulting firms, Katie is still coping with the sudden unexplained disappearance of her first love two years prior. As the investigation continues, Katie is forced to choose between past passions and new possibilities, even as new facts are uncovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zRmopB7pnveyhFaCRSMZMiGO0v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15992'),
  ('191178004350962001', 'Abandoned', 1949, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'William H. Daniels, Joseph M. Newman, William Holland', 'Irwin Gielgud', 'Dennis O''Keefe, Gale Storm, Jeff Chandler, Meg Randall, Raymond Burr, Marjorie Rambeau, Jeanette Nolan, Mike Mazurki', 'NR', 'A Los Angeles newspaperman seeks a woman''s sister and finds a black-market baby ring.', 'A Los Angeles newspaperman seeks a woman''s sister and finds a black-market baby ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJlvfBywxqwogkKy72yeg5iiKTQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32849'),
  ('1027011682138947770', 'Abandoned', 1955, 'Drama, War, Romance', 'Francesco Maselli, Gianni Di Venanzo, Rinaldo Ricci', 'Francesco Maselli, Ageo Savioli, Eriprando Visconti', 'Lucia Bosè, Isa Miranda, Jean-Pierre Mocky, Goliarda Sapienza, Anthony Steffen, Leonardo Botta, Marco Guglielmi, Giuliano Montaldo', null, 'A group of rich young intellectuals hiding from the war in rural Italy play at being partisans when some disbanded soldiers and some refugees ask them for shelter in their villa. The young and aristocratic Andrea strikes up a friendship with a peasant girl, Lucia. Then the Germans suddenly appear, looking for the real partisans, and the time comes for serious decisions.', 'A group of rich young intellectuals hiding from the war in rural Italy play at being partisans when some disbanded soldiers and some refugees ask them for shelter in their villa. The young and aristocratic Andrea strikes up a friendship with a peasant girl, Lucia. Then the Germans suddenly appear, looking for the real partisans, and the time comes for serious decisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1PuA7F7orp3DbpmpD1C5nB610o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210370'),
