  ('873719686709504913', 'Abbott and Costello Meet the Keystone Kops', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Charles Lamont, Reggie Lanning, Joseph Gershenson', 'John Grant', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Fred Clark, Lynn Bari, Maxie Rosenbloom, Harold Goodwin, Roscoe Ates, Mack Sennett', null, 'Harry and Willie are scammed into buying the Thomas Edison studio lot by a man named Gorman. They decide to follow Gorman''s trail to Hollywood where, unbeknownst to them, he has taken the identity of a foreign film director. The lads wind up as stunt doubles in film the which Gorman is now shooting, while the conman tries to have the bungling pair done away with before they realize who he really is.', 'Harry and Willie are scammed into buying the Thomas Edison studio lot by a man named Gorman. They decide to follow Gorman''s trail to Hollywood where, unbeknownst to them, he has taken the identity of a foreign film director. The lads wind up as stunt doubles in film the which Gorman is now shooting, while the conman tries to have the bungling pair done away with before they realize who he really is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPxsFbTp4mX13EjEwkZgZikc2lF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33476'),
  ('770435535954266942', 'Abbott and Costello Meet the Mummy', 1955, 'Adventure, Horror, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Charles Lamont, George Robinson, Phil Bowles', 'John Grant', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Marie Windsor, Michael Ansara, Dan Seymour, Richard Deacon, Kurt Katch, Richard Karlan', null, 'Stranded in Egypt, Bud and Lou find themselves in the buried tomb of a living mummy.', 'Stranded in Egypt, Bud and Lou find themselves in the buried tomb of a living mummy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHKjPVnDwE6iiz3pVj7MGwXo8B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26661'),
  ('276076416881817936', 'Abboud on the Border', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Ahmad Alaa Aldeeb, Hamdy Zain, Magdy Nour', 'Ahmed Abdallah', 'Alaa Wali El Din, Hassan Hosny, Karim Abdel Aziz, Ahmed Helmy, Ghada Adel, Ezzat Abu Ouf, Mahmoud Abdel Moghny, Ahmed Akl', null, 'Abboud lives a reckless life with his two friends. He knows that he will not enter the army because he''s an only child. But when his father marries another woman who gives birth to a boy, Abboud is forced to join the army in spite of being unfit, working at the border with his friends.', 'Abboud lives a reckless life with his two friends. He knows that he will not enter the army because he''s an only child. But when his father marries another woman who gives birth to a boy, Abboud is forced to join the army in spite of being unfit, working at the border with his friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVS0DrO1VjZ4gMEAizoaAeZLVAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514120'),
