  ('952057191602050076', 'ABCs of Superheroes', 2015, 'Comedy, Action', 'Jens Holzheuer, Oliver Tietgen, Oliver Tietgen', 'Oliver Tietgen, Jens Holzheuer', 'Bai Ling, Uwe Boll, Jörg Buttgereit, Lloyd Kaufman, Fred Olen Ray, Aramis Merlin, Meggan Anderson, Jerry Kwarteng', null, 'ABCs of Superheroes brings you not only one or two or five, but no less than twenty-six of the most heroic and outrageous Superheroes and Supervillains of all time. From the Almighty Ape to the fabulous Zee-Men, this anthology feature film will have you laughing and screaming for more. The ultimate experience in Superpower!', 'ABCs of Superheroes brings you not only one or two or five, but no less than twenty-six of the most heroic and outrageous Superheroes and Supervillains of all time. From the Almighty Ape to the fabulous Zee-Men, this anthology feature film will have you laughing and screaming for more. The ultimate experience in Superpower!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZ9ymB11Xen1sOrTW7NCYs1c6Wh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347457'),
