  ('1015310420444138614', 'Abel, Your Brother', 1970, 'Drama', 'Janusz Nasfeter, Zofia Dybowska-Aleksandrowicz, Eugenia Jaśkiewicz', 'Teresa Nasfeter, Janusz Nasfeter', 'Katarzyna Łaniewska, Witold Dederko, Zdzisław Leśniak, Jacek Fedorowicz, Henryk Bąk, Krystyna Feldman, Maria Kaniewska, Wojciech Rajewski', null, 'A young boy tries to earn the friendship of his new classmates, notorious bullies, which leads to tragic consequences.', 'A young boy tries to earn the friendship of his new classmates, notorious bullies, which leads to tragic consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4fhOs1D0CCpKKdW0BD3cGrKIm1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135560'),
