  ('97344224597939131', 'Abilene Town', 1946, 'Western, Romance', 'Edwin L. Marin, Archie Stout, Nat W. Finston', 'Harold Shumate', 'Randolph Scott, Ann Dvorak, Edgar Buchanan, Rhonda Fleming, Lloyd Bridges, Helen Boyce, Howard Freeman, Richard Hale', 'NR', 'Marshall Dan Mitchell, who is the law in Abilene, has the job of keeping peace between two groups. For a long time, the town had been divided, with the cattlemen and cowboys having one end of town to themselves, while townspeople occupied the other end. Mitchell liked it this way, it made things easier for him, and kept problems from arising between the two factions. However…', 'Marshall Dan Mitchell, who is the law in Abilene, has the job of keeping peace between two groups. For a long time, the town had been divided, with the cattlemen and cowboys having one end of town to themselves, while townspeople occupied the other end. Mitchell liked it this way, it made things easier for him, and kept problems from arising between the two factions. However…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56wUpULMCeytbqgdNDCRksNjMkz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22349'),
  ('1127768111354726894', 'Abimm', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Şafak Bal', 'İlkay Akdağlı', 'Mustafa Üstündağ, Levent Üzümcü, Selen Seyven, Rüçhan Çalışkur, Haldun Boysan, Bülent Şakrak, İlkay Akdağlı, Okan Selvi', null, 'Çetin is greedy. Years later upon his father''s death he returns home. He begins a new friendship with his mentally disabled brother Arif.', 'Çetin is greedy. Years later upon his father''s death he returns home. He begins a new friendship with his mentally disabled brother Arif.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfpMIQtczioH74CnyTL4Nx0J17u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52089'),
  ('556593324992103526', 'Ablations', 2014, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Arnold de Parscau, François Catonné', 'Benoît Delépine', 'Denis Ménochet, Virginie Ledoyen, Florence Thomassin, Philippe Nahon, Yolande Moreau, Chantal Baroin, Serge Riaboukine, Philippe Rebbot', null, 'Business trips are trapped by multiple temptations, such as a well stocked hotel bar. But this time salesman Pastor might have overdone it a bit. He wakes up in the middle of a field without any memory at all of how he got there. Even stranger is the ugly scar on his back. But what really drives him out of his mind is that the stitches from the operation are still fresh. Has he become the victim of on organ theft? Is he missing a kidney? Pastor starts to put everything in Question; being a father, a husband, a salesman... The only thing he wants is to find out what has happened to him and nothing and nobody will stop him.', 'Business trips are trapped by multiple temptations, such as a well stocked hotel bar. But this time salesman Pastor might have overdone it a bit. He wakes up in the middle of a field without any memory at all of how he got there. Even stranger is the ugly scar on his back. But what really drives him out of his mind is that the stitches from the operation are still fresh. Has he become the victim of on organ theft? Is he missing a kidney? Pastor starts to put everything in Question; being a father, a husband, a salesman... The only thing he wants is to find out what has happened to him and nothing and nobody will stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fm5DI0kxFiZGBug0gOZ3PXU3xWI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280075'),
  ('526834466486481053', 'Ablaze', 2025, 'Drama', 'Thomas Kruithof, Christophe Beaucarne, Michaël Laguens', 'Jean-Baptiste Delafon, Thomas Kruithof', 'Virginie Efira, Arieh Worthalter, Mama Prassinos, Justine Lacroix, Loup Pinard, Katia Crivellari', null, 'Karine and Jimmy are a close-knit couple, still deeply in love after twenty years together and two children. She works in a factory; he is a truck driver striving to grow his small business. When the Yellow Vests movement emerges, Karine is swept up by the power of the collective, the anger, and the hope for change. But as her commitment intensifies, the couple’s balance begins to falter.', 'Karine and Jimmy are a close-knit couple, still deeply in love after twenty years together and two children. She works in a factory; he is a truck driver striving to grow his small business. When the Yellow Vests movement emerges, Karine is swept up by the power of the collective, the anger, and the hope for change. But as her commitment intensifies, the couple’s balance begins to falter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5a9lShyBV8m3s45HsAibEuvudc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1331358'),
  ('357202211312764172', 'Abnormal Family', 1984, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Masayuki Suō, Yuichi Nagata, Kiyoshi Inoue', 'Masayuki Suō', 'Ren Osugi, Miki Yamaji, Kei Shuto, Shirō Shimomoto, Kaoru Kaze, Usagi Asō, Haruhiko Fukano, Kurara Hanayama', null, 'The film tells a story about a woman and her relationship with the family of her husband''s, in particular her husband''s younger brother and father-in-law. Her husband, on the other hand, has an affair with a dominatrix and is obsessed in S&M games.', 'The film tells a story about a woman and her relationship with the family of her husband''s, in particular her husband''s younger brother and father-in-law. Her husband, on the other hand, has an affair with a dominatrix and is obsessed in S&M games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5AjAAGORo2tvlplzVlvksc8IaV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112702'),
  ('19813638223423162', 'Abominable', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Neal Fredericks, Ryan Schifrin, Theresa Eastman', 'Ryan Schifrin, James Morrison', 'Matt McCoy, Haley Joel, Christien Tinsley, Karin Anna Cheung, Jeffrey Combs, Natalie Compagno, Lance Henriksen, Paul Gleason', 'R', 'A man, crippled in an accident, returns to the woods after rehabilitation, certain that he''ll not see Bigfoot again.', 'A man, crippled in an accident, returns to the woods after rehabilitation, certain that he''ll not see Bigfoot again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVz9kkRU0RmkjHrb1JQBLlQCncS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10011'),
  ('1026119721674019765', 'Abominable', 2019, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jennifer J. Pan, Robert Edward Crawford, Jill Culton', 'Jill Culton', 'Chloe Bennet, Albert Tsai, Eddie Izzard, Tenzing Norgay Trainor, Joseph Izzo, Sarah Paulson, Tsai Chin, Michelle Wong', 'PG', 'A group of misfits encounter a young Yeti named Everest, and they set off to reunite the magical creature with his family on the mountain of his namesake.', 'A group of misfits encounter a young Yeti named Everest, and they set off to reunite the magical creature with his family on the mountain of his namesake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20djTLqppfBx5WYA67Y300S6aPD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431580'),
  ('682452725044297640', 'Abominable', 2020, 'Horror', 'Khu, Jamaal Burden', 'Joseph Daniel Ellis', 'Katrina Mattson, Amy Gordon, Robert Berlin, Justin Prince Moy, Joseph Daniel Ellis, Brandon Grimes, Magdaln Smus, John Carlssun', null, 'A research team embarks on a journey to obtain a plant that can advance medical research by centuries. While stumbling upon clues of the previous expedition, they discover that a Yeti creature lurks within the Himalayan mountains and will do anything to protect its terrain.', 'A research team embarks on a journey to obtain a plant that can advance medical research by centuries. While stumbling upon clues of the previous expedition, they discover that a Yeti creature lurks within the Himalayan mountains and will do anything to protect its terrain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83ugETfeMVqEgmeleX2EfSYOASh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682825'),
  ('524838072114354310', 'Abot Langit', 2026, 'Romance', 'Topel Lee, Jeyow Evangelista, Jaque Carlos', 'Topel Lee, Frederick Castro', 'Aliya Raymundo, JC Tan, Jio Yoshida, Zel Fernandez, Jetleline Esquivel, Aziely Gonzales, Rosalind Pajarillo, Christine Abesamis', null, 'The relationship of a couple is tested when the girl’s first official flight pairs her with a confident senior pilot, jealousy and power dynamics surface in the training ground. The girl is now torn between her present relationship and new temptation she can’t resist.', 'The relationship of a couple is tested when the girl’s first official flight pairs her with a confident senior pilot, jealousy and power dynamics surface in the training ground. The girl is now torn between her present relationship and new temptation she can’t resist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5lVYe4aSimWdxJINKwq9s68TZ2G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1650558'),
  ('757411144833496303', 'About 12', 2015, 'Drama', 'Martín Shanly, Roman Kasseroller, Sofía Brockenshire', 'Martín Shanly', 'Rosario Shanly, María Passo, Javier Burin Heras, Camila Bontá, Renata Toscano Bruzón, María Inés Sancerni, Amy Schulte, Sofía Brockenshire', null, 'Twelve year old Juana goes to a British school in the outskirts of Buenos Aires, where she fails both socially and academically. A week away from the exams that will determine her future in the institution, she is surrounded by the same routine; going to class and trying to pull her social life back together, with useless attempts in between. Juana goes through these strange days apparently feeling indifferent towards the situation.', 'Twelve year old Juana goes to a British school in the outskirts of Buenos Aires, where she fails both socially and academically. A week away from the exams that will determine her future in the institution, she is surrounded by the same routine; going to class and trying to pull her social life back together, with useless attempts in between. Juana goes through these strange days apparently feeling indifferent towards the situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LjPY6I2BPEsGNV1UAAQNFIscgh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301520'),
  ('864454862078609793', 'About a Boy', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Paul Weitz, Remi Adefarasin, Chris Weitz', 'Peter Hedges, Chris Weitz, Paul Weitz', 'Hugh Grant, Nicholas Hoult, Toni Collette, Rachel Weisz, Natalia Tena, Victoria Smurfit, Augustus Prew, Sharon Small', 'PG-13', 'Will Freeman is a good-looking, smooth-talking bachelor whose primary goal in life is avoiding any kind of responsibility. But when he invents an imaginary son in order to meet attractive single moms, Will gets a hilarious lesson about life from a bright, but hopelessly geeky 12-year-old named Marcus. Now, as Will struggles to teach Marcus the art of being cool, Marcus teaches Will that you''re never too old to grow up.', 'Will Freeman is a good-looking, smooth-talking bachelor whose primary goal in life is avoiding any kind of responsibility. But when he invents an imaginary son in order to meet attractive single moms, Will gets a hilarious lesson about life from a bright, but hopelessly geeky 12-year-old named Marcus. Now, as Will struggles to teach Marcus the art of being cool, Marcus teaches Will that you''re never too old to grow up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoZ1bD0q9EFqcNiEYbEigsRcNCt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245'),
  ('796536999152826241', 'About a Girl', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mark Monheim, Daniel Schönauer', 'Martin Rehbock, Mark Monheim', 'Jasna Fritzi Bauer, Heike Makatsch, Aurel Manthei, Simon Schwarz, Lauritz Greve, Dorothea Walda, Sandro Lohmann, Nikolaus Frei', null, 'Charleen is 15, melodramatic, mega depressed, and Kurt Cobain’s biggest fan. Her best friend Isa is getting really boring, her dad is out of the picture, and her mom has hooked up with her biology teacher. Even though she has an apprenticeship preparing bodies for funerals, which is pretty cool, her musical idols are all dead. It’s about time Charleen was, too.', 'Charleen is 15, melodramatic, mega depressed, and Kurt Cobain’s biggest fan. Her best friend Isa is getting really boring, her dad is out of the picture, and her mom has hooked up with her biology teacher. Even though she has an apprenticeship preparing bodies for funerals, which is pretty cool, her musical idols are all dead. It’s about time Charleen was, too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3P3a1LYrNpzk4eRrWAj5tNb7JrY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299353'),
  ('214399079332314853', 'About Adam', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gerard Stembridge, Bruno de Keyzer', 'Gerard Stembridge', 'Kate Hudson, Charlotte Bradley, Frances O''Connor, Stuart Townsend, Alan Maher, Tommy Tiernan, Brendan Dempsey, Cathleen Bradley', 'R', 'A waitress falls for a handsome customer who seduces her, her two sisters, her brother, and her brother''s girlfriend.', 'A waitress falls for a handsome customer who seduces her, her two sisters, her brother, and her brother''s girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4EkKwF0MTcG6lfysals7Nxeq0z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18168'),
  ('767112055719468172', 'About Alex', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andre Lascaris, Jesse Zwick', 'Jesse Zwick', 'Aubrey Plaza, Jane Levy, Jason Ritter, Maggie Grace, Max Greenfield, Max Minghella, Nate Parker, Adam Saunders', 'R', 'When a group of old college friends reunite over a long weekend after one of them attempts suicide, old crushes and resentments shine light on their life decisions, and ultimately push friendships and relationships to the brink.', 'When a group of old college friends reunite over a long weekend after one of them attempts suicide, old crushes and resentments shine light on their life decisions, and ultimately push friendships and relationships to the brink.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWn9qrUP8W3u2TXfBMa6TkLkoLt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259956'),
  ('410152379673760604', 'About Cherry', 2012, 'Drama', 'Darren Genet, Stephen Elliott, Spit Rogers', 'Stephen Elliott, Lorelei Lee', 'Ashley Hinshaw, Lili Taylor, Dev Patel, Diane Farr, Jonny Weston, James Franco, Heather Graham, Maya Raines', 'R', '18-year-old Angelina shuffles between school, a dead-end job, her exploitative boyfriend, and home, where her life consists of cleaning up after her alcoholic mother and protecting her younger sister from their menacing stepfather. After arranging an escape to San Francisco with her best friend Andrew, she soon finds herself dating a coke-addicted attorney and becoming immersed in the local porn industry, mentored by lesbian director Margaret, who has more than just a professional interest in Angelina''s talents.', '18-year-old Angelina shuffles between school, a dead-end job, her exploitative boyfriend, and home, where her life consists of cleaning up after her alcoholic mother and protecting her younger sister from their menacing stepfather. After arranging an escape to San Francisco with her best friend Andrew, she soon finds herself dating a coke-addicted attorney and becoming immersed in the local porn industry, mentored by lesbian director Margaret, who has more than just a professional interest in Angelina''s talents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gl6Q7GwDnwHDNd1emmQBoyUKiwB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94901'),
  ('377228539281992733', 'About Dry Grasses', 2023, 'Drama', 'Kürşat Üresin, Cevahir Şahin, Begüm Aydın', 'Akın Aksu, Nuri Bilge Ceylan, Ebru Ceylan', 'Deniz Celiloğlu, Merve Dizdar, Musab Ekici, Ece Bağcı, Erdem Şenocak, Yüksel Aksu, Münir Can Cindoruk, Onur Berk Arslanoğlu', null, 'A young art teacher hopes to be transferred to Istanbul after completing his mandatory duty in a remote village school in Anatolia. After accusations of inappropriate contact with a student surface, his hopes of escape fade and he descends further into an existential crisis.', 'A young art teacher hopes to be transferred to Istanbul after completing his mandatory duty in a remote village school in Anatolia. After accusations of inappropriate contact with a student surface, his hopes of escape fade and he descends further into an existential crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUFpdQSFAch1fMUb9MqHoESpmLS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665733'),
  ('552006830397250626', 'About Elly', 2009, 'Drama', 'Asghar Farhadi, Hossein Jafarian', 'Asghar Farhadi', 'Golshifteh Farahani, Shahab Hosseini, Payman Maadi, Merila Zarei, Ahmad Mehranfar, Mani Haghighi, Rana Azadivar, Taraneh Alidoosti', 'NR', 'The mysterious disappearance of a kindergarten teacher during a picnic in the north of Iran is followed by a series of misadventures for her fellow travelers.', 'The mysterious disappearance of a kindergarten teacher during a picnic in the north of Iran is followed by a series of misadventures for her fellow travelers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctLrMQrg3kss2JO7OIr7RVdN5an.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37181'),
  ('606446862249898649', 'About Endlessness', 2019, 'Drama, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Roy Andersson, Gergely Pálos', 'Roy Andersson', 'Jan-Eje Ferling, Kristina Ekmark, Martin Serner, Bengt Bergius, Anja Broms, Magnus Wallgren, Lisa Blohm, Tatiana Delaunay', 'NR', 'A reflection on human life in all its beauty and cruelty, its splendor and banality, guided by a Scheherazade-esque narrator. Inconsequential moments have the same significance as historical events. Simultaneously an ode and a lament, presents a kaleidoscope of all that is eternally human, an infinite story of the vulnerability of existence.', 'A reflection on human life in all its beauty and cruelty, its splendor and banality, guided by a Scheherazade-esque narrator. Inconsequential moments have the same significance as historical events. Simultaneously an ode and a lament, presents a kaleidoscope of all that is eternally human, an infinite story of the vulnerability of existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRIBlFJiMNm7DkphQgcHgDS2Pvx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348672'),
  ('900117310289372550', 'About Fate', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Angela Peri, Maryus Vaysberg, David Hennings', 'Tiffany Paulsen, Emil Braginskiy, Eldar Ryazanov', 'Emma Roberts, Thomas Mann, Lewis Tan, Madelaine Petsch, Britt Robertson, Fikile Mthwalo, Cheryl Hines, Verity Branco', 'R', 'Two strangers believe in love but never seem to be able to find its true meaning. In a wild twist of events, fate puts each in the other''s path on one stormy New Year''s Eve.', 'Two strangers believe in love but never seem to be able to find its true meaning. In a wild twist of events, fate puts each in the other''s path on one stormy New Year''s Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fabZkaVHYJ67KbZx7oFoitauX34.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:828613'),
  ('596855475717152978', 'About Her Brother', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yoji Yamada, Masashi Chikamori', 'Emiko Hiramatsu, Yoji Yamada', 'Sayuri Yoshinaga, Yu Aoi, Tsurube Shofukutei, Ryo Kase, Nenji Kobayashi, Haruko Katō, Yuriko Ishida, Takashi Sasano', null, 'Ginko''s younger brother Tetsuro, a failed comedian, is the oddball of the family. Embarrassing, loud and plain inappropriate at times causes Ginko to disown him. The two reunite when she discovers Tetsuro is terminally ill. Tetsuro’s impending death marks the beginning of love and toleration.', 'Ginko''s younger brother Tetsuro, a failed comedian, is the oddball of the family. Embarrassing, loud and plain inappropriate at times causes Ginko to disown him. The two reunite when she discovers Tetsuro is terminally ill. Tetsuro’s impending death marks the beginning of love and toleration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36aAQvycSyQfKfqxxXA3DWDrHsJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51778'),
  ('303710789889850179', 'About Joan', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Laurent Larivière, Céline Bozon', 'Laurent Larivière, François Descodts', 'Isabelle Huppert, Freya Mavor, Lars Eidinger, Éanna Hardwicke, Florence Loiret Caille, Swann Arlaud, Leo Hanna, Christopher Livingstone', null, 'Overwhelmed when a figure from her past reemerges, Joan Verra retreats to the countryside with her son Nathan. There she experiences fragmented recollections of her past romantic encounters.', 'Overwhelmed when a figure from her past reemerges, Joan Verra retreats to the countryside with her son Nathan. There she experiences fragmented recollections of her past romantic encounters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcCy1ShjvgpwZXt3wej4uy4DLHV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820713'),
  ('764487029580078741', 'About Last Night', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Steve Pink, Michael Barrett, Mark Anthony Little', 'Leslye Headland, Tim Kazurinsky', 'Kevin Hart, Michael Ealy, Regina Hall, Joy Bryant, Christopher McDonald, Adam Rodriguez, Joe Lo Truglio, Paula Patton', 'R', 'Bernie and Joan are two fiery flirters who are passionate about everything from hookups to breakups and each other. When he sets up his best friend, Danny, with her roommate, Debbie, the sparks soon fly as they try to navigate the relationship minefields from the bar to the bedroom and are eventually put to the test in the real world.', 'Bernie and Joan are two fiery flirters who are passionate about everything from hookups to breakups and each other. When he sets up his best friend, Danny, with her roommate, Debbie, the sparks soon fly as they try to navigate the relationship minefields from the bar to the bedroom and are eventually put to the test in the real world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3dVYQtxXldDawz7d15wqt2PQLe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222899'),
  ('608518880203165630', 'About Last Night...', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Edward Zwick, Andrew Dintenfass, Allan Wertheim', 'Tim Kazurinsky, Denise DeClue', 'Rob Lowe, Demi Moore, Jim Belushi, Elizabeth Perkins, George DiCenzo, Robin Thomas, Donna Gibbons, Megan Mullally', 'R', 'A man and woman meet and try to have a romantic affair, despite their personal problems and the interference of their disapproving friends.', 'A man and woman meet and try to have a romantic affair, despite their personal problems and the interference of their disapproving friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9KqG5OFi3NLJYBbsDSA8pZ3dln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18169'),
  ('453666636352907358', 'About Love', 2005, 'Romance', 'Zhang Yibai, Ten Shimoyama, Yee Chih-yen', 'Wei Shen, Haruko Nagatsu, Yee Chih-yen', 'Chen Bolin, Misaki Itō, Mavis Fan, Ryo Kase, Li Xiaolu, Takashi Tsukamoto, Yui Ichikawa, Ren Osugi', null, 'Three stories are told, respectively set in Tokyo, Taipei, and Shanghai. The first two stories are about a Japanese person and a Taiwanese person. The last one is set in Shanghai with a story about a Japanese man and a Chinese woman. Some of the characters can speak Japanese and some of them Mandarin. Each story encompasses an experience of a foreigner, either from Japan ,Taiwan or China, with a native of the opposite country.', 'Three stories are told, respectively set in Tokyo, Taipei, and Shanghai. The first two stories are about a Japanese person and a Taiwanese person. The last one is set in Shanghai with a story about a Japanese man and a Chinese woman. Some of the characters can speak Japanese and some of them Mandarin. Each story encompasses an experience of a foreigner, either from Japan ,Taiwan or China, with a native of the opposite country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rvpkQrXju2m1yTJbLNeIueJJuwz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95164'),
  ('278634073215769536', 'About Love', 2017, 'Romance, Drama, Thriller', 'Vladimir Bortko', 'Vladimir Bortko, Valeri Mnatsakanov', 'Anna Chipovskaya, Aleksey Chadov, Dmitriy Pevtsov, Aleksandr Lykov, Mariya Mironova, Pyotr Zhuravlyov, Klavdiya Belova, Boris Birman', null, 'Beautiful Nina lives happily married, as she saw it, with intelligent Alexandr, professor of Sinology. But the debt for the mortgage begins to disturb the relationship of spouses. One day she meets Sergey, the head of the bank where her husband has debt, and so begins their passionate relationships. The story of the relationship with married Sergey hardly promises happiness, but Nina realizes that for the first time she feels true love.', 'Beautiful Nina lives happily married, as she saw it, with intelligent Alexandr, professor of Sinology. But the debt for the mortgage begins to disturb the relationship of spouses. One day she meets Sergey, the head of the bank where her husband has debt, and so begins their passionate relationships. The story of the relationship with married Sergey hardly promises happiness, but Nina realizes that for the first time she feels true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFWCzhuH399m6wF8W3P7cXeT7en.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435901'),
  ('492587783858929391', 'About Love. Adults Only', 2017, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Dmitry Gerasimuk, Tatiana Smirnova, Evgeny Goryainov', 'Natalya Merkulova, Anna Melikyan, Nigina Sayfullaeva', 'John Malkovich, Ingeborga Dapkūnaitė, Fyodor Bondarchuk, Viktoriya Isakova, Maksim Matveev, Gosha Kutsenko, Anna Mikhalkova, Fyodor Lavrov', null, 'The second part of the film “About Love”. Moscow, summer 2016. A new lecture, a new lecturer with a new theme: “How to preserve love in the modern world” – and five new stories about love. The heroes still suffer, struggle for love, even more often get into absurd and ridiculous situations, and yet they trust in love even more.', 'The second part of the film “About Love”. Moscow, summer 2016. A new lecture, a new lecturer with a new theme: “How to preserve love in the modern world” – and five new stories about love. The heroes still suffer, struggle for love, even more often get into absurd and ridiculous situations, and yet they trust in love even more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2d7s1FpGl3fRtJJxScs0w3KNK1j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457859'),
  ('250010020368143653', 'About My Father', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Laura Terruso, Rogier Stoffers, Frank Capra III', 'Sebastian Maniscalco, Austen Earl', 'Sebastian Maniscalco, Robert De Niro, Leslie Bibb, Anders Holm, David Rasche, Brett Dier, Kim Cattrall, Arielle Prepetit', 'PG-13', 'Encouraged by his girlfriend Ellie, Sebastian and his Italian immigrant father, Salvo, spend the 4th of July weekend with her wealthy and exceedingly eccentric family. The gathering soon develops into a culture clash, allowing father and son to discover the true meaning of family.', 'Encouraged by his girlfriend Ellie, Sebastian and his Italian immigrant father, Salvo, spend the 4th of July weekend with her wealthy and exceedingly eccentric family. The gathering soon develops into a culture clash, allowing father and son to discover the true meaning of family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHcXyH207gLJCMLECRlBtXDK12X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:829051'),
  ('320744652501182369', 'About Schmidt', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy', 'James Glennon, Alexander Payne', 'Alexander Payne, Jim Taylor', 'Jack Nicholson, Kathy Bates, Hope Davis, Dermot Mulroney, June Squibb, Howard Hesseman, Harry Groener, Connie Ray', 'R', 'A recently retired man embarks on a journey to his estranged daughter''s wedding, only to discover more about himself and life than he ever expected.', 'A recently retired man embarks on a journey to his estranged daughter''s wedding, only to discover more about himself and life than he ever expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tstvsrJHY57hc951lb190alXRQm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2755'),
  ('87373310696359976', 'About Sidorov Vova', 1985, 'Animation', 'Eduard Nazarov, Tatyana Lytko', 'Eduard Uspensky', 'Sergei Yursky, Eduard Nazarov', null, 'A screen adaptation of the satirical poem by Eduard Uspensky. Vova Sidorov is the only child in a big family, growing up without a father. Everything he cherished, but a summons from the recruitment office turns everything on its head!', 'A screen adaptation of the satirical poem by Eduard Uspensky. Vova Sidorov is the only child in a big family, growing up without a father. Everything he cherished, but a summons from the recruitment office turns everything on its head!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pw4UkIA9A4wCJJBo9qskHIumTXs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219995'),
  ('557041654074783003', 'About the Little Red Riding Hood', 1977, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Leonid Nechayev', 'Inna Vetkina', 'Yana Poplavskaya, Dmitriy Iosifov, Rina Zelyonaya, Vladimir Basov, Nikolay Trofimov, Galina Volchek, Rolan Bykov, Evgeniy Evstigneev', null, 'A sequel to the well-known story about a Little Red Riding Hood (Krasnaya Shapochka). This time, a family of a slain wolf decides to avenge his death. So they falsely inform Little Red Riding Hood that her grandma is sick and prepare to eat her on her way.', 'A sequel to the well-known story about a Little Red Riding Hood (Krasnaya Shapochka). This time, a family of a slain wolf decides to avenge his death. So they falsely inform Little Red Riding Hood that her grandma is sick and prepare to eat her on her way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itKqrB8RUU0UfrS4OdeYc6Bthcj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20944'),
  ('153297599117873862', 'About the Looking for and the Finding of Love', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama, Music', 'Jürgen Jürges, Helmut Dietl', 'Helmut Dietl, Patrick Süskind', 'Moritz Bleibtreu, Alexandra Maria Lara, Uwe Ochsenknecht, Anke Engelke, Heino Ferch, Justus von Dohnányi, Marily Milia, Harald Schmidt', null, 'Director helmut Dietls and Patric Susskinds illustrate a legendary story of two lovers who cant keep themselves away from death.', 'Director helmut Dietls and Patric Susskinds illustrate a legendary story of two lovers who cant keep themselves away from death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eauZ3KLBcBejZDyXge5HoWJ6zwn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419'),
  ('628010773159365065', 'About the Pink Sky', 2013, 'Drama', 'Keiichi Kobayashi', 'Keiichi Kobayashi', 'Ai Ikeda, Ena Koshino, Reiko Fujiwara, Tsubasa Takayama, Hakushu Togetsuan', 'PG-13', 'A high school girl finds a wallet full of money and tracks down its owner, leading to unexpected consequences for the girl and her friends.', 'A high school girl finds a wallet full of money and tracks down its owner, leading to unexpected consequences for the girl and her friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5V7RwMP2Et01Hh8yveeJoSNEXPl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84167'),
  ('317795493795359148', 'About Time', 2013, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Richard Curtis, John Guleserian, Antonia Atha', 'Richard Curtis', 'Domhnall Gleeson, Rachel McAdams, Bill Nighy, Tom Hollander, Margot Robbie, Lydia Wilson, Lindsay Duncan, Richard Cordery', 'R', 'The night after another unsatisfactory New Year''s party, Tim''s father tells his son that the men in his family have always had the ability to travel through time. They can''t change history, but they can change what happens and has happened in their own lives. Thus begins the start of a lesson in learning to appreciate life itself as it is, as it comes, and most importantly, the people living alongside us.', 'The night after another unsatisfactory New Year''s party, Tim''s father tells his son that the men in his family have always had the ability to travel through time. They can''t change history, but they can change what happens and has happened in their own lives. Thus begins the start of a lesson in learning to appreciate life itself as it is, as it comes, and most importantly, the people living alongside us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ls6zswrOZVhCXQBh96DlbnLBajM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122906'),
  ('494592265451650983', 'About Us', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Erica Pierre, Mauro Carvalho, Thiago Cazado', null, 'Thiago Cazado, Rodrigo Bittes, Carmem Moretzsohn, Leandro Menezes, Andressa Lee, Rodrigo Bezerra', null, 'Two young students, Matheus and Diego, experience their first love.', 'Two young students, Matheus and Diego, experience their first love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFwPzByFYOMoUdGOFK2uGI5omnM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450033'),
  ('1022876764979787969', 'About Us But Not About Us', 2026, 'Drama', 'Jun Robles Lana, Neil Daza, Lorna Sanchez', 'Jun Robles Lana', 'Romnick Sarmenta, Elijah Canlas, Olive Isidro, Arkin Del Rosario, James Andrew Razon', null, 'A literature professor meets his student at a restaurant and, over the course of one meal, secrets and lies will be unearthed and the sinister connection to a suicide will be revealed.', 'A literature professor meets his student at a restaurant and, over the course of one meal, secrets and lies will be unearthed and the sinister connection to a suicide will be revealed.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FafrQ09BPQwxmCnl1uhpkECUtTSK.jpg', 'plex:movie:about-us-but-not-about-us'),
  ('772257535399522139', 'Above and Below', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Nicolas Steiner, Markus Nestroy', null, null, null, 'Above and Below is a rough and rhythmic roller coaster ride seating five survivors in their daily hustle through an apocalyptic world. A journey of challenges and beauty in uncomfortable places: Rick &amp; Cindy, Godfather Lalo in the flood channels deep down under the shiny strip of Sin City. Dave in the dry and lonesome Californian desert and April in simulation for a Mars mission in the Utah desert. Through the hustle, the pain and the laughs, we are whisked away to an unfamiliar world, yet quickly discover the souls we encounter are perhaps not that different from our own.', 'Above and Below is a rough and rhythmic roller coaster ride seating five survivors in their daily hustle through an apocalyptic world. A journey of challenges and beauty in uncomfortable places: Rick &amp; Cindy, Godfather Lalo in the flood channels deep down under the shiny strip of Sin City. Dave in the dry and lonesome Californian desert and April in simulation for a Mars mission in the Utah desert. Through the hustle, the pain and the laughs, we are whisked away to an unfamiliar world, yet quickly discover the souls we encounter are perhaps not that different from our own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3qzAyzDxc6UGjaoEdEKqQXPMSc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316883'),
  ('431337400422113701', 'Above and Beyond', 1953, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Melvin Frank, Norman Panama, Ray June', 'Melvin Frank, Norman Panama, Beirne Lay Jr.', 'Robert Taylor, Eleanor Parker, James Whitmore, Larry Keating, Larry Gates, Marilyn Erskine, Stephen Dunne, Robert Burton', 'NR', 'The story of Colonel Paul Tibbets, the pilot that dropped the atomic bomb on Hiroshima. Although unaware of the full potential of this new weapon, he knows that it can do tremendously more damage than any other weapon used before, and that the death toll resulting from it will be huge. He is reluctant to be the person who will end so many lives, but as time goes on, the pressure upon him only increase.', 'The story of Colonel Paul Tibbets, the pilot that dropped the atomic bomb on Hiroshima. Although unaware of the full potential of this new weapon, he knows that it can do tremendously more damage than any other weapon used before, and that the death toll resulting from it will be huge. He is reluctant to be the person who will end so many lives, but as time goes on, the pressure upon him only increase.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCPfp4GCKhQtGwBtTITRIFdJcQr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80806'),
  ('735427942270425530', 'Above Majestic', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Roger R. Richards', null, 'John DeSouza, Laura Magdelene Eisenhower, Corey Goode, Michael Salla, Jordan Sather, William Tompkins, David Wilcock, David Adair', 'NR', 'A look at the origins, history and conspiracies behind the "Majestic 12", a clandestine group of military and corporate figureheads charged with reverse-engineering extraterrestrial technology.', 'A look at the origins, history and conspiracies behind the "Majestic 12", a clandestine group of military and corporate figureheads charged with reverse-engineering extraterrestrial technology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Nib1PpekYy58AqfCKbiN9JRZsE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:557646'),
