  ('177088894954801234', 'Abraham Lincoln', 1930, 'History, Drama', 'D.W. Griffith, Karl Struss', null, 'Walter Huston, Una Merkel, William L. Thorne, Lucille La Verne, Helen Freeman, Otto Hoffman, Edgar Dearing, Russell Simpson', null, 'A biopic dramatizing Abraham Lincoln''s life through a series of vignettes depicting its defining chapters: his romance with Ann Rutledge; his early years as a country lawyer; his marriage to Mary Todd; his debates with Stephen A. Douglas; the election of 1860; his presidency during the Civil War; and his assassination in Ford’s Theater in 1865.', 'A biopic dramatizing Abraham Lincoln''s life through a series of vignettes depicting its defining chapters: his romance with Ann Rutledge; his early years as a country lawyer; his marriage to Mary Todd; his debates with Stephen A. Douglas; the election of 1860; his presidency during the Civil War; and his assassination in Ford’s Theater in 1865.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BOmqevJBC5gBfQNXpa2epf27yO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130816'),
  ('333523850463784152', 'Abraham Lincoln Vampire Hunter: The Great Calamity', 2012, 'Horror, Animation, Fantasy', 'Javier Soto', 'Javier Soto', 'Benjamin Walker, Clifton Collins Jr.', 'NR', 'A motion comic follow-up to a chapter from Abraham Lincoln Vampire Hunter novel where Abe''s friend, Edgar Allan Poe, tells him the tale of historical Hungarian countess Elizabeth Bathory, often tied to vampire legends due to her brutality.', 'A motion comic follow-up to a chapter from Abraham Lincoln Vampire Hunter novel where Abe''s friend, Edgar Allan Poe, tells him the tale of historical Hungarian countess Elizabeth Bathory, often tied to vampire legends due to her brutality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kD8bohNKE1truudhmeOtOjfNeH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297610'),
  ('286839544297848309', 'Abraham Lincoln vs. Zombies', 2012, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Richard Schenkman, Tim Gill', 'Richard Schenkman', 'Bill Oberst Jr., Baby Norman, Jason Vail, Jason Hughley, Don McGraw, Chris Marrone, Anthony Paderewski', 'R', 'As Abraham Lincoln labors over the Gettysburg address, the importance of which he is fully aware, he learns that a menace from his past has returned, threatening to tear the already fractured nation to pieces. He must journey behind enemy lines to face an foe far more fearsome than the Confederate army: the walking dead.', 'As Abraham Lincoln labors over the Gettysburg address, the importance of which he is fully aware, he learns that a menace from his past has returned, threatening to tear the already fractured nation to pieces. He must journey behind enemy lines to face an foe far more fearsome than the Confederate army: the walking dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kcrZQxlzyCepVGqvWvWSm67JFhL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98948'),
  ('1099294277515796927', 'Abraham Lincoln: Vampire Hunter', 2012, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror', 'Caleb Deschanel, Timur Bekmambetov, Jim Lemley', 'Seth Grahame-Smith', 'Benjamin Walker, Dominic Cooper, Anthony Mackie, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Rufus Sewell, John Rothman, Marton Csokas, Alex Lombard', 'R', 'President Lincoln''s mother is killed by a supernatural creature, which fuels his passion to crush vampires and their slave-owning helpers.', 'President Lincoln''s mother is killed by a supernatural creature, which fuels his passion to crush vampires and their slave-owning helpers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qv8deK0ZmutAuEpejruQKApIy6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72331'),
