  ('387466300640255074', 'Abuzer Kadayıf', 2000, 'Comedy, Music, Drama', 'Tunç Başaran', 'Kandemir Konduk', 'Metin Akpınar, Talat Bulut, Sibel Turnagöl, Özlem Savaş, Şebnem Özinal, Melda Arat, Sibel Gökçe, Yeşim Alıç', null, 'After his pregnant wife killed by thinner addicts, Ersin Balkan, decides on to establish a school for children who are abandoned ad thinner addicts. Noticing that he can not afford a such thing with his salary, takes a new career and becomes a singer.', 'After his pregnant wife killed by thinner addicts, Ersin Balkan, decides on to establish a school for children who are abandoned ad thinner addicts. Noticing that he can not afford a such thing with his salary, takes a new career and becomes a singer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPgjZKeMweq2dUsPywYHvJiUfLU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141214'),
