  ('99592026846760967', 'AC/DC : Forever Young', 2023, 'Music, Documentary', 'Dominique Mesmin, Marie-Claire Javoy', null, 'Murray Engleheart, Philip Morris, Mary Renshaw, Tony Currenti, Mark Evans, Chris Slade, Mark Opitz, Michael Browning', null, 'AC/DC, or three brothers in the service of music. The story of a unique sound that spanned fifty years of rock''n''roll: sharp, electric, boosted.', 'AC/DC, or three brothers in the service of music. The story of a unique sound that spanned fifty years of rock''n''roll: sharp, electric, boosted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vl3X07VxCqF19DKvGJLM5u3C25M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1111831'),
  ('61817360549339103', 'AC/DC: No Bull', 1996, 'Music', 'David Mallet', null, 'Brian Johnson, Angus Young, Malcolm Young, Cliff Williams, Phil Rudd', 'NR', '1. Back In Black 2. Shot Down In Flames 3. Thunderstruck 4. Girl''s Got Rhythm 5. Hard As A Rock 6. Shoot To Thrill 7. Boogie Man 8. Hail Caesar 9. Hells Bells 10. Dog Eat Dog 11. The Jack 12. Ballbreaker 13. Rock And Roll Ain''t Noise Pollution 14. Dirty Deeds Done Dirt Cheap 15. You Shook Me All Night Long 16. Whole Lotta Rosie 17. T.N.T. 18. Let There Be Rock 19. Highway To Hell 20. For Those About To Rock (We Salute You) No Bull captures the over the top spectacle that was AC/DC''s 1996 Ballbreaker tour. Shot at the Plaza De Toros De Las Ventas bullfighting arena in Madrid, the film has been completely re-edited in HD and remixed in both Stereo and 5.1 Surround Sound.', '1. Back In Black 2. Shot Down In Flames 3. Thunderstruck 4. Girl''s Got Rhythm 5. Hard As A Rock 6. Shoot To Thrill 7. Boogie Man 8. Hail Caesar 9. Hells Bells 10. Dog Eat Dog 11. The Jack 12. Ballbreaker 13. Rock And Roll Ain''t Noise Pollution 14. Dirty Deeds Done Dirt Cheap 15. You Shook Me All Night Long 16. Whole Lotta Rosie 17. T.N.T. 18. Let There Be Rock 19. Highway To Hell 20. For Those About To Rock (We Salute You) No Bull captures the over the top spectacle that was AC/DC''s 1996 Ballbreaker tour. Shot at the Plaza De Toros De Las Ventas bullfighting arena in Madrid, the film has been completely re-edited in HD and remixed in both Stereo and 5.1 Surround Sound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yDKSXkq8RVm72NF1j4ApGjNP01.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24983'),
  ('672017213453072439', 'Acacia', 2003, 'Horror', 'Lee Chol-o, Hyeon-je Oh, Park Ki-hyung', 'Park Ki-hyung', 'Shim Hye-jin, Jung Hee-tae, Kim Jin-geun, Moon Woo-Bin, Jung Na-Yoon, Lee Young-hee, Kim Mi-kyeong, Park Woong', null, 'A Korean horror film about an adopted young boy with a strange link to an old, dead acacia tree. As the boy settles in to his new home, the tree comes to life. When the family who adopted him becomes pregnant, he is to go back to the orphanage, and horror ensues.', 'A Korean horror film about an adopted young boy with a strange link to an old, dead acacia tree. As the boy settles in to his new home, the tree comes to life. When the family who adopted him becomes pregnant, he is to go back to the orphanage, and horror ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SKnexycVKBKgfLFms3VUPLSLcD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37284'),
