  ('212608278888810575', 'Accel World: Infinite Burst', 2016, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Masakazu Obara, Yukiko Aikei, Tsunetaka Ema', 'Reki Kawahara, Hiroyuki Yoshino', 'Yuki Kaji, Sachika Misawa, Aki Toyosaki, Shintaro Asanuma, Chinatsu Akasaki, Takahiro Sakurai, Takaya Kuroda, Kana Ueda', null, 'In 2046, many aspects of life are carried out on a virtual network. No matter how advanced the time becomes, however, bullying never disappears. Haruyuki is one of the bullied students. However, one day he is contacted by Kuroyukihime, the most famous person in the school. "Wouldn''t you like to ''accelerate'' and go further ahead, boy?" Haruyuki is introduced to the "Accel World" and decides to fight as Kuroyukihime''s knight.', 'In 2046, many aspects of life are carried out on a virtual network. No matter how advanced the time becomes, however, bullying never disappears. Haruyuki is one of the bullied students. However, one day he is contacted by Kuroyukihime, the most famous person in the school. "Wouldn''t you like to ''accelerate'' and go further ahead, boy?" Haruyuki is introduced to the "Accel World" and decides to fight as Kuroyukihime''s knight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyya6A2M4gxFdw0bhhlOdU5kw3N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381873'),
  ('159546070354198278', 'Acceleration', 2019, 'Action, Thriller', 'Michael Merino, Daniel Zirilli, Jan-Michael Losada', 'Michael Merino', 'Sean Patrick Flanery, Dolph Lundgren, Chuck Liddell, Natalie Burn, Quinton ''Rampage'' Jackson, Danny Trejo, Al Sapienza, Olya Banar', null, 'After being double crossed by his most trusted operative, a ruthless crime lord takes revenge by kidnapping the her son. Overwhelmed with fear, the operative is given one night to make up for her misdeeds by systematically eliminating his enemies. As the hours rush by, the steaks begin to rise and the darkened city streets turn into a brutal and bloody battle ground.', 'After being double crossed by his most trusted operative, a ruthless crime lord takes revenge by kidnapping the her son. Overwhelmed with fear, the operative is given one night to make up for her misdeeds by systematically eliminating his enemies. As the hours rush by, the steaks begin to rise and the darkened city streets turn into a brutal and bloody battle ground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50F3NSV89s13oN43h1wXpCoqY5t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:646150'),
  ('13719724402102820', 'Accepted', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Steve Pink, Matthew F. Leonetti, Jody Spilkoman', 'Mark Perez, Bill Collage, Adam Cooper', 'Justin Long, Jonah Hill, Blake Lively, Adam Herschman, Columbus Short, Maria Thayer, Lewis Black, Jim O''Heir', 'PG-13', 'A high school slacker who''s rejected by every school he applies to opts to create his own institution of higher learning, the South Harmon Institute of Technology, on a rundown piece of property near his hometown.', 'A high school slacker who''s rejected by every school he applies to opts to create his own institution of higher learning, the South Harmon Institute of Technology, on a rundown piece of property near his hometown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMh1dCw5vhMATmJs0ve0OpoSVED.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9788'),
  ('1001266517128798621', 'Accident', 1928, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ernö Metzner', 'Ernö Metzner, Grace Chiang', 'Heinrich Gotho, Eva Schmid-Kayser, Sybille Schmitz, Alfred Loretto, Han Ruys, Gustav Püttjer, Hans Casparius, Kurt Gerron', null, 'A tense vignette about the fate of an unlucky man in poverty-stricken Weimar-era Germany.', 'A tense vignette about the fate of an unlucky man in poverty-stricken Weimar-era Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyJf37V9UxaNSWeS3677Bn1bLB7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144650'),
  ('967139711063359152', 'Accident', 1967, 'Romance, Drama', 'Joseph Losey, Gerry Fisher, Richard F. Dalton', 'Harold Pinter', 'Dirk Bogarde, Stanley Baker, Jacqueline Sassard, Michael York, Vivien Merchant, Delphine Seyrig, Alexander Knox, Ann Firbank', 'NR', 'Stephen is a professor at Oxford University who is caught in a rut and feels trapped by his life in both academia and marriage. One of his students, William, is engaged to the beautiful Anna, and Stephen becomes enamored of the younger woman. These three people become linked together by a horrible car crash, with flashbacks providing details into the lives of each person and their connection to the others in this brooding English drama.', 'Stephen is a professor at Oxford University who is caught in a rut and feels trapped by his life in both academia and marriage. One of his students, William, is engaged to the beautiful Anna, and Stephen becomes enamored of the younger woman. These three people become linked together by a horrible car crash, with flashbacks providing details into the lives of each person and their connection to the others in this brooding English drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gttNRLWBDJXwOdoNCKQFgxSGUh8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74544'),
  ('95240693036122885', 'Accident', 2009, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Cheang Pou-Soi, Edmond Fung Yuen-Man, Kam Ka-Wai', 'Szeto Kam-Yuen, Nicholl Tang Nik-Kei', 'Louis Koo, Richie Jen, Michelle Ye Xuan, Stanley Fung Shui-Fan, Lam Suet, Han Yuqin, Monica Mok Siu-Kei, Lai Cheung-Wing', 'R', 'A self-styled accident choreographer, the Brain is a professional hitman who kills his victims by trapping them in well crafted accidents that look like unfortunate mishaps. When the team''s next assignment goes disastrously wrong, Brain begins to suspect that someone else has planned an ‘accident’ on them.', 'A self-styled accident choreographer, the Brain is a professional hitman who kills his victims by trapping them in well crafted accidents that look like unfortunate mishaps. When the team''s next assignment goes disastrously wrong, Brain begins to suspect that someone else has planned an ‘accident’ on them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CwreRof98cUJFJhQlqc5YVdZ7C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25474'),
  ('23920530663565300', 'Accident', 2017, 'Thriller, Action', 'Dan Tondowski', 'Dan Tondowski', 'Stephanie Schildknecht, Roxane Hayward, Tyrone Keogh, Keenan Arrison, Karl Thaning, Alex Anlos, Shane John Kruger, Nathan Lynn', null, 'A group of teenagers suffer a terrible accident during a joy ride and get trapped at the bottom of a ravine.', 'A group of teenagers suffer a terrible accident during a joy ride and get trapped at the bottom of a ravine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYltPToPSvV0c3HCxje2yWVzajf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441762'),
  ('228892221026481990', 'Accident Man', 2018, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Adventure, Comedy', 'Jesse V. Johnson, Duane McClunie, James Evered', 'Scott Adkins, Stu Small', 'Scott Adkins, Ray Stevenson, Ashley Greene, Michael Jai White, Ray Park, Amy Johnston, David Paymer, Perry Benson', 'R', 'Mike Fallon, the Accident Man, is a stone cold killer. When a loved one is murdered by his own crew, Fallon is forced to avenge the one person who actually meant something to him.', 'Mike Fallon, the Accident Man, is a stone cold killer. When a loved one is murdered by his own crew, Fallon is forced to avenge the one person who actually meant something to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHFKej3Dbr8kGRSRHpkoFHq9TJQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455236'),
  ('669152492679652669', 'Accident Man: Hitman''s Holiday', 2022, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Harry Kirby, George Kirby, Richard C Bell', 'Stu Small', 'Scott Adkins, Ray Stevenson, Perry Benson, Sarah Chang, Andy Long Nguyen, Beau Fowler, George Fouracres, Peter Lee Thomas', 'R', 'The Accident Man is back, and this time he must best the top assassins in the world to protect the ungrateful son of a mafia boss, save the life of his only friend and rekindle his relationship with his maniacal father figure.', 'The Accident Man is back, and this time he must best the top assassins in the world to protect the ungrateful son of a mafia boss, save the life of his only friend and rekindle his relationship with his maniacal father figure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XF5EIDUOZv1p9orukdyERvv2Qn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:879444'),
  ('852294791767908245', 'Accidental Family', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Gérard Jugnot, Pierric Gantelmi d''Ille', 'Thibault Vanhulle, Gérard Jugnot, Romain Protat', 'Gérard Jugnot, François Deblock, Isabelle Mergault, Gaia Weiss, Bernard Le Coq, Hubert Saint-Macary, Jérémy Lopez, Marie Bunel', null, 'Loïc Le Tallec never really took care of his son. When the latter disappears in a road accident, Loïc is devastated. He has only one idea in mind: to find the one who lives now with the heart of his son. He falls on Hugo, a young man that this brand new heart makes totally unreasonable and uncontrollable. Their meeting promises to be explosive.', 'Loïc Le Tallec never really took care of his son. When the latter disappears in a road accident, Loïc is devastated. He has only one idea in mind: to find the one who lives now with the heart of his son. He falls on Hugo, a young man that this brand new heart makes totally unreasonable and uncontrollable. Their meeting promises to be explosive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DEdN8s56BzfGJPKlACOEbFRyiW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:439155'),
  ('129479882599912671', 'Accidental Love', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'David O. Russell, Max Malkin', 'Kristin Gore, Matthew Silverstein, Dave Jeser', 'Jessica Biel, Jake Gyllenhaal, James Marsden, Catherine Keener, Paul Reubens, Kirstie Alley, James Brolin, Tracy Morgan', 'PG-13', 'A small town waitress gets a nail accidentally lodged in her head causing unpredictable behavior that leads her to Washington, DC. Sparks fly when she meets a clueless young senator who takes up her cause - but what happens when love interferes with what you stand for?', 'A small town waitress gets a nail accidentally lodged in her head causing unpredictable behavior that leads her to Washington, DC. Sparks fly when she meets a clueless young senator who takes up her cause - but what happens when love interferes with what you stand for?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znPsDmQVKW0BuBnaErIAPo49X3i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316002'),
  ('513390238193046017', 'Accidentally Engaged', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Letia Clouston, Chris Furukawa-Burgon, Nick Rossano', 'Jake Helgren', 'Lexi Giovagnoli, Lexi Atkins, Randy Wayne, Maureen McCormick, Joan Severance, Brant Daugherty, Nthenya Ndunda, Matt Clouston', null, 'When unsuccessful actress Clarissa returns to her hometown for a wedding and tries to impress her old friends by claiming she''s dating big time celebrity Chas Hunter, she suddenly finds herself in a comically false engagement when her lies go public and Chas decides to join the festivities in a stunt to escape bad press.', 'When unsuccessful actress Clarissa returns to her hometown for a wedding and tries to impress her old friends by claiming she''s dating big time celebrity Chas Hunter, she suddenly finds herself in a comically false engagement when her lies go public and Chas decides to join the festivities in a stunt to escape bad press.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lArOsPsD5e0W0paC7vReirclHNw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417936'),
  ('1019110053982315405', 'Accidents Happen', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andrew Lancaster, Ben Nott', 'Brian Carbee', 'Geena Davis, Harrison Gilbertson, Harry Cook, Joel Tobeck, Sebastian Gregory, Sarah Woods, Morgan Griffin, Troy Planet', 'R', 'There are dysfunctional families... and then there are the Conways. After a family tragedy, 15-year-old Billy Conway has become the de facto glue between his bitter mom, distant brother, and stoic dad. But when Billy starts to act out, everything changes for him and his family', 'There are dysfunctional families... and then there are the Conways. After a family tragedy, 15-year-old Billy Conway has become the de facto glue between his bitter mom, distant brother, and stoic dad. But when Billy starts to act out, everything changes for him and his family', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kHwB7LX2SZRa2iFR8de36n71e1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37721'),
  ('1003183101945254301', 'Accomplice', 1946, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Walter Colmes, Jockey Arthur Feindel', 'Irving Elman', 'Richard Arlen, Veda Ann Borg, Tom Dugan, Marjorie Manners, Archie Twitchell, Lee Phelps, Earle Hodgins, Francis Ford', 'NR', 'A private detective and his assistant are hired to find a missing husband by the detective''s former girlfriend who dumped him. The case is quickly complicated by a sexy brunette, a missing bank executive, a castle in the desert, and a dead body with its "head blown off" but identified as the husband.', 'A private detective and his assistant are hired to find a missing husband by the detective''s former girlfriend who dumped him. The case is quickly complicated by a sexy brunette, a missing bank executive, a castle in the desert, and a dead body with its "head blown off" but identified as the husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAq85QcFTcHY2chrY4xtscDBblc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45685'),
  ('784464397351038816', 'Accomplice', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Jeremy Grant', 'Jeremy Grant', 'Andreu Lacondeguy, Brandon Semenuk, Cam McCaul', null, 'It’s a moment time-stamped in our brains. Maybe it was a birthday gift. Or perhaps you saved paycheck after paycheck to finally purchase one. However you met your first bicycle, it was the pedal strokes that came afterward that hooked you onto something intangible. Adventure. Connection. Freedom. From the producers of UnReal and the director of Where The Trail Ends comes Accomplice, an homage to all the crazy adventures and crazier comrades that result from our finest sidekick. On the surface, Accomplice takes you to mind blowing locations across the globe with the world’s top riders. But beyond that, Teton Gravity Research’s latest film celebrates how the bicycle is more than just a mode of transportation - it’s a vehicle for the human spirit.', 'It’s a moment time-stamped in our brains. Maybe it was a birthday gift. Or perhaps you saved paycheck after paycheck to finally purchase one. However you met your first bicycle, it was the pedal strokes that came afterward that hooked you onto something intangible. Adventure. Connection. Freedom. From the producers of UnReal and the director of Where The Trail Ends comes Accomplice, an homage to all the crazy adventures and crazier comrades that result from our finest sidekick. On the surface, Accomplice takes you to mind blowing locations across the globe with the world’s top riders. But beyond that, Teton Gravity Research’s latest film celebrates how the bicycle is more than just a mode of transportation - it’s a vehicle for the human spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1S9jXlNiamObi1esuBgImbOhsEB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:751267'),
  ('518636642503493236', 'Accomplices', 2009, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Frédéric Mermoud, Thomas Hardmeier', 'Pascal Arnold', 'Emmanuelle Devos, Nina Meurisse, Cyril Descours, Gilbert Melki, Joana Preiss, Jeremy Azencott, Jérémy Kapone, Marc Rioufol', null, 'Two police detectives investigate the murder of a high-end male prostitute, and his relationship with his girlfriend.', 'Two police detectives investigate the murder of a high-end male prostitute, and his relationship with his girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dd7uvQLxzrFet2Svj4geC3tQa6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51853'),
  ('12599075851632342', 'According to Greta', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Nancy Bardawil, Michael Lohmann', 'Michael Gilvary', 'Hilary Duff, Evan Ross, Ellen Burstyn, Michael Murphy, Tsianina Joelson, Melissa Leo, Maury Ginsberg, Oren Skoog', 'PG-13', 'Dumped on her grandparents for the summer by her indifferent mother, acerbic and self-destructive teenager Greta disrupts the elderly couple''s staid life on the Jersey Shore. Eventually, a romance helps Greta face down her demons.', 'Dumped on her grandparents for the summer by her indifferent mother, acerbic and self-destructive teenager Greta disrupts the elderly couple''s staid life on the Jersey Shore. Eventually, a romance helps Greta face down her demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDq2E0zGXc9SwMHbTFjvyWK8cJa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26035'),
  ('496480835759891315', 'Accordion Player', 1888, 'Documentary', 'Louis Aimé Augustin Le Prince', null, 'Adolphe Le Prince', null, 'The last remaining film of Le Prince''s LPCCP Type-1 MkII single-lens camera is a sequence of frames of his son, Adolphe Le Prince, playing a diatonic button accordion. It was recorded on the steps of the house of Joseph Whitley, Adolphe''s grandfather.', 'The last remaining film of Le Prince''s LPCCP Type-1 MkII single-lens camera is a sequence of frames of his son, Adolphe Le Prince, playing a diatonic button accordion. It was recorded on the steps of the house of Joseph Whitley, Adolphe''s grandfather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dqOKnbIYYLe2Xm4bYduN59HTW2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96882'),
  ('763584680561893511', 'Account Rendered', 1957, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Peter Graham Scott, Buddy Booth, Jan Saunders', 'Barbara S. Harper', 'Griffith Jones, Ursula Howells, Honor Blackman, Ewen Solon, Carl Bernard, Mary Jones, Philip Gilbert, John Van Eyssen', null, 'Police find that everyone had a motive for the murder of a wealthy woman.', 'Police find that everyone had a motive for the murder of a wealthy woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghRRw2Db2vx3WZaAIch6EFFuvkQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85595'),
  ('864703969060500773', 'Accumulator 1', 1994, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Jan Svěrák, F. A. Brabec, Miloš Kohout', 'Václav Šašek', 'Petr Forman, Edita Brychta, Zdeněk Svěrák, Marián Labuda, Bolek Polívka, Tereza Pergnerová, Jiří Kodet, Markéta Frösslová', null, 'In this movie, TV sets are full of life. If a person is in TV (e.g. because it was filmed on the street) it has a double that''s right in the TV set. This double needs energy from the true character to survive. Each time, the real human watches TV, his Double will pull life energy from him. So there''s a mysterious Death-serial. Many persons die in front of their TV set and nobody knows why. Olda, the main character, is one of the persons, that get more and more weak. He is near death, till Fisarek, the natural healer appears. He teaches Olda how he can resist this magic force and how he can fight it.', 'In this movie, TV sets are full of life. If a person is in TV (e.g. because it was filmed on the street) it has a double that''s right in the TV set. This double needs energy from the true character to survive. Each time, the real human watches TV, his Double will pull life energy from him. So there''s a mysterious Death-serial. Many persons die in front of their TV set and nobody knows why. Olda, the main character, is one of the persons, that get more and more weak. He is near death, till Fisarek, the natural healer appears. He teaches Olda how he can resist this magic force and how he can fight it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aE5BBbf8zVSG6oBEgkTyLnNjYGf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16977'),
  ('286583570308491475', 'Accused', 2005, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Jacob Thuesen, Sebastian Blenkov', 'Kim Fupz Aakeson', 'Troels Lyby, Sofie Gråbøl, Paw Henriksen, Louise Mieritz, Søren Malling, Michael Asmussen, Ditte Gråbøl, Claus Bue', null, 'On the surface Henrik and Nina Christofferson are an ordinary family living happily. But they have a problem. Their daughter, Stine, a difficult 14 year old, has a habit of telling lies in class. When Stine accuses her father of sexual abuse, and is believed by seemingly eager social workers, their family is thrust into crisis. Could Henrik have done it? And when Stine prepares to return home, the ugly side of family life is exposed.', 'On the surface Henrik and Nina Christofferson are an ordinary family living happily. But they have a problem. Their daughter, Stine, a difficult 14 year old, has a habit of telling lies in class. When Stine accuses her father of sexual abuse, and is believed by seemingly eager social workers, their family is thrust into crisis. Could Henrik have done it? And when Stine prepares to return home, the ugly side of family life is exposed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/534CWHbiW0M9obTt9rVlnOxItrS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15822'),
  ('161554447819129030', 'Accused', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Paula van der Oest, Guido van Gennep', 'Tijs van Marle, Moniek Kramer', 'Ariane Schluter, Sallie Harmsen, Fedja van Huêt, Barry Atsma, Annet Malherbe, Bas Keijzer, Marcel Musters, Isis Cabolet', null, 'An assistant prosecutor zealously pursues a conviction in the case of a pediatric nurse accused of murdering her patients, but doubt arises when her evidence shows that the infants may have died of natural causes.', 'An assistant prosecutor zealously pursues a conviction in the case of a pediatric nurse accused of murdering her patients, but doubt arises when her evidence shows that the infants may have died of natural causes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tw32mBOY7zSPgvewNNF2Wfqe622.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242065'),
  ('125084642525272848', 'Accused', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Matthew Lewis, Barnaby Boulton, Philip Barantini', 'James Cummings, Barnaby Boulton', 'Chaneil Kular, Lauryn Ajufo, Frances Tomelty, Nitin Ganatra, Robbie O''Neill, Nila Aalia, Jay Johnson, Gamin Mantis', null, 'After a revenge obsessed society incorrectly selects its next target, a young man must survive the night as the online witch-hunt arrives at his front door.', 'After a revenge obsessed society incorrectly selects its next target, a young man must survive the night as the online witch-hunt arrives at his front door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiXcYP1JwPj57JljO8mOIvFqPpx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:912974'),
  ('953484239733241280', 'Accused', 2026, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Anubhuti Kashyap, Linesh Desai, Panchami Ghavri', 'Sima Agarwal, Yash Keshwani', 'Konkona Sen Sharma, Pratibha Ranta, Aditya Nanda, Mashhoor Amrohi, Monica Mahendru, Sukant Goel, Kallirroi Tziafeta, Keshav Bhardwaj', null, 'When a celebrated queer doctor in London is accused of sexual misconduct, her life unravels. Now under a storm of suspicion and scrutiny, her marriage fractures and the truth blurs. Her wife must decide whether to walk away, or fight for the woman the world is turning against.', 'When a celebrated queer doctor in London is accused of sexual misconduct, her life unravels. Now under a storm of suspicion and scrutiny, her marriage fractures and the truth blurs. Her wife must decide whether to walk away, or fight for the woman the world is turning against.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0YNWPVJBs9wUkcB6a1kCMF4LO7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1389149'),
  ('890340056656654086', 'Accused of Murder', 1956, 'Action, Thriller', 'Joseph Kane, Bud Thackery', 'W.R. Burnett, Robert Creighton Williams', 'David Brian, Vera Ralston, Sidney Blackmer, Virginia Grey, Warren Stevens, Lee Van Cleef, Barry Kelley, Richard Karlan', 'NR', 'A police detective finds himself entangled in the web of the underworld when he falls in love with a nightclub singer accused of murdering a crooked lawyer.', 'A police detective finds himself entangled in the web of the underworld when he falls in love with a nightclub singer accused of murdering a crooked lawyer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/daj8RVW3N90dhltbM8lzPaJHGrl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37350'),
  ('166096542789515921', 'Accused: The Karen Read Story', 2026, 'Drama, Mystery, TV Movie, Crime', 'Linda-Lisa Hayter, Adam Sliwinski, Robert Crippen, Adrian Diepold, Darryl Merpaw, Rachel Klinosky, Linda Lisa Hayter', 'Gregory Small, Richard Blaney', 'Katie Cassidy, Luke Humphrey, Sebastien Roberts, Kurt Evans, Ryan Robbins', 'Not Rated', 'When police officer John O''Keefe is found dead, his girlfriend, Karen Read, is charged in connection with his death. What begins as a shocking tragedy quickly ignites a firestorm that captures national attention.', 'When police officer John O''Keefe is found dead, his girlfriend, Karen Read, is charged in connection with his death. What begins as a shocking tragedy quickly ignites a firestorm that captures national attention.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F0%2Fgracenote%2F083be8941b24b99880cf48ff7bb67c71.jpg', 'plex:movie:accused-the-karen-read-story'),
  ('276752163767888145', 'Ace', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Castellano, Pipolo, Renzo Girolami', 'Pipolo, Castellano', 'Adriano Celentano, Edwige Fenech, Renato Salvatori, Sylva Koscina, Pippo Santonastaso, John Stacy, Gianni Magni, Gerry Bruno', null, 'Asso (Ace), the best poker-player in town, was killed in his wedding night, because he won too much against a bad loser. In the "final" game in heaven the clerk on duty also lost, so Asso can come back to this world as a ghost to search for a good man for his wife (widow). Who is good enough for the wife of Asso ?', 'Asso (Ace), the best poker-player in town, was killed in his wedding night, because he won too much against a bad loser. In the "final" game in heaven the clerk on duty also lost, so Asso can come back to this world as a ghost to search for a good man for his wife (widow). Who is good enough for the wife of Asso ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vwIz284JtxsSPNRGkTKyYWe66n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37765'),
  ('824016879901106433', 'Ace Attorney', 2012, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Takashi Miike, Masakazu Oka', 'Takeharu Sakurai, Sachiko Ôguchi', 'Hiroki Narimiya, Takumi Saitoh, Mirei Kiritani, Akiyoshi Nakao, Shunsuke Daitoh, Akira Emoto, Mitsuki Tanimura, Takehiro Hira', null, 'Based primarily on the first game in the series, Phoenix Wright: Ace Attorney, the film focuses on rookie defense attorney Phoenix Wright, as he strives to protect his clients in various murder trials, including the death of his mentor, Mia Fey, and the accusation of rival prosecutor, Miles Edgeworth. Phoenix''s greatest ally is Mia''s younger sister Maya, a spirit medium whose body is possessed by Mia to communicate with him.', 'Based primarily on the first game in the series, Phoenix Wright: Ace Attorney, the film focuses on rookie defense attorney Phoenix Wright, as he strives to protect his clients in various murder trials, including the death of his mentor, Mia Fey, and the accusation of rival prosecutor, Miles Edgeworth. Phoenix''s greatest ally is Mia''s younger sister Maya, a spirit medium whose body is possessed by Mia to communicate with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2QcDHN7nScDSLsnuS3tCXOl2SN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91694'),
  ('678637751310345856', 'Ace High', 1968, 'Western, Action, Comedy', 'Giuseppe Colizzi, Marcello Masciocchi, Silvana Mangini Colizzi', 'Bino Cicogna, Giuseppe Colizzi', 'Eli Wallach, Terence Hill, Bud Spencer, Brock Peters, Kevin McCarthy, Livio Lorenzon, Steffen Zacharias, Armando Bandini', 'PG-13', 'After Cacopoulos manages to save himself from being hung on a false charge, he robs Cat Stevens and Hutch Bessy of a lot of money and steals their horses. This results in a merry chase and Stevens and Bessy become unwilling allies in Cacopoulus'' revenge against the people who deserted him and framed him to get their money back.', 'After Cacopoulos manages to save himself from being hung on a false charge, he robs Cat Stevens and Hutch Bessy of a lot of money and steals their horses. This results in a merry chase and Stevens and Bessy become unwilling allies in Cacopoulus'' revenge against the people who deserted him and framed him to get their money back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99t363dwsbQ6PXiz5lhGaKmzFCy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11874'),
  ('198241617229599836', 'Ace in the Hole', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Alex Lovy', 'Ben Hardaway, Milt Schaffer', 'Mel Blanc, Ben Hardaway', 'NR', 'Woody Woodpecker is a stable boy. The stables are located right in an airfield, and the sound of airplanes droning around only fuels his lust to fly. "I want to fly like the birds!" declares the woodpecker. But the only thing the bulldog sergeant on the airfield feels Woody is competent for is clipping the horses with an electric clipper. And considering that Woody accidentally allows the clipper to clip off the sarge''s shirt buttons and a long strip of hair off his chin, he may be giving Woody too much credit. Nevertheless, Woody spends his time reading "How to Fly a Plane from the Ground Up." And eventually, he sneaks onto a PU-2.', 'Woody Woodpecker is a stable boy. The stables are located right in an airfield, and the sound of airplanes droning around only fuels his lust to fly. "I want to fly like the birds!" declares the woodpecker. But the only thing the bulldog sergeant on the airfield feels Woody is competent for is clipping the horses with an electric clipper. And considering that Woody accidentally allows the clipper to clip off the sarge''s shirt buttons and a long strip of hair off his chin, he may be giving Woody too much credit. Nevertheless, Woody spends his time reading "How to Fly a Plane from the Ground Up." And eventually, he sneaks onto a PU-2.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96AGlqi5IUcf12fHxfVNReEVXyU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85928'),
  ('520092752947464356', 'Ace of Aces', 1982, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Xaver Schwarzenberger, Gérard Oury', 'Danièle Thompson, Gérard Oury', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Marie-France Pisier, Rachid Ferrache, Frank Hoffmann, Günter Meisner, Benno Sterzenbach, Yves Pignot, Florent Pagny', null, 'In this action comedy the French boxer Jo Cavalier is charmed on the train to Berlin for the Olympics in Hitler''s Germany by the little boy Simon Rosenblum who asks his autograph; when it turns out his adorable young fan is a Jewish orphan in danger of persecution, he risks his one shot at Olympic glory to save Simon and his family, helped only by a German officer-gentleman who became his friend in World War I, by an adventurous escape to Switzerland, Nazi troops on their heals and braving impossible odds in roller coaster-style.', 'In this action comedy the French boxer Jo Cavalier is charmed on the train to Berlin for the Olympics in Hitler''s Germany by the little boy Simon Rosenblum who asks his autograph; when it turns out his adorable young fan is a Jewish orphan in danger of persecution, he risks his one shot at Olympic glory to save Simon and his family, helped only by a German officer-gentleman who became his friend in World War I, by an adventurous escape to Switzerland, Nazi troops on their heals and braving impossible odds in roller coaster-style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9qMoIocHqEYiQY5IZdHbBOioX7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71524'),
  ('701038135449195950', 'Ace of Hearts', 2008, 'Drama, Family', 'David Mackay, Gordon Verheul', 'Frederick Ayeroff', 'Dean Cain, Britt McKillip, Anne Marie DeLuise, Burkely Duffield, Mike Dopud, Peter Kelamis, Zak Santiago, Keith Dallas', 'PG', 'Daniel Harding is a distinguished member of the K-9 police unit. His partner and best friend is Ace, a police dog. When Ace is accused of mauling a suspect, an overzealous DA convinces police authorities that Ace should be euthanized.', 'Daniel Harding is a distinguished member of the K-9 police unit. His partner and best friend is Ace, a police dog. When Ace is accused of mauling a suspect, an overzealous DA convinces police authorities that Ace should be euthanized.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/maWhGQkqwT0cuPLsCmhJpuyoGht.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17157'),
  ('935655233298443234', 'Ace Ventura Jr: Pet Detective', 2009, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure, Crime', 'Mark Irwin, David Mickey Evans', 'Justin Heimberg, Jeff Sank, David Mickey Evans', 'Josh Flitter, Emma Lockhart, Ann Cusack, Cullen Douglas, Art LaFleur, Austin Rogers, Reed Alexander, Carina Conti', 'PG', '"I will try to be normal" 12-year-old Ace Ventura Jr. promises. Thats cool, except whats normal for him is finding missing mutts, kidnapped kitties or gone gators and creating hilarious chaos every step of the way.', '"I will try to be normal" 12-year-old Ace Ventura Jr. promises. Thats cool, except whats normal for him is finding missing mutts, kidnapped kitties or gone gators and creating hilarious chaos every step of the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnLBkPxGn2w8GwHw44MDDFX4R95.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15338'),
  ('162344910633372806', 'Ace Ventura: Pet Detective', 1994, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Tom Shadyac, Julio Macat, Jeff Simon', 'Jack Bernstein, Jim Carrey, Tom Shadyac', 'Jim Carrey, Courteney Cox, Sean Young, Tone Loc, Dan Marino, Noble Willingham, Troy Evans, Raynor Scheine', 'PG-13', 'He''s Ace Ventura: Pet Detective. The Ace is on the case to find the Miami Dolphins'' missing mascot and quarterback Dan Marino. He goes eyeball to eyeball with a man-eating shark, stakes out the Miami Dolphins and woos and wows the ladies. Whether he''s undercover, under fire or underwater, he always gets his man… or beast!', 'He''s Ace Ventura: Pet Detective. The Ace is on the case to find the Miami Dolphins'' missing mascot and quarterback Dan Marino. He goes eyeball to eyeball with a man-eating shark, stakes out the Miami Dolphins and woos and wows the ladies. Whether he''s undercover, under fire or underwater, he always gets his man… or beast!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqiRuETmuSybfnVZ7qyeoXhQyN1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3049'),
  ('547222736376832865', 'Ace Ventura: When Nature Calls', 1995, 'Crime, Comedy, Adventure', 'Steve Oedekerk, Eric Oliver, Eric Oliver', 'Steve Oedekerk', 'Jim Carrey, Ian McNeice, Simon Callow, Maynard Eziashi, Bob Gunton, Sophie Okonedo, Tommy Davidson, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje', 'PG-13', 'Summoned from an ashram in Tibet, Ace finds himself on a perilous journey into the jungles of Africa to find Shikaka, the missing sacred animal of the friendly Wachati tribe. He must accomplish this before the wedding of the Wachati''s Princess to the prince of the warrior Wachootoos. If Ace fails, the result will be a vicious tribal war.', 'Summoned from an ashram in Tibet, Ace finds himself on a perilous journey into the jungles of Africa to find Shikaka, the missing sacred animal of the friendly Wachati tribe. He must accomplish this before the wedding of the Wachati''s Princess to the prince of the warrior Wachootoos. If Ace fails, the result will be a vicious tribal war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wcinCf1ov2D6M3P7BBZkzQFOiIb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9273'),
  ('963853123108352311', 'Acera, or the Witches'' Dance', 1972, 'Documentary', 'Jean Painlevé, Geneviève Hamon, Geneviève Hamon', null, null, null, 'In mud flats along the coast of Brittany we watch acera, small ball-shaped mollusks that are about two inches in diameter. They rest in mud; then, in water, they dance, their skirt-like hood spreading like a dervish''s cassock. They spin and spin. The film adds musical accompaniment. We watch them mate and secrete eggs: acera are both male and female, and can form chains with other acera in which they simultaneously mate as a male and as a female. The eggs hatch, and the cycle begins again.', 'In mud flats along the coast of Brittany we watch acera, small ball-shaped mollusks that are about two inches in diameter. They rest in mud; then, in water, they dance, their skirt-like hood spreading like a dervish''s cassock. They spin and spin. The film adds musical accompaniment. We watch them mate and secrete eggs: acera are both male and female, and can form chains with other acera in which they simultaneously mate as a male and as a female. The eggs hatch, and the cycle begins again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzQO2GUc3kQxgeqIjBOIaMCt4UZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117596'),
  ('395927842761513060', 'Aces ''N'' Eights', 2008, 'Action, Western', 'Craig R. Baxley, Yaron Levy', 'Ronald M. Cohen, Dennis Shryack', 'Casper Van Dien, Bruce Boxleitner, Jake Thomas, Ernest Borgnine, William Atherton, Jeff Kober, Jack Noseworthy, Deirdre Quinn', null, 'Already taking a gamble settling in the uncharted west, the peaceful settlers of a town destined for railroad greatness suddenly find themselves being ruthlessly gunned down. With no law and order to be found, justice falls onto the shoulders of an elderly rancher and an accomplished, but retired, gunslinger.', 'Already taking a gamble settling in the uncharted west, the peaceful settlers of a town destined for railroad greatness suddenly find themselves being ruthlessly gunned down. With no law and order to be found, justice falls onto the shoulders of an elderly rancher and an accomplished, but retired, gunslinger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmSyojTPQFhmPwkrnkgoapUe4dD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19989'),
  ('1027676670382566550', 'Aces Go Places', 1982, 'Action, Comedy', 'Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Manny Hoh Ming', 'Raymond Wong Pak-Ming', 'Sam Hui, Karl Maka, Sylvia Chang, Goo Ga-Lau, Dean Shek Tin, Chan Sing, Tsui Hark, Walter Tso Tat-Wah', null, 'The police track down a notorious burglar in order to apprehend him. However, he is given a chance to make up for his ways by working with the police on a case involving stolen diamonds.', 'The police track down a notorious burglar in order to apprehend him. However, he is given a chance to make up for his ways by working with the police on a case involving stolen diamonds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9bDXTYrRORHq1d1eqvEnP7J4hU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2644'),
  ('894516556780847384', 'Aces Go Places II', 1983, 'Action, Comedy', 'Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai, Kevan Lind, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai', 'Raymond Wong Pak-Ming, Clifton Ko Chi-Sum', 'Sam Hui, Karl Maka, Sylvia Chang, Walter Tso Tat-Wah, Yasuaki Kurata, Billy Lau Nam-Kwong, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Wong Ting-Foon', null, 'An assassin called Filthy Harry is hired by a shady figure and charged with killing the heroes. The men are framed twice for different robberies by King Kong''s new girlfriend, nearly committed to a mental hospital by their devious boss, and forced to battle Filthy Harry''s weaponry-laden robot while covered with time bombs.', 'An assassin called Filthy Harry is hired by a shady figure and charged with killing the heroes. The men are framed twice for different robberies by King Kong''s new girlfriend, nearly committed to a mental hospital by their devious boss, and forced to battle Filthy Harry''s weaponry-laden robot while covered with time bombs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7eU5TA5egzleR1Gl92dNlDrWz3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2645'),
  ('242081192478737761', 'Aces Go Places III: Our Man from Bond Street', 1984, 'Action, Comedy', 'Tsui Hark, Clifton Ko Chi-Sum, Henry Chan', 'Larry Dolgin, Raymond Wong Pak-Ming', 'Sam Hui, Karl Maka, Sylvia Chang, Cyrus Wong Ka-Ming, Richard Kiel, Ricky Hui Koon-Ying, John Shum Kin-Fun, Charlie Cho Cha-Lee', null, 'While vacationing in Paris, King Kong is kidnapped by a British agent called James, who seeks to recover one of the stolen crown jewels, the Star of Fortune, supposedly at the request of the Queen of England. The jewel is hidden at the Hong Kong Police Headquarters and Kong will have to steal the jewel without his partner-in-crime, Detective Albert ''Baldy'' Au, finding out. When James'' devious intentions are revealed and Baldy and his wife, Supt. Nancy Ho, discover Kong''s heist, Kong finds himself at a crossroad.', 'While vacationing in Paris, King Kong is kidnapped by a British agent called James, who seeks to recover one of the stolen crown jewels, the Star of Fortune, supposedly at the request of the Queen of England. The jewel is hidden at the Hong Kong Police Headquarters and Kong will have to steal the jewel without his partner-in-crime, Detective Albert ''Baldy'' Au, finding out. When James'' devious intentions are revealed and Baldy and his wife, Supt. Nancy Ho, discover Kong''s heist, Kong finds himself at a crossroad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/suYE32h1GsqmZhCPVhJuFxUgy7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2646'),
  ('127475348568902167', 'Aces Go Places IV: You Never Die Twice', 1986, 'Action, Comedy', 'Ringo Lam Ling-Tung, Sander Lee', 'Karl Maka', 'Sam Hui, Karl Maka, Sally Yeh, Sylvia Chang, Cyrus Wong Ka-Ming, Sek Kin, Kwan Tak-Hing, Walter Tso Tat-Wah', null, 'Baldy and King Kong shuttle between New Zealand and Hong Kong to recover a hi-tech prism that can impart superhuman powers.', 'Baldy and King Kong shuttle between New Zealand and Hong Kong to recover a hi-tech prism that can impart superhuman powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/caht5fSo6rQ4LtwXW79SE0Q2D23.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2647'),
  ('1024321875144644040', 'Aces Go Places V: The Terracotta Hit', 1989, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Paul Chan, Chu Yat-Hung', 'Tsang Kwok-Chi', 'Sam Hui, Leslie Cheung, Karl Maka, Nina Li Chi, Conan Lee, Melvin Wong, Ellen Chan Nga-Lun, Danny Lee Sau-Yin', null, 'Two friends who own an investment firm turn to a policeman friend for help when they are framed for robbery by a gang of antiquities smugglers.', 'Two friends who own an investment firm turn to a policeman friend for help when they are framed for robbery by a gang of antiquities smugglers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twJLlhy1NBXKLIe5vD05pTpIhXN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2648'),
  ('743042539090421081', 'Aces High', 1976, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Jack Gold, Gerry Fisher, Maurice Cain', 'Howard Barker', 'Malcolm McDowell, Christopher Plummer, Simon Ward, Peter Firth, David Wood, John Gielgud, Trevor Howard, Richard Johnson', 'PG', 'The first World War is in its third year and aerial combat above the Western Front is consuming the nation''s favored children at an appalling rate. By early 1917, the average life-span of a British pilot is less than a fortnight. Such losses place a fearsome strain on Gresham, commanding officer of the squadron. Aces High recreates the early days of the Royal Flying Corps with some magnificently staged aerial battles, and sensitive direction presents a moving portrayal of the futilities of war.', 'The first World War is in its third year and aerial combat above the Western Front is consuming the nation''s favored children at an appalling rate. By early 1917, the average life-span of a British pilot is less than a fortnight. Such losses place a fearsome strain on Gresham, commanding officer of the squadron. Aces High recreates the early days of the Royal Flying Corps with some magnificently staged aerial battles, and sensitive direction presents a moving portrayal of the futilities of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zsRNFxi4efOdIb36chcPOJf2nRt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44630'),
  ('498311945045272496', 'Ach Egon!', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Wolfgang Schleif, Erich Claunigk, Alexander von Richthofen', 'Gustav Kampendonk', 'Heinz Erhardt, Corny Collins, Adrian Hoven, Grethe Weiser, Gunther Philipp, Ruth Stephan, Hans Richter, Rudolf Vogel', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3m05t1a4Q5vRyfNU4RkakGAeH5M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72027'),
  ('884114877676892906', 'Ach, diese Lücke, diese entsetzliche Lücke', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Simon Verhoeven, Jo Heim, Ulrike Schürhoff', 'Simon Verhoeven, Lars Hubrich', 'Bruno Alexander, Senta Berger, Michael Wittenborn, Laura Tonke, Devid Striesow, Katharina Stark, Anne Ratte-Polle, Moritz von Treuenfels', null, 'Twenty-year-old Joachim is unexpectedly accepted at drama school in Munich and moves into his grandparents'' upper-class villa. From then on, he tries to find his identity as a young man between the world of theater and the everyday life of his eccentric grandparents.', 'Twenty-year-old Joachim is unexpectedly accepted at drama school in Munich and moves into his grandparents'' upper-class villa. From then on, he tries to find his identity as a young man between the world of theater and the everyday life of his eccentric grandparents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CDkf8uzyayTXnDndVO4lUvJy6O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1356484'),
  ('348953974534291059', 'Acharya', 2022, 'Action, Drama', 'Chalasani Ramarao, Koratala Siva, S. Thirunavukkarasu', 'Koratala Siva', 'Chiranjeevi, Ram Charan, Sonu Sood, Jisshu Sengupta, Ajay, Nassar, Pooja Hegde, Tanikella Bharani', null, 'Acharya, a middle-aged Naxalite-turned-social reformer, launches a fight against the Endowments Department over misappropriation and embezzlement of temple funds and donations.', 'Acharya, a middle-aged Naxalite-turned-social reformer, launches a fight against the Endowments Department over misappropriation and embezzlement of temple funds and donations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVgTZdg25d8RN2hIHbqSTijdeX1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:679919'),
  ('746671982915912457', 'Achille Tarallo', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Emanuele Donadio, Antonio Capuano, Gianluca Laudadio', 'Antonio Capuano', 'Biagio Izzo, Tony Tammaro, Ascanio Celestini, Monica Assante di Tatisso, Graziella Marina, Olga Gleb, Gianluca Imperatore, Francesca Tolonella', null, 'Achille Tarallo is an absent father and an unhappy husband. He drives buses in Naples for a living but his dream is to be a great crooner. In the meantime he sings at wedding parties with his best friend Café, waiting for their band manager Pennabic to make them famous. One day, Achille falls in love with the new caregiver of his mother, a kind woman from Eastern Europe very different from his nagging wife Elide.', 'Achille Tarallo is an absent father and an unhappy husband. He drives buses in Naples for a living but his dream is to be a great crooner. In the meantime he sings at wedding parties with his best friend Café, waiting for their band manager Pennabic to make them famous. One day, Achille falls in love with the new caregiver of his mother, a kind woman from Eastern Europe very different from his nagging wife Elide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3ipG326eSOI2LZY6YkZE1aFykt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550522'),
  ('661864068774563430', 'Achilles', 1995, 'Animation, War, Fantasy, Drama, Romance', 'Barry JC Purves', 'Barry JC Purves', 'Simon Green, David Holt, Derek Jacobi, Tim Morgan', null, 'With the loss of Patroclus (his undeclared male lover), Greek warrior Achilles returns to the Trojan War.', 'With the loss of Patroclus (his undeclared male lover), Greek warrior Achilles returns to the Trojan War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3MqZU3Lnog0ahFYNluK3iPe1E3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44318'),
  ('769598577838777370', 'Achilles and the Tortoise', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Takeshi Kitano, Katsumi Yanagijima', 'Takeshi Kitano', 'Takeshi Kitano, Kanako Higuchi, Yûrei Yanagi, Kumiko Aso, Akira Nakao, Mariko Tsutsui, Masatô Ibu, Nao Omori', null, 'Machisu is a painter. He never had the success he thinks he is entitled to. Regardless of this, he always remains trying to be successful. His wife Sachiko keeps supporting him, despite all setbacks.', 'Machisu is a painter. He never had the success he thinks he is entitled to. Regardless of this, he always remains trying to be successful. His wife Sachiko keeps supporting him, despite all setbacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5PEfwcJf2JlbbXqfqOWSGHwdsVL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12166'),
  ('618120252510356168', 'Achoura', 2020, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Talal Selhami, Mathieu de Montgrand', 'Jawad Lahlou, David Villemin, Talal Selhami', 'Sofiia Manousha, Younes Bouab, Omar Lotfi, Iván González, Moussa Maaskri, Mohamed Choubi, Jade Beloued, Abdellah El Yousfi', null, 'Four childhood friends are reunited when one of them surfaces after twenty years, forcing them to confront a creature straight out of a spine-chilling Moroccan legend.', 'Four childhood friends are reunited when one of them surfaces after twenty years, forcing them to confront a creature straight out of a spine-chilling Moroccan legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnT4z7Hfqv4gL6ORpTBKD5ish7A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560842'),
  ('787795541279425692', 'Achtung! The Desert Tigers', 1977, 'Drama, Thriller, War', 'Luigi Batzella, Ugo Brunelli', 'Luigi Batzella', 'Richard Harrison, Lea Lander, Isarco Ravaioli, Agnes Kalpagos, Gino Turini, Zaira Zoccheddu, Mauro Mannatrizio, Italo Gasperini', null, 'During World War II, an American major is captured by the Germans and thrown into a POW camp run by a sadistic Nazi officer, whose main pleasures are whipping the local female population and torturing prisoners. The major organizes an escape attempt using the camp''s nubile female doctor as a hostage.', 'During World War II, an American major is captured by the Germans and thrown into a POW camp run by a sadistic Nazi officer, whose main pleasures are whipping the local female population and torturing prisoners. The major organizes an escape attempt using the camp''s nubile female doctor as a hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giZSHFO5FY6MGKLl9c12CB8i66J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139971'),
  ('723379681165026815', 'Acid', 2018, 'Drama', 'Just Philippot, Anaïs Garnier, Nathalie Hinstin', 'Just Philippot', 'Maud Wyler, Sofian Khammes, Antonin Chaussoy, Clément Bertani, Hélène Stadnicki', null, 'A disturbing cloud has appeared from the west. It moves slowly towards the centre of the country, prompting the population to take to the roads. As it advances relentlessly, panic increases. It is a cloud of acid.', 'A disturbing cloud has appeared from the west. It moves slowly towards the centre of the country, prompting the population to take to the roads. As it advances relentlessly, panic increases. It is a cloud of acid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNBn4uFQxA9pdUAhKfPpdcRprD6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518470'),
  ('555131814255358766', 'Acid', 2023, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Romain Cros, Just Philippot', 'Just Philippot, Yacine Badday', 'Guillaume Canet, Laetitia Dosch, Patience Munchenbach, Felicia Talluto, Marie Jung, Suliane Brahim, Martin Verset, Martial Rollin', null, 'During a heat wave, strange clouds start pouring down acid rain, wreaking devastation and panic throughout France. In a world teetering on the edge, a girl and her divorced parents must join forces to confront and try to escape this climate catastrophe.', 'During a heat wave, strange clouds start pouring down acid rain, wreaking devastation and panic throughout France. In a world teetering on the edge, a girl and her divorced parents must join forces to confront and try to escape this climate catastrophe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JrZMrk3ZlQFURI7nmKGMxnTUCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852445'),
  ('979238573384152551', 'Acid Factory', 2009, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Suparn Verma, Sahil Kapoor', 'Sanjay Gupta, Suparn Verma', 'Fardeen Khan, Manoj Bajpayee, Aftab Shivdasani, Irrfan Khan, Dino Morea, Danny Denzongpa, Gulshan Grover, Dia Mirza', null, 'Five people trapped in a factory where two hostages and three are kidnappers but they them self do not know who are kidnappers and hostages.As they all are suffering from temporary memory loss.', 'Five people trapped in a factory where two hostages and three are kidnappers but they them self do not know who are kidnappers and hostages.As they all are suffering from temporary memory loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Kv50pfZ718rPnJJT4cSsqfRONw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23702'),
  ('751161861004713528', 'Acla''s Descent into Floristella', 1992, 'Drama', 'Aurelio Grimaldi', 'Aurelio Grimaldi', 'Francesco Cusimano, Tony Sperandeo, Luigi Maria Burruano, Lucia Sardo, Giovanni Alamia, Giuseppe Calcagno, Benedetto Raneli, Giuseppe Cusimano', null, 'Set in Sicily in the 1930''s, Aurelio Grimaldi''s feature debut chronicles the harsh story of twelve-year-old boy, Aclà, sold into slavery by his destitute parents to work in the underground Floristella sulfur mines. Overworked and underfed, Aclà toils from Monday to Saturday in the steamy, candle-lit labyrinths. Repeatedly beaten and abused by his "owner" and with constant threats of being raped, Aclà plots his escape to the sea...', 'Set in Sicily in the 1930''s, Aurelio Grimaldi''s feature debut chronicles the harsh story of twelve-year-old boy, Aclà, sold into slavery by his destitute parents to work in the underground Floristella sulfur mines. Overworked and underfed, Aclà toils from Monday to Saturday in the steamy, candle-lit labyrinths. Repeatedly beaten and abused by his "owner" and with constant threats of being raped, Aclà plots his escape to the sea...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14ghZtQCuZJ11u8c4O3B0AcznlG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108705'),
  ('233890458036524635', 'Acne', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Federico Veiroj', 'Federico Veiroj', 'Alejandro Tocar, Ana Julia Catalá, Gustavo Melnik, David Blankleider, Laura Piperno, Belén Pouchan, Igal Label, Yoel Bercovici', null, 'At the age of 13, Rafael Bregman has already lost his virginity, but has never kissed a girl. With his pimple-riddled face, his dysfunctional family, and a lowered self-esteem, getting this much anticipated first kiss proves trickier than expected. It''s now time for Rafa to build up some self confidence and attract the attention of his class mate, Nicole...', 'At the age of 13, Rafael Bregman has already lost his virginity, but has never kissed a girl. With his pimple-riddled face, his dysfunctional family, and a lowered self-esteem, getting this much anticipated first kiss proves trickier than expected. It''s now time for Rafa to build up some self confidence and attract the attention of his class mate, Nicole...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86dq07rCG4iAZuYRDb5MAm0GbDB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71917'),
  ('341651501389634213', 'Acolytes', 2009, 'Crime, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jon Hewitt, Sophie Stawaruk, Tony O''Loughlan', 'Jon Hewitt', 'Joel Edgerton, Michael Dorman, Sebastian Gregory, Hanna Mangan Lawrence, Joshua Payne, Belinda McClory, Holly Baldwin, Anthony Phelan', null, 'Three teens blackmail a serial killer into helping them get rid of a violent bully.', 'Three teens blackmail a serial killer into helping them get rid of a violent bully.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7N6F986uq85UC1MROaWaZ2gQZ2O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18557'),
  ('884166937125580550', 'Acompáñame', 1966, 'Comedy, Music', 'Luis César Amadori, Alejandro Ulloa, José Puyol', 'Luis César Amadori, Jesús María de Arozamena', 'Rocío Dúrcal, Enrique Guzmán, Amalia de Isaura, Jesús Tordesillas, Paquito Cano, Carlos Casaravilla, Rafael Guerrero, Laly Soldevila', null, 'Eduvigis is an Eldery Lady who lives in Madrid, and visits bad luck on everyone that she looks at through glasses that her late husband gave her, which were made from crystals from an Egyptian Tomb. To arrange the sale of an inherited house, she must travel to the Canary Islands, and so puts an advert in a newspaper asking for a maid to accompany her, and a chauffeur to drive her car. Mercedes, a girl who works in a Museum in Madrid, and Tony, a student whose college has just started Summer vacation, answer the advert. Neither of them gets along with the other at all, but both are hired to make the trip with Eduvigis. Arriving in Tenerife, Mercedes and Tony discover that the house is worth much more than it appears, and much more than what is being offered.', 'Eduvigis is an Eldery Lady who lives in Madrid, and visits bad luck on everyone that she looks at through glasses that her late husband gave her, which were made from crystals from an Egyptian Tomb. To arrange the sale of an inherited house, she must travel to the Canary Islands, and so puts an advert in a newspaper asking for a maid to accompany her, and a chauffeur to drive her car. Mercedes, a girl who works in a Museum in Madrid, and Tony, a student whose college has just started Summer vacation, answer the advert. Neither of them gets along with the other at all, but both are hired to make the trip with Eduvigis. Arriving in Tenerife, Mercedes and Tony discover that the house is worth much more than it appears, and much more than what is being offered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFfqQccqrHcBXICyhV8U5idZrPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215902'),
  ('43998143762629595', 'Acquária', 2003, 'Science Fiction, Family, Action, Adventure', 'Flávia Moraes, Max Pierre, Lauro Escorel', 'Claudio Galperin, Flávia Moraes', 'Sandy, Junior Lima, Emílio Orciollo Netto, Igor Rudolf, Júlia Lemmertz, Alexandre Borges, Milton Gonçalves, Daniel Ribeiro', null, 'The planet Earth is devastated by the lack of water. Desert and arid, left this place few living beings , who had to adapt to the new bioma.2 Isolated in small communities , living separated...', 'The planet Earth is devastated by the lack of water. Desert and arid, left this place few living beings , who had to adapt to the new bioma.2 Isolated in small communities , living separated...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xbuGM8P1Qsz0AtSoz6GJjcfWrTT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36122'),
  ('95059172876898804', 'Acrimony', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Richard J. Vialet, Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry', 'Taraji P. Henson, Lyriq Bent, Crystle Stewart, Danielle Nicolet, Ptosha Storey, Jazmyn Simon, Kendrick Cross, Nelson Estevez', 'R', 'Faithful wife Melinda, who is tired of standing by her devious husband Robert, is enraged when it becomes clear she has been betrayed. That''s when she lost it, and now she cannot let it go.', 'Faithful wife Melinda, who is tired of standing by her devious husband Robert, is enraged when it becomes clear she has been betrayed. That''s when she lost it, and now she cannot let it go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/raz4UTUI5FPkem2j57EXOL75o6I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464502'),
