  ('46658682994692102', 'Across 110th Street', 1972, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Barry Shear, Jack Priestley', 'Luther Davis', 'Anthony Quinn, Yaphet Kotto, Anthony Franciosa, Paul Benjamin, Richard Ward, Antonio Fargas, Gilbert Lewis, Norma Donaldson', 'R', 'In a daring robbery, some $300,000 is taken from the Italian mob. Several mafiosi are killed, as are two policemen. Lt. Pope and Capt. Mattelli are two New York City cops trying to break the case. Three small-time criminals are on the run with the money. Will the mafia catch them first, or will the police?', 'In a daring robbery, some $300,000 is taken from the Italian mob. Several mafiosi are killed, as are two policemen. Lt. Pope and Capt. Mattelli are two New York City cops trying to break the case. Three small-time criminals are on the run with the money. Will the mafia catch them first, or will the police?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2RFefK8DS8eUEuYyiN3tLAyM5IX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23847'),
  ('762767773125080335', 'Across the Bridge', 1957, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Ken Annakin, Reginald H. Wyer, Roger Good', 'Denis Freeman, Guy Elmes', 'Rod Steiger, David Knight, Marla Landi, Noel Willman, Bernard Lee, Eric Pohlmann, Alan Gifford, Ingeborg von Kusserow', 'NR', 'In Mexico, a financier on the run poses as a man he just murdered, only to find out that the man was also a murderer.', 'In Mexico, a financier on the run poses as a man he just murdered, only to find out that the man was also a murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9W3QNZb5Ia3a4LoMUMKfQzUluG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73027'),
