  ('292285806926305646', 'Across the Great Divide', 1976, 'Action, Drama, Family', 'Stewart Raffill, Gérard Alcan', 'Stewart Raffill', 'Robert Logan, Heather Rattray, Mark Edward Hall, George Buck Flower, Hal Bokar, Frank Salsedo, Loren Ewing, Fernando Celis', 'G', 'Two orphans set out to claim their inheritance - a 400 acre plot of land in Salem Oregon. To Do so they must cross the rugged snow covered Rocky Mountains in the year 1876.', 'Two orphans set out to claim their inheritance - a 400 acre plot of land in Salem Oregon. To Do so they must cross the rugged snow covered Rocky Mountains in the year 1876.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/meGHVaLLtGRy1WFrlu0XpufwI9u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28989'),
  ('752844210367147520', 'Across the Hall', 2009, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Alex Merkin', 'Alex Merkin', 'Mike Vogel, Brittany Murphy, Danny Pino, Brad Greenquist, Arie Verveen, Natalie Smyka, Guillermo Díaz, Dov Davidoff', 'R', 'Convinced that his fiancee is cheating on him, a man follows her to a hotel and calls his best friend to help him avoid a calamity.', 'Convinced that his fiancee is cheating on him, a man follows her to a hotel and calls his best friend to help him avoid a calamity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eH92tHb7A3jrPw0OBgwZeBWKlk1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21469'),
  ('879239077538667498', 'Across the Moon', 1994, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Lisa Gottlieb, Andrzej Sekula, Jeffrey Wetzel', 'Stephen Schneck', 'Christina Applegate, Elizabeth Peña, Michael Mundra, Tony Fields, Peter Berg, Robert Fieldsteel, Jack Nance, Henry Harris', null, 'Two young women bond while living together out in the California desert to be close to their boyfriends who are serving time at the nearby state prison.', 'Two young women bond while living together out in the California desert to be close to their boyfriends who are serving time at the nearby state prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwt29e3e03uztjQECBbg6MDtJgH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214922'),
  ('10259133128628129', 'Across the Pacific', 1942, 'Adventure, Thriller, Drama', 'John Huston, Arthur Edeson', 'Richard Macaulay', 'Humphrey Bogart, Mary Astor, Sydney Greenstreet, Charles Halton, Victor Sen Yung, Roland Got, Lee Tung Foo, Frank Wilcox', 'NR', 'Rick Leland makes no secret of the fact he has no loyalty to his home country after he is court-martialed out of the army and boards a Japanese ship for the Orient in late 1941. But has Leland really been booted out, or is there some other motive for his getting close to fellow passenger Doctor Lorenz? Any motive for getting close to attractive traveler Alberta Marlow would however seem pretty obvious.', 'Rick Leland makes no secret of the fact he has no loyalty to his home country after he is court-martialed out of the army and boards a Japanese ship for the Orient in late 1941. But has Leland really been booted out, or is there some other motive for his getting close to fellow passenger Doctor Lorenz? Any motive for getting close to attractive traveler Alberta Marlow would however seem pretty obvious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Amfvgyd7BpnRVgpMXBrHGNJWvWR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18790'),
  ('752285701272903362', 'Across the River', 2013, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Lorenzo Bianchini, Giuliano Giacomelli', 'Lorenzo Bianchini, Michela Bianchini', 'Renzo Gariup, Marco Marchese, Lidia Zabrieszach', null, 'After a wildlife biologist (Marco Marchese) becomes trapped on the wrong side of the river while collecting data, he comes across an abandoned village. Taking shelter, he begins to suspect he may be sharing the grounds with more than just boar and deer.', 'After a wildlife biologist (Marco Marchese) becomes trapped on the wrong side of the river while collecting data, he comes across an abandoned village. Taking shelter, he begins to suspect he may be sharing the grounds with more than just boar and deer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPF4vXawuzGxhK41QuKNhgj0e08.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210079'),
  ('348327194432456231', 'Across the River and into the Trees', 2023, 'Drama', 'Tiziana Kinkela, Luca Lachin, Bruce Moriarty', 'Peter Flannery', 'Liev Schreiber, Matilda De Angelis, Josh Hutcherson, Laura Morante, Danny Huston, Giulio Berruti, Enzo Cilenti, Sabrina Impacciatore', 'NR', 'In post WW2 Venice Italy, American Army Col. Richard Cantwell, haunted by the war, faces news of his illness with stoic disregard. Determined to spend a weekend in quiet solitude, he commandeers a military driver to visit his old haunts in Venice. As Cantwell''s plans begin to unravel, a chance encounter with a remarkable young woman begins to rekindle hope. Based on the harrowing novel by Ernest Hemingway.', 'In post WW2 Venice Italy, American Army Col. Richard Cantwell, haunted by the war, faces news of his illness with stoic disregard. Determined to spend a weekend in quiet solitude, he commandeers a military driver to visit his old haunts in Venice. As Cantwell''s plans begin to unravel, a chance encounter with a remarkable young woman begins to rekindle hope. Based on the harrowing novel by Ernest Hemingway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ya9Xbrh8rN8EDeFBiI1tEjGY05o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763147'),
  ('1058782860100287340', 'Across the Road', 2000, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Mathias Ledoux', 'Valérie Guignabodet', 'Jean-Hugues Anglade, Clotilde Courau, Christine Boisson, José Garcia, Danièle Lebrun, Jean Benguigui, Emmanuel Salinger, Laurence Février', null, 'Author Jean Dorset has suffered from a bad case of writer''s block since his first novel became a bestseller. He lives in a small apartment in Paris with his wife Michelle and, in spite of their ostensible success, the couple are having trouble making ends meet. One day they receive the utterly unexpected news that they are the sole inheritors of a wealthy neighbor, M. Guillemet, whom they have never met. Guillemet has left them his old townhouse along with all of his belongings, but with two conditions -- the first is that the dead man''s papers be left untouched, and the second is that his live-in maid Clemence Richbourg remain employed at the estate. The Dorsets soon learn why they were the recipients of such strange generosity. Guillemet had set up a camera with a massive zoom lens pointing to their bedroom window. The couple is shocked and disgusted, but not enough to give up their new tony digs.', 'Author Jean Dorset has suffered from a bad case of writer''s block since his first novel became a bestseller. He lives in a small apartment in Paris with his wife Michelle and, in spite of their ostensible success, the couple are having trouble making ends meet. One day they receive the utterly unexpected news that they are the sole inheritors of a wealthy neighbor, M. Guillemet, whom they have never met. Guillemet has left them his old townhouse along with all of his belongings, but with two conditions -- the first is that the dead man''s papers be left untouched, and the second is that his live-in maid Clemence Richbourg remain employed at the estate. The Dorsets soon learn why they were the recipients of such strange generosity. Guillemet had set up a camera with a massive zoom lens pointing to their bedroom window. The couple is shocked and disgusted, but not enough to give up their new tony digs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppOiQEJ6j3mqG1FGCTpiftCzw3U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78559'),
  ('649052377251284468', 'Across the Sea', 2014, 'Drama', 'Esra Saydam, Nisan Dağ, John Wakayama Carey', 'Nisan Dağ, Esra Saydam', 'Damla Sönmez, Ahmet Rıfat Şungar, Jacob Fishel, Elif Ürse, Hakan Karsak, Sanem Öge, Ozum Ersoy, Ayça Yağcıoğlu', null, 'Damla reluctantly returns to her Turkish summer town with her American husband. Her bitter past is soon to be unveiled.', 'Damla reluctantly returns to her Turkish summer town with her American husband. Her bitter past is soon to be unveiled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdrvenm5FO1434k8tVXWMKOgwk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321486'),
  ('118630103877581715', 'Across the Tracks', 1991, 'Drama', 'Sandy Tung, Michael Delahoussaye', 'Sandy Tung', 'Rick Schroder, Brad Pitt, Carrie Snodgress, David Anthony Marshall, Thomas Mikal Ford, John Linton, Cyril O''Reilly, Jack McGee', 'R', 'When Billy returns from reform school he has to attend a different high school at the other side of town. He tries to start with a clean slate but his old rival doesn''t make it easy on him and his buddy Louie tries to make him go astray again. His brother Joe, quite the opposite of Billy, is a good runner and determined to win a track scholarship. He suggests Billy to join his school''s track team, which pits the two brothers against each other.', 'When Billy returns from reform school he has to attend a different high school at the other side of town. He tries to start with a clean slate but his old rival doesn''t make it easy on him and his buddy Louie tries to make him go astray again. His brother Joe, quite the opposite of Billy, is a good runner and determined to win a track scholarship. He suggests Billy to join his school''s track team, which pits the two brothers against each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRZLxXKpbNrTnDyLKRGd2gA8Qwo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48448'),
  ('893161762123505694', 'Across the Universe', 2007, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy', 'Julie Taymor, Bruno Delbonnel, Danielle Rigby', 'Dick Clement, Ian La Frenais', 'Evan Rachel Wood, Jim Sturgess, Joe Anderson, Dana Fuchs, Martin Luther, T.V. Carpio, Spencer Liff, Lisa Dwyer Hogg', 'PG-13', 'When young dockworker Jude leaves Liverpool to find his estranged father in the United States, he is swept up by the waves of change that are re-shaping the nation. Jude falls in love with Lucy, who joins the growing anti-war movement. As the body count in Vietnam rises, political tensions at home spiral out of control and the star-crossed lovers find themselves in a psychedelic world gone mad.', 'When young dockworker Jude leaves Liverpool to find his estranged father in the United States, he is swept up by the waves of change that are re-shaping the nation. Jude falls in love with Lucy, who joins the growing anti-war movement. As the body count in Vietnam rises, political tensions at home spiral out of control and the star-crossed lovers find themselves in a psychedelic world gone mad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/447c8Te3DXC46rQvDEixKGO4dS6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4688'),
  ('987046428435696314', 'Across the Wide Missouri', 1951, 'Adventure, Romance, Western', 'William A. Wellman, William C. Mellor', 'Talbot Jennings', 'Clark Gable, Ricardo Montalban, John Hodiak, Adolphe Menjou, J. Carrol Naish, Jack Holt, Alan Napier, George Chandler', 'NR', 'In the 1830''s beaver trapper Flint Mitchell and other white men hunt and trap in the then unnamed territories of Montana and Idaho. Flint marries a Blackfoot woman as a way to gain entrance into her people''s rich lands, but finds she means more to him than a ticket to good beaver habitat.', 'In the 1830''s beaver trapper Flint Mitchell and other white men hunt and trap in the then unnamed territories of Montana and Idaho. Flint marries a Blackfoot woman as a way to gain entrance into her people''s rich lands, but finds she means more to him than a ticket to good beaver habitat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5CaJjN9FKSujvnTzbyhDF6ZJVjp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34269'),
  ('467262000396214398', 'Across to Singapore', 1928, 'Adventure, Drama', 'William Nigh, John F. Seitz', 'Richard Schayer', 'Ramon Novarro, Joan Crawford, Ernest Torrence, Frank Currier, Dan Wolheim, Duke Martin, Edward Connelly, James Pier Mason', null, 'While Joel and his older ship''s captain brother Mark are at sea, the latter is abandoned in Singapore by devious ship''s mate Finch who, upon their return, convinces the townspeople that Joel abandoned his brother. Joel, determined to not only find Mark but to see justice done, returns the ship to Singapore.', 'While Joel and his older ship''s captain brother Mark are at sea, the latter is abandoned in Singapore by devious ship''s mate Finch who, upon their return, convinces the townspeople that Joel abandoned his brother. Joel, determined to not only find Mark but to see justice done, returns the ship to Singapore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paVqiDnjXYI2QUM2lxbQtLpLf4T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142159'),
