  ('448277047734476823', 'Act of Vengeance', 1974, 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Bob Kelljan, Brick Marquard', 'H.R. Christian, David Kidd', 'Jo Ann Harris, Peter Brown, Jennifer Lee Pryor, Lisa Moore, Connie Strickland, Patricia Estrin, Lada Edmund Jr., Tony Young', 'R', 'A woman is sexually assaulted by a serial rapist wearing a hockey mask. She and other victims form a squad that targets would-be rapists, all the while searching for the mask wearing maniac that raped them all.', 'A woman is sexually assaulted by a serial rapist wearing a hockey mask. She and other victims form a squad that targets would-be rapists, all the while searching for the mask wearing maniac that raped them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4d2VnVngzzkSdO0ID1irc4tUjLt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66765'),
