  ('92091551491249868', 'Act of Violence', 1949, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Fred Zinnemann, Robert Surtees, Andrew Marton', 'Robert L. Richards', 'Van Heflin, Robert Ryan, Janet Leigh, Mary Astor, Phyllis Thaxter, Berry Kroeger, Taylor Holmes, Harry Antrim', 'NR', 'A former prisoner of war, Frank Enley is hailed as a hero in his California town. However, Frank has a shameful secret that comes back to haunt him when fellow survivor Joe Parkson emerges, intent on making Frank pay for his past deeds.', 'A former prisoner of war, Frank Enley is hailed as a hero in his California town. However, Frank has a shameful secret that comes back to haunt him when fellow survivor Joe Parkson emerges, intent on making Frank pay for his past deeds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzJ2CTNDtNfm4sP1JFrcFT7KrmU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32850'),
