  ('611488355488550775', 'Acting Out of Love', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Ken Lin', 'Ken Lin', 'Ken Lin, Teresa Daley, Ella Chen Chia-hwa, Lung Shin, Jay Chou, Kai Fung Rieck, Angel Ho, Alien Huang', null, 'This romantic comedy is about a loser practicing how to “LOVE”.', 'This romantic comedy is about a loser practicing how to “LOVE”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkOLnB6CYu8YplIQZW3A43lDmxT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:684694'),
  ('1051883246655997068', 'Action', 1980, 'Drama', 'Tinto Brass', 'Giancarlo Fusco, Roberto Lerici', 'Luc Merenda, Adriana Asti, Susanna Javicoli, Paola Senatore, Alberto Lupo, Alberto Sorrentino, John Steiner, Franco Fabrizi', null, 'Z-movie actor Bruno Martel has hero syndrome, often quarrelling with directors. He meets fellow actor Doris, who is obsessed with Ophelia but cannot get any Shakespearean bookings. One day, during a nervous breakdown, Bruno ''rescues'' Doris from the set, leaving town to encounter various absurd situations.', 'Z-movie actor Bruno Martel has hero syndrome, often quarrelling with directors. He meets fellow actor Doris, who is obsessed with Ophelia but cannot get any Shakespearean bookings. One day, during a nervous breakdown, Bruno ''rescues'' Doris from the set, leaving town to encounter various absurd situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVAsvxV2FcWTOLClnfjqS92bYoy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137599'),
  ('653403187773498387', 'Action Bog', 2025, 'Animation', 'Winston Hacking', null, null, null, 'A feverish stasis collapses into infinite distraction, spinning on the axis of an algorithm. Each pulse, an uncertain tone, breathes electricity into a half-alive world. Time stretches like soft polymer; metamorphoses creep forward frame by frame, suspiciously slow, as if the film were watching me back. Photographic fragments are transferred onto clay, not quite sculpture, not quite collage, but something in between: a Tonermorph. Figures emerge mid-gesture, faces unsealed yet never whole, suspended within the patterns of their own skin. They falter, caught in an action bog of their own making, or perhaps mine. A work of non-narrative cinema, the piece is guided by a score from electroacoustic and musique concrète composer Andrew Zukerman. Created during a 2025 summer residency at the Toronto Animated Image Society, with production funding support from the Society.', 'A feverish stasis collapses into infinite distraction, spinning on the axis of an algorithm. Each pulse, an uncertain tone, breathes electricity into a half-alive world. Time stretches like soft polymer; metamorphoses creep forward frame by frame, suspiciously slow, as if the film were watching me back. Photographic fragments are transferred onto clay, not quite sculpture, not quite collage, but something in between: a Tonermorph. Figures emerge mid-gesture, faces unsealed yet never whole, suspended within the patterns of their own skin. They falter, caught in an action bog of their own making, or perhaps mine. A work of non-narrative cinema, the piece is guided by a score from electroacoustic and musique concrète composer Andrew Zukerman. Created during a 2025 summer residency at the Toronto Animated Image Society, with production funding support from the Society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79QUDaHy967nIxNbW3R1NaZh02E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1663338'),
  ('754687305915002328', 'Action in Arabia', 1944, 'Drama, Thriller', 'J. Roy Hunt, Léonide Moguy', 'Philip MacDonald, Herbert J. Biberman', 'George Sanders, Virginia Bruce, Lenore Aubert, Gene Lockhart, Robert Armstrong, H.B. Warner, Alan Napier, André Charlot', null, 'Reporter Michael Gordon uncovers intrigue in Damascus, where the Allies and Nazis struggle for control of Arab sympathies.', 'Reporter Michael Gordon uncovers intrigue in Damascus, where the Allies and Nazis struggle for control of Arab sympathies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGOAwvrKIOBp5gmeCW25QSPCbUj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101206'),
  ('1022081546847151746', 'Action in the North Atlantic', 1943, 'War', 'Lloyd Bacon, Ted D. McCord', 'John Howard Lawson', 'Humphrey Bogart, Raymond Massey, Alan Hale, Julie Bishop, Ruth Gordon, Sam Levene, Dane Clark, Peter Whitney', null, 'Merchant Marine sailors Joe Rossi (Humphrey Bogart) and Steve Jarvis (Raymond Massey) are charged with getting a supply vessel to Russian allies as part of a sea convoy. When the group of ships comes under attack from a German U-boat, Rossi and Jarvis navigate through dangerous waters to evade Nazi naval forces. Though their mission across the Atlantic is extremely treacherous, they are motivated by the opportunity to strike back at the Germans, who sank one of their earlier ships.', 'Merchant Marine sailors Joe Rossi (Humphrey Bogart) and Steve Jarvis (Raymond Massey) are charged with getting a supply vessel to Russian allies as part of a sea convoy. When the group of ships comes under attack from a German U-boat, Rossi and Jarvis navigate through dangerous waters to evade Nazi naval forces. Though their mission across the Atlantic is extremely treacherous, they are motivated by the opportunity to strike back at the Germans, who sank one of their earlier ships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FBSnJYFf3FWfgMngCVRajKocpW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23051'),
