  ('568738729203074288', 'Action Jackson', 2014, 'Action, Thriller', 'Vijay Kumar Arora, Prabhu Deva', 'Prabhu Deva, A. C. Mugil', 'Ajay Devgn, Manasvi Mamgai, Byron Gibson, Sonakshi Sinha, Yami Gautam Dhar, Kunaal Roy Kapur, Prabhas, Shahid Kapoor', null, 'A man meets his lookalike, who''s not just a killer of evil, but also a kind hearted man. Together, they team up to fight against a dreaded gangster.', 'A man meets his lookalike, who''s not just a killer of evil, but also a kind hearted man. Together, they team up to fight against a dreaded gangster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3cVmG3G4YezZNLlJ4RuyE3MgKkE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308165'),
