  ('559114070932896260', 'Action of the Tiger', 1957, 'Action, Drama, Adventure', 'Terence Young, Desmond Dickinson', 'Robert Carson, Peter Myers', 'Van Johnson, Martine Carol, Herbert Lom, Gustavo Rojo, José Nieto, Helen Haye, Anna Gerber, Anthony Dawson', 'NR', 'A woman hires soldier-of-fortune Carson to smuggle her into Albania by way of Greece. Their trouble is just beginning when they get there.', 'A woman hires soldier-of-fortune Carson to smuggle her into Albania by way of Greece. Their trouble is just beginning when they get there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lR9crRlVqZUti3EPMyUyox24bsJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44870'),
