  ('61259106677641757', 'Actresses: Sex Audition', 2020, 'Drama', 'Jeong Mi-na', null, 'Lee Chae-dam, Lee Soo, Jo Wan-jin, Han Seok-bong, Tae Hee', null, 'Cheonbong, a third-class movie director, goes hunting with Dae-do as the newly-established assistant director Mi-young. However, hunting is just an excuse, and Cheonbong''s interest is more on Jet-Bob. Chun-bong tries to fill his greed by deceiving Mi-young, who doesn''t know the industry. Cheonbong''s wife, Eunwoo Son''s soccer coach, Together with Seong-gyu, he goes on a journey of deviation. Daebu-do is a place of memories that Cheonbong and Eun-woo enjoyed during their dating. Unfortunately, the couple enjoys an overnight meeting at a neighboring pension. They burn each other''s bodies in the same space without knowing each other''s existence... The life of a couple in this era of tightrope walking between Eros and Tanatos. Digging secretly into the crack''s space.', 'Cheonbong, a third-class movie director, goes hunting with Dae-do as the newly-established assistant director Mi-young. However, hunting is just an excuse, and Cheonbong''s interest is more on Jet-Bob. Chun-bong tries to fill his greed by deceiving Mi-young, who doesn''t know the industry. Cheonbong''s wife, Eunwoo Son''s soccer coach, Together with Seong-gyu, he goes on a journey of deviation. Daebu-do is a place of memories that Cheonbong and Eun-woo enjoyed during their dating. Unfortunately, the couple enjoys an overnight meeting at a neighboring pension. They burn each other''s bodies in the same space without knowing each other''s existence... The life of a couple in this era of tightrope walking between Eros and Tanatos. Digging secretly into the crack''s space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hw0o7e3brKh9nygSqiEm2tfqjFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:723562'),
  ('660855967475893488', 'Acts of Vengeance', 2017, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Isaac Florentine, Yaron Scharf, Paolina Venkova', 'Matt Venne', 'Antonio Banderas, Karl Urban, Paz Vega, Robert Forster, Cristina Serafini, Lillian Blankenship, Clint Dyer, Isaac Florentine', 'R', 'A fast-talking lawyer transforms his body and takes a vow of silence, not to be broken until he finds out who killed his wife and daughter and has his revenge.', 'A fast-talking lawyer transforms his body and takes a vow of silence, not to be broken until he finds out who killed his wife and daughter and has his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dzAMMqEubPItk8EXrUXe0wyuzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445954'),
  ('476773017036239603', 'Acts of Violence', 2018, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Brett Donowho, Edd Lukas', 'Nicolas Aaron Mezzanatto', 'Bruce Willis, Cole Hauser, Shawn Ashmore, Ashton Holmes, Melissa Bolona, Sean Brosnan, Sophia Bush, Mike Epps', 'R', 'When his fiancee is kidnapped by human traffickers, Roman and his ex-military brothers set out to track her down and save her before it is too late. Along the way, Roman teams up with Avery, a cop investigating human trafficking and fighting the corrupt bureaucracy that has harmful intentions.', 'When his fiancee is kidnapped by human traffickers, Roman and his ex-military brothers set out to track her down and save her before it is too late. Along the way, Roman teams up with Avery, a cop investigating human trafficking and fighting the corrupt bureaucracy that has harmful intentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x6sBKpLa86CodgTkIK2r8Hnp07m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479040'),
  ('1078322366778828498', 'Actual People', 2022, 'Drama', 'Kit Zauhar, Owen Smith-Clark', 'Kit Zauhar', 'Kit Zauhar, Scott Mun, Tiye Amenechi, Isabelle Barbier, Mae Claire, Jackson Crook, Shirley Huang, Fraser Jones', 'NR', 'An aimless girl in her final week of college goes to great lengths to win the affections of a boy from her hometown, Philadelphia, and ends up having to confront anxieties about her love life, family, and future.', 'An aimless girl in her final week of college goes to great lengths to win the affections of a boy from her hometown, Philadelphia, and ends up having to confront anxieties about her love life, family, and future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsbRTM1W3It8Cw38qqkpaGw7UTm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846795'),
  ('600977671790603810', 'Açúcar', 2017, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Fernando Lockett, Renata Pinheiro, Sérgio Oliveira', 'Sérgio Oliveira, Renata Pinheiro', 'Maeve Jinkings, Magali Biff, Dandara de Morais, Zé Maria, Fernando Abreu', null, 'Bethânia returns to her land, where the family’s old sugar mill was built, the Wanderley Mill. Between photographs, fantastic creatures, bills to pay and workers claiming their rights to the land, Bethânia faces herself in a present where both the past and the future look menacing.', 'Bethânia returns to her land, where the family’s old sugar mill was built, the Wanderley Mill. Between photographs, fantastic creatures, bills to pay and workers claiming their rights to the land, Bethânia faces herself in a present where both the past and the future look menacing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5RQldxwOHNVzLIMgSNa07hDILH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480406'),
  ('841558573841107974', 'Ad Astra', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Hoyte van Hoytema, Doug Torres, Christina Fong', 'James Gray, Ethan Gross', 'Brad Pitt, Tommy Lee Jones, Liv Tyler, Ruth Negga, Donald Sutherland, Kimberly Elise, Loren Dean, Donnie Keshawarz', 'PG-13', 'The near future, a time when both hope and hardships drive humanity to look to the stars and beyond. While a mysterious phenomenon menaces to destroy life on planet Earth, astronaut Roy McBride undertakes a mission across the immensity of space and its many perils to uncover the truth about a lost expedition that decades before boldly faced emptiness and silence in search of the unknown.', 'The near future, a time when both hope and hardships drive humanity to look to the stars and beyond. While a mysterious phenomenon menaces to destroy life on planet Earth, astronaut Roy McBride undertakes a mission across the immensity of space and its many perils to uncover the truth about a lost expedition that decades before boldly faced emptiness and silence in search of the unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBHvZcjRiWyobQ9kxBhO6B2dtRI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419704'),
  ('219638471946919320', 'Ad Fundum', 1993, 'Drama', 'Erik Van Looy', 'Erik Van Looy, Mark Punt', 'Tom Van Landuyt, Mathias Sercu, Tom van Bauwel, Sven de Ridder, Tania Poppe, Margot van Doorn, Axel Daeseleire, Gert Lahousse', null, 'Sammy Raes, a nice, naive law-freshman from a simple family, dies in a form of hazing known as the ''flying carpet''. The father of the arrogant fraternity president Guy Bogaerts who ordered this reckless procedure abuses his connections to prevent a judicial homicide conviction, while the college authorities prefer to avoid a scandal in the press. However Sammy''s freshmen friends Tom Smits and Denn', 'Sammy Raes, a nice, naive law-freshman from a simple family, dies in a form of hazing known as the ''flying carpet''. The father of the arrogant fraternity president Guy Bogaerts who ordered this reckless procedure abuses his connections to prevent a judicial homicide conviction, while the college authorities prefer to avoid a scandal in the press. However Sammy''s freshmen friends Tom Smits and Denn', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hopnC2X7eF9PuozZUBaKLijOlra.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24524'),
  ('879032086237100274', 'Ad Libitum', 2021, 'Thriller, Adventure', 'Polina Oldenburg, Ivan Kolpakov, Gleb Nekhoroshev', 'Polina Oldenburg', 'Shamil Khamatov, Igor Petrenko, Darya Belousova, Evgeniya Kregzhde, Anton Fedorov, Kristina Babushkina, Karen Badalov, Ivan Stebunov', null, 'The talented and practical journalist German Krylov, in pursuit of sensation, finds himself in a company that sells a feeling of love. Unexpectedly for himself, he becomes the object of manipulation and falls into a trap from which it is difficult to get out.', 'The talented and practical journalist German Krylov, in pursuit of sensation, finds himself in a company that sells a feeling of love. Unexpectedly for himself, he becomes the object of manipulation and falls into a trap from which it is difficult to get out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A90JZ3RRY8ZeDkh5vMzX9Qtun2R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:650743'),
  ('97605935840672289', 'Ad ovest di Paperino', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Alessandro Benvenuti, Romano Albani, Pierluigi Ciriaci', 'Alessandro Benvenuti', 'Athina Cenci, Alessandro Benvenuti, Francesco Nuti, Lucilla Baroni, Riccardo Cioni, Donata Genazzani, Paolo Hendel, Franco Javarone', null, 'It is the first film of the comedy trio "I GianCattivi", formed by Athina Cenci, Francesco Nuti and Benvenuti, who won the Nastro d''Argento for Best New Director. The film is set in Florence, Tuscany, with some scenes shot in Prato.The title is an inside joke that refers to the Tuscan village of Paperino, which is a district of Prato; the film''s surreal and grotesque undertones are also hinted by the title itself, since "Paperino" is also the Italian name for Donald Duck.', 'It is the first film of the comedy trio "I GianCattivi", formed by Athina Cenci, Francesco Nuti and Benvenuti, who won the Nastro d''Argento for Best New Director. The film is set in Florence, Tuscany, with some scenes shot in Prato.The title is an inside joke that refers to the Tuscan village of Paperino, which is a district of Prato; the film''s surreal and grotesque undertones are also hinted by the title itself, since "Paperino" is also the Italian name for Donald Duck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hN2JB46DemQ8kSOqcK1aPIv5LcG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58190'),
  ('790845303007283350', 'Ad Vitam', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime, Action', 'Charlotte Fouix, Rodolphe Lauga, Cyril Pavaux', 'Rodolphe Lauga, Guillaume Canet', 'Guillaume Canet, Alexis Manenti, Stéphane Caillard, Nassim Lyes, Zita Hanrot, Johan Heldenbergh, Etienne Guillou-Kervern, Jamel Blissat', 'R', 'When he and his pregnant wife are attacked in their home, a former elite agent becomes trapped in a deadly manhunt tied to his own painful past.', 'When he and his pregnant wife are attacked in their home, a former elite agent becomes trapped in a deadly manhunt tied to his own painful past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqBSapk1nC35WlZ6PraMjOVMQBy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1261501'),
  ('96074985566024635', 'AD/BC: A Rock Opera', 2004, 'Comedy, Music', 'Richard Ayoade, Dave Lambert, Mary Motture', 'Richard Ayoade', 'Matt Berry, Julian Barratt, Julia Davis, Richard Ayoade, Matt Lucas, Noel Fielding, Tom Hillenbrand, Karl Theobald', null, 'An all-singing, all-dancing, star-spangled musical leap around the biblical story of the Nativity, set in 1972. With a comic twist, this familiar story is brought to life through the eyes of the innkeeper. Despairing after a bad year, he contemplates suicide but his attempt is stalled by a voice from above who points out that King Herod is coming to town.', 'An all-singing, all-dancing, star-spangled musical leap around the biblical story of the Nativity, set in 1972. With a comic twist, this familiar story is brought to life through the eyes of the innkeeper. Despairing after a bad year, he contemplates suicide but his attempt is stalled by a voice from above who points out that King Herod is coming to town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pxL7LiKtYwpj4zpPINUxxZ4PAa3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27531'),
  ('707367117159600353', 'Ada', 1961, 'Drama', 'Daniel Mann, Joseph Ruttenberg, Al Jennings', 'William Driskill, Arthur Sheekman', 'Susan Hayward, Dean Martin, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Ralph Meeker, Martin Balsam, Frank Maxwell, Connie Sawyer, Ford Rainey', null, 'A popular but naive country singer is elected governor of a southern state and, once in office, decides to dismantle the corrupt political machine that got him elected. Director Daniel Mann''s 1961 political drama stars Susan Hayward, Dean Martin, Wilfred Hyde-White, Martin Balsam, Ralph Meeker, Connie Sawyer, William Walker, Ray Teal, Larry Gates and Kathryn Card.', 'A popular but naive country singer is elected governor of a southern state and, once in office, decides to dismantle the corrupt political machine that got him elected. Director Daniel Mann''s 1961 political drama stars Susan Hayward, Dean Martin, Wilfred Hyde-White, Martin Balsam, Ralph Meeker, Connie Sawyer, William Walker, Ray Teal, Larry Gates and Kathryn Card.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6e452Tr1GUTQdChgf0WKRP9qWKV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118998'),
  ('728147246375594440', 'Adagio', 2001, 'Animation', 'Garri Bardin, Aleksandr Dvigubskiy, Igor Skidan-Bosin', 'Garri Bardin', null, null, '"Adagio" which is a philosophical parable exploring the conflict between a hero and the crowd is loosely based on a romantic short story written by the famous Russian writer Maxim Gorky about a young man named Danko and his burning heart.', '"Adagio" which is a philosophical parable exploring the conflict between a hero and the crowd is loosely based on a romantic short story written by the famous Russian writer Maxim Gorky about a young man named Danko and his burning heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKHBbSp3CLxTAujfJFMs0c6340y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147198'),
  ('241484820338479568', 'Adagio', 2023, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Stefano Sollima, Roy Bava, Paolo Carnera', 'Stefano Sollima, Stefano Bises', 'Pierfrancesco Favino, Toni Servillo, Valerio Mastandrea, Adriano Giannini, Gianmarco Franchini, Francesco Di Leva, Lorenzo Adorni, Silvia Salvatori', 'NR', 'Tangled up with blackmail and crooked cops, the son of a former gangster seeks out his father''s old friends, who risk everything to save him.', 'Tangled up with blackmail and crooked cops, the son of a former gangster seeks out his father''s old friends, who risk everything to save him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9kLSGl1q6T4IKjXpJ8I6O8U873.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1021803'),
  ('634193205392940178', 'Adalen 31', 1969, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Bo Widerberg, Jörgen Persson, Roy Andersson', 'Bo Widerberg', 'Peter Schildt, Kerstin Tidelius, Roland Hedlund, Marie De Geer, Olof Bergström, Jonas Bergström, Anita Björk, Stefan Feierbach', null, 'A film about the 1931 Ådalen shootings, in which Swedish military forces opened fire against labour demonstrators in the Swedish sawmill district of Ådalen.', 'A film about the 1931 Ådalen shootings, in which Swedish military forces opened fire against labour demonstrators in the Swedish sawmill district of Ådalen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36nb5JRvhdaEcpE71LKexPtYIa1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87208'),
  ('1151056172150674136', 'Adam', 1983, 'Drama', 'Michael Tuchner, Mike Fash, Jerram A. Swartz', 'Allan Leicht', 'Daniel J. Travanti, JoBeth Williams, Martha Scott, Richard Masur, Paul Regina, Mason Adams, Tony Frank, John M. Jackson', 'NR', 'Based on the true story that shocked the nation and led to vast changes in how law enforcement handled missing children cases...John and Reve Walsh deal with their grief in front of the whole country when their son, Adam, is abducted and later found dead.', 'Based on the true story that shocked the nation and led to vast changes in how law enforcement handled missing children cases...John and Reve Walsh deal with their grief in front of the whole country when their son, Adam, is abducted and later found dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iE1XMj16MX4fz9wF5LNzEMOB0NR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76468'),
  ('622188239209629112', 'Adam', 1992, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Peter Lord', 'Peter Lord', 'Nick Upton', 'NR', 'When The Hand of God creates Adam, he must learn the ways of the world, and can only hope for company.', 'When The Hand of God creates Adam, he must learn the ways of the world, and can only hope for company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHrvgiLi5DjS7FrtKohUIFyk3wR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54821'),
  ('899998527157768498', 'Adam', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Max Mayer, Seamus Tierney', 'Max Mayer', 'Hugh Dancy, Rose Byrne, Peter Gallagher, Amy Irving, Frankie Faison, Mark Linn-Baker, Haviland Morris, Adam LeFevre', 'PG-13', 'Adam, a lonely man with Asperger''s Syndrome, develops a relationship with his upstairs neighbor, Beth.', 'Adam, a lonely man with Asperger''s Syndrome, develops a relationship with his upstairs neighbor, Beth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSN5ec7llAzv0Up7wAQ9qeOM0lS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22051'),
  ('207216021326165870', 'Adam', 2019, 'Drama', 'Maryam Touzani, Virginie Surdej', 'Maryam Touzani', 'Lubna Azabal, Nisrin Erradi, Douae Belkhaouda, Aziz Hattab, Hasna Tamtaoui', 'NR', 'Abla runs a modest local bakery from her home in Casablanca where she lives alone with her 8-year-old daughter Warda. Their routine of housework and homework is interrupted one day by a knock on the door. It is Samia, a young woman looking for a job and a roof over her head. The little girl is immediately taken with the newcomer, but her mother initially refuses to allow a pregnant stranger into their home. Gradually, however, Abla''s resolve softens and Samia''s arrival begins to offer all of them the prospect of a new life.', 'Abla runs a modest local bakery from her home in Casablanca where she lives alone with her 8-year-old daughter Warda. Their routine of housework and homework is interrupted one day by a knock on the door. It is Samia, a young woman looking for a job and a roof over her head. The little girl is immediately taken with the newcomer, but her mother initially refuses to allow a pregnant stranger into their home. Gradually, however, Abla''s resolve softens and Samia''s arrival begins to offer all of them the prospect of a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a5XfgVcGz54bTYUWLtYJZC6lMuN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595875'),
  ('17718037918505681', 'Adam', 2020, 'Drama', 'Michael Uppendahl, Lisa Essary, Tobias Datum', 'Mike Young, Michael Burke, Robin Veith', 'Aaron Paul, Jeff Daniels, Tom Sizemore, Tom Berenger, Lena Olin, Shannon Lucio, Paul Walter Hauser, Celia Weston', 'R', 'A hard-living salesman becomes a quadriplegic after an accident.', 'A hard-living salesman becomes a quadriplegic after an accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xAv4u8E6DN5Jc7qjQT3WLQBO4C3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:706260'),
  ('731635730777061499', 'Adam & Eva', 1997, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Måns Herngren, Hannes Holm, Mats Olofson', 'Hannes Holm, Måns Herngren', 'Björn Kjellman, Josefin Nilsson, Tintin Anderzon, Reine Brynolfsson, Jacob Ericksson, Katrin Sundberg, Dubrilla Ekerlund, Tomas von Brömssen', null, 'Adam and Eva have been married for four years. But the romance has disappeared from their relationship and has been replaced by boredom and old routine. When Adam meets his brother''s baby-sitter, Jackie, he is immediately attracted to her. They have an affair, but Adam tell himself that they are only friends. However, when Eva finds out that he has a mistress, she leaves him. Adam tries to convince himself that he is free again, but soon realizes that he is still in love with Eva, and must win her back...', 'Adam and Eva have been married for four years. But the romance has disappeared from their relationship and has been replaced by boredom and old routine. When Adam meets his brother''s baby-sitter, Jackie, he is immediately attracted to her. They have an affair, but Adam tell himself that they are only friends. However, when Eva finds out that he has a mistress, she leaves him. Adam tries to convince himself that he is free again, but soon realizes that he is still in love with Eva, and must win her back...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QWPOG7KhWiPVlRkKVDDiKwp7u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54044'),
  ('355339500584923808', 'Adam & Evelyn', 2018, 'Drama', 'Andreas Goldstein, Jakobine Motz', 'Jakobine Motz, Andreas Goldstein', 'Florian Teichtmeister, Anne Kanis, Lena Lauzemis, Milian Zerzawy, Christin Alexandrow, Susanne Bredehöft, Markus Lerch, Bernhard Schütz', null, 'Summer 1989, East Germany. Adam works as a tailor, Evelyn as a waitress. They are planning a vacation together when Evelyn finds out that Adam is cheating on her and decides to leave for the holiday on her own.', 'Summer 1989, East Germany. Adam works as a tailor, Evelyn as a waitress. They are planning a vacation together when Evelyn finds out that Adam is cheating on her and decides to leave for the holiday on her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNZPExR0qSTMCZ6yR4n263ZW84J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538702'),
  ('96490979646258644', 'Adam & Evil', 2004, 'Horror', 'Andrew Van Slee', 'Andrew Van Slee', 'Barbara Kottmeier, Erica Cerra, Allison Warnyca, Sean Arnfinson, Brody Harms, Sandra Steier, Tiffany Paterson, Vanessa Van Slee', null, 'A group of sexy high school graduates are ready for a weekend of serious partying at a remote camp ground. Soon a murderer is on the loose...', 'A group of sexy high school graduates are ready for a weekend of serious partying at a remote camp ground. Soon a murderer is on the loose...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9sMh4EGAGnYqw7K5gTVXkasYS7h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61165'),
  ('301589409382481999', 'Adam & Paul', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lenny Abrahamson, James Mather', null, 'Tom Murphy, Mark O''Halloran, Michael McElhatton, Mary Murray, Paul Roe, Deirdre Molloy, Thomas Farrell, Gary Egan', null, 'Adam and Paul are two young junkies living in Dublin and perpetually on the lookout for their next fix. During their search, they encounter various unsavoury characters and make some futile attempts at petty theft. As their day progresses, Adam and Paul get into a good share of trouble as they do whatever they can to score heroin, eventually running afoul of an imposing thug—who only drags them into more shady activities.', 'Adam and Paul are two young junkies living in Dublin and perpetually on the lookout for their next fix. During their search, they encounter various unsavoury characters and make some futile attempts at petty theft. As their day progresses, Adam and Paul get into a good share of trouble as they do whatever they can to score heroin, eventually running afoul of an imposing thug—who only drags them into more shady activities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0AclBTFK6UIe536Q6WUethFsC4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21810'),
  ('766640019457923266', 'Adam & Steve', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Craig Chester, Brian Pryzpek, Carl Bartels', 'Craig Chester', 'Craig Chester, Malcolm Gets, Parker Posey, Chris Kattan, Kristen Schaal, Julie Hagerty, Paul Sand, Noah Segan', 'R', 'Adam and Steve are two gay youths who have a one-night stand that ends embarrassingly. Nearly two decades later, Adam, now a Manhattan tour guide, and Steve, a psychiatrist, meet again -- but neither remembers the other from years before. The two begin dating, even playing matchmaker for their friends Michael and Rhonda, but their promising relationship hits a major snag when Adam and Steve finally recall their past connection.', 'Adam and Steve are two gay youths who have a one-night stand that ends embarrassingly. Nearly two decades later, Adam, now a Manhattan tour guide, and Steve, a psychiatrist, meet again -- but neither remembers the other from years before. The two begin dating, even playing matchmaker for their friends Michael and Rhonda, but their promising relationship hits a major snag when Adam and Steve finally recall their past connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peATXTLxUsLkWTa7S7R9dtLxbRF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17021'),
  ('569978187086828195', 'Adam and Dog', 2013, 'Animation, Drama', 'Minkyu Lee, Matt Braly', null, null, null, 'The story about the dog of Eden. What happened in those first days of Creation that made Man and Dog so inseparable? The dog, as he lives through this curious world, encounters a strange creature; a human being named Adam - and with that discovers a new found connection to the world.', 'The story about the dog of Eden. What happened in those first days of Creation that made Man and Dog so inseparable? The dog, as he lives through this curious world, encounters a strange creature; a human being named Adam - and with that discovers a new found connection to the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6u1NFKH6iccY54VAio46Ucjdfma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157301'),
  ('912268257332836679', 'Adam and Eve', 1956, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Alberto Gout, Alex Phillips', 'Alberto Gout', 'Christiane Martel, Carlos Baena', null, 'Version of the story of Adam and Eve.', 'Version of the story of Adam and Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUxdpPGMe8yOyYBRXuJX6UeyI2s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150528'),
  ('9286775887706813', 'Adam and Eve', 1983, 'Romance, Adventure, Fantasy, Horror', 'Fernando Espiga, Enzo Doria, Luigi Russo', 'Donald Forrest', 'Mark Gregory, Andrea Goldman, Ángel Alcázar, Costantino Rossi, Pierangelo Pozzato, Liliana Gerace, Vito Fornari, Maurizio Margutti', null, 'God casts Adam and Eve out of the Garden of Eden because Eve decided to have a fling with a visiting Cro-Magnon named Bearkiller. The disgraced couple find themselves on the outside up against an assortment of various dinosaurs, flying monsters and cannibals.', 'God casts Adam and Eve out of the Garden of Eden because Eve decided to have a fling with a visiting Cro-Magnon named Bearkiller. The disgraced couple find themselves on the outside up against an assortment of various dinosaurs, flying monsters and cannibals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSJE8SeaBd48Pf6rQAo6uEbLbWc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151717'),
  ('282838220926883426', 'Adam and Eve', 1995, 'Drama', 'Joaquim Leitão, Juan Molina', 'Joaquim Leitão', 'Maria de Medeiros, Joaquim de Almeida, Karra Elejalde, Ana Bustorff, Cristina Carvalhal, Marcantonio Del Carlo, Filipe Crawford, Rogério Samora', null, 'Catarina Menezes is a bisexual TV reporter who decides to have a child on her own and chooses Spanish humanitarian doctor Rafael to father the child, setting up an elaborate charade to lure him into her bed. When Catarina reveals her pregnancy, though, her current live-in girlfriend doesn''t take to it kindly and promises to make Catarina''s life hell; to make matters worse, Rafael finds out her true identity and comes to Lisbon to see her. And Catarina''s sole refuge is in the arms of fellow journalist Francisco, her professional relationship slowly becoming a romantic one.', 'Catarina Menezes is a bisexual TV reporter who decides to have a child on her own and chooses Spanish humanitarian doctor Rafael to father the child, setting up an elaborate charade to lure him into her bed. When Catarina reveals her pregnancy, though, her current live-in girlfriend doesn''t take to it kindly and promises to make Catarina''s life hell; to make matters worse, Rafael finds out her true identity and comes to Lisbon to see her. And Catarina''s sole refuge is in the arms of fellow journalist Francisco, her professional relationship slowly becoming a romantic one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WjLCEloddivhVBnSmvesrSmSqj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112575'),
  ('588282124853116930', 'Adam and Eve', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'John Darbonne, Jeff Kanew, Gary Brockette', 'Justin Kanew', 'Cameron Douglas, Emmanuelle Chriqui, Chad Lindberg, Jake Hoffman, Brian Klugman, Branden Williams, Courtney Peldon, China Shavers', 'R', 'Adam is a typical college-aged guy... which is to say he wants sex 24 hours a day. But when he meets - and falls for - Eve, a scorchingly hot coed who''s still very attached to her virginity, the waiting game is on! While his college buddies score left and right, and campus hotties make tempting passes, Adam ponders an explosive question: Will Eve say "It''s the right time"... before he completely goes out of his mind?', 'Adam is a typical college-aged guy... which is to say he wants sex 24 hours a day. But when he meets - and falls for - Eve, a scorchingly hot coed who''s still very attached to her virginity, the waiting game is on! While his college buddies score left and right, and campus hotties make tempting passes, Adam ponders an explosive question: Will Eve say "It''s the right time"... before he completely goes out of his mind?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtf60tNMJQ6Jbman4Fi43rnSIVA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53928'),
  ('75750348047552314', 'Adam and Six Eves', 1962, 'Comedy', 'John Wallis, Artie Shotz, Robert Chester', 'Lawrence Donner', 'Randy Brent, Gabrielle Benett, Marianne Bennett, Shelly Forbes, Leigh Sands, Lorraine Sheldon, Barbara Stanley', null, 'A gold prospector in the desert gets lost and discovers an oasis of comely maidens.', 'A gold prospector in the desert gets lost and discovers an oasis of comely maidens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g04OKvBVEBP12WeGklEKs7tR9JF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202875'),
  ('829855807854782399', 'Adam and the Devil', 2007, 'Drama', 'Barış Pirhasan', 'İsmail Doruk', 'Nurgül Yeşilçay, Cem Özer, Fırat Can Aydın, Zeynep Özbay, Derya Alabora, Erkan Taşdöğen, Emir Benderlioğlu, Ezel Akay', null, 'Imam Hasan, his wife Hacer and his daughter Fatma arrive at Karaağaçlı, a small railway town in the middle of the Anatolian wilderness. Besides carrying out the duties of the imam, Hasan will be teaching religion to the children of the town during the holy month of Ramadan. His unusual behavior towards his wife and little daughter arrests the attention of the townsfolk. Meanwhile Adem, the son of the stationmaster who is crazy for trains begins to learn about and get into a world he has never heard of before in the lessons given by Hasan: trains, sin, good deeds, heaven and hell.. everything gets jumbled. Condemned of being harsh and merciless towards his family, Hasan one day finds himself obliged to reveal the "secret" about himself and his family and this changes everything in the eyes of people. Yet there has remained another secret of which anyone, even Hasan is hardly aware. The people of the town, including Adem, will remember this Ramadan throughout their lives.', 'Imam Hasan, his wife Hacer and his daughter Fatma arrive at Karaağaçlı, a small railway town in the middle of the Anatolian wilderness. Besides carrying out the duties of the imam, Hasan will be teaching religion to the children of the town during the holy month of Ramadan. His unusual behavior towards his wife and little daughter arrests the attention of the townsfolk. Meanwhile Adem, the son of the stationmaster who is crazy for trains begins to learn about and get into a world he has never heard of before in the lessons given by Hasan: trains, sin, good deeds, heaven and hell.. everything gets jumbled. Condemned of being harsh and merciless towards his family, Hasan one day finds himself obliged to reveal the "secret" about himself and his family and this changes everything in the eyes of people. Yet there has remained another secret of which anyone, even Hasan is hardly aware. The people of the town, including Adem, will remember this Ramadan throughout their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9v3gAAXJjGmK56QwUZTv8Sn53F0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52100'),
  ('664589890759394305', 'Adam at Six A.M.', 1970, 'Drama', 'Robert Scheerer, Charles Rosher Jr.', 'Elinor Karpf, Steven Karpf', 'Michael Douglas, Lee Purcell, Joe Don Baker, Louise Latham, Charles Aidman, Grayson Hall, Marge Redmond, Dana Elcar', 'R', 'A disenchanted young Professor of Semantics at a California college learns of a distant relative''s death in Missouri. He journeys cross-country to the funeral, then decides to spend the summer there and work as a laborer for a power-line company. In time, he meets a girl and falls in love but then faces an important decision as to which direction he wants his life to go.', 'A disenchanted young Professor of Semantics at a California college learns of a distant relative''s death in Missouri. He journeys cross-country to the funeral, then decides to spend the summer there and work as a laborer for a power-line company. In time, he meets a girl and falls in love but then faces an important decision as to which direction he wants his life to go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVPi8iAMuf1gQ2CzZTt0lrJXTDE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121011'),
  ('242491914554176167', 'Adam Bede', 1992, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Giles Foster, Rex Maidment', 'Maggie Wadey', 'Iain Glen, Patsy Kensit, Susannah Harker, James Wilby, Julia McKenzie, Robert Stephens, Jean Marsh, Freddie Jones', null, 'Rich and languorous, this adaptation of George Eliot''s classic tale perfectly evokes rural England in the 18th Century. But beneath the tranquil surface of this pastoral idyll run deep passions and the bitter gall of betrayal.', 'Rich and languorous, this adaptation of George Eliot''s classic tale perfectly evokes rural England in the 18th Century. But beneath the tranquil surface of this pastoral idyll run deep passions and the bitter gall of betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GzxKwqg2kXJRqp4SuqzIjTzCEB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54650'),
  ('924782521998922444', 'Adam by Eve: A Live in Animation', 2022, 'Drama, Animation, Music', 'Takamasa Araki, Shuichi Iseki, Hidenori Matsubara', 'Hibiki Yoshizaki, Nobutaka Yoda', 'Eve, ano, Hanon', 'R', 'Anime, live action and music by cutting-edge artist Eve — all woven together into this dreamlike sonic experience inspired by the story of Adam and Eve.', 'Anime, live action and music by cutting-edge artist Eve — all woven together into this dreamlike sonic experience inspired by the story of Adam and Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vI3aahilqPyMpNQQ7421GSEHRLX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:930821'),
  ('380995517547861639', 'Adam Chaplin', 2011, 'Horror, Action, Crime', 'Emanuele De Santi, Giulio De Santi', 'Emanuele De Santi, Giulio De Santi', 'Emanuele De Santi, Alessandro Gramanti, Paolo Luciani, Giulio De Santi, Christian Riva, Valeria Sannino, Enrique Sorres, Wilmar Zimosa', null, 'Set in the fictional country of Heaven Valley, the film is the story of a man, Adam, who following the suspicious death of his wife begins to investigate her murder and in doing so, discovers the involvement of local mafia boss: Denny Richards. Unable to trust the police, corrupt and controlled by Denny, Adam, consumed by anger, summons a demon who offers him superhuman strength and dark powers. The demon follows him during his trip, promising to lead Adam to the door of the murderer if he does everything the demon asks. This unleashes a bloody war that will bring Adam, the demon on his side, against the police department with all its dark allies. The fight begins and it will be extreme!', 'Set in the fictional country of Heaven Valley, the film is the story of a man, Adam, who following the suspicious death of his wife begins to investigate her murder and in doing so, discovers the involvement of local mafia boss: Denny Richards. Unable to trust the police, corrupt and controlled by Denny, Adam, consumed by anger, summons a demon who offers him superhuman strength and dark powers. The demon follows him during his trip, promising to lead Adam to the door of the murderer if he does everything the demon asks. This unleashes a bloody war that will bring Adam, the demon on his side, against the police department with all its dark allies. The fight begins and it will be extreme!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEUn35sNCZWkaROnKKZXCOrwsr2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99117'),
  ('459243971676969003', 'Adam Had Four Sons', 1941, 'Romance, Drama', 'Gregory Ratoff, J. Peverell Marley, Norman Deming', 'William Hurlbut, Michael Blankfort', 'Ingrid Bergman, Warner Baxter, Susan Hayward, Fay Wray, Richard Denning, Johnny Downs, Robert Shaw, Charles Lind', 'NR', 'Emilie has been hired to care for the four sons of wealthy Adam Stoddard and his wife, Molly. After Molly dies, Adam and the boys grow to depend on Emilie even more. At the same time, Emilie falls in love with Adam. The boys grow up, but Adam insists that Emilie stay on as part of the family. Her relationships with both the boys and Adam become strained after one son marries a gold-digging viper named Hester. Written by Daniel Bubbeo', 'Emilie has been hired to care for the four sons of wealthy Adam Stoddard and his wife, Molly. After Molly dies, Adam and the boys grow to depend on Emilie even more. At the same time, Emilie falls in love with Adam. The boys grow up, but Adam insists that Emilie stay on as part of the family. Her relationships with both the boys and Adam become strained after one son marries a gold-digging viper named Hester. Written by Daniel Bubbeo', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBKJh9iI5JggO8tUqJ6TV3qcndo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106406'),
  ('170689118603891382', 'Adam Resurrected', 2008, 'Drama, War', 'Paul Schrader, Sebastian Edschmid', 'Noah Stollman', 'Jeff Goldblum, Willem Dafoe, Derek Jacobi, Ayelet Zurer, Hana Laslo, Joachim Król, Evgenia Dodina, Idan Alterman', 'R', 'After again attempting to commit murder, a Jewish man with a mysterious past and extraordinary intelligence, charisma, and body control returns to an insane asylum, where he makes a startling discovery.', 'After again attempting to commit murder, a Jewish man with a mysterious past and extraordinary intelligence, charisma, and body control returns to an insane asylum, where he makes a startling discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0Di5lSe0oIzpJle2O9T5di4w3M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18516'),
  ('437797152600794340', 'Adam Sandler: 100% Fresh', 2018, 'Comedy, Music', 'Paul Thomas Anderson, Steven Brill, Andrew Wehde', 'Adam Sandler', 'Adam Sandler, Rob Schneider, Dan Bulla, Chris Farley', 'R', 'Adam Sandler takes his comical musical musings back out on the road, from comedy clubs to concert halls to one very unsuspecting subway station.', 'Adam Sandler takes his comical musical musings back out on the road, from comedy clubs to concert halls to one very unsuspecting subway station.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykIpbOWvqx3Jz6oMFss5ldIVkfU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517596'),
