  ('245696070990940455', 'Adam: The Mirror', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Animation', 'Neill Blomkamp, Kris Woznesensky', 'Neill Blomkamp, Thomas Sweterlitsch, Jordan Brown', 'Jason Cope, Coulton Jackson, Viv Leacock, Dalton Brownson', null, 'Oats Studios brings to life the next chapter in the Adam story, made in real-time using Unity. Join our amnesiac hero as he discovers a clue about what and who he is.', 'Oats Studios brings to life the next chapter in the Adam story, made in real-time using Unity. Join our amnesiac hero as he discovers a clue about what and who he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GdDzzcZp4Fd0FrySZL5CApoCJT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479469'),
  ('375549765344213058', 'Adam''s Apples', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Anders Thomas Jensen, Sebastian Blenkov, Peter Bækkel', 'Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Mads Mikkelsen, Ulrich Thomsen, Paprika Steen, Ole Thestrup, Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Nicolas Bro, Ali Kazim, Gyrd Løfquist', 'R', 'A neo-nazi sentenced to community service at a church clashes with the blindly devotional priest.', 'A neo-nazi sentenced to community service at a church clashes with the blindly devotional priest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBP0xOOaAT9rmJZGVxrolRk87AR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1023'),
  ('46194127077813695', 'Adam''s Rib', 1949, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Cukor, George J. Folsey, Joel Freeman', 'Ruth Gordon, Garson Kanin', 'Spencer Tracy, Katharine Hepburn, Judy Holliday, Tom Ewell, David Wayne, Jean Hagen, Hope Emerson, Eve March', 'NR', 'A woman''s attempted murder of her uncaring husband results in everyday quarrels in the lives of Adam and Amanda, a pair of happily married lawyers who end up on opposite sides of the case in court.', 'A woman''s attempted murder of her uncaring husband results in everyday quarrels in the lives of Adam and Amanda, a pair of happily married lawyers who end up on opposite sides of the case in court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k9gT6d2sDT9Jd4dvzHowTt3l6Zg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25431'),
  ('434758733907994461', 'Adam''s Rib', 1990, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Viacheslav Kryshtofovych, Pavel Lebeshev', 'Vladimir Kunin, Viacheslav Kryshtofovych', 'Inna Churikova, Yelena Bogdanova, Svetlana Ryabova, Mariya Golubkina, Andrei Tolubeyev, Andrei Kasyanov, Stanislav Zhitaryov, Igor Kvasha', null, 'The film is based on the story of Anatoly Kurchatkin "House of Women". A tragicomedy about four women of three generations who lives in a tiny Moscow apartment: a sick grandmother, constantly requiring attention; a mother, very peculiar woman, who still hoping to somehow arrange her personal life; and two daughters, each of whom has a lot of problems.', 'The film is based on the story of Anatoly Kurchatkin "House of Women". A tragicomedy about four women of three generations who lives in a tiny Moscow apartment: a sick grandmother, constantly requiring attention; a mother, very peculiar woman, who still hoping to somehow arrange her personal life; and two daughters, each of whom has a lot of problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNgNosGQq7PXYyjPczOhTpOqdWS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41833'),
  ('541213017521638385', 'Adam''s Sake', 2025, 'Drama', 'Laura Wandel, Christèle Agnello, Julien Denis', 'Laura Wandel', 'Léa Drucker, Anamaria Vartolomei, Alex Descas, Jules Delsart, Claire Bodson, Laurent Capelluto, Timur Magomedgadzhiev, Charlotte De Bruyne', null, 'A head nurse defies hospital rules to let a mother stay with her malnourished son. As they navigate a complex crisis, the nurse''s empathy proves just as vital to the boy''s healing as medicine.', 'A head nurse defies hospital rules to let a mother stay with her malnourished son. As they navigate a complex crisis, the nurse''s empathy proves just as vital to the boy''s healing as medicine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Gdj7NZht38M7BAAn1TbcEdbu5h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1293858'),
  ('569572439822948057', 'Adam''s Two Ribs', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Andrzej Trzos-Rastawiecki, Marian Zaleski, Daniel Szylit', 'Józef Hen', 'Renata Kossobudzka, Zygmunt Kęstowicz, Ewa Wawrzoń, Joanna Kostusiewicz, Feliks Chmurkowski, Bohdan Ejmont, Tadeusz Surowa, Jerzy Bielenia', null, 'An engineer comes home from abroad to his waiting wife. After some time, his second wife, an Italian one, joins him. For a small town, such a triangle will turn out to be unacceptable, especially since the spouses live peacefully under one roof.', 'An engineer comes home from abroad to his waiting wife. After some time, his second wife, an Italian one, joins him. For a small town, such a triangle will turn out to be unacceptable, especially since the spouses live peacefully under one roof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agabpix84AUM9jSEnUFQtYF7xl1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618923'),
  ('369865317621191959', 'Adama: The World of Wind', 2015, 'Animation, Drama, War', 'Simon Rouby', 'Bénédicte Galup', 'Azize Diabate Abdoulaye, Pascal N''Zonzi, Oxmo Puccino, jack mba, Mariam Kaba, Emile Abossolo M''bo, Alexis Thomassian, Lisa Spurio', null, '12 year-­old Adama lives in a remote village in West Africa, sheltered by the cliffs. Out beyond lies "the world of wind," the kingdom of wicked spirits hungry for war. When his elder brother Samba suddenly vanishes from the village, Adama decides to set off in search of him, crossing into a Europe in the grip of World War I.', '12 year-­old Adama lives in a remote village in West Africa, sheltered by the cliffs. Out beyond lies "the world of wind," the kingdom of wicked spirits hungry for war. When his elder brother Samba suddenly vanishes from the village, Adama decides to set off in search of him, crossing into a Europe in the grip of World War I.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kP8WPty76kWNtspDYvfEWNXNzx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348375'),
  ('612658002539735388', 'Adamya', 2026, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Ranjan Ghosh', 'Ranjan Ghosh', 'Aryuun Ghosh, Senjuti Roy Mukherjee, Sourya Madrajee', null, 'A political assassination goes wrong. Palash, the young hunter, becomes the hunted. Set in the Sundarbans, home to long-standing conflicts between humans and nature, Adamya is a character study: Is Palash an extremist or a revolutionary?', 'A political assassination goes wrong. Palash, the young hunter, becomes the hunted. Set in the Sundarbans, home to long-standing conflicts between humans and nature, Adamya is a character study: Is Palash an extremist or a revolutionary?', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F6Ra6U2f3A60sDs9NBzywTv7cnse.jpg', 'plex:movie:adamya-2026'),
  ('822946815728247595', 'Adanis: Kutsal Kavga', 2022, 'Drama, Action, Adventure', 'Emir Khalilzadeh, Ersin Gök', 'Baki İlhan', 'İsmail Filiz, Esra Bilgiç, Baki İlhan, Serdar Deniz, Dilek Serbest, Turgay Tanülkü, Nevzat Yılmaz, Aslıhan Karalar', null, 'The film focuses on events surrounding the sacred map, which is in the possession of the Devoted. The Devoted is a group formed to protect an important secret that fell into Turkish hands after the conquest of Istanbul. The Devoted, who are willing to risk everything to protect the secret, engage in a difficult struggle against the dark forces trying to seize it.', 'The film focuses on events surrounding the sacred map, which is in the possession of the Devoted. The Devoted is a group formed to protect an important secret that fell into Turkish hands after the conquest of Istanbul. The Devoted, who are willing to risk everything to protect the secret, engage in a difficult struggle against the dark forces trying to seize it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1G5mt3uGUW5OWUcxcBUtHm5Zdd9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:978436'),
  ('387008339457508512', 'Adaptation.', 2002, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Lance Acord, Spike Jonze, Thomas Patrick Smith', 'Charlie Kaufman', 'Nicolas Cage, Meryl Streep, Chris Cooper, Tilda Swinton, Jay Tavare, Litefoot, Roger Willie, Jim Beaver', 'R', 'Charlie Kaufman is a confused L.A. screenwriter overwhelmed by feelings of inadequacy, sexual frustration, self-loathing, and by the screenwriting ambitions of his freeloading twin brother Donald. While struggling to adapt "The Orchid Thief," by Susan Orlean, Kaufman''s life spins from pathetic to bizarre. The lives of Kaufman, Orlean''s book, become strangely intertwined as each one''s search for passion collides with the others''.', 'Charlie Kaufman is a confused L.A. screenwriter overwhelmed by feelings of inadequacy, sexual frustration, self-loathing, and by the screenwriting ambitions of his freeloading twin brother Donald. While struggling to adapt "The Orchid Thief," by Susan Orlean, Kaufman''s life spins from pathetic to bizarre. The lives of Kaufman, Orlean''s book, become strangely intertwined as each one''s search for passion collides with the others''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffEmHQAiD0m5dEQ6rlsuA9vlllW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2757'),
  ('96238407588395790', 'Addams Family Reunion', 1998, 'Comedy, Horror, Fantasy, Family, TV Movie', 'Christian Sebaldt, Dave Payne, Tim Andrew', 'Rob Kerchner, Scott Sandin', 'Tim Curry, Daryl Hannah, Ed Begley Jr., Carel Struycken, Ray Walston, Kevin McCarthy, Estelle Harris, Haylie Duff', 'PG', 'The Addams Family goes on a search for their relatives. Gomez and Morticia are horrified to discover that Grandpa and Grandma Addams have a disease that is slowly turning them "normal". The only chance they have of a cure is to find a family member hoping that they know a home remedy.', 'The Addams Family goes on a search for their relatives. Gomez and Morticia are horrified to discover that Grandpa and Grandma Addams have a disease that is slowly turning them "normal". The only chance they have of a cure is to find a family member hoping that they know a home remedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XtfNBKnLDpg1waJhDF5FAd5OEX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11508'),
  ('205293088711104643', 'Addams Family Values', 1993, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Barry Sonnenfeld, Donald Peterman, Burtt Harris', 'Paul Rudnick', 'Anjelica Huston, Raúl Juliá, Christopher Lloyd, Joan Cusack, Christina Ricci, Carol Kane, Jimmy Workman, David Krumholtz', 'PG-13', 'Siblings Wednesday and Pugsley Addams will stop at nothing to get rid of Pubert, the new baby boy adored by parents Gomez and Morticia. Things go from bad to worse when the new "black widow" nanny, Debbie Jellinsky, launches her plan to add Fester to her collection of dead husbands.', 'Siblings Wednesday and Pugsley Addams will stop at nothing to get rid of Pubert, the new baby boy adored by parents Gomez and Morticia. Things go from bad to worse when the new "black widow" nanny, Debbie Jellinsky, launches her plan to add Fester to her collection of dead husbands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdxT2VjVSx9DRicwnuECUdBHeE7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2758'),
  ('717165579820385272', 'Addicted', 2002, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery, Romance', 'Park Young-hoon, Kim Byeong-il', 'Byun Won-mi, Song Min-ho, Kwak Jae-yong', 'Lee Byung-hun, Lee Mi-yeon, Park Sun-young, Lee Eol, Kang Ye-won, Ji Dae-han, Kim Tae-hun, Lee Woo-jin', null, 'Two brothers get into a sudden tragic accident and they both fall into a coma at the same time. A year later, the younger brother Dae-jin wakes up believing he is his older brother Ho-jin.', 'Two brothers get into a sudden tragic accident and they both fall into a coma at the same time. A year later, the younger brother Dae-jin wakes up believing he is his older brother Ho-jin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znBcfFX8BjFDCDwiW5MrKqXPKhT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67025'),
  ('1018064849854346948', 'Addicted', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Bille Woodruff', 'Christina Welsh, Ernie Barbarash', 'Sharon Leal, Boris Kodjoe, John Newberg, Brandon Gonzales, Cameron Mills, Emayatzy Corinealdi, Garrett Hines, Hunter Burke', 'R', 'A gallerist risks her family and flourishing career when she enters into an affair with a talented painter and slowly loses control of her life.', 'A gallerist risks her family and flourishing career when she enters into an affair with a talented painter and slowly loses control of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fAERrD6vvmznDoL99wlgjhSfPcH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235271'),
  ('780907421909952668', 'Addicted to Acting', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Andres Veiel', 'Andres Veiel', null, null, 'The Ernst Busch Academy is one of Germany''s best respected acting schools, and every year hundreds of would-be thespians apply in hopes that they''ll be chosen for their rigorous program of study. Filmmaker Andres Veiel chose four students at random as they were accepted at the Busch Academy, and in the documentary Die Spielwuetigen, he allows us to eavesdrop on them as they spend four years learning their craft and growing from callow youngsters to adults in search of their big break.', 'The Ernst Busch Academy is one of Germany''s best respected acting schools, and every year hundreds of would-be thespians apply in hopes that they''ll be chosen for their rigorous program of study. Filmmaker Andres Veiel chose four students at random as they were accepted at the Busch Academy, and in the documentary Die Spielwuetigen, he allows us to eavesdrop on them as they spend four years learning their craft and growing from callow youngsters to adults in search of their big break.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXiJpqQ24raLVveIHAkG1QuurqC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149872'),
  ('382550721698378001', 'Addicted to Fresno', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Jamie Babbit, Jeffrey Waldron', 'Karey Dornetto', 'Judy Greer, Natasha Lyonne, Aubrey Plaza, Clea DuVall, Ron Livingston, Allison Tolman, Molly Shannon, Fred Armisen', 'NR', 'Two co-dependent sisters, a recovering sex addict and a lonely lesbian who work as hotel maids in Fresno, go to ludicrous lengths to cover up an accidental crime.', 'Two co-dependent sisters, a recovering sex addict and a lonely lesbian who work as hotel maids in Fresno, go to ludicrous lengths to cover up an accidental crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFoDP8JBZFA0r0wMgPGvQyi6IrA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301629'),
  ('951945810553653650', 'Addicted to Love', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Griffin Dunne, Andrew Dunn, Amy Lauritsen', 'Robert Gordon', 'Meg Ryan, Matthew Broderick, Kelly Preston, Tchéky Karyo, Maureen Stapleton, Nesbitt Blaisdell, Remak Ramsay, Lee Wilkof', 'R', 'Good-natured astronomer Sam is devastated when the love of his life leaves him for a suave Frenchman. He therefore does what every other normal dumpee would do — go to New York and set up home in the abandoned building opposite his ex-girlfriend''s apartment, wait until she decides to leave her current lover, and then win her back.', 'Good-natured astronomer Sam is devastated when the love of his life leaves him for a suave Frenchman. He therefore does what every other normal dumpee would do — go to New York and set up home in the abandoned building opposite his ex-girlfriend''s apartment, wait until she decides to leave her current lover, and then win her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRfuSc6E9GvVaOHdPv4vG3ywfMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2058'),
  ('298567724844236280', 'Addiction', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Minna Virtanen, Jouni Mutanen, Mark Stubbs', 'Lara Moon', 'Mi Grönlund, Nicke Lignell, Jasper Pääkkönen, Amira Khalifa, Hanna Karjalainen, Saija Lentonen, Jukka Puotila, Miska Kaukonen', null, '30-something Jonna, successful executive with cozy architect husband Niklas and two children, leads a double life. She is constantly on the lookout for quick casual sex. When she starts seeing handsome and rich young yacht owner Aleksi, things start going awry in her life. While her sister Sanna provides her with suitable alibis,sex therapist Nora tries to help her come to terms with her addiction', '30-something Jonna, successful executive with cozy architect husband Niklas and two children, leads a double life. She is constantly on the lookout for quick casual sex. When she starts seeing handsome and rich young yacht owner Aleksi, things start going awry in her life. While her sister Sanna provides her with suitable alibis,sex therapist Nora tries to help her come to terms with her addiction', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oyE1dGFYalNjFAC9V2wWneXKtGJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20162'),
  ('1076581204907918968', 'Addictions and Subtractions', 2004, 'Drama', 'Víctor Gaviria', 'Víctor Gaviria, Hugo Restrepo', 'Alonso Arias, Fabio Restrepo, Fredy York Monsalve, Juan Carlos Uribe, Ana Isabel Velásquez, María Isabel Gaviria, Ana María Naranjo, José Rincón', null, 'A look at the notorious Colombian Medellin cocaine cartel. Former coke addict has built a new life as contractor, but cannot shake off his past on drugs.', 'A look at the notorious Colombian Medellin cocaine cartel. Former coke addict has built a new life as contractor, but cannot shake off his past on drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qliOZ0X4vO9cD7oImKivGncbFrS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258450'),
  ('913288390524778538', 'Addio al nubilato 2 - L’isola che non c’è', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Francesco Apolloni, Giulio Pietromarchi', 'Francesco Apolloni', 'Antónia Lišková, Chiara Francini, Laura Chiatti, Jun Ichikawa, Marzio El Moety, Francesco Maesti', null, 'In a wonderful hotel on the seashore, preparations are underway for the wedding of Eleonora who will get married in the afternoon to Fabrizio, known as El Tigre. Each of the excited bridesmaids – Vanessa, Linda and Akiko (pregnant with Billo) – gives the bride an accessory to make her outfit more chic. Instead Polina, her mother, gives her a box of jewels: “they belonged to your poor father. The only thing we have left of him." Eleonora is stunned to see that inside her there is not a jewel as she expected but three teeth, a ''relic'' of her father who was killed years earlier in an attack. And since then Polina has asked her to fulfill her father''s wish to be buried in Gorizia, in a small cemetery on the border between Italy and Slovenia.', 'In a wonderful hotel on the seashore, preparations are underway for the wedding of Eleonora who will get married in the afternoon to Fabrizio, known as El Tigre. Each of the excited bridesmaids – Vanessa, Linda and Akiko (pregnant with Billo) – gives the bride an accessory to make her outfit more chic. Instead Polina, her mother, gives her a box of jewels: “they belonged to your poor father. The only thing we have left of him." Eleonora is stunned to see that inside her there is not a jewel as she expected but three teeth, a ''relic'' of her father who was killed years earlier in an attack. And since then Polina has asked her to fulfill her father''s wish to be buried in Gorizia, in a small cemetery on the border between Italy and Slovenia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gW5IB5dvTOXC6EZoDmGpdaFzpxM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1110689'),
  ('146038790300629833', 'Addio fottuti musi verdi', 2017, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Francesco Capaldo', 'Francesco Capaldo, Valerio Cilio, Marco Sani', 'Ciro Priello, Fabio Balsamo, Simone Russo, Beatrice Arnera, Roberto Zibetti, Fortunato Cerlino, Salvatore Esposito, Gigi D''Alessio', null, 'Young Ciro Priello, an ultra-skilled Neapolitan graphic, can not find a job that satisfies and appreciates him. After sending the curriculum practically everywhere, he just have to send a copy in space. He will thus be able to work for an alien society based on competence and meritocracy.', 'Young Ciro Priello, an ultra-skilled Neapolitan graphic, can not find a job that satisfies and appreciates him. After sending the curriculum practically everywhere, he just have to send a copy in space. He will thus be able to work for an alien society based on competence and meritocracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ACERZQZWcWoKzsEoozXJ8DAXki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469876'),
  ('648166091615595657', 'Addition', 2026, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Marcelle Lunam', 'Becca Johnstone', 'Teresa Palmer, Joe Dempsie, Eamon Farren', 'R', 'A woman counts everything because numbers hold her world together, but when a chance encounter with a man turns her world upside down, her meticulously ordered life starts to unravel.', 'A woman counts everything because numbers hold her world together, but when a chance encounter with a man turns her world upside down, her meticulously ordered life starts to unravel.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FvGhd37yFzGBX7NLmKxv8LPvRo9c.jpg', 'plex:movie:addition-2026'),
  ('809649275583084739', 'Addition and Subtraction', 1900, 'Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'A magician performs tricks involving three women, who are sometimes merged together into one corpulent female.', 'A magician performs tricks involving three women, who are sometimes merged together into one corpulent female.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8MN8IsZmnKVZuNtREgMhDIEAUD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106024'),
  ('901988560831759209', 'Address Unknown', 1944, 'Drama, Thriller', 'William Cameron Menzies, Rudolph Maté, John Sherwood', 'Herbert Dalmas', 'Paul Lukas, Carl Esmond, Peter van Eyck, Mady Christians, Morris Carnovsky, K.T. Stevens, Emory Parnell, Mary Young', null, 'When a German art dealer living in the US returns to his native country he finds himself attracted to Nazi propaganda.', 'When a German art dealer living in the US returns to his native country he finds himself attracted to Nazi propaganda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eitmE8snK3kIHhbeoHqwIPRtVaB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126759'),
  ('574391712432854600', 'Address Unknown', 1997, 'Adventure, Family', 'Shawn Levy', null, 'Kyle Howard, Johna Stewart-Bowden, Patrick Renna, Corbin Allred, Michael Flynn, Scott Wilkinson, Suzanne Barnes, Dave Bartholomew', 'PG', 'A 16 year old boy who had thought that his father''s death was an accident, suspects otherwise when he receives a 10-year-old lost letter his father had written just before his death.', 'A 16 year old boy who had thought that his father''s death was an accident, suspects otherwise when he receives a 10-year-old lost letter his father had written just before his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vH7Vt6vBtO7Zro3BzyKkKXwo5IU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195957'),
  ('739616083385852158', 'Address Unknown', 2001, 'Drama', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Yang Dong-geun, Ban Min-jeong, Kim Young-min, Son Min-seok, Pang Eun-jin, Lee In-ok, Cho Jae-hyun, Dong Bang-woo', null, 'Romances end in blood and the frail hopes of individuals are torn apart in a vile karmic continuity of colonialism, civil war and occupation. After surviving Japanese colonization, Korea became the first war zone of the Cold War. The legacy of war remains today in this divided country.', 'Romances end in blood and the frail hopes of individuals are torn apart in a vile karmic continuity of colonialism, civil war and occupation. After surviving Japanese colonization, Korea became the first war zone of the Cold War. The legacy of war remains today in this divided country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vnW8ggyUyZucOVFANdgw2O1pCk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25650'),
  ('658151320283877941', 'Adebar', 1958, null, 'Peter Kubelka', null, null, null, 'Adebar is the first of Peter Kubelka''s ''metric films'', in which every element of the composition is precisely ordered and in relation to the gestalt. The film is made up of single units---13, 26 and 52 frames long---which are subjected to a complex rule-system, including a strict use of positive and negative space, that determines their structure within the film.', 'Adebar is the first of Peter Kubelka''s ''metric films'', in which every element of the composition is precisely ordered and in relation to the gestalt. The film is made up of single units---13, 26 and 52 frames long---which are subjected to a complex rule-system, including a strict use of positive and negative space, that determines their structure within the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbR9iOaqHeizUWZxrD95fjsHKSf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130314'),
  ('599615126923224217', 'Adela Has Not Had Supper Yet', 1978, 'Comedy, Crime, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Oldřich Lipský, Květa Lehovcová, Milan Jonáš', 'Jiří Brdečka, Oldřich Lipský', 'Michal Dočolomanský, Rudolf Hrušínský, Miloš Kopecký, Ladislav Pešek, Naďa Konvalinková, Václav Lohniský, Květa Fialová, Olga Schoberová', null, 'When famous detective Nick Carter visits Prague, he becomes involved in strange case of a missing dog and even stranger carnivorous plant. He becomes convinced that he is standing against his greatest enemy, the Gardener, who supposedly died years ago in a swamp...', 'When famous detective Nick Carter visits Prague, he becomes involved in strange case of a missing dog and even stranger carnivorous plant. He becomes convinced that he is standing against his greatest enemy, the Gardener, who supposedly died years ago in a swamp...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bEeCFpdaWjRpyN2wpOY2wuD42y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20087'),
  ('829453996164665899', 'Adelaide', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Justin Amorim, Edward Herrera', 'Justin Amorim', 'Diana Marquês Guerra, Anabela Teixeira, Alba Baptista, Mikaela Lupu, José Fidalgo, João Mota, Alda Gomes, Rúben Rua', null, 'In the most anticipated interview of the year, sisters Adelaide, Carolina and Julia Paixão come together with their mother Anita - to recount the events that led to one of the most controversial crimes ever committed in Portugal.', 'In the most anticipated interview of the year, sisters Adelaide, Carolina and Julia Paixão come together with their mother Anita - to recount the events that led to one of the most controversial crimes ever committed in Portugal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ab8XwQ7cYh4gXHwKBjtOcMsiter.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513195'),
  ('563416806733572988', 'Adele One Night Only', 2021, 'Music, Documentary', 'Paul Dugdale', null, 'Adele, Oprah Winfrey, Lizzo, Melissa McCarthy, Gabrielle Union, James Corden, Dwyane Wade, Ava DuVernay', null, 'A primetime special with performances from the superstar including Adele’s first new material in six years plus her chart-topping hits. The special will also feature an exclusive interview with Adele by Oprah Winfrey from her rose garden, in Adele’s first televised wide-ranging conversation.', 'A primetime special with performances from the superstar including Adele’s first new material in six years plus her chart-topping hits. The special will also feature an exclusive interview with Adele by Oprah Winfrey from her rose garden, in Adele’s first televised wide-ranging conversation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7tO3IHm02FqRvE4R78bDkYX1Al.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:896633'),
  ('105354500059246773', 'Adelheid', 1970, 'Drama, Romance', 'František Vláčil, Aleš Dospiva, Milena Kropáčková', 'František Vláčil, Vladimír Körner', 'Petr Čepek, Emma Černá, Jan Vostrčil, Pavel Landovský, Jana Krupičková, Lubomír Tlalka, Miloš Willig, Karel Hábl', null, 'In the aftermath of World War II, a soldier takes charge of a manor formerly owned by a German family and falls in love with the daughter, now a maid. Their relationship forces him to confront the tension between his love and his conscience.', 'In the aftermath of World War II, a soldier takes charge of a manor formerly owned by a German family and falls in love with the daughter, now a maid. Their relationship forces him to confront the tension between his love and his conscience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oN9b2eSUasNpgp3clgxMEc1miAK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113456'),
  ('1018967252944289509', 'Adhémar or the Toy of Destiny', 1951, 'Comedy', 'Fernandel', 'Sacha Guitry', 'Fernandel, Bernadette Lange, Andrex, Marcel Lévesque, Marguerite Pierry, Jacques François, Jacqueline Pagnol, Meg Lemonnier', null, 'Is it because his father was a groom that Adhémar Pomme has a long horse head and a horse- toothed smile? Maybe but the fact is that his head has invariably caused laughter whatever the circumstances, which is the tragedy of his life. After having worked as an undertaker, a theater prompter, a casino bouncer, and so on, and failing at each job, he applies out of desperation to an institution where those rejected for physical reasons can hide and live together. But Adhémar immediately starts... laughing at them and gets kicked out as a result! In the end though, he finds his way as a circus artist.', 'Is it because his father was a groom that Adhémar Pomme has a long horse head and a horse- toothed smile? Maybe but the fact is that his head has invariably caused laughter whatever the circumstances, which is the tragedy of his life. After having worked as an undertaker, a theater prompter, a casino bouncer, and so on, and failing at each job, he applies out of desperation to an institution where those rejected for physical reasons can hide and live together. But Adhémar immediately starts... laughing at them and gets kicked out as a result! In the end though, he finds his way as a circus artist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56qgZSqxM8b2AS3imUjo1jVWfTX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74607'),
  ('765266719912371502', 'Adicolor Yellow', 2006, 'Science Fiction', 'Neill Blomkamp, Trent Opaloch', 'Neill Blomkamp, Terri Tatchell', 'Julien Phipps, Gideon Karmel, Jason Bell, Jae Lee, Bob Dong, Hamish Cameron, Irene Astle, Dusan Marusák', null, 'Yellow or Adicolor Yellow is a 2006 futuristic short film by director Neill Blomkamp, written by Terri Tatchell and Blomkamp. It was produced at the request of sportswear maker Adidas as a part of its "Adicolor" viral ads campaign, in which advertising agency Idealogue gathered seven directors, assigning a different color to each of them, and asked them to produce a feature based on their emotional and creative response to the given color, later to be distributed in the form of podcasts. The four-minute film, shot by Trent Opaloch in Blomkamp''s usual handheld camera mockumentary style, deals with an Israeli robotic globe-trotter gone rogue.', 'Yellow or Adicolor Yellow is a 2006 futuristic short film by director Neill Blomkamp, written by Terri Tatchell and Blomkamp. It was produced at the request of sportswear maker Adidas as a part of its "Adicolor" viral ads campaign, in which advertising agency Idealogue gathered seven directors, assigning a different color to each of them, and asked them to produce a feature based on their emotional and creative response to the given color, later to be distributed in the form of podcasts. The four-minute film, shot by Trent Opaloch in Blomkamp''s usual handheld camera mockumentary style, deals with an Israeli robotic globe-trotter gone rogue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3z0013isIwGxA5PA03qpNZv3mPz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47618'),
  ('669032910443253167', 'Adidas Vs. Puma: The Brother''s Feud', 2016, 'Drama', 'Georgij Pestov, Oliver Dommenget', 'Christian Schnalke', 'Ken Duken, Torben Liebrecht, Christopher Gareisen, Martin Hentschel, David C. Bunners, Florian Bartholomäi, Nadja Becker, Picco von Groote', null, 'Two brothers start a sportswear company in the 1920s, hoping to make the best shoes in the world. Their relationship deteriorates until they become bitter rivals.', 'Two brothers start a sportswear company in the 1920s, hoping to make the best shoes in the world. Their relationship deteriorates until they become bitter rivals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpONaTUC5J8DzoGZ0dKmRtENlwz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359483'),
  ('161150237391900060', 'Adieu Bohème', 2017, 'Drama', 'Jeanne Frenkel, Cosme Castro', 'Cosme Castro, Jeanne Frenkel', 'Thibaut Évrard, Richard Sammel, Lucie Digout, Pascal Rénéric, Fanny Santer, Louis Arène, Anne-Gaëlle Jourdain, Grégoire Tachnakian', null, 'Once the show is over at Bastille Opera''s 6th basement, Professor Turrel and his team open their shop. The service offers the opportunity for couples to say goodbye beautifully: recycling sets, performers and musicians. But tonight, we follow Thibaut''s story: a man who couldn''t say goodbye to his love.', 'Once the show is over at Bastille Opera''s 6th basement, Professor Turrel and his team open their shop. The service offers the opportunity for couples to say goodbye beautifully: recycling sets, performers and musicians. But tonight, we follow Thibaut''s story: a man who couldn''t say goodbye to his love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXQPjOZW6lMJMWlO94ki2jc1o9B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890750'),
  ('1096452906144042393', 'Adieu Bonaparte', 1985, 'Drama, History, War', 'Youssef Chahine, Yousry Nasrallah, Hassan El Geretly', 'Youssef Chahine, Yousry Nasrallah, Mohsen Mohey ElDein', 'Mohsen Mohey ElDein, Ahmed Abdelaziz, Gamil Ratib, Michel Piccoli, Patrice Chéreau, Abla Kamel, Mohsena Tawfiq, Seif Abdelrahman', null, 'This big-budget historical epic from acclaimed Egyptian director Youssef Chahine features a crazed turn by Patrice Chereau as Napoleon Bonaparte. The film, an Egyptian-French co-production, deals with Napoleon''s occupation of Alexandria and its effect on a typical Egyptian family. Michel Piccoli leads the cast as a general in Napoleon''s army who tentatively befriends a local poet.', 'This big-budget historical epic from acclaimed Egyptian director Youssef Chahine features a crazed turn by Patrice Chereau as Napoleon Bonaparte. The film, an Egyptian-French co-production, deals with Napoleon''s occupation of Alexandria and its effect on a typical Egyptian family. Michel Piccoli leads the cast as a general in Napoleon''s army who tentatively befriends a local poet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FNGsNpIPwwsUh09kX0KTQxyG39.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198471'),
  ('319188854302084117', 'Adieu Galaxy Express 999', 1981, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Rintaro, Kazuo Komatsubara, Takao Yoshizawa', 'Leiji Matsumoto', 'Masako Nozawa, Masako Ikeda, Reiko Tajima, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Tohru Emori, Ryoko Kinomiya, Kei Tomiyama, Yoko Asagami', null, 'Two years after the events of Galaxy Express 999, Earth has become a battlefield, and Tetsuro is summoned to board the Three-Nine once more. In this, the shattering, full-length theatrical conclusion to Leiji Matsumoto''s epic story, all questions will be answered and all mysteries will be revealed as Tetsuro embarks on a journey which will reveal a secret so awful, even Maetel herself can hardly bear to speak of it.', 'Two years after the events of Galaxy Express 999, Earth has become a battlefield, and Tetsuro is summoned to board the Three-Nine once more. In this, the shattering, full-length theatrical conclusion to Leiji Matsumoto''s epic story, all questions will be answered and all mysteries will be revealed as Tetsuro embarks on a journey which will reveal a secret so awful, even Maetel herself can hardly bear to speak of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OcNyx3gxR52IMpSVY2entIok8H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59717'),
  ('93370441382386733', 'Adieu Gary', 2009, 'Drama', 'Nassim Amaouche', 'Nassim Amaouche', 'Jean-Pierre Bacri, Dominique Reymond, Yasmine Belmadi, Mhamed Arezki, Sabrina Ouazani, Alexandre Bonnin, Hab-Eddine Sebiane, Azzedine Bouabba', null, 'Au milieu de nulle part, une cité ouvrière vidée de sa population depuis quelques années déjà. Pourtant, certains habitants ont décidé d''y rester, plus par choix que par nécessité, parce que c''est là qu''ils sont nés et qu''ils ont grandi. Parmi eux il y a Francis, l''ouvrier consciencieux qui continue d''entretenir la machine sur laquelle il a travaillé toute sa vie ; Samir, son fils.', 'Au milieu de nulle part, une cité ouvrière vidée de sa population depuis quelques années déjà. Pourtant, certains habitants ont décidé d''y rester, plus par choix que par nécessité, parce que c''est là qu''ils sont nés et qu''ils ont grandi. Parmi eux il y a Francis, l''ouvrier consciencieux qui continue d''entretenir la machine sur laquelle il a travaillé toute sa vie ; Samir, son fils.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rS2OZhIePZlkmgYk9W8jlvKnKd2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33912'),
  ('134925365824781713', 'Adieu Paris', 2013, 'Drama', 'Hagen Bogdanski, Franziska Buch', 'Martin Rauhaus', 'Jessica Schwarz, Hans-Werner Meyer, Jean-Yves Berteloot, Sandrine Bonnaire, Massimo Brancatelli, Ina Weisse, Thure Lindhardt, Hannes Hellmann', null, 'Bank manager Frank and writer Patrizia meet by coincidence again and again at the airport. They commute between Dusseldorf and Paris, but behind their travels are two fateful stories. Frank wants to complete the business of his life, Patrizia visits her lover, who is in a coma since a car accident. For both life comes out of joint and they each suffer heavy losses. What connects them is the search for hold, a listener, the need to be needed and the hope that there is a beginning in each end.', 'Bank manager Frank and writer Patrizia meet by coincidence again and again at the airport. They commute between Dusseldorf and Paris, but behind their travels are two fateful stories. Frank wants to complete the business of his life, Patrizia visits her lover, who is in a coma since a car accident. For both life comes out of joint and they each suffer heavy losses. What connects them is the search for hold, a listener, the need to be needed and the hope that there is a beginning in each end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Auczoy4JCkFRO4w7AtNAUsrM8eM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250796'),
  ('358687005867527147', 'Adieu Paris', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Édouard Baer, Alexis Kavyrchine', 'Édouard Baer, Marcia Romano', 'Pierre Arditi, Benoît Poelvoorde, François Damiens, Isabelle Nanty, Gérard Depardieu, Bernard Murat, Daniel Prévost, Jackie Berroyer', null, 'An old Parisian bistro with eternal charm. Eight gentlemen at the table, eight great figures. They were the “kings of Paris”… National treasures, masterpieces in peril. A well-honed ritual ... A sense of humor and self-deprecation intact. Tenderness and cruelty. Eight old friends who hate and love each other. And suddenly an intruder ...', 'An old Parisian bistro with eternal charm. Eight gentlemen at the table, eight great figures. They were the “kings of Paris”… National treasures, masterpieces in peril. A well-honed ritual ... A sense of humor and self-deprecation intact. Tenderness and cruelty. Eight old friends who hate and love each other. And suddenly an intruder ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2p3megjuj0k5kjY7O94RVV0JrCu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:883800'),
  ('225802187979298296', 'Adieu Philippine', 1962, 'Drama', 'Jacques Rozier, René Mathelin, Michel Cavillon', 'Michèle O''Glor, Jacques Rozier', 'Jean-Claude Aimini, Yveline Cery, Vittorio Caprioli, Stefania Sabatini, Daniel Descamps, David Tonelli, Annie Markhan, Maurice Garrel', null, 'Michel is a young technician in the fledgling TV industry and is due for military service in two months at the time of the Algerian War. Juliette and Liliane are inseparable best friends, and aspiring actresses, who hang around outside the TV studio. Michel invites them in to watch, flirts with them both, and dates them separately and together. When Michel goes on a holiday to Corsica, just before he is drafted, the girls follow.', 'Michel is a young technician in the fledgling TV industry and is due for military service in two months at the time of the Algerian War. Juliette and Liliane are inseparable best friends, and aspiring actresses, who hang around outside the TV studio. Michel invites them in to watch, flirts with them both, and dates them separately and together. When Michel goes on a holiday to Corsica, just before he is drafted, the girls follow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMsWl13cKCgCV6SAALtQTZEt5Ou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63880'),
  ('209977026993032096', 'Adile Teyze', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Salih Dikişçi, Alev Akarar', 'Alev Akarar', 'Adile Naşit, Şener Şen, Nükhet Egeli, Mahmut Hekimoğlu, Ayşen Gruda, Hülya Tuğlu, Hulusi Kentmen, Baykal Kent', null, 'A story of an old woman''s sacrifice in the name of a baby.', 'A story of an old woman''s sacrifice in the name of a baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzCrbRunqChRhQRHkmzjsAmFbvZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141218'),
  ('656428907818583773', 'Adiós Buenos Aires', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Germán Kral', 'Germán Kral, Stephan Puchner, Fernando Castets', 'Diego Cremonesi, Marina Bellati, Manuel Vicente, Regina Lamm, Rafael Spregelburd, Carlos Portaluppi, Mario Alarcón, Luis Ziembrowski', null, 'Buenos Aires, November 2001. Argentina is embroiled in crisis, with the Peso plunging deeper and deeper. Julio Färber, the charismatic bandoneon player of the ''Vecinos de Pompeya'', a five-piece working-class tango band, is trying to keep his head above water, but every month he is earning less and less from their gigs as well as from the traditional shoe shop he inherited from his father. At the very moment he takes the decision to leave his beloved Buenos Aires forever, it clearly appears that life is conspiring against him: overnight, the government freezes all bank accounts in the whole country, preventing Julio from purchasing the flight tickets and sparking violent protests throughout the town. And Mariela, a witty young woman and feisty cab driver, bumps into his car at full speed, damaging Julio''s last possession of value before stealing his heart.', 'Buenos Aires, November 2001. Argentina is embroiled in crisis, with the Peso plunging deeper and deeper. Julio Färber, the charismatic bandoneon player of the ''Vecinos de Pompeya'', a five-piece working-class tango band, is trying to keep his head above water, but every month he is earning less and less from their gigs as well as from the traditional shoe shop he inherited from his father. At the very moment he takes the decision to leave his beloved Buenos Aires forever, it clearly appears that life is conspiring against him: overnight, the government freezes all bank accounts in the whole country, preventing Julio from purchasing the flight tickets and sparking violent protests throughout the town. And Mariela, a witty young woman and feisty cab driver, bumps into his car at full speed, damaging Julio''s last possession of value before stealing his heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsR7vtjS7LCNSJxfkwEDTP1huWd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084920'),
  ('1092036961699120042', 'Adiós Gringo', 1965, 'Western', 'Giorgio Stegani', 'Harry Whittington', 'Giuliano Gemma, Ida Galli, Nello Pazzafini, Pierre Cressoy, Germano Longo, Massimo Righi, Roberto Camardiel, Frank Braña', null, 'A gunslinger on the run for a murder he didn''t commit goes to New Mexico where he hopes to find a person who can exculpate him. While on his way he finds a girl who has been kidnapped and tortured, sets her free and then takes his revenge at gunpoint.', 'A gunslinger on the run for a murder he didn''t commit goes to New Mexico where he hopes to find a person who can exculpate him. While on his way he finds a girl who has been kidnapped and tortured, sets her free and then takes his revenge at gunpoint.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cbGAPY2zHmgoYfjgyH2ySYSKtda.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66089'),
  ('181280103621011058', 'Adiós Lagunilla, adiós', 1984, 'Comedy', 'René Cardona Jr.', null, 'Rafael Inclán, Leticia Perdigón, Pedro Weber ''Chatanuga'', Lilia Prado, Manuel ''Flaco'' Ibáñez, Maribel Fernández, Lyn May', null, 'Middle-aged couple''s adult children decide to emigrate to USA. Third movie in trilogy.', 'Middle-aged couple''s adult children decide to emigrate to USA. Third movie in trilogy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7SYDD5kVna7qt4HgZeWQ0dXaCgm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601341'),
  ('187015369057938432', 'Adiós, cigüeña, adiós', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Manuel Summers, José Antonio Escrivá, Chumy Chúmez', 'Manuel Summers, Tono', 'María Isabel Álvarez, Francisco Villa, Curro Martín Summers, Beatriz Galbó, Joaquín Gomá, María Rosa Torrico, Alicia Peramó, Luis A. de la Peña', null, 'During a trip to the mountains with their schoolmates, Arturo, who has just turned fifteen, gets thirteen-year-old Paloma pregnant.', 'During a trip to the mountains with their schoolmates, Arturo, who has just turned fifteen, gets thirteen-year-old Paloma pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4NK3b7flWb27smaci2tGcyq03Xu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459304'),
  ('404595412541521141', 'Adios, Hombre', 1967, 'Western', 'Mario Caiano, Sergio Martino, Julio Ortas', 'Mario Caiano, Eduardo Manzanos', 'Craig Hill, Eduardo Fajardo, Piero Lulli, Giulia Rubini, Nello Pazzafini, Eleonora Vargas, Spartaco Conversi, Nazzareno Zamperla', null, 'A man is arrested, tried and convicted for a robbery that was actually committed by someone else. After he gets out of prison, he goes in search of the real robbers.', 'A man is arrested, tried and convicted for a robbery that was actually committed by someone else. After he gets out of prison, he goes in search of the real robbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0cdhJNeJ12qIAPPdHbn6UxyFAi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122746'),
  ('131475637566220710', 'Adiós, Sabata', 1970, 'Western', 'Gianfranco Parolini, Sandro Mancori, Massimo Carocci', 'Gianfranco Parolini, Renato Izzo', 'Yul Brynner, Dean Reed, Ignazio Spalla, Gérard Herter, Sal Borgese, Franco Fantasia, Turam Quibo, Andrea Scotti', 'PG-13', 'Set in Mexico under the rule of Emperor Maximilian I, Sabata is hired by the guerrilla leader Señor Ocaño to steal a wagonload of gold from the Austrian army. However, when Sabata and his partners Escudo and Ballantine obtain the wagon, they find it is not full of gold but of sand, and that the gold was taken by Austrian Colonel Skimmel. So Sabata plans to steal back the gold.', 'Set in Mexico under the rule of Emperor Maximilian I, Sabata is hired by the guerrilla leader Señor Ocaño to steal a wagonload of gold from the Austrian army. However, when Sabata and his partners Escudo and Ballantine obtain the wagon, they find it is not full of gold but of sand, and that the gold was taken by Austrian Colonel Skimmel. So Sabata plans to steal back the gold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npA2XK7Gad36fUjPgQbhDB6zxgq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71206'),
  ('102661464268565936', 'Adipurush', 2023, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Vicky Sidana, Om Raut, Kharthik Palani', 'Om Raut', 'Prabhas, Saif Ali Khan, Kriti Sanon, Sunny Singh, Devdatta Nage, Vatsal Sheth, Siddhant Karnick, Gaurrav Walia', 'NR', '7000 years ago, Ayodhya''s Prince Raghava and Prince Sesh along with the Mighty Vanar Warriors travels to the island of Lanka with an aim to rescue Raghava''s wife Janaki, who has been abducted by Lankesh, the king of Lanka.', '7000 years ago, Ayodhya''s Prince Raghava and Prince Sesh along with the Mighty Vanar Warriors travels to the island of Lanka with an aim to rescue Raghava''s wife Janaki, who has been abducted by Lankesh, the king of Lanka.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1H2xEZOixs0z0JKwyjANZiKNNVJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734253'),
  ('768534030232435133', 'Aditya 369', 1991, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'V.S.R. Swamy, Kabir Lal, Singeetam Srinivasa Rao', 'Singeetam Srinivasa Rao', 'Nandamuri Balakrishna, Mohini, Tinnu Anand, Amrish Puri, Tarun, Suthi Velu, Chandramohan, Somayajulu J V', null, 'In a series of events involving a stolen diamond, Krishna and Hema get caught in a time machine and travel through the centuries, encountering historical figures and exploring futuristic worlds.', 'In a series of events involving a stolen diamond, Krishna and Hema get caught in a time machine and travel through the centuries, encountering historical figures and exploring futuristic worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2hMK5jAZYsEiiGIkeVtx7AeOK4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280363'),
  ('57574563621184302', 'Admiral', 2008, 'War, Drama', 'Andrey Kravchuk, Igor Grinyakin, Feliks Król', 'Vladimir Valutskiy', 'Konstantin Khabenskiy, Elizaveta Boyarskaya, Sergei Bezrukov, Anna Kovalchuk, Egor Beroev, Richard Bohringer, Oleg Fomin, Anatoliy Pashinin', null, 'This is a story of a great love facing the greatest drama of the history of Russia. Admiral Kolchak is a true war hero and beloved husband and father. One day he meets Anna, the love of his life and the wife of his best friend. The revolution in his heart faces the revolution in his own country His destiny is to become the Supreme Ruler of Russia.', 'This is a story of a great love facing the greatest drama of the history of Russia. Admiral Kolchak is a true war hero and beloved husband and father. One day he meets Anna, the love of his life and the wife of his best friend. The revolution in his heart faces the revolution in his own country His destiny is to become the Supreme Ruler of Russia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8tZqS6ssVbTs7gow90jaUkvGWQV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13506'),
  ('383867735718615452', 'Admiral', 2015, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Roel Reiné, Roel Reiné, Anneke Assen', 'Alex van Galen, Lars Boom', 'Frank Lammers, Sanne Langelaar, Rutger Hauer, Aurélie Meriel, Charles Dance, Filip Peeters, Derek de Lint, Barry Atsma', null, 'When the young republic of The Netherlands is attacked by England, France and Germany and faces its own civil war no less, only one man, Michael de Ruyter, can lead the county''s strongest weapon, the Dutch fleet.', 'When the young republic of The Netherlands is attacked by England, France and Germany and faces its own civil war no less, only one man, Michael de Ruyter, can lead the county''s strongest weapon, the Dutch fleet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/li4FlbrBWWNk9VnyATNXVYIU7hl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277154'),
  ('1005296823739519931', 'Admiral Ushakov', 1953, 'History', 'Mikhail Romm, Yu-Lan Chen, Aleksandr Shelenkov', 'Aleksandr Shtein', 'Ivan Pereverzev, Boris Livanov, Nikolai Svobodin, Nikolai Chistyakov, Gennadi Yudin, Vladimir Druzhnikov, Aleksei Alekseyev, Sergey Bondarchuk', null, 'Historical epic about the legendary Russian naval commander of the 18th century, admiral Fyodor Ushakov, and his fight for Crimea during the Russo-Turkish War.', 'Historical epic about the legendary Russian naval commander of the 18th century, admiral Fyodor Ushakov, and his fight for Crimea during the Russo-Turkish War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n90vG5W1ac93mQwtMIByQUEuuL5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207238'),
  ('450477542603202661', 'Admission', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Paul Weitz, Declan Quinn, Christo Morse', 'Karen Croner', 'Tina Fey, Ann Harada, Ben Levin, Dan Levy, Maggie Keenan-Bolger, Gloria Reuben, Paul Rudd, Wallace Shawn', 'PG-13', 'Straitlaced Princeton University admissions officer Portia Nathan is caught off-guard when she makes a recruiting visit to an alternative high school overseen by her former classmate, the freewheeling John Pressman. Pressman has surmised that Jeremiah, his gifted yet very unconventional student, might well be the son that Portia secretly gave up for adoption many years ago.', 'Straitlaced Princeton University admissions officer Portia Nathan is caught off-guard when she makes a recruiting visit to an alternative high school overseen by her former classmate, the freewheeling John Pressman. Pressman has surmised that Jeremiah, his gifted yet very unconventional student, might well be the son that Portia secretly gave up for adoption many years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3HoCikJxypRtLJptBwvs7L7etE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144340'),
  ('12775985770092808', 'Ado SPECIAL LIVE "Shinzou" in Cinema', 2025, 'Music, Documentary', 'Toshihito Hirose', null, 'Ado, Takafumi ''CO-K'' Koukei, Naoki Kobayashi, Ryunosuke Morita, Sara Wakui, Tak Matsumoto, Shigeo Aoki', null, 'Attracting 140,000 fans over two days (April 27–28, 2024), “Shinzou” was a legendary performance that established Ado the first solo female artist to perform at the iconic Japan National Stadium. The setlist featured 26 songs including her on-stage duet of “Sakura Biyori and Time Machine (with Hatsune Miku),” the highly acclaimed “DIGNITY” featuring guest guitarist Tak Matsumoto (from B’z), and “Show,” a collaboration song with Universal Studios Japan. The theatrical release promises a fresh and immersive experience for fans who missed the live event or want to relive the moment.', 'Attracting 140,000 fans over two days (April 27–28, 2024), “Shinzou” was a legendary performance that established Ado the first solo female artist to perform at the iconic Japan National Stadium. The setlist featured 26 songs including her on-stage duet of “Sakura Biyori and Time Machine (with Hatsune Miku),” the highly acclaimed “DIGNITY” featuring guest guitarist Tak Matsumoto (from B’z), and “Show,” a collaboration song with Universal Studios Japan. The theatrical release promises a fresh and immersive experience for fans who missed the live event or want to relive the moment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imX6RRMjDtaynGAxmdTMqXKmBnM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1377930'),
  ('1123852704073237912', 'Adolescents', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Sébastien Lifshitz, Paul Guilhaume, Antoine Parouty', 'Sébastien Lifshitz', 'Emma Jaubert, Anaïs Chambeaudie', null, 'Emma and Anaïs are best friends and yet everything in their life seems to set them apart, their social backgrounds but also their personalities. From the age of thirteen to eighteen, Adolescentes follows the two teenagers during these years where radical transformations and first times punctuate daily life. Through their personal stories, the film offers a rare portrait of France and its recent history.', 'Emma and Anaïs are best friends and yet everything in their life seems to set them apart, their social backgrounds but also their personalities. From the age of thirteen to eighteen, Adolescentes follows the two teenagers during these years where radical transformations and first times punctuate daily life. Through their personal stories, the film offers a rare portrait of France and its recent history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5yk0uV2gZcAZVWWzHsurTXbY5X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616331'),
  ('705317760927383833', 'Adolf Hitler - My Part in His Downfall', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Norman Cohen, Terry Maher, Thelma Graves', 'Johnny Byrne, Norman Cohen', 'Jim Dale, Arthur Lowe, Bill Maynard, Tony Selby, Geoffrey Hughes, Spike Milligan, Pat Coombs, Windsor Davies', null, 'London, 1940. Aspiring jazz musician and future comedy legend Terence "Spike" Milligan reluctantly obeys his call-up and joins the Royal Artillery regiment at Bexhill, where he begins training to take part in the War. But along the way Spike and his friends get involved in many amusing - and some not-so amusing - scrapes. A film adaptation of the first volume of Spike Milligan''s war diaries.', 'London, 1940. Aspiring jazz musician and future comedy legend Terence "Spike" Milligan reluctantly obeys his call-up and joins the Royal Artillery regiment at Bexhill, where he begins training to take part in the War. But along the way Spike and his friends get involved in many amusing - and some not-so amusing - scrapes. A film adaptation of the first volume of Spike Milligan''s war diaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3eEqS241pl3dM1azl2K0ep4doIT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20418'),
  ('186165137600861261', 'Adopt a Daddy', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Aïm, Xavier De Choudens, Anaïs Ascaride', 'Charly Delwart, Xavier De Choudens', 'Franck Gastambide, Camille Lellouche, Gringe, Youssef Hajdi, Patrick Chesnais, Melisa Sözen, Liliane Rovère, Jessim Kas', null, 'Damien is a pawn in a primary school, and leads a quiet life. To rescue one of his young students, Bahzad, and his mother from imminent expulsion from the land, Damien reconnects with his parents'' militant past and convinces his sister Mélanie, who has become a formidable business lawyer, her best friend Rudy and a bunch of unlikely pals to accompany him in his new fight. Together, they will break the law by solidarity. And very quickly to be completely exceeded.', 'Damien is a pawn in a primary school, and leads a quiet life. To rescue one of his young students, Bahzad, and his mother from imminent expulsion from the land, Damien reconnects with his parents'' militant past and convinces his sister Mélanie, who has become a formidable business lawyer, her best friend Rudy and a bunch of unlikely pals to accompany him in his new fight. Together, they will break the law by solidarity. And very quickly to be completely exceeded.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2A5ELUnmZmbhb8QpPe8pp6si6aT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528668'),
  ('204128346343384715', 'Adopt a Highway', 2019, 'Drama', 'Logan Marshall-Green, Pepe Avila del Pino, Mikhaela Rosen', 'Logan Marshall-Green', 'Ethan Hawke, Elaine Hendrix, Diane Gaeta, Betty Gabriel, Mo McRae, Chris Sullivan, Nate Mooney, Christopher Heyerdahl', null, 'Russ Millings has just been released from prison after serving 21 years for a 3rd strike conviction for possessing an ounce of marijuana. As he tries to adapt to a world he doesn’t recognize – including trying to learn how to use the internet – he finds an abandoned baby in a dumpster behind the fast food restaurant where he works as a dishwasher. Unsure of what to do, and caught between impulses of kindness and panic, Russ soon realizes this could be his chance at redemption.', 'Russ Millings has just been released from prison after serving 21 years for a 3rd strike conviction for possessing an ounce of marijuana. As he tries to adapt to a world he doesn’t recognize – including trying to learn how to use the internet – he finds an abandoned baby in a dumpster behind the fast food restaurant where he works as a dishwasher. Unsure of what to do, and caught between impulses of kindness and panic, Russ soon realizes this could be his chance at redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2nzyAsOufAhqEEhsr0ArTCQBPz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565348'),
  ('1099201026025542537', 'Adoption', 1975, 'Drama', 'Márta Mészáros, Lajos Koltai, Márta Mészáros', 'Ferenc Grunwalsky, Gyula Hernádi, Márta Mészáros', 'Katalin Berek, Gyöngyvér Vigh, Péter Fried, László Szabó, Flóra Kádár, Janos Boross, Erzsi Varga, István Kaszás', 'NR', 'When middle-aged Kata realises that her life will only be complete if she has a baby of her own, her longstanding-but-married boyfriend Joska refuses to comply. But by developing an unlikely friendship with the angst-ridden teenage orphan Anna, who is also involved in a controversial relationship, Kata discovers aspects of herself, and her role as a woman, that have gone unexamined throughout her entire, lonely life.', 'When middle-aged Kata realises that her life will only be complete if she has a baby of her own, her longstanding-but-married boyfriend Joska refuses to comply. But by developing an unlikely friendship with the angst-ridden teenage orphan Anna, who is also involved in a controversial relationship, Kata discovers aspects of herself, and her role as a woman, that have gone unexamined throughout her entire, lonely life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rblFqH0CKL66LG0JA5qbmfaBsmP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61703'),
  ('109942173154110479', 'Adorable Creatures', 1952, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Christian-Jaque, Bernard-Roland, Raymond Villette', 'Michel Audiard', 'Daniel Gélin, Antonella Lualdi, Danielle Darrieux, Martine Carol, Edwige Feuillère, Renée Faure, Georges Chamarat, Daniel Lecourtois', null, 'Andre Noblet, a 21-year-old French artist falls madly in love with Christine, the mother of two children. He tells Chistine he will tell all to her husband and demand her freedom. Christine learns that her husband has been carrying on a romance of his own and they have a meeting.', 'Andre Noblet, a 21-year-old French artist falls madly in love with Christine, the mother of two children. He tells Chistine he will tell all to her husband and demand her freedom. Christine learns that her husband has been carrying on a romance of his own and they have a meeting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fogTVpi0OW0ktpF9bmckNzCUC6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277414'),
  ('502333728007012539', 'Adorable Liar', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Michel Deville, Claude Lecomte', 'Nina Companéez, Michel Deville', 'Marina Vlady, Macha Méril, Michel Vitold, Jean-Marc Bory, Claude Nicot, Jean-François Calvé, Ginette Letondal, Jean-Pierre Moulin', null, 'Juliette is a young woman who just can''t help lying. She lies to her sister, Sophie, to Sophie''s fiancé Martin, and to all the men she attracts with her womanly charms. But when she falls for an older man, a 40-year old lawyer, her reputation as a liar precedes her and she cannot convince him that she really does love him…', 'Juliette is a young woman who just can''t help lying. She lies to her sister, Sophie, to Sophie''s fiancé Martin, and to all the men she attracts with her womanly charms. But when she falls for an older man, a 40-year old lawyer, her reputation as a liar precedes her and she cannot convince him that she really does love him…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9uAMAaBUuaTxcbwrCO6q6u4GIvw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92247'),
  ('1033425600760336277', 'Adoration', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Atom Egoyan, Paul Sarossy', 'Atom Egoyan', 'Devon Bostick, Scott Speedman, Arsinée Khanjian, Rachel Blanchard, Kenneth Welsh, Noam Jenkins, Yuval Daniel, Jeremy Wright', null, 'For his French-class assignment, a high school student weaves his family history in a news story involving terrorism, and goes on to invite an Internet audience in on the resulting controversy.', 'For his French-class assignment, a high school student weaves his family history in a news story involving terrorism, and goes on to invite an Internet audience in on the resulting controversy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHYpXNJPsYQ3aOK2MTLzsvszlYh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8895'),
  ('232204823614805870', 'Adoration', 2013, 'Drama', 'Anne Fontaine, Christophe Beaucarne, Chris Webb', 'Christopher Hampton', 'Naomi Watts, Robin Wright, Xavier Samuel, James Frecheville, Ben Mendelsohn, Sophie Lowe, Gary Sweet, Jessica Tovey', 'R', 'Lil and Roz are two lifelong friends, having grown up together as neighbors in an idyllic beach town. As adults, their sons have developed a friendship as strong as that which binds their mothers. One summer, all four are confronted by simmering emotions that have been mounting between them, and each find unexpected happiness in relationships that cross the bounds of convention.', 'Lil and Roz are two lifelong friends, having grown up together as neighbors in an idyllic beach town. As adults, their sons have developed a friendship as strong as that which binds their mothers. One summer, all four are confronted by simmering emotions that have been mounting between them, and each find unexpected happiness in relationships that cross the bounds of convention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIQqIeG7Ude0QRUFntdLtsAUEBB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111190'),
  ('203293386013503627', 'Adoration', 2020, 'Drama', 'Fabrice Du Welz, Manuel Dacosse', 'Vincent Tavier, Fabrice Du Welz, Romain Protat', 'Thomas Gioria, Fantine Harduin, Benoît Poelvoorde, Laurent Lucas, Gwendolyn Gourvenec, Anaël Snoek, Martha Canga Antonio, Sandor Funtek', null, 'Paul lives with his mother in the private clinic of doctor Loisel, deeply hidden in the woods. Paul likes to roam the forest and observe nature. One day Gloria, a schizophrenic teenager of around fifteen years old, arrives, and Paul falls in love immediately.', 'Paul lives with his mother in the private clinic of doctor Loisel, deeply hidden in the woods. Paul likes to roam the forest and observe nature. One day Gloria, a schizophrenic teenager of around fifteen years old, arrives, and Paul falls in love immediately.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/crOV6AZSgWehpctIrzmVDHkYyCT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487631'),
  ('10746811837597261', 'Adoration ou la transsubstantiation', 1987, 'Drama, Horror', 'Olivier Smolders, Walther van den Ende, Kamal Dehane', null, 'Catherine Aymerie, Takashi Matsuo', null, 'Based on the real life story of Sagawa, a Japanese student who killed, dismembered and ate a young Dutch girl in Paris.', 'Based on the real life story of Sagawa, a Japanese student who killed, dismembered and ate a young Dutch girl in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2uaGKoW1GP7N6jm6zaOyK1JgJXi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239434'),
  ('459572498994975879', 'Adored', 2003, 'Drama', 'Marco Filiberti', 'Marco Filiberti', 'Marco Filiberti, Urbano Barberini, Alessandra Acciai, Rosalinda Celentano, Francesca D''Aloja, Claudio Vanni, Luigi Diberti, Caterina Guzzanti', null, 'South of France: Riki Kandinski and his elder brother Fredrico, come back to their family castle for their father''s funeral. Fredrico knows nothing about his younger brother, but he notices that he is making big money and living in luxury all for a few days work a week. By pure chance, Fredrico gets his hands on a gay porn magazine and sees his brother in it.', 'South of France: Riki Kandinski and his elder brother Fredrico, come back to their family castle for their father''s funeral. Fredrico knows nothing about his younger brother, but he notices that he is making big money and living in luxury all for a few days work a week. By pure chance, Fredrico gets his hands on a gay porn magazine and sees his brother in it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxliU4cVUnkZlkjp5gerJujU2eJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15737'),
  ('977287011666499498', 'Adrenalin: Fear the Rush', 1996, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Albert Pyun, George Mooradian, Sazzy Lee Calhoun', 'Albert Pyun', 'Christopher Lambert, Natasha Henstridge, Norbert Weisser, Elizabeth Barondes, Xavier Declie, Darrell Davis, Nicholas Guest, Andrew Divoff', 'R', 'In a not-too-distant future, a lethal virus sweeps across Europe, prompting the creation of quarantine refugee camps in the United States. Police officers Delon and Lemieux learn of a grisly murder in the Boston camp and team up to investigate. Suspecting the ruthless killer is infected with the virus, the pair have just hours to stop him before he becomes contagious and infects the entire population.', 'In a not-too-distant future, a lethal virus sweeps across Europe, prompting the creation of quarantine refugee camps in the United States. Police officers Delon and Lemieux learn of a grisly murder in the Boston camp and team up to investigate. Suspecting the ruthless killer is infected with the virus, the pair have just hours to stop him before he becomes contagious and infects the entire population.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azeZdo0MfO3ZcDa0GzgAC7zVP5m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55687'),
  ('478420834364341275', 'Adrenaline', 2022, 'Action', 'Massimiliano Cerchi, Manish Vatssalya', 'Massimiliano Cerchi, Adrian Milnes', 'Louis Mandylor, Costas Mandylor, Constance Payne, Adam Saini, Alexander Hauck, Stephen Satterfield, Iacob Catalin Vladut, James Stokes', null, 'A female FBI agent holidaying in Eastern Europe with her family gets her life upside down when her daughter is kidnapped. She has to team up with a criminal on the run to save her daughter before time runs out.', 'A female FBI agent holidaying in Eastern Europe with her family gets her life upside down when her daughter is kidnapped. She has to team up with a criminal on the run to save her daughter before time runs out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSgqZlz7umts77mEhmEhv9piUKv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1048300'),
  ('101331413040449290', 'Adrenaline Drive', 1999, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Shinobu Yaguchi, Takeshi Hamada', 'Shinobu Yaguchi', 'Hikari Ishida, Masanobu Ando, Tomoharu Hasegawa, Yutaka Matsushige, Yuu Tokui, Yoji Tanaka, Takuji Suzuki, Tarō Suwa', null, 'A gas leak explosion at a yakuza hideout provides a shy nurse and a rental car clerk with the opportunity to take a briefcase full of money. A cross-country chase ensues.', 'A gas leak explosion at a yakuza hideout provides a shy nurse and a rental car clerk with the opportunity to take a briefcase full of money. A cross-country chase ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZqOzX7hThHRiUsGIQ65nxHuC4o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31161'),
  ('551513129534732883', 'Adriana''s Pact', 2017, 'Documentary, History', 'Julio Zúñiga, Lissette Orozco, Brian Martinez', 'Lissette Orozco', 'Adriana Rivas González, Lissette Orozco, Marina González, Francia Rivas González, Jorgelino Vergara, Pablo Parodi, Marco Antonio de la Parra, Javier Rebolledo', null, 'Lissette''s favorite aunt Adriana, who lives in Australia, is arrested in 2007 while visiting her family in Chile and accused of having worked for dictator Pinochet''s notorious secret police, the DINA, and of having participated in the commission of state crimes. When Adriana denies these accusations, Lissette begins to investigate her story in order to film a documentary about her.', 'Lissette''s favorite aunt Adriana, who lives in Australia, is arrested in 2007 while visiting her family in Chile and accused of having worked for dictator Pinochet''s notorious secret police, the DINA, and of having participated in the commission of state crimes. When Adriana denies these accusations, Lissette begins to investigate her story in order to film a documentary about her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0ZBt9fmt5ECupXUe6hF0UHIB6I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441186'),
  ('237196170345834386', 'Adriano Olivetti - La forza di un sogno', 2013, 'TV Movie, Drama, History', 'Michele Soavi, Giuseppe Curti, Stefano Ricciotti', null, 'Luca Zingaretti, Stefania Rocca, Massimo Poggio, Francesca Cavallin, Elena Radonicich, Domenico Diele, Antonella Bavaro, Bruno Armando', null, 'In post–WWII Italy, inspired industrialist Adriano Olivetti oversees the creation of the first all-Italian electronic calculator while theorizing a revolutionary business model based on the idea that profit should be reinvested for the benefits of the whole society. An utopian vision that catches the attention of powerful interests...', 'In post–WWII Italy, inspired industrialist Adriano Olivetti oversees the creation of the first all-Italian electronic calculator while theorizing a revolutionary business model based on the idea that profit should be reinvested for the benefits of the whole society. An utopian vision that catches the attention of powerful interests...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqJIP9porfw6zl3PeUlfAb24WWX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328685'),
  ('175255175705234141', 'Adrienne', 2021, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Andy Ostroy, Trish Govoni', null, 'Andy Ostroy, Paul Rudd, Keri Russell, Cheryl Hines, Nathan Fillion, Lew Temple, Jessie Mueller, Jeremy Sisto', null, 'As the muse of Hal Hartley’s indie classics and as writer/director of the critically acclaimed Waitress, Adrienne Shelly was a shining star in the indie film firmament. A devoted young mother, her life was right on track until her husband found her dead. Filmmaker Andy Ostroy has been fighting to discover the truth about his wife’s death ever since.', 'As the muse of Hal Hartley’s indie classics and as writer/director of the critically acclaimed Waitress, Adrienne Shelly was a shining star in the indie film firmament. A devoted young mother, her life was right on track until her husband found her dead. Filmmaker Andy Ostroy has been fighting to discover the truth about his wife’s death ever since.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UwFTzgAiHBBGSD0IONp848ggkD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:887171'),
  ('170271552496267148', 'Adrift', 2009, 'Drama', 'Heitor Dhalia, Ricardo Della Rosa, Tomás Portella', 'Heitor Dhalia, Vera Egito', 'Laura Neiva, Vincent Cassel, Camilla Belle, Débora Bloch, Izadora Armelin, Max Huszar, Matthew Rougé, Thiare Maia', 'NR', 'A 1980s-set drama about a teenage girl undergoing her sexual awakening when she learns about her father''s infidelities.', 'A 1980s-set drama about a teenage girl undergoing her sexual awakening when she learns about her father''s infidelities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2SSLE5WwaZvH7YygajaHqvC0Sl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39641'),
  ('1111316469120588585', 'Adrift', 2017, 'Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Sérgio Graciano, Alexandre Samori', 'Tiago R. Santos', 'Dalila Carmo, Afonso Pimentel, Dânia Neto, Diogo Amaral, Catarina Gouveia, Lourenço Ortigão', null, 'When a group of friends fail to lower the ladder of their boat, they find themselves stranded in the surrounding waters and struggle to survive.', 'When a group of friends fail to lower the ladder of their boat, they find themselves stranded in the surrounding waters and struggle to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gSmNsz16HyYW5R0GVS54w4AGZx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447076'),
  ('305937523093138665', 'Adrift', 2018, 'Thriller, Romance, Adventure', 'Baltasar Kormákur, Robert Richardson, Andy McLaren', 'Aaron Kandell, Jordan Kandell, David Branson Smith', 'Shailene Woodley, Sam Claflin, Jeffrey Thomas, Elizabeth Hawthorne, Grace Palmer, Tami Ashcraft, Siale Tunoka, Kael Damlamian', 'PG-13', 'Tami Oldham and Richard Sharp couldn''t anticipate that they would be sailing directly into one of the most catastrophic hurricanes in recorded history. In the aftermath of the storm, Tami awakens to find Richard badly injured and their boat in ruins. With no hope of rescue, Tami must now find the strength and determination to save herself and the only man she has ever loved.', 'Tami Oldham and Richard Sharp couldn''t anticipate that they would be sailing directly into one of the most catastrophic hurricanes in recorded history. In the aftermath of the storm, Tami awakens to find Richard badly injured and their boat in ruins. With no hope of rescue, Tami must now find the strength and determination to save herself and the only man she has ever loved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gLDeADaETvwQlQow5szlyuhLbj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429300'),
  ('612793751557465869', 'Adrift in Manhattan', 2007, 'Drama', 'Alfredo Rodriguez de Villa, John Foster, Adrienne Stern', 'Nat Moss', 'Heather Graham, Victor Rasuk, Dominic Chianese, Erika Michels, Marlene Forte, Richard Petrocelli, Karina Arroyave, Adriana Bremont', 'R', 'The lives of three lonely strangers intersect while commuting on New York''s 1 and 9 subway lines.', 'The lives of three lonely strangers intersect while commuting on New York''s 1 and 9 subway lines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxNb2TgZ6EhYROv9J6RGFk78mr0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14063'),
  ('78983007447240809', 'Adrift in Tokyo', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Satoshi Miki, Sohei Tanikawa', 'Satoshi Miki', 'Joe Odagiri, Tomokazu Miura, Kyoko Koizumi, Yuriko Yoshitaka, Kumiko Aso, Eri Fuse, Kami Hiraiwa, Léona Hirota', null, 'A thug offers to pay a law student''s gambling debt if the student will accompany him on a trip across Tokyo.', 'A thug offers to pay a law student''s gambling debt if the student will accompany him on a trip across Tokyo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjB0njL8aBTPeVeoGlnNataDxiJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14525'),
  ('790725882977245012', 'Adú', 2020, 'Drama', 'Sergi Vilanova, Salvador Calvo, Eduardo Esquide', 'Alejandro Hernández', 'Luis Tosar, Álvaro Cervantes, Anna Castillo, Moustapha Oumarou, Miquel Fernández, Jesús Carroza, Adam Nourou, Zayidiyya Dissou', null, 'In a desperate attempt to reach Europe and crouched before an airstrip in Cameroon, a six-year-old boy and his older sister wait to sneak into the holds of an airplane. Not too far away, an environmental activist contemplates the terrible image of an elephant, dead and fangless. Not only do you have to fight against poaching, but you will also have to meet the problems of your newly arrived daughter from Spain. Thousands of kilometers to the north, in Melilla, a group of civil guards prepare to face the furious crowd of sub-Saharan people who have begun the assault on the fence. Three stories linked by a central theme, in which none of its protagonists know that their destinies are doomed to cross and that their lives will no longer be the same.', 'In a desperate attempt to reach Europe and crouched before an airstrip in Cameroon, a six-year-old boy and his older sister wait to sneak into the holds of an airplane. Not too far away, an environmental activist contemplates the terrible image of an elephant, dead and fangless. Not only do you have to fight against poaching, but you will also have to meet the problems of your newly arrived daughter from Spain. Thousands of kilometers to the north, in Melilla, a group of civil guards prepare to face the furious crowd of sub-Saharan people who have begun the assault on the fence. Three stories linked by a central theme, in which none of its protagonists know that their destinies are doomed to cross and that their lives will no longer be the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tigbVfTJ4mJccucmov2UThgOQbJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588009'),
  ('1046171130587197589', 'Adua and Her Friends', 1960, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Armando Nannuzzi, Antonio Pietrangeli, Anna Maria Leone', 'Ruggero Maccari, Ettore Scola, Tullio Pinelli', 'Simone Signoret, Sandra Milo, Emmanuelle Riva, Gina Rovere, Marcello Mastroianni, Valeria Fabrizi, Domenico Modugno, Claudio Gora', null, 'When a brothel closes because of new laws, four of the prostitutes decide to go into business running a restaurant. They discover they cannot escape their past.', 'When a brothel closes because of new laws, four of the prostitutes decide to go into business running a restaurant. They discover they cannot escape their past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etamASh59bdUy6wyUGLxC03U28n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63070'),
  ('11664644578360172', 'Adult Beginners', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ross Katz, Vanja Černjul, Scott Lazar', 'Jeff Cox, Liz Flahive', 'Nick Kroll, Rose Byrne, Bobby Cannavale, Joel McHale, Caitlin FitzGerald, Bobby Moynihan, Josh Charles, Jane Krakowski', 'R', 'A young, hipster entrepreneur crashes and burns on the eve of his company’s big launch. With his entire life in disarray, he leaves Manhattan to move in with his estranged pregnant sister, brother-in-law and three year-old nephew in the suburbs — only to become their manny. Faced with real responsibility, he may finally have to grow up — but not without some bad behavior first.', 'A young, hipster entrepreneur crashes and burns on the eve of his company’s big launch. With his entire life in disarray, he leaves Manhattan to move in with his estranged pregnant sister, brother-in-law and three year-old nephew in the suburbs — only to become their manny. Faced with real responsibility, he may finally have to grow up — but not without some bad behavior first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/H9zeZ4Vr1lPUfOCz07FPn1ENRX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287587'),
  ('945053045794011579', 'Adult Behaviour… It''s All in the Mind', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Felix Herngren, Fredrik Lindström, Göran Hallberg', 'Fredrik Lindström', 'Felix Herngren, Karin Bjurström, Cecilia Ljung, Mikael Persbrandt, Källa Bie, Fredrik Lindström, Alvin Nyström, Magnus Härenstam', null, 'Frank leads a respectable yuppie life working at a noted Stockholm law firm. He has also been married for eight years to his beautiful wife Nenne, who runs an upscale boutique. Yet Frank is deeply bored with his life and is supremely randy. He even fantasizes about the marriage counselor that he and Nenne visit weekly. Eventually, Frank shacks up with a young fetching art student named Sofia, though the experience wracks Frank with guilt. Meanwhile, Nenne''s friend and co-worker Rosie suspects that Frank is having an affair, though she does not have the nerve to tell her. Little does Rosie suspect, however, that her friend is sleeping with her lover Georg, an uptight journalist with an ego the size of Finland. Soon wires get crossed, and all hell breaks loose.', 'Frank leads a respectable yuppie life working at a noted Stockholm law firm. He has also been married for eight years to his beautiful wife Nenne, who runs an upscale boutique. Yet Frank is deeply bored with his life and is supremely randy. He even fantasizes about the marriage counselor that he and Nenne visit weekly. Eventually, Frank shacks up with a young fetching art student named Sofia, though the experience wracks Frank with guilt. Meanwhile, Nenne''s friend and co-worker Rosie suspects that Frank is having an affair, though she does not have the nerve to tell her. Little does Rosie suspect, however, that her friend is sleeping with her lover Georg, an uptight journalist with an ego the size of Finland. Soon wires get crossed, and all hell breaks loose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ltVU6kHBLWvDdgJ6iEJuNQw1AXg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13619'),
  ('156099027502101280', 'Adult Life Skills', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bet Rourich, Rachel Tunnard', 'Rachel Tunnard', 'Jodie Whittaker, Lorraine Ashbourne, Brett Goldstein, Rachael Deering, Eileen Davies, Alice Lowe, Edward Hogg, Ozzy Myers', null, 'Anna is stuck: she’s approaching 30 and has just moved back to her rural home-town, and into a shed in her mother’s backyard. She spends her time working a menial job at a local boating center and hides in the depths of her imagination, making movies with her thumbs. Irritated by her childish behavior, Anna''s mother insists that she move out of her shed and on with her life. When a troubled young boy starts hanging around, the two form an unlikely bond. Through their strange yet mutually beneficial friendship, Anna slowly begins to confront her perpetual state of arrested development.', 'Anna is stuck: she’s approaching 30 and has just moved back to her rural home-town, and into a shed in her mother’s backyard. She spends her time working a menial job at a local boating center and hides in the depths of her imagination, making movies with her thumbs. Irritated by her childish behavior, Anna''s mother insists that she move out of her shed and on with her life. When a troubled young boy starts hanging around, the two form an unlikely bond. Through their strange yet mutually beneficial friendship, Anna slowly begins to confront her perpetual state of arrested development.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XiqACmd8cNOtD0pjxBoS7kWnGH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390592'),
  ('175655159196212892', 'Adult Only Institute', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Choi Moo-yeon', null, 'Kim Min-soo, Yoo Ji-won, Oh Joo-ha, Jo Wan-jin, Jeong Ho-yoon, Bae Yoon-kwon, Ahn So-hee', null, 'Chi-soo is a repeater who gets bullied by his friends. However, he had a secret about his body that rumors wouldn''t die down about... The secret was that he was the possessor of an outstanding package. Rumors about Chi-soo spread and all the women begin to desire him. Chi-soo who realizes what he has, takes revenge on those who bullied him by conquering all their women...', 'Chi-soo is a repeater who gets bullied by his friends. However, he had a secret about his body that rumors wouldn''t die down about... The secret was that he was the possessor of an outstanding package. Rumors about Chi-soo spread and all the women begin to desire him. Chi-soo who realizes what he has, takes revenge on those who bullied him by conquering all their women...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XR1lyewXl4U4VoVTi4Mgn0bmiF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447759'),
  ('660857237296754948', 'Adult World', 2014, 'Comedy', 'James Laxton, Scott Coffey', 'Scott Coffey', 'Emma Roberts, Evan Peters, John Cusack, Armando Riesco, Shannon Woodward, Chris Riggi, Scott Coffey, Jo Mei', 'R', 'Amy, a naive college graduate who believes she''s destined to be a great poet, begrudgingly accepts a job at a sex shop while she pursues a mentorship with reclusive writer Rat Billings.', 'Amy, a naive college graduate who believes she''s destined to be a great poet, begrudgingly accepts a job at a sex shop while she pursues a mentorship with reclusive writer Rat Billings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gI3AmarNB7eJXG0Qe8DzWiYjBWv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143049'),
  ('423912548762623793', 'Adulterers', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama', 'H.M. Coakley, Tony Solis, Andrés Moret Urdampilleta', 'H.M. Coakley', 'Sean Faris, Danielle Savre, Mehcad Brooks, Stephanie Charles, Steffinnie Phrommany, Rebecca Reaney, Phillip Brock, Robert Eric Wise', 'R', 'On a steamy New Orleans afternoon, Sam Deuprey decides to surprise his beautiful wife, Ashley, for their anniversary and comes home early. But Ashley is not alone in the bedroom. She and her lover, Damien are about to learn how far a jealous husband will go.', 'On a steamy New Orleans afternoon, Sam Deuprey decides to surprise his beautiful wife, Ashley, for their anniversary and comes home early. But Ashley is not alone in the bedroom. She and her lover, Damien are about to learn how far a jealous husband will go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7weaBxcimjsN9zi89Dfk4fZFCUE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376004'),
  ('332256354925571232', 'Adultery (A User''s Guide)', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Christine Pascal, Renato Berta', 'Robert Boner, Christine Pascal', 'Richard Berry, Karin Viard, Vincent Cassel, Emmanuelle Halimi, Liliane Rovère, Anny Romand, Hélène Fillières, Patrice-Flora Praxo', null, 'This French farce chronicles one special day in the lives of a married pair of Parisian architects, Fabienne and Bruno, as they anxiously await the results of an important architectual contest they have entered. Unable to handle the stress of waiting, both turn to sexual liason''s to ease their tension. Bruno ends up enacting a dark sexual fantasy with a stranger while Fabienne eventually succumbs to the advances of Bruno''s friend Simon, a fortyish Lebanese businessman and part-time drug dealer. The comedy takes on overtones of psycho-drama when the contest winner announced and the couple discovers the truth of each other''s actions. A cache of drugs, discovered in an apartment only adds to their troubles.', 'This French farce chronicles one special day in the lives of a married pair of Parisian architects, Fabienne and Bruno, as they anxiously await the results of an important architectual contest they have entered. Unable to handle the stress of waiting, both turn to sexual liason''s to ease their tension. Bruno ends up enacting a dark sexual fantasy with a stranger while Fabienne eventually succumbs to the advances of Bruno''s friend Simon, a fortyish Lebanese businessman and part-time drug dealer. The comedy takes on overtones of psycho-drama when the contest winner announced and the couple discovers the truth of each other''s actions. A cache of drugs, discovered in an apartment only adds to their troubles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5zjHQdzVkX1UcFePkmGdZG5BL2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143610'),
