  ('900587086061606242', 'Advancing of ZQ', 2023, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Action', 'Song Yang, Ying Zhang', '毕慷, 董文腾, Song Yang', 'Allen, Tao Hui, Zhang Qi, Han Yanbo, Teng Shen, Anastasiya Sedikova, Ma Li, Teng Ge''er', null, 'Story of Zheng Qian who developed a "financial artifact" app. Unexpectedly, he was watched by a evil man of his hometown. Zheng met a meteorite and got superpower. Now Zheng need to use his superpower vs cash ability.', 'Story of Zheng Qian who developed a "financial artifact" app. Unexpectedly, he was watched by a evil man of his hometown. Zheng met a meteorite and got superpower. Now Zheng need to use his superpower vs cash ability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRvzM5rsJUP2Sye87bU3TH1jcKn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:798753'),
  ('226295501118377409', 'Advantageous', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Jennifer Phang, Richard Wong', 'Jacqueline Kim, Jennifer Phang', 'Jacqueline Kim, James Urbaniak, Freya Adams, Ken Jeong, Jennifer Ehle, Samantha Kim, Troi Zee, Olivia Horton', null, 'In a near-future city where soaring opulence overshadows economic hardship, Gwen and her daughter, Jules, do all they can to hold on to their joy, despite the instability surfacing in their world.', 'In a near-future city where soaring opulence overshadows economic hardship, Gwen and her daughter, Jules, do all they can to hold on to their joy, despite the instability surfacing in their world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xVJdSbDxKTanwZtD6qUyc7cGNpG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308457'),
  ('116656231958661924', 'Advantages of Travelling by Train', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Aritz Moreno, Javier Agirre Erauso, Déborah Borque', 'Javier Gullón', 'Luis Tosar, Pilar Castro, Ernesto Alterio, Quim Gutiérrez, Belén Cuesta, Macarena García, Javier Godino, Stéphanie Magnin', null, 'After interning her insane husband in a remote psychiatric hospital, book editor Helga Pato returns home by train, where she meets a mysterious man who identifies himself as a psychiatrist.', 'After interning her insane husband in a remote psychiatric hospital, book editor Helga Pato returns home by train, where she meets a mysterious man who identifies himself as a psychiatrist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWGnq0UgUWpbFLQFAijYpVeIAVP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587986'),
  ('629018831942283419', 'Adventure', 1945, 'Adventure, Romance, Drama', 'Victor Fleming', 'Vincent Lawrence, Frederick Hazlitt Brennan', 'Clark Gable, Greer Garson, Joan Blondell, Thomas Mitchell, Tom Tully, John Qualen, Richard Haydn, Lina Romay', 'NR', 'A rough and tumble man of the sea falls for a meek librarian.', 'A rough and tumble man of the sea falls for a meek librarian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FinPadaPJ40JDEzfWIi8q4RV3Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44869'),
  ('740835971768089520', 'Adventure at the Center of the Earth', 1965, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Alfredo B. Crevenna, Raúl Martínez Solares', 'José María Fernández Unsáin', 'José Elías Moreno, Carlos Cortés, Kitty de Hoyos, David Reynoso, Columba Domínguez, Javier Solís, Carmen Molina, Ramón Bugarini', null, 'After a young man is killed in an unexplored subterranean cavern and his girlfriend driven mad by something she saw there, a track found at the scene cannot be identified with any known animal and thus a scientific expedition is launched to find out just what it is that is living there.', 'After a young man is killed in an unexplored subterranean cavern and his girlfriend driven mad by something she saw there, a track found at the scene cannot be identified with any known animal and thus a scientific expedition is launched to find out just what it is that is living there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAGg7U7pc4BmkHNy4WOAAAfil5V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87690'),
  ('743268646332422207', 'Adventure in Manhattan', 1936, 'Mystery, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Edward Ludwig, Henry Freulich', 'Harry Sauber, Jack Kirkland, Sidney Buchman', 'Jean Arthur, Joel McCrea, Reginald Owen, Thomas Mitchell, Victor Kilian, John Gallaudet, Emmett Vogan, George Cooper', 'NR', 'The story of an egotistical crime writer who gets involved with the case of a notorious art thief (who is believed to be dead) while at the same time romancing a lovely young actress who''s in a play that also happens to be the cover for massive jewel job. Art connoisseur and criminologist George Melville is hired to track down art thieves, assisted by perky Claire Peyton and goaded by Phil Bane, the roaring newspaper editor who has employed him. The mastermind poses as a theatrical impresario and stages a war drama, replete with loud explosions, to divert attention from his band of thieves, who are cracking safes in a bank adjacent to the theater.', 'The story of an egotistical crime writer who gets involved with the case of a notorious art thief (who is believed to be dead) while at the same time romancing a lovely young actress who''s in a play that also happens to be the cover for massive jewel job. Art connoisseur and criminologist George Melville is hired to track down art thieves, assisted by perky Claire Peyton and goaded by Phil Bane, the roaring newspaper editor who has employed him. The mastermind poses as a theatrical impresario and stages a war drama, replete with loud explosions, to divert attention from his band of thieves, who are cracking safes in a bank adjacent to the theater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWxvJzZ6mWhPo4pJ1cC0v3BkqSt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98301'),
  ('115257458532267225', 'Adventure in Sahara', 1938, 'Adventure, Action', 'D. Ross Lederman, Franz Planer', 'Maxwell Shane', 'Paul Kelly, C. Henry Gordon, Lorna Gray, Robert Fiske, Marc Lawrence, Dick Curtis, Stanley Brown, Al Bridge', null, 'Agadez is a lonely French outpost baking under the desert sun and commanded by the cruel and oppressive Captain Savatt. To it comes, at his own request, Legionnaire Jim Wilson soon followed by his fiancée, Carla Preston, who has been tracing him from post to post. Legionnaires seize the fort and turn Savitt loose in the Arab-haunted desert with only a fraction of the water and food needed to get back to civilization. But Savitt gets through and returns to the fort at the head of an avenging troop of men. But Arabs surround Savitt and his men, and the mutineers, knowing that to leave the fort and aid them means their own death', 'Agadez is a lonely French outpost baking under the desert sun and commanded by the cruel and oppressive Captain Savatt. To it comes, at his own request, Legionnaire Jim Wilson soon followed by his fiancée, Carla Preston, who has been tracing him from post to post. Legionnaires seize the fort and turn Savitt loose in the Arab-haunted desert with only a fraction of the water and food needed to get back to civilization. But Savitt gets through and returns to the fort at the head of an avenging troop of men. But Arabs surround Savitt and his men, and the mutineers, knowing that to leave the fort and aid them means their own death', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4ANedpmB2eSfwVIYkXmNzKaI4s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158821'),
  ('794618491861936305', 'Adventure of an Ant', 1983, 'Animation', 'Eduard Nazarov, Mikhail Druyan, Tatyana Lytko', 'Eduard Nazarov', 'Eduard Nazarov', null, 'A 1983 short film directed by Eduard Nazarov about an ant who gets blown away with the wind from its home and the adventures it goes through in desperately trying to find its way back.', 'A 1983 short film directed by Eduard Nazarov about an ant who gets blown away with the wind from its home and the adventures it goes through in desperately trying to find its way back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zcjEIb72gkLp3K9PoW5i0LAXYe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193216'),
  ('89580958804890421', 'Adventure Planet', 2012, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Kompim Kemgumnird', 'Kongdej Jaturanrasmee, Charoonporn Parapakpralai, Warunyu Udomkanjananon', 'Nuengthida Sophon, Noppan Chantasorn, Athipich Chutiwatkajornchai, Kongdej Jaturanrasmee, Thospol Sirivivat, Boonsri Yindee, Warinda Damrongphol, Kwankaew Khongnisai', 'PG', 'Story of the adventures of three young men from two of the world''s metropolis, New State Trinity Capital and Karen village in Northern Thailand. To help save the world from disaster recovery due to global warming.', 'Story of the adventures of three young men from two of the world''s metropolis, New State Trinity Capital and Karen village in Northern Thailand. To help save the world from disaster recovery due to global warming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pt2SbE1UHMtrX69jAqHMIfPYdXQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136368'),
  ('586191457457040667', 'Adventure Time', 2007, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Mystery, Family, Drama', 'Larry Leichliter, Hugo Morales, Pendleton Ward', 'Pendleton Ward', 'Zack Shada, John DiMaggio, Paige Moss, Dee Bradley Baker, John Kassir, Tom Kenny', null, 'Pen and Jake have to rescue Princess Bubblegum from the antagonistic Ice King.', 'Pen and Jake have to rescue Princess Bubblegum from the antagonistic Ice King.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2K0TUPjiSZSy7tS9IlE7H06WyPM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355460'),
  ('330386715923776644', 'Adventureland', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Greg Mottola, Terry Stacey', 'Greg Mottola', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Kristen Stewart, Martin Starr, Kristen Wiig, Bill Hader, Ryan Reynolds, Margarita Levieva, Jack Gilpin', 'R', 'It''s the summer of 1987, and recent college grad James Brennan can''t wait to begin his long-anticipated dream trip to Europe. Unfortunately, James'' plans come to a screeching halt when his parents announce that they are unable to subsidize his trip. Forced to take a job at the local amusement park, James prepares for the worst summer ever, until he finds love with a captivating co-worker named Em.', 'It''s the summer of 1987, and recent college grad James Brennan can''t wait to begin his long-anticipated dream trip to Europe. Unfortunately, James'' plans come to a screeching halt when his parents announce that they are unable to subsidize his trip. Forced to take a job at the local amusement park, James prepares for the worst summer ever, until he finds love with a captivating co-worker named Em.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeSJNAR1aWcgANq26KWIHm3cbyB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16614'),
  ('658924405199539732', 'Adventures in Babysitting', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Chris Columbus, Gregory P. Keen, Ric Waite', 'David Simkins', 'Elisabeth Shue, Maia Brewton, Keith Coogan, Anthony Rapp, Calvin Levels, Vincent D''Onofrio, Penelope Ann Miller, George Newbern', 'PG-13', 'When plans with her boyfriend fall through, high school senior Chris Parker ends up babysitting the Anderson kids, Brad and Sara. What should be a quiet night in, however, turns into a series of ridiculous exploits, starting when they leave the house to pick up Chris'' friend Brenda. Soon, Brad''s buddy Daryl is involved, and the group must contend with car thieves, blues musicians and much more.', 'When plans with her boyfriend fall through, high school senior Chris Parker ends up babysitting the Anderson kids, Brad and Sara. What should be a quiet night in, however, turns into a series of ridiculous exploits, starting when they leave the house to pick up Chris'' friend Brenda. Soon, Brad''s buddy Daryl is involved, and the group must contend with car thieves, blues musicians and much more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8QiAj0Xw2UMeZMIIfZKeNoIsszs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14367'),
  ('982812111707779488', 'Adventures in Babysitting', 2016, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Charles Minsky, John Schultz', 'Tiffany Paulsen', 'Sabrina Carpenter, Sofia Carson, Nikki Hahn, Mallory James Mahoney, Max Gecowets, Jet Jurgensmeyer, Madison Horcher, Kevin G. Quinn', 'G', 'Two teen rival babysitters, Jenny and Lola, team up to hunt down one of their kids who accidentally ran away into the big city without any supervision.', 'Two teen rival babysitters, Jenny and Lola, team up to hunt down one of their kids who accidentally ran away into the big city without any supervision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t12bYhmv7LIcHT4TGGpW6WaMV2W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360606'),
