  ('995372405700215634', 'Adventures of Ali-Baba and the Forty Thieves', 1980, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Latif Faiziyev, Umesh Mehra, Peter Pereira', 'Shanti Prakash Bakshi, Boris Saakov', 'Dharmendra, Hema Malini, Zeenat Aman, Prem Chopra, Zakir Mukhamedzhanov, Sofiko Chiaureli, Yelena Sanayeva, Mher Mkrtchyan', null, 'A village man accidentally uncovers a web of political intrigue after discovering and distributing treasures from Hussain''s secret hideout. The Khazi sets a gang of ruthless bandits on the man to ensure the safety of his treasures.Based on the story of Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves from the 1001 Nights or Arabian Tales.', 'A village man accidentally uncovers a web of political intrigue after discovering and distributing treasures from Hussain''s secret hideout. The Khazi sets a gang of ruthless bandits on the man to ensure the safety of his treasures.Based on the story of Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves from the 1001 Nights or Arabian Tales.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIQJMdnu5qR1PXuN8gNDdyxvwdx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14478'),
  ('568709788501343775', 'Adventures of Brownie', 1985, 'Animation', 'Aida Zyablikova', 'Marina Vishnevetskaya', 'Georgiy Vitsin, Phelix Ivanov, Svetlana Travkina, Tatyana Pelttser', null, 'Prequel to Kuzya''s story tells about his adventures in the woods, and how he got into Natasha''s apartment.', 'Prequel to Kuzya''s story tells about his adventures in the woods, and how he got into Natasha''s apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxIGIR0XoHCwqwZ12WBVwjlmgtE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448879'),
  ('827714306521926457', 'Adventures of Captain Fabian', 1951, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Marcel Grignon, William Marshall, Robert Florey', 'Errol Flynn', 'Errol Flynn, Micheline Presle, Vincent Price, Agnes Moorehead, Victor Francen, Jim Gérald, Héléna Manson, Howard Vernon', 'NR', 'It all begins with the discreet romance between the Creole maid Lea Mariotte and her young boss, George Brissac, an amoral bourgeois who plans to inherit his uncle''s fortune and marry a young woman from a good family. After an incident where she kills a man, she is saved from the gallows by Fabian, a ship''s captain, who has personal reasons for antagonizing the Brissacs. He takes care of her and falls in love with her, but doesn''t tell her. She, in turn, takes the opportunity to return to her lover Brissac''s arms, forcing him to marry her after seeing him murder his uncle.', 'It all begins with the discreet romance between the Creole maid Lea Mariotte and her young boss, George Brissac, an amoral bourgeois who plans to inherit his uncle''s fortune and marry a young woman from a good family. After an incident where she kills a man, she is saved from the gallows by Fabian, a ship''s captain, who has personal reasons for antagonizing the Brissacs. He takes care of her and falls in love with her, but doesn''t tell her. She, in turn, takes the opportunity to return to her lover Brissac''s arms, forcing him to marry her after seeing him murder his uncle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qY2uebQzurcjcd2963wtk5Ghr6A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119881'),
  ('347501771743954874', 'Adventures of Captain Marvel', 1941, 'Fantasy, Action, Science Fiction, Family', 'John English, William Witney', 'Ronald Davidson, Norman S. Hall, Arch Heath', 'Tom Tyler, Frank Coghlan Jr., William Benedict, Louise Currie, Robert Strange, Harry Worth, Bryant Washburn, Kenne Duncan', null, 'On a scientific expedition to Siam young Billy Batson is given the ability to change himself into the super-powered Captain Marvel by the wizard Shazam, who tells him his powers will last only as long as the Golden Scorpion idol is threatened. Finding the idol, the scientists realize it could be the most powerful weapon in the world and remove the lenses that energize it, distributing them among themselves so that no one would be able to use the idol by himself. Back in the US, Billy Batson, as Captain Marvel, wages a battle against an evil, hooded figure, the Scorpion, who hopes to accumulate all five lenses, thereby gaining control of the super-powerful weapon', 'On a scientific expedition to Siam young Billy Batson is given the ability to change himself into the super-powered Captain Marvel by the wizard Shazam, who tells him his powers will last only as long as the Golden Scorpion idol is threatened. Finding the idol, the scientists realize it could be the most powerful weapon in the world and remove the lenses that energize it, distributing them among themselves so that no one would be able to use the idol by himself. Back in the US, Billy Batson, as Captain Marvel, wages a battle against an evil, hooded figure, the Scorpion, who hopes to accumulate all five lenses, thereby gaining control of the super-powerful weapon', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79YcAqIQ3q29s7l1IuWBCyFvQ31.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61020'),
  ('1006589580869455021', 'Adventures of Captain Vrungel', 1980, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Action', 'Davyd Cherkaskyi, Viktor Hruzdiev, Vladimir Belorussov', 'Ivan Vorobyov', 'Zinoviy Gerdt, Yevhen Papernyi, Heorhii Kyshko, Aleksandr Burmistrov, Semyon Farada, Grigoriy Shpigel, Eduard Nazarov, Venyamin Smekhov', null, 'An old sea captain and his student decide to take part in the international regatta. At the same time an amateur thief steals a statue of Aphrodite from Louvre and boards their yacht by mistake. A long, fun adventure is ahead.', 'An old sea captain and his student decide to take part in the international regatta. At the same time an amateur thief steals a statue of Aphrodite from Louvre and boards their yacht by mistake. A long, fun adventure is ahead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTKUENSIX7Ylam8XTHw05Ec67Uw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74535'),
  ('95999677270942647', 'Adventures of Don Juan', 1948, 'Adventure, Romance, Action', 'Vincent Sherman, Everett Alton Brown, Elwood Bredell', 'Harry Kurnitz, George Oppenheimer, William Faulkner', 'Errol Flynn, Viveca Lindfors, Robert Douglas, Alan Hale, Romney Brent, Ann Rutherford, Robert Warwick, Jerry Austin', 'NR', 'Spanish Lothario Don Juan, the legendary lover and adventurer returns to Spain following a scandal and comes to the aid of his queen, who is under threat from sinister forces.', 'Spanish Lothario Don Juan, the legendary lover and adventurer returns to Spain following a scandal and comes to the aid of his queen, who is under threat from sinister forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kI8MwkTQWBGsFqwDTVkvMDOHg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34233'),
  ('383819020791082215', 'Adventures of Félix', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Jacques Martineau, Olivier Ducastel, Matthieu Poirot-Delpech', 'Olivier Ducastel, Jacques Martineau', 'Sami Bouajila, Pierre-Loup Rajot, Patachou, Charly Figuiere, Ariane Ascaride, Maurice Bénichou, Christiane Millet, Adrien Auzias', null, 'A charming comedy about going on a rather long walk. Félix is a laid-back guy living in the bleak northern coastal town of Dieppe. He lives happily with his lover Daniel and is a soap opera enthusiast and HIV-positive. After losing his job, Félix decides to find the father he never knew in Marseilles. Agreeing to meet Daniel in the southern port city in a week''s time, Félix throws on his backpack and starts hiking. On his way, he discovers that family need not always be connected by blood.', 'A charming comedy about going on a rather long walk. Félix is a laid-back guy living in the bleak northern coastal town of Dieppe. He lives happily with his lover Daniel and is a soap opera enthusiast and HIV-positive. After losing his job, Félix decides to find the father he never knew in Marseilles. Agreeing to meet Daniel in the southern port city in a week''s time, Félix throws on his backpack and starts hiking. On his way, he discovers that family need not always be connected by blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62DDLzTOsqRYX5vWi9v2KflNykS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21488'),
  ('975816777007887305', 'Adventures of Joselito and Tom Thumb', 1960, 'Drama, Family, Music', 'René Cardona, Antonio del Amo', null, 'Joselito, Cesáreo Quezadas ''Pulgarcito'', Enrique Rambal, Óscar Ortiz de Pinedo, Anita Blanch, Nora Veryán, Arturo Castro, Florencio Castelló', null, 'Joselito lives with his grandmother in a fishing village. His father went to America long ago to make a fortune. One day, the boy decides to travel there to meet him. He takes courage and embarks on a fragile boat and miraculously is saved at sea by a vessel that leads him to Mexico where he meets Tom Thumb, a little newsboy who lives many adventures and helps him in the search.', 'Joselito lives with his grandmother in a fishing village. His father went to America long ago to make a fortune. One day, the boy decides to travel there to meet him. He takes courage and embarks on a fragile boat and miraculously is saved at sea by a vessel that leads him to Mexico where he meets Tom Thumb, a little newsboy who lives many adventures and helps him in the search.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9SMNeZji0ijUnOc5F3qIgDExXI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102744'),
