  ('37589780310682986', 'Adventures of Mowgli: Raksha', 1967, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Roman Davydov', null, 'Stepan Bubnov, Lyudmila Kasatkina, Sergei Martinson, Aleksandr Nazarov, Lyusyena Ovchinnikova, Anatoliy Papanov, Yuri Puzyryov, Vladimir Ushakov', null, 'Episode 1. A small child falls into the jungle in the wolf family. He liked the mother wolf Raksha, which gave him the tiger Sher Khan. The wolves raised a human baby named Mowgli. But life in a wolf pack is subject to the law of the jungle. The Council of the pack should decide whether Mowgli live among the beasts or eaten by Shere Khan.', 'Episode 1. A small child falls into the jungle in the wolf family. He liked the mother wolf Raksha, which gave him the tiger Sher Khan. The wolves raised a human baby named Mowgli. But life in a wolf pack is subject to the law of the jungle. The Council of the pack should decide whether Mowgli live among the beasts or eaten by Shere Khan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpUzLw9kxGlDIWSY5irvQejE36e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194148'),
  ('110206430362378975', 'Adventures of Mowgli: Return to Mankind', 1971, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Roman Davydov', null, 'Stepan Bubnov, Lyudmila Kasatkina, Sergei Martinson, Aleksandr Nazarov, Lyusyena Ovchinnikova, Yuri Puzyryov, Vladimir Ushakov, Oleg Vidov', null, 'Episode 5. Mowgli stood the leader of the wolf pack. It''s time to settle with the main enemy of Mowgli tiger Shere Khan. In addition, the jungle comes the time of renewal, blossom and love. Mowgli feels vaguely disturbing. It''s time to leave the jungle and return back to the people.', 'Episode 5. Mowgli stood the leader of the wolf pack. It''s time to settle with the main enemy of Mowgli tiger Shere Khan. In addition, the jungle comes the time of renewal, blossom and love. Mowgli feels vaguely disturbing. It''s time to leave the jungle and return back to the people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbDnCTD5bN8dn95C8cWsmoMiEgB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195083'),
  ('634466938319966346', 'Adventures of Mowgli: The Fight', 1970, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Roman Davydov', null, 'Stepan Bubnov, Lyudmila Kasatkina, Anatoliy Papanov, Sergei Martinson, Aleksandr Nazarov, Lyusyena Ovchinnikova, Yuri Puzyryov, Vladimir Ushakov', null, 'Episode 4. A terrible threat hanging over the wolf tribe and all living inhabit the jungle. On native places for Mowgli is approaching a huge flock of wild red dogs, destroying everything in its path. It seemed nothing to resist them, but Mowgli comes up with as they confront the red Horde.', 'Episode 4. A terrible threat hanging over the wolf tribe and all living inhabit the jungle. On native places for Mowgli is approaching a huge flock of wild red dogs, destroying everything in its path. It seemed nothing to resist them, but Mowgli comes up with as they confront the red Horde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mHMW1PkRGs0Ah4qniIj0utsMZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195080'),
  ('237181493159211520', 'Adventures of Mowgli: The Kidnapping', 1968, 'Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Roman Davydov', null, 'Stepan Bubnov, Lyudmila Kasatkina, Sergei Martinson, Anatoliy Papanov, Lyusyena Ovchinnikova, Yuri Puzyryov, Vladimir Ushakov, Oleg Vidov', null, 'Episode 2. Mowgli — the adopted son of a wolf family. He grows quickly and learns from his mentors. The rumor that the wolf pack living human child, comes to banderlogs. The monkey tribe, decided to make Mowgli their leader. They steal Mowgli and transfer it into a towns ruins in the jungle.', 'Episode 2. Mowgli — the adopted son of a wolf family. He grows quickly and learns from his mentors. The rumor that the wolf pack living human child, comes to banderlogs. The monkey tribe, decided to make Mowgli their leader. They steal Mowgli and transfer it into a towns ruins in the jungle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEdMT7bL6drgraiX6ewT4sy0tEL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195065'),
  ('641904878259661478', 'Adventures of Petrov and Vasechkin, Both Usual and Unbelieveable', 1983, 'Comedy, Family', 'Vladimir Alenikov, Igor Feldshtein, Aleksandr Nikolayevsky', 'Valentin Gorlov, Vladimir Alenikov', 'Egor Druzhinin, Dmitri Barkov, Inga Ilm, Inna Alenikova, Lyudmila Ivanova, Tatyana Bozhok, Yuri Medvedev, Aleksandr Lenkov', null, 'Best friends and mischievous third-graders Vasya Petrov and Petya Vasechkin, despite their differences, share a love for adventures. Romantic Vasya falls for his serious, excellent classmate Masha and writes her an anonymous love note. However, the quick-witted Masha identifies Vasya due to his errors and rejects him harshly. Upset, Vasya confides in Petya, who then devises a cunning plan to win Masha over.', 'Best friends and mischievous third-graders Vasya Petrov and Petya Vasechkin, despite their differences, share a love for adventures. Romantic Vasya falls for his serious, excellent classmate Masha and writes her an anonymous love note. However, the quick-witted Masha identifies Vasya due to his errors and rejects him harshly. Upset, Vasya confides in Petya, who then devises a cunning plan to win Masha over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeAT4dBnyW90pXIP7eKyQHuOoTt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183331'),
  ('807658272261255353', 'Adventures of Power', 2008, 'Comedy, Music', 'Lisa Wiegand, Ari Gold', 'Ari Gold', 'Ari Gold, Michael McKean, Shoshannah Stern, Adrian Grenier, Jane Lynch, Chiu Chi-Ling, Steven Williams, Jimmy Jean-Louis', null, 'In his quest to become the world''s greatest air-drummer, a small-town dreamer must overcome obstacles and ridicule to save the day.', 'In his quest to become the world''s greatest air-drummer, a small-town dreamer must overcome obstacles and ridicule to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlY034R3iQb5trUiM9lbmqsTS2h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30023'),
  ('996071921973821266', 'Adventures of the Road-Runner', 1962, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Paul Julian, Dick Tufeld, Nancy Wible, Mel Blanc, Dick Beals', 'NR', 'Adventures of the Road-Runner is an animated film, directed by Chuck Jones and co-directed by Maurice Noble and Tom Ray. It was the intended pilot for a TV series starring Wile E. Coyote and the Road Runner, but was never picked up until four years later when Warner Bros. Television produced The Road Runner Show for CBS from 1966 to 1968 and later on ABC from 1971 to 1973. As a result, it was split into three further shorts. The first one was To Beep or Not to Beep (1963). The other two were assembled by DePatie-Freleng Enterprises in 1965 after they took over the Looney Tunes series. The split-up shorts were titled Road Runner a Go-Go and Zip Zip Hooray!.', 'Adventures of the Road-Runner is an animated film, directed by Chuck Jones and co-directed by Maurice Noble and Tom Ray. It was the intended pilot for a TV series starring Wile E. Coyote and the Road Runner, but was never picked up until four years later when Warner Bros. Television produced The Road Runner Show for CBS from 1966 to 1968 and later on ABC from 1971 to 1973. As a result, it was split into three further shorts. The first one was To Beep or Not to Beep (1963). The other two were assembled by DePatie-Freleng Enterprises in 1965 after they took over the Looney Tunes series. The split-up shorts were titled Road Runner a Go-Go and Zip Zip Hooray!.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpkaIEJF7nfpQlVZmiwT95M0Dtu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107974'),
  ('682024258293966046', 'Adventures of the Wilderness Family 2', 1978, 'Adventure, Family', 'Frank Zuniga', 'Arthur R. Dubs, Fred R. Krug', 'Robert Logan, Susan Damante, Heather Rattray, Ham Larsen, George Buck Flower, Brian Cutler, Kurt Grayson', 'G', 'The Wilderness Family now face terrifying times in fierce winter storms, an avalanche, and being attacked by a ferocious pack of hungry wolves. Watch as America''s favorite family stands strong together to prove that the best things in life are really free.', 'The Wilderness Family now face terrifying times in fierce winter storms, an avalanche, and being attacked by a ferocious pack of hungry wolves. Watch as America''s favorite family stands strong together to prove that the best things in life are really free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yc2LBfZyKkTFBOG5jgGBpw1YKeB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52485'),
  ('142689322935666682', 'Adventures of the Wilderness Family 3', 1979, 'Family, Adventure', 'Jack Couffer, James W. Roberson', 'Arthur R. Dubs', 'Robert Logan, Susan Damante, Heather Rattray, Ham Larsen, George Buck Flower, Cal Bartlett, Jim Davidson, William Bryant', 'G', 'A family goes "back to nature" by homesteading in the Colorado Rockies.', 'A family goes "back to nature" by homesteading in the Colorado Rockies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xrJsRHfH44NGygOqKhFlUMTAer.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102661'),
