  ('306452823433412071', 'Æon Flux', 2005, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Karyn Kusama, Stuart Dryburgh, Gary Freeman', 'Matt Manfredi, Phil Hay', 'Charlize Theron, Marton Csokas, Jonny Lee Miller, Sophie Okonedo, Frances McDormand, Pete Postlethwaite, Amelia Warner, Caroline Chikezie', 'PG-13', '400 years into the future, disease has wiped out the majority of the world''s population, except one walled city, Bregna, ruled by a congress of scientists. When Æon Flux, the top operative in the underground ''Monican'' rebellion, is sent on a mission to kill a government leader, she uncovers a world of secrets.', '400 years into the future, disease has wiped out the majority of the world''s population, except one walled city, Bregna, ruled by a congress of scientists. When Æon Flux, the top operative in the underground ''Monican'' rebellion, is sent on a mission to kill a government leader, she uncovers a world of secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5958Nt4QX6aRSUdQnvNw8wqjTJQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8202'),
