  ('991384231695209464', 'Affairs of the Art', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Joanna Quinn', 'Les Mills', 'Menna Trussler, Brendan Charleson, Joanna Quinn, Mali Ann Rees', null, 'Look out: Beryl''s back. With Affairs of the Art, British animator Joanna Quinn recounts another gloriously unhinged chapter in the adventures of Beryl, the comic everywoman she unleashed upon the world with her debut film, Girls'' Night Out, which took home three major awards from Annecy in 1987.', 'Look out: Beryl''s back. With Affairs of the Art, British animator Joanna Quinn recounts another gloriously unhinged chapter in the adventures of Beryl, the comic everywoman she unleashed upon the world with her debut film, Girls'' Night Out, which took home three major awards from Annecy in 1987.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vWn23tb9AYbhvpJMUrBLHIoUNn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:742843'),
  ('110511528047486045', 'Affinity', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery, Romance', 'Tim Fywell, Bernard Couture', 'Andrew Davies', 'Zoë Tapper, Anna Madeley, Domini Blythe, Amanda Plummer, Anne Reid, Caroline Loncq, Anna Massey, Sarah Crowden', null, 'A grieving upper class woman becomes a "Lady Visitor" at Millbank prison, hoping to escape her troubles and be a guiding figure in the lives of the female prisoners. Of all her friendships with prisoners, she is most fascinated by Selina - a medium.', 'A grieving upper class woman becomes a "Lady Visitor" at Millbank prison, hoping to escape her troubles and be a guiding figure in the lives of the female prisoners. Of all her friendships with prisoners, she is most fascinated by Selina - a medium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riT2rqSggvjG2NeXFu4Z1KIvbul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14766'),
  ('308948027643319216', 'Affinity', 2025, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery', 'Brandon Slagle, Niccolo De La Fere', 'Gina Aguad, Liam O''Neil, Marko Zaror', 'Marko Zaror, Brooke Ence, Jane Mirro, Louis Mandylor, Brahim Achabbakhe, Andrey Kasushkin, Ego Mikitas, Tofan Pirani', 'R', 'Chilean martial-arts star Marko Zaror is Bruno, an ex-SEAL struggling with PTSD. He lives a life in fear of his demons until one day when he discovers a beautiful woman with no past of her own. Together they begin to build a life, but when she disappears, Bruno must return to his violent past if he’s going to save her from a shocking conspiracy.', 'Chilean martial-arts star Marko Zaror is Bruno, an ex-SEAL struggling with PTSD. He lives a life in fear of his demons until one day when he discovers a beautiful woman with no past of her own. Together they begin to build a life, but when she disappears, Bruno must return to his violent past if he’s going to save her from a shocking conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WKwQOPh2mQPRL12jSu2yFHk4A7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1480295'),
