  ('690956448018641676', 'Afflicted', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Clif Prowse, Derek Lee, Norm Li', 'Clif Prowse, Derek Lee', 'Baya Rehaz, Derek Lee, Clif Prowse, Edo van Breemen, Zachary Gray, Michael Gill, Jason Lee, Benjamin Zeitoun', 'R', 'Two friends'' tour of Europe takes a dark turn when one of them contracts a mysterious illness. They race to find out what it is and how to cure it before the sickness consumes him completely.', 'Two friends'' tour of Europe takes a dark turn when one of them contracts a mysterious illness. They race to find out what it is and how to cure it before the sickness consumes him completely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMkRWgAvwe0XkpL8swG7UA4N4Q8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210947'),
  ('169757905881744747', 'Affliction', 1998, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Paul Schrader, Paul Sarossy, Anne Alloucherie', 'Paul Schrader', 'Nick Nolte, Sissy Spacek, James Coburn, Willem Dafoe, Mary Beth Hurt, Jim True-Frost, Marian Seldes, Holmes Osborne', 'R', 'A small town policeman must investigate a suspicious hunting accident. The investigation and other events result in him slowly disintegrating mentally.', 'A small town policeman must investigate a suspicious hunting accident. The investigation and other events result in him slowly disintegrating mentally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNu8ePwoRyXDQxhLY4iurCVXAQs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31662'),
  ('1105150087673750945', 'Afghan Breakdown', 1991, 'War, Drama, Action', 'Valery Fedosov, Pavel Zasyadko, Vladimir Bortko', 'Leonid Bogachuk, Aleksandr Chervinsky, Mikhail Leshchinsky', 'Michele Placido, Tatyana Dogileva, Mikhail Zhigalov, Aleksey Serebryakov, Nina Ruslanova, Yuriy Kuznetsov, Viktor Proskurin, Leonid Kulagin', null, 'During the main withdrawal of troops from Afghanistan, a company of hardened paratroopers under the command of Major Bandura are joined by Steklov, the son of a high-ranking officer.', 'During the main withdrawal of troops from Afghanistan, a company of hardened paratroopers under the command of Major Bandura are joined by Steklov, the son of a high-ranking officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teMAa9SwP0Uy4AeAAZmzDgzHLli.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89779'),
  ('257442107360436454', 'Afire', 2023, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Christian Petzold, Hans Fromm, Ires Jung', 'Christian Petzold', 'Thomas Schubert, Paula Beer, Langston Uibel, Enno Trebs, Matthias Brandt, Jennipher Antoni, Ralph Barnebeck, Esther Esche', 'NR', 'Self-important author Leon joins his best friend on a summer holiday near the Baltic Sea to complete his novel. When they arrive, they find their house is already occupied by a carefree woman who challenges Leon to open up. Meanwhile, forest wildfires rage around them and impending disaster looms.', 'Self-important author Leon joins his best friend on a summer holiday near the Baltic Sea to complete his novel. When they arrive, they find their house is already occupied by a carefree woman who challenges Leon to open up. Meanwhile, forest wildfires rage around them and impending disaster looms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8NYzD01zAUsdqocjhLXbO9BSS8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:900379'),
  ('17423520818654598', 'Aflatoon', 1997, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Guddu Dhanoa', null, 'Akshay Kumar, Urmila Matondkar, Anupam Kher, Shazia Malik, Farida Jalal, Sonia Sahni, Harish Patel, Subbiraj', null, 'Mistakenly appointed as a college professor, happy-go-lucky Raja finds the rich girl of his dreams - but must confront a look-alike con man named Rocky to win her father''s approval. The plot thickens when Raja pretends to be Rocky, and Rocky pretends to be Raja. But both does not know that this mistake will engulf them for years to come', 'Mistakenly appointed as a college professor, happy-go-lucky Raja finds the rich girl of his dreams - but must confront a look-alike con man named Rocky to win her father''s approval. The plot thickens when Raja pretends to be Rocky, and Rocky pretends to be Raja. But both does not know that this mistake will engulf them for years to come', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33ibzMirUrCoG859TSz3gVhQVEO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165016'),
  ('392097142254145397', 'Afonso Padilha: Classless', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Rudge Campos, Júnior Carelli', null, 'Afonso Padilha', null, 'Brazilian comedian Afonso Padilha dives into his humble beginnings and digs out hilarious stories about his childhood in this very personal set.', 'Brazilian comedian Afonso Padilha dives into his humble beginnings and digs out hilarious stories about his childhood in this very personal set.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZY9hI0cvny3XwzkZnU0yZiWQNn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:739227'),
  ('75624469344248100', 'Afonya', 1975, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Georgiy Daneliya, Sergey Vronsky, Evgeniy Fyodorov', 'Aleksandr Borodyanskiy', 'Leonid Kuravlyov, Yevgeniya Simonova, Evgeni Leonov, Savely Kramarov, Nina Maslova, Boryslav Brondukov, Valentina Talyzina, Vladimir Basov', null, 'The 1975 film by Georgi Daneliya "Afonya" was an unexpected commercial hit in USSR. The main character "Afonya" Borshev is a plumber, who spends his life partying with "buddies", many of whom he doesn''t even remember after nights of heavy drinking. His wife leaves him, his boss places him on probation, his whole life is falling apart, but he doesn''t realize it. Afonya met Katya at a dance club, yet didn''t pay her much attention. But she is the one, who can save him... In this movie Daneliya achieves a perfect balance of satire and drama. Quotes from the movie gained a cult status in USSR.', 'The 1975 film by Georgi Daneliya "Afonya" was an unexpected commercial hit in USSR. The main character "Afonya" Borshev is a plumber, who spends his life partying with "buddies", many of whom he doesn''t even remember after nights of heavy drinking. His wife leaves him, his boss places him on probation, his whole life is falling apart, but he doesn''t realize it. Afonya met Katya at a dance club, yet didn''t pay her much attention. But she is the one, who can save him... In this movie Daneliya achieves a perfect balance of satire and drama. Quotes from the movie gained a cult status in USSR.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wp40fUEK8qlfqyFE1uvTV8bg4e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20870'),
  ('957910617875837152', 'Afraid', 2024, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Chris Weitz, Javier Aguirresarobe, James Moran', 'Chris Weitz', 'John Cho, Katherine Waterston, Keith Carradine, Havana Rose Liu, Lukita Maxwell, Ashley Romans, David Dastmalchian, Wyatt Lindner', 'PG-13', 'Curtis Pike and his family are selected to test a new home device: a digital assistant called AIA. AIA observes the family''s behaviors and begins to anticipate their needs. And she can – and will – make sure nothing – and no one – gets in her family''s way.', 'Curtis Pike and his family are selected to test a new home device: a digital assistant called AIA. AIA observes the family''s behaviors and begins to anticipate their needs. And she can – and will – make sure nothing – and no one – gets in her family''s way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUREuXCnJLVHsvKXDH9fgIcfM6e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1062215'),
  ('519945243316688935', 'Afraid of the Dark', 1991, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Mark Peploe, Dominic Masters, Bruno de Keyzer', 'Frederick Seidel, Mark Peploe', 'Ben Keyworth, James Fox, Fanny Ardant, Clare Holman, Paul McGann, Robert Stephens, Susan Wooldridge, Rosalind Knight', 'R', 'A little boy, obsessed with blindness and violence, slowly gets trapped in his own delusions.', 'A little boy, obsessed with blindness and violence, slowly gets trapped in his own delusions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vnMNulSEBYX6yE21SM8ZVnCrV3N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60158'),
  ('196038354782766388', 'Afraid to Die', 1960, 'Drama, Crime', 'Yasuzō Masumura, Kiyoshi Ishida, Hiroshi Murai', 'Ryuzo Kikushima, Hideo Ando', 'Yukio Mishima, Ayako Wakao, Keizō Kawasaki, Eiji Funakoshi, Takashi Shimura, Yoshie Mizutani, Michiko Ono, Mayumi Kurata', null, 'On his release from prison a young yakuza, along with his brother, decides to turn his back on criminal life instead of taking over the position of his recently deceased father, boss of the Asahina clan. But their exit proves more difficult than planned when their rival clan steps in to exact revenge.', 'On his release from prison a young yakuza, along with his brother, decides to turn his back on criminal life instead of taking over the position of his recently deceased father, boss of the Asahina clan. But their exit proves more difficult than planned when their rival clan steps in to exact revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1amZPzPRIoOM08mZCoqPWVALL4i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44785'),
  ('310205631533885544', 'Afraid to Go Out at Night', 1980, 'Drama, Comedy, Thriller', 'Eloy de la Iglesia, Josetxo San Mateo, Enrique Molinero', 'Eloy de la Iglesia, Roberto Bodegas, José María Palacio', 'José Sacristán, Antonio Ferrandis, Claudia Gravy, Tina Sainz, Mari Carmen Prendes, Florinda Chico, Antonio Betancourt, José Lifante', null, 'A bank employee, shy and skittish, is falling into the web of fear of the events he sees around him and the crime wave that seems to invade the city.', 'A bank employee, shy and skittish, is falling into the web of fear of the events he sees around him and the crime wave that seems to invade the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWk9OjEs2oFBywz09VhBWBSCTLl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115895'),
  ('687654240129128672', 'Africa Before Dark', 1928, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Walt Disney', null, null, null, 'Oswald goes big game hunting in Africa.', 'Oswald goes big game hunting in Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCFVi1QFgvkwyWeXFiUocWYylGX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321822'),
  ('463611651929873115', 'Africa Blood and Guts', 1966, 'Documentary, History, War, Horror', 'Gualtiero Jacopetti, Franco Prosperi, Antonio Climati', 'Gualtiero Jacopetti, Franco Prosperi', 'Sergio Rossi, Jomo Kenyatta, Gualtiero Jacopetti, Julius Nyerere, Moïse Kapenda Tshombe, Richard Gordon Turnbull, Ian Yule', 'R', 'A chronicle of the violence that occurred in much of the African continent throughout the 1960s. As many African countries were transitioning from colonial rule to other forms of government, violent political upheavals were frequent. Revolutions in Zanzibar and Kenya in which thousands were killed are shown, the violence not only political; there is also extensive footage of hunters and poachers slaughtering different types of wild animals.', 'A chronicle of the violence that occurred in much of the African continent throughout the 1960s. As many African countries were transitioning from colonial rule to other forms of government, violent political upheavals were frequent. Revolutions in Zanzibar and Kenya in which thousands were killed are shown, the violence not only political; there is also extensive footage of hunters and poachers slaughtering different types of wild animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPLzCid2gk7eOCrYlXIBU24bTpO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41264'),
  ('616304379151017574', 'Africa Express', 1975, 'Action, Comedy, Adventure', 'Michele Lupo, Roberto Gerardi, Gianni Cozzo', 'Mario Amendola, Bruno Corbucci, Gabrielle Martin', 'Ursula Andress, Giuliano Gemma, Jack Palance, Giuseppe Maffioli, Luciana Turina, Rossana Di Lorenzo, Nello Pazzafini, Gianni Vernucio', null, 'John Baxter is a freewheeling trader of goods in Africa with a pet chimpanzee and one dream: to save enough money to buy a gas station in Detroit.', 'John Baxter is a freewheeling trader of goods in Africa with a pet chimpanzee and one dream: to save enough money to buy a gas station in Detroit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbRC5ohbcs20XZDQDmpWUKoczlO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102055'),
  ('265731515887681837', 'Africa Paradise', 2007, 'Drama', 'Sylvestre Amoussou', 'Sylvestre Amoussou', 'Stéphane Roux, Ériq Ebouaney, Sylvestre Amoussou, Charlotte Vermeil, Sandrine Bulteau, Martial Odone, Mylène Wagram, Emile Abossolo M''bo', null, 'France, 2033. Olivier, an engineer, and Pauline, a teacher, decide to emigrate to the United States of Africa because they can no longer live in their country.', 'France, 2033. Olivier, an engineer, and Pauline, a teacher, decide to emigrate to the United States of Africa because they can no longer live in their country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGng6Yh2Z8VJOzehLOY22YA1XP4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177610'),
  ('440591195031844809', 'Africa Screams', 1949, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Charles Barton, Charles Van Enger', 'Earl Baldwin', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Clyde Beatty, Frank Buck, Buddy Baer, Hillary Brooke, Shemp Howard, Joe Besser', 'NR', 'When bookseller Buzz cons Diana into thinking that his friend Stanley knows all there is to know about Africa, they are abducted and ordered to lead Diana and her henchmen to an African tribe in search of a fortune in jewels.', 'When bookseller Buzz cons Diana into thinking that his friend Stanley knows all there is to know about Africa, they are abducted and ordered to lead Diana and her henchmen to an African tribe in search of a fortune in jewels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwG0Zvu99fFerIJv0qnqHXZ5MWt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20278'),
  ('726757689620951811', 'Africa: The Serengeti', 1994, 'Documentary', 'George Casey, Andrew Kitzanuk', 'George Casey, Mose Richards', 'James Earl Jones', 'NR', 'The equation of life on the Serengeti is simple: carnivores eat plants, herbivores eat carnivores. Africa: The Serengeti takes you on an extraordinary journey to view a spectacle few humans have ever witnessed. The Great Migration. Journey with more than two million wildebeests, zebras and antelopes in their annual 500 mile trek across the Serengeti plains', 'The equation of life on the Serengeti is simple: carnivores eat plants, herbivores eat carnivores. Africa: The Serengeti takes you on an extraordinary journey to view a spectacle few humans have ever witnessed. The Great Migration. Journey with more than two million wildebeests, zebras and antelopes in their annual 500 mile trek across the Serengeti plains', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVcLCA0ZUMaVzRn7qwxrLXyurI1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13794'),
  ('560984717351894050', 'African Cats', 2011, 'Documentary, Adventure', 'Keith Scholey, Alastair Fothergill', 'John Truby, Keith Scholey', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Patrick Stewart', 'G', 'African Cats captures the real-life love, humor and determination of the majestic kings of the savanna. The story features Mara, an endearing lion cub who strives to grow up with her mother’s strength, spirit and wisdom; Sita, a fearless cheetah and single mother of five mischievous newborns; and Fang, a proud leader of the pride who must defend his family from a once banished lion.', 'African Cats captures the real-life love, humor and determination of the majestic kings of the savanna. The story features Mara, an endearing lion cub who strives to grow up with her mother’s strength, spirit and wisdom; Sita, a fearless cheetah and single mother of five mischievous newborns; and Fang, a proud leader of the pride who must defend his family from a once banished lion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nERPMF2kHjc1slLHZYZGwcWX9kg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57586'),
  ('532717269346699216', 'African Diary', 1945, 'Animation', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Frank Graham, James MacDonald, Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Goofy narrates his own quest to Africa accompanied by various tour guides. He is in search of wild game. After run-ins with various animals while camping for the night and taking his morning plunge (ruined by a hippo that takes all the water with him when exiting the pool), he sets off in search of the black rhinoceros. Unfortunately for Goofy, the rhino is prepared for Goofy (thanks to a stool pigeon bird resting on his horn) and charges him. Goofy tries his gun against the rhino but the rhino is still to much for Goofy so he leaves Africa and leaves the rhino for other hunters.', 'Goofy narrates his own quest to Africa accompanied by various tour guides. He is in search of wild game. After run-ins with various animals while camping for the night and taking his morning plunge (ruined by a hippo that takes all the water with him when exiting the pool), he sets off in search of the black rhinoceros. Unfortunately for Goofy, the rhino is prepared for Goofy (thanks to a stool pigeon bird resting on his horn) and charges him. Goofy tries his gun against the rhino but the rhino is still to much for Goofy so he leaves Africa and leaves the rhino for other hunters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Jc0YxPYPdzjQzn2MFaw6BUitH6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66818'),
  ('751119304828778364', 'African Territory 2', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Julian Azulay, Joaquín Azulay', 'Julian Azulay, Joaquín Azulay', 'Julian Azulay, Joaquín Azulay', null, 'A 22-month anthropological expedition to the African continent. The ''Gauchos del Mar'' Azulay brothers travel in a 1985-model military ambulance from Spain to South Africa. The objective is to encourage human relationships through an unprecedented surfing exploration, promoting cultural exchange in this vast and diverse continent.', 'A 22-month anthropological expedition to the African continent. The ''Gauchos del Mar'' Azulay brothers travel in a 1985-model military ambulance from Spain to South Africa. The objective is to encourage human relationships through an unprecedented surfing exploration, promoting cultural exchange in this vast and diverse continent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgKwYismEnFI8DHNrZFS9rzm3d2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1122638'),
  ('776625657929139735', 'Africano', 2001, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure', 'Amr Arafa, Sameh Selim', 'Amr Arafa, Mohamed Amin', 'Ahmed Al Saqqa, Mona Zaki, Ahmed Eid, Hassan Hosny, Nashwa Mustafa, Talaat Zein, Samir Chamas, Fauzia Abdel Aleem', null, 'The story of Badr, a young veterinarian, and his brother in law ‘Essaam, their desire for success and the seeming good fortune they encounter. Their life turned upside down when they get news that they have inherited a Zoo from Badr''s uncle in South Africa. Badr and ‘Essaam fly to South Africa where they meet Gameela, Badr''s niece, they find that the zoo is facing many problems. Badr, ‘Essaam, and Gameela face such challenges as vicious lion attacks, greedy bankers, treacherous relatives, with the help of Shaaker the father''s lawyer and Adam, the loyal family employee.', 'The story of Badr, a young veterinarian, and his brother in law ‘Essaam, their desire for success and the seeming good fortune they encounter. Their life turned upside down when they get news that they have inherited a Zoo from Badr''s uncle in South Africa. Badr and ‘Essaam fly to South Africa where they meet Gameela, Badr''s niece, they find that the zoo is facing many problems. Badr, ‘Essaam, and Gameela face such challenges as vicious lion attacks, greedy bankers, treacherous relatives, with the help of Shaaker the father''s lawyer and Adam, the loyal family employee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBI7WzoTLX6akMQVVQ9N8llhfKG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418291'),
  ('458121371974158472', 'Afrique 50', 1950, 'Documentary', 'René Vautier, René Vautier', 'René Vautier', 'René Vautier', null, 'The first French anti-colonialist film, derived from an assignment in which the director was to document educational activities by the French League of Schooling in West Africa. Vautier later filmed what he actually saw: “a lack of teachers and doctors, the crimes committed by the French Army in the name of France, the instrumentalization of the colonized peoples.” For his role in the film, Vautier was imprisoned for several months. The film was banned from public screening for more than 40 years.', 'The first French anti-colonialist film, derived from an assignment in which the director was to document educational activities by the French League of Schooling in West Africa. Vautier later filmed what he actually saw: “a lack of teachers and doctors, the crimes committed by the French Army in the name of France, the instrumentalization of the colonized peoples.” For his role in the film, Vautier was imprisoned for several months. The film was banned from public screening for more than 40 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHV4HeZHmIoxNE0AQX7CNubHSAC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31291'),
  ('1107062289316596437', 'Afro Samurai Pilot', 2007, 'Action, Animation, Music', 'Takeshi Koike', 'Tomohiro Yamashita, Yasuyuki Muto', 'Gang Starr, CYNE', null, 'Original pilot for the "Afro Samurai" TV series, directed and animated by Takeshi Koike before anime studio Gonzo took on the production of the final product four years later.', 'Original pilot for the "Afro Samurai" TV series, directed and animated by Takeshi Koike before anime studio Gonzo took on the production of the final product four years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vG5PYV6IkVD3CuaPQxwXT8rbeUx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515056'),
  ('1070337446868099448', 'Afro Samurai: Resurrection', 2009, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Fuminori Kizaki', 'Eric S. Calderon, Leo Chu', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Lucy Liu, Yuri Lowenthal, Mark Hamill, Jeff Bennett, S. Scott Bullock, Grey DeLisle, Greg Eagles', 'NR', 'Afro Samurai avenged his father and found a life of peace. But the legendary master is forced back into the game by a beautiful and deadly woman from his past. The sparks of violence dropped along Afro’s bloody path now burn out of control – and nowhere are the flames of hatred more intense than in the eyes of Sio.', 'Afro Samurai avenged his father and found a life of peace. But the legendary master is forced back into the game by a beautiful and deadly woman from his past. The sparks of violence dropped along Afro’s bloody path now burn out of control – and nowhere are the flames of hatred more intense than in the eyes of Sio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6snrLj3Ydmbu5L9giAYtiSNwE0U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14711'),
  ('38570770265734546', 'Afro Tanaka', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Daigo Matsui, Tetsuhiko Tsuchiya, Gen Kobayashi', 'Masafumi Nishida', 'Shota Matsuda, Nozomi Sasaki, Atsushi Tsutsumishita, Kei Tanaka, Kaname Endo, Ryusuke Komakine, Mikie Hara, Minami', null, 'Hiroshi Tanaka sports an intense perm which looks like the afro hairstyle favored by some African-Americans back in the 1970''s. He doesn''t get his hair done at a hair shop, he was actually born with his hair like that. For freedom, Hiroshi moves to Tokyo. He works hard there and, even though he turns 24, he still doesn''t have a girlfriend.', 'Hiroshi Tanaka sports an intense perm which looks like the afro hairstyle favored by some African-Americans back in the 1970''s. He doesn''t get his hair done at a hair shop, he was actually born with his hair like that. For freedom, Hiroshi moves to Tokyo. He works hard there and, even though he turns 24, he still doesn''t have a girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nUcEqwwHKYUqgZS5oVuXOgCCReY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124505'),
  ('1067035935050359816', 'After', 2009, 'Drama', 'Alberto Rodríguez, Álex Catalán', 'Rafael Cobos', 'Tristán Ulloa, Guillermo Toledo, Blanca Romero, Jesús Carroza, Maxi Iglesias, Ricardo de Barreiro, Cristina Domínguez, Valeria Alonso', null, 'Manuel, Ana and Julio get together in a warm summer night after not having seen each other for a while and set off to explore the night.', 'Manuel, Ana and Julio get together in a warm summer night after not having seen each other for a while and set off to explore the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTsLBUCE6sxrv5ymv9OnEh94N2u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39172'),
  ('352485598946805708', 'After', 2012, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror, Drama', 'Ryan Smith, Blake McClure, Justin Tolley', 'Ryan Smith', 'Steven Strait, Karolina Wydra, Sandra Ellis Lafferty, Ric Reitz, Jackson Walker, Madison Lintz, Bob Penny, April Billingsley', 'PG-13', 'When two bus crash survivors awake to discover that they are the only people left in their small town, they must form an unlikely alliance in a race to unravel the truth behind their isolation. As strange events begin to unfold, they start to question whether the town they know so well is really what it seems.', 'When two bus crash survivors awake to discover that they are the only people left in their small town, they must form an unlikely alliance in a race to unravel the truth behind their isolation. As strange events begin to unfold, they start to question whether the town they know so well is really what it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5AKcsJYztbcX2KsyCXtKucyUUMA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118612'),
  ('259594629260264755', 'After', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jenny Gage, Tom Betterton, Lynne Mitchell', 'Susan McMartin, Jenny Gage, Tom Betterton', 'Josephine Langford, Hero Fiennes Tiffin, Shane Paul McGhie, Khadijha Red Thunder, Dylan Arnold, Samuel Larsen, Inanna Sarkis, Selma Blair', 'PG-13', 'Tessa Young is a dedicated student, dutiful daughter and loyal girlfriend to her high school sweetheart. Entering her first semester of college, Tessa''s guarded world opens up when she meets Hardin Scott, a mysterious and brooding rebel who makes her question all she thought she knew about herself -- and what she wants out of life.', 'Tessa Young is a dedicated student, dutiful daughter and loyal girlfriend to her high school sweetheart. Entering her first semester of college, Tessa''s guarded world opens up when she meets Hardin Scott, a mysterious and brooding rebel who makes her question all she thought she knew about herself -- and what she wants out of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3B2YKUjWABcxXZ6Nm9h10hLUbh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537915'),
  ('722257674939688807', 'After Blue (Dirty Paradise)', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Fantasy, Western', 'Pascale Granel, Chouchane Bakirel, Arnaud Lucas', 'Bertrand Mandico', 'Paula Luna, Elina Löwensohn, Vimala Pons, Agata Buzek, Michaël Erpelding, Mara Taquin, Claïna Clavaron, Claire Duburcq', null, 'In a faraway future, on a wild and untamed female inhabited planet called After Blue, a lonely teenager named Roxy unknowingly releases a mystical, dangerous, and sensual assassin from her prison.', 'In a faraway future, on a wild and untamed female inhabited planet called After Blue, a lonely teenager named Roxy unknowingly releases a mystical, dangerous, and sensual assassin from her prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzlk8JZbialeyduUjgtbsqwH3yX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660715'),
  ('748125240997488069', 'After Dark, My Sweet', 1990, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'James Foley, Mark Plummer', 'James Foley, Robert Redlin', 'Jason Patric, Rachel Ward, Bruce Dern, Rocky Giordani, Tom Wagner, James E. Bowen Jr., George Dickerson, Napoleon Walls', 'R', 'Three desperados try to kidnap a wealthy child in hope of turning their lives around.', 'Three desperados try to kidnap a wealthy child in hope of turning their lives around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6fWrEcIEoFuwYt4MUY4RtZwuMo9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25501'),
  ('903635344893995077', 'After Death', 1990, 'Horror, Action', 'Claudio Fragasso', 'Rossella Drudi', 'Jeff Stryker, Candice Daly, Massimo Vanni, Jim Gaines, Donald Wilson, Adrianne Joseph, Jimmy Moss, Nick Nicholson', 'NR', 'Seeking the cure for cancer, a woman goes back to the island where her parents were killed, and accidentally raises the dead by angering a voodoo priest.', 'Seeking the cure for cancer, a woman goes back to the island where her parents were killed, and accidentally raises the dead by angering a voodoo priest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBjQiteWRpTogARRq4LseRvmtTO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5796'),
  ('389118922782815910', 'After Death', 2023, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Chris Radtke, Jacqueline Grajales, Stephen Gray', 'Stephen Gray', 'Koko Marshall, Michael Jovanovski, Doug Lito, Kate Duffy, Drew Neal Horton, Nicholas Saenz, Raymond Moody, Don Piper', 'PG-13', 'Based on real near-death experiences, the afterlife is explored with the guidance of New York Times bestselling authors, medical experts, scientists and survivors who shed a light on what awaits us.', 'Based on real near-death experiences, the afterlife is explored with the guidance of New York Times bestselling authors, medical experts, scientists and survivors who shed a light on what awaits us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jftgQ8mYaPFYf0UywgwgqimAkmu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1162322'),
  ('284231554683450189', 'After Earth', 2013, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Peter Suschitzky, M. Night Shyamalan, Sarah Boardman', 'Gary Whitta, M. Night Shyamalan', 'Jaden Smith, Will Smith, Sophie Okonedo, Zoë Kravitz, Glenn Morshower, Kristofer Hivju, Sacha Dhawan, Chris Geere', 'PG-13', 'One thousand years after cataclysmic events forced humanity''s escape from Earth, Nova Prime has become mankind''s new home. Legendary General Cypher Raige returns from an extended tour of duty to his estranged family, ready to be a father to his 13-year-old son, Kitai. When an asteroid storm damages Cypher and Kitai''s craft, they crash-land on a now unfamiliar and dangerous Earth. As his father lies dying in the cockpit, Kitai must trek across the hostile terrain to recover their rescue beacon. His whole life, Kitai has wanted nothing more than to be a soldier like his father. Today, he gets his chance.', 'One thousand years after cataclysmic events forced humanity''s escape from Earth, Nova Prime has become mankind''s new home. Legendary General Cypher Raige returns from an extended tour of duty to his estranged family, ready to be a father to his 13-year-old son, Kitai. When an asteroid storm damages Cypher and Kitai''s craft, they crash-land on a now unfamiliar and dangerous Earth. As his father lies dying in the cockpit, Kitai must trek across the hostile terrain to recover their rescue beacon. His whole life, Kitai has wanted nothing more than to be a soldier like his father. Today, he gets his chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXMvYIlzzJBs352CfeiQcBvovZt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82700'),
  ('1062281876983201610', 'After Ever Happy', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Castille Landon, Joshua Reis, Rob Givens', 'Sharon Soboil', 'Josephine Langford, Hero Fiennes Tiffin, Carter Jenkins, Louise Lombard, Chance Perdomo, Rob Estes, Arielle Kebbel, Stephen Moyer', 'R', 'As a shocking truth about a couple''s families emerges, the two lovers discover they are not so different from each other. Tessa is no longer the sweet, simple, good girl she was when she met Hardin — any more than he is the cruel, moody boy she fell so hard for.', 'As a shocking truth about a couple''s families emerges, the two lovers discover they are not so different from each other. Tessa is no longer the sweet, simple, good girl she was when she met Hardin — any more than he is the cruel, moody boy she fell so hard for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/moogpu8rNkEjTgFyLXwhPghft5w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744276'),
  ('393314473724694056', 'After Everything', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Hannah Marks, Joey Power, Sandra Valde-Hansen', 'Hannah Marks, Joey Power', 'Jeremy Allen White, Maika Monroe, Gina Gershon, Marisa Tomei, Joe Keery, Dean Winters, DeRon Horton, Sasha Lane', null, 'When Elliot, a brash 23-year-old living carefree in New York City, meets the sensible Mia and receives a damning diagnosis all in the same week, his world is turned completely upside down. But as their love blossoms amidst the chaos of his treatment, they discover that Elliot''s illness is not the real test of their relationship – it''s everything else.', 'When Elliot, a brash 23-year-old living carefree in New York City, meets the sensible Mia and receives a damning diagnosis all in the same week, his world is turned completely upside down. But as their love blossoms amidst the chaos of his treatment, they discover that Elliot''s illness is not the real test of their relationship – it''s everything else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5fwosV84f3BOV2h4kqcbpQplFLY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448557'),
  ('379912379342447225', 'After Everything', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', 'Castille Landon, Joshua Reis, Maria Miguel Serra', 'Castille Landon', 'Hero Fiennes Tiffin, Josephine Langford, Mimi Keene, Stephen Moyer, Louise Lombard, Arielle Kebbel, Carter Jenkins, Kiana Madeira', 'R', 'Besieged by writer’s block and the crushing breakup with Tessa, Hardin travels to Portugal in search of a woman he wronged in the past – and to find himself. Hoping to win back Tessa, he realizes he needs to change his ways before he can make the ultimate commitment.', 'Besieged by writer’s block and the crushing breakup with Tessa, Hardin travels to Portugal in search of a woman he wronged in the past – and to find himself. Hoping to win back Tessa, he realizes he needs to change his ways before he can make the ultimate commitment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQxjZGU6rxSPSMeAJPJQlmfV3ys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820525'),
  ('473125240989519761', 'After Him', 2007, 'Drama', 'Gaël Morel, Franck Morand, Bertrand Guerry', 'Christophe Honoré, Gaël Morel', 'Catherine Deneuve, Guy Marchand, Thomas Dumerchez, Élodie Bouchez, Elli Medeiros, Pom Klementieff, Adrien Jolivet, Magali Bonat', null, 'When Camille''s son was killed in a car accident, the devastating loss proved too much for emotionally fragile mother to bear. Now desperately clinging to any reminder of the son she held so close to her heart, Camille becomes increasingly fixated on Frank - the young man who was not only her child''s best friend, but the one who was responsible for the tragic accident that took his life as well. At first, Frank is receptive to Camille''s advances. It''s not long, however, before the pair''s scandalous relationship prompts many of Camille''s friends to distance themselves from the increasingly unstable woman. Later, as Camille''s obsession with Frank turns menacing, the relationship between grief-stricken mother and her guilt-ridden lover begins to take on ominous undertones.', 'When Camille''s son was killed in a car accident, the devastating loss proved too much for emotionally fragile mother to bear. Now desperately clinging to any reminder of the son she held so close to her heart, Camille becomes increasingly fixated on Frank - the young man who was not only her child''s best friend, but the one who was responsible for the tragic accident that took his life as well. At first, Frank is receptive to Camille''s advances. It''s not long, however, before the pair''s scandalous relationship prompts many of Camille''s friends to distance themselves from the increasingly unstable woman. Later, as Camille''s obsession with Frank turns menacing, the relationship between grief-stricken mother and her guilt-ridden lover begins to take on ominous undertones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fiU2GEybwloWWTzURhqcpXnYL3B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51844'),
  ('755654634260061182', 'After Hitler', 2016, 'Documentary, History', 'David Korn-Brzoza', 'Olivier Wieviorka, David Korn-Brzoza', 'Vincent Lindon', null, 'What happened in France just after WWII, between 1945 and 1949? An interesting historic documentary looks at the fate of male and female (presumed) collaborators with the Nazis, the use of the POW in the reconstruction of the plundered and devastated country.', 'What happened in France just after WWII, between 1945 and 1949? An interesting historic documentary looks at the fate of male and female (presumed) collaborators with the Nazis, the use of the POW in the reconstruction of the plundered and devastated country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMWhEZTYcdQmsQNbKGBKlPBv5nB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400875'),
  ('701635558438743910', 'After Hours', 1985, 'Comedy, Thriller, Drama', 'Martin Scorsese, Michael Ballhaus, Sarah M. Brim', 'Joseph Minion', 'Griffin Dunne, Rosanna Arquette, Verna Bloom, Tommy Chong, Linda Fiorentino, Teri Garr, John Heard, Cheech Marin', 'R', 'Desperate to escape his mind-numbing routine, uptown Manhattan office worker Paul Hackett ventures downtown for a hookup with a mystery woman.', 'Desperate to escape his mind-numbing routine, uptown Manhattan office worker Paul Hackett ventures downtown for a hookup with a mystery woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eamOBurHBu0MIxohTIVcfxmZ6Z7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10843'),
  ('307281034710666251', 'After Last Season', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama', 'Mark Region, Mark Region, Peter Morris', 'Mark Region', 'Jason Kulas, Peggy McClellan, Scott Winters, Casey McDougal, Joan-Marie Dewsnap, William York, Tristan Cole, Katarína Morháčová', 'PG-13', 'Two neurology students create a telepathy experiment together to visualize a murderer, who recently knifed another student.', 'Two neurology students create a telepathy experiment together to visualize a murderer, who recently knifed another student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OKaj3yFHYxwJDXW1RgA4mwkCDt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64104'),
  ('294836665806122841', 'After Life', 1999, 'Fantasy, Drama', 'Hirokazu Kore-eda, Yutaka Yamazaki, Masayoshi Sukita', 'Hirokazu Kore-eda', 'Arata Iura, Erika Oda, Susumu Terajima, Takashi Naito, Kei Tani, Kyōko Kagawa, Tōru Yuri, Yūsuke Iseya', 'NR', 'On a cold Monday morning, a group of counselors clock in at an old-fashioned social services office. Their task is to interview the recently deceased, record their personal details, then, over the course of the week, assist them in choosing a single memory to keep for eternity.', 'On a cold Monday morning, a group of counselors clock in at an old-fashioned social services office. Their task is to interview the recently deceased, record their personal details, then, over the course of the week, assist them in choosing a single memory to keep for eternity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bs2M1hqAQl5LeAOPPRV4drwouZS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17962'),
  ('1124022297591228906', 'After Life', 2003, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lucas Belvaux', null, 'Dominique Blanc, Gilbert Melki, Ornella Muti, Catherine Frot, François Morel, Lucas Belvaux, Jean-Baptiste Montagut, Bernard Mazzinghi', null, 'The final installment in director Lucas Belvaux''s trilogy follows Pascal, a cop who sees a return to credibility in the capture of escaped convict Bruno--who in turn is harbored by Pascal''s morphine-addicted wife Agnes. Pascal''s already precarious ties to Agnes are strained further when he meets and falls for her fellow schoolteacher friend Cecile. With Pascal focused on Bruno and Cecile, Agnes is forced to find a fix on her own.', 'The final installment in director Lucas Belvaux''s trilogy follows Pascal, a cop who sees a return to credibility in the capture of escaped convict Bruno--who in turn is harbored by Pascal''s morphine-addicted wife Agnes. Pascal''s already precarious ties to Agnes are strained further when he meets and falls for her fellow schoolteacher friend Cecile. With Pascal focused on Bruno and Cecile, Agnes is forced to find a fix on her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8WBA8OjyIYABpQsDHAmDdG4DHE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44674'),
  ('333956357801875622', 'After Love', 2016, 'Drama', 'Joachim Lafosse, Jean-François Hensgens', 'Fanny Burdino, Joachim Lafosse, Mazarine Pingeot', 'Bérénice Bejo, Cédric Kahn, Marthe Keller, Catherine Salée, Tibo Vandenborre, Philippe Jeusette, Margaux Soentjens, Jade Soentjens', null, 'Marie and Boris decide to get a divorce after 15 years of marriage. Tensions rise when cash-strapped Boris must continue to live with Marie and the two children while trying to figure out how to divide the assets.', 'Marie and Boris decide to get a divorce after 15 years of marriage. Tensions rise when cash-strapped Boris must continue to live with Marie and the two children while trying to figure out how to divide the assets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/98Q38iZx8eHZLVuyFMF7dPMvyzJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377278'),
  ('861591650017920269', 'After Love', 2021, 'Drama', 'Shaheen Baig, Jeroen Bogaert, Aleem Khan', 'Aleem Khan', 'Joanna Scanlan, Nathalie Richard, Nasser Memarzia, Talid Ariss, Sudha Bhuchar, Nisha Chadha, Jabeen Butt, Subika Anwar-Khan', null, 'Set in the port town of Dover in the South-East of England, Mary Hussain suddenly finds herself a widow following the unexpected death of her husband. A day after the burial, she discovers he has a secret just twenty-one miles across the English Channel in Calais.', 'Set in the port town of Dover in the South-East of England, Mary Hussain suddenly finds herself a widow following the unexpected death of her husband. A day after the burial, she discovers he has a secret just twenty-one miles across the English Channel in Calais.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXaNg69iWEs0Qsj4AJxcvCXuWKw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:714011'),
  ('1099642713906231138', 'After Lucia', 2012, 'Drama', 'Michel Franco, Chuy Chávez, Nosha Sauma', 'Michel Franco', 'Tessa Ía, Hernán Mendoza, Gonzalo Vega Sisto, Tamara Yazbek Bernal, Paco Rueda, Paloma Cervantes, Carmen Beato, Mónica del Carmen', null, 'Alejandra and her dad Roberto have just moved to town. She is new at school, he has a new job. Starting over is sometimes complicated when you have left so much behind.', 'Alejandra and her dad Roberto have just moved to town. She is new at school, he has a new job. Starting over is sometimes complicated when you have left so much behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aL0R8E6pIehFCuVpo3Wj8ewAWi9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126315'),
  ('871716627675304016', 'After Maria', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Nadia Hallgren, Nadia Hallgren', null, 'Glenda Martes', null, 'Strong Puerto Rican women forced to flee the island after Hurricane Maria have bonded like family in a FEMA hotel in the Bronx. They seek stability in their new life as forces try to pull them apart.', 'Strong Puerto Rican women forced to flee the island after Hurricane Maria have bonded like family in a FEMA hotel in the Bronx. They seek stability in their new life as forces try to pull them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KVPsQue77aCd8Eu9OGZeLk5rm1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:600700'),
  ('755039798923638379', 'After Midnight', 1989, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Jim Wheat, Ken Wheat, Phedon Papamichael', 'Ken Wheat, Jim Wheat', 'Jillian McWhirter, Pamela Adlon, Ramy Zada, Marg Helgenberger, Marc McClure, Judie Aronson, Nadine Van der Velde, Alan Rosenberg', 'R', 'A college professor teaching a course called "The Psychology of Fear" brings his students (including a psychic) to his home, one dark and stormy night to tell scary stories. The first involves a young couple whose car breaks down by an old, abandoned house. The second has four trendy teenage girls getting lost in a bad part of town and chased by a pack of vicious dogs. Last, a woman on crutches confronting a stalker at the answering service where she works the night shift.', 'A college professor teaching a course called "The Psychology of Fear" brings his students (including a psychic) to his home, one dark and stormy night to tell scary stories. The first involves a young couple whose car breaks down by an old, abandoned house. The second has four trendy teenage girls getting lost in a bad part of town and chased by a pack of vicious dogs. Last, a woman on crutches confronting a stalker at the answering service where she works the night shift.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8IYYw7b3tbizUr7FDWTVNUIj6i6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66192'),
  ('668906081610371215', 'After Midnight', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Fernanda Selvaggi, Dante Cecchin, Luca Grivet Brancot', 'Davide Ferrario', 'Giorgio Pasotti, Francesca Inaudi, Fabio Troiano, Francesca Picozza, Silvio Orlando, Pietro Eandi, Andrea Romero, Giampiero Perone', null, 'A beautiful fugitive draws a shy film buff out of his shell while she hides in the museum — the cavernous interiors of the Mole Antonelliana in Turin, Italy — where he works as night watchman.', 'A beautiful fugitive draws a shy film buff out of his shell while she hides in the museum — the cavernous interiors of the Mole Antonelliana in Turin, Italy — where he works as night watchman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9i2kGn1n2tQJurXDfEbB1DRU6Yw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38004'),
