  ('594460169273806388', 'After Sex', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Eric Amadio, Karen Meisels, Todd Hickey', 'Eric Amadio', 'Marc Blucas, Jose Pablo Cantillo, Emmanuelle Chriqui, James DeBello, Noel Fisher, Dave Franco, Mila Kunis, Taryn Manning', 'NR', 'Sex is a background to examine intimacy and vulnerability. Looks at the complexity of modern day relationships told through eight separate couples. Through dialogue and compromising situations, the film takes us from the beginning of a relationship to the aftermath of one, and examines every stage in between seeing humor within the drama, heartache and confusion of it all.', 'Sex is a background to examine intimacy and vulnerability. Looks at the complexity of modern day relationships told through eight separate couples. Through dialogue and compromising situations, the film takes us from the beginning of a relationship to the aftermath of one, and examines every stage in between seeing humor within the drama, heartache and confusion of it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4n41P5CKHFFkQ3s8VJieNmqUkn7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17097'),
  ('2416462093841771', 'After Spring', 1986, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Alexander Røsler', 'Alexander Røsler', 'Joakim Kock, Camilla Sletten, Øystein Offer-Olsen, Siri Hoff', null, 'Two boys, age ten, spend their summer in idyllic rural surroundings. They play in the fields, they swim au natural, and more often than not - - - they find themselves in the company of those very beings that a ten-year-old boy pretends to hate..... girls!', 'Two boys, age ten, spend their summer in idyllic rural surroundings. They play in the fields, they swim au natural, and more often than not - - - they find themselves in the company of those very beings that a ten-year-old boy pretends to hate..... girls!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUxBr4W8PWxB1VCXBXj5YxLrZIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80991'),
  ('1042548730231031964', 'After Stonewall', 1999, 'Documentary', 'John Scagliotti', 'John Scagliotti, Andrew Podell', 'Melissa Etheridge, Larry Kramer, Barney Frank, Pratibha Parmar, Rita Mae Brown, Armistead Maupin, Boy George, Jeff May', null, 'This sequel to "Before Stonewall" documents the history of gay and lesbian life from the riots at Stonewall in 1969 to the present. Narrated by Melissa Etheridge, the film explains the work, struggles, victories, and defeats the gay community has weathered to become a vibrant and integral part of North American society.', 'This sequel to "Before Stonewall" documents the history of gay and lesbian life from the riots at Stonewall in 1969 to the present. Narrated by Melissa Etheridge, the film explains the work, struggles, victories, and defeats the gay community has weathered to become a vibrant and integral part of North American society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6okeWmSYauy8TCjVbCHUlr366ig.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37082'),
