  ('810878732829927767', 'After the Rain', 2000, 'Drama', 'Takashi Koizumi, Teruyo Nogami, Takao Saitō', null, 'Akira Terao, Yoshiko Miyazaki, Shirō Mifune, Hisashi Igawa, Hidetaka Yoshioka, Tatsuya Nakadai, Mieko Harada, Fumi Dan', null, 'A group of travelers is stranded in a small country inn when the river floods during heavy rains. As the bad weather continues, tensions rise amongst the trapped travelers.', 'A group of travelers is stranded in a small country inn when the river floods during heavy rains. As the bad weather continues, tensions rise amongst the trapped travelers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5m7uLaFRcW6c4hqNC4bryNnfQGC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15319'),
  ('537634409594079186', 'After the Rain', 2018, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ryuta Nishizawa, Akira Nagai, Orie Ichihashi', 'Riko Sakaguchi', 'Nana Komatsu, Yo Oizumi, Nana Seino, Hayato Isomura, Shono Hayama, Honoka Matsumoto, Maika Yamamoto, Mari Hamada', null, 'Akira Tachibana is a soft-spoken high school student who used to be a part of the track and field club. Working part-time at a restaurant, she finds herself inexplicably falling in love with her manager, a divorced 45-year-old man.', 'Akira Tachibana is a soft-spoken high school student who used to be a part of the track and field club. Working part-time at a restaurant, she finds herself inexplicably falling in love with her manager, a divorced 45-year-old man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9rWgoxfUUlAlAYkPPM7wUrIIyrT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520576'),
  ('694773608241871646', 'After the Rain, on Thursday', 1986, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Mikhail Yuzovskiy, Konstantin Arutyunov, Vladimir Sapozhnikov', 'Yuli Kim', 'Oleg Tabakov, Tatyana Pelttser, Semyon Farada, Valentina Talyzina, Oleg Anofriev, Marina Yakovleva, Mariya Barabanova, Yuri Medvedev', null, 'A palace steward conspires with bandits to kidnap an infant czar''s son and an orphan adopted by the czar, replacing the prince with the steward''s son. Two decades later the true prince and his foster brother are slaves in a quarry, the changeling grew up as a prince, and his mother has been elevated to the highest position in the state for "saving" the prince, but losing her own child. Then the brothers escape, the changeling prince departs to fight an immortal wizard and vanishes, and the brothers have to deal with the wizard. Which includes stealing a bird-woman from a Mid-Eastern khan and figuring where the wizard''s death is.', 'A palace steward conspires with bandits to kidnap an infant czar''s son and an orphan adopted by the czar, replacing the prince with the steward''s son. Two decades later the true prince and his foster brother are slaves in a quarry, the changeling grew up as a prince, and his mother has been elevated to the highest position in the state for "saving" the prince, but losing her own child. Then the brothers escape, the changeling prince departs to fight an immortal wizard and vanishes, and the brothers have to deal with the wizard. Which includes stealing a bird-woman from a Mid-Eastern khan and figuring where the wizard''s death is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukhWCAiJKdfBlg0kC1ZJaukGACK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81561'),
  ('390915818728773113', 'After the Rehearsal', 1984, 'Drama', 'Ingmar Bergman, Sven Nykvist, Eva Bergman', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Erland Josephson, Ingrid Thulin, Lena Olin, Nadja Palmstjerna-Weiss, Bertil Guve', null, 'Rational, exacting, and self-controlled theater director, Henrik Vogler, often stays after rehearsal to think and plan. On this day, Anna comes back, ostensibly looking for a bracelet. She is the lead in his new production of Strindberg''s A Dream Play. She talks of her hatred for her mother, now dead, an alcoholic actress, who was Vogler''s star and lover.', 'Rational, exacting, and self-controlled theater director, Henrik Vogler, often stays after rehearsal to think and plan. On this day, Anna comes back, ostensibly looking for a bracelet. She is the lead in his new production of Strindberg''s A Dream Play. She talks of her hatred for her mother, now dead, an alcoholic actress, who was Vogler''s star and lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHgcLxoF0pxH9JmriF01MHV11du.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42090'),
  ('240186273752311426', 'After the SIlence', 1996, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Fred Gerber, Maggie Parker, Ken Meyer', 'Vivienne Radkoff', 'JoBeth Williams, Kellie Martin, Alan Rosenberg, Aaron Kubey, Thomas Kopache, Billy Jayne, Donna Bullock, Jennifer Delora', null, 'Laura is a 20 year old deaf girl who has never been taught sign language. She is rescued from neglect and physical abuse by Pam, a social worker. Pam teaches her how to communicate and uncovers Laura''s true personality.', 'Laura is a 20 year old deaf girl who has never been taught sign language. She is rescued from neglect and physical abuse by Pam, a social worker. Pam teaches her how to communicate and uncovers Laura''s true personality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSZrnzfgMnRHLGnKaVI0OuAOXlY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129021'),
  ('107919202996405406', 'After the Storm', 2016, 'Drama', 'Hirokazu Kore-eda, Atsushi Kaneshige, Kaoru Endô', 'Hirokazu Kore-eda', 'Hiroshi Abe, Kirin Kiki, Yoko Maki, Taiyo Yoshizawa, Satomi Kobayashi, Sosuke Ikematsu, Lily Franky, Isao Hashizume', null, 'Ryota is an unpopular writer although he won a literary award 15 years ago. Now, Ryota works as a private detective. He is divorced from his ex-wife Kyoko and he has an 11-year-old son Shingo. His mother Yoshiko lives alone at her apartment. One day, Ryota, his ex-wife Kyoko, and son Shingo gather at Yoshiko''s apartment. A typhoon passes and the family must stay there all night long.', 'Ryota is an unpopular writer although he won a literary award 15 years ago. Now, Ryota works as a private detective. He is divorced from his ex-wife Kyoko and he has an 11-year-old son Shingo. His mother Yoshiko lives alone at her apartment. One day, Ryota, his ex-wife Kyoko, and son Shingo gather at Yoshiko''s apartment. A typhoon passes and the family must stay there all night long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwpBfqI1xPkSWD5PYlwypoBIkpz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374671'),
  ('994416014181493524', 'After the Storm', 2019, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Jeff Maher, Iain LaCourt, Jean-Christophe Castell', 'Patrick McBrearty', 'Madeline Leon, Bo Yokely, Carlisle J. Williams, Diana Chrisman, Craig Morgan, Will Ennis, Colin Price, Brian Scott Carleton', null, 'Lauren wants to rebuild her community, including her family home, in the aftermath of a devastatingly disastrous storm.', 'Lauren wants to rebuild her community, including her family home, in the aftermath of a devastatingly disastrous storm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Az6FT66SQJk1NUO8YSpsWcodzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601701'),
  ('525512909475743919', 'After the Sunset', 2004, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Dante Spinotti, Brett Ratner, Victoria Thomas', 'Paul Zbyszewski, Craig Rosenberg', 'Pierce Brosnan, Salma Hayek Pinault, Woody Harrelson, Don Cheadle, Naomie Harris, Troy Garity, Russell Hornsby, Rex Linn', 'PG-13', 'An FBI agent is suspicious of two master thieves, quietly enjoying their retirement near what may - or may not - be the biggest score of their careers.', 'An FBI agent is suspicious of two master thieves, quietly enjoying their retirement near what may - or may not - be the biggest score of their careers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mo3OdxeR6pLgAVt4a3cyvUUQri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10589'),
  ('861035504003251463', 'After the Thin Man', 1936, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Harry McAfee, Edwin B. Willis, W.S. Van Dyke', 'Frances Goodrich, Albert Hackett', 'William Powell, Myrna Loy, James Stewart, Elissa Landi, Joseph Calleia, Jessie Ralph, Alan Marshal, Teddy Hart', 'NR', 'Nick and Nora Charles investigate when Nora''s cousin reports her disreputable husband is missing, and find themselves in a mystery involving the shady owners of a popular nightclub, a singer and her dark brother, the cousin''s forsaken true love, and Nora''s bombastic and controlling aunt.', 'Nick and Nora Charles investigate when Nora''s cousin reports her disreputable husband is missing, and find themselves in a mystery involving the shady owners of a popular nightclub, a singer and her dark brother, the cousin''s forsaken true love, and Nora''s bombastic and controlling aunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fkCHOffEkPOY0UwSrvzG6YKDVp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14588'),
  ('1011619173740369222', 'After the Truth', 1999, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Roland Suso Richter, Anja Dihrberg, Martin Langer', 'Christopher Riley, Johannes W. Betz, Kathleen Riley', 'Götz George, Kai Wiesinger, Karoline Eichhorn, Doris Schade, Peter Roggisch, Bastian Trost, Peter Rühring, Michaela Rosen', null, 'Famous Nazi doctor Josef Mengele — the ''Death Angel of Auschwitz'', who killed more than 300.000 people — emerges from his hideout in Argentina to Germany as a 87-year-old man, and must stand for his crimes in court. The young solicitor Peter Rohm is assigned to defend him, but Rohm himself — an expert on Mengele and his crimes — feels unable to do so. When he decides to take on the case, he endangers not only his marriage but also his and his wife''s lives.', 'Famous Nazi doctor Josef Mengele — the ''Death Angel of Auschwitz'', who killed more than 300.000 people — emerges from his hideout in Argentina to Germany as a 87-year-old man, and must stand for his crimes in court. The young solicitor Peter Rohm is assigned to defend him, but Rohm himself — an expert on Mengele and his crimes — feels unable to do so. When he decides to take on the case, he endangers not only his marriage but also his and his wife''s lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPK44BqPchl5NvFC68nZsYP3w6i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25144'),
  ('686350057485574085', 'After the War', 2017, 'Drama', 'Annarita Zambrano, Laurent Brunet', 'Annarita Zambrano, Delphine Agut', 'Giuseppe Battiston, Barbora Bobuľová, Fabrizio Ferracane, Charlotte Cétaire, Elisabetta Piccolomini, Marilyne Canto, Jean-Marc Barr, Orfeo Orlando', null, 'Bologna, 2002. Amidst protests against the labor reform, the assassination of a lawyer opens old wounds between Italy and France. Former far-left terrorist Marco, convicted of murder during the Years of Lead and living in Paris since then thanks to the Mitterrand Doctrine, is suspected of being its instigator. When the Italian government asks for extradition, Marco goes into hiding with his daughter Viola, precipitating also the life of his family back in Italy.', 'Bologna, 2002. Amidst protests against the labor reform, the assassination of a lawyer opens old wounds between Italy and France. Former far-left terrorist Marco, convicted of murder during the Years of Lead and living in Paris since then thanks to the Mitterrand Doctrine, is suspected of being its instigator. When the Italian government asks for extradition, Marco goes into hiding with his daughter Viola, precipitating also the life of his family back in Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8w3xeEyB69mL2em0hwRxRdxAjT9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452018'),
  ('1114531682615041280', 'After the Wedding', 2006, 'Drama', 'Morten Søborg, Susanne Bier', 'Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Mads Mikkelsen, Stine Fischer Christensen, Sidse Babett Knudsen, Rolf Lassgård, Christian Tafdrup, Ida Dwinger, Mona Malm, Neel Rønholt', null, 'A manager of an orphanage in India is sent to Copenhagen, Denmark, where he discovers a life-altering family secret.', 'A manager of an orphanage in India is sent to Copenhagen, Denmark, where he discovers a life-altering family secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29t5x0Aj4cQJJC9jNR3VWS7l3JL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3549'),
  ('155898040283647017', 'After the Wedding', 2019, 'Drama', 'Bart Freundlich, Julio Macat', 'Susanne Bier, Anders Thomas Jensen', 'Julianne Moore, Michelle Williams, Billy Crudup, Abby Quinn, Alex Esola, Susan Blackwell, Will Chase, Eisa Davis', 'PG-13', 'Seeking funds for her orphanage in India, Isabelle travels to New York to meet Theresa, a wealthy benefactor. An invitation to attend a wedding ignites a series of events in which the past collides with the present while mysteries unravel.', 'Seeking funds for her orphanage in India, Isabelle travels to New York to meet Theresa, a wealthy benefactor. An invitation to attend a wedding ignites a series of events in which the past collides with the present while mysteries unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cyFbVSajl1NGwBJdW0xOyvh9t7G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:527385'),
  ('684149746009451716', 'After Truth: Disinformation and the Cost of Fake News', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Andrew Rossi, Bryan Sarkinen', null, 'Jack Burkman, Elizabeth Williamson, Molly McKew, Troy Michalik, Brian Schatz', null, 'An investigation into the ongoing threat caused by the phenomenon of “fake news” in the U.S., focusing on the real-life consequences that disinformation, conspiracy theories and false news stories have on the average citizen.', 'An investigation into the ongoing threat caused by the phenomenon of “fake news” in the U.S., focusing on the real-life consequences that disinformation, conspiracy theories and false news stories have on the average citizen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0O1IMV3DtLiXtw9m8wLsazfyA9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680438'),
  ('505448870705886060', 'After We Collided', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Chad Rosen, Tony Niknejadi, Chris Wright Jr.', 'Anna Todd, Mario Celaya', 'Josephine Langford, Hero Fiennes Tiffin, Dylan Sprouse, Louise Lombard, Charlie Weber, Candice King, Shane Paul McGhie, Rob Estes', 'R', 'Tessa finds herself struggling with her complicated relationship with Hardin; she faces a dilemma that could change their lives forever.', 'Tessa finds herself struggling with her complicated relationship with Hardin; she faces a dilemma that could change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiX7UYfOpYrMFSAGbI6j1pFkLzQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613504'),
  ('526917113580257478', 'After We Fell', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Joshua Reis, Satyvart Arya, Castille Landon', 'Sharon Soboil', 'Josephine Langford, Hero Fiennes Tiffin, Carter Jenkins, Louise Lombard, Chance Perdomo, Rob Estes, Arielle Kebbel, Stephen Moyer', 'R', 'Just as Tessa''s life begins to become unglued, nothing is what she thought it would be. Not her friends nor her family. The only person that she should be able to rely on is Hardin, who is furious when he discovers the massive secret that she''s been keeping. Before Tessa makes the biggest decision of her life, everything changes because of revelations about her family.', 'Just as Tessa''s life begins to become unglued, nothing is what she thought it would be. Not her friends nor her family. The only person that she should be able to rely on is Hardin, who is furious when he discovers the massive secret that she''s been keeping. Before Tessa makes the biggest decision of her life, everything changes because of revelations about her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dU4HfnTEJDf9KvxGS9hgO7BVeju.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744275'),
  ('1148848831272931658', 'After Yang', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Benjamin Loeb, Todd Ivins, Rosa Callejas', 'Kogonada', 'Justin H. Min, Malea Emma Tjandrawidjaja, Colin Farrell, Jodie Turner-Smith, Haley Lu Richardson, Sarita Choudhury, Ritchie Coster, Clifton Collins Jr.', 'PG', 'When his young daughter''s beloved companion — an android named Yang — malfunctions, Jake searches for a way to repair him. In the process, Jake discovers the life that has been passing in front of him, reconnecting with his wife and daughter across a distance he didn''t know was there.', 'When his young daughter''s beloved companion — an android named Yang — malfunctions, Jake searches for a way to repair him. In the process, Jake discovers the life that has been passing in front of him, reconnecting with his wife and daughter across a distance he didn''t know was there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjEuDeKOhA7JqaaqhLSfoS9titb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585378'),
  ('34094812442084366', 'After You', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Pierre Salvadori', 'Benoît Graffin, Pierre Salvadori, David Léotard', 'Daniel Auteuil, Sandrine Kiberlain, Marilyne Canto, Michèle Moretti, José Garcia, Ange Ruzé, Blandine Pélissier, Didier Menin', 'R', 'Antoine works in a bar in Paris. One evening on his way home from work, he intervenes when a man tries to commit suicide. He feels strangely guilty about having saved the man''s life and constantly tries to help him, make things better. No matter what Antoine does, he can''t get Louis''s mind off Blanche, the woman of his dreams, his sole obsession, the reason why he wanted to die... Antoine decides to look for her, but doesn''t let Louis know.', 'Antoine works in a bar in Paris. One evening on his way home from work, he intervenes when a man tries to commit suicide. He feels strangely guilty about having saved the man''s life and constantly tries to help him, make things better. No matter what Antoine does, he can''t get Louis''s mind off Blanche, the woman of his dreams, his sole obsession, the reason why he wanted to die... Antoine decides to look for her, but doesn''t let Louis know.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ro2GcTo04JtEl62caPAjzVBPcPx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16932'),
  ('389550596355825548', 'After.Life', 2009, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Agnieszka Wojtowicz-Vosloo, Rumiko Ishii, Anastas N. Michos', 'Paul Vosloo, Jakub Korolczuk, Agnieszka Wojtowicz-Vosloo', 'Christina Ricci, Liam Neeson, Justin Long, Chandler Canterbury, Josh Charles, Celia Weston, Shuler Hensley, Anna Kuchma', 'R', 'Following a terrible car crash, a woman awakes to find an enigmatic mortician preparing her for burial.', 'Following a terrible car crash, a woman awakes to find an enigmatic mortician preparing her for burial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ty43RTdSBpL3VjBJWeRoKhFg7hF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36419'),
  ('247807675134038932', 'Afterburn', 2025, 'Action, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'J.J. Perry, José David Montero', 'Matt Johnson, Nimród Antal', 'Dave Bautista, Olga Kurylenko, Kristofer Hivju, Samuel L. Jackson, Daniel Bernhardt, Simon Merrells, Kevin Eldon, Eden Epstein', 'R', 'Set against the backdrop of a postapocalyptic Earth whose Eastern Hemisphere was destroyed by a massive solar flare, leaving what life remains mutated from radiation and fallout. The story revolves around a group of treasure hunters who extract such objects as the Mona Lisa, the Rosetta Stone and the Crown Jewels while facing rival hunters, mutants and pirates.', 'Set against the backdrop of a postapocalyptic Earth whose Eastern Hemisphere was destroyed by a massive solar flare, leaving what life remains mutated from radiation and fallout. The story revolves around a group of treasure hunters who extract such objects as the Mona Lisa, the Rosetta Stone and the Crown Jewels while facing rival hunters, mutants and pirates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fSXZFZVfJmC2v0TkW711QD5o76N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507244'),
  ('938240509878822178', 'AfterDeath', 2015, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Gez Medinger, Robin Schmidt, Benedict Spence', 'Andrew Ellard', 'Miranda Raison, Sam Keeley, Daniella Kertesz, Elarica Johnson, Lorna Nickson Brown', null, 'Five young people wake up dead. Washed up by the tide they scramble to an abandoned beach house, soon realizing that the perpetual night and blasts of pain suggest this is some version of hell. Between in-fighting and attacks by a demonic shadow creature, they recall the collapse of the nightclub that brought them here - and begin seeing hope of a second chance in the cabin''s two mysterious paintings...', 'Five young people wake up dead. Washed up by the tide they scramble to an abandoned beach house, soon realizing that the perpetual night and blasts of pain suggest this is some version of hell. Between in-fighting and attacks by a demonic shadow creature, they recall the collapse of the nightclub that brought them here - and begin seeing hope of a second chance in the cabin''s two mysterious paintings...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nfbBfC7lqOKMC8G5bx4e7kKB2C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214256'),
  ('540620363359215748', 'Afterglow', 1997, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alan Rudolph, Toyomichi Kurita, Christina Fon', 'Alan Rudolph', 'Nick Nolte, Julie Christie, Lara Flynn Boyle, Jonny Lee Miller, Jay Underwood, Genevieve Bissonnette, Domini Blythe, Yves Corbeil', 'R', 'Lucky Mann is a builder equally handy at repairs and seduction. The latest housewife to succumb to his charms is Marianne, unhappily married to corporate exec Jeffrey. When Jeffrey becomes enraptured by Lucky’s wife Phyllis, the four get caught in a love quadrangle that reignites their marriages.', 'Lucky Mann is a builder equally handy at repairs and seduction. The latest housewife to succumb to his charms is Marianne, unhappily married to corporate exec Jeffrey. When Jeffrey becomes enraptured by Lucky’s wife Phyllis, the four get caught in a love quadrangle that reignites their marriages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c13Luo9O09ah6nMPrsr3zqlLyF9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26941'),
  ('351089929634643813', 'Afterimage', 2016, 'Drama, History', 'Alexander Denysenko, Andrzej Wajda, Paweł Edelman', 'Andrzej Mularczyk, Andrzej Wajda', 'Bogusław Linda, Bronisława Zamachowska, Zofia Wichłacz, Aleksandra Justa, Krzysztof Pieczyński, Mariusz Bonaszewski, Rafał Zawierucha, Jacek Beler', null, 'In 1945, as Stalin sets his hands over Poland, famous painter Wladislaw Strzeminski refuses to compromise on his art with the doctrines of social realism. Persecuted, expelled from his chair at the University, he''s eventually erased from the museums'' walls. With the help of some of his students, he starts fighting against the Party and becomes the symbol of an artistic resistance against intellectual tyranny.', 'In 1945, as Stalin sets his hands over Poland, famous painter Wladislaw Strzeminski refuses to compromise on his art with the doctrines of social realism. Persecuted, expelled from his chair at the University, he''s eventually erased from the museums'' walls. With the help of some of his students, he starts fighting against the Party and becomes the symbol of an artistic resistance against intellectual tyranny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewSIleSH1w6hOvfgHlDTNyFooUF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411678'),
  ('167904338862702275', 'Afterlife of the Party', 2021, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Swan, Stephen Herek', 'Carrie Freedle', 'Victoria Justice, Midori Francis, Robyn Scott, Adam Garcia, Timothy Renouf, Gloria Garcia, Myfanwy Waring, Spencer Sutherland', null, 'A social butterfly who dies during her birthday week is given a second chance to right her wrongs on Earth.', 'A social butterfly who dies during her birthday week is given a second chance to right her wrongs on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bkcOEt4zvc5tBl6xFxTbkSqhEQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785457'),
  ('966306649206990124', 'Afterlight', 2025, 'Science Fiction', 'Alison Kohlhardt, Andrew McGee', 'Thomas Loveman, Andrew McGee', 'Anna Fraser, Ellise Chappell, Linda-Jean Barry, Clive Wood, Jacob Fortune-Lloyd, Stefan Trout', null, 'In a future shaped by war, AI, and fractured timelines, five sci-fi stories explore humanity’s fight for connection, survival, and meaning across time and space.', 'In a future shaped by war, AI, and fractured timelines, five sci-fi stories explore humanity’s fight for connection, survival, and meaning across time and space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bzMCW1E1sOWEbjVuQ8iRGrdpcw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1590097'),
  ('427599969206153873', 'Aftermath', 1994, 'Horror, Crime', 'Nacho Cerdà, Christopher Baffa', 'Nacho Cerdà', 'Pep Tosar, Xevi Collellmir, Jordi Tarrida, Ángel Tarris', 'R', 'When the others leave for the night, the last mortician begins to fondle the corpses. He quickly moves to the corpse of a young woman who died in a car crash.', 'When the others leave for the night, the last mortician begins to fondle the corpses. He quickly moves to the corpse of a young woman who died in a car crash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yq2p5GPbtyFN5QuhwGbNtvEdUp7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31022'),
  ('626335142806713927', 'Aftermath', 2012, 'Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 'Władysław Pasikowski, Paweł Edelman', 'Władysław Pasikowski', 'Ireneusz Czop, Maciej Stuhr, Jerzy Radziwiłowicz, Zuzana Fialová, Andrzej Mastalerz, Zbigniew Zamachowski, Danuta Szaflarska, Jerzy Szynkiewicz', null, 'Two brothers are trying to find out the truth from years ago. The whole town is against them.', 'Two brothers are trying to find out the truth from years ago. The whole town is against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdkPvFAs5C5RtQan18cvPQdsM0e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143800'),
  ('825531674964492092', 'Aftermath', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Peter Engert, Scott Winig', 'Christian McDonald', 'Alexander B. Williams, Jessie Rusu, Monica Keena, Edward Furlong, Andre Royo, Luis Da Silva, Jr., Bobbi Sue Luther, C.J. Thomason', 'R', 'Searching for a happy ending to a tale of unimaginable disaster and horror, nine strangers find themselves holed up together in a farmhouse cellar in rural Texas. The United States has hastily become embroiled in World War 3. A young doctor named Hunter survives the nuclear attack and is thrown together by happenstance with a group of wounded and frightened victims, including Elizabeth, a strong-willed confidant to Hunter, Brad - an antagonistic redneck jackass, and Jennifer, a barely coherent young woman suffering from severe post-traumatic stress. Together, they attempt to endure the devastating holocaust as they struggle with claustrophobia and conflicting personalities. In a makeshift shelter, Hunter and his dying companions wait for news from the government while fending off hunger, radiation sickness, and a horde of frightened and dying refugees', 'Searching for a happy ending to a tale of unimaginable disaster and horror, nine strangers find themselves holed up together in a farmhouse cellar in rural Texas. The United States has hastily become embroiled in World War 3. A young doctor named Hunter survives the nuclear attack and is thrown together by happenstance with a group of wounded and frightened victims, including Elizabeth, a strong-willed confidant to Hunter, Brad - an antagonistic redneck jackass, and Jennifer, a barely coherent young woman suffering from severe post-traumatic stress. Together, they attempt to endure the devastating holocaust as they struggle with claustrophobia and conflicting personalities. In a makeshift shelter, Hunter and his dying companions wait for news from the government while fending off hunger, radiation sickness, and a horde of frightened and dying refugees', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QsMEN5Vkjusez9Q1bZTaFJJWOM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188839'),
  ('715990435110925156', 'Aftermath', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Elliott Lester, Pieter Vermeer, Jeremy Phoenix', 'Javier Gullón', 'Arnold Schwarzenegger, Scoot McNairy, Maggie Grace, Judah Nelson, Larry Sullivan, Jason McCune, Glenn Morshower, Mariana Klaveno', 'R', 'A fatal plane crash changes the lives of Roman and Jake forever. Roman loses his wife and daughter in the accident, while Jake loses his mind—as he happens to be the air traffic controller who failed to avert the nightmare. Rage and revenge engulfs Roman and Jake finds himself swamped with guilt and regret.', 'A fatal plane crash changes the lives of Roman and Jake forever. Roman loses his wife and daughter in the accident, while Jake loses his mind—as he happens to be the air traffic controller who failed to avert the nightmare. Rage and revenge engulfs Roman and Jake finds himself swamped with guilt and regret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25oWTCGqIik4gUTMidx3L8DI4Bt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390051'),
