  ('903790073968325919', 'Afterwards', 2008, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Gilles Bourdos, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Gilles Bourdos, Michel Spinosa', 'John Malkovich, Romain Duris, Evangeline Lilly, Reece Thompson, Pascale Bussières, Sara Waisglass, Bruno Verdoni, Joan Gregson', 'R', 'Newly divorced lawyer Nathan Del Amico is shaken up after he meets a doctor who claims that he can sense when select people are about to die. Though he doesn''t believe the doctor, events in Nathan''s life slowly make him think he''s not long for this world.', 'Newly divorced lawyer Nathan Del Amico is shaken up after he meets a doctor who claims that he can sense when select people are about to die. Though he doesn''t believe the doctor, events in Nathan''s life slowly make him think he''s not long for this world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/byElFR4rU7aU8FQoorVNmIxCSUV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1782'),
