  ('869393300979735351', 'Again Once Again', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Martín Slifkin, Romina Paula, Eduardo Crespo', 'Romina Paula', 'Romina Paula, Mónica Rank, Ramón Cohen Arazi, Mariana Chaud, Pablo Sigal, Denise Groesman, Esteban Bigliardi', null, 'Romina returns to her roots to rediscover who she is. After the first overwhelming years as a mother, it''s as if the mist starts to rise: she''s a little too old for disco parties and hanging round with twenty-somethings, but still young enough to fantasise about others. Actress Romina Paula points the camera at herself, her son and her mother in this intriguing mixture of documentary and fiction.', 'Romina returns to her roots to rediscover who she is. After the first overwhelming years as a mother, it''s as if the mist starts to rise: she''s a little too old for disco parties and hanging round with twenty-somethings, but still young enough to fantasise about others. Actress Romina Paula points the camera at herself, her son and her mother in this intriguing mixture of documentary and fiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fb2UHxbrlmRz7RCBxKvsEPc79MO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575804'),
