  ('795657897136475411', 'Against the Wind', 1948, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Charles Crichton, Lionel Banes, Paul Beeson', 'Michael Pertwee, J. Elder Wills, T. E. B. Clarke', 'Robert Beatty, Simone Signoret, Jack Warner, Gordon Jackson, Paul Dupuis, James Robertson Justice, Eugene Deckers, John Slater', 'NR', 'A disparate group of volunteers are trained as saboteurs and parachuted into Belgium to blow up an office containing important Nazi records and to rescue a prominent S.O.E. agent, who is being interrogated by the Germans for vital information.', 'A disparate group of volunteers are trained as saboteurs and parachuted into Belgium to blow up an office containing important Nazi records and to rescue a prominent S.O.E. agent, who is being interrogated by the Germans for vital information.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3RjT4AFZZqABKEUH7NIdjHFrp5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32867'),
  ('124896747785584516', 'Agak Laen', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Muhadkly Acho, Arfian, Joan Ardiana', 'Muhadkly Acho', 'Oki Rengga, Boris Bokir, Bene Dion Rajagukguk, Indra Jegel, Tissa Biani, Arie Kriting, Arief Didu, Indah Permatasari', 'PG-13', 'Four friends, working in a haunted house ride at a night market, unintentionally cause the death of an elderly man with heart disease through fright. They decide to bury his body within the haunted house, which turns out to be beneficial for the attraction... at least for a little while.', 'Four friends, working in a haunted house ride at a night market, unintentionally cause the death of an elderly man with heart disease through fright. They decide to bury his body within the haunted house, which turns out to be beneficial for the attraction... at least for a little while.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUOwyPbDD9Agl3pHQVHGbZE0TvI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1175161'),
  ('555087182211827661', 'Agak Laen: Menyala Pantiku!', 2025, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Muhadkly Acho, Meisa Felaroze, Joan Ardiana', 'Muhadkly Acho', 'Bene Dion Rajagukguk, Oki Rengga, Indra Jegel, Boris Bokir, Tissa Biani, Boah Sartika, Priska Baru Segu, Gita Bhebhita', null, 'After repeatedly failing their missions, Detectives Bene, Boris, Jegel, and Oki are given one last chance: to go undercover in a nursing home in search of a fugitive wanted for the murder of the mayor’s child.', 'After repeatedly failing their missions, Detectives Bene, Boris, Jegel, and Oki are given one last chance: to go undercover in a nursing home in search of a fugitive wanted for the murder of the mayor’s child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPJ9OjLgAQoLZrPeL6ZfQwNkfPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1287571'),
  ('224347212285786270', 'Agamenon: The Film', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Victor Lopes, Jacques Cheuiche', 'Marcelo Madureira, Hubert', 'Marcelo Adnet, Luana Piovani, Hubert, Marcelo Madureira, Pedro Bial, Fernanda Montenegro, Zeca Pagodinho, Susana Vieira', null, 'The trajectory of the clumsy reporter Agamenon Mendes Pereira, always present in key events of history, his biggest scoops and his eternal love for Isaura, who survives his unexpected travels around the world, in search of news and fame.', 'The trajectory of the clumsy reporter Agamenon Mendes Pereira, always present in key events of history, his biggest scoops and his eternal love for Isaura, who survives his unexpected travels around the world, in search of news and fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sA7eFsHAdlSwdqtbxuATV9QaOiL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95753'),
  ('247662316845123450', 'Agata Christian - Murder on the Snow', 2026, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Eros Puglielli, Mirko Vigliotti, Michele D''Attanasio', 'Mariano Di Nardo, Federico Fava, Antonio Manca', 'Christian De Sica, Lillo Petrolo, Paolo Calabresi, Maccio Capatonda, Giorgio Colangeli, Sara Croce, Tony Effe, Chiara Francini', null, 'Christian Agata, a famous criminologist known for his biting sarcasm and infallible investigative talent, finds himself caught up in a weekend of mystery. Invited by the Gulmar family—tycoons of the board game industry—to act as a spokesperson for the relaunch of their historic game "Crime Castle," he agrees to spend a few days at their winter estate in the Aosta Valley. What began as a quiet commercial operation soon transforms itslef into a case to solve.', 'Christian Agata, a famous criminologist known for his biting sarcasm and infallible investigative talent, finds himself caught up in a weekend of mystery. Invited by the Gulmar family—tycoons of the board game industry—to act as a spokesperson for the relaunch of their historic game "Crime Castle," he agrees to spend a few days at their winter estate in the Aosta Valley. What began as a quiet commercial operation soon transforms itslef into a case to solve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aepzyeHXnnKxHNwynDILsp0QGm8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1449709'),
  ('470486487673855957', 'Agatha', 1979, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Michael Apted, Gary White, Matthew Binns', 'Arthur Hopcraft, Kathleen Tynan', 'Dustin Hoffman, Vanessa Redgrave, Timothy Dalton, Helen Morse, Celia Gregory, Paul Brooke, Carolyn Pickles, Timothy West', 'PG', 'England, 1926. An American journalist looks for mystery writer Agatha Christie when she suddenly disappears without explanation, leaving no trace.', 'England, 1926. An American journalist looks for mystery writer Agatha Christie when she suddenly disappears without explanation, leaving no trace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxjoGsAvcMUM23ciIYOERGZUxSE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31200'),
  ('894479172122227356', 'Agatha and the Curse of Ishtar', 2019, 'Crime', 'Victor Jenkins, Catherine Goldschmidt, Daniel-Konrad Cooper', 'Tom Dalton', 'Lyndsey Marshal, Jonah Hauer-King, Bronagh Waugh, Rory Fleck-Byrne, Jack Deam, Katherine Kingsley, Crystal Clarke, Stanley Townsend', 'PG-13', 'On an archaeological dig in Iraq, author Agatha Christie uncovers a series of murders.', 'On an archaeological dig in Iraq, author Agatha Christie uncovers a series of murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpKLc5LCxuI7VJ57ZYIpAEpF0bp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655730'),
  ('269330478459911301', 'Agatha and the Limitless Readings', 1981, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marguerite Duras, Jean-Paul Meurisse, Dominique Le Rigoleur', 'Marguerite Duras', 'Bulle Ogier, Yann Andréa, Marguerite Duras', null, 'A man and his sister meet at a seaside village to discuss their relationship.', 'A man and his sister meet at a seaside village to discuss their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agrscypKfjYeFVqw6rtD9GwQp5f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63659'),
  ('561673657950918283', 'Agatha and the Midnight Murders', 2020, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Birgit Dierken, Grantly Butters, Joe Stephenson', 'Tom Dalton', 'Helen Baxendale, Blake Harrison, Jacqueline Boatswain, Gina Bramhill, Daniel Caltagirone, Thomas Chaanhing, Scott Chambers, Vanessa Grasse', null, 'As bombs fall on London, writer Agatha Christie decides it is time to kill off her most famous creation.', 'As bombs fall on London, writer Agatha Christie decides it is time to kill off her most famous creation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irV5m9TNccLSluETdX2KNy6noGp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:749395'),
  ('874416472947135834', 'Agatha and the Storm', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Silvio Soldini, Cinzia Castania, Arnaldo Catinari', 'Doriana Leondeff, Francesco Piccolo, Silvio Soldini', 'Licia Maglietta, Giuseppe Battiston, Emilio Solfrizzi, Marina Massironi, Claudio Santamaria, Giselda Volodi, Monica Nappo, Ann Eleonora Jørgensen', null, 'The story of a middle-aged bookshop owner, who becomes embroiled in a surreal swirl of romance and family secrets of infidelity, her energy levels registering in bursts of electrical interference - causing lightbulbs, traffic lights, toasters and computers to spontaneously spark and malfunction.', 'The story of a middle-aged bookshop owner, who becomes embroiled in a surreal swirl of romance and family secrets of infidelity, her energy levels registering in bursts of electrical interference - causing lightbulbs, traffic lights, toasters and computers to spontaneously spark and malfunction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jx7kuBMHAmfSPW84APW9MYRFlEQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14086'),
  ('522066849849688626', 'Agatha and the Truth of Murder', 2018, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Terry Loane, Theo Herron, Afric Gray', 'Tom Dalton', 'Ruth Bradley, Pippa Haywood, Dean Andrews, Bebe Cave, Blake Harrison, Tim McInnerny, Luke Pierre, Joshua Silver', 'PG-13', 'England, December 1926. Although her personal life is in tatters, the famous writer Agatha Christie decides to leave everything behind to help unravel an unsolved murder committed on a train six years ago, unable to imagine the disproportionate consequences that such a selfless act will cause.', 'England, December 1926. Although her personal life is in tatters, the famous writer Agatha Christie decides to leave everything behind to help unravel an unsolved murder committed on a train six years ago, unable to imagine the disproportionate consequences that such a selfless act will cause.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9RzNEpejLkEBVH7cGNekpec8hS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570352'),
  ('74271279576341231', 'Agatha Christie''s Seven Dials Mystery', 1981, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Tony Wharmby', 'Pat Sandys', 'John Gielgud, Cheryl Campbell, Rula Lenska, Lynne Ross, James Warwick, Harry Andrews, Joyce Redman, Lucy Gutteridge', null, 'When two mysterious deaths mar an otherwise pleasant weekend in the English countryside, unflappable flapper Lady Eileen Brent teams up with the dashing Jimmy Thesinger to solve the dastardly deeds. Their sleuthing leads them into a world of espionage and international intrigue as they discover a secret society known as "The Seven Dials" and the attempted theft of top-secret government documents.', 'When two mysterious deaths mar an otherwise pleasant weekend in the English countryside, unflappable flapper Lady Eileen Brent teams up with the dashing Jimmy Thesinger to solve the dastardly deeds. Their sleuthing leads them into a world of espionage and international intrigue as they discover a secret society known as "The Seven Dials" and the attempted theft of top-secret government documents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8qT9SGGqMqFVAAGvKZ2HApjszP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55910'),
  ('138220233652348862', 'Agatha Christie''s The Pale Horse', 1997, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Charles Beeson, Witold Stok', null, 'Colin Buchanan, Jayne Ashbourne, Hermione Norris, Leslie Phillips, Michael Byrne, Jean Marsh, Ruth Madoc, Andy Serkis', null, 'Writer Mark Easterbrook has a vested interest in solving the murder of a priest. That''s because Mark himself is under suspicion. But to save his reputation and put the real killer behind bars, he''ll have to go through a mysterious list of names that''s suddenly turned up and may hold the key to the murderer''s identity.', 'Writer Mark Easterbrook has a vested interest in solving the murder of a priest. That''s because Mark himself is under suspicion. But to save his reputation and put the real killer behind bars, he''ll have to go through a mysterious list of names that''s suddenly turned up and may hold the key to the murderer''s identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HIyF3TOuQPSPmdpzRqfJoLqF1W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56012'),
  ('858940755911253785', 'Agathe Cléry', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Étienne Chatiliez, Philippe Welt', 'Laurent Chouchan, Étienne Chatiliez', 'Valérie Lemercier, Anthony Kavanagh, Dominique Lavanant, Jacques Boudet, Isabelle Nanty, Jean Rochefort, Artus de Penguern, Valentine Varela', null, 'Agathe Clery, a marketing manager for a cosmetics company, is snobbish, stubborn and racist. When she is diagnosed with Addison Syndrome, an disorder that darkens the pigmentation of one''s skin, she suddenly finds herself resembling a black woman.', 'Agathe Clery, a marketing manager for a cosmetics company, is snobbish, stubborn and racist. When she is diagnosed with Addison Syndrome, an disorder that darkens the pigmentation of one''s skin, she suddenly finds herself resembling a black woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNJDjrXOEXegDnSpxJ9W3AILRuO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20072'),
  ('606639001094486661', 'Age of Bloom', 2001, 'Drama', 'Wong Kar-Wai', null, null, null, 'A montage of scenes from vintage Chinese films—most of which were considered lost until some nitrate prints were discovered in a California warehouse in the 1990s—set to the song "Hua yang de nian hua" ("Age of Bloom") by Zhou Xuan.', 'A montage of scenes from vintage Chinese films—most of which were considered lost until some nitrate prints were discovered in a California warehouse in the 1990s—set to the song "Hua yang de nian hua" ("Age of Bloom") by Zhou Xuan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Vijm6LezZvQXqiAritLOang81p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187548'),
  ('271874218155831841', 'Age of Cannibals', 2014, 'Drama', 'Johannes Naber', 'Stefan Weigl', 'Devid Striesow, Sebastian Blomberg, Katharina Schüttler, Joana Adu-Gyamfi, Jaymes Butler, Steve Ellery, Warsama Guled, Florence Kasumba', null, 'Öllers and Niederländer have everything under control. For the past six years, the two successful business consultants have been traveling through some of the seediest countries around the world in order to satisfy their clients greed. They have achieved almost everything, but there is one career move left: to finally become a partner in the company! When they find out that their team colleague Hellinger made the cut, they are at their wits end. Up or Out is the name of the game. The fact that Hellinger falls from an office window for no explainable reason doesnt seem to help the situation. Of all people, the young and ambitious Bianca steps in for Hellinger. Öllers and Niederländer are irritated, sarcasm spreads, neuroses break out. The fight for survival within the company takes its toll the AGE OF CANNIBALS dawns.', 'Öllers and Niederländer have everything under control. For the past six years, the two successful business consultants have been traveling through some of the seediest countries around the world in order to satisfy their clients greed. They have achieved almost everything, but there is one career move left: to finally become a partner in the company! When they find out that their team colleague Hellinger made the cut, they are at their wits end. Up or Out is the name of the game. The fact that Hellinger falls from an office window for no explainable reason doesnt seem to help the situation. Of all people, the young and ambitious Bianca steps in for Hellinger. Öllers and Niederländer are irritated, sarcasm spreads, neuroses break out. The fight for survival within the company takes its toll the AGE OF CANNIBALS dawns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LnIo5TNGBuQRz0HI7LFetwKF2V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261192'),
  ('342405069666121424', 'Age of Consent', 1969, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michael Powell, Hannes Staudinger', 'Peter Yeldham', 'James Mason, Helen Mirren, Jack MacGowran, Neva Carr-Glynn, Andonia Katsaros, Peggy Cass, Harold Hopkins, Slim DeGrey', 'R', 'An elderly artist thinks he has become too stale and is past his prime. His friend (and agent) persuades him to go to an offshore island to try once more. On the island he re-discovers his muse in the form of a young girl.', 'An elderly artist thinks he has become too stale and is past his prime. His friend (and agent) persuades him to go to an offshore island to try once more. On the island he re-discovers his muse in the form of a young girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgNg90MAqNsmdwkNAKzB3iMzPyW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49225'),
  ('594579808310258895', 'Age of Dinosaurs', 2013, 'Action, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Joseph J. Lawson, Richard J. Vialet, Glenn Miller', 'Hank Woon Jr', 'Treat Williams, Ronny Cox, Jillian Rose Reed, Laura Tuny, Joshua Michael Allen, Jennifer Robyn Jacobs, Julia Paul, Max Aria', 'NR', 'Using breakthrough flesh-regeneration technology, a biotech firm creates a set of living dinosaurs. But when the creatures escape their museum exhibit and terrorize Los Angeles, a former firefighter must rescue his teenage daughter from the chaos brought on by the Age of Dinosaurs', 'Using breakthrough flesh-regeneration technology, a biotech firm creates a set of living dinosaurs. But when the creatures escape their museum exhibit and terrorize Los Angeles, a former firefighter must rescue his teenage daughter from the chaos brought on by the Age of Dinosaurs', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBqIxwCKWGKKOzsiaSbeYsQxqeZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192813'),
  ('258759728425966990', 'Age of Heroes', 2011, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, War', 'Adrian Vitoria, Lee Whiteman, Mark Hamilton', 'Ed Scates, Adrian Vitoria', 'Sean Bean, Izabella Miko, Danny Dyer, James D''Arcy, Sebastian Street, William Houston, John Dagleish, John Dagleish', 'R', 'The true story of the formation of Ian Fleming''s 30 Commando unit, a precursor for the elite forces in the U.K.', 'The true story of the formation of Ian Fleming''s 30 Commando unit, a precursor for the elite forces in the U.K.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQQbOn1jMfb8bJBhhwrEsDV5474.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38540'),
  ('411189337249458941', 'Age of Ice', 2014, 'Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Ele Bardha, Melody Teodoro Kurtis, Samantha Smith', 'Emile Edwin Smith', 'Barton Bund, Bailey Spry, Owais Ahmed, Joe Cipriano, Jules Hartley, Yaron Urbas, Wasim No''Mani, Revon Yousif', 'NR', 'Massive earthquakes open the Arabian tectonic plate, resulting in unstable weather and freezing temperatures that will be unsurvivable by nightfall. Attempting to reach safety, a vacationing family in Egypt must battle the rapidly cooling temperatures that usher in a new Ice Age, covering the Sphinx, Pyramids, and Sahara Desert with mountains of snow.', 'Massive earthquakes open the Arabian tectonic plate, resulting in unstable weather and freezing temperatures that will be unsurvivable by nightfall. Attempting to reach safety, a vacationing family in Egypt must battle the rapidly cooling temperatures that usher in a new Ice Age, covering the Sphinx, Pyramids, and Sahara Desert with mountains of snow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajWTTgzLImSumz0U0G6cOZMsE1v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297544'),
  ('631322350117343832', 'Age of Monster', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Félix Sabroso', 'Félix Sabroso', 'Javier Cámara, Candela Peña, Carmen Machi, Antonia San Juan, Pilar Castro', null, 'Victor, who claims to have filmed a number of films he''s not been able to release, unites around his deathbed his most faithful collaborator to present his posthumous work.', 'Victor, who claims to have filmed a number of films he''s not been able to release, unites around his deathbed his most faithful collaborator to present his posthumous work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0SJAlqghzCATe1RKcQ3gOAMhJQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366749'),
  ('551684636642229894', 'Age of Panic', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tom Harari, Justine Triet, Benjamin Papin', 'Justine Triet', 'Laetitia Dosch, Vincent Macaigne, Arthur Harari, Virgil Vernier, Marc-Antoine Vaugeois, Jeane Arra-Bellanger, Liv Harari, Émilie Brisavoine', null, 'May 6, 2012. Cable news reporter Laetitia is covering the French presidential elections, while Vincent, her ex-husband, demands to see their two young daughters. It''s a manic Sunday in Paris: two agitated girls, a frazzled babysitter, a needy new boyfriend, a grumpy lawyer and France cut in half!', 'May 6, 2012. Cable news reporter Laetitia is covering the French presidential elections, while Vincent, her ex-husband, demands to see their two young daughters. It''s a manic Sunday in Paris: two agitated girls, a frazzled babysitter, a needy new boyfriend, a grumpy lawyer and France cut in half!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ga63T8UvWRgtyk9oUzTU9ZEizks.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195173'),
  ('167577810635384735', 'Age of the Dragons', 2011, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Ryan Little, Ryan Little', 'McKay Daines, Anne K. Black', 'Corey Sevier, Danny Glover, Vinnie Jones, Sofia Pernas, Larry Bagby, Kepa Kruse, David Morgan, Raphael Cruz', 'PG-13', 'Age of the Dragons is an adaptation of Herman Melville''s classic novel Moby Dick. Set in a medieval realm where Captain Ahab and crew hunt dragons for the vitriol that powers their world, Ishmael, a charismatic harpooner and his friend Queequeg join their quest. Ahab''s adopted daughter Rachel, beautiful and tough, runs the hunting vessel. Ahab''s obsession to seek revenge on a great White Dragon that slaughtered his family when he was young and left his body scarred and mauled, drives the crew deeper into the heart of darkness. In the White Dragon''s lair Ahab''s secrets are revealed and Rachel must choose between following him on his dark quest or escaping to a new life with Ishmael.', 'Age of the Dragons is an adaptation of Herman Melville''s classic novel Moby Dick. Set in a medieval realm where Captain Ahab and crew hunt dragons for the vitriol that powers their world, Ishmael, a charismatic harpooner and his friend Queequeg join their quest. Ahab''s adopted daughter Rachel, beautiful and tough, runs the hunting vessel. Ahab''s obsession to seek revenge on a great White Dragon that slaughtered his family when he was young and left his body scarred and mauled, drives the crew deeper into the heart of darkness. In the White Dragon''s lair Ahab''s secrets are revealed and Rachel must choose between following him on his dark quest or escaping to a new life with Ishmael.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOVRvsCzfFhFjLmIpdEzWAfA7S1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59883'),
  ('909425336501588185', 'Age of Tomorrow', 2014, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Action', 'James Kondelik, Ben Demaree', 'Jacob Cooney, Bill Hanstock', 'Laura Alexandra Ramos, Anthony Marks, Robert Picardo, Taylor Coliee, Morgan West, Kelly Hu, Lane Townsend, Mitchell Carpenter', 'NR', 'Mankind must fight to survive as Earth is invaded by hostile UFOs bent on destroying the planet. As the epic battle wages on, astronauts sneak aboard the mothership where they discover a portal to the aliens'' home world. They manage to alert Earth before they are brutally murdered. Left with no other choice, Earth sends an elite military team of science and combat specialists through the portal where they attempt to stop the invasion from the inside out.', 'Mankind must fight to survive as Earth is invaded by hostile UFOs bent on destroying the planet. As the epic battle wages on, astronauts sneak aboard the mothership where they discover a portal to the aliens'' home world. They manage to alert Earth before they are brutally murdered. Left with no other choice, Earth sends an elite military team of science and combat specialists through the portal where they attempt to stop the invasion from the inside out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rij2GSSXbhNLCFdvJN8YmRRD2i3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275619'),
  ('43384116631929699', 'Age of Uprising: The Legend of Michael Kohlhaas', 2013, 'Drama, History', 'Arnaud des Pallières, Jeanne Lapoirie', 'Christelle Berthevas, Arnaud des Pallières', 'Mads Mikkelsen, Mélusine Mayance, Delphine Chuillot, Bruno Ganz, Denis Lavant, David Kross, Roxane Duran, Paul Bartel', 'NR', 'In the 16th century in the Cévennes, a horse dealer by the name of Michael Kohlhaas leads a happy and prosperous family life. When a lord treats him unjustly, this pious, upstanding man raises an army and puts the country to fire and sword in order to have his rights restored.', 'In the 16th century in the Cévennes, a horse dealer by the name of Michael Kohlhaas leads a happy and prosperous family life. When a lord treats him unjustly, this pious, upstanding man raises an army and puts the country to fire and sword in order to have his rights restored.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlLec0D9nq9TSv5OjbgqPqEDGKK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186971'),
  ('792433738409644057', 'Agency', 1980, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Thriller', 'George Kaczender, Miklós Lente', 'Noel Hynd', 'Robert Mitchum, Lee Majors, Valerie Perrine, Alexandra Stewart, Saul Rubinek, George Touliatos, Franz Russell, Michael Kirby', 'R', 'A mysterious millionaire buys an ad agency and begins to replace its employees with his own people, who don''t appear to be advertising types at all...', 'A mysterious millionaire buys an ad agency and begins to replace its employees with his own people, who don''t appear to be advertising types at all...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9LEbYn6qiMRvUksqIF0bB4LQhZQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215794'),
  ('694855318378878158', 'Agent 38-24-36', 1964, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Édouard Molinaro, Andréas Winding, Robert Biard', 'François Billetdoux, André Tabet, Georges Tabet', 'Brigitte Bardot, Anthony Perkins, Grégoire Aslan, Jean-Marc Tennberg, Hans Verner, André Luguet, Hélène Dieudonné, Jacques Monod', 'NR', 'A Russian spy is sent out to steal sensitive information from NATO about military mobilization. Without much intelligence of his own, the distrusted agent of Soviet intelligence needs all the help he can get from his "talented" partner Penelope Lightfeather as they scatter around the French countryside for secret rendez-vous'' while trying to avoid being caught by counter intelligence agents and distrustful communist operatives.', 'A Russian spy is sent out to steal sensitive information from NATO about military mobilization. Without much intelligence of his own, the distrusted agent of Soviet intelligence needs all the help he can get from his "talented" partner Penelope Lightfeather as they scatter around the French countryside for secret rendez-vous'' while trying to avoid being caught by counter intelligence agents and distrustful communist operatives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCS43EepWg56h3y7veQkaxpfeYh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200502'),
  ('398094204584577311', 'Agent Cody Banks', 2003, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Harald Zwart, Denis Crossan, Jim Brebner', 'Ashley Miller, Zack Stentz, Scott Alexander', 'Frankie Muniz, Hilary Duff, Angie Harmon, Keith David, Cynthia Stevenson, Darrell Hammond, Martin Donovan, Arnold Vosloo', 'PG', 'Recruited by the U.S. government to be a special agent, nerdy teenager Cody Banks must get closer to cute classmate Natalie in order to learn about an evil plan hatched by her father. But despite the agent persona, Cody struggles with teen angst.', 'Recruited by the U.S. government to be a special agent, nerdy teenager Cody Banks must get closer to cute classmate Natalie in order to learn about an evil plan hatched by her father. But despite the agent persona, Cody struggles with teen angst.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhK0mqqirPsckxkNisvi32A4lf6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10923'),
  ('50149113787344580', 'Agent Cody Banks 2: Destination London', 2004, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure, Family, Romance', 'Kevin Allen, Denis Crossan, Jim Dowdall', 'Don Rhymer', 'Frankie Muniz, Anthony Anderson, Hannah Spearritt, Alfie Allen, Cynthia Stevenson, Daniel Roebuck, Anna Chancellor, Keith Allen', 'PG', 'With all-new gadgets, high-flying action, exciting chases and a wisecracking new handler, Derek (Anthony Anderson), Cody has to retrieve the device before the world''s leaders fall under the evil control of a diabolical villain.', 'With all-new gadgets, high-flying action, exciting chases and a wisecracking new handler, Derek (Anthony Anderson), Cody has to retrieve the device before the world''s leaders fall under the evil control of a diabolical villain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlAltvp84rYVTYs3kdemqHBaiat.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17047'),
  ('196763724428367497', 'Agent F.O.X.', 2015, 'Animation', 'Ge Shuiying', null, 'Qiao Shiyu, Xuan Xiaoming, Chen Hao, Zhang Yaohan, Hong Shang, Zhen Zhao, Yu Zhou, Zhang Wei', 'G', 'Super spy and master inventor Agent F.O.X. arrives in Carrot Town with one objective: infiltrate the community of friendly rabbits, locate a mysterious artifact, and return to base immediately. But the mission is turned on its head when the secret agent is discovered... and mistaken for a distant cousin: a long-tailed rabbit. Overwhelmed by their hospitality and friendship, Long Tail is forced to make a difficult choice: abandon his mission or betray his newfound friends. He soon discovers that he is part of a dangerous plot that could threaten the peace between the two animal groups forever. Agent F.O.X. is a high octane animated adventure with lots of laughs, zany action, and a heartwarming story the entire family will enjoy.', 'Super spy and master inventor Agent F.O.X. arrives in Carrot Town with one objective: infiltrate the community of friendly rabbits, locate a mysterious artifact, and return to base immediately. But the mission is turned on its head when the secret agent is discovered... and mistaken for a distant cousin: a long-tailed rabbit. Overwhelmed by their hospitality and friendship, Long Tail is forced to make a difficult choice: abandon his mission or betray his newfound friends. He soon discovers that he is part of a dangerous plot that could threaten the peace between the two animal groups forever. Agent F.O.X. is a high octane animated adventure with lots of laughs, zany action, and a heartwarming story the entire family will enjoy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rPcFxJJiByJugHjmTe0ViGpgPSe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276678'),
  ('326551190586801417', 'Agent for H.A.R.M.', 1966, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Thriller', 'Gerd Oswald, Ted V. Mikels, James Crabe', 'Blair Robertson', 'Peter Mark Richman, Wendell Corey, Carl Esmond, Barbara Bouchet, Martin Kosleck, Aliza Gur, Donna Michelle, Rafael Campos', null, 'The head of the Human Aetiological Relations Machine pits an agent against a flesh-to-fungus spore gun.', 'The head of the Human Aetiological Relations Machine pits an agent against a flesh-to-fungus spore gun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2j79blKjbZLhhI6ObVw69pX7gjB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31240'),
  ('459199002052878675', 'Agent Game', 2022, 'Action, Thriller', 'Grant S. Johnson, Lee Whittaker, Barbara Zagrodnik', 'Tyler W. Konney, Mike Langer', 'Mel Gibson, Dermot Mulroney, Adan Canto, Katie Cassidy, Jason Isaacs, Barkhad Abdi, Rhys Coiro, Annie Ilonzeh', 'R', 'Harris, a CIA interrogator at an Agency black site, finds himself the target of a rendition operation after being scapegoated for an interrogation gone horribly wrong. As the team tasked to bring Harris in begins to question their orders -- and each other --Olsen, a senior intelligence officer, and his subordinate, Visser, raise the stakes. Now, it''s up to Harris and some newfound allies to uncover the truth and turn the tables.', 'Harris, a CIA interrogator at an Agency black site, finds himself the target of a rendition operation after being scapegoated for an interrogation gone horribly wrong. As the team tasked to bring Harris in begins to question their orders -- and each other --Olsen, a senior intelligence officer, and his subordinate, Visser, raise the stakes. Now, it''s up to Harris and some newfound allies to uncover the truth and turn the tables.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yG05YYiKHNtbsqFUfrmCxGQj5zc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:872542'),
  ('629163195587043285', 'Agent Macaw: Shaken & Stirred', 2009, 'Animation', 'Andrés Couturier, Ariel Orea', 'Andrés Couturier, Adolfo Martínez Vara, Alberto Rodríguez', 'Jaime Camil, Silvia Pinal, Dulce María, Rogelio Guerra, Andrés Couturier, Luis Alfonso Mendoza, Mario Castañeda, Adrián Fogarty', null, 'Tambo Macaw, an overweight macaw who works as a janitor at the Central Intelligentus Animalus (CIA), dreams of becoming a secret agent. His opportunity arises when he is assigned by mistake the most important mission in the agency''s history: stop the wicked plans of Mama Bear and her evil organization. Tambo is helped by Jack Tortoise, an old turtle that''s in charge of the advanced technology lab in the agency and is one of Tambo''s few friends.', 'Tambo Macaw, an overweight macaw who works as a janitor at the Central Intelligentus Animalus (CIA), dreams of becoming a secret agent. His opportunity arises when he is assigned by mistake the most important mission in the agency''s history: stop the wicked plans of Mama Bear and her evil organization. Tambo is helped by Jack Tortoise, an old turtle that''s in charge of the advanced technology lab in the agency and is one of Tambo''s few friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zG3nxFOeLYkfpLyDNxspdhHzS3c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75968'),
  ('174930125666278608', 'Agent Ranjid Saves the World', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Michael Karen, Stephan Schuh', 'Norman Coester, Paul Panzer, Kaya Yanar', 'Kaya Yanar, Rutger Hauer, Gode Benedix, Birte Glang, Vedat Erincin, Tom Gerhardt, Antonia von Romatowski, Carolin Kebekus', null, 'The Dutch supervillain Freek van Dyk is keeping the world on tenterhooks - and the world''s best secret services can only stand by and watch. Finally, the Turkish Ayran Secret Service intervenes. However, there is a mix-up, because after two of the ASS men are eliminated, ASS head Süleyman is looking for a "Süper agent" and mistakes the clueless Indian cleaner Ranjid for one. He actually just wants to cure his sick cow, but suddenly has to save the world.', 'The Dutch supervillain Freek van Dyk is keeping the world on tenterhooks - and the world''s best secret services can only stand by and watch. Finally, the Turkish Ayran Secret Service intervenes. However, there is a mix-up, because after two of the ASS men are eliminated, ASS head Süleyman is looking for a "Süper agent" and mistakes the clueless Indian cleaner Ranjid for one. He actually just wants to cure his sick cow, but suddenly has to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ys1U1d2ZNBpKbOUr2XimrBX1vIg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138672'),
  ('782740703666254852', 'Agent Red', 2000, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Damian Lee, Jim Wynorski, Franklin A. Vallette', 'Damian Lee', 'Dolph Lundgren, Tony Becker, Meilani Paul, Natalie Radford, Randolph Mantooth, Alexander Kuznetsov, Steve Eastin, Allan Kolman', 'R', 'Matt Hendricks is the US Navy''s top Marine Special Operations Commander and is facing his toughest challenge yet - escorting the deadliest viral weapon on the planet back to a secure storage facility.', 'Matt Hendricks is the US Navy''s top Marine Special Operations Commander and is facing his toughest challenge yet - escorting the deadliest viral weapon on the planet back to a secure storage facility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5n9rh4C2qE9UJZI3jKxs6XE9Wvj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51422'),
  ('87414587282633590', 'Agent Revelation', 2021, 'Action, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Derek Ting', 'Derek Ting', 'Derek Ting, Michael Dorn, Kayla Ewell, Carole Weyers, Teo Briones, Maxine Bahns, Cory Tucker, Janelle Beaudry', null, 'An ancient dust that controls humans is unleashed, but mysteriously affects Jim Yung who gains superpowers. Jim is taken to an underground base where he''s trained to be an operative to take on an imminent alien threat and learn why aliens have returned to Earth.', 'An ancient dust that controls humans is unleashed, but mysteriously affects Jim Yung who gains superpowers. Jim is taken to an underground base where he''s trained to be an operative to take on an imminent alien threat and learn why aliens have returned to Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lnihobYZTZZ88PUKKw30WpaCveV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:786532'),
  ('230383346236003061', 'Agent Sai Srinivasa Athreya', 2019, 'Crime, Comedy, Mystery', 'Sunny Kurapati, Swaroop RSJ', 'Naveen Polishetty, Swaroop RSJ', 'Naveen Polishetty, Shruti Sharma, Ram Dutt, Suhas, Shredha Rajagopalan, Darbha Appaji Ambarisha, Viswanath Mandalika, Prashant Yarramilli', null, 'Agent Sai Srinivasa Athreya is a brilliant, underrated detective from Nellore who runs an agency called FBI which sees no business. He gets more than what he asked for when a case happens to fall right into his lap out of nowhere.', 'Agent Sai Srinivasa Athreya is a brilliant, underrated detective from Nellore who runs an agency called FBI which sees no business. He gets more than what he asked for when a case happens to fall right into his lap out of nowhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMVfhhWfHLawVp3kd55KBy3VBsW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:610482'),
  ('708197149131730586', 'Agent trouble', 1987, 'Thriller', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, William Lubtchansky', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky', 'Catherine Deneuve, Richard Bohringer, Tom Novembre, Dominique Lavanant, Kristin Scott Thomas, Pierre Arditi, Sophie Moyse, Hervé Pauchon', null, 'Amanda Weber is a museum employee. Her nephew, Victorien, who feels that wild animals should not be kept in zoos, while hitchhiking saw a mysterious bus with 50 dead tourists that later was found by autorities at the bottom of a lake. When Victorien gets in very serious problems due to what he saw Amanda seeks to find out what happened and soon also becomes a target.', 'Amanda Weber is a museum employee. Her nephew, Victorien, who feels that wild animals should not be kept in zoos, while hitchhiking saw a mysterious bus with 50 dead tourists that later was found by autorities at the bottom of a lake. When Victorien gets in very serious problems due to what he saw Amanda seeks to find out what happened and soon also becomes a target.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPDNkFmobtHIfjmliFdixeImfz7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2385'),
  ('1003463030572783392', 'Agent Vinod', 2012, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller, Romance', 'Sriram Raghavan, C.K. Muraleedharan', 'Sriram Raghavan, Arijit Biswas', 'Saif Ali Khan, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Adil Hussain, Ravi Kishan, Prem Chopra, Ram Kapoor, Shahbaz Khan, Gulshan Grover', null, 'Agent Vinod sets out on a secret mission to find the reason behind the death of Rajan, his colleague. Terror strikes when he unfolds an even bigger conspiracy.', 'Agent Vinod sets out on a secret mission to find the reason behind the death of Rajan, his colleague. Terror strikes when he unfolds an even bigger conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1GOWhrtXHidZGGsNMJiB8r5CIp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85050'),
  ('944614783374416748', 'Agent Zero', 2025, 'Action, Thriller', 'Guillaume de Fontenay, Pierre Cottereau, Fabrice Camoin', 'Guillaume de Fontenay, Matt Alexander', 'Marine Vacth, Niels Schneider, Emmanuelle Bercot, Slimane Dazi, Grégoire Colin, Lionel Abelanski, Salim Kéchiouche, Hichem Yacoubi', 'R', 'When police officer Ilias is shot and left in a coma, Alma must reconnect with her former identity as Badh, a ruthless intelligence operative and skilled assassin. She brutally eliminates members of the Khoury family one by one, unleashing the fury of their leader Mansour, only to discover that Mansour is working with Joana, her former secret service unit officer.', 'When police officer Ilias is shot and left in a coma, Alma must reconnect with her former identity as Badh, a ruthless intelligence operative and skilled assassin. She brutally eliminates members of the Khoury family one by one, unleashing the fury of their leader Mansour, only to discover that Mansour is working with Joana, her former secret service unit officer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diDNHFfccBZxw0CmQoVQkSuJIri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1383247'),
  ('443271593622312133', 'Agent Zeta', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Dani de la Torre, Eva Leira, Yolanda Serrano', 'Dani de la Torre, Jordi Vallejo, Oriol Paulo', 'Mario Casas, Mariela Garriga, Luis Zahera, Nora Navas, Christian Tappán, Cristina Umaña, Ricardo de Barreiro, Luisa Vides Galiano', null, 'Four Spanish ex-intelligence officers are assassinated simultaneously worldwide. The CNI discovers all participated in the covert "Operation Ciénaga" decades ago in Colombia. Zeta, the CNI''s best operative, must hunt and protect the sole survivor, facing his deadliest global mission yet. Top Colombian agent Alfa will join Zeta, seemingly knowing more about "Ciénaga"''s secrets than him.', 'Four Spanish ex-intelligence officers are assassinated simultaneously worldwide. The CNI discovers all participated in the covert "Operation Ciénaga" decades ago in Colombia. Zeta, the CNI''s best operative, must hunt and protect the sole survivor, facing his deadliest global mission yet. Top Colombian agent Alfa will join Zeta, seemingly knowing more about "Ciénaga"''s secrets than him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cKLG9KMoCjsgFB8Nw1EuglteVi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1314786'),
