  ('668532303635751208', 'Agenzia Riccardo Finzi... praticamente detective', 1979, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Roberto Tatti, Giovanni Ciarlo, Bruno Corbucci', 'Luciano Secchi', 'Renato Pozzetto, Enzo Cannavale, Simona Mariani, Lory Del Santo, Luca Sportelli, Barbara De Bortoli, Olga Karlatos, Silvano Tranquilli', null, 'After graduating in correspondence detective, Riccardo Finzi arrives in Milan. The first case he deals with is the death of a young maid. Cockpit in a surreal yellow from a novel by Luciano Secchi.', 'After graduating in correspondence detective, Riccardo Finzi arrives in Milan. The first case he deals with is the death of a young maid. Cockpit in a surreal yellow from a novel by Luciano Secchi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sf4EeNpCkXTYKyLcX1wZtHxC2z0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165159'),
  ('127577052423881949', 'Ages of Love', 2011, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Tani Canevari, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Andrea Agnello, Giovanni Veronesi, Ugo Chiti', 'Carlo Verdone, Robert De Niro, Monica Bellucci, Laura Chiatti, Riccardo Scamarcio, Michele Placido, Valeria Solarino, Vittorio Emanuele Propizio', null, 'In Italy, three men fall in love with three women. First a young engaged lawyer has a fling, then the middle-aged married man has a fling, then a retired man falls in love with his friend''s daughter.', 'In Italy, three men fall in love with three women. First a young engaged lawyer has a fling, then the middle-aged married man has a fling, then a retired man falls in love with his friend''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xckurqcoNkTYtjh5f3HvOZFMMP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58219'),
  ('633351698016370470', 'Aggiungi un posto a tavola', 1978, null, 'Gino Landi', 'Jaja Fiastri, Pietro Garinei, Alessandro Giovannini', 'Johnny Dorelli, Paolo Panelli, Bice Valori, Renato Turi, Jenny Tamburi, Ugo Maria Morosi, Carlo Piantadosi', null, 'Father Silvestro receives a phone call from God telling him He intends to send the second flood to earth. The priest then decides to seek help from his compatriots to build a new Noah’s Ark. But to achieve their objectives they must overcome the obstacles that mayor Crispino puts in their way.', 'Father Silvestro receives a phone call from God telling him He intends to send the second flood to earth. The priest then decides to seek help from his compatriots to build a new Noah’s Ark. But to achieve their objectives they must overcome the obstacles that mayor Crispino puts in their way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1flVMghPh7GsL0stairlQ8OtTfH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254608'),
  ('883990000770207646', 'Aggretsuko: We Wish You a Metal Christmas', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Rareko', null, 'Kaolip, Shingo Katou, Rina Inoue, Maki Tsuruta, Sohta Arai, Yuki Takahashi, Komegumi Koiwasaki, Rareko', null, 'Red panda Retsuko, worked to the bone, unleashes her frustration in the form of death metal. Lately, though, she''s found another joy—getting the most likes possible on her Instagram posts. In fact, it is said that social media attention can release endorphins. As Christmas falls upon the city, Retsuko''s hunger for validation only grows, pushing her to find new ways to embellish and sugarcoat her otherwise drab life for the internet to see.', 'Red panda Retsuko, worked to the bone, unleashes her frustration in the form of death metal. Lately, though, she''s found another joy—getting the most likes possible on her Instagram posts. In fact, it is said that social media attention can release endorphins. As Christmas falls upon the city, Retsuko''s hunger for validation only grows, pushing her to find new ways to embellish and sugarcoat her otherwise drab life for the internet to see.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3W5isfVQv0j82f3uThLHrsZ0Rg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:643058'),
  ('191494565892802514', 'AGGRO DR1FT', 2024, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Arnaud Potier, Harmony Korine', 'Harmony Korine', 'Jordi Mollà, Travis Scott, Joshua Tilley, Stet Blancett, Chanya Middleton, Xavier Rawson, Madison Anderson, Savannah Brownfield', 'NR', 'In the seedy domain of Miami’s criminal underbelly, a seasoned hitman embarks on the relentless pursuit of his next target. As shot entirely through thermal lens, he navigates a twisted world where violence and madness reign supreme. Tensions unravel, leading to a psychedelic journey that blurs the lines between predator and prey.', 'In the seedy domain of Miami’s criminal underbelly, a seasoned hitman embarks on the relentless pursuit of his next target. As shot entirely through thermal lens, he navigates a twisted world where violence and madness reign supreme. Tensions unravel, leading to a psychedelic journey that blurs the lines between predator and prey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPgdBXbqeeCYFd0boZvpoSgGDnx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1156118'),
  ('1063351266035009447', 'Agitator', 2001, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Takashi Miike, Kiyoshi Itô', 'Shigenori Takechi', 'Masaya Katō, Taisaku Akino, Kenichi Endo, Hakuryu, Mickey Curtis, Takashi Miike, Yoshiyuki Daichi, Eiichi Furui', null, 'When a young Yakuza torments the customers in a rival crime family''s nightclub, it is not long before his dead body is found. Soon, inter-family retaliation follows, resulting in the death for a prominent crime boss. Devastated by this turn of events, the temperamental Kenzaki vows to avenge his boss''s death and, as bloody violence ensues, the body count reaches excessive proportions.', 'When a young Yakuza torments the customers in a rival crime family''s nightclub, it is not long before his dead body is found. Soon, inter-family retaliation follows, resulting in the death for a prominent crime boss. Devastated by this turn of events, the temperamental Kenzaki vows to avenge his boss''s death and, as bloody violence ensues, the body count reaches excessive proportions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kebGMY4ORYs4RGmW4vwa1pXMrbd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2896'),
  ('67178739209143905', 'Agneepath', 1990, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Mukul Anand', 'Santosh Saroj, Kader Khan', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Mithun Chakraborty, Danny Denzongpa, Madhavi, Neelam Kothari, Rohini Hattangadi, Alok Nath, Goga Kapoor', null, 'A young boy''s father is lynched before his eyes; fifteen years later he returns home for revenge.', 'A young boy''s father is lynched before his eyes; fifteen years later he returns home for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKCWrcIi6pAXNvPnC1LWtV4hB8u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37403'),
  ('344698621328487881', 'Agneepath', 2012, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Karan Malhotra, Jogi Malang, Roocha Yagnik', 'Karan Malhotra, Ila Dutta Bedi', 'Hrithik Roshan, Sanjay Dutt, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Rishi Kapoor, Zarina Wahab, Om Puri, Madhurjeet Sarghi, Inaamulhaq', null, 'When his father is lynched by a mob after being framed by a gangster, a young boy leaves his village along with his pregnant mother and flees to Mumbai. He takes up a life of crime and swears to avenge his father. A remake of the 1990 film.', 'When his father is lynched by a mob after being framed by a gangster, a young boy leaves his village along with his pregnant mother and flees to Mumbai. He takes up a life of crime and swears to avenge his father. A remake of the 1990 film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xO9sErs0c3XMzh8O34ygQWcENTj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84858'),
  ('668943888849551329', 'Agnes', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Johannes Schmid, Michael Bertl', 'Johannes Schmid, Nora Lämmermann, Ben Braeunlich', 'Odine Johne, Stephan Kampwirth, Sonja Baum, Walter Hess, Berit Menze, Oliver Bürgin, Maximilian Scheidt, Regine Andratschke', null, 'The non-fiction author Walter falls for the physics student Agnes. He is fascinated by her extreme attitude towards life and her reserved appearance, which is quite the opposite of his quiet and regular life. When Agnes encourages him to follow his passion for writing fiction, he starts to work on a book, a portrait of how he sees her.', 'The non-fiction author Walter falls for the physics student Agnes. He is fascinated by her extreme attitude towards life and her reserved appearance, which is quite the opposite of his quiet and regular life. When Agnes encourages him to follow his passion for writing fiction, he starts to work on a book, a portrait of how he sees her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eY9DJR8UVgFOsjqOrWQbNyXC1Vg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359947'),
  ('721933373521054818', 'Agnes', 2021, 'Horror, Drama', 'Mickey Reece, Samuel Calvin', 'John Selvidge, Mickey Reece', 'Molly C. Quinn, Jake Horowitz, Hayley McFarland, Rachel True, Zandy Hartig, Chris Browning, Ben Hall, Mary Buss', null, 'Rumors of demonic possession at a religious convent prompts a church investigation into the strange goings-on among its nuns. A disaffected priest and his neophyte are confronted with temptation, bloodshed and a crisis of faith.', 'Rumors of demonic possession at a religious convent prompts a church investigation into the strange goings-on among its nuns. A disaffected priest and his neophyte are confronted with temptation, bloodshed and a crisis of faith.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDskIhzLfZc8SB4ybkcWOgmI98M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:804755'),
