  ('381352243024489508', 'Ah! My Goddess: The Movie', 2000, 'Fantasy, Animation, Drama, Comedy, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Hiroaki Goda, Hisao Shirai, Hidenori Matsubara', 'Kousuke Fujishima', 'Aya Hisakawa, Ayako Kawasumi, Hiroshi Yanaka, Kikuko Inoue, Masami Kikuchi, Yumi Touma, Yui Horie, Rumi Kasahara', null, 'It has been three spring-times since Belldandy came to Earth to grant Keiichi one wish. Things seem to be fine with them while living in the temple with Belldandy''s sisters Urd and Skuld, but little do they know that a fallen god from Belldandy''s past has escaped from his lunar prison. He has plans for everyone which do not include what the goddess and her human lover wanted for themselves.', 'It has been three spring-times since Belldandy came to Earth to grant Keiichi one wish. Things seem to be fine with them while living in the temple with Belldandy''s sisters Urd and Skuld, but little do they know that a fallen god from Belldandy''s past has escaped from his lunar prison. He has plans for everyone which do not include what the goddess and her human lover wanted for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ovbBoerwuVaCulOkP5e6DwKtTJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21174'),
  ('695755321472644765', 'Aha Naa Pellanta!', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Jandhyala Subramanya Sastry, S. Gopala Reddy', 'Jandhyala Subramanya Sastry', 'Rajendra Prasad, Kota Srinivasa Rao, Nutan Prasad, Rajani, Brahmanandam, Rallapalli Narasimha, Janaki, Suthi Veerabhadra Rao', null, 'Krishna Murthy, the son of a rich industrialist, falls in love with Padma, the daughter of a greedy miser. To win her heart and teach her father a lesson, Krishna acts like a greedy miser.', 'Krishna Murthy, the son of a rich industrialist, falls in love with Padma, the daughter of a greedy miser. To win her heart and teach her father a lesson, Krishna acts like a greedy miser.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKeZsdUDIhXddTrLzraNsrCHcxn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37612'),
