  ('271562162626589437', 'AI Love You', 2022, 'Romance, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Stephan Zlotescu, David Asavanond, Damon H Chung', 'Stephan Zlotescu, Philip Gelatt', 'Mario Maurer, Pimchanok Luevisadpaibul, Michael S. New, David Asavanond, Sahajak Boonthanakit, Kenneth Won, Ladapa Ratchataamonchot, James Laver', 'PG-13', 'A modern love story set in the near future where an AI building is powered by human feelings. Due to a software glitch, it falls in love with a real girl, escapes the building into the body of a real man, and tries to win her affections.', 'A modern love story set in the near future where an AI building is powered by human feelings. Due to a software glitch, it falls in love with a real girl, escapes the building into the body of a real man, and tries to win her affections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBiJOvHCSWORnFpc4yItflIkdTi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928769'),
