  ('958881961906082442', 'Ai Weiwei: Never Sorry', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Alison Klayman, Alison Klayman', null, 'Ai Weiwei, Chen Danqing, Li Zhanyang, Hung Huang, Ethan Cohen, Phil Tinari, Feng Boyi, Evan Osnos', 'R', 'An account of the many tribulations that Chinese artist Ai Weiwei, known for his subversive art and political activism, endured between 2008 and 2011, from his rise to world fame via the Internet to his highly publicized arrest due to his frequent and daring confrontations with the Chinese authorities.', 'An account of the many tribulations that Chinese artist Ai Weiwei, known for his subversive art and political activism, endured between 2008 and 2011, from his rise to world fame via the Internet to his highly publicized arrest due to his frequent and daring confrontations with the Chinese authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bkXKjsaBYmvbCt6LLRcqsd74jG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84169'),
  ('517468865527273006', 'Aibolit and Barmaley', 1973, 'Animation, Family', 'Natalia Chervinskaya, Mikhail Meerovich', 'Natalia Chervinskaya', 'Leonid Kuravlyov, Klara Rumyanova, Yuri Sokovnin, Garri Bardin, Vasiliy Livanov', null, 'About the adventures of the good doctor Aibolit and the evil robber Barmalei.', 'About the adventures of the good doctor Aibolit and the evil robber Barmalei.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtI16W80vcZ7eqTUKtjJqvh6lGe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90570'),
  ('981977822685473297', 'Aicha', 2025, 'Drama', 'Antoine Héberlé, Mehdi M. Barsaoui', 'Mehdi M. Barsaoui', 'Fatma Sfar, Nidhal Saadi, Yassmine Dimassi, Mohamed Ali Ben Jemaa, Hela Ayed, Ala Benhamad, Sawssen Maalej, Badis Galaoui', null, 'Aya, thirty-year-old Tunisian, lives in Tozeur, a city in southern Tunisia, at the gates of the desert. Between social diktats, conservatism and disillusionment, Aya is not the happiest girl in the world. One day, a misfortune befalls her. Aya doesn''t know yet that this will be the most beautiful thing that has ever happened to her. An unexpected opportunity for this young woman who sees her life completely questioned.', 'Aya, thirty-year-old Tunisian, lives in Tozeur, a city in southern Tunisia, at the gates of the desert. Between social diktats, conservatism and disillusionment, Aya is not the happiest girl in the world. One day, a misfortune befalls her. Aya doesn''t know yet that this will be the most beautiful thing that has ever happened to her. An unexpected opportunity for this young woman who sees her life completely questioned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8r4Mow5MlLh4fe45W8Uv7Lo0hiN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1108795'),
  ('1001044034387072152', 'Aïcha', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Yamina Benguigui, Antoine Roch', 'Dominique Lancelot', 'Sofia Essaïdi, Rabia Mokeddem, Amidou, Bunny Godillot, Biyouna, Shemss Audat, Priscilla Attal-Sfez, Bernard Montiel', null, 'A few miles from Paris, on the other side of the northern ring road, stands a ghetto neighborhood with countless rows of dilapidated apartment buildings, their concrete crumbling and iron rusting. A multiracial community has long been rooted here, while most native French families have deserted the area. In tower 216 lives a "model" family of Algerian origin, the Bouamazzas. Our heroine, Aïcha, 25, the eldest daughter, is held up as an example by the whole community. But Aïcha can no longer bear the weight of the community: she wants to spread her wings, gain her independence, and finally cross the Rubicon.', 'A few miles from Paris, on the other side of the northern ring road, stands a ghetto neighborhood with countless rows of dilapidated apartment buildings, their concrete crumbling and iron rusting. A multiracial community has long been rooted here, while most native French families have deserted the area. In tower 216 lives a "model" family of Algerian origin, the Bouamazzas. Our heroine, Aïcha, 25, the eldest daughter, is held up as an example by the whole community. But Aïcha can no longer bear the weight of the community: she wants to spread her wings, gain her independence, and finally cross the Rubicon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JhYnMUJnI8pcu3Sf82yS6yTVP4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74164'),
  ('593908446524985341', 'Aïcha : Job à tout prix', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Yamina Benguigui', 'Yamina Benguigui, Dominique Lancelot', 'Sofia Essaïdi, Rabia Mokeddem, Amidou, Bunny Godillot, Biyouna, Shemss Audat, Isabelle Adjani', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCOpAZW73NY0Yh3Fkxcp97eHTE8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74165'),
  ('840409323973000321', 'Aïcha : La grande débrouille', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Yamina Benguigui', 'Yamina Benguigui, Dominique Lancelot', 'Sofia Essaïdi, Rabia Mokeddem, Amidou, Bunny Godillot, Biyouna, Shemss Audat', null, 'Rid of her rival Gloria, Aïcha will do everything to make her boss proud, with Ginette''s help. Patrick presents her with a love ultimatum: their mothers must meet. And to top it off, things are getting worse in the neighborhood.', 'Rid of her rival Gloria, Aïcha will do everything to make her boss proud, with Ginette''s help. Patrick presents her with a love ultimatum: their mothers must meet. And to top it off, things are getting worse in the neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iH9BV0jBsLiHsFowZp1MRex977f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118002'),
  ('999332916976494416', 'Aida of the Trees', 2001, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Guido Manuli', 'Guido Manuli, Umberto Marino', 'Jasmine Laurenti, Filippa Giordano, Simone D''Andrea, Peppe Servillo, Enzo Iacchetti, Massimo Lopez, Elda Olivieri, Mario Scarabelli', null, 'In a world divided between two cities, the evil stone dragon Satam and his followers in the city of Petra wage war against the peaceful Tree People of Alborea. Beautiful Princess Aida, the daughter of Alborea''s king, is taken prisoner by the Petrans and enslaved. As a servant, Aida meets and falls in love with handsome soldier Ramades. Ramades feels the same for Aida, but can their young love end the war between their two peoples?', 'In a world divided between two cities, the evil stone dragon Satam and his followers in the city of Petra wage war against the peaceful Tree People of Alborea. Beautiful Princess Aida, the daughter of Alborea''s king, is taken prisoner by the Petrans and enslaved. As a servant, Aida meets and falls in love with handsome soldier Ramades. Ramades feels the same for Aida, but can their young love end the war between their two peoples?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDs9AbxcN14ORnHckvLU4BS20SY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47757'),
  ('910413369192839553', 'Aída y vuelta', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Paco León, Kiko de la Rica, Tonucha Vidal', 'Paco León, Fernando Pérez', 'Carmen Machi, Paco León, Melani Olivares, Miren Ibarguren, David Castillo, Eduardo Casanova, Pepa Rus, Canco Rodríguez', null, 'The film deals with the filming of an episode of the series with storylines that take place both within the fiction with the characters of ''Aída'' and outside of it with the actors themselves and their relationships, which reflects on topics such as the limits of comedy, the work of a comedian and fame.', 'The film deals with the filming of an episode of the series with storylines that take place both within the fiction with the characters of ''Aída'' and outside of it with the actors themselves and their relationships, which reflects on topics such as the limits of comedy, the work of a comedian and fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3k4FKVgaxUZo1CITvj2nFDyNNKy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1370123'),
  ('456861115760907108', 'Aida: The Movie', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Paco Leon', 'Paco Leon, Fernando Perez', 'Carmen Machi, Paco León, Melani Olivares', null, 'The film deals with the filming of an episode of the series with storylines that take place both within the fiction with the characters of ''Aída'' and outside of it with the actors themselves and their relationships, which reflects on topics such as the limits of comedy, the work of a comedian and fame.', 'The film deals with the filming of an episode of the series with storylines that take place both within the fiction with the characters of ''Aída'' and outside of it with the actors themselves and their relationships, which reflects on topics such as the limits of comedy, the work of a comedian and fame.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F3k4FKVgaxUZo1CITvj2nFDyNNKy.jpg', 'plex:movie:aida-the-movie'),
  ('106186149280532741', 'Aileen Wuornos: American Boogeywoman', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Daniel Farrands, Roberto Correa', 'Daniel Farrands', 'Peyton List, Tobin Bell, Lydia Hearst, Nick Vallelonga, Swen Temmel, Andrew Biernat, Ashley Atwood, Hamish Sturgeon', null, 'Based on Aileen Wuornos’s early life, this is the true story of America’s most notorious female serial killer, who went on a killing spree in Florida in 1989 and 1990. What few people know, is that back in 1976 a young and beautiful Aileen Wuornos arrived in Florida searching for a new life that would help her escape her tragic past, married a wealthy Yacht Club President and had the chance to start again as part of Florida’s high society... or did she?', 'Based on Aileen Wuornos’s early life, this is the true story of America’s most notorious female serial killer, who went on a killing spree in Florida in 1989 and 1990. What few people know, is that back in 1976 a young and beautiful Aileen Wuornos arrived in Florida searching for a new life that would help her escape her tragic past, married a wealthy Yacht Club President and had the chance to start again as part of Florida’s high society... or did she?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9g1ZUcVDEOTsS9U1ifRMCgSVoH6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:806804'),
  ('1105725618595560170', 'Aileen Wuornos: The Selling of a Serial Killer', 1992, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Nick Broomfield, Barry Ackroyd', 'Nick Broomfield', 'Aileen Wuornos, Nick Broomfield, Arlene Pralle, Tyria Moore, Mike Reynolds, Steve Glazer, Merle Cannonball, Jesse ''The Human Bomb'' Aviles', 'R', 'In this documentary, filmmaker Nick Broomfield follows the saga of Aileen Wuornos, a prostitute who has been accused of committing a brutal series of murders. Broomfield conducts interviews with Wuornos herself, and his crew films her trial as well as her interactions with religious fanatic Arlene Pralle, who gives Wuornos dubious advice and legally adopts her. The cameras also roll as the accused''s attorney ignores the case at hand to negotiate a deal to sell his client''s story.', 'In this documentary, filmmaker Nick Broomfield follows the saga of Aileen Wuornos, a prostitute who has been accused of committing a brutal series of murders. Broomfield conducts interviews with Wuornos herself, and his crew films her trial as well as her interactions with religious fanatic Arlene Pralle, who gives Wuornos dubious advice and legally adopts her. The cameras also roll as the accused''s attorney ignores the case at hand to negotiate a deal to sell his client''s story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRsTiPrgzWVFnSw14biZkrPEpY9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97044'),
  ('110617251881640973', 'Aileen: Life and Death of a Serial Killer', 2003, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Joan Churchill, Nick Broomfield, Joan Churchill', null, 'Aileen Wuornos, Nick Broomfield, Diane Wuornos, Arlene Pralle, Tyria Moore, Dawn Botkins, Michelle Chauvin, Dick Mills', 'R', 'British documentarian Nick Broomfield creates a follow-up piece to his 1992 documentary of the serial killer Aileen Wuornos, a highway prostitute who was convicted of killing six men in Florida between 1989 and 1990. Interviewing an increasingly mentally unstable Wuornos, Broomfield captures the distorted mind of a murderer whom the state of Florida deems of sound mind -- and therefore fit to execute. Throughout the film, Broomfield includes footage of his testimony at Wuornos'' trial.', 'British documentarian Nick Broomfield creates a follow-up piece to his 1992 documentary of the serial killer Aileen Wuornos, a highway prostitute who was convicted of killing six men in Florida between 1989 and 1990. Interviewing an increasingly mentally unstable Wuornos, Broomfield captures the distorted mind of a murderer whom the state of Florida deems of sound mind -- and therefore fit to execute. Throughout the film, Broomfield includes footage of his testimony at Wuornos'' trial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MJpX3xlQicN2zIBhPsjpyyIWH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37088'),
  ('354660424480413249', 'Aileen: Queen of the Serial Killers', 2025, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Emily Turner, Kirsty Cunningham', null, 'Aileen Wuornos, Michele Gillen', 'R', 'Aileen Wuornos remains a rarity: a female serial killer. From childhood abuse to death-row revelations, this documentary revisits her life and crimes.', 'Aileen Wuornos remains a rarity: a female serial killer. From childhood abuse to death-row revelations, this documentary revisits her life and crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBCorGTwpXhIOeWwTA21HC5Rprx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1550569'),
  ('455306880473862280', 'Aimée & Jaguar', 1999, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Max Färberböck, Tony Imi, Zbigniew Macków', 'Rona Munro, Max Färberböck', 'Maria Schrader, Juliane Köhler, Johanna Wokalek, Heike Makatsch, Elisabeth Degen, Detlev Buck, Inge Keller, Kyra Mladeck', 'NR', 'In 1943, while the Allies are bombing Berlin and the Gestapo is purging the capital of Jews, a dangerous love affair blossoms between two women – one a Jewish member of the underground, the other an exemplar of Nazi motherhood.', 'In 1943, while the Allies are bombing Berlin and the Gestapo is purging the capital of Jews, a dangerous love affair blossoms between two women – one a Jewish member of the underground, the other an exemplar of Nazi motherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vd6c4PliEGXgtWTzq1iFxnXIE5H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2211'),
  ('531586559991838484', 'AIMEE. The Visitor', 2023, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Shawn Booth, Howard Wexler, Charles Band', 'Neal Marshall Stevens', 'Dallas Schaefer, Faith West, Felix Merback, Tom Dacey Carr, Joe Kurak, Liz Jordan, Lexi Lore', null, 'Scott Keyes is a brilliant but misanthropic computer hacker who generally prefers porn to living women and computers to human beings. But Keyes’ life is about to be turned upside-down. Thanks to some code-breaking by his partners Hunter and Gazelle, Keyes is finally able to unlock AIMEE, an incredibly advanced Artificial Intelligence program that appears in the form of a beautiful and seductive woman. But what a smitten Keyes doesn’t realize, and what Gazelle soon discovers, is that AIMEE is an advanced infiltration program and has been designed to learn from whoever downloads her, become whatever he most desires, and in the process, to take over, control, dominate, replicate, spread – and ultimately destroy anyone who opposes her.', 'Scott Keyes is a brilliant but misanthropic computer hacker who generally prefers porn to living women and computers to human beings. But Keyes’ life is about to be turned upside-down. Thanks to some code-breaking by his partners Hunter and Gazelle, Keyes is finally able to unlock AIMEE, an incredibly advanced Artificial Intelligence program that appears in the form of a beautiful and seductive woman. But what a smitten Keyes doesn’t realize, and what Gazelle soon discovers, is that AIMEE is an advanced infiltration program and has been designed to learn from whoever downloads her, become whatever he most desires, and in the process, to take over, control, dominate, replicate, spread – and ultimately destroy anyone who opposes her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8r8ZWqDXGEZqwRBHpu3tD48JQld.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1158922'),
  ('731517947087198438', 'Aimless Bullet', 1961, 'Drama', 'Yu Hyun-mok, Mun Sang-heon, Choi Jin', 'Lee Jong-gi, Lee I-ryeong', 'Kim Jin-kyu, Choi Mu-ryong, Seo Ae-ja, Kim Hye-jeong, No Jae-shin, Moon Jeong-suk, Yoon Il-bong, Yu Gye-seon', 'NR', 'Two brothers—Chul-ho, an accountant with a toothache and a pregnant wife, and Yong-ho, an unemployed ex-soldier wounded in battle—navigate life in post-war Korea.', 'Two brothers—Chul-ho, an accountant with a toothache and a pregnant wife, and Yong-ho, an unemployed ex-soldier wounded in battle—navigate life in post-war Korea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4O53U5HYkdw4HN6mpJmvxqfPi7U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70909'),
  ('6386486400556986', 'Aimless Walk', 1930, 'Documentary', 'Alexander Hammid, Alexander Hammid', null, null, null, 'This first true Czech avant-garde film turns away from a purely celebratory approach to the city. The camera follows a detached protagonist on his wanderings, as his highly subjective journey becomes a fragmented visualization of urban landscapes.', 'This first true Czech avant-garde film turns away from a purely celebratory approach to the city. The camera follows a detached protagonist on his wanderings, as his highly subjective journey becomes a fragmented visualization of urban landscapes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnO9GMkV6ZWx1zk16oAMlXdKuLx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165933'),
  ('1000772167009767848', 'Ain''t Nature Grand!', 1931, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Hugh Harman, Rudolf Ising', null, 'Bernard B. Brown', null, 'Bosko fishes, and sings and dances with frogs. But two ladybugs use a wasp as an airplane, and a beehive and tree branch as a machine gun to drive him away.', 'Bosko fishes, and sings and dances with frogs. But two ladybugs use a wasp as an airplane, and a beehive and tree branch as a machine gun to drive him away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDKkGfLiOBTbWxTXhYsA5M1SUQT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162638'),
  ('440086520512657546', 'Ain''t No Tomorrows', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yuki Tanada, Yutaka Yamazaki', 'Kosuke Mukai', 'Tokio Emoto, Yuya Endo, Ini Kusano, Sakura Ando, Ayame Misaki, Miwako , Dankan, Tomorowo Taguchi', null, '17 year-old Hiruma is desperate to get laid and takes out his sexual urges on Anpai, a fat boy who has "boobs." His classmate Tomono, a sickly loner, is in a serious relationship with their married teacher.', '17 year-old Hiruma is desperate to get laid and takes out his sexual urges on Anpai, a fat boy who has "boobs." His classmate Tomono, a sickly loner, is in a serious relationship with their married teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i71Na8ktekPomDUApkr12Bbds38.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74175'),
  ('121043892361325178', 'Ain''t She Tweet', 1952, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet', 'NR', 'Sylvester Cat discovers Tweety Bird in a pet store window. Tweety is taken to be delivered by truck to a new owner - Granny. Sylvester chases the delivery truck to Granny''s home, where Granny has a huge, fenced-in area for her army of bulldogs. Sylvester makes several unsuccessful attempts to pass the dogs and reach Tweety inside Granny''s house.', 'Sylvester Cat discovers Tweety Bird in a pet store window. Tweety is taken to be delivered by truck to a new owner - Granny. Sylvester chases the delivery truck to Granny''s home, where Granny has a huge, fenced-in area for her army of bulldogs. Sylvester makes several unsuccessful attempts to pass the dogs and reach Tweety inside Granny''s house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4k3lPFbRmkF8gSg2cbst45cHOuS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119608'),
  ('394027469725042518', 'Ain''t Them Bodies Saints', 2013, 'Crime, Drama, Romance, Western', 'David Lowery, Bradford Young, Tomas Deckaj', 'David Lowery', 'Rooney Mara, Casey Affleck, Ben Foster, Keith Carradine, Kennadie Smith, Jacklynn Smith, Nate Parker, Robert Longstreet', 'R', 'Bob Muldoon and Ruth Guthrie, an impassioned young outlaw couple on an extended crime spree, are finally apprehended by lawmen after a shootout in the Texas hills. Although Ruth wounds a local officer, Bob takes the blame. But four years later, Bob escapes from prison and sets out to find Ruth and their daughter, born during his incarceration.', 'Bob Muldoon and Ruth Guthrie, an impassioned young outlaw couple on an extended crime spree, are finally apprehended by lawmen after a shootout in the Texas hills. Although Ruth wounds a local officer, Bob takes the blame. But four years later, Bob escapes from prison and sets out to find Ruth and their daughter, born during his incarceration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkGkVjeMcvEg7P3VxWy8wYBJ7Dv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152748'),
  ('904340187197096660', 'Ainbo: Spirit of the Amazon', 2021, 'Adventure, Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'José Zelada, Richard Claus', 'Brian Cleveland, Jason Cleveland, Larry Wilson', 'Lola Raie, Alejandra Gollas, Thom Hoffman, Bernardo de Paula, Dino Andrade, Yeni Alvarez, Rene Mujica, Susana Ballesteros', 'PG', 'An epic journey of a young hero and her Spirit Guides, ''Dillo'' a cute and humorous armadillo and "Vaca" a goofy oversized tapir, who embark on a quest to save their home in the spectacular Amazon Rainforest.', 'An epic journey of a young hero and her Spirit Guides, ''Dillo'' a cute and humorous armadillo and "Vaca" a goofy oversized tapir, who embark on a quest to save their home in the spectacular Amazon Rainforest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8HyObVj8fPrzacAPtGWWLDhcfh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588921'),
  ('1007397252305208582', 'Ainsley McGregor Mysteries: A Case for the Watchmaker', 2026, 'Mystery, Crime, TV Movie, Drama, Romance', 'Martin Wood', 'Robin Dunne', 'Aaron Ashmore, Candace Havens, Candace Cameron Bure, Robin Dunne', 'PG', 'Ainsley McGregor is enjoying small-town routines until murder disrupts again. When a respected local watchmaker is found dead, the close-knit community is shaken, and suspicion quickly spreads among friends, customers, and competitors.', 'Ainsley McGregor is enjoying small-town routines until murder disrupts again. When a respected local watchmaker is found dead, the close-knit community is shaken, and suspicion quickly spreads among friends, customers, and competitors.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F54a1WSYGAiWBwx7odKktfxI7JKz.jpg', 'plex:movie:ainsley-mcgregor-mysteries-a-case-for-the-watchmaker'),
  ('348200015851140021', 'Air', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Christian Cantamessa, Norm Li', 'Chris Pasetto, Christian Cantamessa', 'Norman Reedus, Djimon Hounsou, Sandrine Holt, Peter Benson, Michael Hogan, Paula Lindberg, Ryan Beil, David Nykl', 'PG-13', 'In the near future, breathable air is nonexistent. Virtually all of humanity has disappeared, and those chosen to reestablish society reside in a controlled state of suspended animation. Two engineers tasked with guarding the last hope for mankind struggle to preserve their own sanity and lives while administering to the vital task at hand.', 'In the near future, breathable air is nonexistent. Virtually all of humanity has disappeared, and those chosen to reestablish society reside in a controlled state of suspended animation. Two engineers tasked with guarding the last hope for mankind struggle to preserve their own sanity and lives while administering to the vital task at hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vs7xGGYZltIZuLTcCgDp73tTJYn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284674'),
  ('894651045375198231', 'Air', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Julian Krubasik, Anatol Schuster, Ella Cieslinski', 'Britta Schwem, Anatol Schuster', 'Paula Hüttisch, Lara Feith, Anna Brodskaja-Bomke, Peter Cieslinski, Mélanie Fouché, Jakob D''Aprile, Marija Kandic, Matthias Neukirch', null, 'Louk is deep as the sea. Manja is pure as the air. Her love means: No fear. No lie. No trace.', 'Louk is deep as the sea. Manja is pure as the air. Her love means: No fear. No lie. No trace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUtUyTW0N8ELSdza7PkAWHb33FX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502971'),
  ('762513079796019224', 'Air', 2023, 'Drama, History', 'Ben Affleck, Robert Richardson, A. Todd Holland', 'Alex Convery', 'Matt Damon, Jason Bateman, Ben Affleck, Chris Messina, Viola Davis, Julius Tennon, Damian Young, Chris Tucker', 'R', 'Discover the game-changing partnership between a then undiscovered Michael Jordan and Nike''s fledgling basketball division which revolutionized the world of sports and culture with the Air Jordan brand.', 'Discover the game-changing partnership between a then undiscovered Michael Jordan and Nike''s fledgling basketball division which revolutionized the world of sports and culture with the Air Jordan brand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76AKQPdH3M8cvsFR9K8JsOzVlY5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964980'),
  ('1034246657918156528', 'Air America', 1990, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Roger Spottiswoode, Roger Deakins, Albert M. Shapiro', 'Richard Rush, John Eskow', 'Mel Gibson, Robert Downey Jr., Nancy Travis, Ken Jenkins, David Marshall Grant, Lane Smith, Art LaFleur, Ned Eisenberg', 'R', 'Air America was the CIA''s private airline operating in Laos during the Vietnam War, running anything and everything from soldiers to foodstuffs for local villagers. After losing his pilot''s license, Billy Covington is recruited, and ends up in the middle of a bunch of lunatic pilots, gun-running by his friend Gene Ryack, and opium smuggling by his own superiors.', 'Air America was the CIA''s private airline operating in Laos during the Vietnam War, running anything and everything from soldiers to foodstuffs for local villagers. After losing his pilot''s license, Billy Covington is recruited, and ends up in the middle of a bunch of lunatic pilots, gun-running by his friend Gene Ryack, and opium smuggling by his own superiors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cVANiDU7AdSLGgs4T7dpgyU2SK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11856'),
  ('581203448315650528', 'Air Bound', 2015, 'Family, Animation', 'Tomohiro Kawamura, Yoshihiro Komori', 'Ryota Kosawa', 'Keiji Fujiwara, Sayaka Kanda, Yuki Kaji, Shuichi Ikeda, Mansai Nomura, Masako Nozawa, Wataru Takagi, Yasuhiro Takato', 'PG', 'Gamba, a town mouse with a brave spirit decides to go on an adventure to discover the ocean. On his way, he meets a troubled child mouse, Chuta. He says his family and other mice on a nearby island have been killed by a clan of weasels, led by the terrifying Noroi. Gamba promises to save the island, his family and the other mice. He and his friends team up to defeat the evil Noroi and his clan.', 'Gamba, a town mouse with a brave spirit decides to go on an adventure to discover the ocean. On his way, he meets a troubled child mouse, Chuta. He says his family and other mice on a nearby island have been killed by a clan of weasels, led by the terrifying Noroi. Gamba promises to save the island, his family and the other mice. He and his friends team up to defeat the evil Noroi and his clan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9G8AdvLC8xITHBcySvQu6t8peR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400328'),
  ('1090483508229924816', 'Air Bridge', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Julia Rezende, Berna Ceppas, Dante Belluti', 'L.G. Bayão, Julia Rezende', 'Caio Blat, Letícia Colin, Emílio de Mello, Felipe Camargo, Sílvio Guindane, Sylvio Zilber, Martha Nowill, Cristina Flores', null, 'Bruno and Amanda have to face the difficulties of a long distance relationship after meeting in a flight forced into an emergency landing.', 'Bruno and Amanda have to face the difficulties of a long distance relationship after meeting in a flight forced into an emergency landing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yENjbwwk9T9cgrNiQt0d5VgcOhf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332719'),
  ('1032532931987270341', 'Air Bud', 1997, 'Comedy, Family', 'Charles Martin Smith, Mike Southon, Kelsey T. Howard', 'Aaron Mendelsohn, Paul Tamasy', 'Kevin Zegers, Wendy Makkena, Michael Jeter, Bill Cobbs, Eric Christmas, Brendan Fletcher, Norman Browning, Jay Brazeau', 'PG', 'A lonely boy befriends a stray dog who has a natural talent for basketball and together they experience the highs and lows of life as their friendship remains solid through a series of escapades.', 'A lonely boy befriends a stray dog who has a natural talent for basketball and together they experience the highs and lows of life as their friendship remains solid through a series of escapades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDfzh6QdX2tseTwwyB7lp2RP7iE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20737'),
