  ('40921594561094327', 'Air Bud: Seventh Inning Fetch', 2002, 'Comedy, Family', 'Robert Vince, Glen Winter', 'Stephanie Isherwood, Sara Sutton, Anne Vince', 'Kevin Zegers, Caitlin Wachs, Chantal Strand, Molly Hagan, Patrick Cranshaw, Nicholas Harrison, Cynthia Stevenson, Richard Karn', 'G', 'Josh is off to his first year of college and Buddy has stayed behind with Josh’s little sister Andrea and the rest of the family. Andrea, attempting to fit in with her Jr. High classmates, decides to join the baseball team and along the way discovers that Buddy is a talented baseball player.', 'Josh is off to his first year of college and Buddy has stayed behind with Josh’s little sister Andrea and the rest of the family. Andrea, attempting to fit in with her Jr. High classmates, decides to join the baseball team and along the way discovers that Buddy is a talented baseball player.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLsy4zylPWwcwEn0WPqBzNIJ1jj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21518'),
  ('960133916142892017', 'Air Bud: Spikes Back', 2003, 'Comedy, Family', 'Mike Southon', 'Kevin DiCicco, Robert Vince', 'Katija Pevec, Jake D. Smith, Tyler Boissonnault, Christopher Bishop, Bailey Gwynne, Nicholas Harrison, Patrick Cranshaw, Chantal Strand', 'G', 'Air Bud finds that he has the uncanny ability to play volleyball.', 'Air Bud finds that he has the uncanny ability to play volleyball.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqRR2h2OkgUHZPlI3bjtIWqCSJv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24794'),
  ('119217734685778149', 'Air Bud: World Pup', 2001, 'Comedy, Family', 'Bill Bannerman, Cyrus Block, Doris Deutschmann', 'Mick Whiting, Robert Vince, Anne Vince', 'Kevin Zegers, Dale Midkiff, Chilton Crane, Caitlin Wachs, Miguel Sandoval, Shayn Solberg, Chantal Strand, David Glyn-Jones', 'G', 'In this second heartwarming and hilarious sequel to the popular favorite, Air Bud masters two new starring roles: soccer player and fatherhood. Loaded with laughs and cool soccer action, Buddy teams up alongside U.S. women''s soccer greats.', 'In this second heartwarming and hilarious sequel to the popular favorite, Air Bud masters two new starring roles: soccer player and fatherhood. Loaded with laughs and cool soccer action, Buddy teams up alongside U.S. women''s soccer greats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnoKBYR4CBjYfxT66JPdyXrINoh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20755'),
