  ('682597971012208277', 'Air Force One', 1997, 'Action, Thriller', 'Wolfgang Petersen, Michael Ballhaus, Nancy Patton', 'Andrew W. Marlowe', 'Harrison Ford, Gary Oldman, Glenn Close, Wendy Crewson, Liesel Matthews, Paul Guilfoyle, Xander Berkeley, William H. Macy', 'R', 'When Russian neo-nationalists hijack Air Force One, the world''s most secure and extraordinary aircraft, the President is faced with a nearly impossible decision to give in to terrorist demands or sacrifice not only the country''s dignity, but the lives of his wife and daughter.', 'When Russian neo-nationalists hijack Air Force One, the world''s most secure and extraordinary aircraft, the President is faced with a nearly impossible decision to give in to terrorist demands or sacrifice not only the country''s dignity, but the lives of his wife and daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evO1iENjLpUnbwjnt5XK85jRYob.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9772'),
  ('367664555391766751', 'Air Force One Down', 2024, 'Action, Thriller', 'Anton Bakarski, James Bamford', 'Steven Paul', 'Katherine McNamara, Ian Bohen, Dascha Polanco, Rade Šerbedžija, Paul S. Tracey, Anthony Michael Hall, Trevor Van Uden, JR Esposito', 'R', 'On her first assignment aboard Air Force One, a rookie Secret Service agent faces the ultimate test when terrorists hijack the plane, intent on derailing a pivotal energy deal. With the President''s life on the line and a global crisis at stake, her bravery and skills are pushed to the limit in a relentless battle that could change the course of history.', 'On her first assignment aboard Air Force One, a rookie Secret Service agent faces the ultimate test when terrorists hijack the plane, intent on derailing a pivotal energy deal. With the President''s life on the line and a global crisis at stake, her bravery and skills are pushed to the limit in a relentless battle that could change the course of history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKPoSD4pZ3s3CJ9g3cqWRcQ41TC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1124127'),
