  ('40121267588914047', 'Air Shift', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Chris Maes', 'Chris Maes', 'Ashlee Lawhorn, Alex Diehl, Morgan Flanagan, Patrick Andrew Jones, Margarita Gamarnik', 'Not Rated', 'A small-town radio disk-jockey is taken hostage by a deranged killer during her overnight shift. As the night progresses, a mysterious force outside unleashes zombie-like attackers, who see the radio station as their target.', 'A small-town radio disk-jockey is taken hostage by a deranged killer during her overnight shift. As the night progresses, a mysterious force outside unleashes zombie-like attackers, who see the radio station as their target.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fd%2Fgracenote%2Fd5f42e69f9be3372efc424732bbe33c1.jpg', 'plex:movie:air-shift'),
  ('544614947778858765', 'Air Strike', 2018, 'Action, Drama, War, History', 'Feng Xiao, Conrad W. Hall, Karl Tam', 'Chen Ping', 'Liu Ye, Bruce Willis, Adrien Brody, Song Seung-heon, Fan Wei, Cao Kefan, Fan Bingbing, William Chan', 'R', 'An American pilot is sent to a Chinese province to teach a crew of would-be pilots how to fly war planes against the Japanese during World War II.', 'An American pilot is sent to a Chinese province to teach a crew of would-be pilots how to fly war planes against the Japanese during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ve7xmUK167YZloN8LnSyhKmmNgE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345934'),
  ('770500926452427955', 'Air: The Motion Picture', 2005, 'Animation, Romance, Fantasy', 'Osamu Dezaki, Shoji Hata, Hiroshi Matsuzono', 'Makoto Nakamura', 'Tomoko Kawakami, Aya Hisakawa, Hikaru Midorikawa, Chinami Nishimura, Kikuko Inoue, Nobutoshi Canna, Shin-ichiro Miki, Yumi Touma', 'PG-13', 'A long time ago, a winged maiden was held prisoner in a castle - cursed never to experience love, lest she die. Centuries later, in a sleepy coastal town, a young girl relives this agony.', 'A long time ago, a winged maiden was held prisoner in a castle - cursed never to experience love, lest she die. Centuries later, in a sleepy coastal town, a young girl relives this agony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/869qSfiou8ZGBhOGrmAol48K9Vo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40728'),
  ('887311892796290983', 'Airbag', 1997, 'Comedy, Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Juanma Bajo Ulloa, Gonzalo F. Berridi, Luis Gómez Valdivieso', 'Juanma Bajo Ulloa, Karra Elejalde, Fernando Guillén Cuervo', 'Fernando Guillén Cuervo, Karra Elejalde, Alberto San Juan, Karlos Arguiñano, Manuel Manquiña, Maria de Medeiros, Francisco Rabal, Rosa María Sardà', null, 'Mommy''s boy Juantxo is engaged. Dragged to the party by his friends Konradin and Paco, he loses his expensive wedding ring inside the body of a prostitute. Mafioso whorehouse owner Villambrosa finds the ring. Meanwhile Villambrosa''s rival gangster Souza sends femme fatale Fatima to check things out. Juantxo and his friends are trying to get the ring back and in the process get involved in the war between gangs.', 'Mommy''s boy Juantxo is engaged. Dragged to the party by his friends Konradin and Paco, he loses his expensive wedding ring inside the body of a prostitute. Mafioso whorehouse owner Villambrosa finds the ring. Meanwhile Villambrosa''s rival gangster Souza sends femme fatale Fatima to check things out. Juantxo and his friends are trying to get the ring back and in the process get involved in the war between gangs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjvz7mxHsygeO4K09GoSgWR4dfy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21700'),
  ('607956975468744919', 'Airborne', 1993, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Rob Bowman, Daryn Okada, Steve Boyum', 'Bill Apablasa', 'Shane McDermott, Seth Green, Brittney Powell, Chris Conrad, Edie McClurg, Patrick Thomas O''Brien, Jack Black, Alanna Ubach', 'PG', 'Good-natured teen surfer Mitchell Goosen finds himself staying with his aunt and uncle in Cincinnati, Ohio when his parents head to Australia for work. There he meets his cousin, Wiley, and together they try to navigate the perils of high school—avoid the bullies, get the girl, and win a little respect.', 'Good-natured teen surfer Mitchell Goosen finds himself staying with his aunt and uncle in Cincinnati, Ohio when his parents head to Australia for work. There he meets his cousin, Wiley, and together they try to navigate the perils of high school—avoid the bullies, get the girl, and win a little respect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TPCzvOoQmmParPjgHCiqqiVYIJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13064'),
  ('888437086128645044', 'Airborne', 1998, 'Action', 'Julian Grant, Russ Goozee, Marc Forby', 'Julian Grant, Tony Johnston', 'Steve Guttenberg, Sean Bean, Kim Coates, Torri Higginson, Colm Feore, Philip Akin', 'R', 'A gang of thieves break into a top secret government research centre and steal a deadly virus. Mach 1, a top secret special operations team, is called in to recover it. The team, lead by Commander Bill McNeil (Steve Guttenberg), boards the thieves'' plane midflight and recovers the virus. When two members of the team are subsequently murdered, McNeil suspects that the thieves might have inside help. In an attempt to track down who was responsible, the team steals the virus in a hope that the thieves will come after them.', 'A gang of thieves break into a top secret government research centre and steal a deadly virus. Mach 1, a top secret special operations team, is called in to recover it. The team, lead by Commander Bill McNeil (Steve Guttenberg), boards the thieves'' plane midflight and recovers the virus. When two members of the team are subsequently murdered, McNeil suspects that the thieves might have inside help. In an attempt to track down who was responsible, the team steals the virus in a hope that the thieves will come after them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYSvEpLjbICzha8kosW6IRdevLl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60856'),
  ('374999684540761243', 'Airborne', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Dominic Burns, Alessio Valori, Anthony Woodley', 'Paul Chronnell', 'Craig Conway, Simon Phillips, Gemma Atkinson, Mark Hamill, Billy Murray, Allison McKenzie, Alan Ford, Julian Glover', 'NR', 'As a snow storm closes in, one final plane takes off. The plane reports to the ground that both pilots are dead, while the slowly dwindling number of passengers on the plane wish that they’d never left the ground.', 'As a snow storm closes in, one final plane takes off. The plane reports to the ground that both pilots are dead, while the slowly dwindling number of passengers on the plane wish that they’d never left the ground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iprvmW1GnvV2BrfAwVI3sZWVR1m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85207'),
  ('164553524424428132', 'Aircraft Carrier Ibuki', 2019, 'Drama', 'Setsuro Wakamatsu, Takahide Shibanushi, Toshihisa Yamada', 'Yasuo Hasegawa, Kazunori Ito', 'Hidetoshi Nishijima, Tsubasa Honda, Koichi Sato, Kuranosuke Sasaki, Jun Murakami, Tatsuya Fuji, Shigeyuki Totsugi, Hayato Ichihara', null, 'The story takes place over a 24 hour period. In the southernmost part of Japan, 20 fishing boats of an unknown nationality suddenly fire upon and occupy parts of the Hateruma archipelago. Members of the Japan Coast Guard are detained. Under the extremely tense situation, the Japanese government sends Aircraft Carrier Ibuki and an escort fleet to the area. Ryota Akitsu is the captain of the Aircraft Carrier Ibuki and Toshiya Niinami is second-in-command. It is now 6:23 am. and Japan faces one day which they never have before.', 'The story takes place over a 24 hour period. In the southernmost part of Japan, 20 fishing boats of an unknown nationality suddenly fire upon and occupy parts of the Hateruma archipelago. Members of the Japan Coast Guard are detained. Under the extremely tense situation, the Japanese government sends Aircraft Carrier Ibuki and an escort fleet to the area. Ryota Akitsu is the captain of the Aircraft Carrier Ibuki and Toshiya Niinami is second-in-command. It is now 6:23 am. and Japan faces one day which they never have before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kk0zaiWzO8UjgpnwSja3InvGo1H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:572632'),
  ('794305695101787640', 'Aire libre', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Anahí Berneri, Hugo Colace', 'Javier van de Couter, Anahí Berneri', 'Leonardo Sbaraglia, Celeste Cid, Máximo Silva, Érica Rivas, Fabiana Cantilo, Marilú Marini, Juan Bautista Greppi, Pedro Merlo', null, 'A couple of thirty-somethings struggling with life, marriage, work, a kid and a new bought house outside the city.', 'A couple of thirty-somethings struggling with life, marriage, work, a kid and a new bought house outside the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oszhFl8KWktanhDoCspQM3h2cnW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287482'),
  ('299295489086401875', 'Aire: Just Breathe', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Luis Enrique Carrión, Leticia Tonos', 'Junior Rosario, Leticia Tonos', 'Paz Vega, Jalsen Santana, Sophie Gómez, Camila Cosio', null, 'It’s year 2147, men are sterile due to a virus leaving humankind almost extinct and Tania, a biologist, is trying to inseminate herself to prevent this with the help of an AI system called VIDA. Things take a turn when Azarias, one of the last men and a traveller with a dark past, suddenly appears.', 'It’s year 2147, men are sterile due to a virus leaving humankind almost extinct and Tania, a biologist, is trying to inseminate herself to prevent this with the help of an AI system called VIDA. Things take a turn when Azarias, one of the last men and a traveller with a dark past, suddenly appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wpjbrUHO821BVLm0Lk2VErVCEWi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1219529'),
  ('778743252007171811', 'Airheads', 1994, 'Comedy, Crime, Music', 'Joe Camp III, Richard Oswald, Michael Lehmann', 'Rich Wilkes', 'Brendan Fraser, Steve Buscemi, Adam Sandler, Joe Mantegna, Chris Farley, Judd Nelson, Amy Locane, Michael McKean', 'PG-13', 'The Lone Rangers have heavy-metal dreams and a single demo tape they can''t get anyone to play. The solution: Hijack an FM rock radio station and hold the deejays hostage until they agree to broadcast the band''s tape.', 'The Lone Rangers have heavy-metal dreams and a single demo tape they can''t get anyone to play. The solution: Hijack an FM rock radio station and hold the deejays hostage until they agree to broadcast the band''s tape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xPG8pPMyeoec48gKWbbC85EC8j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13595'),
  ('738932939217976473', 'Airlift', 2016, 'Drama, History, Action', 'Raja Menon', 'Suresh Nair, Ritesh Shah', 'Akshay Kumar, Nimrat Kaur, Inaamulhaq, Prakash Belawadi, Kumud Mishra, Feryna Wazheir, Purab Kohli, Lenaa', null, 'When Iraq invades Kuwait in August, 1990, a callous Indian businessman becomes the spokesperson for more than 170,000 stranded countrymen.', 'When Iraq invades Kuwait in August, 1990, a callous Indian businessman becomes the spokesperson for more than 170,000 stranded countrymen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oyaxIm3kTWDQtcYQ45eN5sZ6WIz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375290'),
  ('85689216253550099', 'Airplane II: The Sequel', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Ken Finkleman, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Al Jean, Mike Reiss', 'Lloyd Bridges, Raymond Burr, Chuck Connors, Rip Torn, John Dehner, Chad Everett, Peter Graves, Julie Hagerty', 'PG', 'A faulty computer causes a passenger space shuttle to head straight for the sun, and man-with-a-past Ted Striker must save the day and get the shuttle back on track – again – all the while trying to patch up his relationship with Elaine.', 'A faulty computer causes a passenger space shuttle to head straight for the sun, and man-with-a-past Ted Striker must save the day and get the shuttle back on track – again – all the while trying to patch up his relationship with Elaine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zs7Pjyabt0fwe2XqIx0gnF9Q4np.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2665'),
  ('927931260312791220', 'Airplane Mode', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Dylan Trussell, David Dinetz, Colt Seman', 'Dylan Trussell, Logan Paul, David Dinetz', 'Logan Paul, Chloe Bridges, Juanpa Zurita, Lauren Swickard, Lele Pons, Andrew Bachelor, Amanda Cerny, Nick Bateman', 'R', 'En route to the world''s largest social media convention in Australia, Logan Paul is scared to death; today is his first time flying. All of his worst nightmares come true when the passengers refuse to switch their phones to airplane mode, causing the plane''s controls to go haywire and electrocuting the pilots.', 'En route to the world''s largest social media convention in Australia, Logan Paul is scared to death; today is his first time flying. All of his worst nightmares come true when the passengers refuse to switch their phones to airplane mode, causing the plane''s controls to go haywire and electrocuting the pilots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWcxcTE0LfDL1M4NSN2NORvEyho.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550115'),
  ('267097479758004682', 'Airplane Mode', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'José Roberto Eliezer, Leonardo Carvalho, César Rodrigues', 'Renato Fagundes, Alice Name-Bomtempo', 'Larissa Manoela, Erasmo Carlos, André Luiz Frambach, Katiuscia Canoro, Dani Ornellas, Sílvia Lourenço, Michel Bercovitch, Mariana Amâncio', 'NR', 'When Ana, an influencer, crashes her car while talking on the phone, she''s shipped to her grumpy grandfather''s farm -- and forced into a digital detox.', 'When Ana, an influencer, crashes her car while talking on the phone, she''s shipped to her grumpy grandfather''s farm -- and forced into a digital detox.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLXisj0j39zaktmoU72tVtOXx6W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:652483'),
  ('31923056235602210', 'Airplane vs Volcano', 2014, 'Action', 'James Kondelik, Jon Kondelik, Alexander Yellen', 'James Kondelik, Jon Kondelik', 'Dean Cain, Robin Givens, Lawrence Hilton-Jacobs, Tamara Goodwin, Matt Mercer, Graham Denman, Scarlett Redmond, Harvey Q. Johnson', 'PG-13', 'When a commercial airliner is trapped within a ring of erupting volcanoes, the passengers and crew must find a way to survive - without landing.', 'When a commercial airliner is trapped within a ring of erupting volcanoes, the passengers and crew must find a way to survive - without landing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhxcTclnvLsn55xQBZddMlzALlh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258210'),
  ('1084785120095171149', 'Airplane!', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Jim Abrahams, Jerry Zucker, David Zucker', 'David Zucker, Jim Abrahams, Jerry Zucker', 'Robert Hays, Julie Hagerty, Leslie Nielsen, Kareem Abdul-Jabbar, Lloyd Bridges, Peter Graves, Robert Stack, Lorna Patterson', 'PG', 'An ex-fighter pilot forced to take over the controls of an airliner when the flight crew succumbs to food poisoning.', 'An ex-fighter pilot forced to take over the controls of an airliner when the flight crew succumbs to food poisoning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Q3efxd3AF1vQjlSxnlerSA7RzN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:813'),
  ('1115624834023358107', 'Airpocalypse', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Xiao Yang', 'Xiao Yang, Huang Yuan, Liu Ben', 'Xiao Yang, Du Juan, Chang Yuan, Xiao Shenyang, Yue Yunpeng, Wang Xiaoli, Zhang Benyu, Yi Yunhe', 'NR', 'Ma Le is a suicide prevention psychologist whose happiness stems from others'' misfortune. The God of Longevity comes to earth to prevent a planet shattering disaster but his power is absorbed by Ma Le, so he has to ask Ma Le for help. They find four Gods: Thunder, Lightning, Wind and Rain living on the earth and start the adventure of saving the world.', 'Ma Le is a suicide prevention psychologist whose happiness stems from others'' misfortune. The God of Longevity comes to earth to prevent a planet shattering disaster but his power is absorbed by Ma Le, so he has to ask Ma Le for help. They find four Gods: Thunder, Lightning, Wind and Rain living on the earth and start the adventure of saving the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJiq7cvOQ1cLhyjj7YK7lRnbv6w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570027'),
  ('662029845509338606', 'Airport', 1970, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'George Seaton, Ernest Laszlo, Donald Roberts', 'George Seaton', 'Burt Lancaster, Dana Wynter, Dean Martin, Barbara Hale, Jean Seberg, Jacqueline Bisset, George Kennedy, Jodean Lawrence', 'G', 'An airport manager tries to keep his terminals open during a snowstorm, while a suicide bomber plots to blow up a Boeing 707 airliner in flight.', 'An airport manager tries to keep his terminals open during a snowstorm, while a suicide bomber plots to blow up a Boeing 707 airliner in flight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6iOKluJfyiU1SLZbGYrY7Z0i6k0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10671'),
  ('32286454762412452', 'Airport ''77', 1977, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Jerry Jameson, Philip H. Lathrop, Robert Graner', 'Michael Scheff, David Spector', 'Jack Lemmon, Lee Grant, Brenda Vaccaro, Joseph Cotten, Olivia de Havilland, Darren McGavin, Christopher Lee, George Kennedy', 'PG', 'Flight 23 has crashed in the Bermuda Triangle after a hijacking gone wrong. Now the surviving passengers must brave panic, slow leaks, oxygen depletion, and more while attempting a daring plan, all while 200 feet underwater.', 'Flight 23 has crashed in the Bermuda Triangle after a hijacking gone wrong. Now the surviving passengers must brave panic, slow leaks, oxygen depletion, and more while attempting a daring plan, all while 200 feet underwater.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9b3frZR0Wu8I3ayN3QPrxfZMvC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7227'),
  ('1105218556661868359', 'Airport 1975', 1974, 'Drama, Thriller, Action', 'Jack Smight, Philip H. Lathrop, Wayne A. Farlow', 'Don Ingalls', 'Charlton Heston, Karen Black, George Kennedy, Efrem Zimbalist Jr., Susan Clark, Helen Reddy, Linda Blair, Dana Andrews', 'PG', 'When an in-flight collision incapacitates the pilots of an airplane bound for Los Angeles, stewardess Nancy Pryor is forced to take over the controls. From the ground, her boyfriend Alan Murdock, a retired test pilot, tries to talk her through piloting and landing the 747 aircraft. Worse yet, the anxious passengers — among which are a noisy nun and a cranky man — are aggravating the already tense atmosphere.', 'When an in-flight collision incapacitates the pilots of an airplane bound for Los Angeles, stewardess Nancy Pryor is forced to take over the controls. From the ground, her boyfriend Alan Murdock, a retired test pilot, tries to talk her through piloting and landing the 747 aircraft. Worse yet, the anxious passengers — among which are a noisy nun and a cranky man — are aggravating the already tense atmosphere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etfUuwVCvywq8mGspT94CBeLpSz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27932'),
  ('584458450187824684', 'Airport 2013', 2014, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Koki Mitani, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Koki Mitani', 'Yuko Takeuchi, Anna Ishibashi, Erika Toda, Joe Odagiri, Katsuhisa Namase, Teruyuki Kagawa, Toshiki Ayata, Sosuke Ikematsu', null, 'When there''s a transfer flight delay, a put-upon ground staff worker at a small town airport has to deal with a family that has plenty of problems of their own. Shot in a single take, "Airport" focuses on familial and romantic relationships and the secrets that often hold them together.', 'When there''s a transfer flight delay, a put-upon ground staff worker at a small town airport has to deal with a family that has plenty of problems of their own. Shot in a single take, "Airport" focuses on familial and romantic relationships and the secrets that often hold them together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJuykkGWw8tvZZh1yQmA9edrrFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249982'),
  ('906513535512077939', 'Airspeed', 1998, 'Adventure, Action', 'Robert Tinnell', 'Richard Goudreau, Roc LaFortune', 'Joe Mantegna, Elisha Cuthbert, Bronwen Booth, Lynne Adams, Russell Yuen, Gordon Masten, Don Jordan, Martin Lacroix', 'PG', 'When wealthy executive Raymond Stone sends out his private plane to pick up his spoiled teenage daughter, Nicole, and a pair of his top-ranking employees, disaster strikes. While the jet flies through an electrical storm, the pilot and other passengers are incapacitated, and Nicole is left on her own to keep the plane in the air, guided by an air traffic controller. Can the irresponsible and panic-stricken teen find a way to land the jet?', 'When wealthy executive Raymond Stone sends out his private plane to pick up his spoiled teenage daughter, Nicole, and a pair of his top-ranking employees, disaster strikes. While the jet flies through an electrical storm, the pilot and other passengers are incapacitated, and Nicole is left on her own to keep the plane in the air, guided by an air traffic controller. Can the irresponsible and panic-stricken teen find a way to land the jet?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYYXK19BmmqXDIshAmZU5XCthrB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19568'),
  ('1066413334504605148', 'Airwolf: The Movie', 1984, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Donald P. Bellisario', 'Donald P. Bellisario', 'Jan-Michael Vincent, Ernest Borgnine, Alex Cord, David Hemmings, Belinda Bauer, Deborah Pratt, Eugene Roche, W.K. Stratton', 'PG', 'Airwolf is capable of supersonic speeds, invisible to radar and armed with ultra state-of-the-art hardware. Airwolf is the most awesome aerial weapon ever developed. When the helicopter is stolen by Libyan mercenaries, Michael Archangel, Project director for the CIA, enlists the help of Vietnam veteran Stringfellow Hawke and his closest friend Dominic Santini, to attempt to recover the Airwolf. The mission throws them into the midst of Middle Eastern violence and destruction, where they come face to face with danger, romance and intrigue in their battle to re-possess the deadliest aerial weapon ever used.', 'Airwolf is capable of supersonic speeds, invisible to radar and armed with ultra state-of-the-art hardware. Airwolf is the most awesome aerial weapon ever developed. When the helicopter is stolen by Libyan mercenaries, Michael Archangel, Project director for the CIA, enlists the help of Vietnam veteran Stringfellow Hawke and his closest friend Dominic Santini, to attempt to recover the Airwolf. The mission throws them into the midst of Middle Eastern violence and destruction, where they come face to face with danger, romance and intrigue in their battle to re-possess the deadliest aerial weapon ever used.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7oxBfH1k2OvMcByjoIji9VQnWg7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61968'),
  ('594821121507505192', 'Aisha', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Rajshree Ojha', 'Javed Akhtar', 'Sonam Kapoor Ahuja, Abhay Deol, Cyrus Sahukar, Arunoday Singh, Ira Dubey, Amrita Puri, Lisa Haydon, Yuri Suri', 'PG', 'Aisha, who loves playing matchmaker much to her friend Arjun''s disapproval, finds a new target in the simple Shefali. But in the process, she ends up ruining her own relationship with close friends.', 'Aisha, who loves playing matchmaker much to her friend Arjun''s disapproval, finds a new target in the simple Shefali. But in the process, she ends up ruining her own relationship with close friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axShahJKiP33H3YypztYQ2SgJG3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44248'),
  ('603248961578168914', 'Aisha', 2022, 'Drama', 'Frank Berry', 'Frank Berry', 'Letitia Wright, Josh O''Connor, Lorcan Cranitch, Denis Conway, Stuart Graham, Ian Toner, Ruth McCabe, Pius Ojo', null, 'Aisha lives at a centre for asylum-seekers in Ireland in a state of ongoing uncertainty. Having fled Nigeria after a violent gang murdered members of her family, she is desperately trying to find some degree of permanency, where she and her mother can be reunited and live without fear. As she navigates the complex legal system to seek settlement in Ireland, she sparks an unlikely friendship with Conor, a new guard at the centre. A former prisoner, Conor’s life experience and calming presence resonate with Aisha, allowing for a tentative romance to begin. But the bond between the pair comes under strain as the threat of deportation looms ever larger.', 'Aisha lives at a centre for asylum-seekers in Ireland in a state of ongoing uncertainty. Having fled Nigeria after a violent gang murdered members of her family, she is desperately trying to find some degree of permanency, where she and her mother can be reunited and live without fear. As she navigates the complex legal system to seek settlement in Ireland, she sparks an unlikely friendship with Conor, a new guard at the centre. A former prisoner, Conor’s life experience and calming presence resonate with Aisha, allowing for a tentative romance to begin. But the bond between the pair comes under strain as the threat of deportation looms ever larger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tazlFOBWLxsFLdJbpZkRMwrMNz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820880'),
  ('700164261202736040', 'Aitraaz', 2004, 'Thriller, Romance, Drama', 'Mustan Alibhai Burmawalla, Abbas Alibhai Burmawalla, Ravi Yadav', 'Shiraz Ahmed, Shyam Goel', 'Akshay Kumar, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Amrish Puri, Paresh Rawal, Annu Kapoor, Upasna Singh, Anil Nagrath', 'PG-13', 'Raj, a married man, is falsely accused of rape by his ex-girlfriend who is also his employer''s wife. He decides to sue her for sexual harassment despite societal pressures.', 'Raj, a married man, is falsely accused of rape by his ex-girlfriend who is also his employer''s wife. He decides to sue her for sexual harassment despite societal pressures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tVt6N7vgIFnf8g6NzaqfjkQObr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22315'),
  ('1081375061853599131', 'Aiyaary', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Neeraj Pandey, Sudhir Palsane, Dominique Colin', 'Neeraj Pandey', 'Manoj Bajpayee, Sidharth Malhotra, Rakul Preet Singh, Anupam Kher, Naseeruddin Shah, Kumud Mishra, Adil Hussain, Vikram Gokhale', 'NR', 'An Indian Army officer is compelled to chase down his protege when the latter turns rogue and threatens to disrupt the country’s government and army.', 'An Indian Army officer is compelled to chase down his protege when the latter turns rogue and threatens to disrupt the country’s government and army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lfpxWPKRN9GOCdad5XhdxWuS3U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493620'),
  ('562158444359079190', 'Aiyyaa', 2012, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Sachin Kundalkar, Amal Chaudhary', 'Sachin Kundalkar', 'Rani Mukerji, Prithviraj Sukumaran, Nirmiti Sawant, Satish Alekar, Anita Date-Kelkar, Amey Wagh, Tamizh', null, 'Meenakshi, a Marathi gal with an ultra-sensitive sense of smell, lives her life in her dreams, dancing and enacting her favourite actresses Sridevi, Madhuri and Juhi. Not believing in arranged marriages, Meenakshi awaits her prince when she comes across Tamil artist Surya, to whom she is strangely attracted to.', 'Meenakshi, a Marathi gal with an ultra-sensitive sense of smell, lives her life in her dreams, dancing and enacting her favourite actresses Sridevi, Madhuri and Juhi. Not believing in arranged marriages, Meenakshi awaits her prince when she comes across Tamil artist Surya, to whom she is strangely attracted to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gz4zgMZGg3zYOLYL7qzOQwDP13.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137180'),
  ('809812563134801026', 'Aj Zombies!', 2017, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Julián Estrada, Daniel Martín Rodríguez', 'Bruno Rosina, Gonzalo Rodríguez Risco, Pablo Carrillo', 'Emilram Cossío, Anahí de Cárdenas, César Ritter, Miguel Iza, Liliana Trujillo, Pietro Sibille, Alicia Mercado, Julián Legaspi', null, 'Claudia and Felipe can''t be any more different. Only a zombie apocalypse could bring them together. A hilarious love story set in zombie times, Claudia, Felipe, a drunkard and a security guard must escape Lima together in search of safety.', 'Claudia and Felipe can''t be any more different. Only a zombie apocalypse could bring them together. A hilarious love story set in zombie times, Claudia, Felipe, a drunkard and a security guard must escape Lima together in search of safety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNyoezgLnyVDuPqZloKrG6njlq7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638688'),
  ('185323790392345658', 'Ajab Prem Ki Ghazab Kahani', 2009, 'Romance, Comedy, Action', 'Rajkumar Santoshi, Dharam Prakash, S. Thirunavukkarasu', 'Rajkumar Santoshi, R.D. Tailang', 'Ranbir Kapoor, Katrina Kaif, Upen Patel, Govind Namdeo, Darshan Jariwala, Mithilesh Chaturvedi, Navneet Nishan, Smita Jaykar', 'PG', 'When his love interest doesn''t show up for a meeting, a man and his friends go to Goa in order to find her, where they discover she loves someone else.', 'When his love interest doesn''t show up for a meeting, a man and his friends go to Goa in order to find her, where they discover she loves someone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6IC8PQZAynsUAh0MDvopR3zDTRk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24827'),
  ('556288643499773874', 'Ajami', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', 'Scandar Copti, Yaron Shani', 'Scandar Copti, Yaron Shani', 'Fouad Habash, Nisrine Rihan, Elias Saba, Youssef Sahwani, Abu George Shibli, Ibrahim Frege, Scandar Copti, Shahir Kabaha', null, 'Ajami is an area of Tel Aviv in Israel where Arabs, Palestinians, Jews and Christians live together in a tense atmosphere. Omar, an Israeli Arab, struggles to save his family from a gang of extortionists. He also courts a beautiful Christian girl: Hadir. Malek, an illegal Palestinian worker, tries to collect enough money to pay for his mother''s operation. Dando, an Israeli cop, does his utmost to find his missing brother who may have been killed by Palestinians.', 'Ajami is an area of Tel Aviv in Israel where Arabs, Palestinians, Jews and Christians live together in a tense atmosphere. Omar, an Israeli Arab, struggles to save his family from a gang of extortionists. He also courts a beautiful Christian girl: Hadir. Malek, an illegal Palestinian worker, tries to collect enough money to pay for his mother''s operation. Dando, an Israeli cop, does his utmost to find his missing brother who may have been killed by Palestinians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wA7rM6zoWqJDT9BG5Vj92WbEJEp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24424'),
  ('135640200913271804', 'Ajantrik', 1958, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ritwik Ghatak, Dinen Gupta', 'Ritwik Ghatak', 'Kali Bannerjee, Gangapada Basu, Satindra Bhattacharya, Tulsi Chakraborty, Anil Chatterjee, Shriman Deepak, Kajal Gupta, Gyanesh Mukhopadhyay', null, 'Bimal is a taxi-driver in a small provincial town. He lives alone, his taxi (an old 1920 Chevrolet jalopy which he named Jagaddal) is his only companion and, although very battered, it is the apple of Bimal''s eye.', 'Bimal is a taxi-driver in a small provincial town. He lives alone, his taxi (an old 1920 Chevrolet jalopy which he named Jagaddal) is his only companion and, although very battered, it is the apple of Bimal''s eye.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7M1Eky1kGfTnHGscanKT80tbW18.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166798'),
  ('325633603832787752', 'Ajeeb Daastaans', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pushkar Singh, Jishnu Bhattacharjee, Siddharth Diwan', 'Uzma Khan, Sumit Saxena, Shashank Khaitan', 'Konkona Sen Sharma, Shefali Shah, Aditi Rao Hydari, Abhishek Banerjee, Nushrratt Bharuccha, Inayat Verma, Jaideep Ahlawat, Fatima Sana Shaikh', 'NR', 'An anthology of four stories that explore the surprising ways in which unexpected catalysts inflame the uncomfortable emotions simmering under fractured relationships.', 'An anthology of four stories that explore the surprising ways in which unexpected catalysts inflame the uncomfortable emotions simmering under fractured relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KHjF8H2bqvQdmvkmeAlFjKXkmB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:802403'),
  ('594101275643925254', 'Ajin: Demi-Human', 2017, 'Action, Horror, Mystery', 'Katsuyuki Motohiro, Toru Yamamoto, Akira Sako', 'Gamon Sakurai, Masahiro Yamaura, Hiroshi Seko', 'Takeru Satoh, Go Ayano, Minami Hamabe, Yuki Yamada, Rina Kawaei, Yudai Chiba, Yu Shirota, Tetsuji Tamayama', null, 'Kei Nagai dies in a car accident, but realises he is a type of immortal known as Ajin. Hunted by humans, Ajin is eventually found by the government and used as a subject in cruel experiments. He finds fellow demi-humans along the way as he escapes and goes on the run.', 'Kei Nagai dies in a car accident, but realises he is a type of immortal known as Ajin. Hunted by humans, Ajin is eventually found by the government and used as a subject in cruel experiments. He finds fellow demi-humans along the way as he escapes and goes on the run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8rfdqGtc4fH4e0Bq0Ab3G5HogyM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433128'),
  ('610354147996531382', 'Ajin: Demi-Human – Collide', 2016, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Hiroyuki Seshita, Hiroaki Ando, Yoshikazu Iwanami', 'Hiroshi Seko', 'Mamoru Miyano, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Aya Suzaki, Daisuke Hirakawa, Hiroyuki Kinoshita, Hochu Otsuka, Jun Fukuyama, Kenichi Suzumura', null, 'For high schooler Kei—and for at least forty-six others—immortality comes as the nastiest surprise ever. Sadly for Kei, such a feat doesn''t make him a superhero. In the eyes of both the general public and governments, he''s a rare specimen who needs to be hunted down and handed over to scientists to be experimented on for life—a demi-human who must die a thousand deaths for the benefit of humanity.', 'For high schooler Kei—and for at least forty-six others—immortality comes as the nastiest surprise ever. Sadly for Kei, such a feat doesn''t make him a superhero. In the eyes of both the general public and governments, he''s a rare specimen who needs to be hunted down and handed over to scientists to be experimented on for life—a demi-human who must die a thousand deaths for the benefit of humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ie5qRvi1kkIBKVkKcjUkH2lykrv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394322'),
