  ('422029362111700086', 'Ajji', 2017, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Devashish Makhija', 'Devashish Makhija', 'Sushama Deshpande, Sharvani Suryavanshi, Smita Tambe, Abhishek Banerjee, Sadiya Siddiqui, Sudhir Pandey, Vikas Kumar, Kiran Khoje', null, 'After her 10-year-old granddaughter Manda is brutally raped by a serial sex offender, the young girl''s Ajji sets out to seek revenge, after custodians of law refuse to bring the rapist to book, thanks to his influential political background.', 'After her 10-year-old granddaughter Manda is brutally raped by a serial sex offender, the young girl''s Ajji sets out to seek revenge, after custodians of law refuse to bring the rapist to book, thanks to his influential political background.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9o0MyXY9n7oukVLmH84v9yMCoT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:482154'),
  ('626953606889444541', 'Ajnabee', 2001, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Abbas Alibhai Burmawalla, Mustan Alibhai Burmawalla, Rajan Kinagi', 'Neeraj Vora, Shyam Goel, Robin Bhatt', 'Bobby Deol, Akshay Kumar, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Bipasha Basu, Johny Lever, Amita Nangia, Narendra Bedi, Sheela Sharma', null, 'Raj and Priya befriend their new neighbors Vicky and Sonia. One day, Raj wakes up in Vicky''s house and finds out that Sonia has been murdered and he''s being framed for it. On the run, he must try and prove his innocence with the support of his loving wife.', 'Raj and Priya befriend their new neighbors Vicky and Sonia. One day, Raj wakes up in Vicky''s house and finds out that Sonia has been murdered and he''s being framed for it. On the run, he must try and prove his innocence with the support of his loving wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIscKIZxR4HXzLiWgAU7GykfpfI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22316'),
  ('181999035736637244', 'Ajooba', 1991, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Gennadi Vasilyev, Shashi Kapoor, Peter Pereira', 'Brij Katyal, Prayag Raj, Bharat Bhalla', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Dimple Kapadia, Rishi Kapoor, Shammi Kapoor, Bakhtawar Murad Khan, Ariadna Shengelaia, Saeed Jaffrey, Amrish Puri', null, 'The evil Vizier of Baharistan kills the royal family and takes power for himself. The real prince, who has survived his machinations, returns to his homeland to avenge his parents as a masked vigilante.', 'The evil Vizier of Baharistan kills the royal family and takes power for himself. The real prince, who has survived his machinations, returns to his homeland to avenge his parents as a masked vigilante.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ai4kr0EVDnEwIvD4r5RKVkNFu7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146255'),
  ('196816882197889820', 'Ajoomma', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'He Shuming, Hwang Kyung-hyun', 'He Shuming, Kris Ong', 'Hong Huifang, Kang Hyung-suk, Jeong Dong-hwan, Shane Pow, Yeo Jin-goo, Han Yeo-reum, Shin Dam-su, Fanny Teo', null, 'A widow obsessed with Korean soap operas travels abroad for the first time in her life and finds more than she bargained for in Seoul.', 'A widow obsessed with Korean soap operas travels abroad for the first time in her life and finds more than she bargained for in Seoul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stg68STX02Cwtpgj5PDqfQhb3dc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958937'),
  ('155916985148870353', 'AK vs AK', 2020, 'Comedy, Action, Drama, Crime', 'Vikramaditya Motwane, Swapnil S. Sonawane, Tavishi Ghosh', 'Avinash Sampath', 'Anil Kapoor, Anurag Kashyap, Sonam Kapoor Ahuja, Harshvardhan Kapoor, Boney Kapoor, Sucharita Tyagi, Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Yogita Bihani', null, 'After a public spat with a movie star, a disgraced director retaliates by kidnapping the actor''s daughter, filming the search for her in real-time.', 'After a public spat with a movie star, a disgraced director retaliates by kidnapping the actor''s daughter, filming the search for her in real-time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ULEEvH0hDYnbWN3nClrb88sYCF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:735919'),
  ('231759943177522172', 'AKA', 2023, 'Action', 'Morgan S. Dalibert, Florent Astolfi', 'Alban Lenoir, Morgan S. Dalibert', 'Alban Lenoir, Éric Cantona, Thibault de Montalembert, Sveva Alviti, Saïdou Camara, Lucille Guillaume, Kevin Layne, Philippe Résimont', null, 'A steely special ops agent finds his morality put to the test when he infiltrates a crime syndicate and unexpectedly bonds with the boss'' young son.', 'A steely special ops agent finds his morality put to the test when he infiltrates a crime syndicate and unexpectedly bonds with the boss'' young son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4juLCxzbdgKJ6pgLV95d6NT8wjy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1102776'),
  ('566867489532163379', 'Aka Ana', 2008, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Antoine D''Agata', null, 'Rei Amami, Saki Haneiro, lzumi Hayashi', null, 'A photographer documents his nightly expeditions through Japan''s world of sex for hire. Filmed across 120 nights in Japan''s brothels and presented in 120 fragments ― divided into 6 chapters and 6 female prostitutes.', 'A photographer documents his nightly expeditions through Japan''s world of sex for hire. Filmed across 120 nights in Japan''s brothels and presented in 120 fragments ― divided into 6 chapters and 6 female prostitutes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Q4ploXXdD88Hruk6mHntmgwVDJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316681'),
  ('87838611768796370', 'Aka Medaka', 2015, 'TV Movie, Drama, Comedy', 'Hideta Takahata', 'Hiroyuki Yatsu', 'Kazunari Ninomiya, Takeshi Kitano, Gaku Hamada, Hiroko Yakushimaru, Tsurube Shofukutei, Teruyuki Kagawa, Atsushi Hashimoto, Yukiya Kitamura', null, 'One of the hottest selling tickets in town is to see the hugely popular rakugoka, or comic storyteller, Danshun. Danshun himself was inspired as a little boy to become a rakugoka after seeing the legendary Danshi.', 'One of the hottest selling tickets in town is to see the hugely popular rakugoka, or comic storyteller, Danshun. Danshun himself was inspired as a little boy to become a rakugoka after seeing the legendary Danshi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUr5C4NcXntJVkCwGT6rzvKn4Vy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375306'),
  ('914099542732404678', 'Akaash Vani', 2013, 'Romance, Drama', 'Luv Ranjan, Sudhir K Chaudhary', 'Luv Ranjan', 'Kartik Aaryan, Nushrratt Bharuccha, Sunny Singh, Fatima Sana Shaikh, Kiran Kumar, Mahesh Thakur', null, 'Akaash and Vani leaving their house to go to college. Vani catches her train on the other hand Akaash travels by a truck as he misses his train. As they reach their the next day Vaani says "I love you" to Akaash. He replies to this in a filmy way and both of them become friends. Akaash and Vani fall in love with each other and continue a 4 year relationship.', 'Akaash and Vani leaving their house to go to college. Vani catches her train on the other hand Akaash travels by a truck as he misses his train. As they reach their the next day Vaani says "I love you" to Akaash. He replies to this in a filmy way and both of them become friends. Akaash and Vani fall in love with each other and continue a 4 year relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6Bi6Xm3VhfkHkdyRqRRX76H2Jj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181462'),
  ('1129600445723272300', 'Akallinen mies', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Edvin Laine, Olavi Tuomi, Olavi Tuomi', 'Seppo Lappalainen', 'Martti Järvinen, Elisabeth Haavisto, Kauko Helovirta, Raili Tiensuu, Esa Saario, Maija-Leena Soinne, Ahti Kuoppala, Ismo Kallio', null, 'The farmer now has found a wife.', 'The farmer now has found a wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csXCh8PNEbhV7Zy0GjbXWGaA2Ez.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375755'),
  ('632479648852431738', 'Åke and His World', 1984, 'Drama', 'Allan Edwall, Jörgen Persson, Kerstin Eriksdotter', 'Allan Edwall', 'Martin Lindström, Loa Falkman, Gunnel Fred, Katja Blomquist, Ulla Sjöblom, Suzanne Ernrup, Björn Gustafson, Alexander Skarsgård', null, 'Åke and his world is a long, lyrical study of a Swedish country doctor of the 1930s. Åke is the doctor''s six-year-old son, from whose point of view the film is told. His best friend is Kalle Nubb. Åke is very frightened of the janitor Bergström as well as the lunatic Anne-Marie.', 'Åke and his world is a long, lyrical study of a Swedish country doctor of the 1930s. Åke is the doctor''s six-year-old son, from whose point of view the film is told. His best friend is Kalle Nubb. Åke is very frightened of the janitor Bergström as well as the lunatic Anne-Marie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l31fLIvqpPkjxcNp3JvaIHqkz2Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125926'),
  ('178750821071321463', 'Akeelah and the Bee', 2006, 'Drama', 'Doug Atchison, M. David Mullen, Rodney Allen Hooks', 'Doug Atchison', 'Keke Palmer, Laurence Fishburne, Angela Bassett, Curtis Armstrong, J.R. Villarreal, Sean Michael Afable, Sahara Garey, Lee Thompson Young', 'PG', '11-year-old Akeelah Anderson has a way with words. After winning her schoolwide spelling bee, she decides to enter the competition, despite her classmates'' derision and the antipathy of her mother Tanya. Thanks to the efforts of her teacher Dr. Larabee, she reaches the finals. As she gets to know her fellow competitors, Akeelah realizes that coming first isn''t everything in life.', '11-year-old Akeelah Anderson has a way with words. After winning her schoolwide spelling bee, she decides to enter the competition, despite her classmates'' derision and the antipathy of her mother Tanya. Thanks to the efforts of her teacher Dr. Larabee, she reaches the finals. As she gets to know her fellow competitors, Akeelah realizes that coming first isn''t everything in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLejxaLJu8Qh5F2VKacWniMSZ3v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13751'),
  ('548053748053287448', 'Akelarre', 1984, 'Drama, History', 'José Luis Alcaine, Pedro Olea', 'Pedro Olea, Gonzalo Goikoetxea', 'Sílvia Munt, José Luis López Vázquez, Mary Carrillo, Walter Vidarte, Patxi Bisquert, Iñaki Miramón, Mariví Bilbao, Mikel Garmendia', null, 'A small village in Navarre, Spain, XVII century. Garazi''s grandmother is burned at the stake when accussed of being a witch and convicted by an inquisitor, something that brings Garazi under suspicion and eventually into prison, where she is atrociously tortured and humiliated.', 'A small village in Navarre, Spain, XVII century. Garazi''s grandmother is burned at the stake when accussed of being a witch and convicted by an inquisitor, something that brings Garazi under suspicion and eventually into prison, where she is atrociously tortured and humiliated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/djFTczff4Y8SMqyvZLFqHmHS1h6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263412'),
  ('77303367375348594', 'Akele Hum Akele Tum', 1995, 'Drama', 'Mansoor Khan, Baba Azmi', 'Mansoor Khan', 'Aamir Khan, Manisha Koirala, Tanvi Azmi, Deven Verma, Rakesh Roshan, Rohini Hattangadi, Satish Shah, Shafi Inamdar', null, 'Rohit and wealthy Kiran Dayal meet each other and fall in love. They intend to marry, but Kiran''s parents will not permit her to marry beneath her class. Kiran is adamant, and the marriage goes through without the blessings of the Dayals. They live in harmony for months, even after Kiran gives birth to Sunil. Then they start to have differences, which are minor at present, and then snowball...', 'Rohit and wealthy Kiran Dayal meet each other and fall in love. They intend to marry, but Kiran''s parents will not permit her to marry beneath her class. Kiran is adamant, and the marriage goes through without the blessings of the Dayals. They live in harmony for months, even after Kiran gives birth to Sunil. Then they start to have differences, which are minor at present, and then snowball...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpCbEiAstlOOIhjbQhQrTHF4ZEg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16894'),
  ('989061269577259930', 'Akhanda', 2021, 'Action, Drama', 'Boyapati Srinu, C. Ramprasad', 'M. Rathnam, Boyapati Srinu', 'Nandamuri Balakrishna, Pragya Jaiswal, Poorna, Nitin Mehta, Srikanth, Viji Chandrasekhar, Avinash, Subbaraju', null, 'Brothers Murali Krishna and Akhanda are separated at birth. They grow up to lead completely separate lives, Murali as a local hero, and Akhanda as a secluded Shiva devotee. But when the lives of Murali and his family are in danger, his long-lost brother finally returns.', 'Brothers Murali Krishna and Akhanda are separated at birth. They grow up to lead completely separate lives, Murali as a local hero, and Akhanda as a secluded Shiva devotee. But when the lives of Murali and his family are in danger, his long-lost brother finally returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mjw3CdnDJk3W0gki3N9K5Ol0EL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:794961'),
  ('410501320152110158', 'Akhiyon Se Goli Maare', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Harmesh Malhotra', null, 'Govinda, Raveena Tandon, Govinda, Kader Khan, Johny Lever, Asrani, Shakti Kapoor, Dinesh Hingoo', null, 'Akelinder or Bhangari Dada (Kader Khan) has a shop at Chor bazaar which he runs illegally, he lives with his wife and only daughter Kiran (Raveena Tandon). Bhangari wants his daughter to be married to a gangster, so he begins his search. He finds Shakti dada (Shakti Kapoor) and wants him to be married to Kiran but Kiran already loves Raj (Govinda), a wealthy man who has no links to crime. But in order to satisfy her dad, she persuades Raj to pose as a Gangster for time being. For this they search a Trainer called Subramaniam (Johnny Lever), who teaches Raj to act as a Gangster. Finally Raj becomes successful posing as a gangster but Bhangari''s dad (Kader Khan) somehow appears and doesn''t want Kiran to marry to a gangster. Will Raj be able to clean his image?', 'Akelinder or Bhangari Dada (Kader Khan) has a shop at Chor bazaar which he runs illegally, he lives with his wife and only daughter Kiran (Raveena Tandon). Bhangari wants his daughter to be married to a gangster, so he begins his search. He finds Shakti dada (Shakti Kapoor) and wants him to be married to Kiran but Kiran already loves Raj (Govinda), a wealthy man who has no links to crime. But in order to satisfy her dad, she persuades Raj to pose as a Gangster for time being. For this they search a Trainer called Subramaniam (Johnny Lever), who teaches Raj to act as a Gangster. Finally Raj becomes successful posing as a gangster but Bhangari''s dad (Kader Khan) somehow appears and doesn''t want Kiran to marry to a gangster. Will Raj be able to clean his image?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qK7ceXlDh10AJxEz53dHlWhjPYL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158723'),
  ('1047718073130294251', 'Aki no Kanade', 2015, 'Animation, Music, Drama', 'Miyuki Ishida, Youhei Yaegashi, Youhei Suzuki', null, 'Rina Sato, Kenji Hamada', null, 'Aki Miyagawa moved to Tokyo to pursue her dream to be a taiko drummer, but had a hard time balancing her strict training regimen with her part-time job. Now, after 15 years, she''s returning to coach others for a taiko festival.', 'Aki Miyagawa moved to Tokyo to pursue her dream to be a taiko drummer, but had a hard time balancing her strict training regimen with her part-time job. Now, after 15 years, she''s returning to coach others for a taiko festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bl9Ahw3zEeGQ4XeHQnYjuEncjIf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334493'),
  ('945181256514987529', 'Akihabara@DEEP', 2006, 'Action, Drama, Comedy', 'Takashi Minamoto', 'Takashi Minamoto, Hajime Narita', 'Hiroki Narimiya, Yu Yamada, Shugo Oshinari, Haruma Miura, Shinobu Terajima, Yoshiyoshi Arakawa', null, 'Set in Tokyo''s otaku mecca Akihabara, "Akihabara@DEEP" tells the story of five otaku who drop out of society and end up founding their own successful IT venture called Crook. But Nakagomi, president of an influential electronics company called Digital Capital, will do anything to get his hands on Crook.', 'Set in Tokyo''s otaku mecca Akihabara, "Akihabara@DEEP" tells the story of five otaku who drop out of society and end up founding their own successful IT venture called Crook. But Nakagomi, president of an influential electronics company called Digital Capital, will do anything to get his hands on Crook.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ySn21gaFKejhX6z0RODWi3tt1E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22024'),
  ('678655071045101203', 'Akin Ang Gabi', 2025, 'Drama', 'Joel Ferrer, Jeyow Evangelista, Roni S. Benaid', 'Joel Ferrer', 'Queenie De Mesa, VR Relosa, Trish Gaden, Allen Legazpi, Claudia Enriquez, Aidan Valentino, Evandeer Fieldman Catalan, Rosalie May Buban', null, 'A steamy tale of a young woman’s awakening. After her first encounter with her crush, Alexa learns to use her body to take control in a world that ignores her—until her secret life spirals into scandal and betrayal.', 'A steamy tale of a young woman’s awakening. After her first encounter with her crush, Alexa learns to use her body to take control in a world that ignores her—until her secret life spirals into scandal and betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFqXF5GwmdFfLlv6bU98kT5hEes.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1580234'),
  ('839075525304184785', 'Akira', 1988, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action', 'Katsuhiro Otomo, Katsuji Misawa, Takashi Nakamura', 'Izo Hashimoto, Katsuhiro Otomo', 'Mitsuo Iwata, Nozomu Sasaki, Mami Koyama, Taro Ishida, Mizuho Suzuki, Tessyo Genda, Koichi Kitamura, Yuriko Fuchizaki', 'R', 'A secret military project endangers Neo-Tokyo when it turns a biker gang member into a rampaging psychic psychopath that only two teenagers and a group of psychics can stop.', 'A secret military project endangers Neo-Tokyo when it turns a biker gang member into a rampaging psychic psychopath that only two teenagers and a group of psychics can stop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/neZ0ykEsPqxamsX6o5QNUFILQrz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149'),
  ('238584379139461812', 'Akira', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'A. R. Murugadoss, R. D. Rajasekhar', 'A. R. Murugadoss, Santha Kumar', 'Sonakshi Sinha, Konkona Sen Sharma, Urmila Mahanta, Anurag Kashyap, Amit Sadh, Raai Laxmi, Mithun Chakraborty, Atul Kulkarni', null, 'Akira Sharma is your average Jane from Jodhpur. Early in life she sees an atrocity committed on a neighbour and learns to defend herself. And, a spitfire is born.', 'Akira Sharma is your average Jane from Jodhpur. Early in life she sees an atrocity committed on a neighbour and learns to defend herself. And, a spitfire is born.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jU0gw5z6JrazhGOh4UfULKqt268.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404579'),
  ('1087817511681850730', 'Akitsu Hot Springs', 1962, 'Romance, Drama', 'Yoshishige Yoshida, Tōichirō Narushima', 'Yoshishige Yoshida', 'Mariko Okada, Hiroyuki Nagato, So Yamamura, Jūkichi Uno, Eijirō Tōno, Fukuko Sayo, Sumiko Hidaka, Teruo Yoshida', null, 'Just after WW2, a romance between an innkeeper and a man with tuberculosis unravels near a thermal spring.', 'Just after WW2, a romance between an innkeeper and a man with tuberculosis unravels near a thermal spring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h1ArecIy9TpzLvBQ9DWfxRby3ug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33342'),
  ('670277891204579674', 'Akkare Akkare Akkare', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Priyadarshan, S. Kumar', 'Sreenivasan', 'Mohanlal, Sreenivasan, Mukesh, M G Soman, Maniyanpilla Raju, Nedumudi Venu, Sukumari, Jagadish', null, 'Ramdas and Vijayan are sent on a mission to the US to retrieve a priceless gold crown stolen from India. With a couple of clues, the comic duo embarks on the adventure.', 'Ramdas and Vijayan are sent on a mission to the US to retrieve a priceless gold crown stolen from India. With a couple of clues, the comic duo embarks on the adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ks1nhkO1xvTuZE1iadkQJoQanlX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152625'),
  ('641650492961132135', 'Akko''s Secret', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy', 'Taisuke Kawamura, Satoru Karasawa, Tomoko Jo', 'Mika Ohmori, Masahiro Fukuma, Masatoshi Yamaguchi', 'Haruka Ayase, Masaki Okada, Takeshi Kaga, Masako Motai, Muga Tsukaji, Shosuke Tanihara, Kazue Fukiishi, Ren Osugi', null, '5th-grader Atsuko Kagami, nicknamed Akko, comes into possession of a magical mirror that lets her transform into anything she wishes. Wanting to grow up beautiful, she gets a job at a cosmetics company, and finds true love. What will Akko do to keep the company afloat and her secrets hidden? Only her technical magical compact can help!', '5th-grader Atsuko Kagami, nicknamed Akko, comes into possession of a magical mirror that lets her transform into anything she wishes. Wanting to grow up beautiful, she gets a job at a cosmetics company, and finds true love. What will Akko do to keep the company afloat and her secrets hidden? Only her technical magical compact can help!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqRAWPUYDsU4077KowZgpowSj6G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189151'),
  ('474637242013251586', 'Ako', 1964, 'Drama', 'Hiroshi Teshigahara', 'Hiroshi Teshigahara', 'Miki Irie, Teruko Hasegawa, Yoko Matsushita', null, 'A day in the life of Ako, a 16-year-old Japanese girl, and her friends and co-workers. An alarm clock wakes her in a dorm; she gets ready for work and travels to a large bakery. We see her with friends, chatting and laughing, as well as working. They go out, seven of them jammed in an old Pontiac: bowling, then to an amusement park, then driving around. Car trouble may put her at risk. Is she going to be okay? One of four film sketches on the problems of adolescents facing the adult world in the 1960s included in the anthology film That Tender Age (La fleur de l''âge, ou Les adolescentes). The three other sketches were directed by Michel Brault, Jean Rouch, and Gian Vittorio Baldi.', 'A day in the life of Ako, a 16-year-old Japanese girl, and her friends and co-workers. An alarm clock wakes her in a dorm; she gets ready for work and travels to a large bakery. We see her with friends, chatting and laughing, as well as working. They go out, seven of them jammed in an old Pontiac: bowling, then to an amusement park, then driving around. Car trouble may put her at risk. Is she going to be okay? One of four film sketches on the problems of adolescents facing the adult world in the 1960s included in the anthology film That Tender Age (La fleur de l''âge, ou Les adolescentes). The three other sketches were directed by Michel Brault, Jean Rouch, and Gian Vittorio Baldi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kUgpIdSPGz0JZTXTK7u4ty0Fby.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105582'),
  ('1002896720340630740', 'Akoibon', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Édouard Baer', null, 'Jean Rochefort, Édouard Baer, Chiara Mastroianni, Benoît Poelvoorde, Jeanne Moreau, Marie Denarnaud, Nader Boussandel, François Rollin', null, 'A disparate group of people meet at a hotel on a gorgeous and isolated Mediterranean island. Meanwhile, a woman schemes to get even with its owner.', 'A disparate group of people meet at a hotel on a gorgeous and isolated Mediterranean island. Meanwhile, a woman schemes to get even with its owner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOUl01CbPiFhxq52M8TTxo8i1E4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60448'),
  ('793756978260088248', 'Akran', 1969, 'Drama', 'Richard Myers', null, 'Robert Ohlrich, Pat Myers, Jake Leed, Mary Leed', null, '"A feature-length deluge of incessant, brilliant bursts of images (short takes and jump cuts, single frames in series, freeze-frames slightly altered between takes) it creates a Joyce-like dense and sombre mosaic of memory and sensory impressions, a texture instead of a plot, a dream-like flow of visually-induced associations often flashing by faster than they can be absorbed. Described by the director as an ''anxious allegory and chilling album of nostalgia,'' its penetrating monomania is unexpectedly — subversively — realized to be a statement about American today: the alienation and atomization o technological consumer society is reflected in the very style of the film." - Amos Vogel, Film as a Subversive Art. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2010.', '"A feature-length deluge of incessant, brilliant bursts of images (short takes and jump cuts, single frames in series, freeze-frames slightly altered between takes) it creates a Joyce-like dense and sombre mosaic of memory and sensory impressions, a texture instead of a plot, a dream-like flow of visually-induced associations often flashing by faster than they can be absorbed. Described by the director as an ''anxious allegory and chilling album of nostalgia,'' its penetrating monomania is unexpectedly — subversively — realized to be a statement about American today: the alienation and atomization o technological consumer society is reflected in the very style of the film." - Amos Vogel, Film as a Subversive Art. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2010.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLJlltu59Yc6Ypenp9ZY2FSd7fG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173029'),
  ('421860270439221848', 'Akrobatisches Potpourri', 1895, 'Documentary', 'Max Skladanowsky', null, 'Grunato', null, 'Eight circus performers known as the Grunato family perform their famous balancing act.', 'Eight circus performers known as the Grunato family perform their famous balancing act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foYCfHpwfb7Rl9mXzc0WShdGoUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194085'),
  ('1096115178501671171', 'Akron', 2015, 'Romance, Drama', 'Sasha King, Brian O''Donnell, Patrick Jordan', 'Brian O''Donnell', 'Matthew Frias, Edmund Donovan, Andréa Burns, Amy da Luz, Joseph Melendez, Isabel Rose Machado, Cailan Rose', null, 'Benny, a college freshman at the University of Akron, Ohio meets and falls for fellow freshman Christopher at a football game. With the support of their families and friends they embark on a new relationship. But a tragic event in the past involving their mothers soon comes to light and threatens to tear them apart.', 'Benny, a college freshman at the University of Akron, Ohio meets and falls for fellow freshman Christopher at a football game. With the support of their families and friends they embark on a new relationship. But a tragic event in the past involving their mothers soon comes to light and threatens to tear them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7G92ackDnKzwqdBgqmR3xDsqHOE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361018'),
  ('869997502610439016', 'Aks', 2001, 'Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Rakeysh Omprakash Mehra, Kiran Deohans, Kunal Kapoor', 'Rakeysh Omprakash Mehra, Kamlesh Pandey', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Manoj Bajpayee, Raveena Tandon, Nandita Das, K.K. Raina, Kamal Chopra, Tanvi Azmi, Vinit Kumar', null, 'On the trail of an underworld contract killer, a dedicated police officer is thrust into a battle between good vs evil.', 'On the trail of an underworld contract killer, a dedicated police officer is thrust into a battle between good vs evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vGi15Vx0KsU9ngvE6jpB2lSXhq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152035'),
  ('160061198738454573', 'Aksar', 2006, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Ananth Narayan Mahadevan', 'Ananth Narayan Mahadevan', 'Emraan Hashmi, Udita Goswami, Dino Morea, Tara Sharma, Suresh Menon, Rajat Bedi', null, 'A love triangle where everybody is blackmailing the other two gets a nasty upset when one of them is suddenly found murdered.', 'A love triangle where everybody is blackmailing the other two gets a nasty upset when one of them is suddenly found murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNgA58yyd3tO5e3ti1MocKygKhn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324218'),
  ('74782038840669252', 'Akvaariorakkaus', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paul-Anders Simma, Claes Olsson, Pertti Mutanen', 'Tove Idström', 'Tiina Lymi, Nicke Lignell, Minna Pirilä, Satu Silvo, Antti Virmavirta, Riitta-Liisa Helminen, Olli Tuominen, Mika Nuojua', null, 'Waitress Saara meets handsome journalist Joni, and soon moves in to live with him. Joni tries his best to satisfy Saara sexually but, disturbed by violent lesbian fantasies, she is unable to experience orgasm. Trying to cope with the situation, Saara has another brief affair back in her old home town.', 'Waitress Saara meets handsome journalist Joni, and soon moves in to live with him. Joni tries his best to satisfy Saara sexually but, disturbed by violent lesbian fantasies, she is unable to experience orgasm. Trying to cope with the situation, Saara has another brief affair back in her old home town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ai0iLfhWziDZKJUyBfQV29qH3GA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285110'),
  ('35725050882948001', 'Al Berto', 2017, 'Drama', 'Vicente Alves do Ó, Rui Poças, Pedro Melo', 'Vicente Alves do Ó', 'Ricardo Teixeira, José Pimentão, Ana Vilela da Costa, João Villas-Boas, Rita Loureiro, Mia Tomé, Gabriela Barros, Raquel Rocha Vieira', null, 'Portugal, 1975. A time of rough changes. A young gay artist trapped in a small seaside town ran by communist winds. Al Berto, the writer, embodies an entire moving generation. He and his friends exude youth, eccentricity and hope for the future - but right after the fall of Portugal''s dictatorship system, the country is not yet ready for his love story.', 'Portugal, 1975. A time of rough changes. A young gay artist trapped in a small seaside town ran by communist winds. Al Berto, the writer, embodies an entire moving generation. He and his friends exude youth, eccentricity and hope for the future - but right after the fall of Portugal''s dictatorship system, the country is not yet ready for his love story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRnNXSEhPRd9i5odjc2l066EMnu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470163'),
  ('641539429924759226', 'Al Capone', 1959, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Drama', 'Richard Wilson, Lucien Ballard', 'Malvin Wald, Henry F. Greenberg', 'Rod Steiger, Fay Spain, James Gregory, Martin Balsam, Nehemiah Persoff, Murvyn Vye, Robert Gist, Lewis Charles', null, 'In this unusually accurate biography, small-time hood Al Capone comes to Chicago at the dawn of Prohibition to be the bodyguard of racketeer Johnny Torrio. Capone''s rise in Chicago gangdom is followed through murder, extortion, and political fraud. He becomes head of Chicago''s biggest "business," but moves inexorably toward his downfall and ignominious end.', 'In this unusually accurate biography, small-time hood Al Capone comes to Chicago at the dawn of Prohibition to be the bodyguard of racketeer Johnny Torrio. Capone''s rise in Chicago gangdom is followed through murder, extortion, and political fraud. He becomes head of Chicago''s biggest "business," but moves inexorably toward his downfall and ignominious end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmtLUojTRYTswWEx7U9lWjZeZtx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43051'),
  ('535923353341178941', 'Al cuore si comanda', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Giulio Pietromarchi, Giovanni Morricone', 'Roberto De Giorgi, Rosa Menduni', 'Claudia Gerini, Pierfrancesco Favino, Sabrina Impacciatore, Pierre Cosso, Giovanni Esposito, Valentina Carnelutti, Francesca Antonelli, Elda Alvigini', null, 'Lorenza is 30 years old and has not yet found the man of her life. Not wanting to be alone, she decides to take the penniless Riccardo as her husband "for rent".', 'Lorenza is 30 years old and has not yet found the man of her life. Not wanting to be alone, she decides to take the penniless Riccardo as her husband "for rent".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxNwDsselTptcp7MB5K08dzMk7M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114080'),
  ('558151354210645151', 'Al final del camino', 2009, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Roberto Santiago, Juan Antonio Castaño', 'Roberto Santiago, Javier Gullón', 'Fernando Tejero, Malena Alterio, Javier Gutiérrez, Diego Peretti, Javier Mora, Cristina Alcázar, Jorge Monje, Luis Callejo', null, 'A photographer and a journalist who despise each other must pretend that they are a couple when they are sent to cover the story of a guru, and encounter a number of off-the-wall situations en route through Galicia.', 'A photographer and a journalist who despise each other must pretend that they are a couple when they are sent to cover the story of a guru, and encounter a number of off-the-wall situations en route through Galicia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaPqMVNvVKW00iZNgbYj8a7fcN1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26846'),
  ('1042200370388186896', 'Al lupo, al lupo', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Danilo Desideri, Carlo Verdone', 'Filippo Ascione, Piero De Bernardi, Leonardo Benvenuti', 'Carlo Verdone, Sergio Rubini, Francesca Neri, Barry Morse, Loris Paiusco, Giampiero Bianchi, Cecilia Luci, Alberto Marozzi', null, 'Vanni, Gregorio and Livia are brothers. The first is a well-known pianist, the second has abandoned his career as an aspiring violinist to become a deejay. When Vanni discovers that his father has disappeared into thin air, together with Gregorio they decide to call his sister Livia. The three relatives travel the length and breadth of Tuscany to find their missing parent.', 'Vanni, Gregorio and Livia are brothers. The first is a well-known pianist, the second has abandoned his career as an aspiring violinist to become a deejay. When Vanni discovers that his father has disappeared into thin air, together with Gregorio they decide to call his sister Livia. The three relatives travel the length and breadth of Tuscany to find their missing parent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7z5tdHsxZ73bCzHanSIFCt3oSdg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58744'),
