  ('316176626700199003', 'Al Pacino: The Reluctant Star', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Lukas Hoffmann', null, 'Al Pacino, Marthe Keller, Jerry Schatzberg, Lawrence Grobel, Mónica del Castillo', null, 'Al Pacino is a mystery. He is fire and ice at the same time. His attraction is animalistic, his looks frightening. From the ghetto of the Bronx in New York he has made it onto the big stage – from Broadway to Hollywood. As Michael Corleone in "The Godfather" he celebrated his big breakthrough at the beginning of the 70s – against much resistance, because apart from director Francis Coppola himself nobody wants him for the role. His realistic acting became the measure of all things overnight.', 'Al Pacino is a mystery. He is fire and ice at the same time. His attraction is animalistic, his looks frightening. From the ghetto of the Bronx in New York he has made it onto the big stage – from Broadway to Hollywood. As Michael Corleone in "The Godfather" he celebrated his big breakthrough at the beginning of the 70s – against much resistance, because apart from director Francis Coppola himself nobody wants him for the role. His realistic acting became the measure of all things overnight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tCNhqUIut31Alet6Bz7gIg8EGv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:697050'),
  ('445657390125103024', 'Al Pereira vs. the Alligator Ladies', 2013, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Jesús Franco, Antonio Mayans, Fernando Barranquero', 'Antonio Mayans, Jesús Franco', 'Antonio Mayans, Carmen Montes, Paula Davis, Irene Verdú, Luisje Moyano, Naxo Fiol, Mariví Carrillo, Jesús Franco', null, 'Al Pereira, the one and only original private-private detective, is fighting against all the shameless women on earth - especially the Alligator Ladies.', 'Al Pereira, the one and only original private-private detective, is fighting against all the shameless women on earth - especially the Alligator Ladies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxO4LqYcr7R0QiHN983ZLvuhfzU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137854'),
