  ('842665396442132523', 'Alejandro Sanz: What I Was Is What I Am', 2018, 'Documentary, Music', 'Gervasio Iglesias, Alexis Morante, Óscar García Blesa', null, 'Alejandro Sanz', null, 'This documentary follows the life and career of the Spanish singer Alejandro Sanz, from his beginnings and his rise to fame until June 24, 2017 day of his legendary concert "+ es +" in Madrid', 'This documentary follows the life and career of the Spanish singer Alejandro Sanz, from his beginnings and his rise to fame until June 24, 2017 day of his legendary concert "+ es +" in Madrid', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8D33I0mGprRL01fcthHSDmDGG0w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517827'),
  ('224703754692553148', 'Alelí', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lucio Bonelli, Leticia Jorge', 'Ana Guevara, Leticia Jorge', 'Néstor Guzzini, Mirella Pascual, Cristina Morán, Romina Peluffo, Laila Reyes Silberberg, Pablo Tate, Gerónimo Pizzanelli, Georgina Yankelevich', null, 'The death of patriarch Alfredo sends his heirs into a downward spiral. With the pending sale of their beach house, a repository of childhood memories, three siblings’ long-simmering resentments are brought to a full boil.', 'The death of patriarch Alfredo sends his heirs into a downward spiral. With the pending sale of their beach house, a repository of childhood memories, three siblings’ long-simmering resentments are brought to a full boil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gtcPLk0qEGghqIW1g7DJ4Jydf3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:632318'),
  ('298115215228282726', 'Alemania', 2024, 'Drama', 'María Zanetti, Emilio Guazzaroni, Pablo López Puebla', 'María Zanetti', 'Maite Aguilar, Miranda de la Serna, María Ucedo, Walter Jakob, Oliverio Beccaria, Vicky Peña, Gala Gutman, Andy Pruss', null, 'Sixteen-year-old Lola is studying for her resits when the possibility of a semester in Germany comes up. Lola wants to go, but her family, bogged down by her elder sister''s psychiatric problems, don''t want her to make the trip. The lack of stability and exhaustion in the ties with her family prompt Lola to go ahead with her idea and set out to find new experiences that make her see both herself and the circumstances that surround her with different eyes.', 'Sixteen-year-old Lola is studying for her resits when the possibility of a semester in Germany comes up. Lola wants to go, but her family, bogged down by her elder sister''s psychiatric problems, don''t want her to make the trip. The lack of stability and exhaustion in the ties with her family prompt Lola to go ahead with her idea and set out to find new experiences that make her see both herself and the circumstances that surround her with different eyes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQruQTUjyBtqkWuOwSu4G5rx3j5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:862754'),
  ('342451198369254400', 'Alemão', 2014, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'José Eduardo Belmonte, Alexandre Ramos, Chaiana Furtado', 'Gabriel Martins, Leonardo Levis', 'Caio Blat, Gabriel Braga Nunes, Marcelo Mello Jr., Milhem Cortaz, Otávio Müller, Mariana Nunes, Jefferson Brasil, Antônio Fagundes', null, 'Five undercover cops at Complexo do Alemão, one of Rio de Janeiro''s most dangerous areas, have their covers blown by drug dealers. Arrested, they wait execution or to be rescued by police forces that would risk expose a larger operation.', 'Five undercover cops at Complexo do Alemão, one of Rio de Janeiro''s most dangerous areas, have their covers blown by drug dealers. Arrested, they wait execution or to be rescued by police forces that would risk expose a larger operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h21n3HgNnqtRyujwiFcdDnJUDP8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227933'),
  ('901215010267510651', 'Alemão 2', 2022, 'Action, Crime', 'José Eduardo Belmonte, Fabricio Tadeu', 'Marton Olympio, Thiago Brito', 'Vladimir Brichta, Leandra Leal, Aline Borges, Gabriel Leone, Mariana Nunes, Dan Ferreira, Digão Ribeiro, Démick Lopes', null, 'The Alemão community in Rio de Janeiro is known for its high crime rate. Once again, a team faces drug trafficking to try to carry out the proposals inside the complex.', 'The Alemão community in Rio de Janeiro is known for its high crime rate. Once again, a team faces drug trafficking to try to carry out the proposals inside the complex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esrDBZxTE8OxJA8AMx0LIBLmFDV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:714694'),
  ('108134579485699035', 'Alena', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Daniel di Grado, Simon Olsson', 'Kerstin Gezelius, Alexander Onofri, Daniel di Grado', 'Amalia Holm Bjelke, Rebecka Nyman, Molly Nutley, Felice Jankell, Fanny Klefelt, Marie Senghore, Helena af Sandeberg, Johan Ehn', null, 'When Alena arrives at her new elite boarding school, Filippa and the other girls start to harass her. But Alena’s best friend Josefin won’t let her take anymore beating. If she won’t strike back, Josefin will do it for her. Hard.', 'When Alena arrives at her new elite boarding school, Filippa and the other girls start to harass her. But Alena’s best friend Josefin won’t let her take anymore beating. If she won’t strike back, Josefin will do it for her. Hard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eg1nyqLDkXjmFHrbx2g8sd7o0E1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347344'),
  ('880233375690048895', 'Alerta, alta tension', 1969, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Fernando Durán Rojas, Alfonso Corona Blake', 'Rafael García Travesí, José María Fernández Unsáin', 'Jorge Rivero, Alma Delia Fuentes, Claudia Islas, Lilia Castillo, Carlos Ancira, Antonio Raxel, Federico Falcón', null, 'After a criminal gang kidnaps a scientist with valuable information about nuclear weapons, an undercover agent named Jorge Rubio tries to infiltrate this gang in order to deal with the situation. The gang, however, quickly unmasks Rubio and uses both brainwashing and torture techniques on him. They also create a clone of Rubio, thus setting up a show-down battle between the two look-alikes.', 'After a criminal gang kidnaps a scientist with valuable information about nuclear weapons, an undercover agent named Jorge Rubio tries to infiltrate this gang in order to deal with the situation. The gang, however, quickly unmasks Rubio and uses both brainwashing and torture techniques on him. They also create a clone of Rubio, thus setting up a show-down battle between the two look-alikes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htRhHo7IorZf1Hi4hpqFYAK8gdt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385240'),
  ('267344974552628841', 'Alesha Popovich and Tugarin the Dragon', 2004, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Konstantin Bronzit, Vladimir Golounin', 'Aleksandr Boyarsky, Ilya Maksimov, Konstantin Bronzit', 'Oleg Kulikovich, Liya Medvedeva, Anatoli Petrov, Dmitry Vysotsky, Ivan Krasko, Tatyana Ivanova, Mikhail Chernyak, Konstantin Bronzit', null, 'Alesha Popovich has to catch Tugarin Zmey and bring back the stolen money with the help of a talking Horse (which talks all the time and has an opinion on everything), a wise granny, a donkey and a beauty Lyubava.', 'Alesha Popovich has to catch Tugarin Zmey and bring back the stolen money with the help of a talking Horse (which talks all the time and has an opinion on everything), a wise granny, a donkey and a beauty Lyubava.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/noAS8EazXkexdOY9v6c709hKeYZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33065'),
