  ('393110210343494526', 'Alexander', 2004, 'War, History, Action, Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Rodrigo Prieto, Oliver Stone, Aziz Hamichi', 'Laeta Kalogridis, Oliver Stone, Christopher Kyle', 'Colin Farrell, Angelina Jolie, Val Kilmer, Jared Leto, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Anthony Hopkins, Jessie Kamm, Christopher Plummer', 'R', 'Alexander, the King of Macedonia, leads his legions against the giant Persian Empire. After defeating the Persians, he leads his army across the then known world, venturing farther than any westerner had ever gone, all the way to India.', 'Alexander, the King of Macedonia, leads his legions against the giant Persian Empire. After defeating the Persians, he leads his army across the then known world, venturing farther than any westerner had ever gone, all the way to India.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrwQu72sGwGqwE8Ijne89PSIvhp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1966'),
  ('28962232005090147', 'Alexander and the Terrible, Horrible, No Good, Very Bad Day', 2014, 'Family, Comedy', 'Miguel Arteta, Terry Stacey, Sunday Stevens', 'Rob Lieber', 'Steve Carell, Jennifer Garner, Ed Oxenbould, Dylan Minnette, Kerris Dorsey, Elise Vargas, Zoey Vargas, Sidney Fullmer', 'PG', 'Alexander''s day begins with gum stuck in his hair, followed by more calamities. Though he finds little sympathy from his family and begins to wonder if bad things only happen to him, his mom, dad, brother, and sister all find themselves living through their own terrible, horrible, no good, very bad day.', 'Alexander''s day begins with gum stuck in his hair, followed by more calamities. Though he finds little sympathy from his family and begins to wonder if bad things only happen to him, his mom, dad, brother, and sister all find themselves living through their own terrible, horrible, no good, very bad day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pxbAepXQjsGFDHaR3dPndFSxDU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218778'),
  ('960060846133936212', 'Alexander and the Terrible, Horrible, No Good, Very Bad Road Trip', 2025, 'Family, Comedy', 'Al Goto, Marvin Lemus, Jas Shelton', 'Matt Lopez', 'Thom Nemer, Eva Longoria, Cheech Marin, Jesse García, Paulina Chávez, Rose Portillo, Alexander Alayon Jr., Michelle Buteau', 'PG', 'Eleven-year-old Alexander and his family embark on a dream Spring Break vacation to Mexico City only to have all their plans go terribly wrong when they discover a cursed idol.', 'Eleven-year-old Alexander and his family embark on a dream Spring Break vacation to Mexico City only to have all their plans go terribly wrong when they discover a cursed idol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AhyvU3nIZ6uzop8lMgRB5N3AY9l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:774100'),
  ('890649746621888700', 'Alexander Nevsky', 1938, 'Drama, History, War', 'Sergei Eisenstein, Eduard Tisse, Dmitriy Vasilev', 'Pyotr Pavlenko, Sergei Eisenstein', 'Nikolai Cherkasov, Nikolai Okhlopkov, Andrei Abrikosov, Valentyna Ivashova, Lev Fenin, Sergei Blinnikov, Nikolai Arsky, Varvara Massalitinova', null, 'When German knights invade Russia, Prince Alexander Nevsky must rally his people to resist the formidable force. After the Teutonic soldiers take over an eastern Russian city, Alexander stages his stand at Novgorod, where a major battle is fought on the ice of frozen Lake Chudskoe. While Alexander leads his outnumbered troops, two of their number, Vasili and Gavrilo, begin a contest of bravery to win the hand of a local maiden.', 'When German knights invade Russia, Prince Alexander Nevsky must rally his people to resist the formidable force. After the Teutonic soldiers take over an eastern Russian city, Alexander stages his stand at Novgorod, where a major battle is fought on the ice of frozen Lake Chudskoe. While Alexander leads his outnumbered troops, two of their number, Vasili and Gavrilo, begin a contest of bravery to win the hand of a local maiden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lsTJYStIsnddwioD1L4FEmwj4Cx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10235'),
  ('577805767076145146', 'Alexander the Great', 1956, 'Adventure, History, Drama, War', 'Robert Rossen, Robert Krasker', 'Robert Rossen', 'Richard Burton, Fredric March, Claire Bloom, Danielle Darrieux, Barry Jones, Harry Andrews, Stanley Baker, Niall MacGinnis', 'PG', 'An engrossing spectacle set in the 4th-century BC, in which Alexander of Greece leads his troops forth, conquering all of the known world, in the belief that the Greek way of thinking will bring enlightenment to people. The son of the barbaric and ruthless King Philip of Macedonia, Alexander achieved glory in his short but remarkable life.', 'An engrossing spectacle set in the 4th-century BC, in which Alexander of Greece leads his troops forth, conquering all of the known world, in the belief that the Greek way of thinking will bring enlightenment to people. The son of the barbaric and ruthless King Philip of Macedonia, Alexander achieved glory in his short but remarkable life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3P3GiCKaEmLxzibDMzALmPbEHL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42668'),
  ('680719448939505663', 'Alexander the Great', 1980, 'Drama, History', 'Theo Angelopoulos, Giorgos Arvanitis', 'Theo Angelopoulos, Petros Markaris', 'Omero Antonutti, Eva Kotamanidou, Mihalis Giannatos, Grigoris Evangelatos, Miranda Kounelaki, Laura De Marchi, Toula Stathopoulou, Thanos Grammenos', null, 'Alexander, a tribal warlord and former political prisoner, kidnaps British tourists, holding them for ransom until Britain and the Greek puppet government in Athens meet his demand for amnesty for his band of freedom fighters.', 'Alexander, a tribal warlord and former political prisoner, kidnaps British tourists, holding them for ransom until Britain and the Greek puppet government in Athens meet his demand for amnesty for his band of freedom fighters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cX8GPfrHhUrwA7DLVqtF4bpiufY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111988'),
  ('665244676979948974', 'Alexander the Last', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Joe Swanberg, Joe Swanberg', 'Joe Swanberg', 'Jess Weixler, Justin Rice, Barlow Jacobs, Amy Seimetz, Jane Adams, Josh Hamilton, Jo Schornikow, Sean Price Williams', null, 'An ensemble drama about a married actress, her sister and their myriad sexual and creative temptations.', 'An ensemble drama about a married actress, her sister and their myriad sexual and creative temptations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQgwIrqkD73ReRuQVQNDDvpBH99.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33833'),
  ('1090610225613872245', 'Alexander: The Other Side of Dawn', 1977, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'John Erman, Gayne Rescher', 'Walter Dallenbach', 'Leigh McCloskey, Eve Plumb, Juliet Mills, Jean Hagen, Lonny Chapman, Asher Brauner, Diana Douglas, Fred Sadoff', 'NR', 'In this sequel to Dawn: Portrait of a Teenage Runaway, Alexander''s story is told in both the past and the present. Alexander''s parents send him away from home for being too sensitive and not helping enough on their farm. He goes to Los Angeles in hopes of going to art school, but when he can''t find a job as a minor, he turns to prostitution. After being arrested, he wants to head to Arizona to marry Dawn, but he falls into a lucrative job/relationship with a gay football star.', 'In this sequel to Dawn: Portrait of a Teenage Runaway, Alexander''s story is told in both the past and the present. Alexander''s parents send him away from home for being too sensitive and not helping enough on their farm. He goes to Los Angeles in hopes of going to art school, but when he can''t find a job as a minor, he turns to prostitution. After being arrested, he wants to head to Arizona to marry Dawn, but he falls into a lucrative job/relationship with a gay football star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UloLn5jgcYDe3ODwFWPJjCpzq8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258599'),
  ('311344094714565237', 'Alexander''s Ragtime Band', 1938, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Henry King, Alfred Newman, J. Peverell Marley', 'Lamar Trotti, Kathryn Scola', 'Tyrone Power, Alice Faye, Don Ameche, Ethel Merman, Jack Haley, Jean Hersholt, Helen Westley, John Carradine', 'NR', 'Classical violinist Roger Grant disappoints his family and teacher when he organizes a jazz band, but he and the band become successful. Roger falls in love with the band''s singer, Stella, but his reluctance to lose her leads him to thwart her efforts to become a solo star. When the World War separates them in 1917, Stella marries Roger''s best friend and, when Roger returns home after the war, an important concert at Carnegie Hall brings the corners of the romantic triangle together.', 'Classical violinist Roger Grant disappoints his family and teacher when he organizes a jazz band, but he and the band become successful. Roger falls in love with the band''s singer, Stella, but his reluctance to lose her leads him to thwart her efforts to become a solo star. When the World War separates them in 1917, Stella marries Roger''s best friend and, when Roger returns home after the war, an important concert at Carnegie Hall brings the corners of the romantic triangle together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbmvwfs9C1eTIyCcuhdbnFeuQSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43839'),
  ('157557582378057076', 'Alexandra', 2007, 'War, Drama', 'Aleksandr Sokurov, Aleksandr Burov, Vladimir Studennikov', 'Aleksandr Sokurov', 'Galina Vishnevskaya, Vasily Shevtsov, Raisa Gichaeva, Evgeniy Tkachuk, Andrei Bogdanov, Rustam Shakhgireyev, Aleksandr Alyoshkin, Aleksandr Kladko', null, 'Elderly Aleksandra visits her Russian soldier grandson, Denis, at the Chechen war front, providing comfort as she tours his army. All the while, Denis ponders the reason for her unexpected appearance.', 'Elderly Aleksandra visits her Russian soldier grandson, Denis, at the Chechen war front, providing comfort as she tours his army. All the while, Denis ponders the reason for her unexpected appearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6U6akMnCZyss1EVOR5P2SPHnDRz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17479'),
  ('386450187186054047', 'Alexandra''s Project', 2003, 'Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 'Rolf de Heer, Ian Jones', 'Rolf de Heer', 'Gary Sweet, Helen Buday, Bogdan Koca, Samantha Knigge, Eileen Darley, Jack Christie, Geoff Revell, Philip Spruce', 'NR', 'Steve is a man who has it all, a successful career, wonderful children, beautiful home and a loving wife. However, returning to his home after work on his birthday, he finds his house deserted and darkened with almost all the lightbulbs missing, all easy access outside cut off and a videotape waiting for him. Playing that tape, he watches a bizarre and grueling recording in which his wife explains her grievance with him, her reasons for disappearing with the children and her revenge for how he treated her in a way he would never forget.', 'Steve is a man who has it all, a successful career, wonderful children, beautiful home and a loving wife. However, returning to his home after work on his birthday, he finds his house deserted and darkened with almost all the lightbulbs missing, all easy access outside cut off and a videotape waiting for him. Playing that tape, he watches a bizarre and grueling recording in which his wife explains her grievance with him, her reasons for disappearing with the children and her revenge for how he treated her in a way he would never forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sao0EIQ94kcSjMABVvAZJDmaAIU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34595'),
  ('763468606500169533', 'Alexandria Again and Forever', 1989, 'Drama', 'Youssef Chahine, Khairiya A-Mansour, Yousry Nasrallah', 'Youssef Chahine, Yousry Nasrallah', 'Youssef Chahine, Yousra, Hussein Fahmy, Amr Abdel Gelil, Hesham Selim, Tahiya Cariocca, Huda Sultan, Seif Abdelrahman', null, 'Set in 1987 against the backdrop of a hunger strike by the Egyptian film industry, Chahine himself steps in to play Yehia, the famed Egyptian director whose life is chronicled in "Alexandria, Why?" and "An Egyptian Story". Obsessed with Amr, the handsome actor he discovered and cast as his alter-ego in parts one and two of The Alexandria Trilogy, Yehia pressures Amr to star in various film projects that change even as Yehia''s perception of the young actor begins to change. He first casts Amr as Hamlet, which the actor deems too demanding for his talents, then as the lead in a musical biopic of demigod Alexander the Great, who founded the city of Alexandria in 332 B.C.', 'Set in 1987 against the backdrop of a hunger strike by the Egyptian film industry, Chahine himself steps in to play Yehia, the famed Egyptian director whose life is chronicled in "Alexandria, Why?" and "An Egyptian Story". Obsessed with Amr, the handsome actor he discovered and cast as his alter-ego in parts one and two of The Alexandria Trilogy, Yehia pressures Amr to star in various film projects that change even as Yehia''s perception of the young actor begins to change. He first casts Amr as Hamlet, which the actor deems too demanding for his talents, then as the lead in a musical biopic of demigod Alexander the Great, who founded the city of Alexandria in 332 B.C.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p55iCAyRWFlzbb8m13g18VX17Cg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123652'),
  ('849272083281852267', 'Alexandria, Private', 2005, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Sandra Nashaat, Nezar Shaker', 'Wael Abdullah, Mohamed Hefzy', 'Ahmed Ezz, Ghada Adel, Khaled Saleh, Mahmoud Abdel Moghny, Nour, Mohamed Ragab, Reham Abdelghafour, Khaled Zaki', null, 'When a woman is accused of a high-profile murder, a young lawyer takes on her defense, only to uncover a web of secrets, deceit, and hidden motives. As he digs deeper, the case becomes more personal—and far more dangerous than he ever expected.', 'When a woman is accused of a high-profile murder, a young lawyer takes on her defense, only to uncover a web of secrets, deceit, and hidden motives. As he digs deeper, the case becomes more personal—and far more dangerous than he ever expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wK4022PbFe31NqSOe6uwCDDKvXd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300420'),
  ('944729980347522571', 'Alexandria… Why?', 1979, 'Drama, War', 'Youssef Chahine, Mohsen Nasr', 'Youssef Chahine, Mohsen Zayed', 'Mohsen Mohey ElDein, Mahmoud El Meligy, Mohsena Tawfiq, Abdullah Mahmoud, Ahmed Zaki, Naglaa Fathy, Ahmed Mehrez, Gerry Sundquist', 'NR', 'Amid the poverty, death, and suffering caused by World War II, 18-year-old Yehia retreats into a private world of fantasy and longing. Obsessed with Hollywood, he dreams of studying filmmaking in America but struggles to pursue his dream, given the constraints of his life in the middle class and the horrors of war.', 'Amid the poverty, death, and suffering caused by World War II, 18-year-old Yehia retreats into a private world of fantasy and longing. Obsessed with Hollywood, he dreams of studying filmmaking in America but struggles to pursue his dream, given the constraints of his life in the middle class and the horrors of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k68nAl2BJpX9405UCqs4Xhw2S7n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40939'),
  ('37138652835139647', 'Alexia', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Andrés Borghi, María Valiente, Melina Blumen', 'Andrés Borghi', 'Sergio Berón, Paula Carruega, Pilar Boyle', null, 'Although Alexia, Franco''s ex-girlfriend, has been deceased for some time, Franco still has her as a contact on his social network. When he decides to delete her and move on, something strange starts to manifest through his computer.', 'Although Alexia, Franco''s ex-girlfriend, has been deceased for some time, Franco still has her as a contact on his social network. When he decides to delete her and move on, something strange starts to manifest through his computer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJBIFfy4ej4R2ed3OfvGllkg5zw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323214'),
  ('10963907168111148', 'Alfie', 1966, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Lewis Gilbert, Otto Heller, William P. Cartlidge', 'Bill Naughton', 'Michael Caine, Shelley Winters, Millicent Martin, Julia Foster, Jane Asher, Shirley Anne Field, Vivien Merchant, Eleanor Bron', 'PG', 'A young man leads a promiscuous lifestyle until several life reversals make him rethink his purposes and goals in life.', 'A young man leads a promiscuous lifestyle until several life reversals make him rethink his purposes and goals in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPUqgfGMkZazRZ1UO41j2Fiib5C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15598'),
  ('652139031838430255', 'Alfie', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Charles Shyer, Ashley Rowe, Cliff Lanning', 'Elaine Pope, Charles Shyer', 'Jude Law, Marisa Tomei, Omar Epps, Jane Krakowski, Renée Taylor, Jeff Harding, Sienna Miller, Nia Long', 'R', 'A tale of a philosophical womanizer who is forced to question his seemingly carefree existence.', 'A tale of a philosophical womanizer who is forced to question his seemingly carefree existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jXJdaGy07JqYFHGsG2GKZBjTa2k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8849'),
  ('432949957564132202', 'Alfie Darling', 1975, 'Drama', 'Ken Hughes, Ousama Rawi, Peter Cotton', 'Bill Naughton', 'Alan Price, Joan Collins, Jill Townsend, Paul Copley, Hannah Gordon, Rula Lenska, Vicki Michelle, Minah Bird', null, 'Alfie meets his romantic match when the modern-day Casanova falls in love with a career woman. Alfie soon realises that Abby, a magazine editor, is just as romantically ruthless as he is.', 'Alfie meets his romantic match when the modern-day Casanova falls in love with a career woman. Alfie soon realises that Abby, a magazine editor, is just as romantically ruthless as he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agOuy4xqOaD7HGqmMVrwI88iFqe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155324'),
  ('335553130340548734', 'Alfons Jitterbit – Class Trip Chaos!', 2022, 'Family, Comedy', 'Mark Schlichter', 'Mark Schlichter', 'Luis Vorbach, Leopold Ferdinand Schill, Leni Deschner, Lisa Moell, Ron Antony Renzenbrink, Alexandra Maria Lara, Sam Riley, Thorsten Merten', null, 'After oversleeping yet again, Alfons manages to catch the bus to his class trip to the Baltic Sea at the last minute. In his luggage: lots of adventure, funny pranks and - wait a minute - his mother''s clothes?', 'After oversleeping yet again, Alfons manages to catch the bus to his class trip to the Baltic Sea at the last minute. In his luggage: lots of adventure, funny pranks and - wait a minute - his mother''s clothes?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRLXGEe85QaogIvEVux7aZIHGhc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:957815'),
  ('996658147895230473', 'Alfons Zitterbacke', 2019, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Mark Schlichter, Christof Wahl', 'Anja Flade, John Chambers, Mark Schlichter', 'Alexandra Maria Lara, Devid Striesow, Tilman Döbler, Leopold Ferdinand Schill, Lisa Moell, Ron Antony Renzenbrink, Katharina Thalbach, Wolfgang Stumph', null, 'Clumsy peculiar pupil Alfons Zitterbacke dreams of being an astronaut and wreaks havoc anywhere he goes but against all odds wants to proof everyone who is teasing him wrong especially his father who wants him to be more of a ''normal'' kid.', 'Clumsy peculiar pupil Alfons Zitterbacke dreams of being an astronaut and wreaks havoc anywhere he goes but against all odds wants to proof everyone who is teasing him wrong especially his father who wants him to be more of a ''normal'' kid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9NQWau4yXKCalGSRVMFnhuMP61.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568972'),
  ('808959654288589024', 'Alfred the Great', 1969, 'History', 'Clive Donner, Michael Stevenson, Mike Fox', null, 'David Hemmings, Michael York, Prunella Ransome, Colin Blakely, Ian McKellen, Peter Vaughan, Alan Dobie, Julian Glover', null, 'While Old England is being ransacked by roving Danes in the 9th century, Alfred is planning to join the priesthood. But observing the rape of his land, he puts away his religious vows to take up arms against the invaders, leading the English Christians to fight for their country. Alfred soundly defeats the Danes and becomes a hero. But now, although Alfred still longs for the priesthood, he is torn between his passion for God and his lust for blood.', 'While Old England is being ransacked by roving Danes in the 9th century, Alfred is planning to join the priesthood. But observing the rape of his land, he puts away his religious vows to take up arms against the invaders, leading the English Christians to fight for their country. Alfred soundly defeats the Danes and becomes a hero. But now, although Alfred still longs for the priesthood, he is torn between his passion for God and his lust for blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYQBfJ0igsaecCRjnxp8BYjuyIK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73672'),
  ('405200345527334564', 'Alfredo, Alfredo', 1972, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Pietro Germi, Jean Blondel, Francesco Fantacci', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Pietro Germi, Tullio Pinelli', 'Dustin Hoffman, Stefania Sandrelli, Carla Gravina, Saro Urzì, Duilio Del Prete, Luigi Baghetti, Renzo Marignano, Danika La Loggia', 'R', 'Alfredo, a timid young Italian, lusts after and woos the beautiful Maria Rosa. But when he manages to marry her, he discovers life is not nearly so blissful as he expected.', 'Alfredo, a timid young Italian, lusts after and woos the beautiful Maria Rosa. But when he manages to marry her, he discovers life is not nearly so blissful as he expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfIKrvKxswDpfpLlJZ6D5Q7Ymbg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59855'),
  ('1006379704681823221', 'Algea: God of Pain', 2024, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'JD Allen, Musa Aden, Damarr Jones', 'JD Allen, Shyina Crayton', 'Jason K. Wixom, Sonny Grimsley, Duane Finley, Yolanda Stange, Kenna Denali, Savannah Meyer, Jenessa Sheffield, Brittney Souther', null, 'A man wakes up in the middle of the street with no idea where he is or how he ended up there. Soon he is forced to confront the demons he is battling within before a gateway to the underworld unlocks the secret of Algea the God of Pain.', 'A man wakes up in the middle of the street with no idea where he is or how he ended up there. Soon he is forced to confront the demons he is battling within before a gateway to the underworld unlocks the secret of Algea the God of Pain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nil688jt57wIE1baE9aMCkK8PGZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1201734'),
  ('309032882527717878', 'Alger la blanche', 1986, 'Drama', 'Daniel Barrau, Cyril Collard', 'Cyril Collard, Jean-Marie Guillaume', 'Frédéric Deban, Ali Baouche, Farida Chrouki, Aïssa Djabri, Mohamed Zran, Sahalia Baouche, Tawfik El Sherbini, Larbi Bekka', null, 'Farid, a teenager of Algerian descent, spends his free time hanging out with the wrong crowds in the suburbs south of Paris while maintaining a secret relationship with illustrator Jean. Both Jean and Farid are unsure about the future of their relationship - Farid wants Jean to move to Algiers with him, but Jean doesn''t want to continue being Farid''s secret. But when Farid becomes embroiled in a police matter, both his passionate private life and conservative family life hurtle towards one another, with explosive results.', 'Farid, a teenager of Algerian descent, spends his free time hanging out with the wrong crowds in the suburbs south of Paris while maintaining a secret relationship with illustrator Jean. Both Jean and Farid are unsure about the future of their relationship - Farid wants Jean to move to Algiers with him, but Jean doesn''t want to continue being Farid''s secret. But when Farid becomes embroiled in a police matter, both his passionate private life and conservative family life hurtle towards one another, with explosive results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQ1QnIIH1SCTGnib0iGvfxcQAOk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363815'),
  ('438347155085968079', 'Alger: Rue Bab-Azoun', 1896, 'Documentary', 'Alexandre Promio', null, null, null, 'Another street scene from the Lumiere company', 'Another street scene from the Lumiere company', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9Pfsx0jdKHESUKZd50PrXe6OpO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194583'),
  ('45437361810531493', 'Algiers', 1938, 'Drama, Mystery, Romance, Crime', 'John Cromwell, James Wong Howe, Horace Hough', 'John Howard Lawson', 'Charles Boyer, Hedy Lamarr, Sigrid Gurie, Joseph Calleia, Alan Hale, Gene Lockhart, Walter Kingsford, Paul Harvey', null, 'Pepe Le Moko is a notorious thief, who escaped from France. Since his escape, Moko has become a resident and leader of the immense Casbah of Algiers. French officials arrive insisting on Pepe''s capture are met with unfazed local detectives, led by Inspector Slimane, who are biding their time. Meanwhile, Pepe meets the beautiful Gaby, which arouses the jealousy of Ines.', 'Pepe Le Moko is a notorious thief, who escaped from France. Since his escape, Moko has become a resident and leader of the immense Casbah of Algiers. French officials arrive insisting on Pepe''s capture are met with unfazed local detectives, led by Inspector Slimane, who are biding their time. Meanwhile, Pepe meets the beautiful Gaby, which arouses the jealousy of Ines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvNQjlXJxRQrmB5VCcyssjKIwW8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22657'),
  ('479307463646237962', 'Alguém Como Eu', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Leonel Vieira, Luís Branquinho', 'Pedro Varela, Tatiana Maciel', 'Paolla Oliveira, Ricardo Pereira, Irene Ravache, Júlia Rabello, Dânia Neto, Paulo Pires, Sara Prata, Matilde Breyner', null, 'Helen, 30 years-old, decides she is going to change the rest of her life. Her biggest mistake, she asks God for some precious help.', 'Helen, 30 years-old, decides she is going to change the rest of her life. Her biggest mistake, she asks God for some precious help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfSjQvdAZxKCSq7t2rzAGxYoPCb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418963'),
  ('522503035644635645', 'Ali', 2001, 'Drama', 'Michael Mann, Emmanuel Lubezki, Richard Fojo', 'Christopher Wilkinson, Eric Roth, Michael Mann', 'Will Smith, Jamie Foxx, Jon Voight, Mario Van Peebles, Ron Silver, Jeffrey Wright, Mykelti Williamson, Jada Pinkett Smith', 'R', 'In 1964, a brash, new pro boxer, fresh from his Olympic gold medal victory, explodes onto the scene: Cassius Clay. Bold and outspoken, he cuts an entirely new image for African Americans in sport with his proud public self-confidence and his unapologetic belief that he is the greatest boxer of all time. Yet at the top of his game, both Ali''s personal and professional lives face the ultimate test.', 'In 1964, a brash, new pro boxer, fresh from his Olympic gold medal victory, explodes onto the scene: Cassius Clay. Bold and outspoken, he cuts an entirely new image for African Americans in sport with his proud public self-confidence and his unapologetic belief that he is the greatest boxer of all time. Yet at the top of his game, both Ali''s personal and professional lives face the ultimate test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32l3FaCzs8cXWps6hkgNJAcOsP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8489'),
  ('1101038813150264859', 'Ali & Ava', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ole Bratt Birkeland, Malinda Kaua, Tony Aherne', 'Clio Barnard', 'Adeel Akhtar, Claire Rushbrook, Natalie Gavin, Macy Shackleton, Ellora Torchia, Shaun Thomas, Mona Goodwin, Krupa Pattani', null, 'Sparks fly after Ali and Ava meet through their shared affection for Sofia, the child of Ali’s tenants whom Ava teaches. Ali finds comfort in Ava’s warmth and kindness while Ava finds Ali’s complexity and humour irresistible. As the pair begin to form a deep connection they have to find a way to keep their newfound passion from being overshadowed by the stresses and struggles of their separate lives and histories.​', 'Sparks fly after Ali and Ava meet through their shared affection for Sofia, the child of Ali’s tenants whom Ava teaches. Ali finds comfort in Ava’s warmth and kindness while Ava finds Ali’s complexity and humour irresistible. As the pair begin to form a deep connection they have to find a way to keep their newfound passion from being overshadowed by the stresses and struggles of their separate lives and histories.​', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phBaAgc4EGxs0ScOb16ZfOShyfQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661365'),
  ('679022785084441059', 'Ali and Nino', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Asif Kapadia, Gökhan Tiryaki', 'Christopher Hampton', 'Adam Bakri, María Valverde, Connie Nielsen, Mandy Patinkin, Numan Acar, Riccardo Scamarcio, Homayoun Ershadi, Halit Ergenç', 'PG-13', 'Muslim prince Ali and Georgian aristocrat Nino have grown up in the Russian province of Azerbaijan. Their tragic love story sees the outbreak of the First World War and the world’s struggle for Baku’s oil. Ultimately they must choose to fight for their country’s independence or for each other.', 'Muslim prince Ali and Georgian aristocrat Nino have grown up in the Russian province of Azerbaijan. Their tragic love story sees the outbreak of the First World War and the world’s struggle for Baku’s oil. Ultimately they must choose to fight for their country’s independence or for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k678ohrP2DcfgElWZl2mxdO3vEd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:371741'),
  ('848502850453534584', 'Ali Baba and the 40 thieves', 2007, 'Adventure, Action, Drama, TV Movie', 'Pierre Aknine, Allen Smith', 'Michel Delgado, Claude-Michel Rome', 'Gérard Jugnot, Leïla Bekhti, Saïda Jawad, Michèle Bernier, Marc Ruchmann, Ken Duken, Thomas Trabacchi, Farida Rahouadj', null, 'The story of Ali Baba, who takes on forty thieves to save the Caliph of Baghdad and prevent a war between the Orient and the Occident.', 'The story of Ali Baba, who takes on forty thieves to save the Caliph of Baghdad and prevent a war between the Orient and the Occident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGGq0FiZW6XI7HMM1y36Nyz4fNf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193261'),
  ('342817874862943373', 'Ali Baba and the 7 Dwarfs', 2015, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Gökhan Atılmış, Cem Yılmaz', 'Cem Yılmaz', 'Cem Yılmaz, Çetin Altay, Irina Ivkina, Zafer Algöz, Can Yılmaz, Yosi Mizrahi, Bahtiyar Engin, Yavor Baharov', null, 'Ali Senay and Ilber, the two partners of Senay Cüccaciye, sell garden dwarfs. When their company starts to dwindle, they decide to participate in a gardening fair in Sofia with the plan to meet new people from the sector in an attempt to drum up new business. Things don''t go as planned as they find themselves crossing paths with the wrong people hell bent on causing world chaos.', 'Ali Senay and Ilber, the two partners of Senay Cüccaciye, sell garden dwarfs. When their company starts to dwindle, they decide to participate in a gardening fair in Sofia with the plan to meet new people from the sector in an attempt to drum up new business. Things don''t go as planned as they find themselves crossing paths with the wrong people hell bent on causing world chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x5o8vK2BJlXU8qtgNoNNIObJ1rw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366759'),
  ('1142773814593558886', 'Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves', 1902, 'Adventure', 'Ferdinand Zecca', null, null, 'G', 'An early hand-tinted adaptation of Ali Baba.', 'An early hand-tinted adaptation of Ali Baba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVskggcZ1ghEYXm3B5qklTE91Yu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190648'),
  ('357304587422745809', 'Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves', 1907, 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Segundo de Chomón', null, null, null, 'The legend of Ali Baba and the forty thieves: Ali Baba discovers a hidden cave where a band of thieves have stored their enormous treasure. Cassim also learns about the cave, but he is caught by the thieves and put to death. Knowing that their secret has been found out, the thieves devise a trick in an attempt to kill Ali Baba and anyone else who might know about their hiding place.', 'The legend of Ali Baba and the forty thieves: Ali Baba discovers a hidden cave where a band of thieves have stored their enormous treasure. Cassim also learns about the cave, but he is caught by the thieves and put to death. Knowing that their secret has been found out, the thieves devise a trick in an attempt to kill Ali Baba and anyone else who might know about their hiding place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ec9PNBCQaezyOoSBDYES3v4ObpY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48600'),
  ('186536539567946572', 'Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves', 1944, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Romance', 'Arthur Lubin, W. Howard Greene, George Robinson', 'Edmund L. Hartmann', 'Maria Montez, Jon Hall, Turhan Bey, Andy Devine, Kurt Katch, Frank Puglia, Fortunio Bonanova, Moroni Olsen', 'NR', 'Orphaned as a young child and adopted by a band of notorious thieves, now-grown Ali Baba sets out to avenge his father’s murder, reclaim the royal throne, and rescue his beloved Amara from the iron fist of his treacherous enemy.', 'Orphaned as a young child and adopted by a band of notorious thieves, now-grown Ali Baba sets out to avenge his father’s murder, reclaim the royal throne, and rescue his beloved Amara from the iron fist of his treacherous enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3bXF6WDy5YiD0TsdzncL2aU293.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44475'),
  ('416502593062844577', 'Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves', 1954, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Jacques Becker, Marc Maurette, Marc Lanjean', 'Maurice Griffe, Jacques Becker, Marc Maurette', 'Fernandel, Samia Gamal, Dieter Borsche, Henri Vilbert, Édouard Delmont, Edmond Ardisson, José Casa, Manuel Gary', 'G', 'A lord’s servant, Ali Baba, is sent to retrieve a slave for his master, but ends up on an adventure filled with gold, mischief, love, and forty famous thieves instead.', 'A lord’s servant, Ali Baba, is sent to retrieve a slave for his master, but ends up on an adventure filled with gold, mischief, love, and forty famous thieves instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/314RaBN4qVTQcmbu2kfKVLmdPfY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66540'),
  ('372793348186311620', 'Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves', 1971, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy', 'Hiroshi Shidara, Akira Daikuhara', 'Morihisa Yamamoto', 'Chikao Ohtsuka, Junpei Takiguchi, Gorō Naya, Kosei Tomita, Isamu Tanonaka, Kenji Utsumi, Nobuyo Oyama, Masao Imanishi', null, 'A peasant boy and 38 cats band against the tyrannical Ali Baba the 33rd and his cat-phobic genie.', 'A peasant boy and 38 cats band against the tyrannical Ali Baba the 33rd and his cat-phobic genie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwwxEJNNp1zdzfzpYshcHqeLZxh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70520'),
  ('309585926675464319', 'Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves', 1972, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure', 'Nuri Ergün', 'Vecdi Uygun', 'Sadri Alışık, Feri Cansel, Yusuf Sezgin, Hulusi Kentmen, Güzin Özipek, Erol Taş, Kayhan Yıldızoğlu, Süheyl Eğriboz', null, 'The Classical story of Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves, starring Sadri Alışık as Ali Baba.', 'The Classical story of Ali Baba and the Forty Thieves, starring Sadri Alışık as Ali Baba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKLVct1W6dzvUC0zOssLAb4zFOm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157573'),
  ('538570001172225000', 'Ali Baba Bunny', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Bugs and Daffy get lost on the way to Pismo Beach, and find a cave full of treasure in the Arabian Desert, guarded by Hassan.', 'Bugs and Daffy get lost on the way to Pismo Beach, and find a cave full of treasure in the Arabian Desert, guarded by Hassan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGxSqPwnFos4CIV86K7csgTV4ll.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101503'),
  ('799840999387245466', 'Ali Babá e os Quarenta Ladrões', 1972, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Victor Lima, Antônio Gonçalves, Neila Tavares', 'Victor Lima', 'Renato Aragão, Dedé Santana, Luís Delfino, Neila Tavares, Elza De Castro, Angelo Antonio, Elisa Fernandes, Mariel Mariscot', null, 'Ali Baba falls for a former trapeze artist who was paralyzed in an accident and wants to get money to make the girl recover their health. Ali Baba discovers a hidden deposit of 40 thieves, and finds many bars and diamonds too fake money.', 'Ali Baba falls for a former trapeze artist who was paralyzed in an accident and wants to get money to make the girl recover their health. Ali Baba discovers a hidden deposit of 40 thieves, and finds many bars and diamonds too fake money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AuoLAGJvUFGv6LtvWv2EgtCJWfw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143558'),
  ('146720169941125483', 'Ali Baba Goes to Town', 1937, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Music', 'David Butler', 'Harry Tugend, Jack Yellen', 'Eddie Cantor, Tony Martin, Roland Young, June Lang, Gypsy Rose Lee, John Carradine, Virginia Field, Jeni Le Gon', 'NR', 'While visiting Hollywood a starstruck movie fan (Eddie Cantor) fantasizes about himself cast in an Arabian adventure. Director David Butler''s comedy--with many songs--also features Tony Martin, Roland Young, Gypsy Rose Lee (billed as Rose Hovick), John Carradine, June Lang, Virginia Field, Charles Lane, The Peters Sisters and many big-name guest stars playing themselves.', 'While visiting Hollywood a starstruck movie fan (Eddie Cantor) fantasizes about himself cast in an Arabian adventure. Director David Butler''s comedy--with many songs--also features Tony Martin, Roland Young, Gypsy Rose Lee (billed as Rose Hovick), John Carradine, June Lang, Virginia Field, Charles Lane, The Peters Sisters and many big-name guest stars playing themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8s3ApbS97KDPIHi8CeqpulOc980.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106515'),
  ('812520162914259179', 'Ali Blue Eyes', 2012, 'Drama', 'Claudio Giovannesi, Adriano Candiago', 'Claudio Giovannesi, Filippo Gravino', 'Nader Sarhan, Stefano Rabatti, Marian Valenti Adrian, Brigitte Abruzzesi, Marco Conidi, Alessandra Roca, Totò Onnis', null, 'Ostia, outskirts of Rome: the beach in winter. Two sixteen-year-old boys steal a scooter at 8 in the morning, then rob a store, all in time for getting to school at 9. Nader is Egyptian, but was born in Rome. Stefano is Italian and his best friend Brigitte, Nader’s girlfriend, is also Italian, but for this very reason Nader’s parents are against the match, and Nader runs away from home. The film describes a week in the life of a teenager who tries to subvert the values of his own family. Torn between his Arab and Italian identity, audacious and in love, like the hero of a contemporary fairy tale, Nader will have to put up with the cold, the loneliness, life on the street, hunger and fear, the flight from his enemies and the loss of his friends, before he can really understand who he is.', 'Ostia, outskirts of Rome: the beach in winter. Two sixteen-year-old boys steal a scooter at 8 in the morning, then rob a store, all in time for getting to school at 9. Nader is Egyptian, but was born in Rome. Stefano is Italian and his best friend Brigitte, Nader’s girlfriend, is also Italian, but for this very reason Nader’s parents are against the match, and Nader runs away from home. The film describes a week in the life of a teenager who tries to subvert the values of his own family. Torn between his Arab and Italian identity, audacious and in love, like the hero of a contemporary fairy tale, Nader will have to put up with the cold, the loneliness, life on the street, hunger and fear, the flight from his enemies and the loss of his friends, before he can really understand who he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/voupdE8Mhm2xZsSJZKiOMukugCS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145015'),
  ('413715050608839052', 'Ali G Indahouse', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Mark Mylod, Ashley Rowe', 'Sacha Baron Cohen, Dan Mazer', 'Sacha Baron Cohen, Michael Gambon, Charles Dance, Kellie Bright, Martin Freeman, Paul Clayton, Rhona Mitra, Tony Way', 'R', 'Ali G unwittingly becomes a pawn in the evil Chancellor''s plot to overthrow the Prime Minister of Great Britain. However, instead of bringing the Prime Minister down, Ali is embraced by the nation as the voice of youth and ''realness'', making the Prime Minister and his government more popular than ever.', 'Ali G unwittingly becomes a pawn in the evil Chancellor''s plot to overthrow the Prime Minister of Great Britain. However, instead of bringing the Prime Minister down, Ali is embraced by the nation as the voice of youth and ''realness'', making the Prime Minister and his government more popular than ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjKvQrVpekshVM6DUDOt3ImhAVH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9298'),
  ('1028588078876798300', 'Ali G, Innit', 1999, 'Comedy', 'James Bobin, Steve Smith', 'Sacha Baron Cohen', 'Sacha Baron Cohen, Alex A. Alonso', 'R', 'Ali G travels throughout Britain, interviewing unsuspecting leaders and politicians.', 'Ali G travels throughout Britain, interviewing unsuspecting leaders and politicians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lIncU61cXqzeLRJCoUc0LmQqDG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21037'),
  ('1145029729502750316', 'Ali G: Bling Bling', 2001, 'Comedy', 'James Bobin', null, 'Sacha Baron Cohen', null, 'Bling Bling is an assortment of Ali G''s interviews; a couple of them with possibly the last people in Britain who didn''t realise that someone was pulling their leg and several with American grandees of various sorts, including economist JK Galbraith and former CIA director Admiral Stansfield Turner. The real selling point, however, is Ali G''s undeniably spectacular Comic Relief interview', 'Bling Bling is an assortment of Ali G''s interviews; a couple of them with possibly the last people in Britain who didn''t realise that someone was pulling their leg and several with American grandees of various sorts, including economist JK Galbraith and former CIA director Admiral Stansfield Turner. The real selling point, however, is Ali G''s undeniably spectacular Comic Relief interview', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1afagcSQn6hvJCH7XWdxDfPBvg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17272'),
  ('523908697201125068', 'Ali Kundilli', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Bülent İşbilen', 'Cem Gelinoğlu', 'Cem Gelinoğlu, Sami Aksu, Zeynep Aktuğ, Ezgi Tombul, Emre Mutlu, Bilal Kaya, İcmal Aktuna, Sibel Tomaç', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmQDYPKNAnt5Vlrf3imr8MAD4Jw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345416'),
  ('925395737213032863', 'Ali Kundilli 2', 2016, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Faruk Aksoy', 'Cem Gelinoğlu, Faruk Aksoy', 'Cem Gelinoğlu, Zeynep Aktuğ, Sami Aksu, Ezgi Tombul, Hakan Bilgin, Ayşegül Atik, Emre Mutlu, Gülnihal Demir', null, 'Ali and İlknur, who married with great love, are waiting for the fruit of their love. İlknur is eight months pregnant, and during this time, she has exhausted Ali with her endless strange requests. She wants to give birth to the child not in Istanbul, but in Ayvalık, Küçükköy, where Ali''s grandmother lives, based on a dream she had. Here too, her shocking requests will not end, and Ali will find himself in very comical situations. However, the child''s birth there will also provide a solution to a very important problem for the townspeople.', 'Ali and İlknur, who married with great love, are waiting for the fruit of their love. İlknur is eight months pregnant, and during this time, she has exhausted Ali with her endless strange requests. She wants to give birth to the child not in Istanbul, but in Ayvalık, Küçükköy, where Ali''s grandmother lives, based on a dream she had. Here too, her shocking requests will not end, and Ali will find himself in very comical situations. However, the child''s birth there will also provide a solution to a very important problem for the townspeople.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvANwir9ZKkv0iZUW7KBbCAkzSu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447234'),
  ('788962867701664095', 'Ali Wong: Baby Cobra', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Brian Burgoyne, Jay Karas', 'Ali Wong', 'Ali Wong', null, 'Ali Wong might be seven-months pregnant, but there’s not a fetus in the world that can stop this acerbic and savage train of comedy from delivering a masterful hour of stand-up.', 'Ali Wong might be seven-months pregnant, but there’s not a fetus in the world that can stop this acerbic and savage train of comedy from delivering a masterful hour of stand-up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8stTLVktSAATgFdCeaEUSh6WU2j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396292'),
  ('950569150688715919', 'Ali Wong: Don Wong', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Jason Vandermer, Nahnatchka Khan', 'Ali Wong', 'Ali Wong', 'R', 'In her third Netflix stand-up special, Ali Wong reveals her wildest fantasies, the challenges of monogamy and how she really feels about single people.', 'In her third Netflix stand-up special, Ali Wong reveals her wildest fantasies, the challenges of monogamy and how she really feels about single people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhwfoNRrTTLbdkkqjjC6yCDZXte.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:933738'),
  ('998690565126265324', 'Ali Wong: Hard Knock Wife', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Samuel Brownfield, Jay Karas', 'Ali Wong', 'Ali Wong', null, 'Pregnant again, Ali Wong returns to Netflix in her second original stand-up comedy special and gets real on why having kids is not all it''s cracked up to be.', 'Pregnant again, Ali Wong returns to Netflix in her second original stand-up comedy special and gets real on why having kids is not all it''s cracked up to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1WE1V01HMz1TGrqFPbLLiXeNdU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518045'),
  ('600824493497778750', 'Ali Wong: Single Lady', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Ali Wong', 'Ali Wong', 'Ali Wong', 'R', 'After a whirlwind couple of years, Ali Wong returns to the stage to dish on the highs, lows and surprises of dating post-divorce.', 'After a whirlwind couple of years, Ali Wong returns to the stage to dish on the highs, lows and surprises of dating post-divorce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnptXWJicqtx36Xdo4e7sK6eV4X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1360212'),
  ('1016891153729769977', 'Ali Zaoua: Prince of the Streets', 2001, 'Drama', 'Nabil Ayouch, Sylvie Léonard Victorino, Renaat Lambeets', 'Nabil Ayouch, Nathalie Saugeon', 'Mounïm Kbab, Abdelhak Zhayra, Hicham Moussoune, Mustapha Hansali, Abdessamad Tourab, Saïd Taghmaoui, Amal Ayouch, Mohamed Majd', null, 'Ali, Kwita, Omar and Boubker are street kids. The daily dose of glue sniffing represents their only escape from reality. Since they left Dib and his gang, they have been living on the portside of Casablanca. They live in constant fear of Dib''s revenge. Ali wants to become a sailor - when he was living with his mother, a prostitute, he used to listen to a fairy tale about the sailor who discovered the miracle island with two suns. Instead of finding his island in the dream, Ali and his friends are confronted with Dib''s gang. Matters are getting serious.', 'Ali, Kwita, Omar and Boubker are street kids. The daily dose of glue sniffing represents their only escape from reality. Since they left Dib and his gang, they have been living on the portside of Casablanca. They live in constant fear of Dib''s revenge. Ali wants to become a sailor - when he was living with his mother, a prostitute, he used to listen to a fairy tale about the sailor who discovered the miracle island with two suns. Instead of finding his island in the dream, Ali and his friends are confronted with Dib''s gang. Matters are getting serious.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Uf2zhivRpxTNI9c1MjGwjT3Szx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49167'),
  ('383129085667876724', 'Ali-Baba Bound', 1940, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Porky finds out that Ali-Baba and his Dirty Sleeves plan to attack the fort; it''s up to him to go warn the fort. He gets there to discover everyone has left for the Legion convention in Boston. Porky and his rented camel fend off the attackers themselves for a while, but when the situation gets dire, the young camel summons its mother. Momma takes care of the attacker that''s menacing them. The secret weapon, who has been sitting on the bench with an artillery shell strapped to his head, now comes in, but runs right through the fort and into Ali-Baba.', 'Porky finds out that Ali-Baba and his Dirty Sleeves plan to attack the fort; it''s up to him to go warn the fort. He gets there to discover everyone has left for the Legion convention in Boston. Porky and his rented camel fend off the attackers themselves for a while, but when the situation gets dire, the young camel summons its mother. Momma takes care of the attacker that''s menacing them. The secret weapon, who has been sitting on the bench with an artillery shell strapped to his head, now comes in, but runs right through the fort and into Ali-Baba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqWX8UYcELMt47Vx0fvWsXO96io.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188393'),
  ('861568275784920768', 'Ali''s Eight Days', 2009, 'Drama', 'Cemal Şan', 'Cemal Şan', 'Serdar Orçin, Begüm Birgören, Ufuk Bayraktar, Uğur Polat, Suleyman Atanisev, Ferit Kaya, Orhan Eşkin, Emre Özcan', null, 'Ali is a young man whose life passes as a routine between his house and the little shop he owns. Everything changes when she meets Zeynep, a girl who''s recently moved to the neighbourhood.', 'Ali is a young man whose life passes as a routine between his house and the little shop he owns. Everything changes when she meets Zeynep, a girl who''s recently moved to the neighbourhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vaxBcwDkDueyvnE3b9fvppHjFR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52194'),
  ('438547494504250847', 'Ali''s Wedding', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ian Kenny, Jeffrey Walker', 'Osamah Sami, Andrew Knight', 'Osamah Sami, Don Hany, Helana Sawires, Robert Rabiah, Khaled Khalafalla, Asal Shenaveh, Ryan Corr, Shayan Salehian', null, 'After a "white lie" which spirals out of control, a neurotic, naive and musically gifted Muslim cleric''s eldest son must follow through with an arranged marriage, except he is madly in love with an Australian born-Lebanese girl.', 'After a "white lie" which spirals out of control, a neurotic, naive and musically gifted Muslim cleric''s eldest son must follow through with an arranged marriage, except he is madly in love with an Australian born-Lebanese girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e27BoM25FfABoEpZ2NU4jlzrNlY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457258'),
  ('70531388585589191', 'Alias Boston Blackie', 1942, 'Mystery', 'Philip Tannura, Lew Landers, Robert Peterson', 'Paul Yawitz', 'Chester Morris, Adele Mara, Richard Lane, George E. Stone, Lloyd Corrigan, Walter Sande, Larry Parks, George McKay', 'NR', 'It is the Christmas Holidays and reformed thief, Boston Blackie goes to Castle Theater to pick up players who will perform for prisoners that are still in prison. He takes a girl with him who has a brother already in prison. She has visited the prison twice in the month, so is not suppose to visit again. However when the group is completed the girl is included as well as Inspector Farrady. One of the clowns in the show is kidnapped and replaced by a con who wants to get even with two ex-partners. Boston Blackie figures out that a con has replaced one of his clowns but is unable to stop him. Blackie''s clothes are stolen and a murder is committed. Of course, the Inspector immediately suspects Blackie of being involved. Now it is Blackie''s job to find the killer, exonerate himself and help the girl free her brother.', 'It is the Christmas Holidays and reformed thief, Boston Blackie goes to Castle Theater to pick up players who will perform for prisoners that are still in prison. He takes a girl with him who has a brother already in prison. She has visited the prison twice in the month, so is not suppose to visit again. However when the group is completed the girl is included as well as Inspector Farrady. One of the clowns in the show is kidnapped and replaced by a con who wants to get even with two ex-partners. Boston Blackie figures out that a con has replaced one of his clowns but is unable to stop him. Blackie''s clothes are stolen and a murder is committed. Of course, the Inspector immediately suspects Blackie of being involved. Now it is Blackie''s job to find the killer, exonerate himself and help the girl free her brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3E2eV6QzBerr0sn6cpNAaRv3eRb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50637'),
  ('1017575603918664639', 'Alias Jesse James', 1959, 'Comedy, Western', 'Daniel McCauley, Norman Z. McLeod, Lionel Lindon', 'Daniel B. Beauchamps, William Bowers', 'Bob Hope, Rhonda Fleming, Wendell Corey, Gloria Talbott, Jim Davis, Will Wright, Mary Young, Mickey Finn', 'NR', 'Insurance salesman Milford Farnsworth sells a man a life policy only to discover that the man in question is the outlaw Jesse James. Milford is sent to buy back the policy, but is robbed by Jesse. And when Jesse learns that Milford''s boss is on the way out with more cash, he plans to rob him too and have Milford get killed in the robbery while dressed as Jesse, and collect on the policy.', 'Insurance salesman Milford Farnsworth sells a man a life policy only to discover that the man in question is the outlaw Jesse James. Milford is sent to buy back the policy, but is robbed by Jesse. And when Jesse learns that Milford''s boss is on the way out with more cash, he plans to rob him too and have Milford get killed in the robbery while dressed as Jesse, and collect on the policy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9401kHeTLSsAMmwcrph7VkJP35x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39318'),
  ('499660273813299352', 'Alias Maria', 2015, 'War, Drama', 'José Luis Rugeles, Sergio Iván Castaño, Daniela Castro', 'Diego Vivanco', 'Karen Torres, Carlos Clavijo Cobos, Erik Ruiz, Anderson Gómez, Carmenza González, Lola Lagos, Julio Pachón, Fabio Velazco', null, 'A vision of Colombia''s inhuman armed conflict, seen through the eyes of a young - and pregnant - girl soldier.', 'A vision of Colombia''s inhuman armed conflict, seen through the eyes of a young - and pregnant - girl soldier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1eK7xgtv1vzhEAAI2z8Ni5aMi33.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337115'),
  ('888602748167438757', 'Alias Nick Beal', 1949, 'Drama, Crime, Fantasy', 'John Farrow, Lionel Lindon, Francisco Day', 'Jonathan Latimer', 'Ray Milland, Audrey Totter, Thomas Mitchell, George Macready, Fred Clark, Geraldine Wall, Henry O''Neill, Darryl Hickman', 'NR', 'After straight-arrow district attorney Joseph Foster says in frustration that he would sell his soul to bring down a local mob boss, a smooth-talking stranger named Nick Beal shows up with enough evidence to seal a conviction. When that success leads Foster to run for governor, Beal''s unearthly hold on him turns the previously honest man corrupt, much to the displeasure of his wife and his steadfast minister.', 'After straight-arrow district attorney Joseph Foster says in frustration that he would sell his soul to bring down a local mob boss, a smooth-talking stranger named Nick Beal shows up with enough evidence to seal a conviction. When that success leads Foster to run for governor, Beal''s unearthly hold on him turns the previously honest man corrupt, much to the displeasure of his wife and his steadfast minister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wy0peTDb2Zrdecely80hOyAPv8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32887'),
  ('766993025935048418', 'Alibi', 1929, 'Crime, Drama', 'Roland West, Ray June', 'Roland West, C. Gardner Sullivan', 'Chester Morris, Eleanor Griffith, Purnell Pratt, Pat O''Malley, Regis Toomey, Harry Stubbs, Mae Busch, Irma Harrison', 'NR', 'Chick Williams, a prohibition gangster, rejoins his mob soon after being released from prison. When a policeman is murdered during a robbery, he falls under suspicion. The gangster took Joan, a policeman''s daughter, to the theater, sneaked out during the intermission to commit the crime, then used her to support his alibi. The detective squad employs its most sophisticated and barbaric techniques, including planting an undercover agent in the gang, to bring him to justice.', 'Chick Williams, a prohibition gangster, rejoins his mob soon after being released from prison. When a policeman is murdered during a robbery, he falls under suspicion. The gangster took Joan, a policeman''s daughter, to the theater, sneaked out during the intermission to commit the crime, then used her to support his alibi. The detective squad employs its most sophisticated and barbaric techniques, including planting an undercover agent in the gang, to bring him to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2C3ZDxVrOVafzNoOVrxsNQDiHey.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13847'),
  ('775325701926785952', 'Alibi', 1937, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Pierre Chenal, Theodore J. Pahle', 'Marcel Achard', 'Erich von Stroheim, Louis Jouvet, Jany Holt, Albert Préjean, Véra Flory, Foun-Sen, Génia Vaury, Made Siamé', null, 'Paris, 1937. Winckler kills his enemy Gordon, a Chicago mobster, from the stage of a Parisian music hall, where he performs telepathy. He pays another artist, Helene, so that she tells the police they''ve spent the night together, which doesn''t fool Callas, the police officer who investigates the murder. He hires one of his fellow officers in order to seduce Helene.', 'Paris, 1937. Winckler kills his enemy Gordon, a Chicago mobster, from the stage of a Parisian music hall, where he performs telepathy. He pays another artist, Helene, so that she tells the police they''ve spent the night together, which doesn''t fool Callas, the police officer who investigates the murder. He hires one of his fellow officers in order to seduce Helene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6WZOoLCrcT7ehswoaSvCsbdr9K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65700'),
  ('112375729535921352', 'Alibi', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Johan Nijenhuis, Rolf Dekens', 'Wijo Koek', 'Achmed Akkabi, Georgina Verbaan, Frederik Brom, Egbert Jan Weeber, Isa Hoes, Daphne de Winkel, Sanne Vogel, Hugo Maerten', null, 'Youssef, a professional liar, falls in love with airhead waitress Andrea. Things get awry as she never wants to date a guy who keeps secrets or lies.', 'Youssef, a professional liar, falls in love with airhead waitress Andrea. Things get awry as she never wants to date a guy who keeps secrets or lies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emINZkZwKrSYdCKs0goSn8ZVSiK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35789'),
  ('834335110428777645', 'Alibi.com', 2017, 'Comedy, Family', 'Philippe Lacheau, Dominique Colin, Carole Bonamy', 'Philippe Lacheau, Julien Arruti, Pierre Dudan', 'Philippe Lacheau, Élodie Fontan, Julien Arruti, Tarek Boudali, Nathalie Baye, Didier Bourdon, Nawell Madani, Medi Sadoun', null, 'Greg founded a company called Alibi.com that creates any type of alibi. With his associate, Augustin, and Medhi his new employee, they devise unstoppable stratagems and stagings to cover their clients. But meeting Flo, a pretty blonde who hates men who lie, will complicate Greg''s life, which begins by hiding the true nature of his activity. During the presentation to parents, Greg understands that Gérard, the father of Flo, is also one of their clients.', 'Greg founded a company called Alibi.com that creates any type of alibi. With his associate, Augustin, and Medhi his new employee, they devise unstoppable stratagems and stagings to cover their clients. But meeting Flo, a pretty blonde who hates men who lie, will complicate Greg''s life, which begins by hiding the true nature of his activity. During the presentation to parents, Greg understands that Gérard, the father of Flo, is also one of their clients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8K5dvcXq7Lq2qiE9nkjF1Dht60R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398929'),
  ('5417552059368511', 'Alibi.com 2', 2023, 'Comedy, Family', 'Philippe Lacheau, Pierric Gantelmi d''Ille, Lola Berteloot', 'Philippe Lacheau, Pierre Lacheau, Pierre Dudan', 'Philippe Lacheau, Tarek Boudali, Élodie Fontan, Julien Arruti, Nathalie Baye, Didier Bourdon, Arielle Dombasle, Gérard Jugnot', null, 'After closing his agency Alibi.com and promising Flo that he would never lie to her again, Greg''s new life became quiet, too quiet... Not for long! When he decides to propose to Flo, Greg is up against the wall and has to introduce his family. But with his crooked father and his ex-charm actress mother, this could ruin his future union. He has no choice but to reopen his agency with his former accomplices for an ultimate Alibi and to find more presentable fake parents.', 'After closing his agency Alibi.com and promising Flo that he would never lie to her again, Greg''s new life became quiet, too quiet... Not for long! When he decides to propose to Flo, Greg is up against the wall and has to introduce his family. But with his crooked father and his ex-charm actress mother, this could ruin his future union. He has no choice but to reopen his agency with his former accomplices for an ultimate Alibi and to find more presentable fake parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u2IgcRl1q5iDoag5xBYR4q51gJW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:967585'),
  ('482653191240697372', 'Alice', null, 'Drama', 'Jean-Louis Sonzogni, Gabriel Benattar', 'Gabriel Benattar', 'Anne Consigny, Nadia Mourouzi, Alain Fromager, Martin Provost, Denis Manuel', null, 'In Paris, the student protests of December 1986. Alice Lazard is having her own revolution, expressing herself and trying to confront a world whose aggression and hatred ignite her fierce will to live and her madness. Or so we imagine. Swept away by her colorful language, her youth, her vivacity, her humor, we remain fascinated, and yet she expresses so much despair in the slow destruction of her relationship with a man... Romain, the creator of this character, is overwhelmed by her. He projects himself into another woman, Alice Lazard, brunette, warm, and aggressive. She comes to present herself to Romain for a role in his next film, but she doesn''t understand his reactions at all. All of this unfolds under the sometimes amused, sometimes irritated gaze of Jean, the film''s editor.', 'In Paris, the student protests of December 1986. Alice Lazard is having her own revolution, expressing herself and trying to confront a world whose aggression and hatred ignite her fierce will to live and her madness. Or so we imagine. Swept away by her colorful language, her youth, her vivacity, her humor, we remain fascinated, and yet she expresses so much despair in the slow destruction of her relationship with a man... Romain, the creator of this character, is overwhelmed by her. He projects himself into another woman, Alice Lazard, brunette, warm, and aggressive. She comes to present herself to Romain for a role in his next film, but she doesn''t understand his reactions at all. All of this unfolds under the sometimes amused, sometimes irritated gaze of Jean, the film''s editor.', null, 'tmdb:movie:976732'),
  ('114449105110409775', 'Alice', 1988, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Jan Švankmajer, Svatopluk Malý', 'Jan Švankmajer', 'Kristýna Kohoutová', null, 'A quiet young English girl named Alice finds herself in an alternate version of her own reality after chasing a white rabbit. She becomes surrounded by living inanimate objects and stuffed dead animals, and must find a way out of this nightmare - no matter how twisted or odd that way must be.', 'A quiet young English girl named Alice finds herself in an alternate version of her own reality after chasing a white rabbit. She becomes surrounded by living inanimate objects and stuffed dead animals, and must find a way out of this nightmare - no matter how twisted or odd that way must be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8o460rJZt7GY3j7QmLPeJrQWNwD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18917'),
  ('574655458232608120', 'Alice', 1990, 'Fantasy, Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Woody Allen, Carlo Di Palma, Thomas A. Reilly', 'Woody Allen', 'Mia Farrow, William Hurt, Joe Mantegna, Alec Baldwin, Blythe Danner, Judy Davis, Keye Luke, Bernadette Peters', 'PG-13', 'Alice Tate, mother of two, with a marriage of 16 years, finds herself falling for a handsome sax player, Joe. Stricken with a backache, she consults herbalist Dr. Yang, who realizes that her problems are not related to her back, but in her mind and heart. Dr. Yang''s magical herbs give Alice wondrous powers, taking her out of her well-established rut.', 'Alice Tate, mother of two, with a marriage of 16 years, finds herself falling for a handsome sax player, Joe. Stricken with a backache, she consults herbalist Dr. Yang, who realizes that her problems are not related to her back, but in her mind and heart. Dr. Yang''s magical herbs give Alice wondrous powers, taking her out of her well-established rut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6PGzYqXNofrrGKS7dixoc2P5M7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8217'),
  ('143065289122849064', 'Alice', 2002, 'Drama', 'Sylvie Ballyot', null, 'Anne Bargain, Lei Dinety, Élodie Mennegand', null, 'Alice has deeply buried feelings and memories for her sister Manon who is about to be married. During their childhood the two sisters were extremely close not only emotionally, but also sexually. With news of the wedding the pain of the past resurfaces and Alice''s relationship with her girlfriend Elsa start to fall apart. As the wedding approaches Alice reminisces about her childhood, and has trouble letting go of her incestuous relationship with her sister Manon.', 'Alice has deeply buried feelings and memories for her sister Manon who is about to be married. During their childhood the two sisters were extremely close not only emotionally, but also sexually. With news of the wedding the pain of the past resurfaces and Alice''s relationship with her girlfriend Elsa start to fall apart. As the wedding approaches Alice reminisces about her childhood, and has trouble letting go of her incestuous relationship with her sister Manon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0bU7yVmB5pz3zgKCMewC08g7CX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207941'),
  ('443340017591463671', 'Alice', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marco Martins, Carlos Lopes, Dörte Schneider', 'Marco Martins', 'Nuno Lopes, Beatriz Batarda, Miguel Guilherme, Ana Bustorff, Laura Soveral, Gonçalo Waddington, Carla Maciel, José Wallenstein', null, 'In the wake of his daughter''s disappearance, a father wallowing in grief feeds his desire to find her with unusual methods.', 'In the wake of his daughter''s disappearance, a father wallowing in grief feeds his desire to find her with unusual methods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSCyHW9RjimNveu7xU650ostpxv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53042'),
  ('58133957811437388', 'Alice', 2019, 'Fantasy', 'Jawahine Zentar, Juliette Rose', null, 'Garance Marillier, Laurent Bateau, Aude Koegler', null, 'Seven years after the abduction of his daughter Alice, Jacques leads a life suspended in waiting. The days pass by, between the routine of his work as a storekeeper and the emptiness of the family home. As a usual day ends, strange details disturb Jacques'' daily life and gradually awaken his existence ...', 'Seven years after the abduction of his daughter Alice, Jacques leads a life suspended in waiting. The days pass by, between the routine of his work as a storekeeper and the emptiness of the family home. As a usual day ends, strange details disturb Jacques'' daily life and gradually awaken his existence ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRVJ4GG7Osw0KlJK4MjH9rOuR5j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659742'),
  ('571312598456075830', 'Alice', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Josephine Mackerras, Mickaël Delahaie', 'Josephine Mackerras', 'Emilie Piponnier, Martin Swabey, Chloé Boreham, Christophe Favre, David Coburn, Jules Milo Levy Mackerras, Ariana Rodriguez Giraldo, Juliette Tresanini', null, 'Alice, a perfect wife and mother, lives happily with her husband and child until the day she discovers he is living a double life that has ruined her financially and left her a single mother. Alice fights back and dives into a world beyond anything she has ever known.', 'Alice, a perfect wife and mother, lives happily with her husband and child until the day she discovers he is living a double life that has ruined her financially and left her a single mother. Alice fights back and dives into a world beyond anything she has ever known.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlBr2E4lqpjOKfIy6UqC5vdInVs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576002'),
  ('853845431586000432', 'Alice', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Alex Disenhof, Jeff Fuller, Krystin Ver Linden', 'Krystin Ver Linden', 'Keke Palmer, Common, Jonny Lee Miller, Gaius Charles, Madelon Curtis, Kenneth Farmer, Natasha Yvette Williams, Jaxon Goldenberg', 'R', 'Alice spends her days enslaved on a rural Georgia plantation, restlessly yearning for freedom. After a violent clash with plantation owner Paul, Alice flees through the neighboring woods and stumbles onto the unfamiliar sight of a highway, soon discovering the year is actually 1973.', 'Alice spends her days enslaved on a rural Georgia plantation, restlessly yearning for freedom. After a violent clash with plantation owner Paul, Alice flees through the neighboring woods and stumbles onto the unfamiliar sight of a highway, soon discovering the year is actually 1973.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrGyjoCsRLVbzmsaeFCueOnGOKL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:714676'),
  ('956047402648548965', 'Alice & Viril', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Steven Shainberg', null, 'Angelina Jolie', null, 'Alice asks Viril to hold his head under water for three minutes.', 'Alice asks Viril to hold his head under water for three minutes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/soRDettFVe6LuGN7FPyAeGe830T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128943'),
  ('272230182998728042', 'Alice Adams', 1935, 'Romance, Drama', 'George Stevens, Robert De Grasse', 'Dorothy Yost, Mortimer Offner, Jane Murfin', 'Katharine Hepburn, Fred MacMurray, Fred Stone, Evelyn Venable, Frank Albertson, Ann Shoemaker, Charley Grapewin, Grady Sutton', null, 'In the lower-middle-class Adams family, father and son are happy to work in a drugstore, but mother and daughter Alice try every possible social-climbing stratagem despite snubs and embarrassment. When Alice finally meets her dream man Arthur, mother nags father into a risky business venture and plans to impress Alice''s beau with an "upscale" family dinner. Will the excruciating results drive Arthur away?', 'In the lower-middle-class Adams family, father and son are happy to work in a drugstore, but mother and daughter Alice try every possible social-climbing stratagem despite snubs and embarrassment. When Alice finally meets her dream man Arthur, mother nags father into a risky business venture and plans to impress Alice''s beau with an "upscale" family dinner. Will the excruciating results drive Arthur away?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjhJDaC7025umyBKvKHyOsocKDp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43886'),
  ('136426429531239022', 'Alice and Martin', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'André Téchiné, Caroline Champetier', 'Olivier Assayas, Gilles Taurand, André Téchiné', 'Juliette Binoche, Alexis Loret, Mathieu Amalric, Carmen Maura, Jean-Pierre Lorit, Marthe Villalonga, Roschdy Zem, Pierre Maguelon', null, 'Martin, the illegitimate son of an industrialist and a hairdresser, was sent to live with his wealthy father in the countryside as a young boy. Alice is a musician living with Martin''s half-brother in Paris. When Martin shows up at Alice''s door after fleeing his father''s home under troubled circumstances, their lives become intertwined.', 'Martin, the illegitimate son of an industrialist and a hairdresser, was sent to live with his wealthy father in the countryside as a young boy. Alice is a musician living with Martin''s half-brother in Paris. When Martin shows up at Alice''s door after fleeing his father''s home under troubled circumstances, their lives become intertwined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IwtR0iolypfZbDrPk3xB7A9fKh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102489'),
  ('962260222638453252', 'Alice and the Dog Catcher', 1924, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Virginia Davis, Joe Allen', null, 'Alice presides over a secret club which proposes to rid the town of dog catchers and free the dogs!', 'Alice presides over a secret club which proposes to rid the town of dog catchers and free the dogs!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zW2FcrYC67VngEnHELmlGcaO8T3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176336'),
  ('123957022500602385', 'Alice and the Mayor', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nicolas Pariser, Valérie Roucher, Sébastien Autret', 'Nicolas Pariser', 'Fabrice Luchini, Anaïs Demoustier, Nora Hamzawi, Léonie Simaga, Antoine Reinartz, Maud Wyler, Alexandre Steiger, Pascal Rénéric', null, 'The mayor of Lyon, Paul Théraneau, is in a delicate position. After 30 years in politics, he is running out of ideas and is faced with a feeling of existential emptiness. To overcome this, Paul hires a young and brilliant philosopher, Alice Heimann. Then follows a dialogue between two diametrically opposed personalities who will turn their certainties upside down.', 'The mayor of Lyon, Paul Théraneau, is in a delicate position. After 30 years in politics, he is running out of ideas and is faced with a feeling of existential emptiness. To overcome this, Paul hires a young and brilliant philosopher, Alice Heimann. Then follows a dialogue between two diametrically opposed personalities who will turn their certainties upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6dlspGA6PS7eM2lOj4BMY65ndS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592480'),
  ('563755889548724689', 'Alice and the Three Bears', 1924, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Virginia Davis', null, 'The Three Bears are busy cooking when Baby Bear realises his recipe requires hops. Naturally his first inclination is to go find some frogs to provide for him his hops, so he runs off and pursues a frog at the local pond. In the meantime Alice and her cat stumble upon the Three Bears'' house and sneak inside (Ma and Pa Bear are nowhere to be seen).', 'The Three Bears are busy cooking when Baby Bear realises his recipe requires hops. Naturally his first inclination is to go find some frogs to provide for him his hops, so he runs off and pursues a frog at the local pond. In the meantime Alice and her cat stumble upon the Three Bears'' house and sneak inside (Ma and Pa Bear are nowhere to be seen).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdrfhY1JsX4kLNSPjH9L502HhOJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176421'),
  ('177472835989664900', 'Alice Cans the Cannibals', 1925, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', 'Walt Disney', 'Virginia Davis', null, 'Alice and her cat are driving along the coast when they accidentally ride off a cliff and into the ocean. They trick a fish into towing them along until a storm hits and they are swept away to the Cannibal Islands, where they are pursued aggressively by the locals.', 'Alice and her cat are driving along the coast when they accidentally ride off a cliff and into the ocean. They trick a fish into towing them along until a storm hits and they are swept away to the Cannibal Islands, where they are pursued aggressively by the locals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVt0lNTbLBa3RcxV7ESs9hG2do0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184405'),
  ('1127233661664499796', 'Alice Doesn''t Live Here Anymore', 1974, 'Romance, Drama', 'Martin Scorsese, Kent L. Wakeford, Mike Moder', 'Robert Getchell', 'Ellen Burstyn, Alfred Lutter, Kris Kristofferson, Harvey Keitel, Diane Ladd, Lelia Goldoni, Billy Green Bush, Jodie Foster', 'PG', 'After her husband dies, Alice and her son, Tommy, leave their small New Mexico town for California, where Alice hopes to make a new life for herself as a singer. Money problems force them to settle in Arizona instead, where Alice takes a job as waitress in a small diner.', 'After her husband dies, Alice and her son, Tommy, leave their small New Mexico town for California, where Alice hopes to make a new life for herself as a singer. Money problems force them to settle in Arizona instead, where Alice takes a job as waitress in a small diner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A99yzz1W3NCG6zR2HXSwn2kWlse.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16153'),
  ('654272167418351970', 'Alice Gets in Dutch', 1924, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Virginia Davis, David F. Hollander, Marjorie Sewell', 'NR', 'Alice misbehaves in school and is forced to sit in the corner. She falls asleep and dreams, but schoolwork intrudes even into her dreams. Alice dreams of dancing dogs and donkeys until her fun is interrupted by three walking schoolbooks.', 'Alice misbehaves in school and is forced to sit in the corner. She falls asleep and dreams, but schoolwork intrudes even into her dreams. Alice dreams of dancing dogs and donkeys until her fun is interrupted by three walking schoolbooks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AabJw5bJ30JHmppoTJS24cSkE9h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51777'),
  ('755047390244099829', 'Alice Gets Stung', 1925, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Virginia Davis', null, 'Julius goes rabbit hunting while Alice goes bear hunting. Alice and her cat learn at their own expense that one shouldn''t bother animals, whether those be rabbits or bears.', 'Julius goes rabbit hunting while Alice goes bear hunting. Alice and her cat learn at their own expense that one shouldn''t bother animals, whether those be rabbits or bears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26ue5y5zRsDO6IBPpzVF2FLEqcP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35033'),
  ('303295476115796470', 'Alice Guy, the First Female Filmmaker', 2021, 'Documentary, History, TV Movie', 'Valérie Urrea, Nathalie Masduraud', null, 'Agnès Jaoui, Maud Wyler, Alice Guy-Blaché', null, 'Who, apart from moviegoers, knows Alice Guy (1873-1968) today? However, she was the first woman behind the camera and the first female director and producer of fiction films in history.', 'Who, apart from moviegoers, knows Alice Guy (1873-1968) today? However, she was the first woman behind the camera and the first female director and producer of fiction films in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0Tj9Si3pNV6PQe7MxEYWK8VAK5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:921221'),
  ('461564077174909344', 'Alice in Acidland', 1969, 'Drama', 'Donn Greer', 'Gertrude Steen', 'Donn Greer, Sheri Jackson, Julia Blackburn, Roger Gentry, Janice Kelly', 'R', 'Cute and perky college student Alice is invited to a "pool party" by Freida, a female teacher who is actually a lesbian and has designs on Alice. At the party Alice gets drunk, takes acid and immediately becomes a lesbian, taking a bath with Freida. Later Alice gets mixed up with LSD-addicted hippies, rape, more lesbians, more LSD, orgies, suicide, and having sex with guys in boxers.', 'Cute and perky college student Alice is invited to a "pool party" by Freida, a female teacher who is actually a lesbian and has designs on Alice. At the party Alice gets drunk, takes acid and immediately becomes a lesbian, taking a bath with Freida. Later Alice gets mixed up with LSD-addicted hippies, rape, more lesbians, more LSD, orgies, suicide, and having sex with guys in boxers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pIlWirIQM2iakBJEVh3mqvlINi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35749'),
  ('317651842890232859', 'Alice in Chains: MTV Unplugged', 1996, 'Music', 'Joe Perota, Alex Coletti', null, 'Layne Staley, Jerry Cantrell, Mike Inez, Sean Kinney, Scott Olson', null, 'Alice In Chains returned to the stage after a three year absence with this live acoustic performance in New York on 10th April 1996. The band performed a 13-song set, including, ''Heaven Beside You'', ''Rooster'' and ''Would?''.', 'Alice In Chains returned to the stage after a three year absence with this live acoustic performance in New York on 10th April 1996. The band performed a 13-song set, including, ''Heaven Beside You'', ''Rooster'' and ''Would?''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RdS0AQGwe0GQ2yxh7mTlZIYuqf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30098'),
  ('463500894447227464', 'Alice in Earnestland', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy, Thriller', 'Ahn Gooc-jin, Lee Seok-jun, Choi Cheong-il', 'Ahn Gooc-jin', 'Lee Jung-hyun, Lee Hae-yeong, Seo Young-hwa, Dong Bang-woo, Lee Jun-hyeok, Bae Je-gi, Lee Dae-yeon, Park Eun-young', null, 'A young woman struggles to pay the hospital bills of her vegetative husband. Despite her hard work, there''s no hope for him to ever wake up, until an opportunity arises.', 'A young woman struggles to pay the hospital bills of her vegetative husband. Despite her hard work, there''s no hope for him to ever wake up, until an opportunity arises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TWuLXCUD3ggaMrOPg5UG24M48k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347697'),
  ('1069965155209333194', 'Alice in Marialand', 2014, 'Drama', 'Jesús Magaña Vázquez', 'Jesús Magaña Vázquez, Rafael Gaytán, Fernando del Razo', 'Bárbara Mori, Stephanie Sigman, Claudio Lafarga, Angélica Aragón, Osvaldo de León, Lila Avilés, Clarisa Rendón, Mario Zaragoza', null, 'Tonatiuh and Maria experience a passionate and turbulent relationship. One night, in the heat of an argument, they suffer a dramatic automobile accident. Tonatiuh is left in a coma, where he sees Alicia, his nurse, including her in his dreams about Maria. Time later, Alicia has an accident and suffers amnesia while Tonatiuh wakes up. One year later, Tonatiuh and Alicia meet and an impossible love arouses from oblivion, haunted by the ghost of Maria''s memories.', 'Tonatiuh and Maria experience a passionate and turbulent relationship. One night, in the heat of an argument, they suffer a dramatic automobile accident. Tonatiuh is left in a coma, where he sees Alicia, his nurse, including her in his dreams about Maria. Time later, Alicia has an accident and suffers amnesia while Tonatiuh wakes up. One year later, Tonatiuh and Alicia meet and an impossible love arouses from oblivion, haunted by the ghost of Maria''s memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3srOLsMbeWosr8S9cEkpcdx64AH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326293'),
  ('114105852956749572', 'Alice in Terrorland', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Richard John Taylor, Harry Tali Cord', 'Richard John Taylor', 'Lizzy Willis, Rula Lenska, Jon-Paul Gates, Steve Wraith, Lila Sarner, Nigel Troup, Nikol Atanasova, Rikki Kimpton', null, 'A recently bereaved teenage girl goes to live with her aunt in a secluded woodland house, unaware that sinister forces lurk within.', 'A recently bereaved teenage girl goes to live with her aunt in a secluded woodland house, unaware that sinister forces lurk within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XJGvr8g9jkmN6KUIOQOj2iE6K4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1174618'),
  ('878243007363426215', 'Alice in the Country of Hearts: Wonderful Wonder World', 2011, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Romance', 'Hideaki Ōba', null, 'Jun Fukuyama, Daisuke Hirakawa, Kenyu Horiuchi, Akira Ishida, Yuhko Kaida, Mika Kanda, Katsuyuki Konishi, Takehito Koyasu', null, 'The girly but bloody otome game re-imagining of Lewis Carroll''s classic fantasy novel Alice''s Adventures in Wonderland with bishounen characters and added romance. A parody of Alice''s Adventures in Wonderland where Alice is smart and non-doormatlike. In this story, Alice is not all what she seems. She is practical, strong, yet darkly cynical. Instead of the tradition story, Alice is kidnapped unwillingly by a mysterious (yet somewhat bishie-looking) man with bunny ears into a place call Heartland. Stuck in Heartland due to a trick by the mysterious bunny eared man, she meets the residents of this world. Along the way, Alice meets Blood, handsome mafia leader; Ace, the psycho yet charming knight and more…What should Alice do in such a world!? (Source: Manga Updates)', 'The girly but bloody otome game re-imagining of Lewis Carroll''s classic fantasy novel Alice''s Adventures in Wonderland with bishounen characters and added romance. A parody of Alice''s Adventures in Wonderland where Alice is smart and non-doormatlike. In this story, Alice is not all what she seems. She is practical, strong, yet darkly cynical. Instead of the tradition story, Alice is kidnapped unwillingly by a mysterious (yet somewhat bishie-looking) man with bunny ears into a place call Heartland. Stuck in Heartland due to a trick by the mysterious bunny eared man, she meets the residents of this world. Along the way, Alice meets Blood, handsome mafia leader; Ace, the psycho yet charming knight and more…What should Alice do in such a world!? (Source: Manga Updates)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6L5aBWj1wPDfzHUnrVqKoCNCVC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118306'),
  ('1141372063971506434', 'Alice in the Jungle', 1925, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Virginia Davis', null, 'Alice and Julius the cat are riding an elephant through the jungle. Julius falls and is nearly eaten by crocodiles but manages to escape nevertheless. Meanwhile, two elephant children are having fun at a watering hole and a monkey barber has his barber pole eaten by a hippo, who mistakes it for a candy cane. Julius tries to remedy the latter injustice by starching up a tiger''s striped tail and knocking it off, using it as a replacement pole. Alice hunts a lion who proves to be too much for her to handle, but Julius bravely comes to the rescue.', 'Alice and Julius the cat are riding an elephant through the jungle. Julius falls and is nearly eaten by crocodiles but manages to escape nevertheless. Meanwhile, two elephant children are having fun at a watering hole and a monkey barber has his barber pole eaten by a hippo, who mistakes it for a candy cane. Julius tries to remedy the latter injustice by starching up a tiger''s striped tail and knocking it off, using it as a replacement pole. Alice hunts a lion who proves to be too much for her to handle, but Julius bravely comes to the rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJqmbjOA3Bs4HyRvtnO8jMuEaZ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38588'),
  ('431466559366010273', 'Alice in the Navy', 1961, 'Comedy', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Nikos Dimopoulos, Walter Lassally', 'Alekos Sakellarios', 'Aliki Vougiouklaki, Dimitris Papamichael, Labros Konstadaras, Giannis Malouhos, Giannis Gionakis, Giorgos Tsitsopoulos, Rafael Denogias, Kaiti Lambropoulou', null, 'Aliki is in love with someone who serves his duty in the greek navy. Wanting to see him, she disguises as a navy soldier and gets aboard her lover''s ship. Things get more complicated when she comes accross the ship''s captain; her father!', 'Aliki is in love with someone who serves his duty in the greek navy. Wanting to see him, she disguises as a navy soldier and gets aboard her lover''s ship. Things get more complicated when she comes accross the ship''s captain; her father!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5eJhSpvoVYZH7SEUrV9HECGdB6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64674'),
  ('777035461589634939', 'Alice in the Wooly West', 1926, 'Western, Animation, Comedy', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Margie Gay', null, 'Julius is out for a ride on his horse; he does some rope tricks. Some bad guys rob a stagecoach; one of the passengers is Alice, who finds herself stuck between the head bad guy and a cactus. Julius rides in and saves most of the passengers, but the bad guy rides off with Alice. After a short chase, he ends up battling Julius on top of a tall rock outcropping. A piece eventually breaks off, sending both of them into a boulder field. They play hide-and-seek a while. Julius then takes off his fur and sends it out as a decoy while he sneaks up behind the bad guy with a club and beats him into the ground. Alice comes up to thank him; ashamed by his nakedness, he hides behind a rock and puts his fur back on, then accepts her thanks.', 'Julius is out for a ride on his horse; he does some rope tricks. Some bad guys rob a stagecoach; one of the passengers is Alice, who finds herself stuck between the head bad guy and a cactus. Julius rides in and saves most of the passengers, but the bad guy rides off with Alice. After a short chase, he ends up battling Julius on top of a tall rock outcropping. A piece eventually breaks off, sending both of them into a boulder field. They play hide-and-seek a while. Julius then takes off his fur and sends it out as a decoy while he sneaks up behind the bad guy with a club and beats him into the ground. Alice comes up to thank him; ashamed by his nakedness, he hides behind a rock and puts his fur back on, then accepts her thanks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65STh3fD3nhhQi8iaWFFi3MS5rl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40846'),
  ('735262982775107741', 'Alice in Wonderland', 1903, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Cecil M. Hepworth, Percy Stow, Cecil M. Hepworth', 'Cecil M. Hepworth', 'May Clark, Cecil M. Hepworth, Mrs. Hepworth, Norman Whitten, Stanley Faithfull, Geoffrey Faithfull, Blair', 'G', 'This is the first movie version of the famous story. Alice dozes in a garden, awakened by a dithering white rabbit in waistcoat with pocket watch. She follows him down a hole and finds herself in a hall of many doors.', 'This is the first movie version of the famous story. Alice dozes in a garden, awakened by a dithering white rabbit in waistcoat with pocket watch. She follows him down a hole and finds herself in a hall of many doors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEgsAWaOC1Emw8eCd2ckKS23uZg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41278'),
  ('682479088194739935', 'Alice in Wonderland', 1933, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Norman Z. McLeod, Bert Glennon, Henry Sharp', 'Joseph L. Mankiewicz, William Cameron Menzies', 'Charlotte Henry, Richard Arlen, Roscoe Ates, William Austin, Gary Cooper, Leon Errol, Louise Fazenda, W.C. Fields', 'NR', 'In Victorian England, a bored young girl dreams that she has entered a fantasy world called Wonderland, populated by even more fantastic characters.', 'In Victorian England, a bored young girl dreams that she has entered a fantasy world called Wonderland, populated by even more fantastic characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4hlsqfhEtTrEtiDE647qxTR6PI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25694'),
  ('932094007917809388', 'Alice in Wonderland', 1949, 'Music, Family, Fantasy, Animation', 'Dallas Bower, Lou Bunin, Marc Maurette', 'Henry Myers, Albert E. Lewin, Edward Eliscu', 'Stephen Murray, Ernest Milton, Pamela Brown, Felix Aylmer, Joyce Grenfell, Carol Marsh, Raymond Bussières, David Reed', null, 'This exceptional theatrical version of Lewis Carroll''s 1865 classic features a combination of live characters and puppets.', 'This exceptional theatrical version of Lewis Carroll''s 1865 classic features a combination of live characters and puppets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXcHOl6MmhOkJO64wNrNDnpp86m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150535'),
  ('70644516703998136', 'Alice in Wonderland', 1951, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Clyde Geronimi, Wilfred Jackson, Hamilton Luske', null, 'Kathryn Beaumont, Ed Wynn, Richard Haydn, Sterling Holloway, Jerry Colonna, Verna Felton, J. Pat O''Malley, Bill Thompson', 'G', 'On a golden afternoon, wildly curious young Alice tumbles into the burrow and enters the merry, madcap world of Wonderland full of whimsical escapades.', 'On a golden afternoon, wildly curious young Alice tumbles into the burrow and enters the merry, madcap world of Wonderland full of whimsical escapades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20cvfwfaFqNbe9Fc3VEHJuPRxmn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12092'),
  ('750129096078348159', 'Alice in Wonderland', 1966, 'Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Jonathan Miller, Tony Palmer, Sheila Lally', null, 'Anne-Marie Mallik, Freda Dowie, Jo Maxwell Muller, Wilfrid Brambell, Alan Bennett, Finlay Currie, Geoffrey Dunn, Mark Allington', null, 'Alice in Wonderland (1966) is a BBC television play based on Alice''s Adventures in Wonderland by Lewis Carroll. It was directed by Jonathan Miller, then most widely known for his appearance in the long-running satirical revue Beyond the Fringe.', 'Alice in Wonderland (1966) is a BBC television play based on Alice''s Adventures in Wonderland by Lewis Carroll. It was directed by Jonathan Miller, then most widely known for his appearance in the long-running satirical revue Beyond the Fringe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeT2KNow160hdhV3WgbOhPkiqH6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35109'),
  ('594838470289806101', 'Alice in Wonderland', 1981, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Izrail Moizhes, Oleksandr Mukhin, Yefrem Pruzhanskyi', 'Yevhen Zahdanskyi', 'Marina Neyolova, Heorhii Kyshko, Vyacheslav Nevinnyy, Yevhen Papernyi, Rostislav Plyatt, Aleksandr Shirvindt, Tatyana Vasileva, Rina Zelyonaya', null, 'Alice follows the white rabbit, falls down a deep hole and discovers a strange Wonderland at the bottom.', 'Alice follows the white rabbit, falls down a deep hole and discovers a strange Wonderland at the bottom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6W3BzlwKhauMZTEGrQFFr8uwYr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84774'),
  ('589748294502276306', 'Alice in Wonderland', 1988, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Richard Trueblood', 'Paul Leadon', 'Olivia Martin, Phillip Hinton, Paul Johnstone, Moya O''Sullivan, Keith Scott', null, 'It''s a whimsical romp through Wonderland when Alice falls down the rabbit hole and finds herself in a strange land filled with a fabulous menagerie of curious characters.', 'It''s a whimsical romp through Wonderland when Alice falls down the rabbit hole and finds herself in a strange land filled with a fabulous menagerie of curious characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4p0IpXValcKpML006Zp4oM6pX6Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114364'),
  ('951085022984140409', 'Alice in Wonderland', 1995, 'Animation, Family', 'Richard Trueblood, Toshiyuki Hiruma, Takashi Masunaga', 'Lewis Carroll', 'Bailee Reid, Ian James Corlett, Michael Donovan, Lillian Carlson, Tony Ail, Nathan Aswell, Kathleen Barr, Garry Chalk', null, 'A girl follows a rabbit into a magical world.', 'A girl follows a rabbit into a magical world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/anyYmXXEQz4VioZzCRKM9OEIOQd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210075'),
  ('202502582442012228', 'Alice in Wonderland', 1999, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Nick Willing, Giles Nuttgens, Alan Tomkins', null, 'Tina Majorino, Robbie Coltrane, Ben Kingsley, Miranda Richardson, Martin Short, Christopher Lloyd, Gene Wilder, Whoopi Goldberg', 'PG', 'Alice follows a white rabbit down a rabbit-hole into a whimsical Wonderland, where she meets characters like the delightful Cheshire Cat, the clumsy White Knight, a rude caterpillar, and the hot-tempered Queen of Hearts and can grow ten feet tall or shrink to three inches. But will she ever be able to return home?', 'Alice follows a white rabbit down a rabbit-hole into a whimsical Wonderland, where she meets characters like the delightful Cheshire Cat, the clumsy White Knight, a rude caterpillar, and the hot-tempered Queen of Hearts and can grow ten feet tall or shrink to three inches. But will she ever be able to return home?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpXmXjqeyuSYCtNuGMytWQLdKX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30923'),
  ('920803542255509609', 'Alice in Wonderland', 2010, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Tim Burton, Dariusz Wolski, Katterli Frauenfelder', 'Linda Woolverton', 'Mia Wasikowska, Johnny Depp, Anne Hathaway, Helena Bonham Carter, Crispin Glover, Matt Lucas, Alan Rickman, Stephen Fry', null, 'Alice, now 19 years old, returns to the whimsical world she first entered as a child and embarks on a journey to discover her true destiny.', 'Alice, now 19 years old, returns to the whimsical world she first entered as a child and embarks on a journey to discover her true destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0kre9wRCZz3jjSjaru7QU0UtFz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12155'),
  ('1008204016892402798', 'Alice Júnior', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Gil Baroni, Renato Ogata, Adriel Nizer', 'Luiz Bertazzo, Adriel Nizer', 'Anne Celestino, Emmanuel Rosset, Thaís Schier, Surya Amitrano, Matheus Moura, Katia Horn, Igor Augustho, Marcel Szymanski', null, 'This is the story of Alice Junior, a transgender girl full of life, who wants to give her first kiss, but first, she just wants to be who she really is.', 'This is the story of Alice Junior, a transgender girl full of life, who wants to give her first kiss, but first, she just wants to be who she really is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5eiFLJcDAgr1xp3eZuXJiBn1cvj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:619154'),
  ('62424600982365055', 'Alice Loses Out', 1925, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Margie Gay', null, 'A rich garbage magnate Ima Hawg is being driven by his chauffeur to a hotel run by Alice and her cat Julius. The hotel has seen better times, and so the two are thrilled when they see the limousine roll up. Hawg demands a barber and a manicurist, and Julius feels he''s up to the job. He does his best to please the grouch, with mixed results.', 'A rich garbage magnate Ima Hawg is being driven by his chauffeur to a hotel run by Alice and her cat Julius. The hotel has seen better times, and so the two are thrilled when they see the limousine roll up. Hawg demands a barber and a manicurist, and Julius feels he''s up to the job. He does his best to please the grouch, with mixed results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqRhuZZBs7Fm2LjaOYlbk0aRULq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38589'),
  ('217552086168136140', 'Alice of Wonderland in Paris', 1966, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Gene Deitch', 'Gene Deitch', 'Luce Ennis, Norma MacMillan, Howard Morris, Carl Reiner, Trinka Snyder, Allen Swift, Lionel G. Wilson', null, 'Alice travels to Paris and hears five stories adapted from children''s picture books in this anthology film. The books adapted include: "Anatole," "Madeline and the Bad Hat," "The Frowning Prince," "Many Moons," and "Madeline and the Gypsies."', 'Alice travels to Paris and hears five stories adapted from children''s picture books in this anthology film. The books adapted include: "Anatole," "Madeline and the Bad Hat," "The Frowning Prince," "Many Moons," and "Madeline and the Gypsies."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8uvV5jqLmhF1wdC9s35mDoQIYfS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234305'),
  ('818494820343588866', 'Alice or the Last Escapade', 1977, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Claude Chabrol, Jean Rabier', 'Claude Chabrol', 'Sylvia Kristel, Charles Vanel, Jean Carmet, Fernand Ledoux, François Perrot, Bernard Rousselet, Thomas Chabrol, André Dussollier', null, 'One night Alice can''t stand her husband anymore and she decides to leave him. It''s a dark, rainy night and something smashes the windshield so Alice is forced to seek shelter in an old mansion. She is warmly welcomed but soon realises that strange things are happening. She tries to escape but it seems there''s no way out.', 'One night Alice can''t stand her husband anymore and she decides to leave him. It''s a dark, rainy night and something smashes the windshield so Alice is forced to seek shelter in an old mansion. She is warmly welcomed but soon realises that strange things are happening. She tries to escape but it seems there''s no way out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x47T7a9AR6J8OUmcbIQx1ZbtbQa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32722'),
  ('280707367663549029', 'Alice Solves the Puzzle', 1925, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Margie Gay', null, 'Alice and Julius are playing on the seashore when Pete comes around, gets Julius drunk and tries to steal a crossword puzzle from Alice. Julius has to sober up to come to the rescue.', 'Alice and Julius are playing on the seashore when Pete comes around, gets Julius drunk and tries to steal a crossword puzzle from Alice. Julius has to sober up to come to the rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8kHgVnXTqph0QlLtPiTcVeqeTw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35808'),
  ('912358494481375914', 'Alice The Musical', 2023, 'Fantasy, Music', 'Serdar Biliş', 'Aylin Alıveren, Murat Uyurkulak', 'Serenay Sarıkaya, Ezgi Mola, Enis Arıkan, Şükrü Özyıldız, İbrahim Selim, Merve Dizdar, Ecrin Su Çoban', null, 'Feeling stuck in her life, Alice follows the call of a mobile app and plots into a virtual world by following the white rabbit. She finds herself in a fantastic world while she searching for answers to the “Who am I?”. Alice will test her courage in this new universe with her imagination and fears.', 'Feeling stuck in her life, Alice follows the call of a mobile app and plots into a virtual world by following the white rabbit. She finds herself in a fantastic world while she searching for answers to the “Who am I?”. Alice will test her courage in this new universe with her imagination and fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGF5AaBqUckyElDGtHuWYikhgMq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1056234'),
  ('197771167634465656', 'Alice the Toreador', 1925, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Virginia Davis', null, 'Alice is in a bullfight where she thinks she will win since she is matched against a peaceful bull. But the tables are turned when her bull is switched with one with a worse temper.', 'Alice is in a bullfight where she thinks she will win since she is matched against a peaceful bull. But the tables are turned when her bull is switched with one with a worse temper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGTYr8z5Gu2cEwi2BDxWg0tOUZh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32953'),
  ('423328449465249879', 'Alice the Whaler', 1927, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Lois Hardwick', null, 'Alice is dancing aboard her ship with a veritable zoo of a crew. Meanwhile, in the galley, the chef (a cat) is preparing food while his assistant, a mouse, is peeling potatoes. When the chef complains that they need eggs, the mouse is enlisted to retrieve them from the crow''s nest. The birds there give him a rough time, but he''s eventually able to capture one and strong-arm three eggs out of it. When he returns, though, he finds the chef now wants some milk, and so he''s off to find the ship''s goat, with similar comedic results.', 'Alice is dancing aboard her ship with a veritable zoo of a crew. Meanwhile, in the galley, the chef (a cat) is preparing food while his assistant, a mouse, is peeling potatoes. When the chef complains that they need eggs, the mouse is enlisted to retrieve them from the crow''s nest. The birds there give him a rough time, but he''s eventually able to capture one and strong-arm three eggs out of it. When he returns, though, he finds the chef now wants some milk, and so he''s off to find the ship''s goat, with similar comedic results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aufllhnWw2I7Gt7dHPl0Z6t0dwr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41111'),
  ('977525647314569325', 'Alice Through the Looking Glass', 1982, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Oleksandr Mukhin, Izrail Moizhes, Yefrem Pruzhanskyi', 'Yevhen Zahdanskyi', 'Marina Neyolova, Rostislav Plyatt, Mikhail Svetin, Aleksandr Burmistrov, Yevhen Papernyi, Heorhii Kyshko, Liya Akhedzhakova, Tatyana Vasileva', null, 'The second adventure of Alice who steps through the looking glass and finds herself in a wonderful mirror land populated by chess figures and weird creatures.', 'The second adventure of Alice who steps through the looking glass and finds herself in a wonderful mirror land populated by chess figures and weird creatures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2rHPFocgwC6Cid1aO8cLven2Ju.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198916'),
  ('686413133067864756', 'Alice Through the Looking Glass', 1987, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure, Music', 'Ryszard Słapczyński, Andrea Bresciani', 'Jameson Brewer', 'Janet Waldo, Phyllis Diller, Mr. T, Jonathan Winters, Booker Bradshaw, Townsend Coleman, Clive Revill, Hal Smith', null, 'Young Alice returns to Wonderland and is on her way to be crowned Queen, but she must dare to cross Chessland first. On her exciting journey, she encounters a magical jester, the feared Jabberwocky, Humpty Dumpty, Tiger Lily, and Tweedledum and Tweedledee.', 'Young Alice returns to Wonderland and is on her way to be crowned Queen, but she must dare to cross Chessland first. On her exciting journey, she encounters a magical jester, the feared Jabberwocky, Humpty Dumpty, Tiger Lily, and Tweedledum and Tweedledee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcQoHqDGCTn8QS8FSb0CARHyDGG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176462'),
  ('471007896239548529', 'Alice Through the Looking Glass', 1998, 'Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'John Henderson, Tim Lewis, John Ignatius', 'Nick Vivian', 'Kate Beckinsale, Geoffrey Palmer, Ian Holm, Steve Coogan, Penelope Wilton, Charlotte Curley, Louise J. Taylor, Rebecca Palmer', null, 'A modern adaptation of the classic children''s story ''Alice through the Looking Glass'', which continued on from the popular ''Alice in Wonderland'' story. This time Alice is played by the mother, who falls asleep while reading the the bedtime story to her daughter. Walking through the Looking Glass, Alice finds herself in Chessland, a magical and fun world. There she meets the Red and White Queens, as well as many other amusing friends on her journey across the chessboard countryside onto become a crowned queen.', 'A modern adaptation of the classic children''s story ''Alice through the Looking Glass'', which continued on from the popular ''Alice in Wonderland'' story. This time Alice is played by the mother, who falls asleep while reading the the bedtime story to her daughter. Walking through the Looking Glass, Alice finds herself in Chessland, a magical and fun world. There she meets the Red and White Queens, as well as many other amusing friends on her journey across the chessboard countryside onto become a crowned queen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpFhYi64PE3vKJVvN3ZxqZFcfBl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15162'),
  ('690890250267876563', 'Alice Through the Looking Glass', 2016, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy', 'James Bobin, Stuart Dryburgh, Denise Ball', 'Linda Woolverton', 'Mia Wasikowska, Johnny Depp, Anne Hathaway, Helena Bonham Carter, Sacha Baron Cohen, Matt Lucas, Alan Rickman, Stephen Fry', 'PG', 'Alice Kingsleigh returns to Underland and faces a new adventure in saving the Mad Hatter.', 'Alice Kingsleigh returns to Underland and faces a new adventure in saving the Mad Hatter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbGamUkYfgKIYIrU8kW5oc0NatZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241259'),
  ('771898755642238139', 'Alice Upside Down', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Romance', 'Sandy Tung', 'Meghan Heritage, Sandy Tung', 'Alyson Stoner, Lucas Grabeel, Ashley Eckstein, Dylan McLaughlin, Parker McKenna Posey, Bridgit Mendler, Ann Dowd, Boris Kodjoe', null, 'Still mourning the death of her mother a few years back, Alice McKinley finds her life seriously disrupted when her father Ben buys a store and moves her and her older brother Lester to a new town.', 'Still mourning the death of her mother a few years back, Alice McKinley finds her life seriously disrupted when her father Ben buys a store and moves her and her older brother Lester to a new town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QNYxepooPEhC3CpGYVPXZzIMtG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49162'),
  ('488157913211881427', 'Alice, Darling', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama, Romance', 'Caoimhe Clancy, Jeremy Doiron, Mary Nighy', 'Alanna Francis', 'Anna Kendrick, Wunmi Mosaku, Kaniehtiio Horn, Charlie Carrick, Markjan Winnick, Daniel Stolfi, Carolyn Fe, Gordon Harper', 'R', 'Pushed to the breaking point by Simon, her psychologically abusive boyfriend, Alice becomes an unwitting participant in an intervention staged by her two closest friends while on vacation. As she rediscovers the essence of herself and gains some much-needed perspective, she slowly starts to fray the cords of codependency that bind her. However, Simon''s vengeance is as inevitable as it is shattering, and once unleashed, it tests her strength, her courage, and the bonds of deep-rooted friendships.', 'Pushed to the breaking point by Simon, her psychologically abusive boyfriend, Alice becomes an unwitting participant in an intervention staged by her two closest friends while on vacation. As she rediscovers the essence of herself and gains some much-needed perspective, she slowly starts to fray the cords of codependency that bind her. However, Simon''s vengeance is as inevitable as it is shattering, and once unleashed, it tests her strength, her courage, and the bonds of deep-rooted friendships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QpO7dxLXBdPgWpNLKvRNojz7bv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:850028'),
  ('1041640181132388286', 'Alice, Sweet Alice', 1976, 'Horror, Mystery, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Alfred Sole, Adrienne Hamalian-Mangine, Chuck Hall', 'Rosemary Ritvo, Alfred Sole', 'Linda Miller, Mildred Clinton, Paula E. Sheppard, Niles McMaster, Jane Lowry, Rudolph Willrich, Michael Hardstark, Alphonso DeNoble', 'R', 'Alice is a withdrawn 12-year-old who lives with her mother and her younger sister, Karen, who gets most of the attention from her mother, leaving Alice out of the spotlight. When Karen is found brutally murdered in a church, suspicions start to turn toward Alice. But could a 12-year-old girl really be capable of such savagery?', 'Alice is a withdrawn 12-year-old who lives with her mother and her younger sister, Karen, who gets most of the attention from her mother, leaving Alice out of the spotlight. When Karen is found brutally murdered in a church, suspicions start to turn toward Alice. But could a 12-year-old girl really be capable of such savagery?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izawwwy80RH7U7YKkdV1OpdPohZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23761'),
  ('107530256706662204', 'Alice: Boy from Wonderland', 2015, 'Horror, Fantasy, Romance', 'Huh Eun-hee', 'Huh Eun-hee', 'Hong Jong-hyun, Jung So-min, Jeong Yeon-joo, Park Hyun-suk, Lee Seung-yun, Seo Gap-suk, Jang Seo-won, Lee Go-eun', null, 'Hye-Joong (Jung So-Min) can''t remember anything before the age of 4. Every night she experiences terrible nightmares. Unable to cope with the nightmares anymore, she heeds the advice of a shaman and goes back to the villa where her family stayed 24 years ago. The villa is now known as "Wonderland." There, she meets Hwan (Hong Jong-Hyun), Soo-Ryun (Jung Yeon-Joo) and a white rabbit. During the next 15 days, Hye-Joong has to find something that is missing. If she succeeds her nightmares will stop.', 'Hye-Joong (Jung So-Min) can''t remember anything before the age of 4. Every night she experiences terrible nightmares. Unable to cope with the nightmares anymore, she heeds the advice of a shaman and goes back to the villa where her family stayed 24 years ago. The villa is now known as "Wonderland." There, she meets Hwan (Hong Jong-Hyun), Soo-Ryun (Jung Yeon-Joo) and a white rabbit. During the next 15 days, Hye-Joong has to find something that is missing. If she succeeds her nightmares will stop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XyaWZPowuDRbFo9q29Lg4YLdhG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:373944'),
  ('605835973213801637', 'Alice''s Adventures in Wonderland', 1972, 'Family, Fantasy, Music', 'William Sterling, Geoffrey Unsworth', 'William Sterling', 'Fiona Fullerton, Michael Crawford, Robert Helpmann, Peter Sellers, Spike Milligan, Michael Jayston, Hywel Bennett, Davy Kaye', null, 'An all-star cast highlights this vibrant musical adaptation of Lewis Carroll''s immortal tale. One day, plucky young Alice follows a white rabbit down a hole and discovers a world of bizarre characters.', 'An all-star cast highlights this vibrant musical adaptation of Lewis Carroll''s immortal tale. One day, plucky young Alice follows a white rabbit down a hole and discovers a world of bizarre characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GaiN6EjIlY6wiPynV5XAG1mCrX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34461'),
  ('157629829278714210', 'Alice''s Balloon Race', 1926, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Margie Gay', null, 'Alice and Julius, as a team, are one of four entrants in a $10,000 balloon race. The bad guy takes out one balloon quickly. It''s not clear what kind of balloons these are, since they are sealed like hydrogen/helium balloons, but a good thwack on the top by the bad guy sends Alice and Julius plummeting to the ground, balloon still intact. Julius makes some attempts to re-launch, but they fail. He spots a hippo, smoking nearby, and has an idea: using some pepper, he creates a massive sneeze that re-launches them. But he wasn''t onboard. Alice throws down a rope ladder, but it isn''t anchored; Julius eventually pulls himself up with a rope. They are then immediately under attack by a lightning storm, which deflates the balloon. Julius makes substitutes from, first, a weiner dog and a couple of empty thought balloons, then, an elephant with extra air pumped in. He grabs a passing bird and catches up to the bad guy, then finds himself in another battle with lightning.', 'Alice and Julius, as a team, are one of four entrants in a $10,000 balloon race. The bad guy takes out one balloon quickly. It''s not clear what kind of balloons these are, since they are sealed like hydrogen/helium balloons, but a good thwack on the top by the bad guy sends Alice and Julius plummeting to the ground, balloon still intact. Julius makes some attempts to re-launch, but they fail. He spots a hippo, smoking nearby, and has an idea: using some pepper, he creates a massive sneeze that re-launches them. But he wasn''t onboard. Alice throws down a rope ladder, but it isn''t anchored; Julius eventually pulls himself up with a rope. They are then immediately under attack by a lightning storm, which deflates the balloon. Julius makes substitutes from, first, a weiner dog and a couple of empty thought balloons, then, an elephant with extra air pumped in. He grabs a passing bird and catches up to the bad guy, then finds himself in another battle with lightning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s750QMC6TUVtS1LDqqLbk0O84dp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40781'),
  ('1009565030671263123', 'Alice''s Day at Sea', 1924, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Virginia Davis', null, 'Alice''s trip to the sea inspires her to dream of a visit to an animated underwater world.', 'Alice''s trip to the sea inspires her to dream of a visit to an animated underwater world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18FdaFQowADAEiU0puh1K4fzAeF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106114'),
  ('926184515099438760', 'Alice''s Egg Plant', 1925, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Anne Shirley', null, 'Julius, the boss of Alice''s chicken farm, has to find a way to deliver 5000 eggs to Sinkem and Soakem when the hens go on strike.', 'Julius, the boss of Alice''s chicken farm, has to find a way to deliver 5000 eggs to Sinkem and Soakem when the hens go on strike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iaOt4tl8J45IAuF0obocPvVl0De.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35819'),
  ('316923396796170720', 'Alice''s Fishy Story', 1924, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Virginia Davis, Walt Disney, Spec O''Donnell, Tommy Hicks, Leon Holmes', null, 'Alice wants desperately to get out of practicing her piano so she can go have fun with her friends. She tricks her mother into thinking she''s still playing by getting her dog to play for her, and then she and the gang hitch a ride to the local pond where they spend their time fishing. While there, she envisions what it would be like to go fishing at the North Pole.', 'Alice wants desperately to get out of practicing her piano so she can go have fun with her friends. She tricks her mother into thinking she''s still playing by getting her dog to play for her, and then she and the gang hitch a ride to the local pond where they spend their time fishing. While there, she envisions what it would be like to go fishing at the North Pole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNKqcmqfUJJoJn8f8h2enRaOVpH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176437'),
  ('888295581797569638', 'Alice''s House', 2007, 'Drama', 'Chico Teixeira', 'Chico Teixeira', 'Carla Ribas, Berta Zemel, Vinicius Zinn, Ricardo Vilaça, Felipe Massuia, Zécarlos Machado, Renata Zhaneta, Luciano Quirino', null, 'Alice, married for the last 20 years to a taxi driver, works in a beauty parlour, has three children, the eldest of whom is doing his military service, and a mother who works as a maid in her house. None of the three siblings pay much attention to their mother, and they treat their grandmother with lack of respect. Alice''s life in the female working world contrasts strongly with the powerful masculine presence in her home. Although she''s a good girl, the chance to betray uncovers other betrayals she didn''t know existed.', 'Alice, married for the last 20 years to a taxi driver, works in a beauty parlour, has three children, the eldest of whom is doing his military service, and a mother who works as a maid in her house. None of the three siblings pay much attention to their mother, and they treat their grandmother with lack of respect. Alice''s life in the female working world contrasts strongly with the powerful masculine presence in her home. Although she''s a good girl, the chance to betray uncovers other betrayals she didn''t know existed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2t8pCgcgA04iYkyisPLVzlemMc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81923'),
  ('576215406708228876', 'Alice''s Mysterious Mystery', 1926, 'Animation, Comedy, Horror, Mystery', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Margie Gay', null, 'A mouse and his boss pose as dogcatchers and grab a schoolhouse full of dogs; they use several other ruses to round up dogs for, as we discover, a sausage factory. Alice and Julius are on the trail soon after the first caper, but it takes them a while to catch up with the bad guys. They do, and Julius tricks the big boss into getting clobbered by the sausage guy, then turns the dogs loose on him.', 'A mouse and his boss pose as dogcatchers and grab a schoolhouse full of dogs; they use several other ruses to round up dogs for, as we discover, a sausage factory. Alice and Julius are on the trail soon after the first caper, but it takes them a while to catch up with the bad guys. They do, and Julius tricks the big boss into getting clobbered by the sausage guy, then turns the dogs loose on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w75ziq42LX3lvw9jeyQ2JgYUxgA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40788'),
  ('972052369620379040', 'Alice''s Odyssey', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Denise Filiatrault', 'Pierre Poirier, Sylvie Lussier', 'Sophie Lorain, Martin Drainville, Pierrette Robitaille, Marc Labrèche, Mitsou Gélinas, Danielle Ouimet, Marc Béland, Pascale Desrochers', null, 'After reading a bedtime story to her daughter, Alice Tremblay leaves her daughter''s room and enters her own fairytale.', 'After reading a bedtime story to her daughter, Alice Tremblay leaves her daughter''s room and enters her own fairytale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KrIHRYOtMz4q279mkqXsqOkjja.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69882'),
  ('505332053020724728', 'Alice''s Restaurant', 1969, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Arthur Penn, Fred Hellerman, Michael Nebbia', 'Arthur Penn, Venable Herndon', 'Arlo Guthrie, Patricia Quinn, James Broderick, Tina Chen, Geoff Outlaw, Michael McClanathan, Pete Seeger, Lee Hays', 'R', 'After getting kicked out of college, Arlo decides to visit his friend Alice for Thanksgiving dinner. After dinner is over, Arlo volunteers to take the trash to the dump but finds it closed for the holiday, so he dumps the trash in the bottom of a ravine. This act of littering gets him arrested and sends him on a bizarre journey.', 'After getting kicked out of college, Arlo decides to visit his friend Alice for Thanksgiving dinner. After dinner is over, Arlo volunteers to take the trash to the dump but finds it closed for the holiday, so he dumps the trash in the bottom of a ravine. This act of littering gets him arrested and sends him on a bizarre journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3xifcmDpyuYfrm1tHuACBaLjlZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5638'),
  ('529941331183122182', 'Alice''s Spooky Adventure', 1924, 'Comedy, Animation, Horror', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Virginia Davis', null, 'When a ball is accidentally knocked through the window of a neighbourhood haunted house, Alice is the only one brave enough to go inside to retrieve it. While she''s in there she falls and bumps her head, sending her to a cartoon dream-world in which she rescues a cat and battles some spirits in a ghost town.', 'When a ball is accidentally knocked through the window of a neighbourhood haunted house, Alice is the only one brave enough to go inside to retrieve it. While she''s in there she falls and bumps her head, sending her to a cartoon dream-world in which she rescues a cat and battles some spirits in a ghost town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kN8sklBshPorq3I9Zx7KhqQIZXQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176441'),
  ('621185996824067247', 'Alice''s Tin Pony', 1925, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Margie Gay', 'G', 'Alice and Julius are driving a train, which is carrying a large payroll. Pete the Bear and his gang find out about it and devise a plan to rob the train.', 'Alice and Julius are driving a train, which is carrying a large payroll. Pete the Bear and his gang find out about it and devise a plan to rob the train.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krUC1fC2I1IJ5POltZ1kPPonhpW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37568'),
  ('494826928790996247', 'Alice''s Wild West Show', 1924, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Virginia Davis, Tommy Hicks', null, 'Alice and her friends put on a show.', 'Alice and her friends put on a show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOWF68vQYploTuHsnnzJGWZrL5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151428'),
  ('994240857176220611', 'Alice''s Wonderland', 1923, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', 'Walt Disney', 'Virginia Davis, Walt Disney, Hugh Harman, Rudolf Ising, Ub Iwerks, Margaret Davis', null, 'Instead of Wonderland, Alice visits the Walt Disney animation room.', 'Instead of Wonderland, Alice visits the Walt Disney animation room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cq9jtWGfQMMQCixuHN9BZ7yEfKB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146730'),
  ('1061650941063995518', 'Alicia', 1994, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Jaume Balagueró', 'Jaume Balagueró', 'Danae, Ana Luna, Elena Luna', null, 'After her first menstruation, Alicia is kidnapped and led by fly-men into a surreal and dirty underworld ruled by a disgusting being.', 'After her first menstruation, Alicia is kidnapped and led by fly-men into a surreal and dirty underworld ruled by a disgusting being.', null, 'tmdb:movie:166092'),
  ('50823654103373789', 'Alicia en el país de las maravillas', 1976, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Family, Animation', 'Eduardo Plá', 'Eduardo Plá', 'Mónica von Reust, Carlos Lorca, Marta Serrano, Ricardo Bouzas, Evelyn Rodríguez, Nano Gruberg, Ruben Fraga, Tina Write', null, 'When young Alice sees a man who looks like a rabbit claiming that he is late, she follows him and stumbles into a bizarre, strange world as cryptic as the 1970s Argentina she left. English Title: Alice in Wonderland', 'When young Alice sees a man who looks like a rabbit claiming that he is late, she follows him and stumbles into a bizarre, strange world as cryptic as the 1970s Argentina she left. English Title: Alice in Wonderland', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCr9Ui8DPh9jqtB0GFRdj3HzTIw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396929'),
  ('823289235902539419', 'Alien', 1979, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Ridley Scott, Derek Vanlint, Jonathan Amberston', 'Dan O''Bannon', 'Tom Skerritt, Sigourney Weaver, Veronica Cartwright, Harry Dean Stanton, John Hurt, Ian Holm, Yaphet Kotto, Bolaji Badejo', 'R', 'During its return to the earth, commercial spaceship Nostromo intercepts a distress signal from a distant planet. When a three-member team of the crew discovers a chamber containing thousands of eggs on the planet, a creature inside one of the eggs attacks an explorer. The entire crew is unaware of the impending nightmare set to descend upon them when the alien parasite planted inside its unfortunate host is birthed.', 'During its return to the earth, commercial spaceship Nostromo intercepts a distress signal from a distant planet. When a three-member team of the crew discovers a chamber containing thousands of eggs on the planet, a creature inside one of the eggs attacks an explorer. The entire crew is unaware of the impending nightmare set to descend upon them when the alien parasite planted inside its unfortunate host is birthed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfrQk5IPloGg1v9Rzbh2Eg3VGyM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348'),
  ('971601764857009323', 'Alien 2: On Earth', 1980, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Biagio Proietti, Ciro Ippolito, Silvio Fraschetti', 'Ciro Ippolito', 'Belinda Mayne, Mark Bodin, Michele Soavi, Benedetta Fantoli, Roberto Barrese, Judy Perrin, Danilo Micheli, Ciro Ippolito', null, 'A group of cave explorers are confronted in an underground cavern by a mysterious living rock. Little do they know that it bears home to deadly, flesh-eating creatures, intent on wiping out the entire human population. An ultra low-budget, unofficial and unauthorized sequel to the 1979 film Alien, although the plot has little connection to the original film.', 'A group of cave explorers are confronted in an underground cavern by a mysterious living rock. Little do they know that it bears home to deadly, flesh-eating creatures, intent on wiping out the entire human population. An ultra low-budget, unofficial and unauthorized sequel to the 1979 film Alien, although the plot has little connection to the original film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LLfieDmGmfQ0PTJfNIaLR2y69C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42872'),
  ('1112143707313979173', 'Alien Abduction', 2005, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Eric Forsberg', 'Eric Forsberg', 'Megan Lee Ethridge, Griff Furst, Marissa Morse, Patrick Thomassie, Jilon VanOver, Bobby James, Claudia Katz Minnick, Edwin Craig', null, 'After being abducted by extraterrestrials, Jean and her friends are committed to a top secret government-run mental institution to undergo tests and be brainwashed.', 'After being abducted by extraterrestrials, Jean and her friends are committed to a top secret government-run mental institution to undergo tests and be brainwashed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGlzXMQcEoxsvVdw5FC86UkOVzp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172002'),
  ('831293890148917492', 'Alien Abduction', 2014, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Matty Beckerman, Luke Geissbühler, Joel Jeffrey Nishimine', 'Robert Alvin Lewis', 'Katherine Sigismund, Corey Eid, Riley Polanski, Jillian Clare, Jeff Bowser, Peter Holden, Walter Phelan, Kelley Hinman', 'NR', 'A vacationing family encounters an alien threat in this pulse-pounding thriller based on the real-life Brown Mountain Lights phenomenon in North Carolina.', 'A vacationing family encounters an alien threat in this pulse-pounding thriller based on the real-life Brown Mountain Lights phenomenon in North Carolina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4Ny82lizNTdTH2MFLjjyOVDWtk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258193'),
  ('1020456589772204883', 'Alien Abduction: Incident in Lake County', 1998, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Dean Alioto', 'Paul Chitlik, Dean Alioto', 'Benz Antoine, Kristian Ayre, Gillian Barber, Michael Buie, Emmanuelle Chriqui, Marya Delver, Katlyn Alexandra Ducharme, Ingrid Kavelaars', null, 'After a mysterious blackout, a son goes out to investigate and captures footage of actual aliens. When the aliens follow he and his brothers back to their home all hell breaks lose.', 'After a mysterious blackout, a son goes out to investigate and captures footage of actual aliens. When the aliens follow he and his brothers back to their home all hell breaks lose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ix6kUUS6UkbzzTb3gVzHk9QcNxY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20182'),
  ('1012088606057140549', 'Alien Agent', 2007, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Jesse V. Johnson, C. Kim Miles, Greg Fawcett', 'Vlady Pildysh', 'Mark Dacascos, Amelia Cooke, Emma Lahana, Kim Coates, Billy Zane, Dominique Vandenberg, Jim Shield, John Tench', 'R', 'A lawman from another galaxy must stop an invading force from building a gateway to planet Earth.', 'A lawman from another galaxy must stop an invading force from building a gateway to planet Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdgI2z1waA5NFVtv373AhzPOKaF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19279'),
  ('557670556510184122', 'Alien Apocalypse', 2005, 'Drama, Horror, Comedy, Thriller, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Josh Becker', 'Josh Becker', 'Bruce Campbell, Renée O''Connor, Michael Cory Davis, Peter Jason, Neda Sokolovska, Vladimir Kolev, Remington Franklin, Valentin Giasbeily', null, 'An astronaut doctor Ivan Hood and his fellow astronaut Kelly return from their mission in space to find the world has been taken over by aliens. Now Dr. Ivan Hood and Kelly must lead a revolution to free the human slaves from their alien masters.', 'An astronaut doctor Ivan Hood and his fellow astronaut Kelly return from their mission in space to find the world has been taken over by aliens. Now Dr. Ivan Hood and Kelly must lead a revolution to free the human slaves from their alien masters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMCLTS7tjfzYpd6JAiLYs07ZLd1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14907'),
  ('1114618093674142515', 'Alien Arsenal', 1998, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'David DeCoteau, Howard Wexler, Steven Buhai', 'Matthew Jason Walsh', 'Josh Hammond, Riley Smith, Chris Olivero, Dominic Catrambone, Kovács Krisztián, Robert Donavan, Danielle Hoover, Michele Nordin', 'PG-13', 'Alien Arsenal, also released as Alien Weapons, tells the story of two teenage misfits, Ralph and Baxter, who accidentally discover a bizarre vault full of alien weaponry and body armor in the basement of their high school, with which they harness the power to transform from super geeks...to superheroes. Unfortunately, their discovery signals the arsenal''s alien owners who have returned to Earth to reclaim the deadly cache...and destroy the planet!', 'Alien Arsenal, also released as Alien Weapons, tells the story of two teenage misfits, Ralph and Baxter, who accidentally discover a bizarre vault full of alien weaponry and body armor in the basement of their high school, with which they harness the power to transform from super geeks...to superheroes. Unfortunately, their discovery signals the arsenal''s alien owners who have returned to Earth to reclaim the deadly cache...and destroy the planet!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujmTFuBKl6eFt9nlQzfgRQiKgjC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30936'),
  ('530642305935630277', 'Alien Autopsy', 2006, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Simon Chaudoir, Jonny Campbell', 'William Davies', 'Declan Donnelly, Anthony McPartlin, Bill Pullman, Götz Otto, Morwenna Banks, Omid Djalili, Harry Dean Stanton, Mike Blakeley', 'PG-13', 'Humouristic reconstruction of the 1995 scandal when two British lads were accused of having faked a documentary from the Roswell incident in 1947.', 'Humouristic reconstruction of the 1995 scandal when two British lads were accused of having faked a documentary from the Roswell incident in 1947.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFQ23icWVfFIONdyedlfutZHijo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9773'),
  ('512992664087549832', 'Alien Autopsy: (Fact or Fiction?)', 1995, 'Documentary, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Tom McGough', 'Tom Seligson, Robert Kiviat', 'Jonathan Frakes, Stan Winston, Allen Daviau', 'NR', 'This provacative FOX Network "prime time" television special investigates the purported "Alien Autopsy" footage that was allegedly filmed by the United States military after the legendary UFO crash near Roswell, New Mexico in 1947.', 'This provacative FOX Network "prime time" television special investigates the purported "Alien Autopsy" footage that was allegedly filmed by the United States military after the legendary UFO crash near Roswell, New Mexico in 1947.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k62M23OzQt4qATi1o5FhmjZRX8i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141490'),
  ('290695903657893493', 'Alien Cargo', 1999, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Mark Haber, John Stokes', 'Carla Jean Wagner', 'Jason London, Alan Dale, Missy Crider, Simon Westaway, Elizabeth Alexander, Warwick Young, Kevin Copeland, Diana Glenn', null, 'After eight months of hyper-sleep, when Christopher ''Chris'' McNiel (Jason London) and Theta Kaplan (Missy Crider) of a Mars cargo transport ship the Solar System Shipping Vessel No.17 (Triple S-17) awaken, they find out something has gone terribly wrong. They''ve woken up from hyper-sleep almost ten months past their scheduled time, find the ship''s internals badly damaged, off course and almost no fuel. What''s more, it''s discovered the first shift killed each other. As the plot unfolds, something truly evil is discovered on board - an alien biological life form which can psychologically manipulate humans.', 'After eight months of hyper-sleep, when Christopher ''Chris'' McNiel (Jason London) and Theta Kaplan (Missy Crider) of a Mars cargo transport ship the Solar System Shipping Vessel No.17 (Triple S-17) awaken, they find out something has gone terribly wrong. They''ve woken up from hyper-sleep almost ten months past their scheduled time, find the ship''s internals badly damaged, off course and almost no fuel. What''s more, it''s discovered the first shift killed each other. As the plot unfolds, something truly evil is discovered on board - an alien biological life form which can psychologically manipulate humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGktETuqS4qKkPYH90FmPNIvVqq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52477'),
  ('1032215349877046648', 'Alien Code', 2017, 'Science Fiction', 'Michael G. Cooney, Teruhisa Yoshida, Stuart B. Hagen', 'Michael G. Cooney', 'Kyle Gallner, Azura Skye, Mary McCormack, Richard Schiff, Tate Birchmore, Noah Scott, Brett Newton', 'PG', 'After deciphering a message found in a satellite, genius cryptographer Alex Jacobs finds himself being stalked by government agents and otherworldly beings.', 'After deciphering a message found in a satellite, genius cryptographer Alex Jacobs finds himself being stalked by government agents and otherworldly beings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wimw8IIOnFjx8JXxqCOpn3hrOe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529358'),
  ('221643322545071970', 'Alien Conquest', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Natalya Rahmann, Ben Gelera, Michelle Ng Mini', 'Joe Roche', 'Anthony Jensen, Tom Sizemore, Emily Killian, Michael Devorzon, Emma Nasfell, DeAngelo Davis, Paulina Nguyen, Torrey Richardson', null, 'Sibling astronomers join forces with the military when hostile aliens attack Earth.', 'Sibling astronomers join forces with the military when hostile aliens attack Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIqoCDvQMo5psY8SDUeSIvGmmeL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800705'),
  ('402675535101466738', 'Alien Convergence', 2017, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Rob Pallatina, Josh Maas', 'Marc Gottlieb', 'Caroline Ivari, Stephen Brown, Mishone Feigin, Ikaika Jonathan, Michael Marcel, Britt George, Ana Zimhart, Dennis Renard', null, 'When flying reptilian creatures wreak havoc all over the world, the survivors’ only hope of stopping them is a new, state-of-the-art fighter jet piloted by the only team that knows how to use the technology.', 'When flying reptilian creatures wreak havoc all over the world, the survivors’ only hope of stopping them is a new, state-of-the-art fighter jet piloted by the only team that knows how to use the technology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96xgOCz2li0IiqKYcLQh5bK7CiU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460962'),
  ('269257029892030920', 'Alien Crystal Palace', 2018, 'Music, Mystery, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Arielle Dombasle, Élie Girard, Vojta Janyska', 'Jacques Fieschi, Florian Bernas, Nicolas Ker', 'Nicolas Ker, Arielle Dombasle, Michel Fau, Asia Argento, Zoé Le Ber, Joséphine de la Baume, Théo Hakola, Julian de Gainza', null, 'A scientist finds the secret that predispose to the formation of the ideal couple. With this new alchemy, he achieves a pioneering experience: the creation of a perfect androgynous.', 'A scientist finds the secret that predispose to the formation of the ideal couple. With this new alchemy, he achieves a pioneering experience: the creation of a perfect androgynous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5d78inuD3yEAob9haQ5WjJLWJq4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544501'),
  ('170705526010786693', 'Alien Evolution', 2001, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Andrew Abbott, Russell Leven, Simon Higgins', 'Mark Kermode', 'Michael Biehn, Ralph Brown, James Cameron, Veronica Cartwright, Ron Cobb, Charles Dance, Jenette Goldstein, Carrie Henn', null, 'Mark Kermode brings a tribute to the successful Alien series, featuring interviews with the cast members and directors, including Sigourney Weaver and Ridley Scott. This documentary is featured on the 9th disc of the Alien Quadrilogy DVD set, released in 2003.', 'Mark Kermode brings a tribute to the successful Alien series, featuring interviews with the cast members and directors, including Sigourney Weaver and Ridley Scott. This documentary is featured on the 9th disc of the Alien Quadrilogy DVD set, released in 2003.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYohwNp2ltWyuRTmNStpg8iGzej.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172596'),
  ('485335779727405773', 'Alien Expedition', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Wallace Brothers', 'Jeffrey Giles, Jacoby Bancroft, Michael Lurie', 'Edward Gusts, Whitney Nielsen, Linda S. Wong, Ethan McDowell, C.J. Baker, Cody Renee Cameron, Gregory Niebel, Motown Maurice', null, 'After a deep space exploration vessel discovers a potentially habitable planet, a scouting team composed of human and biorobotic individuals is dispatched to investigate the planet''s resources. Once on the ground, their reconnaissance mission soon turns into a battle for survival against the planet''s hostile alien lifeforms.', 'After a deep space exploration vessel discovers a potentially habitable planet, a scouting team composed of human and biorobotic individuals is dispatched to investigate the planet''s resources. Once on the ground, their reconnaissance mission soon turns into a battle for survival against the planet''s hostile alien lifeforms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alHSQQMgJUAyHxVHzH1i8VXk6hu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550844'),
  ('619697330249911511', 'Alien from L.A.', 1988, 'Family, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Albert Pyun, Tom Fraser, Scott Cameron', 'Albert Pyun, Judith Berg, Sandra Berg', 'Kathy Ireland, William R. Moses, Don Michael Paul, Thom Mathews, Simon Poland, Linda Kerridge, Deep Roy, Jeff Celentano', 'PG', 'When her archaeologist father disappears on an expedition, Wanda sets out to look for him. What she finds is a secret underground world, where no one believes in life on the surface and where she and her father are taken for spies.', 'When her archaeologist father disappears on an expedition, Wanda sets out to look for him. What she finds is a secret underground world, where no one believes in life on the surface and where she and her father are taken for spies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Al8v2ASozhufxTiA7HVL7GAxi3y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31397'),
  ('311114109012078538', 'Alien from the Darkness', 1997, 'Animation, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Norio Takanami, Yosuke Moriguchi, Hajime Takakuwa', 'Shino Taira', 'Kumiko Nishihara, Yumi Takada, Yoko Soumi, Hiroko Konishi, Sumie Baba', null, 'The all female crew of the transport ship Muse is on a mission in deep space. They pick up an SOS signal and discover a derelict space cruiser where all the women have died mysteriously. They take the only survivor, a young woman named Flair, and detonate the ghost ship. However, the danger is just beginning. With Flair on the Muse, the romances between the women begin to take a new turn. One by one, the crewmembers are attacked by a mysterious alien presence, desperate to find a way to reproduce with human women!', 'The all female crew of the transport ship Muse is on a mission in deep space. They pick up an SOS signal and discover a derelict space cruiser where all the women have died mysteriously. They take the only survivor, a young woman named Flair, and detonate the ghost ship. However, the danger is just beginning. With Flair on the Muse, the romances between the women begin to take a new turn. One by one, the crewmembers are attacked by a mysterious alien presence, desperate to find a way to reproduce with human women!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbxpznxnTpR5MCl0bdDRor7j4qK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272108'),
  ('179171005966320619', 'Alien from the Deep', 1989, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Antonio Margheriti, Fausto Zuccoli', 'Tito Carpi', 'Daniel Bosch, Marina Giulia Cavalli, Robert Marius, Luciano Pigozzi, Charles Napier, Roberto Dell''Acqua, David Brass, Kenneth Peerless', null, 'Two members of Greenpeace discover that a local factory sheds radioactive waste into an active volcano, which has created a terrifying creature that wreaks havoc in the area.', 'Two members of Greenpeace discover that a local factory sheds radioactive waste into an active volcano, which has created a terrifying creature that wreaks havoc in the area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqYOY76qUL0XVcUy12GlTreqk3F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27909'),
  ('666264275826745321', 'Alien Hunter', 2003, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Ron Krauss, Antony Tanev, Darko Šuvak', 'J.S. Cardone', 'James Spader, Janine Eser, John Lynch, Leslie Stefanson, Carl Lewis, Anthony Crivello, Aimee Graham, Roy Dotrice', 'R', 'Government agents find evidence of extraterrestrial life at the South Pole.', 'Government agents find evidence of extraterrestrial life at the South Pole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cb58aaGnPJROoooFCXlR6o1ebw5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22076'),
  ('973297978097604736', 'Alien Intruder', 1993, 'Science Fiction', 'Ricardo Jacques Gale, Diana Phipps, Michael Pinkey', 'Nick Stone', 'Maxwell Caulfield, Tracy Scoggins, Billy Dee Williams, Gary Roberts, Richard Cody, Stephen Davies, Jeff Conaway, Michael Delano', 'R', 'Set in the year 2022, a group of convicts sentenced to life in prison are led on a mission into uncharted deep space by Commander Skyler (Williams) to salvage a lost ship. As incentive to go on this dangerous mission, the convicts are given the opportunity to spend their weekends in a virtual reality world where they could live out their sexual fantasies with any woman they choose. However, a woman who is not part of the program appears in it (Scoggins), kills each virtual woman and seduces each convict. When she begins to appear outside the program, the men quickly turn on each other.', 'Set in the year 2022, a group of convicts sentenced to life in prison are led on a mission into uncharted deep space by Commander Skyler (Williams) to salvage a lost ship. As incentive to go on this dangerous mission, the convicts are given the opportunity to spend their weekends in a virtual reality world where they could live out their sexual fantasies with any woman they choose. However, a woman who is not part of the program appears in it (Scoggins), kills each virtual woman and seduces each convict. When she begins to appear outside the program, the men quickly turn on each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMBhCqkmwZt6puWgfkAjJEBukIG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38160'),
  ('117016580104703749', 'Alien Invasion', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Lin Yunxiang', 'Liu Yuan, Chen Yanhong', 'Zheng Xitong, Wang Yiqi, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Felix Lok Ying-Kwan, Jackson Liu, Song Xiang, Zhang Na', null, 'Inspired by the myth of Cthulhu, it tells a fantasy adventure story triggered by a mysterious quantum mechanics experiment.', 'Inspired by the myth of Cthulhu, it tells a fantasy adventure story triggered by a mysterious quantum mechanics experiment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AsrToGSOSHPCC5albpPADN5SWVD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:757977'),
  ('958899281095926357', 'Alien Invasion', 2023, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Fred Searle, Dan Robins', 'Craig McLearie', 'Sarah T. Cohen, Amber Doig-Thorne, May Kelly, Benjamin Colbourne, Nikolai Leon, Matthew Baunsgard, Richard Kovacs, Bao Tieu', null, 'A group of friends find a large egg, but little do they know it contains an unwelcome predator. Now they must stop it from reaching civilization.', 'A group of friends find a large egg, but little do they know it contains an unwelcome predator. Now they must stop it from reaching civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kaSvEH3RJvQa6NfAuEVqDMBEk5E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:981314'),
  ('1107083431550432902', 'Alien Invasion: S.U.M.1', 2017, 'Science Fiction', 'Inken Janssen, Christian Hoyer, Christian Pasquariello', 'Christian Pasquariello', 'Iwan Rheon, André Hennicke, Tim Williams, Rainer Werner, Norman Reedus, Gökdeniz A. Özcetin, Zoe Grisedale, Niels-Bruno Schmidt', null, 'An aggressive race of aliens took over Planet Earth and humanity''s at its end, living in giant bunkers below ground. Young Military rookie S.U.M.1 (Iwan Rheon) is sent to the surface to save a group of unprotected survivors.', 'An aggressive race of aliens took over Planet Earth and humanity''s at its end, living in giant bunkers below ground. Young Military rookie S.U.M.1 (Iwan Rheon) is sent to the surface to save a group of unprotected survivors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RSEWZD65hUkfl4vwx75DYiVcet.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457665'),
  ('109102281524907568', 'Alien Nation', 1988, 'Science Fiction, Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Graham Baker, Adam Greenberg, Conrad E. Palmisano', 'Rockne S. O''Bannon', 'James Caan, Mandy Patinkin, Terence Stamp, Kevyn Major Howard, Leslie Bevis, Peter Jason, Conrad Dunn, Jeff Kober', 'R', 'A few years from now, Earth will have the first contact with an alien civilization. These aliens, known as Newcomers, slowly begin to be integrated into human society after years of quarantine.', 'A few years from now, Earth will have the first contact with an alien civilization. These aliens, known as Newcomers, slowly begin to be integrated into human society after years of quarantine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wEyQkFXX6ReyW44YQa1kLQYkCg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10128'),
  ('896718255197810153', 'Alien Nation: Body and Soul', 1995, 'TV Movie, Science Fiction', 'Kenneth Johnson, Shelly Johnson', 'Kenneth Johnson, Rockne S. O''Bannon, Andrew Schneider', 'Gary Graham, Eric Pierpoint, Michele Scarabelli, Lauren Woodland, Sean Six, Terri Treas, Jeffrey Marcus, Ron Fassler', null, 'Sikes and Francisco are called in to a case when a mysterious young girl, who looks part Newcomer, part human, appears. Her huge, brutish counterpart tries to free her from the precinct, and their bizarre relationship turns out to be the result of a slaveship medical experiment. Meanwhile, Cathy and Matt are going to sex school, in preparation of becoming intimate, while Buck distresses his parents by his anti-human opinions.', 'Sikes and Francisco are called in to a case when a mysterious young girl, who looks part Newcomer, part human, appears. Her huge, brutish counterpart tries to free her from the precinct, and their bizarre relationship turns out to be the result of a slaveship medical experiment. Meanwhile, Cathy and Matt are going to sex school, in preparation of becoming intimate, while Buck distresses his parents by his anti-human opinions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KHyvnqYhleMvO4LQeL1RfteGGF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77348'),
  ('921306516817591088', 'Alien Nation: Dark Horizon', 1994, 'TV Movie, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Kenneth Johnson, Lloyd Ahern II, Venita Ozols-Graham', 'Diane Frolov, Andrew Schneider', 'Gary Graham, Jenny Gago, Eric Pierpoint, Michele Scarabelli, Sean Six, Lauren Woodland, Dana Andersen, Susan Appling', null, 'Followup movie to the TV series about 250,000 aliens, or "newcomers" as they are known, who have by now settled alongside the humans in California. Most of the newcomers were slaves, and the slave masters are now looking for them. They send Aponso to earth to locate the slaves ready for the aliens to pick them up.', 'Followup movie to the TV series about 250,000 aliens, or "newcomers" as they are known, who have by now settled alongside the humans in California. Most of the newcomers were slaves, and the slave masters are now looking for them. They send Aponso to earth to locate the slaves ready for the aliens to pick them up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDBN0S2l5QiuoVTPd8K4DTbcKPX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24047'),
  ('642943340693818481', 'Alien Nation: Millennium', 1996, 'TV Movie, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Shelly Johnson, Kenneth Johnson', 'Kenneth Johnson', 'Gary Graham, Eric Pierpoint, Michele Scarabelli, Terri Treas, Lauren Woodland, Sean Six, Jason Behr, David Faustino', null, 'It''s 1999, and as the end of the millenium approaches, people are attempting to find spiritual enlightenment. But a few people want to skip all the work that entails, and a holy Tenktonese relic in the hands of a heretic is giving them a shortcut. But it''s not quite as easily controlled as she says.', 'It''s 1999, and as the end of the millenium approaches, people are attempting to find spiritual enlightenment. But a few people want to skip all the work that entails, and a holy Tenktonese relic in the hands of a heretic is giving them a shortcut. But it''s not quite as easily controlled as she says.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aoNNauHlqGoCzw8HwKDF3TZEI8l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50291'),
  ('948761820583486943', 'Alien Nation: The Enemy Within', 1996, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Kenneth Johnson, Ronald Víctor García, Venita Ozols-Graham', 'Diane Frolov, Andrew Schneider', 'Gary Graham, Eric Pierpoint, Michele Scarabelli, Terri Treas, Lauren Woodland, Sean Six, Joe Lando, Jeffrey Marcus', 'PG', 'When detectives Sikes and Francisco are presented with the mysterious death of an Eeno, Matt is stupefied to discover that George rudely snubs the case. He, like most newcomers, reviles the outcast Eenos. As the case unfolds, George has to reassess his prejudices, and George''s family help save the city from an alien threat originating in an Eeno waste disposal facility.', 'When detectives Sikes and Francisco are presented with the mysterious death of an Eeno, Matt is stupefied to discover that George rudely snubs the case. He, like most newcomers, reviles the outcast Eenos. As the case unfolds, George has to reassess his prejudices, and George''s family help save the city from an alien threat originating in an Eeno waste disposal facility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9LPNJljJWe1a4GdmHXLfkk83S3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81244'),
  ('872878122610355867', 'Alien Nation: The Udara Legacy', 1997, 'TV Movie, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Kenneth Johnson, Ronald Víctor García, Venita Ozols-Graham', 'Harry Longstreet, Renee Longstreet', 'Gary Graham, Eric Pierpoint, Michele Scarabelli, Terri Treas, Lauren Woodland, Sean Six, Jeffrey Marcus, Ron Fassler', 'PG', 'Matt and George investigate a series of strange occurrences involving newcomers, who are found to be programmed to carry out someone''s dirty work. The method by which they are brainwashed dates back to the slave ship''s rebellion group, the Udara, who, we discover, Susan was a part of. Susan and George''s lives are further disrupted when Buck enrols in the police academy.', 'Matt and George investigate a series of strange occurrences involving newcomers, who are found to be programmed to carry out someone''s dirty work. The method by which they are brainwashed dates back to the slave ship''s rebellion group, the Udara, who, we discover, Susan was a part of. Susan and George''s lives are further disrupted when Buck enrols in the police academy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8IOgyiIotTqdhaOxaPLdutF4HHg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81246'),
  ('768353840855391615', 'Alien Nights', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Lorena Ortiz, Pedro Von Krüger, Adler Paz', 'Sérgio de Carvalho, Camilo Cavalcante, Rodolfo Minari', 'Gabriel Knoxx, Chico Diaz, Joana Gatis, Adanilo, Gleici Damasceno, Bimi Huni Kuin, Francisca Arara, Jefferson Xavier', null, 'Rio Branco, Acre, an Amazon city near the border with Peru and Bolivia, has been suffering the violent impacts of recent changes in trafficking routes, which have arrived with violence in the Brazilian Amazon. In this scenario, the lives of three young childhood friends intertwine and ultimately, they find themselves in a common tragedy.', 'Rio Branco, Acre, an Amazon city near the border with Peru and Bolivia, has been suffering the violent impacts of recent changes in trafficking routes, which have arrived with violence in the Brazilian Amazon. In this scenario, the lives of three young childhood friends intertwine and ultimately, they find themselves in a common tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkwOj1Ex2EjgYkfkuXbjr9lRsxU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647003'),
  ('804373239256496460', 'Alien Outbreak', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Neil Rowe', 'Neil Rowe', 'Katherine Drake, Ritchie Crane, Philip Alexander Baker, Michael Terry, Ian Rowe, Aaron Deakins', 'R', 'In a small rural community, local police officers Zoe and Patrick begin their shift as normal but soon, strange events unfold. Residents begin behaving erratically, and suicidal panic spreads amongst the township they are trying to protect. Zoe and Patrick realise alien machines are taking hold, cutting their small group of survivors off from the outside world. Can the determined humans band together to save their community, and all mankind, from extinction?', 'In a small rural community, local police officers Zoe and Patrick begin their shift as normal but soon, strange events unfold. Residents begin behaving erratically, and suicidal panic spreads amongst the township they are trying to protect. Zoe and Patrick realise alien machines are taking hold, cutting their small group of survivors off from the outside world. Can the determined humans band together to save their community, and all mankind, from extinction?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izAtqyIJzfZnb4JONp92sIkPkBd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:668343'),
  ('277703322625871844', 'Alien Outlaw', 1985, 'Mystery, Science Fiction, Comedy, Western, Horror', 'Phil Smoot', 'Phil Smoot', 'Lash LaRue, Kari Anderson, Sunset Carson, Wild Bill Cody, Paul Holman, Gil Newsom, Richard Davis, Liz Warrington', null, 'Aliens land in a small town where Jesse Jamison is about to have a gun show and bullets fly after the aliens start killing people. Watch out Diamond Booking agency for your next momentous event!', 'Aliens land in a small town where Jesse Jamison is about to have a gun show and bullets fly after the aliens start killing people. Watch out Diamond Booking agency for your next momentous event!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EvfFgkccFbcWmKMlnIeDGK2Zkk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248595'),
  ('721958824185609012', 'Alien Planet', 2005, 'Documentary, Science Fiction, Animation', 'Pierre de Lespinois', 'Peter Crabbe, Steve Eder', 'Wayne D. Barlowe, Curtis Clark, James Garvin, Jamie Haines, Stephen Hawking, Jack Horner, Joan Horvath, Michio Kaku', null, 'The dynamic meeting of solid science and futuristic simulation culminates in a dramatic exploration to another inhabited planet seven light years away. Alien Planet creates a realistic depiction of creatures on another world, where life is possible, if not provable, according to scientists'' theories. Take this fascinating journey created by state-of-the-art animation and photo-realistic effects.', 'The dynamic meeting of solid science and futuristic simulation culminates in a dramatic exploration to another inhabited planet seven light years away. Alien Planet creates a realistic depiction of creatures on another world, where life is possible, if not provable, according to scientists'' theories. Take this fascinating journey created by state-of-the-art animation and photo-realistic effects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13cALR5mOLxz4K9kEA6uPmtaHYb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18606'),
  ('288507063800042387', 'Alien Private Eye', 1989, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Vik Rubenfeld, Jürg V. Walther', 'Vik Rubenfeld', 'Nicholas Hill, Cliff Aduddell, John Alexander, Robert Axelrod, Judith Burke, Christina Cardan, Scott Chenoweth, Nur Nur Cummings', null, 'An alien sent to Earth to retrieve a drug that was sent here on a black disc has to fight her race''s enemies, who are also on Earth to search for the drug.', 'An alien sent to Earth to retrieve a drug that was sent here on a black disc has to fight her race''s enemies, who are also on Earth to search for the drug.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDOH7fj8Tn1qyAK2FRo8GE4KCIx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84212'),
  ('573987596470200134', 'Alien Raiders', 2008, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Ben Rock, Walt Lloyd, John Pontrelli', 'David Simkins', 'Carlos Bernard, Mathew St. Patrick, Courtney Ford, Rockmond Dunbar, Tom Kiesche, Joel McCrary, Jeffrey Licon, Samantha Streets', 'R', 'It''s the end of yet another night at Hastings Supermarket, a grocery store in Buck Lake, Arizona. But just before closing, a group of masked and armed to the teeth militants invades the store and take everyone hostage', 'It''s the end of yet another night at Hastings Supermarket, a grocery store in Buck Lake, Arizona. But just before closing, a group of masked and armed to the teeth militants invades the store and take everyone hostage', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBz8ueJSWIVwB3LO80BiuUFpiWY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13954'),
  ('1070394165721053039', 'Alien Resurrection', 1997, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Action', 'Jean-Pierre Jeunet, Bill Boes, Darius Khondji', 'Joss Whedon', 'Sigourney Weaver, Winona Ryder, Dominique Pinon, Ron Perlman, Gary Dourdan, Michael Wincott, Kim Flowers, Dan Hedaya', 'R', 'Two hundred years after Lt. Ripley died, a group of scientists clone her, hoping to breed the ultimate weapon. But the new Ripley is full of surprises … as are the new aliens. Ripley must team with a band of smugglers to keep the creatures from reaching Earth.', 'Two hundred years after Lt. Ripley died, a group of scientists clone her, hoping to breed the ultimate weapon. But the new Ripley is full of surprises … as are the new aliens. Ripley must team with a band of smugglers to keep the creatures from reaching Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9aRDMlU5Zwpysilm0WCWzU2PCFv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8078'),
  ('255737232052539247', 'Alien Seed', 1989, 'Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Bob James, Kenny Carmack', 'Douglas K. Grimm, Robert Hyatt, Bob James', 'Erik Estrada, Heidi Paine, Steven Blade, Shellie Block, David Hayes, Terry Phillips, Michael Ford, Steve Gellman', null, 'An alien impregnates an Earth woman so she can deliver an alien "messiah" that will rule the world. A newspaper reporter finds out what''s going on and sets out to stop it.', 'An alien impregnates an Earth woman so she can deliver an alien "messiah" that will rule the world. A newspaper reporter finds out what''s going on and sets out to stop it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haMpJJjWqLjVO4G7N3mHpkrDKWp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26943'),
  ('156792791780587881', 'Alien Space Avenger', 1989, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Comedy', 'Richard W. Haines', 'Richard W. Haines', 'Robert Prichard, Michael McCleery, Charity Staley, Gina Mastrogiacomo, Angela Nicholas, Kirk Fogg, Marty Roberts, Jamie Gillis', 'NR', 'In 1939 a spaceship carrying four alien escaped prisoners crash-lands on Earth and the aliens take over the bodies of four locals. Fifty years later the aliens find out that an artist has written a comic book called "Space Avenger," which they believe is about them. They go to New York to try to kill the artist.', 'In 1939 a spaceship carrying four alien escaped prisoners crash-lands on Earth and the aliens take over the bodies of four locals. Fifty years later the aliens find out that an artist has written a comic book called "Space Avenger," which they believe is about them. They go to New York to try to kill the artist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQHY06KYBYSjuf1OukgZWCVEjX1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87302'),
  ('663219618778508938', 'Alien Terminator', 1996, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Dave Payne, Mike Mickens, Ross Novie', 'Dave Payne, Duke Lorr', 'Maria Ford, Rodger Halston, Lisa Boyle, Emile B. Levisetti, Bob McFarland, Kevin Alber, Betsy Baldwin', 'R', 'Five miles below the Earth''s surface, a group of scientists is working in self-imposed isolation, perfecting a series of DNA experiments that could literally change the world. But when one of those experiments goes awry, it unleashes a nearly immortal organism--one capable of instant regeneration, and with an insatiable appetite for living flesh. Soon, nothing can contain the creature, and with the lab''s life support systems quickly shutting down, the scientists grimly prepare for their final battle... A small group of scientists are working in self-imposed isolation below the Earth''s surface. They are all working to create DNA which could change the world, but one of the scientists have been given an secret assignment, and when the assignment goes wrong, all hell breaks lose. The new creation is now aboard the ship and will destroy anyone who gets in its way, as it moves towards the surface.', 'Five miles below the Earth''s surface, a group of scientists is working in self-imposed isolation, perfecting a series of DNA experiments that could literally change the world. But when one of those experiments goes awry, it unleashes a nearly immortal organism--one capable of instant regeneration, and with an insatiable appetite for living flesh. Soon, nothing can contain the creature, and with the lab''s life support systems quickly shutting down, the scientists grimly prepare for their final battle... A small group of scientists are working in self-imposed isolation below the Earth''s surface. They are all working to create DNA which could change the world, but one of the scientists have been given an secret assignment, and when the assignment goes wrong, all hell breaks lose. The new creation is now aboard the ship and will destroy anyone who gets in its way, as it moves towards the surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onYNCujqToCWgPsYgu451oTlwrH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133360'),
  ('879486084692997863', 'Alien Terror', 1971, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'José Luis González de León, Jack Hill, Juan Ibáñez', 'Juan Ibáñez, Karl Schanzer, Luis Enrique Vergara', 'Boris Karloff, Enrique Guzmán, Christa Linder, Maura Monti, Yerye Beirute, Tere Valez, Griselda Mejía, Sergio Kleiner', null, 'Near the end of the 19th century, Prof. John Mayer and his assistant, the scientist Dr. Isabel Reed, accidentally invent a powerful ray. An alien travels to Earth to destroy the machine since it would be a threat to the universe. He initially possesses the mind of Thomas, a sex maniac and serial killer, to get close to Mayer during the demonstration of the machine to scientists and the military. Mayer''s niece, Laura, meets an acquaintance of her uncle, the chemist Dr. Paul Rosten, and Mayer invites him to join the research. When Thomas gets close to Mayer, the alien also possesses his mind in order to destroy the device and his notes. Meanwhile, Thomas is not able to control his murderous impulses and attacks several women with a straight razor.', 'Near the end of the 19th century, Prof. John Mayer and his assistant, the scientist Dr. Isabel Reed, accidentally invent a powerful ray. An alien travels to Earth to destroy the machine since it would be a threat to the universe. He initially possesses the mind of Thomas, a sex maniac and serial killer, to get close to Mayer during the demonstration of the machine to scientists and the military. Mayer''s niece, Laura, meets an acquaintance of her uncle, the chemist Dr. Paul Rosten, and Mayer invites him to join the research. When Thomas gets close to Mayer, the alien also possesses his mind in order to destroy the device and his notes. Meanwhile, Thomas is not able to control his murderous impulses and attacks several women with a straight razor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gT3fN6XpeDalJZBUoUcO80fs73a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42523'),
  ('1000391203041849510', 'Alien Tornado', 2012, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Jeff Burr, Andrew Strahorn', 'Paul A. Birkett', 'Kari Wührer, Stacey Asaro, Jeff Fahey, Chip Haw, David Jensen, Mike Kimmel, Terry Kiser, Daniel Ponsky', null, 'Aliens attack Earth with deadly electrical tornadoes, and it’s up to a farmer, his smart high-school daughter and a tornado blogger to thwart the horrific invasion.', 'Aliens attack Earth with deadly electrical tornadoes, and it’s up to a farmer, his smart high-school daughter and a tornado blogger to thwart the horrific invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCiOtKLJdYtjie64pO5925OC2vS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104185'),
  ('976923268853165764', 'Alien Trespass', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction, Horror', 'R. W. Goodwin, David Moxness', 'Jim Swift', 'Eric McCormack, Jenni Baird, Dan Lauria, Robert Patrick, Jody Thompson, Sarah Smyth, Andrew Dunbar, Sage Brocklebank', 'PG', 'In 1957 a fiery object crashes into a mountaintop in the California desert, bringing the threat of disaster to Earth. Out of the flying saucer escapes a murderous creature, the Ghota, bent on destroying all life forms on the planet. A benevolent alien from the spaceship, Urp, inhabits the body of Ted Lewis, an astronomer and with the help of Tammy, a diner waitress, sets out to save mankind.', 'In 1957 a fiery object crashes into a mountaintop in the California desert, bringing the threat of disaster to Earth. Out of the flying saucer escapes a murderous creature, the Ghota, bent on destroying all life forms on the planet. A benevolent alien from the spaceship, Urp, inhabits the body of Ted Lewis, an astronomer and with the help of Tammy, a diner waitress, sets out to save mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3W6DuB0dp5SSZCvqaJxD25M6Evt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16634'),
  ('558472534183219510', 'Alien Visitor', 1997, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Rolf de Heer', 'Rolf de Heer', 'Ullie Birvé, Syd Brisbane, Alethea McGrath, Chloe Ferguson, Phoebe Ferguson', null, 'In this sci-fi adventure a gorgeous alien woman is sent to Earth by mistake from the planet Epsilon. Landing in the Australian outback she meets a surveyor and they cross the continent together. However, she spends the trip haranguing him for the ecological recklessness and avarice of the human race.', 'In this sci-fi adventure a gorgeous alien woman is sent to Earth by mistake from the planet Epsilon. Landing in the Australian outback she meets a surveyor and they cross the continent together. However, she spends the trip haranguing him for the ecological recklessness and avarice of the human race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppGVl0XNeK4PfrUpGtCjzXWvPK6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94353'),
  ('10831535033281871', 'Alien vs. Ninja', 2010, 'Horror, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Seiji Chiba, Kensuke Sonomura, Takamichi Fujita', 'Seiji Chiba', 'Masanori Mimoto, Shuji Kashiwabara, Donpei Tsuchihira, Mika Hijii, Ben Hiura, Kenji Saito, Hidetaka Nishio, Kentarō Shimazu', 'R', 'A comet crashes into a Japanese forest and a group of mighty ninjas must fight a group of killer Aliens before they reach their village and kill everyone.', 'A comet crashes into a Japanese forest and a group of mighty ninjas must fight a group of killer Aliens before they reach their village and kill everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s91ImWTqm6ESxiXdEkCgxW30McH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57011'),
  ('356858877720895778', 'Alien Warfare', 2019, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Jeremiah Jones, Chelsea Vale, David Gere', 'Ben Bailey, Nathan Zoebl, Dave Baker', 'Clayton Snyder, David Meadows, Scott C. Roe, Larissa Andrade, Daniel Washington, Tom DeNucci, Sama Fernands, Taylor Vale', null, 'A team of Navy Seals investigates a mysterious science outpost only to have to combat a squad of powerful alien soldiers.', 'A team of Navy Seals investigates a mysterious science outpost only to have to combat a squad of powerful alien soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJOj0T5DyChfECevDg0xpEGznsl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593035'),
  ('150267518819389116', 'Alien Warrior', 1986, 'Crime, Science Fiction, Action', 'Ed Hunt, Ricardo Jacques Gale, Joe Pennella', 'Ruben Gordon, Ed Hunt, Barry Pearson', 'Brett Baxter Clark, Pamela Saunders, Reggie De Morton, Nelson Anderson, Norman Budd, Elodie McKee, Bill Woods Jr., Rameon Witt', 'R', 'He’s the ALIEN WARRIOR - the mysterious defender of justice in a world of deceit, corruption and decay. He’s been sent to save the Earth from its impending ruin. Rugged BRETT CLARK (Star Trek II: The Wrath of Khan, Bachelor Party) stars as an interstellar being with superhuman powers sent to Earth to restore law and order. His mission takes him to the violent streets where the law means nothing. His quest begins! A confrontation with the dark side, the destructors of society. With his supernatural abilities and a growing legion of followers, he becomes the ALIEN WARRIOR!', 'He’s the ALIEN WARRIOR - the mysterious defender of justice in a world of deceit, corruption and decay. He’s been sent to save the Earth from its impending ruin. Rugged BRETT CLARK (Star Trek II: The Wrath of Khan, Bachelor Party) stars as an interstellar being with superhuman powers sent to Earth to restore law and order. His mission takes him to the violent streets where the law means nothing. His quest begins! A confrontation with the dark side, the destructors of society. With his supernatural abilities and a growing legion of followers, he becomes the ALIEN WARRIOR!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2Uqa6HxZlvIMIgilgNgB47tJSx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119525'),
  ('875916683026934808', 'Alien Xmas', 2020, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Aaron Wise, Helder Sun, Stephen Chiodo', 'Kealan O''Rourke', 'Dee Bradley Baker, Barbara Goodson, Kirk Thornton, Tony Oliver, Keythe Farley, Jessica Gee-George, Steve Staley, Kaliayh Rhambo', null, 'A young elf mistakes a tiny alien for a Christmas gift, not knowing her new plaything has plans to destroy Earth''s gravity — and steal all the presents.', 'A young elf mistakes a tiny alien for a Christmas gift, not knowing her new plaything has plans to destroy Earth''s gravity — and steal all the presents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UGrAX6D1AMVra80jmUMUOLq8Qr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656561'),
  ('448704468113379327', 'Alien: Containment', 2019, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Chris Reading, Howard Mills, Jack Jennings', 'Chris Reading', 'Gaia Weiss, Theo Barklem-Biggs, Sharon Duncan-Brewster, Adam Loxley, James Paxton', null, 'Aboard a small escape pod, four survivors try to discover what caused the destruction of their spaceship.', 'Aboard a small escape pod, four survivors try to discover what caused the destruction of their spaceship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Au2rDB47SuP0U0y3MV8awoCO8qd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588207'),
  ('119598879200445370', 'Alien: Covenant', 2017, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Ridley Scott, Andrew Chan, Dariusz Wolski', 'Dante Harper, John Logan', 'Michael Fassbender, Katherine Waterston, Billy Crudup, Danny McBride, Demián Bichir, Carmen Ejogo, Jussie Smollett, Callie Hernandez', 'R', 'The crew of the colony ship Covenant, bound for a remote planet on the far side of the galaxy, discovers what they think is an uncharted paradise but is actually a dark, dangerous world.', 'The crew of the colony ship Covenant, bound for a remote planet on the far side of the galaxy, discovers what they think is an uncharted paradise but is actually a dark, dangerous world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zecMELPbU5YMQpC81Z8ImaaXuf9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126889'),
  ('943585733717014490', 'Alien: Harvest', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Benjamin Howdeshell, Chris Saul', 'Craig Dewey', 'Jessica Clark, Agnes Albright, Adam Sinclair, James C. Burns', null, 'The surviving crew of a damaged space harvester has a motion sensor as their only navigation tool leading them to safety, while a creature in the shadows terrorizes them. However, the greatest threat might have been hiding in plain sight.', 'The surviving crew of a damaged space harvester has a motion sensor as their only navigation tool leading them to safety, while a creature in the shadows terrorizes them. However, the greatest threat might have been hiding in plain sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UqdqHoXIr8ETRhTq50qBDCAfuE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588209'),
  ('1128334441417221357', 'Alien: Ore', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Kailey Spear, Sam Spear, Graham Talbot', 'Sam Spear, Kailey Spear', 'Mikela Jay, Tara Pratt, Dalj Brar, Steven Stiller, Ambrose Gardener, Theresa Wong, Alexandra Quispe, Julie Boersema', null, 'When her shift uncovers the death of a fellow miner under mysterious circumstances, a hard-working miner of a planet mining colony is forced to choose between escape or defying management orders and fight for the safety of her family.', 'When her shift uncovers the death of a fellow miner under mysterious circumstances, a hard-working miner of a planet mining colony is forced to choose between escape or defying management orders and fight for the safety of her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zS6vvoRgy3v4FR0diWPydYanzvJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588211'),
  ('407375666058769326', 'Alien: Romulus', 2024, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Fede Álvarez, Igor Staritsin, Fred Palacio', 'Fede Álvarez, Rodo Sayagues', 'Cailee Spaeny, David Jonsson, Archie Renaux, Isabela Merced, Spike Fearn, Aileen Wu, Rosie Ede, Soma Simon', 'R', 'While scavenging the deep ends of a derelict space station, a group of young space colonizers come face to face with the most terrifying life form in the universe.', 'While scavenging the deep ends of a derelict space station, a group of young space colonizers come face to face with the most terrifying life form in the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2uSWRTtCG336nuBiG8jOTEUKSy8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:945961'),
  ('384441168607639657', 'Alien: Rubicon', 2024, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Adrian Avila, Michael Su, James Mahoney', 'Tammy Klein, Glenn Campbell', 'Michael Paré, Preston Geer, Paul Logan, Neeley Dayan, Vinney Pugliese, Eric Davenport, Christina Rose, Doug Jeffery', 'PG-13', 'An alien spacecraft lands near New York and destroys everything as it heads toward Washington D.C. If it reaches the capital, it will trigger an invasion. Scientists and the military must stop it before it''s too late.', 'An alien spacecraft lands near New York and destroys everything as it heads toward Washington D.C. If it reaches the capital, it will trigger an invasion. Scientists and the military must stop it before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFH6wa8uVU7dKkval9QzMX8nSAb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1330373'),
  ('958658257263842223', 'Alien: Specimen', 2019, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Kelsey Taylor, Adam Lee', 'Federico Fracchia', 'Jolene Andersen, Aubrey Wakeling, Goose', null, 'During the night shift in a colony greenhouse, a botanist does her best to contain suspicious soil samples that have alarmed her sensitive lab dog.', 'During the night shift in a colony greenhouse, a botanist does her best to contain suspicious soil samples that have alarmed her sensitive lab dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hC6hpX6I8CK7LUhm4KbcWK4zrXr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588216'),
  ('367532452777596494', 'Alien³', 1992, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'David Fincher, Alex Thomson, Richard Styles', 'David Giler, Walter Hill, Larry Ferguson', 'Sigourney Weaver, Charles S. Dutton, Charles Dance, Paul McGann, Brian Glover, Ralph Brown, Danny Webb, Christopher John Fields', 'R', 'After escaping with Newt and Hicks from the alien planet, Ripley crash lands on Fiorina 161, a prison planet and host to a correctional facility. Unfortunately, although Newt and Hicks do not survive the crash, a more unwelcome visitor does. The prison does not allow weapons of any kind, and with aid being a long time away, the prisoners must simply survive in any way they can.', 'After escaping with Newt and Hicks from the alien planet, Ripley crash lands on Fiorina 161, a prison planet and host to a correctional facility. Unfortunately, although Newt and Hicks do not survive the crash, a more unwelcome visitor does. The prison does not allow weapons of any kind, and with aid being a long time away, the prisoners must simply survive in any way they can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xh5wI0UoW7DfS1IyLy3d2CgrCEP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8077'),
  ('860751911260462524', 'Alienator', 1990, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Gary Graver, Fred Olen Ray, Grant Austin Waldman', 'Paul Garson', 'Jan-Michael Vincent, John Phillip Law, Teagan Clive, P. J. Soles, Ross Hagen, Dyana Ortelli, Jesse Dabson, Dawn Wildsmith', 'R', 'A space commander sends a female android to Earth to destroy an escaped convict.', 'A space commander sends a female android to Earth to destroy an escaped convict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kem76xYVBDp1P8j8et545lwoAH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86094'),
  ('1021328161555340092', 'Alienoid', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Action, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Hwang Jae-jin, Jay Seung Jaegal, Choi Dong-hoon', 'Choi Dong-hoon, Lee Ki-cheol', 'Ryu Jun-yeol, Kim Woo-bin, Kim Tae-ri, So Ji-sub, Yum Jung-ah, Jo Woo-jin, Kim Eui-sung, Lee Hanee', 'NR', 'Gurus in the late Goryeo dynasty try to obtain a fabled, holy sword, and humans in 2022 hunt down an alien prisoner that is locked in a human''s body. The two parties cross paths when a time-traveling portal opens up.', 'Gurus in the late Goryeo dynasty try to obtain a fabled, holy sword, and humans in 2022 hunt down an alien prisoner that is locked in a human''s body. The two parties cross paths when a time-traveling portal opens up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8QVDXDiOGHRcAD4oM6MXjE0osSj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601796'),
  ('306015149939408389', 'Alienoid: Return to the Future', 2024, 'Action, Fantasy, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Kim Tae-kyeong, Hong Seung-chul, Hwang Jae-jin', 'Choi Dong-hoon, Lee Ki-cheol', 'Ryu Jun-yeol, Kim Tae-ri, Kim Woo-bin, Lee Hanee, Yum Jung-ah, Jo Woo-jin, Kim Eui-sung, Jin Sun-kyu', null, 'Ean has a critical mission to return to the future to save everyone. However, she becomes trapped in the distant past while trying to prevent the escape of alien prisoners who are locked up in the bodies of humans. Meanwhile, Muruk, who helps Ean escape various predicaments, is unnerved when he begins sensing the presence of a strange being in his body. Traveling through the centuries, they are trying to prevent the explosion of the haava.', 'Ean has a critical mission to return to the future to save everyone. However, she becomes trapped in the distant past while trying to prevent the escape of alien prisoners who are locked up in the bodies of humans. Meanwhile, Muruk, who helps Ean escape various predicaments, is unnerved when he begins sensing the presence of a strange being in his body. Traveling through the centuries, they are trying to prevent the explosion of the haava.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RClncz0GTKPZzSAcAalHCw0h3g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:626412'),
  ('559473282001497400', 'Aliens', 1986, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'James Cameron, Adrian Biddle, Terry Ackland-Snow', 'James Cameron', 'Sigourney Weaver, Carrie Henn, Michael Biehn, Paul Reiser, Lance Henriksen, Bill Paxton, William Hope, Jenette Goldstein', 'R', 'Ripley, the sole survivor of the Nostromo''s deadly encounter with the monstrous Alien, returns to Earth after drifting through space in hypersleep for 57 years. Although her story is initially met with skepticism, she agrees to accompany a team of Colonial Marines back to LV-426.', 'Ripley, the sole survivor of the Nostromo''s deadly encounter with the monstrous Alien, returns to Earth after drifting through space in hypersleep for 57 years. Although her story is initially met with skepticism, she agrees to accompany a team of Colonial Marines back to LV-426.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1x5JGpyqZU8PYhbs4UcrO1Xb6x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:679'),
  ('25673941457101503', 'Aliens Abducted My Parents and Now I Feel Kinda Left Out', 2023, 'Family, Adventure, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Jake Van Wagoner', 'Austin Everett', 'Emma Tremblay, Jacob Buster, Will Forte, Elizabeth Mitchell, Matt Biedel, Hailey Smith, Landry Townsend, Kenneth Cummins', null, 'Itsy is new in town and her life seems over until she meets her space-obsessed neighbor Calvin, who believes his parents were abducted by aliens. An aspiring journalist, Itsy decides to write an exposé on Calvin but ends up discovering much more.', 'Itsy is new in town and her life seems over until she meets her space-obsessed neighbor Calvin, who believes his parents were abducted by aliens. An aspiring journalist, Itsy decides to write an exposé on Calvin but ends up discovering much more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfKcSlQddk0LsLqMeh9mdkcboD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058622'),
  ('782612357264912184', 'Aliens in the Attic', 2009, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'John Schultz, Don Burgess, Tony Williams', 'Adam F. Goldberg, Mark Burton', 'Carter Jenkins, Austin Butler, Ashley French, Ashley Boettcher, Robert Hoffman, Doris Roberts, Henri Young, Regan Young', 'PG', 'A group of kids must protect their vacation home from invading aliens.', 'A group of kids must protect their vacation home from invading aliens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bb8ym5zSRGmhNx3gyDnzSN2waS4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20856'),
