  ('1058239953002463586', 'Aliens vs Predator: Requiem', 2007, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Colin Strause, Greg Strause, Daniel Pearl', 'Shane Salerno', 'David Paetkau, Sam Trammell, Steven Pasquale, Reiko Aylesworth, John Ortiz, Johnny Lewis, Ariel Gade, Kristen Hager', 'R', 'After a horrifying PredAlien crash-lands near a small Colorado town, killing everyone it encounters and producing countless Alien offspring, a lone Predator arrives to "clean up" the infestation.', 'After a horrifying PredAlien crash-lands near a small Colorado town, killing everyone it encounters and producing countless Alien offspring, a lone Predator arrives to "clean up" the infestation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5iTwPDNtvK6ZZF607BHBbU3HO0B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440'),
