  ('486204037098746303', 'Alison''s Birthday', 1981, 'Horror', 'Ian Coughlan, Kevan Lind, Brian Bansgrove', 'Ian Coughlan', 'Joanne Samuel, Lou Brown, Bunney Brooke, John Bluthal, Vincent Ball, Margie McCrae, Julie Wilson, Martin Vaughan', null, 'During a Ouija board session with her teenaged friends, 16-year-old Alison gets a message from beyond the grave not to go home for her birthday three years later.', 'During a Ouija board session with her teenaged friends, 16-year-old Alison gets a message from beyond the grave not to go home for her birthday three years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiVFQQPhuUr7gr9uzXQ8jcm3zXS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147641'),
  ('330385821282908209', 'Alison''s Choice', 2015, 'Drama', 'Bruce Marchiano, Joth Riggs, Frederick Gourgue', 'Bruce Marchiano', 'Chanel Marriott, Bruce Marchiano, Alicia Monet Caldwell, Gregg Wayans, Britt Prentice, Sarunas J. Jackson, Jennifer Keller, Amy Lyndon', null, 'Alison, a teen, is facing pregnancy. With nowhere to turn, she finds herself in a "clinic" about to end her baby''s life. Suddenly a man appears. His mop tells her he''s the janitor. Conversation begins and it quickly becomes clear that this man is no mere janitor, but Jesus manifest. And he''s come to save the life of her baby.', 'Alison, a teen, is facing pregnancy. With nowhere to turn, she finds herself in a "clinic" about to end her baby''s life. Suddenly a man appears. His mop tells her he''s the janitor. Conversation begins and it quickly becomes clear that this man is no mere janitor, but Jesus manifest. And he''s come to save the life of her baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBiYWJGV0KI8l1LA10Oy0MmSoeX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488596'),
  ('403659957934165514', 'Alita: Battle Angel', 2019, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Robert Rodriguez, Brian Bettwy, Bill Pope', 'James Cameron, Laeta Kalogridis', 'Rosa Salazar, Christoph Waltz, Jennifer Connelly, Mahershala Ali, Ed Skrein, Jackie Earle Haley, Keean Johnson, Lana Condor', 'PG-13', 'When Alita awakens with no memory of who she is in a future world she does not recognize, she is taken in by Ido, a compassionate doctor who realizes that somewhere in this abandoned cyborg shell is the heart and soul of a young woman with an extraordinary past.', 'When Alita awakens with no memory of who she is in a future world she does not recognize, she is taken in by Ido, a compassionate doctor who realizes that somewhere in this abandoned cyborg shell is the heart and soul of a young woman with an extraordinary past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xRWht48C2V8XNfzvPehyClOvDni.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399579'),
  ('548272655359495138', 'Alive', 1993, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Frank Marshall, Peter James', 'John Patrick Shanley', 'Josh Hamilton, Bruce Ramsay, Ethan Hawke, Vincent Spano, John Newton, David Kriegel, Kevin Breznahan, Sam Behrens', 'R', 'The amazing true story of a Uruguayan rugby team''s plane that crashed in the middle of the Andes mountains, and their immense will to survive and pull through alive, forced to do anything and everything they could to stay alive on meager rations and through the freezing cold.', 'The amazing true story of a Uruguayan rugby team''s plane that crashed in the middle of the Andes mountains, and their immense will to survive and pull through alive, forced to do anything and everything they could to stay alive on meager rations and through the freezing cold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQACcCZqd7WCTRin9xRIW5gr1bd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7305'),
  ('690338907501866003', 'Alive', 2002, 'Drama', 'Sandrine Ray', null, 'Vahina Giocante, Samuel Jouy, François Berléand, Fanny Cottençon, Pierre Cassignard, Cécile Cassel, Manuel Blanc, Jérôme Marc', null, 'After a brutal attack, a 19-year-old girl falls into a self-destructive cycle.', 'After a brutal attack, a 19-year-old girl falls into a self-destructive cycle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDmQ91hXQKtGqSaGI2PFDaTN1Qs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55891'),
  ('1101522251410350744', 'Alive', 2003, 'Action, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Ryuhei Kitamura, Takumi Furuya, Yuji Shimomura', 'Ryuhei Kitamura, Yudai Yamaguchi, Isao Kiriyama', 'Hideo Sakaki, Ryo, Koyuki, Shun Sugata, Erika Oda, Tak Sakaguchi, Jun Kunimura, Ryushi Mizukami', null, 'Tenshu is imprisoned and sentenced to death for murdering the men who raped his girlfriend. However, he manages to survive his execution and is presented with an option: face another execution attempt or subject himself to their bizarre and dangerous experiments.', 'Tenshu is imprisoned and sentenced to death for murdering the men who raped his girlfriend. However, he manages to survive his execution and is presented with an option: face another execution attempt or subject himself to their bizarre and dangerous experiments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BvfITuoAHhCTPz5f0jFCjbHNzm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5844'),
  ('994982229071352510', 'Alive', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Frédéric Berthe', 'Philippe Lyon', 'Richard Anconina, Valeria Golino, Ginie Line, Maxim Nucci, Stéphane De Groodt, Sonia Lacen, Frankie Wallach, Laurent Ban', null, 'To regain the one he loves and his children, Alex Meyer, composer and director of musicals, hard hit by his marital breakdown dating back three years, decides to rebuild himself.', 'To regain the one he loves and his children, Alex Meyer, composer and director of musicals, hard hit by his marital breakdown dating back three years, decides to rebuild himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5b8YKyhrj6RFdYefmJpaRCMkIwT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61076'),
  ('128767741661271885', 'Alive', 2006, 'Drama', 'Alexandr Veledinsky, Pavel Ignatov, Andrey Khudyakov', 'Alexandr Veledinsky, Igor Porublyov', 'Aleksey Chadov, Andrey Chadov, Aleksandr Robak, Ekaterina Volkova, Vladimir Yepifantsev, Oleksiy Horbunov, Olga Arntgolts, Viktoriya Smirnova', null, 'A veteran of the Chechen War is helped by the ghosts of his two fallen comrades to leave the war behind.', 'A veteran of the Chechen War is helped by the ghosts of his two fallen comrades to leave the war behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSMCyi1bwtr8O7NXmfIp4E4cf5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62616'),
  ('782471646723837446', 'Alive', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Charles Hamilton, Derek Jones, Kyle Cooper', 'Chuck McCue, Jules Vincent', 'Thomas Cocquerel, Camille Stopps, Angus Macfadyen, Chantal Perron, Gerrick Winston, Zoe Marlett, Lisa Moreau', null, 'A severely injured man and woman awake in an abandoned sanitarium only to discover that a sadistic caretaker holds the keys to their freedom and the horrific answers as to their true identity.', 'A severely injured man and woman awake in an abandoned sanitarium only to discover that a sadistic caretaker holds the keys to their freedom and the horrific answers as to their true identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KqM6l45QQVDYQgYWnQnK1jDDHa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492414'),
  ('1042541278338776438', 'Alive and Kicking', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nancy Meckler, Janey Fothergill, Chris Seager', 'Martin Sherman', 'Jason Flemyng, Antony Sher, Dorothy Tutin, Anthony Higgins, Bill Nighy, Philip Voss, Diane Parish, Aiden Waters', null, 'A passionately committed young dancer is forced to re-examine his career and life when faced with death, finding hope through an older man who becomes his lover, mentor and companion.', 'A passionately committed young dancer is forced to re-examine his career and life when faced with death, finding hope through an older man who becomes his lover, mentor and companion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCWcDTik7uyrDwaIIwFGvkHBrrn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172545'),
  ('36440944984180898', 'Alive and Ticking', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Andi Rogenhagen', 'Andi Rogenhagen', 'Jasna Fritzi Bauer, Victoria Trauttmansdorff, Waldemar Kobus, Stefan Kurt, Renate Delfs, Falk Rockstroh, Katja Liebing, Traute Hoess', null, 'Eva lives a happy life with her ​​father, an unsuccessful but always optimistic car salesman, her consumerist mother, and her quirky grandmother. But Eva is a tad different - she suffers from Tourette''s syndrome. Her family has long been accustomed to her tics and the accompanying insults and bullying, and Eva has come to grips with her role as an outsider. When her father gets a job offer to work in Berlin, they must suddenly leave their familiar surroundings. But Eva won''t have it, this move must be prevented - at any price!', 'Eva lives a happy life with her ​​father, an unsuccessful but always optimistic car salesman, her consumerist mother, and her quirky grandmother. But Eva is a tad different - she suffers from Tourette''s syndrome. Her family has long been accustomed to her tics and the accompanying insults and bullying, and Eva has come to grips with her role as an outsider. When her father gets a job offer to work in Berlin, they must suddenly leave their familiar surroundings. But Eva won''t have it, this move must be prevented - at any price!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WbUDNVIr5q01mtvuh0XqKzHEPp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70757'),
  ('651152776397794146', 'Alive in Joburg', 2005, 'Science Fiction', 'Neill Blomkamp', null, 'Dawie Ackermann, Jason Cope, Sharlto Copley, Braam Greyling, Godfrey Seome, Sweetness Hlomza, Patrick Hlomza, Bennet Mogobithla', null, 'A documentary-style short film about the arrival of an alien spaceship over Johannesburg, South Africa.', 'A documentary-style short film about the arrival of an alien spaceship over Johannesburg, South Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQFaObHn4rLQ0dkGzU5T0RUVxGc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45887'),
  ('257750845881342394', 'Alive Inside', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Michael Rossato-Bennett, Shachar Langlev', 'Michael Rossato-Bennett', 'Oliver Sacks, Bobby McFerrin', 'PG', 'Five million Americans suffer from Alzheimer''s disease and dementia—many of them alone in nursing homes. A man with a simple idea discovers that songs embedded deep in memory can ease pain and awaken these fading minds. Joy and life are resuscitated, and our cultural fears over aging are confronted.', 'Five million Americans suffer from Alzheimer''s disease and dementia—many of them alone in nursing homes. A man with a simple idea discovers that songs embedded deep in memory can ease pain and awaken these fading minds. Joy and life are resuscitated, and our cultural fears over aging are confronted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xuKGqgNAer0XfCSVotrBaP5bCTT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250643'),
  ('1034487951000081875', 'Alive or Preferably Dead', 1969, 'Action, Comedy, Western', 'Duccio Tessari, Ricardo Huertas, Manuel Rojas', 'Giorgio Salvioni, Duccio Tessari', 'Giuliano Gemma, Nino Benvenuti, Sydne Rome, Cris Huerta, Antonio Casas, Julio Peña, George Rigaud, Víctor Israel', null, 'Two brothers, Monty and Ted, will inherit $300,000 if they manage to live together for six months.', 'Two brothers, Monty and Ted, will inherit $300,000 if they manage to live together for six months.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqarjX9iZ4xtFQxiQ3WZNlp5XTF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102949'),
  ('841564445532646329', 'Alix''s Pictures', 1982, 'Documentary', 'Jean Eustache, Robert Alazraki, Caroline Champetier', null, 'Boris Eustache, Alix Cléo Roubaud', null, 'Alix Cléo Roubaud, a photographer, describes her images to Eustache’s son Boris. An “essay in the shape of a hoax”, Eustache’s last film wittily questions the relationship between showing and telling as it gradually shifts Alix’s narration out of sync with what we see.', 'Alix Cléo Roubaud, a photographer, describes her images to Eustache’s son Boris. An “essay in the shape of a hoax”, Eustache’s last film wittily questions the relationship between showing and telling as it gradually shifts Alix’s narration out of sync with what we see.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8McfqYXWoLEZChQMMgr8sMQk6Sc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198644'),
  ('461668307572320637', 'Aliyah', 2012, 'Drama', 'Elie Wajeman, David Chizallet', 'Gaëlle Macé, Elie Wajeman', 'Pio Marmaï, Cédric Kahn, Adèle Haenel, Guillaume Gouix, David Geselson, Olivier Desautel, Jean-Marie Winling, Mar Sodupe', null, 'Paris 2011. Alex is 27. He lives off dealing and pays the debts of his brother, Isaac, who after being his support has now become dead weight. When his cousin announces he''s going to open a restaurant in Tel Aviv, Alex imagines he can join him and change his life. Set on emigrating, Alex has to find money, leave his beloved Paris, end his complicated love life, drop his destructive brother and find his way.', 'Paris 2011. Alex is 27. He lives off dealing and pays the debts of his brother, Isaac, who after being his support has now become dead weight. When his cousin announces he''s going to open a restaurant in Tel Aviv, Alex imagines he can join him and change his life. Set on emigrating, Alex has to find money, leave his beloved Paris, end his complicated love life, drop his destructive brother and find his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGHtsrYbDqApmGnvlDEcGVdwg6h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136582'),
  ('964425239457260413', 'Alkali, Iowa', 1995, 'Drama', 'Jamie Silverstein, Mark Christopher', 'Mark Christopher', 'J.D. Cerna, Mary Beth Hurt, Edward Seamon, Ellen Hamilton Latzen, Kent Broadhurst, Greg Villepique', null, 'On his family''s farm in rural Iowa, young Jack Gudmanson is wrestling with his sexual identity, not an easy thing to do in the macho world of the Midwest. But things become clearer for him when he discovers via a rusty old lunch box filled with gay magazines that his father, killed in Vietnam, led a double life down on the farm. But as liberating as the discovery is for Jack, it is painful for his grandfather and mother, who have tried for years to keep it a family secret. Now Jack must decide whether to share this new information with his younger sister or allow it to remain buried a while longer.', 'On his family''s farm in rural Iowa, young Jack Gudmanson is wrestling with his sexual identity, not an easy thing to do in the macho world of the Midwest. But things become clearer for him when he discovers via a rusty old lunch box filled with gay magazines that his father, killed in Vietnam, led a double life down on the farm. But as liberating as the discovery is for Jack, it is painful for his grandfather and mother, who have tried for years to keep it a family secret. Now Jack must decide whether to share this new information with his younger sister or allow it to remain buried a while longer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljb0l2Cyf4S3hERCQxiH32VcLEp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410028'),
  ('493726624710565554', 'Alkhallat+', 2022, 'Mystery, Comedy', 'Fahad Alammari', 'Fahad Alammari, Wael Al-Saeed, Mohammed Algarawi', 'Mohammed Aldokhei, Abdulaziz Alshehri, Sohayb Godus, Fahad Albutairi, Ziyad Al-Amri, Ismail Alhassan, Ibraheem Al-Hajjaj, Khalid Abdulaziz', 'PG-13', 'These four tales explore trickery and deception, from tire thieves crashing a wedding to a man''s frantic attempt to bury a secret for a deceased friend.', 'These four tales explore trickery and deception, from tire thieves crashing a wedding to a man''s frantic attempt to bury a secret for a deceased friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znOml3I0JoZaYL47B7u7WuNzKHI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1064450'),
  ('172278636694849516', 'Alki Alki', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Dennis Pauls, Axel Ranisch', 'Heiko Pinkowski, Peter Trabner, Axel Ranisch', 'Heiko Pinkowski, Peter Trabner, Christina Große, Thorsten Merten, Oliver Korittke, Eva Bay, Iris Berben, Teresa Harder', null, 'Tobias and Flasche are childhood friends. However, their alcoholic friendship is doing more harm than good to Tobias, who realizes he should focus on his family and career. Everything changes when Tobias tells this to Flasche.', 'Tobias and Flasche are childhood friends. However, their alcoholic friendship is doing more harm than good to Tobias, who realizes he should focus on his family and career. Everything changes when Tobias tells this to Flasche.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSRPJ6KhnkgGRnux4z7eXOSx3E4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354803'),
  ('708993900307268487', 'Alkohol', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Andreas Pichler, Martin Rattini', 'Andreas Pichler', null, null, 'Alcohol: No substance in the world seems so familiar to us and is so incredibly diverse in its effect. Alcohol is available everywhere and this particular molecule has the power to affect all 200 billion neurons of our human brain in completely different ways. But hardly anyone calls alcohol a drug despite its psychoactive and cell-destroying effect. Why do we tolerate the death of three million people every year? Have we turned a blind eye to the dangers and risks for thousands of years? What role does the powerful alcohol industry play with an annual turnover of 1.2 trillion euros in this on-going concealment? The author, who himself enjoys having a drink, looks into the question why we drink at all, what alcohol does to us and to what extent the alcohol industry influences society and politics.', 'Alcohol: No substance in the world seems so familiar to us and is so incredibly diverse in its effect. Alcohol is available everywhere and this particular molecule has the power to affect all 200 billion neurons of our human brain in completely different ways. But hardly anyone calls alcohol a drug despite its psychoactive and cell-destroying effect. Why do we tolerate the death of three million people every year? Have we turned a blind eye to the dangers and risks for thousands of years? What role does the powerful alcohol industry play with an annual turnover of 1.2 trillion euros in this on-going concealment? The author, who himself enjoys having a drink, looks into the question why we drink at all, what alcohol does to us and to what extent the alcohol industry influences society and politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXEIv0dbWq7GpMJZkaYQ9RM7wZ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653481'),
  ('490515317625837732', 'All a Bir-r-r-d', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet', 'NR', 'Tweety Bird is on a train with Sylvester.', 'Tweety Bird is on a train with Sylvester.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eoFEN2TbIzcMkC9AAYuezjAHNwi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118979'),
  ('1121378415016843922', 'All Aboard!', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Benjamin Euvrard, Vincent Gallot, Sébastien Deux', 'Benjamin Euvrard, Benjamin Dumont, Charly de Witte', 'André Dussollier, Jérôme Commandeur, Jonathan Lambert, Anaëlle Othenin-Girard, Charly de Witte, Léo Dussollier, Marie-Julie Baup, Ferdinand Leclère', null, 'Finally, the holidays are here! Vlad and his friends are so excited! Jérôme, Vlad’s father, is in charge. André, the grandfather of Jeanne and Basile, is also here to help. Six kids, two adults, an eight-hour train trip. Nothing could go wrong. But Jérôme and André miss the train… and watch it leave the station with the kids on board. It’s the beginning of a crazy race for the unlikely duo. While the unsupervised children go wild and have the time of their life, André and Jérôme go through various delays and adventures…', 'Finally, the holidays are here! Vlad and his friends are so excited! Jérôme, Vlad’s father, is in charge. André, the grandfather of Jeanne and Basile, is also here to help. Six kids, two adults, an eight-hour train trip. Nothing could go wrong. But Jérôme and André miss the train… and watch it leave the station with the kids on board. It’s the beginning of a crazy race for the unlikely duo. While the unsupervised children go wild and have the time of their life, André and Jérôme go through various delays and adventures…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89JKGiDKxIaW3Hieficws0eiBLr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:787868'),
  ('594003304455699879', 'All About Actresses', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Maïwenn, Pierre Aïm', 'Maïwenn', 'Jeanne Balibar, Romane Bohringer, Julie Depardieu, Mélanie Doutey, Marina Foïs, Estelle Lefébure, Maïwenn, Karin Viard', null, 'A director wants to make a documentary about actresses, all actresses: the popular ones, the unknown ones, the intellectuals, the comedians, the forgotten ones... Filming everything, with or without their consent, the director gets caught up in the game and lets herself be devoured by these women, who are as fragile as they are manipulative.', 'A director wants to make a documentary about actresses, all actresses: the popular ones, the unknown ones, the intellectuals, the comedians, the forgotten ones... Filming everything, with or without their consent, the director gets caught up in the game and lets herself be devoured by these women, who are as fragile as they are manipulative.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjTGM0O0MSlq4QRWke4INJiA1QQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14720'),
  ('273336754268857626', 'All About Ah-Long', 1989, 'Drama', 'Johnnie To, Horace Wong Wing-Hang, Lo Kim-Wah', 'Sylvia Chang', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Sylvia Chang, Wong Kwan-Yuen, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Wong Tin-Lam, Alan Yu Ga-Lun, Tam Sin-Hung, Joseph Chi Chiong Chavez', null, 'Ah-Long, a father living a low-class lifestyle, while trying to raise his son, Porky. The strong bond between father and son is tested when a chance encounter from Ah-Long''s ex-girlfriend changes the course of their lives.', 'Ah-Long, a father living a low-class lifestyle, while trying to raise his son, Porky. The strong bond between father and son is tested when a chance encounter from Ah-Long''s ex-girlfriend changes the course of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uitGYHaROmywcpJs2dBGrZHS5NG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76257'),
  ('233033351122308796', 'All About Asado', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Mariano Cohn, Gastón Duprat, Jerónimo Carranza', 'Andrés Duprat, Guillermo David, Juan José Becerra', 'El Negro Álvarez, Oscar Bopp, Luis Caporossi, Vicente Cohn, Mónica Cragnolini, Mónica Duprat, Hugo Echevarrieta, Tuca Esponoza', null, 'All About Asado is a trip into the culinary heart of Argentina. Asado, the tradition of grilled meat, is a food and also a ritual. It is primitive and modern, wild and sophisticated, an art and a science. Few phenomena reveal the essential characteristics of Argentina’s national identity with more originality and precision. Equal parts road-movie, documentary and fiction, Gastón Duprat and Mariano Cohn’s playful film delves into the almost sacred tradition of asado, using a sharp and irreverent gaze to explore the country’s meaty fixation.', 'All About Asado is a trip into the culinary heart of Argentina. Asado, the tradition of grilled meat, is a food and also a ritual. It is primitive and modern, wild and sophisticated, an art and a science. Few phenomena reveal the essential characteristics of Argentina’s national identity with more originality and precision. Equal parts road-movie, documentary and fiction, Gastón Duprat and Mariano Cohn’s playful film delves into the almost sacred tradition of asado, using a sharp and irreverent gaze to explore the country’s meaty fixation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybT1L9nVdG1lAQ1xfaLHunmucXG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456705'),
  ('928214195526662182', 'All About Evil', 2010, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Joshua Grannell, Tom Richmond', 'Joshua Grannell', 'Natasha Lyonne, Thomas Dekker, Cassandra Peterson, Mink Stole, Noah Segan, Jack Donner, Jade Ramsey, Nikita Ramsey', 'R', 'A mousy librarian inherits her father''s beloved but failing old movie house. In order to save the family business, she discovers her inner serial killer — and a legion of rabid gore fans — when she starts turning out a series of grisly shorts. What her fans don''t realize yet is that the murders in the movies are all too real…', 'A mousy librarian inherits her father''s beloved but failing old movie house. In order to save the family business, she discovers her inner serial killer — and a legion of rabid gore fans — when she starts turning out a series of grisly shorts. What her fans don''t realize yet is that the murders in the movies are all too real…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJOtBW2q9mwLuEsxvQxhzQ7i74o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70448'),
  ('60440246411966153', 'All About Lily Chou-Chou', 2001, 'Drama, Crime', 'Shunji Iwai, Koto Nagata, Noboru Shinoda', 'Shunji Iwai', 'Hayato Ichihara, Shugo Oshinari, Yu Aoi, Ayumi Ito, Issey Takahashi, Ryo Katsuji, Takao Osawa, Kaku Tomohiro', 'NR', 'Charts the troubled teenage years of students Yūichi Hasumi and Shūsuke Hoshino, exploring the shifting and complex power dynamics of their relationship against the backdrop of Yūichi''s love for the dreamy and abstract music of pop star Lily Chou-Chou.', 'Charts the troubled teenage years of students Yūichi Hasumi and Shūsuke Hoshino, exploring the shifting and complex power dynamics of their relationship against the backdrop of Yūichi''s love for the dreamy and abstract music of pop star Lily Chou-Chou.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLBNmJUH9JYRCRsh349PJ22WpkS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16664'),
  ('155461538455648619', 'All About Love', 2001, 'Drama', 'Jean-François Richet, Christophe Beaucarne', 'Jean-François Richet', 'Virginie Ledoyen, Stomy Bugsy, Bruno Putzulu, Jean-Marc Thibault, Brigitte Roüan, Jean-François Gallotte, Anne Canovas, Jean-Paul Bonnaire', null, 'Maria is a bright and attractive but not especially responsible young woman who is used to having things go her way in life. Out of school and with no clear career path, Maria ends up taking a job putting together cushions for chairs. But after a single day on the job she quits, claiming the work hurts her hands and she''d rather start her own restaurant. As Maria plots her next move, she impulsively swipes a piece of lingerie from a store, then tries to lie her way out of the situation when she''s caught. But Maria finds that words can''t get her out of this bind, and soon she''s in jail and dealing with much deeper trouble than she ever imagined possible.', 'Maria is a bright and attractive but not especially responsible young woman who is used to having things go her way in life. Out of school and with no clear career path, Maria ends up taking a job putting together cushions for chairs. But after a single day on the job she quits, claiming the work hurts her hands and she''d rather start her own restaurant. As Maria plots her next move, she impulsively swipes a piece of lingerie from a store, then tries to lie her way out of the situation when she''s caught. But Maria finds that words can''t get her out of this bind, and soon she''s in jail and dealing with much deeper trouble than she ever imagined possible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uzQVLZfaGCzMiX5T1YpSp5ch1l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78539'),
  ('71439162828988774', 'All About Loving', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Jean Aurel, Edmond Richard', 'Jacques Laurent', 'Michel Piccoli, Anna Karina, Elsa Martinelli, Jean Sorel, Philippe Avron, Joanna Shimkus, Nico, Rita Maiden', null, 'Serge follows Hélène in the crowded streets of Paris and manages to seduce her. Werther takes Sophie to her dentist, Raoul, who tries to seduce her too.', 'Serge follows Hélène in the crowded streets of Paris and manages to seduce her. Werther takes Sophie to her dentist, Raoul, who tries to seduce her too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YbL6BedxutkJC3fJBmEVsNnVgH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199391'),
  ('667627444316983057', 'All About Me', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Franca Drewes, Sina Scheitler, Dorothea Popovic', 'Ruth Toma', 'Julius Weckauf, Luise Heyer, Sönke Möhring, Hedi Kriegeskotte, Joachim Król, Ursula Werner, Rudolf Kowalski, Maren Kroymann', null, 'Dramatised origin story of one of Germany''s most beloved contemporary comedians, Hape Kerkeling.', 'Dramatised origin story of one of Germany''s most beloved contemporary comedians, Hape Kerkeling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeDciv0CfekuKASO8fxJtcC6xyY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497106'),
  ('27889679067350270', 'All About Mothers', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Marie-Castille Mention-Schaar, Myriam Vinocour', 'Marie-Castille Mention-Schaar', 'Audrey Fleurot, Clotilde Courau, Olivia Côte, Pascale Arbillot, Jeanne Rosa, Carmen Maura, Nicole Garcia, Vincent Dedienne', null, 'They are possessive, benevolent, clumsy, absent, omnipresent, overwhelmed, guilty, indulgent, loving, fragile, in full possession of their wits, or losing their heads. Alive or already a memory. They are mothers, and it’s their party.', 'They are possessive, benevolent, clumsy, absent, omnipresent, overwhelmed, guilty, indulgent, loving, fragile, in full possession of their wits, or losing their heads. Alive or already a memory. They are mothers, and it’s their party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibfyFHXlZROfmK9emRVmlh1VL05.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486519'),
  ('1010545653535573990', 'All About My Wife', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Min Kyu-dong, Kim Dong-young, Lee Jae-hyuk', 'Heo Sung-hye, Min Kyu-dong', 'Lee Sun-kyun, Lim Soo-jung, Ryu Seung-ryong, Lee Kwang-soo, Kim Jung-tae, Lee Sung-min, Kim Do-young, Kim Ji-young', null, 'A man asks a womanizer to seduce his wife in order to catalyze a divorce.', 'A man asks a womanizer to seduce his wife in order to catalyze a divorce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zEyJ6JRL3xtUrJJ24vic2H76v3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116488'),
  ('574353469943404699', 'All About Nina', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Eva Vives, Thomas Scott Stanton, Drew Langer', 'Eva Vives', 'Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Common, Chace Crawford, Clea DuVall, Kate del Castillo, Beau Bridges, Sonoya Mizuno, Jay Mohr', 'R', 'Nina Geld''s passion and talent have made her a rising star in the comedy scene, but she''s an emotional mess offstage. When a new professional opportunity coincides with a romantic one, she is forced to confront her own deeply troubled past.', 'Nina Geld''s passion and talent have made her a rising star in the comedy scene, but she''s an emotional mess offstage. When a new professional opportunity coincides with a romantic one, she is forced to confront her own deeply troubled past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcOV7ALpm0CiIyeTxP3Ncjrc7HA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483435'),
  ('475214012999543618', 'All About Our House', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Koki Mitani, Naoto Sakai, Tomoki Sano', 'Koki Mitani', 'Toshiaki Karasawa, Kunie Tanaka, Naoki Tanaka, Akiko Yagi, Tsuyoshi Ihara, Akira Shirai, Nobuo Yana, Takashi Ebata', null, 'Two newlyweds decide to build their dream home, and hire an old friend named Yanagisawa to design it. Unfortunately, Yanagisawa isn’t licensed to build homes, so they call in the wife’s father, a retired carpenter, to help out. When Yanagisawa’s contemporary ideas clash with the old carpenter’s traditional Japanese methods, the project becomes a huge mess.', 'Two newlyweds decide to build their dream home, and hire an old friend named Yanagisawa to design it. Unfortunately, Yanagisawa isn’t licensed to build homes, so they call in the wife’s father, a retired carpenter, to help out. When Yanagisawa’s contemporary ideas clash with the old carpenter’s traditional Japanese methods, the project becomes a huge mess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Z7jBc56gsCsehcTCa9JNsRUkAf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114030'),
  ('1052781149702248101', 'All About Sex', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Courtney Hope Thérond, Andra L. Hayes, Carter Ross', 'Dakota Gorman', 'Natalee Linez, Emma Deckers, Dakota Gorman, Dillon Lane, Matt Angel, Chris Costanzo, James Hyde, Parvesh Cheena', 'NR', 'Three friends in their mid-20s struggle to navigate their professional and personal lives, colliding head on with the messy, hilarious and dreadful growing pangs of adulthood.', 'Three friends in their mid-20s struggle to navigate their professional and personal lives, colliding head on with the messy, hilarious and dreadful growing pangs of adulthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNTwgukBFEYtYNMGsKxgrCFm1xF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:802119'),
  ('736037267178231514', 'All About Steve', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Phil Traill, Tim Suhrstedt, John LaBrucherie', 'Kim Barker', 'Bradley Cooper, Sandra Bullock, Thomas Haden Church, Ken Jeong, Katy Mixon, DJ Qualls, Keith David, Howard Hesseman', 'PG-13', 'After one short blind date, Mary Horowitz, a brilliant and eccentric crossword constructor, is convinced that Steve, a CCN cameraman, is her soul mate. Because his job takes him hither and yon, she crisscrosses the country following Steve, with the encouragement of a reporter, turning up at media events he''s at to convince him they are perfect for each other. Along the way, she befriends an assortment of misfits who accept her for who she is, leading her to reassess her reasons for this strange journey.', 'After one short blind date, Mary Horowitz, a brilliant and eccentric crossword constructor, is convinced that Steve, a CCN cameraman, is her soul mate. Because his job takes him hither and yon, she crisscrosses the country following Steve, with the encouragement of a reporter, turning up at media events he''s at to convince him they are perfect for each other. Along the way, she befriends an assortment of misfits who accept her for who she is, leading her to reassess her reasons for this strange journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7lmf0OeOpQLUoTRLG7e5JZ7H4B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23706'),
  ('472786400168562659', 'All About the Benjamins', 2002, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'John Nelson, Wendi Lampassi, Karen Radzikowski', 'Ronald Lang, Ice Cube', 'Ice Cube, Mike Epps, Eva Mendes, Tommy Flanagan, Carmen Chaplin, Valarie Rae Miller, Roger Guenveur Smith, Anthony Michael Hall', 'R', 'Bounty hunter Bucum Jackson teams with the small-time con artist, Reggie Wright, that he is pursuing, in an attempt to locate a missing stash of diamonds and a lottery ticket worth millions of dollars. Bucum and Reggie find themselves in a race to the finish as they embark on an unlikely partnership that should -- when all is said and done -- prove beneficial to them both.', 'Bounty hunter Bucum Jackson teams with the small-time con artist, Reggie Wright, that he is pursuing, in an attempt to locate a missing stash of diamonds and a lottery ticket worth millions of dollars. Bucum and Reggie find themselves in a race to the finish as they embark on an unlikely partnership that should -- when all is said and done -- prove beneficial to them both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sO7IpJHjZBGLevi8Ozj9EsAUw5h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13950'),
  ('1013990194289258006', 'All About Them', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jérôme Bonnell, Pascal Lagriffoul', 'Maël Piriou, Jérôme Bonnell', 'Anaïs Demoustier, Félix Moati, Sophie Verbeeck, Patrick d''Assumçao, Laure Calamy', null, 'Charlotte is cheating on Micha with Mélodie. Not suspecting a thing, yet feeling neglected, Micha in turn cheats on Charlotte. But also with Mélodie. For Mélodie, things are topsy-turvy. She lies to both of them. She is privy to each of their lies. And is in love with both of them at the same time.', 'Charlotte is cheating on Micha with Mélodie. Not suspecting a thing, yet feeling neglected, Micha in turn cheats on Charlotte. But also with Mélodie. For Mélodie, things are topsy-turvy. She lies to both of them. She is privy to each of their lies. And is in love with both of them at the same time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hFczO5WuLSAZYZlbXAJIwVJZ5n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299715'),
  ('352692703620267855', 'All About Women', 2008, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Tsui Hark, Choi Sung-Fai', 'Tsui Hark', 'Zhou Xun, Gwei Lun-mei, Zhang Yuqi, Stephen Fung, Alex Fong Chung-Sun, Eddie Peng Yu-Yan, Godfrey Gao, Shen Chang', null, 'A series of intertwining stories focus on the lives and transformations of three women and their romantic relationships.', 'A series of intertwining stories focus on the lives and transformations of three women and their romantic relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/si5zOf3YeGk25mYshBXhjhOCUbQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39277'),
  ('177494493282935008', 'All About Yves', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Benoît Forgeard, Thomas Favel', 'Alain Layrac, Alexandre Maji, Camille Servignat', 'William Lebghil, Doria Tillier, Philippe Katerine, Alka Balbir, Ugo Savary, Vincent de Boüard, Sébastien Chassagne, Clémence Boisnard', null, 'Jerem decides to settle at his grandma’s place to compose his first album. There he meets So, a mysterious investigator working on behalf of the startup Digital Cool. She will persuade Jerem to try out Yves, a new kind of smart refrigerator gifted with an IA.', 'Jerem decides to settle at his grandma’s place to compose his first album. There he meets So, a mysterious investigator working on behalf of the startup Digital Cool. She will persuade Jerem to try out Yves, a new kind of smart refrigerator gifted with an IA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21HCuYOd3qm6KYMZxQGEXa0xNNP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570258'),
