  ('156862637719063864', 'All American Bikini Car Wash', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Nimrod Zalmanowitz, Ryan Brown', 'Patrick Rodio', 'Jack Cullison, Jason Lockhart, J.R. Ritcherson, Ashley Park, Scarlet Red, Kayla Collins, Thalia Longchamp, Emma Lane', 'NR', 'An enterprising college student agrees to run his professor''s Las Vegas car wash to avoid flunking out of school. But it''s Vegas gone wild when he decides to staff it with gorgeous bikini-clad girls.', 'An enterprising college student agrees to run his professor''s Las Vegas car wash to avoid flunking out of school. But it''s Vegas gone wild when he decides to staff it with gorgeous bikini-clad girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zj68ujtL481AQNwghdfZL3dPrSK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364708'),
  ('512631080668504767', 'All Around Us', 2008, 'Drama', 'Ryosuke Hashiguchi, Shogo Ueno', 'Ryosuke Hashiguchi', 'Lily Franky, Tae Kimura, Akira Emoto, Susumu Terajima, Tamae Ando, Ken Mitsuishi, Ryo Kase, Seiichi Tanabe', null, 'Kanao, a courtroom portrait artist, observes crimes, scandals and the decline of Japanese values without passing judgement. As he and his wife endure the tragedy of their first child’s death, hope slowly unfolds and their love story flickers to life once again.', 'Kanao, a courtroom portrait artist, observes crimes, scandals and the decline of Japanese values without passing judgement. As he and his wife endure the tragedy of their first child’s death, hope slowly unfolds and their love story flickers to life once again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oviXQSqyaCV8CWp1wse8eN5BMTZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51549'),
  ('308934940938850707', 'All at Sea', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Matteo Cerami', 'Matteo Cerami, Vincenzo Cerami', 'Gigi Proietti, Marco Giallini, Ilaria Occhini, Ninetto Davoli, Ambra Angiolini, Claudia Zanella, Anna Bonaiuto, Libero De Rienzo', null, 'Every morning, pushing the wheelchair of his mother, Maurizio along the walkway through the bush and tie him entrance to his kiosk on the beach. After being assured that his attendants, and Khaled Omar, they did a good job, going to hoist the Italian flag, which stands on top of building.', 'Every morning, pushing the wheelchair of his mother, Maurizio along the walkway through the bush and tie him entrance to his kiosk on the beach. After being assured that his attendants, and Khaled Omar, they did a good job, going to hoist the Italian flag, which stands on top of building.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNNWLv5aERQsh5p9puIVIUps8WY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68888'),
  ('106893761447547120', 'All Because of the Cat', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cécile Telerman, Antoine Monod', 'Cécile Telerman, Xavier Daugreilh', 'Zabou Breitman, Pascal Elbé, Marie-Josée Croze, Pascal Demolon, Camille Lellouche, Mélanie Bernier, Samuel Le Bihan, Mathias Mlekuz', null, 'Laure and Daniel welcome their friends for the yearly holidays in their country home, but their cat’s disappearance soon makes old secrets resurface.', 'Laure and Daniel welcome their friends for the yearly holidays in their country home, but their cat’s disappearance soon makes old secrets resurface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/we4s7n9hSYEKGXWCbzjzynII9tX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964883'),
  ('1133683909347721145', 'All Cats Are Grey', 2014, 'Drama', 'Thomas Buelens, Savina Dellicour', 'Savina Dellicour, Matthieu de Braconier', 'Manon Capelle, Bouli Lanners, Anne Coesens, Erika Sainte, Alain Eloy, Benoît Verhaert, Alexandre von Sivers, Danièle Denie', null, 'Paul is a chubby kind-­‐hearted amateur detective. Dorothy is an intense upper class teenager. Paul is into quoting Sherlock Holmes and watching Derrick. Dorothy is into punk clothing and hating her mother. Paul is forty three, Dorothy is sixteen, and the only thing that links them is Paul’s knowledge that he is Dorothy’s biological father… over time, this has grown into a one way relationship with Paul spying on Dorothy as she grew up, always from a safe distance…They would never have met if Dorothy hadn’t heard of Paul’s amateur detective skills. She wants to use him to find her father…', 'Paul is a chubby kind-­‐hearted amateur detective. Dorothy is an intense upper class teenager. Paul is into quoting Sherlock Holmes and watching Derrick. Dorothy is into punk clothing and hating her mother. Paul is forty three, Dorothy is sixteen, and the only thing that links them is Paul’s knowledge that he is Dorothy’s biological father… over time, this has grown into a one way relationship with Paul spying on Dorothy as she grew up, always from a safe distance…They would never have met if Dorothy hadn’t heard of Paul’s amateur detective skills. She wants to use him to find her father…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udPjqm5FF1CwYzfDQ7ZlibDlzoG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299674'),
  ('79786113102656554', 'All Cheerleaders Die', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller, Comedy', 'Chris Sivertson, Lucky McKee', 'Lucky McKee, Chris Sivertson', 'Caitlin Stasey, Sianoa Smit-McPhee, Brooke Serene Butler, Amanda Grace Benitez, Reanin Johannink, Tom Williamson, Nicholas S. Morrison, Chris Petrovski', 'NR', 'When tragedy rocks Blackfoot High, rebellious outsider Mäddy Killian shocks the student body by joining the cheerleading squad. After a confrontation with the football team, Mäddy and her new cheerleader friends are sent on a supernatural roller coaster ride which leaves a path of destruction none of them may be able to escape.', 'When tragedy rocks Blackfoot High, rebellious outsider Mäddy Killian shocks the student body by joining the cheerleading squad. After a confrontation with the football team, Mäddy and her new cheerleader friends are sent on a supernatural roller coaster ride which leaves a path of destruction none of them may be able to escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNCz2pALvvVsU2paFZlnkpoXmxl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210908'),
  ('1082228058325906233', 'All Creatures Great and Small', 1975, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Claude Whatham, Peter Suschitzky', 'Hugh Whitemore', 'Simon Ward, Anthony Hopkins, Lisa Harrow, Brian Stirner, Freddie Jones, T. P. McKenna, Brenda Bruce, John Collin', null, 'James Herriot is a vet in Yorkshire, England, during the 1930s. He is assigned to the practice of Siegfried Farnon, who—together with his mischievous brother Tristan—already have a successful business. James undergoes a variety of adventures during his work, which are just as often caused by the characters of the county, including the Farnon brothers, as the animals in his care.', 'James Herriot is a vet in Yorkshire, England, during the 1930s. He is assigned to the practice of Siegfried Farnon, who—together with his mischievous brother Tristan—already have a successful business. James undergoes a variety of adventures during his work, which are just as often caused by the characters of the county, including the Farnon brothers, as the animals in his care.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68m869xfOgxCaEBb9grIf0ndaec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53205'),
  ('503803516846520032', 'All Day and a Night', 2020, 'Drama', 'Joe Robert Cole, Jessica Lee Gagné', 'Joe Robert Cole', 'Ashton Sanders, Jeffrey Wright, Isaiah John, Kelly Jenrette, Shakira Ja''nai Paye, Regina Taylor, Jalyn Hall, Ramone Hamilton', 'R', 'While serving life in prison, a young man looks back at the people, the circumstances and the system that set him on the path toward his crime.', 'While serving life in prison, a young man looks back at the people, the circumstances and the system that set him on the path toward his crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xiV8j18GhWnnrfMGaDR0E5oOif.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:530956'),
  ('937327135150448002', 'All Dirt Roads Taste of Salt', 2023, 'Drama', 'Jomo Fray, Semmi Cole, Jeremiah Kelleher', 'Raven Jackson', 'Kaylee Nicole Johnson, Chris Chalk, Jayah Henry, Sheila Atim, Bernadette Albright, Preston McDowell, Charleen McClure, Reginald Helms Jr.', 'PG', 'Tender caresses and enveloping embraces are portals into the life of Mack, a Black woman in Mississippi. Winding through the anticipation, love, and heartbreak she experiences from childhood to adulthood, the expressionist journey is an ode to connection — with loved ones and with place.', 'Tender caresses and enveloping embraces are portals into the life of Mack, a Black woman in Mississippi. Winding through the anticipation, love, and heartbreak she experiences from childhood to adulthood, the expressionist journey is an ode to connection — with loved ones and with place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1Rap5zhPUBctPcX8h7TBFJQth4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800227'),
  ('234310819609152970', 'All Dogs Go to Heaven', 1989, 'Drama, Animation, Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Don Bluth, Gary Goldman, Dan Kuenster', 'David N. Weiss', 'Burt Reynolds, Dom DeLuise, Judith Barsi, Vic Tayback, Melba Moore, Ken Page, Charles Nelson Reilly, Nigel Pegram', 'G', 'When a casino-owning dog named Charlie is murdered by his rival Carface, he finds himself in Heaven. Wanting to get back at his killer, he cons his way back to the living with the warning that doing so damns him to Hell. Once back, he teams with his old partner, Itchy, to prep his retaliation. He stumbles upon an orphan girl who can talk to the animals, thus allowing him to get the inside info on the races to ensure his wins to finance his plans. However, all the while, he is still haunted by nightmares of what''s waiting for him on the other side unless he can prove that he is worthy of Heaven again.', 'When a casino-owning dog named Charlie is murdered by his rival Carface, he finds himself in Heaven. Wanting to get back at his killer, he cons his way back to the living with the warning that doing so damns him to Hell. Once back, he teams with his old partner, Itchy, to prep his retaliation. He stumbles upon an orphan girl who can talk to the animals, thus allowing him to get the inside info on the races to ensure his wins to finance his plans. However, all the while, he is still haunted by nightmares of what''s waiting for him on the other side unless he can prove that he is worthy of Heaven again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmWh1NglDinfkHD9zCNqGWyhl7Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11497'),
  ('1110722559314968159', 'All Dogs Go to Heaven 2', 1996, 'Romance, Animation, Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Larry Leker, Paul Sabella, John Williamson', 'Kelly Ward, Mark Young, Arne Olsen', 'Charlie Sheen, Dom DeLuise, Adam Wylie, Sheena Easton, Ernest Borgnine, George Hearn, Bebe Neuwirth, Hamilton Camp', 'G', 'Charlie and Itchy return to Earth to find Gabriel''s Horn, but along the way meet up with a young boy named David, who ran away from home.', 'Charlie and Itchy return to Earth to find Gabriel''s Horn, but along the way meet up with a young boy named David, who ran away from home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNmIJILOW9qF2F1Z0qOXkadaS50.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19042'),
  ('297343665539704895', 'All Ears', 2023, 'Drama', 'Zhou Wencao, Zeng Xiaoming, Liu Jie', 'Liu Jiayin', 'Hu Ge, Leo Wu, Qi Xi, White-K, Huang Lei, Na Renhua, Gan Yunchen, Hu Yaozhi', null, 'Wen Shan is a mediocre screenwriter struggling to make a living in Beijing. Commercial projects are left undone, and his own stories fall by the wayside. He lives a stagnant life in a fast growing city. By chance, he begins to write eulogies for a living. He meets the families of the deceased, carefully observes, listens to the stories, and at last, puts pen to paper. As he restores the lives of others, he finds his own place in the city and finally realizes that ordinary people can take the center stage too.', 'Wen Shan is a mediocre screenwriter struggling to make a living in Beijing. Commercial projects are left undone, and his own stories fall by the wayside. He lives a stagnant life in a fast growing city. By chance, he begins to write eulogies for a living. He meets the families of the deceased, carefully observes, listens to the stories, and at last, puts pen to paper. As he restores the lives of others, he finds his own place in the city and finally realizes that ordinary people can take the center stage too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/trTG5CH0RlsDtyuC0nTPLjn4DzU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1077297'),
  ('324692982014487278', 'All Eyes', 2022, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Todd Greenlee', 'Alex Greenlee', 'Jasper Hammer, Ben Hall, Danielle Evon Ploeger, Nick Ballard, Skyler Davenport, Laurie Cummings', null, 'A disgraced podcast host interviews an eccentric farmer who claims to have a monster living in the woods near his house.', 'A disgraced podcast host interviews an eccentric farmer who claims to have a monster living in the woods near his house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKnD8g1id6Z7EDshDEgfK9BoCbL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:974926'),
  ('862554982477629992', 'All Eyes Off Me', 2022, 'Drama', 'Meidan Arama, Hadas ben Aroya', 'Hadas ben Aroya', 'Elisheva Weil, Leib Lev Levin, Yoav Hayt, Hadar Katz, Hila Mann', null, 'A party in Tel Aviv, Israel. Danny is looking for Max to share that she is pregnant with his child; but Max has just started a new relationship with Avishag whose rough sexual fantasy he is trying to make come true.', 'A party in Tel Aviv, Israel. Danny is looking for Max to share that she is pregnant with his child; but Max has just started a new relationship with Avishag whose rough sexual fantasy he is trying to make come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtgZafeiX0eDmojCoMDk622ofKR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795774'),
  ('613650114757357395', 'All Eyes on Me', 2026, 'Drama', 'Pascal Payant', 'Pascal Payant', 'Oliwia Drozdzyk, Svandís Dóra Einarsdóttir, Þóra Karítas Árnadóttir, Ágúst Þór Ámundason, Gudmundur Thorvaldsson', null, 'Trilogy Part One - After losing his family in an accident, a man travels across Iceland to pay his respects at their burial site. Along the way, he meets a young traveler who has fled Poland.', 'Trilogy Part One - After losing his family in an accident, a man travels across Iceland to pay his respects at their burial site. Along the way, he meets a young traveler who has fled Poland.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FbBTPXzuHntnsvXxkoUz7UvZ4534.jpg', 'plex:movie:all-eyes-on-me-2026'),
  ('119648401678203933', 'All Eyez on Me', 2017, 'History, Drama, Music', 'Benny Boom, Peter Menzies Jr., Shawn D. Bronson', 'Jeremy Haft, Eddie Gonzalez, Steven Bagatourian', 'Demetrius Shipp Jr., Danai Gurira, Kat Graham, Jamal Woolard, Dominic L. Santana, Annie Ilonzeh, Lauren Cohan, Cory Hardrict', 'R', 'All Eyez on Me chronicles the life and legacy of Tupac Shakur, including his rise to superstardom as a hip-hop artist, actor, poet and activist, as well as his imprisonment and prolific, controversial time at Death Row Records. Against insurmountable odds, Tupac rose to become a cultural icon whose career and persona both continue to grow long after his passing.', 'All Eyez on Me chronicles the life and legacy of Tupac Shakur, including his rise to superstardom as a hip-hop artist, actor, poet and activist, as well as his imprisonment and prolific, controversial time at Death Row Records. Against insurmountable odds, Tupac rose to become a cultural icon whose career and persona both continue to grow long after his passing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmgsaKFWbmZ1Grz4SO0PLNxilv3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402529');
